msgid "Nothing happens."
msgstr "아무 일도 일어나지 않았습니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:956
msgid "The door on the safe swings open."
msgstr "금고 문이 활짝 열립니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:959
msgid "You activate the panel!"
msgstr "조작판을 작동시켰습니다!"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:960
msgid "The nearby doors unlock."
msgstr "인근 출입구의 잠금이 해제되었습니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:997 src/iuse.cpp:9012
msgid "It's too dark to write!"
msgstr "뭔가를 작성하기엔 너무 어둡습니다!"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1014
#, c-format
msgid "You copy the recipe for %1$s into your recipe book."
msgstr "%1$s의 제작법을 옮겨 적었습니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1097
msgid "You found the wire that starts the engine."
msgstr "엔진 시동을 거는 전선을 찾았습니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1101
msgid "You found a wire that looks like the right one."
msgstr "적절해 보이는 전선을 찾아냈습니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1106
msgid "The red wire always starts the engine, doesn't it?"
msgstr "시동이 걸리는 건 항상 빨간 전선이더군요."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1111
msgid "By process of elimination, you found the wire that starts the engine."
msgstr "엔진의 시동을 거는 전선을 찾아냈습니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1207 src/activity_handlers.cpp:1293
#, c-format
msgid "Your %1$s ran out of charges."
msgstr "%1$s의 잔여량이 모두 떨어졌습니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1209
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s %2$s ran out of charges."
msgstr "%1$s의 %2$s 잔여량이 모두 떨어졌습니다."

#. ~ Sound of a metal sawing tool at work!
#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1233 src/activity_actor.cpp:1250
msgid "grnd grnd grnd"
msgstr "그릉 그릉 그릉"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1479 src/activity_actor.cpp:1593
msgid "You come to a gentle landing."
msgstr "부드럽게 착륙합니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1480 src/activity_actor.cpp:1594
msgid "<npcname> comes to a gentle landing."
msgstr "<npcname>가 부드럽게 착륙합니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1486 src/activity_actor.cpp:1503
#, c-format
msgid "You collide with %s, bringing an abrupt halt to your glide."
msgstr "%s과/와 충돌하면서 활공에 급격한 정지가 일어납니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1487 src/activity_actor.cpp:1504
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> collides with %s, bringing an abrupt halt to their glide."
msgstr "<npcname>이(가) %s와(과) 충돌하여 활공이 갑자기 멈춥니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1513
#, c-format
msgid "You deftly maneuver around %s."
msgstr "당신은 %s 주위를 능숙하게 움직입니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1514
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> deftly maneuvers around %s."
msgstr "<npcname>이(가) %s 주위를 능숙하게 움직입니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1668
msgid "You no longer have the book!"
msgstr "책을 갖고 있지 않습니다!"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1669
msgid "<npcname> no longer has the book!"
msgstr "<npcname>(이)가 책을 갖고 있지 않습니다!"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1718 src/character.cpp:9543 src/npc.cpp:1361
msgid "It's too dark to read!"
msgstr "너무 어두워 읽을 수 없습니다!"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1734
msgid "You no longer have the e-book!"
msgstr "전자책을 갖고 있지 않습니다!"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1735
msgid "<npcname> no longer has the e-book!"
msgstr "<npcname>(이)가 전자책을 갖고 있지 않습니다!"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1743 src/activity_actor.cpp:2868
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s %2$s ran out of batteries."
msgstr "%1$s의 %2$s 전력이 방전되었습니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1885
#, c-format
msgid "Your theoretical knowledge of %s increases to level %d."
msgstr "%s의 이론적 지식 수준이 %d로 상승하였습니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1888
#, c-format
msgid "%s increases their %s knowledge."
msgstr "%s(이)가 %s 지식 수준을 올렸습니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1898
#, c-format
msgid "You learn a little about %s!  (%d%%)"
msgstr "당신은 %s에 대해 약간 익혔습니다! (%d%%)"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1908
#, c-format
msgid "You can no longer learn from %s."
msgstr "%s에서 더 배울만한 내용은 없습니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1921 src/activity_actor.cpp:2040
#, c-format
msgid "%s learns a little about %s!"
msgstr "%s(이)가 %s에 대해 약간 익혔습니다!"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1926
#, c-format
msgid "%s learn a little about %s!"
msgstr "%s(이)가 %s에 대해 약간 익혔습니다!"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1931 src/activity_actor.cpp:2046
#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2051
#, c-format
msgid "%s can no longer learn from %s."
msgstr "%s(은)는 %s에서 더는 배울 것이 없습니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1973
msgid ""
"You train the moves according to the book, but can't get a grasp of the "
"style, so you start from the beginning."
msgstr "책을 따라 동작을 훈련해보지만, 감이 오지 않아 처음부터 다시 시작합니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1977
msgid ""
"This martial art is not easy to grasp.  You start training the moves from "
"the beginning."
msgstr "이 무술은 익히기 쉽지 않습니다. 동작들을 처음부터 다시 훈련합니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1981
msgid ""
"You decide to read the manual and train even more.  In martial arts, "
"patience leads to mastery."
msgstr "무술서를 읽으며 더 열심히 훈련합니다. 무술에 왕도는 없는 법이죠."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1985
msgid "You try again.  This training will finally pay off."
msgstr "다시 시도합니다. 이 훈련은 언젠가 반드시 도움이 될겁니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:1989
msgid "You train for a while."
msgstr "잠시동안 훈련합니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2033
#, c-format
msgid "%s increases their %s level."
msgstr "%s(이)가 %s 기술 수준을 올렸습니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2127
msgid "You finish reading."
msgstr "독서를 마쳤습니다."

#. ~ skill_name current_skill_level -> next_skill_level (% to next level)
#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2166
#, c-format
msgctxt "reading progress"
msgid "%1$s %2$d -> %3$d (%4$d%%)"
msgstr "%1$s %2$d -> %3$d (%4$d%%)"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2285
msgid ""
"You lose track of some hauled items as they didn't fit on the current tile."
msgstr "이동한 타일의 공간이 부족하여 끌고 있던 일부 물품을 놓칩니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2339
msgid "Moving canceled auto-pickup."
msgstr "이동으로 인해 자동 습득을 취소합니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2352
msgid "Some items were not picked up!"
msgstr "일부 물품을 줍지 않았습니다!"

#. ~ Boltcut sound of terrain "chain link fence"
#. ~ Boltcut sound of terrain "wire fence"
#. ~ Boltcut sound of terrain "barbed wire fence"
