msgid "Snick, snick, gachunk!"
msgstr "짤깍, 짤깍, 카칭!"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2606
msgid "The lock opens…"
msgstr "자물쇠가 열립니다…"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2619 src/activity_actor.cpp:2631
msgid "You can't open this lock."
msgstr "이 자물쇠를 딸 수 없습니다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2699
msgid "Your clumsy attempt jams the lock!"
msgstr "섣불리 시도하다가 자물쇠 구멍이 막혀버렸습니다!"

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2704
msgid "The lock stumps your efforts to pick it, and you destroy your tool."
msgstr "잠금장치를 여는데 실패했고, 도구가 파괴되었다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2708
msgid "The lock stumps your efforts to pick it, and you damage your tool."
msgstr "잠금장치를 여는데 실패했고, 도구가 손상되었다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2711
msgid "The lock stumps your efforts to pick it."
msgstr "잠금장치를 여는데 실패했다."

#: src/activity_actor.cpp:2761
msgid "There is nothing to lockpick nearby."
