msgid "Things are returning to normal."
msgstr "뭔가 정상으로 돌아가는 것 같습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:522
msgid "Your thoughts are unclear."
msgstr "사고력이 흐려집니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:524
msgid "Your face is stiff from the cold."
msgstr "추워서 얼굴이 뻣뻣해졌습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:526
msgid "You quiver from the cold."
msgstr "추위에 몸이 약간 떨립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:526
msgid "Your torso is freezing cold.  You should put on a few more layers."
msgstr "몸통이 얼어붙을 것처럼 차갑습니다. 더 걸쳐야 합니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:527
msgid "Your shivering makes you unsteady."
msgstr "몸이 떨려서 가누기 힘듭니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:528 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:529
msgid "Your left arm is shivering."
msgstr "왼팔이 떨립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:528 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:529
msgid "Your left arm trembles from the cold."
msgstr "추위에 왼팔이 떨립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:530 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:531
msgid "Your right arm is shivering."
msgstr "오른팔이 떨립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:530 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:531
msgid "Your right arm trembles from the cold."
msgstr "추위에 오른팔이 떨립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:532 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:533
msgid "Your left hand feels like ice."
msgstr "왼손이 얼음장 같습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:532 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:533
msgid "Your left hand quivers in the cold."
msgstr "추위에 왼손이 약간 떨립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:534 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:535
msgid "Your right hand feels like ice."
msgstr "오른손이 얼음장 같습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:534 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:535
msgid "Your right hand quivers in the cold."
msgstr "추위에 오른손이 약간 떨립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:536 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:537
msgid "Your left leg trembles against the relentless cold."
msgstr "냉혹한 추위에 왼다리가 떨립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:536 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:537
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:538 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:539
msgid "Your legs uncontrollably shake from the cold."
msgstr "추위에 다리가 견딜 수 없이 심하게 떨립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:538 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:539
msgid "Your right leg trembles against the relentless cold."
msgstr "냉혹한 추위에 오릅니다리가 떨립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:540 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:541
msgid "Your left foot feels frigid."
msgstr "왼발이 차갑습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:540
msgid "Your left foot is as nimble as a block of ice."
msgstr "왼발이 얼음덩이같고 도무지 움직이질 않습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:541
msgid "Your freezing left foot messes up your balance."
msgstr "왼발이 얼어붙어서 균형을 망칩니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:542 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:543
msgid "Your right foot feels frigid."
msgstr "오른발이 차갑습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:542
msgid "Your right foot is as nimble as a block of ice."
msgstr "오른발이 얼음덩이같고 도무지 움직이질 않습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:543
msgid "Your freezing right foot messes up your balance."
msgstr "오른발이 얼어붙어서 균형을 망칩니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:556
msgid "Your head is pounding from the heat."
msgstr "열기 때문에 머리가 지끈거립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:558
msgid "You are sweating profusely."
msgstr "땀이 심하게 납니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:560 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:561
msgid "Your left hand's too sweaty to grip well."
msgstr "왼손에 땀이 너무 많아서 뭔가를 붙잡기가 어렵습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:562 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:563
msgid "Your right hand's too sweaty to grip well."
msgstr "오른손에 땀이 너무 많아서 뭔가를 붙잡기가 어렵습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:564
msgid "Your left leg is cramping up."
msgstr "왼 다리에 경련이 오기 시작합니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:566
msgid "Your right leg is cramping up."
msgstr "오른 다리에 경련이 오기 시작합니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:568
msgid "Your left foot is swelling in the heat."
msgstr "열기 때문에 왼발이 부어오릅니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:570
msgid "Your right foot is swelling in the heat."
msgstr "열기 때문에 오른발이 부어오릅니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:589
msgid "The heat is making you see things."
msgstr "열기 때문에 헛것이 보입니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:598 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:599
msgid "You have trouble grasping with your numb fingers."
msgstr "손이 얼어있어 붙잡는데 어려움이 있습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:600 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:601
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:602 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:603
msgid "Your foot has gone numb."
msgstr "발에 감각이 없습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:604 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:605
msgid "Your face feels numb."
msgstr "얼굴에 감각이 없습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:633
msgid "Glowing lights surround you, and you teleport."
msgstr "반짝이는 빛에 휩싸이며 순간이동했습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:653
msgid "You pass out."
msgstr "기절했습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:687 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1343
msgid "A monster appears nearby!"
msgstr "괴물이 근처에 나타났습니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:688 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1344
msgid "A portal opens nearby, and a monster crawls through!"
msgstr "근처에 포털이 열리더니, 괴물들이 기어나옵니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:697
msgid "You shudder suddenly."
msgstr "갑자기 몸이 떨려옵니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:711
msgid "Your vision is filled with bright lights…"
msgstr "시야가 밝은 빛으로 채워집니다…"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:727
msgid "You're suddenly covered in ectoplasm."
msgstr "갑자기 엑토플라즘에 뒤덮였습니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:738
msgid "We have many colonists awaiting passage."
msgstr "이주를 기다리는 이주민이 많이 있습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:767
msgid ""
"You're experiencing loss of basic motor skills and blurred vision.  Your "
"mind recoils in horror, unable to communicate with your spinal column."
msgstr "몸이 둔해지고 시야가 흐려집니다. 몸이 제대로 움직이지 않자 두려움에 휩싸입니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:768
msgid "You stagger and fall!"
msgstr "비틀거리다가 쓰러졌습니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:783
msgid "There's some kind of big machine in the sky."
msgstr "하늘에 거대한 기계 같은 것이 있습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:786
msgid "It's some kind of electric snake, coming right at you!"
msgstr "전기로 된 뱀 같은 것이 다가옵니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:793
msgid ""
"Order us some golf shoes, otherwise we'll never get out of this place alive."
msgstr "우리한테 골프화 좀 사줘, 안 그러면 우린 절대 여기서 살아나가지 못할거야."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:797
msgid "The possibility of physical and mental collapse is now very real."
msgstr "신체적, 정신적으로 기절할 가능성이 매우 높아졌습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:799
msgid "No one should be asked to handle this trip."
msgstr "아무도 이 여행을 맡으라고 해서는 안된다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:809
msgid ""
"Your heart spasms painfully and stops, dragging you back to reality as you "
"die."
msgstr "심장이 고통스럽게 경련을 일으키더니 멈춥니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:812
msgid ""
"You dissolve into beautiful paroxysms of energy.  Life fades from your "
"nebulae and you are no more."
msgstr "몸이 분해되어 눈부시게 소용돌이치는 에너지로 변했습니다. 생명이 희미해지며 이제 더이상 아무것도 아닌 것이 되었습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:834
msgid "You bleed to death!"
msgstr "출혈로 사망했습니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:835
msgid "<npcname> bleeds to death!"
msgstr "<npcname>이(가) 출혈로 사망했습니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:840
msgid "Your heart can't keep up the pace and fails!"
msgstr "심장이 속도를 따라가지 못하고 멈춥니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:867
msgid "Your skin looks pale and you feel anxious and thirsty.  Blood loss?"
msgstr "피부가 창백해지고 불안하고 목이 마르세요. 출혈이 있나요?"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:869
msgid ""
"Your pale skin is sweating, your heart is beating fast, and you feel "
"restless.  Maybe you lost too much blood?"
msgstr "창백한 피부에서 땀이 나고, 심장이 빠르게 뛰며, 불안합니다. 혹시 피를 너무 많이 흘렸습니까?"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:871
msgid ""
"You're unsettlingly white, but your fingertips are bluish.  You are agitated"
" and your heart is racing.  Your blood loss must be serious."
msgstr "불안할 정도로 창백하지만, 손가락 끝은 푸르스름합니다. 초조하고 심장이 격렬하게 뛰고 있습니다. 실혈이 심각한 것 같습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:873
msgid ""
"You are pale as a ghost, dripping wet from the sweat, and sluggish - despite"
" your heart racing like a train.  You are on the brink of collapse from the "
"effects of blood loss."
msgstr ""
"유령처럼 창백하고, 땀으로 흠뻑 젖었으며, 기차처럼 심장이 뛰는데도 불구하고 느릿느릿합니다. 실혈의 영향으로 쓰러지기 직전입니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:881
msgid "You feel dizzy and lightheaded."
msgstr "어지럽고 현기증이 납니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:885
msgid "You feel tired and you breathe heavily."
msgstr "피곤하고 숨을 가쁘게 쉽니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:889
msgid "You are anxious and cannot collect your thoughts."
msgstr "불안해서 생각을 정리할 수 없습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:893
msgid "You are sweating profusely, but you feel cold."
msgstr "땀을 많이 흘리지만, 춥습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:902
msgid "You huff and puff.  Your breath is rapid and shallow."
msgstr "헐떡거립니다. 숨이 빠르고 얕습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:907
msgid "You drop to the ground, fighting to keep yourself conscious."
msgstr "의식을 유지하기 위해 싸우며 땅에 쓰러집니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:911
msgid "Your mind slips away."
msgstr "정신이 희미해집니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:942
msgid "You cannot breathe and your body gives out!"
msgstr "숨을 쉴 수 없고 몸이 말을 듣지 않습니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:943
msgid "<npcname> gasps for air and dies!"
msgstr "<npcname>이(가) 숨을 헐떡이다 죽습니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:951
msgid "Your hands feel unusually cold."
msgstr "손이 비정상적으로 차갑습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:956
msgid "Your feet feel unusually cold."
msgstr "발이 비정상적으로 차갑습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:961
msgid "Your skin looks very pale."
msgstr "피부가 매우 창백해 보입니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:964
msgid "You feel weak.  Where has your strength gone?"
msgstr "당신은 약하다고 느낍니다. 당신의 힘은 어디로 사라진 걸까요?"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:967
msgid "You feel feeble.  A gust of wind could make you stumble."
msgstr "허약한 느낌입니다. 돌풍에도 비틀거릴 수 있습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:970
msgid "There is an overwhelming aura of tiredness inside of you."
msgstr "몸 안에 압도적인 피로감이 있습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:983
msgid "Rest is what you want.  Rest is what you need."
msgstr "휴식이 당신이 원하는 것입니다. 휴식이 당신에게 필요한 것입니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:986
msgid "You feel dizzy and can't coordinate the movement of your feet."
msgstr "어지럽고 발의 움직임을 조절할 수 없습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:990
msgid "Your muscles are quivering."
msgstr "근육이 떨립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:994
msgid "You crave for ice.  The dirt under your feet looks tasty too."
msgstr "얼음을 갈망합니다. 발밑의 흙도 맛있어 보입니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:997
msgid "Your whole mouth is sore, and your tongue is swollen."
msgstr "입 전체가 아프고, 혀가 부어 있습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1000
msgid "You feel lightheaded.  A migraine follows."
msgstr "현기증이 납니다. 편두통이 뒤따릅니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1013
msgid "Your legs are restless.  The urge to move them is so strong."
msgstr "다리가 불안합니다. 움직이고 싶은 충동이 너무 강합니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1016
msgid "You feel like you could sleep on a rock."
msgstr "바위 위에서도 잠들 수 있을 것 같습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1020
msgid "You gasp for air!"
msgstr "숨을 헐떡입니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1025
msgid "Can't breathe.  Must rest."
msgstr "숨을 쉴 수 없습니다. 쉬어야 합니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1030
msgid "You can't take it any more.  Rest first; everything else later."
msgstr "더 이상 견딜 수 없습니다. 먼저 쉬세요; 다른 모든 것은 나중에."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1035
msgid "You must sit down for a moment.  Just a moment."
msgstr "잠시 앉아야 합니다. 잠시만요."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1076
msgid "You feel well rested."
msgstr "편히 잘 쉰 것 같습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1079
msgid ""
"You feel physically rested, but you haven't been able to catch up on your "
"missed sleep yet."
msgstr "신체의 피로는 풀어졌지만, 아직 놓쳐버린 잠을 마저 보충할 수 없었습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1176 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1185
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1192
msgid "It's too bright to sleep."
msgstr "너무 밝아서 잘 수가 없습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1200
#, c-format
msgid "You see %s approaching!"
msgstr "%s 접근중!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1218
msgid "You toss and turn trying to keep warm."
msgstr "온기를 보존하려고 몸을 뒤척입니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1222
msgid "It's too cold to sleep."
msgstr "잠을 청하기엔 너무 춥습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1230
msgid "You toss and turn in the heat."
msgstr "더위 때문에 몸을 뒤척입니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1234
msgid "It's too hot to sleep."
msgstr "잠을 청하기엔 너무 덥습니다."

#. ~ %s is bodypart in accusative.
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1303
#, c-format
msgid "You start scratching your %s!"
msgstr "%s(을)를 긁기 시작합니다!"

#. ~ 1$s is NPC name, 2$s is bodypart in accusative.
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1307
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s starts scratching their %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$s(이)가 %2$s(을)를 긁기 시작합니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1319
msgid "Why waste your time on that insignificant speck?"
msgstr "왜 그런 쓸데없는 것에 시간을 낭비합니까?"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1351
msgid "The bees have started escaping your teeth."
msgstr "벌들이 이빨을 피해 달아나기 시작했습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1353
msgid "You feel paranoid.  They're watching you."
msgstr "극심한 불안감이 듭니다. 그들이 날 지켜보고 있어."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1358
msgid ""
"You feel like you need less teeth.  You pull one out, and it is rotten to "
"the core."
msgstr "이빨이 덜 있어도 될 듯한 기분이 듭니다. 하나를 뽑았더니 뿌리까지 썩어 있었습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1361
msgid "You notice a large abscess.  You pick at it."
msgstr "큰 종기가 있는 것을 깨달았습니다. 뜯어 내버렸습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1367
msgid ""
"You feel so sick, like you've been poisoned, but you need more.  So much "
"more."
msgstr "중독된 것처럼 너무 아픕니다. 하지만 더 많은 고통을 원합니다. 더더욱 많은."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1373
msgid "You are beset with a vision of a prowling beast."
msgstr "배회하는 짐승의 환영에 사로잡힙니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1377
msgid "Your surroundings are permeated with a foul scent."
msgstr "주변이 더러운 냄새로 스며들고 있습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1384
msgid "Your asthma attack stops."
msgstr "천식 발작이 멈춥니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1387
msgid ""
"Your asthma overcomes you.\n"
"You asphyxiate."
msgstr ""
"천식이 한계를 넘어섰습니다.\n"
"질식할 것 같습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1392
msgid "You wheeze and gasp for air."
msgstr "호흡이 힘들어 겨우 숨을 쉬었습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1397
msgid "Your head aches faintly."
msgstr "머리가 조금 욱신거립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1403
msgid "Your vision is getting fuzzy."
msgstr "시야가 흐려집니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1411
msgid "Your vision goes black!"
msgstr "시야가 점점 어두워집니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1417
msgid "Your bowels ache."
msgstr "속이 아픕니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1421
msgid "Your veins itch."
msgstr "정맥이 간질거립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1425
msgid "Your muscles feel like they're knotted and tired."
msgstr "근육이 딱딱하게 뭉쳤고, 쥐가 날 것 같습니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1429
msgid "Your muscles are tight and sore."
msgstr "근육이 당기고 쓰립니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1433
msgid "Your muscles are locking up and you can't fight effectively."
msgstr "근육이 조여와서 제대로 싸우기가 힘듭니다."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1435
msgid "Your muscles spasm."
msgstr "근육이 경련합니다."

#. ~ %s is bodypart name.
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1496 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1548
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s wound begins to feel better!"
msgstr "당신의 상처%s(이)가 좋아지기 시작합니다!"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1559
msgid "You succumb to the infection."
