"Strength - 1;   Perception - 1;   Dexterity - 1;\n"
"Depression and physical pain to some degree.  Frequent cravings.  Vomiting."
msgstr ""
"체력 - 1;   지각 - 1;   민첩 - 1;\n"
"약간의 우울증과 육체적 고통. 잦은 투약충동. 구토."

#. ~ Name of the "amphetamine" addiction's effect as it appears in the
#. player's status
#: data/json/addictions.json
