"Strength - 1;   Intelligence - 1;\n"
"Movement rate reduction.  Depression.  Weak immune system.  Frequent cravings."
msgstr ""
"체력 - 1; 지능 - 1;\n"
"이동속도가 느려짐. 우울증. 면역력 감소. 잦은 투약충동."

#. ~ Name of the "cocaine" addiction's effect as it appears in the player's
