#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your blisters distract you"
msgstr "물집때문에 집중하기가 힘듭니다."

#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "dermatik"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Insect Parasite"
msgstr "곤충류 기생충"

