msgstr "심한 가려움"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Itchy, Very Itchy, Terribly Itchy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You stop to scratch yourself frequently; high INT helps you resist the urge."
msgstr "자주 멈춰서 몸을 긁습니다. 지능이 높으면 충동을 억제하는데 도움이 됩니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Itchy, Very Itchy, Terribly Itchy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel extremely itchy!"
msgstr "극심한 가려움이 몰려옵니다!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "sap"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Sap-coated"
msgstr "수액에 덮임"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sap-coated"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Sap-coated"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're coated in sap!"
msgstr "수액으로 뒤덮였습니다!"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Sap-coated"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The sap's too sticky for you to fight effectively."
msgstr "수액이 너무 찐득하게 달라붙어서 제대로 싸우기 어렵습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "pre_common_cold"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "pre_flu"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Getting Sick"
msgstr "몸이 안 좋아집니다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Getting Sick"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are coming down with some kind of sickness.  It's too early to tell how "
"bad it's going to be, but it might be a good idea to find a safe place to "
"rest."
msgstr ""
"무언가 병에 걸린 듯한 느낌입니다. 증상이 아직은 뚜렷하진 않지만, 얼마나 심각해질지는 두고 봐야 할 것 같습니다. 지금은 안전한 곳에서"
" 휴식을 취하는 게 좋을지도 모릅니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Getting Sick"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel a sickness coming on…"
msgstr "병이 시작되는 느낌이 듭니다…"

#. ~ Male memorial apply log of effect type "Getting Sick"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Started getting sick."
msgstr "병에 걸리기 시작했습니다."

#. ~ Female memorial apply log of effect type "Getting Sick"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Started getting sick."
msgstr "병에 걸리기 시작했습니다."

