#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Simple Home Cooking"
msgstr "간단한 가정 요리"

#. ~ Description of profession "Simple Home Cooking" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been living on your own long enough that you know how to cook basic "
"dishes and feed yourself."
msgstr "혼자서 생활한 지 오래되어 기본적인 요리와 끼니를 해결하는 방법을 알고 있습니다."

