#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Computer Literate"
msgstr "컴퓨터 활용 능력"

#. ~ Description of profession "Computer Literate" for male
#: data/json/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Either through school, your job, or from your family, you've learned the "
"basics of how to use a computer."
msgstr "학교, 직장 또는 가족을 통해 컴퓨터의 기본 사용법을 배웠습니다."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/hobbies.json
