msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Basketball Player"
msgstr "농구 선수"

#. ~ Description of profession "Basketball Player" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your first major game was abruptly canceled when zombies stormed the court."
"  Quick feet and good reflexes meant you were among the lucky few to escape "
"the stadium alive."
msgstr ""
"좀비들이 코트를 습격하면서 첫 메이저 경기가 갑자기 취소되었습니다. 빠른 발과 뛰어난 반사신경 덕분에 경기장에서 살아서 탈출한 소수의 "
"행운아 중 한 명이었습니다."

