#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Convict"
msgstr "죄수"

#. ~ Description of profession "Convict" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your trial was contentious, but ultimately you found yourself behind bars.  "
"The Cataclysm has offered you a chance to escape, but freedom may come with "
"a steep price."
msgstr ""
"당신의 재판은 논쟁의 여지가 많았지만, 결국 감옥에 갇히게 되었습니다. 대격변은 당신에게 탈출의 기회를 제공했지만, 자유에는 가혹한 "
"대가가 따르게 될지도 모릅니다."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Convict"
msgstr "죄수"

#. ~ Description of profession "Convict" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
