#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Martial Artist"
msgstr "무술 초심자"

#. ~ Description of profession "Novice Martial Artist" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've decided today is the day to take your first lesson at the local dojo."
"  You'll be great at it, you're sure of it."
msgstr "오늘을 동네 도장에서 첫 레슨을 받는 날로 정했습니다. 당신은 잘할 수 있을 거라고 확신합니다."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Novice Martial Artist"
msgstr "무술 초심자"

#. ~ Description of profession "Novice Martial Artist" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
