#: data/json/effects_on_condition/misc_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"As you gaze upon the sunset, you feel enraptured by its ethereal beauty."
msgstr "일몰을 바라보며, 그 영묘한 아름다움에 황홀경을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "sunset_morale_buff"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/misc_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The sunset is especially beautiful today."
msgstr "오늘 일몰은 특히 아름답습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "sunset_morale_buff"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/misc_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The sunset always makes you a feel a little bit better."
msgstr "일몰은 항상 당신의 기분을 조금 더 좋게 만듭니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "sunset_morale_buff"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/misc_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"The sunset is hidden behind clouds, but you can still see the pretty amber "
"hue."
msgstr "일몰은 구름 뒤에 숨겨져 있지만, 여전히 아름다운 호박색을 볼 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SPAWN_MANSION_MONSTERS_NEAR_PLAYER"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/scenario_specific_eocs.json
msgid "What was that sound?"
msgstr "무슨 소리였지?"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SPAWN_MANSION_MONSTERS_NEAR_PLAYER"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/scenario_specific_eocs.json
msgid "Is there someone else in here?"
msgstr "여기 다른 사람이 있나요?"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "scenario_assassin_conv"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/scenario_specific_eocs.json
msgid "Now… Where is your mark?"
msgstr "이제… 당신의 표식은 어디에 있나요?"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_lone_survivor"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/scenario_specific_eocs.json
msgid ""
"They are all dead.  The group you were surviving with has been annihilated."
"  Their bodies are still nearby.  You are the last one left alive and their "
"screams will haunt you."
msgstr ""
"그들은 모두 죽었습니다.  당신이 살아남은 그룹은 소멸되었습니다.  그들의 시체는 여전히 근처에 있습니다.  당신은 마지막으로 남은 "
"마지막 사람이고 그들의 비명은 당신을 괴롭힐 것입니다."

#. ~ Weather type name
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/scenario_specific_eocs.json
msgid "Moonlit"
msgstr "달빛이 비치는"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_scenario_clear_weather"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/scenario_specific_eocs.json
msgid "The moon shines brightly."
msgstr "달이 밝게 빛납니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "thunder"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "magic_weather_thunder"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/weather_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/weather_eocs.json
msgid "You hear a distant rumble of thunder."
msgstr "멀리서 천둥 소리가 들립니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "lightning"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "magic_weather_lightning"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/weather_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/weather_eocs.json
msgid "A flash of lightning illuminates your surroundings!"
msgstr "번쩍이는 번개가 주위를 밝게 비춥니다!"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "slot_machine_examine"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mapgen_eocs/furniture_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have any money to gamble with."
msgstr "도박할 돈이 없습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mapgen_eocs/furniture_eocs.json
msgid "&How much money do you want to bet?"
msgstr "&돈 얼마나 걸 거야?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mapgen_eocs/furniture_eocs.json
msgid "Twenty dollars."
msgstr "20달러."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mapgen_eocs/furniture_eocs.json
msgid "Ten dollars."
msgstr "10달러."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mapgen_eocs/furniture_eocs.json
msgid "Five dollars."
msgstr "5달러."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mapgen_eocs/furniture_eocs.json
msgid "One dollar."
msgstr "1달러."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mapgen_eocs/furniture_eocs.json
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "Walk away."
msgstr "떠난다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in effect in EoC
#. "slot_machine_gamble_chance"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mapgen_eocs/furniture_eocs.json
msgid "Oh, you lost!"
msgstr "아, 당신이 졌습니다!"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in effect in EoC
#. "slot_machine_gamble_chance"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mapgen_eocs/furniture_eocs.json
msgid "Three cherries!  You get your money back."
msgstr "세 체리!  당신은 돈을 돌려받습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in effect in EoC
#. "slot_machine_gamble_chance"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mapgen_eocs/furniture_eocs.json
msgid "Three bells!  You double your money!"
msgstr "세 종!  당신은 당신의 돈을 두 배로 늘립니다!"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in effect in EoC
#. "slot_machine_gamble_chance"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mapgen_eocs/furniture_eocs.json
msgid "Three stars!  You triple your money!"
msgstr "세 별!  당신은 당신의 돈을 트리플합니다!"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in effect in EoC
#. "slot_machine_gamble_chance"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mapgen_eocs/furniture_eocs.json
msgid "Three sevens, JACKPOT!  You get 100 times your bet!"
msgstr "세 시벤스, 잭팟!  당신은 100 배의 베팅을 얻습니다!"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CONTACTS"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/contant_lenses_eocs.json
msgid "These lenses won't help you with your sight problems."
msgstr "이 렌즈는 시력 문제에 도움이 되지 않을 것입니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CONTACTS"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/contant_lenses_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have any sight problems that require lenses."
msgstr "렌즈가 필요한 시력 문제가 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CONTACTS1"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/contant_lenses_eocs.json
msgid "Can't apply contact lenses underwater."
msgstr "물속에서는 콘택트렌즈를 착용할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CONTACTS2"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/contant_lenses_eocs.json
msgid "You remove your old contact lenses and apply a new pair."
msgstr "오래된 콘택트렌즈를 제거하고 새 렌즈를 착용합니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CONTACTS2"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/contant_lenses_eocs.json
msgid "You decide not to open the sealed lenses case."
msgstr "밀봉된 렌즈 케이스를 열지 않기로 결정합니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_CONTACTS2"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/contant_lenses_eocs.json
msgid "You apply a new pair of contact lenses."
msgstr "새 콘택트렌즈를 착용합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_REGEN_SERUM_PAIN_SPIKE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/regen_serum_eoc.json
msgid ""
"You feel an immense pain, when something within your bloodstream moves "
"eerily."
msgstr "혈류 속에서 무언가가 섬뜩하게 움직일 때 엄청난 고통을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "regen_serum_main"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/regen_serum_eoc.json
msgid "Injected 48x-\"Locutus\""
msgstr "48x-\"Locutus\" 주입"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Injected 48x-"Locutus""
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/regen_serum_eoc.json
msgid ""
"You just took a shot of some weird stuff.  You feel sleepy, nauseous, and "
"generally weak, but your wounds are closing up at an unnatural pace."
msgstr "방금 이상한 사진을 찍으셨네요. 졸리고, 메스껍고, 전반적으로 기운이 없지만, 상처가 비정상적으로 빨리 아물고 있어요."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Injected 48x-"Locutus""
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/regen_serum_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Without hesitation, you draw the liquid from the ampule, smack it a bit to "
"release any air, and inject it right into a vein, hoping it won't kill you."
msgstr "망설임 없이 앰플에서 액체를 뽑아내고, 공기를 빼기 위해 살짝 두드린 다음, 죽지 않기를 바라며 바로 정맥에 주사합니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Injected 48x-"Locutus""
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/regen_serum_eoc.json
msgid "You feel your rapid regeneration fade away, but you still feel sick."
msgstr "빠른 재생력이 사라지는 것을 느끼지만, 여전히 몸이 좋지 않습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "regen_serum_crash_fatigue"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/regen_serum_eoc.json
msgid "Injected Serum Crash"
msgstr "주입된 혈청 충돌"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Injected Serum Crash"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/regen_serum_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Your body regeneration is not as fast as before, but you still feel some "
"weakness."
msgstr "몸의 재생 속도가 이전만큼 빠르지는 않지만, 여전히 약간의 약함을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "SALINE_INFUSION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/saline_infusion_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You prepare the tubing, insert the needle into a vein, and patiently wait "
"for the saline solution to flow into your bloodstream."
msgstr "튜브를 준비하고, 바늘을 정맥에 삽입한 다음, 식염수가 혈류로 흘러들어갈 때까지 참을성 있게 기다립니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SERUM_GENERIFIED"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/serum_eoc.json
msgid "You need a syringe to inject the liquid."
msgstr "액체를 주사하려면 주사기가 필요합니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SERUM_GENERIFIED_2"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/medicine_eocs/serum_eoc.json
msgid "You would not dare to inject two of them at once."
msgstr "두 개를 한 번에 주사할 엄두를 내지 못할 것입니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "changing_failed"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
msgstr "<CHANGING_FAILED>"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "changing_successful"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
msgstr "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "changing_reqs_not_met"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "<CHANGING_ENDS>"
msgstr "<CHANGING_ENDS>"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "changing_mutate2" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "changing_mutate"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "You feel a deep, churning sensation fill your body."
msgstr "몸속 깊은 곳에서 휘젓는 듯한 느낌이 가득합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "You feel a shift in your body, but it quickly reverts."
msgstr "몸에 변화를 느끼지만, 빠르게 되돌아옵니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "Your flesh has taken on an impatient wriggling sensation."
msgstr "살이 조급하게 꿈틀거리는 느낌을 받습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "Your skin feels like wax.  Or wet clay."
msgstr "당신의 피부는 왁스처럼 느껴집니다.  또는 젖은 점토."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You feel as though you're on the cusp of something, if you just give it a "
"bit more time…"
msgstr "조금만 더 시간을 주면 무언가의 문턱에 서 있는 것 같은 느낌이 듭니다…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "Your vision swims.  You feel dizzy."
msgstr "시야가 흐릿해지고 어지러움이 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_FAILED>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"It won't be long now.  Your innards flex and twist in anticipatory "
"contortions."
msgstr "이제 오래 걸리지 않을 거야. 네 내장은 기대감에 몸을 뒤틀며 꿈틀거린다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You begin to feel a sickeningly beautiful ache, the feeling of your cells "
"tearing apart and recombining in strange new patterns."
msgstr "역겹도록 아름다운 통증, 세포가 찢어지고 이상한 새로운 패턴으로 재결합하는 느낌을 받기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "Your body is slowly reshaping itself!"
msgstr "당신의 몸이 서서히 재형성되고 있습니다!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Every muscle you have begins to minutely spasm and cramp as your body starts"
" morphing, slowly, in unearthly new ways."
msgstr "당신의 몸이 천천히, 비현실적인 새로운 방식으로 변형되기 시작하면서 모든 근육이 미세하게 경련하고 쥐가 나기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid "You feel your chest wriggle and begin to palpitate.  Here we go."
msgstr "가슴이 꿈틀거리고 두근거리기 시작하는 걸 느낍니다. 자, 시작해 볼까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_SUCCESS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Tiny ripples begin appearing in your skin and radiating outward like waves."
"  It is indescribably uncomfortable."
msgstr "피부에 작은 잔물결이 나타나 파도처럼 퍼져 나갑니다. 말로 표현할 수 없을 만큼 불편합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_ENDS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You can palpably feel the churning sensation within fade, your mutation cut "
"short by a lack of nutrients."
msgstr "내부의 휘젓는 듯한 감각이 사라지는 것을 분명히 느낄 수 있으며, 영양 부족으로 인해 돌연변이가 중단됩니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_ENDS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"The strain of mutation fades, leaving a throbbing sensation like a bad "
"headache.  Or an afterglow."
msgstr "돌연변이의 긴장감이 사라지고, 심한 두통처럼 욱신거리는 감각이 남는다. 아니면 잔광처럼."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_ENDS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You're pulled back to reality as your body stops warping, leaving you in "
"your current state for the time being."
msgstr "몸이 뒤틀리는 것을 멈추고 현실로 돌아오면서 당장은 현재 상태가 유지됩니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<CHANGING_ENDS>"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/changing_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your mutation abruptly ends from a lack of nutrients.  Back to Earth for "
"now."
msgstr "영양분 부족으로 돌연변이가 갑자기 끝났습니다. 이제 지구로 돌아가겠습니다."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_BIOLUM3_activated"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You launch a glob of bioluminescent material!"
msgstr "생체 발광 물질 덩어리를 발사합니다!"

#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOLUM3_activated"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "Your body is too starved to activate your bioluminescent flare."
msgstr "몸이 너무 굶주려 생체 발광 섬광을 활성화할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_SLIME_SPRAY"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "You spit out some goo onto your enemies!"
msgstr "적들에게 끈적한 물질을 뱉어냅니다!"

#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_SLIME_SPRAY"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid "Your body is too starved to activate your slime spray."
msgstr "몸이 너무 굶주려 점액 분사를 활성화할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_FELINE_LEAP"
#. ~ Description of spell "spell_feline_leap ( Pounce )"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"You squat down, build up tension in your legs, waggling your tail, then "
"release, launching yourself quite a distance."
msgstr "웅크려 앉아 다리에 긴장을 모으고 꼬리를 흔든 다음, 몸을 날려 상당한 거리를 도약합니다."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_FELINE_LEAP"
#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_SHORT_LEAP"
#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_CRUSHING_LEAP"
#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_AVIAN_LEAP"
#. ~ value of variable 'message_fail' in effect in EoC "EOC_LILIN_STRIX_LEAP"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin_trait_eocs.json
msgid "Your legs are too tired to perform a jump."
msgstr "다리가 너무 피곤하여 점프를 할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_SHORT_LEAP"
#. ~ Description of spell "spell_short_leap ( Short Leap )"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"You squat down, build up tension in your legs and release, launching "
"yourself quite a distance."
msgstr "웅크려 앉아 다리에 긴장을 모으고 몸을 날려 상당한 거리를 도약합니다."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_CRUSHING_LEAP"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You squat down, build up tension in your legs and release.  Death from "
"above."
msgstr "쪼그리고 앉아 다리에 긴장을 풀고, 그 긴장을 풀어라. 하늘에서 죽음이 내려온다."

#. ~ value of variable 'message_success' in effect in EoC "EOC_AVIAN_LEAP"
#. ~ Description of spell "spell_avian_leap ( Talon Leap )"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_activation_eocs.json
#: data/json/mutations/mutation_spells.json
msgid ""
"You jump at your target with your talons up front, attempting to deal "
"devastating damage to your target."
msgstr "발톱을 앞으로 내밀고 목표물에 뛰어들어 치명적인 피해를 입히려고 합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNMUTE_BIRD"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "What's that made of?  Glass.  That will have to do."
msgstr "저거 뭐로 만든 거야? 유리잖아. 그걸로 해야겠다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_UNMUTE_BIRD"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Restricting your range to the apes' feels demeaning, and you decide to take "
"a break before you start plucking out your feathers in frustration."
msgstr ""
"원숭이에게만 활동 범위를 제한하는 건 모욕적인 일이라고 생각되어, 좌절감에 빠져 깃털을 뽑기 전에 잠시 휴식을 취하기로 결심합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNMUTE_CEPH"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your sentences are short, and you can't quite control your beak's clicking "
"as you tire.  Still, they will understand, if they want to."
msgstr "네 말은 짧고, 피곤해서 부리가 딱딱거리는 소리도 제대로 조절할 수 없어. 그래도 그들은 이해해 줄 거야. 원한다면 말이야."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_UNMUTE_CEPH"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Draw air into your mantle, close your throat, rehearse your sentence, exhale"
" and contort your beak just so."
msgstr "망토에 공기를 들이마시고, 목을 닫고, 문장을 연습하고, 숨을 내쉬고, 부리를 꼭 그렇게 비틀어 보세요."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNMUTE_GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"As your tongues files down from use the pitch of the different sounds "
"changes, but you have managed to get a few short, raspy sentences out."
msgstr "혀를 천천히 움직여가면서 다양한 소리의 높낮이가 바뀌지만, 짧고 쉰 목소리로 몇 문장을 말하는 데는 성공했습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_UNMUTE_GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"If you rub your tongue against your palate like this is makes a `th` - or at"
" least, a `thrksrkkk`, but it's a start.  Ignore the taste of blood, there's"
" work to be done."
msgstr ""
"이렇게 혀를 입천장에 문지르면 'th' 소리가 나요. 아니면 적어도 'thrksrkkk' 소리가 나지만, 시작이잖아요. 피 맛은 "
"무시하세요. 해야 할 일이 있어요."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNMUTE_INSECT"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You decide on the next few words, cramp your maxillae, and inhale deeply.  "
"With some imagination you can understand the words in the whistling, before "
"your mouthparts fall limp and you need a pause.  Larva steps."
msgstr ""
"다음 몇 마디를 정하고, 턱을 움츠리고 숨을 깊이 들이마십니다. 상상력을 발휘하면 휘파람 소리 속 단어들을 이해할 수 있을 겁니다. 입이"
" 축 늘어지고 잠시 멈춰야 할 때가 오기 전에요. 애벌레 걸음걸이."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_UNMUTE_INSECT"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You have all these new moving parts in your not-mouth, but they are "
"struggling under the strain you put them under."
msgstr "당신은 입이 아닌 입 속에 새로운 움직이는 부품들을 가지고 있지만, 그들은 당신이 가하는 부담을 견디지 못하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNMUTE_SLIME"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You realize you don't need to grow anything nearly as complicated as your "
"old insides - one vesicle per word will suffice, but you needed a long time "
"to learn the right rhythm."
msgstr ""
"당신은 당신의 오래된 내부처럼 복잡한 것을 키울 필요가 없다는 것을 깨달았습니다. 단어 하나당 소포 하나만 있으면 충분하지만, 올바른 "
"리듬을 배우는 데는 오랜 시간이 필요했습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_UNMUTE_SLIME"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Do you need teeth, lungs?  You fall back into your resting shape in "
"exasperation.  This will take long."
msgstr "이가 필요해, 폐가 필요해? 당신은 짜증을 내며 다시 평정심을 되찾는다. 시간이 꽤 걸릴 것이다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTE_BEAK_LOSE_2"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You grasp at the base of your beak and feel the familiar contours of your "
"old mouth.  You give it a try and your voice sounds almost like before."
msgstr "부리 아랫부분을 꽉 쥐고 익숙한 입 모양을 느껴봅니다. 한 번 시도해 보니 목소리가 거의 예전처럼 들립니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MUTE_GASTROPOD_LOSE_2"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You cough up a lot of off-color blood, but you swear in your own old voice "
"again afterwards."
msgstr "색깔이 이상한 피를 많이 토하지만, 그 후 다시 예전 목소리로 욕을 합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "mut_eyestalk"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "Your vision inverts!"
msgstr "시야가 뒤집힙니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "chitin2_molt_timer_3"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your exoskeleton grows steadily more rigid until you can no longer move.  "
"You strain against it for a few minutes, and it peels and cracks away in "
"chunks like a plaster mold, revealing a soft and tender new layer beneath."
msgstr ""
"외골격은 점점 더 단단해지다가 더 이상 움직일 수 없게 됩니다. 몇 분 동안 힘을 주면 석고 틀처럼 조각조각 벗겨지고 갈라지면서 그 "
"아래에 부드럽고 연약한 새로운 층이 드러납니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "chitin2_molt_timer4"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "chitin3_molt_timer4"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "chitin_carapace_molt_timer4"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "Your exoskeleton has finished hardening."
msgstr "외골격이 단단해지는 것을 마쳤습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "chitin3_molt_timer3"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "chitin_carapace_molt_timer3"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your exoskeleton locks up around you like a straitjacket, completely "
"immobilizing you.  As you try to move, you begin to feel it painlessly rip, "
"opening a hole through which you can slowly emerge, raw, soft, and "
"vulnerable."
msgstr ""
"외골격이 구속복처럼 몸을 감싸 완전히 움직이지 못하게 합니다. 움직이려고 하면 고통 없이 찢기는 듯한 느낌이 들기 시작하고, 그 틈을 "
"통해 당신은 천천히, 거칠고, 부드럽고, 취약한 모습으로 빠져나올 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "hay_fever_spring_fall"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "hay_fever_summer"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "Your eyes water and your nose itches."
msgstr "눈물이 나고 코가 가렵습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "sneeze"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "You sneeze!"
msgstr "재채기를 합니다!"

#. ~ Player makes sound in effect in EoC "sneeze"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "a sneeze!"
msgstr "재채기!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "shed_summer_timer_lupine"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "shed_summer_timer_ursine"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You've been shedding for a while, and your coat feels noticeably lighter."
msgstr "한동안 털갈이를 했더니 털이 눈에 띄게 가벼워졌습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "regrow_timer_lupine"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "regrow_timer_ursine"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "It looks like your coat has grown back in for the colder seasons."
msgstr "추운 계절을 맞아 털이 다시 자란 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "seasonal_affective_fall"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "It's only fall, but you already miss the summer sun."
msgstr "아직 가을인데도 벌써 여름 햇살이 그립습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "seasonal_affective_winter"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "The long, cold nights really get you feeling down."
msgstr "길고 추운 밤은 정말 당신을 우울하게 만듭니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ink_grand_spray"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "Your ink glands spray some ink into your attacker's eyes!"
msgstr "먹물샘이 공격자의 눈에 먹물을 뿌립니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_insect_wings_shutoff"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have the stamina to keep buzzing."
msgstr "계속 윙윙거릴 체력이 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_social2_penalty"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "You could use some friendly company."
msgstr "친근한 동반자가 필요할 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_asocial2_penalty"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/mutation_eocs/mutation_effect_eocs.json
msgid "You'd really rather be by yourself."
msgstr "정말 혼자 있고 싶습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LIXA_UNFOLD_ENTRY"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
msgid ""
"You step into a space that unfolds around you, becoming endless and "
"completely flat.  Every side of every surface is on display.  You look down "
"at your hands; you can see the front, the back, the insides and outsides of "
"every vein and bone, all in the same place on one surface.  You can't "
"imagine what has happened to your eyes to let you understand what you are "
"seeing.  Or your brain."
msgstr ""
"당신은 당신 주변으로 펼쳐지는 공간 속으로 발을 들여놓습니다. 끝없이 펼쳐지고 완전히 평평해집니다. 모든 표면의 모든 면이 펼쳐집니다. "
"당신은 손을 내려다봅니다. 모든 혈관과 뼈의 앞면, 뒷면, 안과 밖이 모두 한 표면의 같은 자리에 보입니다. 당신은 당신의 눈에 무슨 "
"일이 일어났는지, 그리고 당신의 뇌에 무슨 일이 일어났는지 상상조차 할 수 없습니다. 당신이 보고 있는 것을 이해할 수 있도록 말입니다."

#. ~ Success message in teleportation in nested effect in switch statement in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_LIXA_BACK"
#. ~ Success message in teleportation in nested effect in switch statement in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_LIXA_FORWARD"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
msgid "You walk for a long while."
msgstr "한참을 걷습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LIXA_unfold_return"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/LIXA_EOCs_spells_traps.json
msgid ""
"There is a soft sound, like a champagne cork popping in an empty concert "
"hall.  The world is almost as it was again, aside from a brief strange "
"feeling.  The LIXA device still hums quietly as it finishes powering down."
msgstr ""
"텅 빈 콘서트홀에서 샴페인 코르크가 터지는 듯한 부드러운 소리가 난다. 세상은 잠시 낯선 느낌을 제외하면 거의 예전과 같다. LIXA "
"장치는 전원이 꺼지는 동안에도 여전히 조용히 윙윙거린다."

#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_LS_Teleport_to_labyrinth"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/labyrinth_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Nope!"
msgstr "아니요!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LS_Teleport_to_labyrinth"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/labyrinth_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Zwoink."
msgstr "즈윙크."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LS_Exit_labyrinth"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/labyrinth_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Zworunk"
msgstr "즈워렁크"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LS_Exit_labyrinth_sparkling_chasm"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/labyrinth_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"As you fall into the chasm, you see a multitude of stars, spots, and other "
"shapes.  It's like you're sinking ever further into quicksand, yet falling "
"through the air at the same time.  Your head throbs with pain as the "
"pressure increases, and you black out.  When you come to, you're back in "
"reality: disoriented but unharmed."
msgstr ""
"그 틈으로 빠지면서 수많은 별, 점, 그리고 다른 형체들이 보입니다. 마치 모래사장 속으로 점점 더 깊이 빠져드는 듯하면서도 동시에 "
"공중으로 떨어지는 듯한 느낌입니다. 압력이 증가함에 따라 머리가 욱신거리고 정신을 잃습니다. 정신을 차렸을 때, 당신은 현실로 "
"돌아왔습니다. 방향 감각을 잃었지만 무사했습니다."

#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_nether_glass_lost_tp"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_nether_glass_event"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_NEXT_LEVEL"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_STORM_DUNGEON_EXIT"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ENTER_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_DUNGEON"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ENTER_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_NEXT_LEVEL"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ENTER_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_NEXT_LEVEL"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_EXIT"
#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_UNDINE_WARP_POOL_BOTTOM_FLOOR"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_glass_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/abyssal_hunger_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/elemental_eruptions.json
msgid "Something is very wrong!"
msgstr "뭔가 크게 잘못되었습니다!"

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_nether_glass_yrax_encounter" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_nether_glass_event"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_glass_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The emptiness yields before an all-encompassing construct."
msgstr "공허함이 모든 것을 아우르는 구조물 앞에 무너집니다."

#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_nether_glass_yrax_encounter" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_nether_glass_event"
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_MEDIUM"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_glass_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Reality twists and deforms as wriggling chunks of it fall on the ground."
msgstr "현실이 뒤틀리고 변형되며 꿈틀거리는 조각들이 땅에 떨어집니다."

#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/vanilla_overwrites.json
msgid ""
"As it stops moving, the creature quickly begins to darken and turn "
"translucent, shattering like glass soon after."
msgstr "움직임을 멈추자, 그 생물은 빠르게 어두워지고 반투명해지기 시작하며, 곧 유리처럼 산산조각 납니다."

#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/vanilla_overwrites.json
msgid ""
"As it stops moving, the creature's skin turns darker and it falls limp like "
"a pool noodle."
msgstr "움직임을 멈추자, 그 생물의 피부는 더 어두워지고 수영장 막대처럼 축 늘어집니다."

#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/vanilla_overwrites.json
msgid ""
"As it stops moving, the creature seems to lose all detail and falls limply "
"on the ground with a wet thud."
msgstr "움직임을 멈추자, 그 생물은 모든 세부 사항을 잃은 듯 축 늘어져 젖은 쿵 소리와 함께 땅에 떨어집니다."

#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/vanilla_overwrites.json
msgid ""
"As it stops moving, the creature seems to stiffen as it skins seems to "
"harden and take a form not dissimilar to stone."
msgstr "움직임을 멈추자, 그 생물은 피부가 단단해지고 돌과 다르지 않은 형태를 취하면서 굳어지는 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in switch
#. statement in effect in EoC "EOC_YUGG_DEATH"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/nether_monster_death.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/vanilla_overwrites.json
msgid ""
"As it falls to the ground, strands of fog seem to tear away from the corpse."
"  The giant worm dissolves in the air in front of your eyes."
msgstr "시체가 땅에 떨어지자 안개가 시체에서 걷혀 나갑니다. 거대한 벌레가 눈앞에서 허공으로 사라집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MORALE_GOOD"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You feel a warm sense of being at home."
msgstr "집에 있는 듯한 따뜻한 느낌을 받습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_1"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a weight you didn't know you had on you, being lifted "
"away."
msgstr "당신은 갑자기 자신에게 있었는지 몰랐던 무게가 들어 올려지는 것을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_2"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel wakeful and energized, as if something that was slowing "
"you down is now gone."
msgstr "갑자기 몸이 들뜨고 기운이 넘칩니다. 당신을 붙잡고 늘어지던 무언가가 놓은 듯 몸이 가벼워집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_3"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You suddenly feel as if invisible shackles are being lifted away…"
msgstr "갑자기 당신을 묶고 있던 족쇄가 풀리는 것 같은 느낌을 받습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_4"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_5"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a profound sense of belonging take root inside you, "
"spreading throughout your body.  It fades quickly, but something warm "
"remains…"
msgstr ""
"갑자기 깊은 소속감이 마음속에 뿌리내리며 온몸으로 퍼져 나가는 것을 느낀다. 그 느낌은 금세 사라지지만, 따뜻한 무언가가 남아 있다…"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_ACCEPTANCE_4"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a profound sense of belonging take root inside you, but "
"then abruptly grow cold.  You reach out for it, but it's gone now, taken "
"away by the indoors.  You long for the sky…"
msgstr ""
"갑자기 마음속 깊은 소속감이 뿌리내리는 것을 느낀다가, 이내 갑자기 차가워진다. 그 소속감을 찾으려 손을 뻗어 보지만, 이제는 사라져 "
"버렸다. 실내에 갇힌 당신에게서. 하늘이 그리워진다…"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_FOCUS_GOOD"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Everything suddenly feels more clear."
msgstr "당신이 보고 느끼는 모든게 또렷해지는 느낌입니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_MORALE_BAD"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You suddenly feel like you shouldn't be here."
msgstr "갑자기 당신의 육체와 정신이 이런 곳에 있으면 안될 것 같은 기분이 듭니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_FOCUS_BAD"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You try to recall what you were about to do, but you can't focus…"
msgstr "당신은 방금까지 무엇을 하려고 했는지 까먹었습니다. 기억해내려고 애쓰지만 집중을 할 수 없군요…"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_STR_BAD"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You suddenly feel feeble.  Your muscles wobble."
msgstr "갑자기 힘이 풀리고, 몸이 떨리기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DEX_BAD"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a sharp pain in your hand.  You reach out to grab it, and "
"miss."
msgstr "갑자기 손에 날카로운 가시가 박힌듯한 고통이 느껴집니다. 반사적으로 가시를 잡으려고 했지만, 아무것도 없군요…"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_PER_BAD"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You blink one time, and everything seems bigger."
msgstr "갑자기 모든게 크게 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_INT_BAD"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You stop to think, but you can't seem to remember about what."
msgstr "당신이 생각을 멈추자, 그게 무슨 생각이였는지 기억조차 나지 않습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_SHAKES"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You feel anxious for no reason."
msgstr "갑자기 기분이 초조해집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_NAUSEA"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You suddenly feel as if your stomach and its contents are fighting."
msgstr "갑자기 당신의 위장이 위산마저도 거부하는 듯한 느낌이 듭니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_STUN"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "For a brief moment, you feel rejected by the world."
msgstr "한순간에 이 세상으로부터 거절당한 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DOWNED"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Gravity suddenly exerts immense pressure, forcing you to the ground!"
msgstr "갑자기 땅이 당신을 확 끌어오는 듯한 압력이 느껴지더니, 저항하지 못하고 쓰러집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DAMAGE_CONSTANT"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Your vision suddenly fills with cold sparks.  You feel so alone…"
msgstr "갑자기 주변이 싸늘해지더니, 이 세상에 당신 혼자만 남은 듯한 기분이 듭니다…"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_PAIN_CONSTANT"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Faint sparks surround your body as you suffer with every action you take, as"
" if you weren't intended to do them."
msgstr "몸이 뻣뻣하게 느껴지고, 움직일 때마다 쥐가 난듯 아픕니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_PAIN"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Faint sparks suddenly appear and disappear around you, as if rejecting your "
"very existence.  Pain flares across your body."
msgstr ""
"당신의 존재 자체가 부정당하는 듯 몸 주변에 희미한 빛이 일어나다가 사라지더니 바늘로 후벼파는 듯한 고통이 온 몸에 퍼집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_0"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You feel invigorated by what you just experienced, so…  What is this feeling"
" of regret for leaving that place?"
msgstr "당신은 방금까지 경험한 것으로부터 활기가 느껴집니다. 이상하게도 미련이 남는 것 같네요…"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_1"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You feel like the shackles of your body are loosening a little.  The world "
"seems to accept your distorted presence for now.  You wonder if what you "
"currently feel would have been greater if only you had gone deeper…"
msgstr ""
"몸을 묶고 있던 족쇄가 조금 풀리는 것 같은 기분이 듭니다. 세상이 마치 당신의 왜곡된 존재를 받아들이는 것 같습니다. 아마도 더 깊이 "
"들어갔다면 이 족쇄를 완전히 풀 수 있었을까요…?"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_2"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel in calm, your body a little faster, and your surroundings "
"less hostile than what you remember.  Before this new sensation passes away "
"though, you hear a little voice in your head saying \"deeper…\""
msgstr ""
"갑작스런 평온함이 당신을 감싸며, 몸이 한결 가벼워지고, 주변이 이전보다 덜 적대적으로 느껴집니다. 그러나 이 새로운 감각이 사라지기 "
"전에, 당신의 내면에서 작은 목소리가 \"더 깊이…\" 라고 속삭입니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_3"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You return to your reality with a sense of ecstasy, your body feels great, "
"your shackles have come loose and you feel powerful because of it.  But you "
"can feel it, this exhilarating feeling is only the beginning, you need to go"
" deeper…"
msgstr ""
"환희의 감정을 느끼며 현실로 돌아왔습니다. 몸의 기분이 좋아지고, 당신을 묶던 족쇄가 완전히 풀린 듯하며, 전보다 강해진 느낌을 "
"받습니다. 그러나 이것도 단순히 시작에 불과한건 확실한게 느껴집니다. 더 깊이, 더 멀리 파고들어야만 합니다…"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_4"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You feel in communion with the world around you, the world is no longer "
"rejecting you, at least for now, YOU are rejecting IT.  Your whole body "
"craves for what you could have gained if only you had gone a little deeper…"
msgstr ""
"당신은 주변 세계와 하나가 되는 듯한 느낌을 받습니다. 세계가 당신을 더 이상 거부하지 않는 것 같지만, 당신이 이를 거부하는 것입니다."
" 적어도 지금은 말이죠.. 당신의 온 몸이 그곳을 더 깊이 파고들었다면 얻을 수 있었을 힘을 갈망합니다…"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_DEPENDENT_DUNGEON_REWARD_5"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_dependent_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel a profound sense of belonging take root inside you, "
"temporally amplifying your grasp of reality.  For some time you will be the "
"master of your surroundings."
msgstr ""
"갑자기 마음속 깊은 소속감이 뿌리내리며 현실 감각이 일시적으로 확장되는 것을 느낍니다. 한동안 당신은 주변 환경의 주인이 될 것입니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CAUSE_EARLY_PORTAL_STORM"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CAUSE_EARLY_PORTAL_STORM_ACTUAL"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/effects_on_condition/altered_eocs.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_premonition_instances.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly register a buzzing in your senses.  It's getting louder, and "
"your head starts to throb.  Somewhere nearby, a tiny cataclysm has begun "
"(check mission log for details)."
msgstr ""
"갑자기 형용할 수 없는 복잡한 감각이 느껴지더니 머리 속이 울렁거립니다. 무언가가 점점 다가오고 있습니다.  당신의 주변에 또 다른 "
"대격변이 시작됩니다. (퀘스트 리스트를 확인하세요)"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CAUSE_PORTAL_STORM"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Reality is breaking!"
msgstr "현실이 무너지기 시작합니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CANCEL_PORTAL_STORM"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"As suddenly as it began, the portal storm fades.  Reality returns to normal."
"  Hopefully the scarring is minimal…"
msgstr "포털 폭풍이 갑작스레 희미해져가고, 현실이 정상으로 돌아갑니다. 현실의 균열이 크지 않기를 빌어야죠…"

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_SHIFTING_MASS"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Small gashes in reality open nearby, revealing an endless expanse of black "
"water.  An alien being spills through before the portals close."
msgstr ""
"현실 세계에 작은 균열이 생겨 근처에서 끝없이 펼쳐진 검은 물이 드러난다. 차원문이 닫히기 전, 외계 생명체가 쏟아져 나온다."

#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_SHIFTING_MASS"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Small gashes in reality open nearby, revealing an endless expanse of black "
"water.  Several alien beings spill out before the portals close."
msgstr ""
"현실 세계에 작은 균열이 근처에서 열리며 끝없이 펼쳐진 검은 물이 드러난다. 차원문이 닫히기 전에 외계 생명체 몇 마리가 쏟아져 나온다."

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_WEAK"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "A chunk of reality gets loose and falls on the ground."
msgstr "현실의 한 조각이 풀려나 땅에 떨어집니다."

#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_WEAK"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Chunks of reality get loose and fall on the ground."
msgstr "현실의 조각들이 풀려나 땅에 떨어집니다."

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_MEDIUM"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Reality twists and deforms as a wriggling chunk of it falls on the ground."
msgstr "현실이 뒤틀리고 변형되며 꿈틀거리는 한 조각이 땅에 떨어집니다."

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_STRONG"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "A chunk of reality tears itself asunder and takes shape on the ground."
msgstr "현실의 한 조각이 스스로 찢어져 땅 위에서 형태를 이룹니다."

#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ARTIFACT_STRONG"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"Chunks of reality tear themselves asunder and take shape on the ground."
msgstr "현실의 조각들이 스스로 찢어져 땅 위에서 형태를 이룹니다."

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_IMPOSSIBLE_SHAPE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You cannot remember how the impossible shape came to be here.  The pain in "
"your head suggests that that's a good thing."
msgstr "그 불가능한 형상이 어떻게 여기 있게 되었는지 당신은 기억할 수 없습니다. 머릿속의 고통은 그것이 좋은 일임을 암시합니다."

#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_IMPOSSIBLE_SHAPE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You cannot remember how the impossible shapes came to be here.  The pain in "
"your head suggests that that's a good thing."
msgstr "불가능한 형상들이 어떻게 여기 있게 되었는지 당신은 기억할 수 없습니다. 머릿속의 고통은 그것이 좋은 일임을 암시합니다."

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_FLATLANDER"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"something glides into your field of vision out of thin air, slipping between"
" the space between atoms."
msgstr "원자 사이의 공간으로 뭔가가 공기 중에서 미끄러져 들어와 시야에 들어온다."

#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_FLATLANDER"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"several things glide into your field of vision out of thin air, slipping "
"between the spaces between atoms."
msgstr "여러 가지 물체가 원자 사이의 틈으로 미끄러져 들어가 시야에 들어옵니다."

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_GIANT_APPENDAGE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "A gigantic limb tears its way into reality."
msgstr "거대한 사지가 현실 속으로 찢고 들어옵니다."

#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_GIANT_APPENDAGE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Gigantic limbs tear their way into reality around you."
msgstr "거대한 사지들이 당신 주변의 현실 속으로 찢고 들어옵니다."

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_MEMORIES"
#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_conjure_memories"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/json/mapgen/haunting.json
msgid "A flickering silhouette appears nearby."
msgstr "근처에 깜빡이는 실루엣이 나타납니다."

#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_MEMORIES"
#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_conjure_memories"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
#: data/json/mapgen/haunting.json
msgid "Human silhouettes appear and surround you."
msgstr "인간 실루엣들이 나타나 당신을 둘러쌉니다."

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_ABSENCE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"The very notion of empty space is made a cruel joke.  Nearby nothing becomes"
" even less."
msgstr "빈 공간의 개념은 잔인한 농담이되었습니다.  근처의 아무것도 줄어들지 않습니다."

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_SWARM_STRUCTURE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The swarm structure was always here, right?"
msgstr "군집 구조는 항상 여기에 있었죠, 그렇죠?"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_PAIN"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You awake with a start from what must have been a violent and horrifying "
"daydream.  Your body aches as if the wounds were real."
msgstr "처음엔 폭력적이고 공포스러운, 꿈 같았던 것이 진짜였던 것처럼 느껴집니다. 꿈에서 겪은 부상들이 너무나 고통스럽습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_SMOKE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"A million tiny pinpricks in space open for an instant, and smoke fills the "
"air."
msgstr "공간에서 수백만 개의 작은 구멍들이 갑자기 열리더니, 공기 중을 연기로 가득 채웁니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_YRAX_ATTENTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "An alien construct emerges from the storm."
msgstr "폭풍 속에서 외계 구조물이 나타납니다."

#. ~ Player makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_TAUNT"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The voice was loud, it might have drawn attention to you!"
msgstr "당신의 주변에 목소리가 크게 납니다. 원치 않은 관심을 끌었을 수도 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_TELEPORT_STUCK_START"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The moment feels thick, as if it's not quite over."
msgstr "아직 끝나지 않았다는 듯, 이 순간이 짙게만 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Player makes sound in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_TELEPORT_STUCK_LOOP"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "a loud tearing sound."
msgstr "촤아아악!"

#. ~ Success message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PORTAL_TELEPORT_STUCK"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "You feel an intense sense of deja vu."
msgstr "데쟈뷰가 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_LIGHT"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "The sun is snuffed out like a candle."
msgstr "태양이 촛불처럼 꺼집니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_LIGHT"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid "Some of the stars grow so bright that they hurt to look at."
msgstr "어떤 별들은 너무 밝아 쳐다보기조차 힘듭니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_INCORPOREAL"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
msgid ""
"You feel stretched, as if part of you was elsewhere.  You are not solid "
"enough to affect matter, and your equipment falls through you."
msgstr ""
"당신의 일부분이 외딴 곳까지 간 듯 몸이 늘어지는게 느껴집니다. 당신의 장비를 포함한 물체들이 당신의 몸을 무시하고 통과합니다."

#. ~ Player makes sound in effect in EoC "EOC_PORTAL_GRASS_CHANGE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/nether_eocs/portal_storm_effect_on_condition.json
