#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "folded wall"
msgstr "접힌 벽"

#. ~ Description of terrain "folded wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid ""
"When looked at out of the side of the eye, this wall seems to bend and curve"
" in on itself and when looked at head on it seems to be a repeating pattern "
"of solid concrete hexagons."
msgstr ""
"곁눈질로 보면 이 벽은 스스로 구부러지고 휘어지는 것처럼 보이며, 정면으로 보면 단단한 콘크리트 육각형이 반복되는 패턴처럼 보입니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
