"Big and powerful generator, painted in camo.  It just needs to be plugged "
"in, fueled up, and then turned on."
msgstr "크고 강력한 발전기, 위장색으로 도색되어 있습니다. 플러그를 꽂고 연료를 넣은 후 켜기만 하면 됩니다."

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_generators.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_generators.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_generators.json
msgid "powerful gasoline generator"
msgid_plural "powerful gasoline generators"
msgstr[0] "강력한 휘발유 발전기"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "powerful gasoline generator"
#. ~ Description of "powerful gasoline generator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_generators.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_generators.json
msgid ""
"Still reasonably portable, this 12000 W gasoline generator can power up an "
"entire house.  It just needs to be plugged in, fueled up, and then turned "
"on."
msgstr ""
"휴대성이 꽤 좋은 이 12,000W 가솔린 발전기는 온 집안에 전력을 공급할 수 있습니다. 플러그를 꽂고 연료를 채운 후 전원을 켜기만 "
"하면 됩니다."

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
