#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "heavy-duty fridge"
msgid_plural "heavy-duty fridges"
msgstr[0] "대형 냉장고"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty fridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty refrigerator.  When turned on, it will cool the food inside, "
"extending the time until the food spoils."
msgstr ""
"식당에서 많은 양의 음식을 보관할 때 사용하는 대형 냉장고입니다. 전원을 켜면 안에 들어있는 음식들의 온도를 낮춰 음식의 부패를 "
"늦춥니다."

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "display fridge"
msgid_plural "display fridges"
msgstr[0] "진열용 냉장고"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "display fridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A display fridge.  When turned on, it will cool the food inside, extending "
"the time until the food spoils."
msgstr ""
"안의 내용물을 볼 수 있는 유리문이 달린 냉장고입니다. 전원을 켜면 안에 들어있는 음식들의 온도를 낮춰 음식의 부패를 늦춥니다."

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/items/appliances.json
msgid "freezer"
msgid_plural "freezers"
msgstr[0] "냉동고"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "freezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A common upright freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, "
"preventing any further expiration."
msgstr "일반적인 수직형 냉동고입니다. 전원을 켜면 안에 있는 음식이 얼어서 더 이상 유통기한이 지나지 않습니다."

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "minifreezer"
msgid_plural "minifreezers"
msgstr[0] "소형 냉동고"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "minifreezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A small freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, preventing"
" any further expiration."
msgstr "작은 냉동고입니다. 전원을 켜면 안에 있는 음식이 얼어서 더 이상 유통기한이 지나지 않습니다."

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "chest minifreezer"
msgid_plural "chest minifreezers"
msgstr[0] "상자형 소형 냉동고"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "chest minifreezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A small chest freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, "
"preventing any further expiration."
msgstr "작은 냉동고입니다. 전원을 켜면 안에 있는 음식이 얼어서 더 이상 유통기한이 지나지 않습니다."

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "food truck freezer"
msgid_plural "food truck freezers"
msgstr[0] "푸드트럭 냉동고"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "food truck freezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A heavy, portable freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, "
"preventing any further expiration."
msgstr "무겁고 휴대하기 편한 냉동고입니다. 전원을 켜면 안에 있는 음식이 얼어서 더 이상 유통기한이 지나지 않습니다."

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "chest freezer"
msgid_plural "chest freezers"
msgstr[0] "상자형 냉동고"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "chest freezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A big chest freezer.  When turned on, it will freeze the food inside, "
"preventing any further expiration.  Don't fall in!"
msgstr "큰 냉동고. 전원을 켜면 안에 있는 음식이 얼어서 더 이상 상하지 않습니다. 빠지지 마세요!"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/appliances_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
