#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "leather-padded pants"
msgid_plural "leather-padded pants"
msgstr[0] "가죽 덧대진 바지"

#. ~ Description of "leather-padded pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of tough canvas pants with sections from leather pants affixed, "
"excluding the joints.  Offers mild protection without compromising mobility "
"too much, but a lot of the pockets have been removed to make room for the "
"leather."
msgstr ""
"가죽 바지의 접합 부분을 제외한 부분을 부착한 튼튼한 캔버스 바지입니다. 활동성을 크게 해치지 않으면서도 가벼운 보호 기능을 제공하지만,"
" 가죽을 위한 공간을 확보하기 위해 주머니를 많이 없앴습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "cloth-padded pants"
msgid_plural "cloth-padded pants"
msgstr[0] "천 덧대진 바지"

#. ~ Description of "cloth-padded pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of tough canvas pants with sections of cotton sewn onto it in a "
"crossing pattern, clearly done by an amateur."
msgstr "튼튼한 캔버스 바지에 면 조각을 교차 패턴으로 꿰맨 모습은 아마추어가 한 게 분명합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "riot leg guards (pair)"
msgid_plural "riot leg guards (pair)"
msgstr[0] "폭동 진압 다리 보호대 (한 쌍)"

#. ~ Description of "riot leg guards (pair)"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "Hard leg guards used by riot police."
msgstr "진압 경찰이 사용하는 단단한 다리 보호대."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "leather leg guards (pair)"
msgid_plural "leather leg guards (pair)"
msgstr[0] "가죽 다리 보호대 (한 쌍)"

#. ~ Description of "leather leg guards (pair)"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_armor.json
msgid "A pair of tough leather leg guards.  Light and comfortable."
msgstr "튼튼한 가죽 레그 가드. 가볍고 편안합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "antarvasa"
msgid_plural "antarvasas"
msgstr[0] "안타르바사"

#. ~ Description of "antarvasa"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Buddhist skirt.  The bottom protrudes, and "
"appears in the rough shape of a triangle."
msgstr "발목까지 내려오는 전통 불교 치마입니다. 밑단이 튀어나와 있으며, 대략 삼각형 모양을 하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "basketball shorts"
msgid_plural "basketball shorts"
msgstr[0] "농구용 반바지"

#. ~ Description of "basketball shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of basketball shorts.  Comfortable and light."
msgstr "농구용 반바지. 편안하고 가볍습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "breeches"
msgid_plural "breeches"
msgstr[0] "브리치즈"

#. ~ Description of "breeches"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A well-made pair of old-fashioned pants, made of stiff yet baggy material.  "
"Comfortable, but lacks pockets."
msgstr "뻣뻣하지만 헐렁한 재료로 만든 옛날 바지. 편하지만, 주머니가 없습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "cheerleader skirt"
msgid_plural "cheerleader skirts"
msgstr[0] "치어리더 치마"

#. ~ Description of "cheerleader skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A breezy red cheerleader skirt.  Easy to move in, and of an acceptable "
"length for most real cheerleading."
msgstr "산뜻한 빨간색 치어리더 스커트입니다. 움직이기 편하고, 대부분의 실제 치어리딩에 적합한 길이입니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "short cheerleader skirt"
msgid_plural "short cheerleader skirts"
msgstr[0] "짧은 치어리더 치마"

#. ~ Description of "short cheerleader skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A very short and breezy red cheerleader skirt.  Easy to move in, but you "
"will probably need shorts underneath to safely practice cheerleading in "
"this."
