#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
msgid "long knit scarf (headwrap)"
msgid_plural "long knit scarves (headwrap)"
msgstr[0] "긴 니트 스카프 (머리)"

#. ~ Description of "long knit scarf (headwrap)"
#: data/json/items/armor/scarfs.json
