#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "light Kevlar wetsuit oversuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_bodysuits.json
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "Pants pocket."
msgstr "바지 주머니"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "work coveralls"
#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "heavy work coveralls"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "Chest pocket."
msgstr "가슴 주머니"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "heavy work coveralls"
msgid_plural "heavy work coveralls"
msgstr[0] "두꺼운 작업용 오버롤"

#. ~ Description of "heavy work coveralls"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A thick, fully covering jumpsuit made of waterproof canvas lined with extra "
"fabric for warmth in brisk weather.  Offers solid protection from everyday "
"dangers on the job and plenty of storage pockets."
msgstr ""
"방수 캔버스 소재에 두꺼운 전신 커버 점프수트로, 쌀쌀한 날씨에도 따뜻하게 입을 수 있도록 특수 원단을 안감으로 덧대었습니다. 일상적인 "
"업무 위험으로부터 안전하게 보호하며, 넉넉한 수납 포켓이 있습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "union suit"
msgid_plural "union suits"
msgstr[0] "일체형 속옷"

#. ~ Description of "union suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A one-piece suit of full-body long underwear that helps to maintain body "
"temperature.  It laces closed in the front."
msgstr "전신을 감싸는 일체형 속옷으로, 체온 유지에 도움이 됩니다. 앞 부분을 끈으로 여미게 되어 있습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "fursuit"
msgid_plural "fursuits"
msgstr[0] "퍼슈트"

#. ~ Description of "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A full-body fursuit in the form of an anthropomorphic animal.  It is quite "
"encumbering and has little storage but is very warm."
msgstr "의인화된 동물 모양의 전신 퍼슈트입니다. 꽤 무겁고 수납공간이 부족하지만 매우 따뜻합니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "wolf fursuit"
msgid_plural "wolf fursuits"
msgstr[0] "늑대 퍼슈트"

#. ~ Description of variant "wolf fursuit" of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A cartoonish full-body fursuit made to resemble an anthropomorphic wolf.  It"
" is quite encumbering and has little storage but is very warm."
msgstr "의인화된 늑대를 본떠 만든 만화 같은 전신 퍼슈트입니다. 꽤 크고 수납공간이 부족하지만 매우 따뜻합니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "dog fursuit"
msgid_plural "dog fursuits"
msgstr[0] "개 퍼슈트"

#. ~ Description of variant "dog fursuit" of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
" A fuzzy full-body fursuit made to resemble an anthropomorphic domestic "
"canine of unknown breed.  It is quite encumbering and has little storage but"
" is very warm."
msgstr ""
"품종을 알 수 없는, 의인화된 반려견을 본떠 만든, 털이 복슬복슬한 전신 퍼슈트입니다. 꽤 무겁고 수납공간도 부족하지만, 매우 "
"따뜻합니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "tiger fursuit"
msgid_plural "tiger fursuits"
msgstr[0] "호랑이 퍼슈트"

#. ~ Description of variant "tiger fursuit" of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"An intricately designed full-body fursuit made to resemble an "
"anthropomorphic bengal tiger, you can't imagine how long it took for it's "
"maker to sew all those stripes onto it.  It is quite encumbering and has "
"little storage but is very warm."
msgstr ""
"의인화된 벵골 호랑이를 본떠 정교하게 디자인된 전신 퍼슈트입니다. 제작자가 그 모든 줄무늬를 수놓는 데 얼마나 오랜 시간이 걸렸을지 "
"상상도 할 수 없을 겁니다. 꽤 크고 수납공간도 부족하지만, 매우 따뜻합니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "feline fursuit"
msgid_plural "feline fursuits"
msgstr[0] "고양이 퍼슈트"

#. ~ Description of variant "feline fursuit" of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A fluffy full-body fursuit made to resemble an anthropomorphic feline of "
"indistinguishable breed.  It is quite encumbering and has little storage but"
" is very warm."
msgstr ""
"혈통을 알 수 없는, 의인화된 고양이를 본떠 만든 푹신한 전신 퍼슈트입니다. 꽤 무겁고 수납공간도 부족하지만, 매우 따뜻합니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "otter fursuit"
msgid_plural "otter fursuits"
msgstr[0] "수달 퍼슈트"

#. ~ Description of variant "otter fursuit" of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A dopey-looking full-body fursuit made to resemble an anthropomorphic otter."
"  It is quite encumbering and has little storage but is very warm."
msgstr "의인화된 수달을 본떠 만든, 우스꽝스러워 보이는 전신 퍼슈트입니다. 꽤 크고 수납공간도 부족하지만, 매우 따뜻합니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "beaver fursuit"
msgid_plural "beaver fursuits"
msgstr[0] "비버 퍼슈트"

#. ~ Description of variant "beaver fursuit" of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A full-body fursuit made to resemble a nervous-looking anthropomorphic "
"beaver.  It is quite encumbering and has little storage but is very warm."
msgstr "긴장한 표정의 의인화된 비버를 본떠 만든 전신 퍼슈트입니다. 꽤 무겁고 수납공간도 부족하지만 매우 따뜻합니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "dragon fursuit"
msgid_plural "dragon fursuits"
msgstr[0] "용 퍼슈트"

#. ~ Description of variant "dragon fursuit" of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A detailed full-body fursuit made to resemble a western dragon, complete "
"with a set of small stubby wings on its back.  It is quite encumbering and "
"has little storage but is very warm."
msgstr ""
"서양 용을 본떠 정교하게 제작된 전신 퍼슈트입니다. 등에는 작고 뭉툭한 날개가 달려 있습니다. 다소 무겁고 수납공간이 부족하지만 매우 "
"따뜻합니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "lizard fursuit"
msgid_plural "lizard fursuits"
msgstr[0] "도마뱀 퍼슈트"

#. ~ Description of variant "lizard fursuit" of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A sleek full-body fursuit made to resemble an anthropomorphic lizard.  It is"
" quite encumbering and has little storage but is very warm."
msgstr "인간형 도마뱀을 본떠 만든 매끈한 전신 퍼슈트입니다. 다소 무겁고 수납공간이 부족하지만 매우 따뜻합니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "shark fursuit"
msgid_plural "shark fursuits"
msgstr[0] "상어 퍼슈트"

#. ~ Description of variant "shark fursuit" of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A gnarly looking full-body costume in the form of an anthropomorphic bull "
"shark.  It is quite encumbering and has little storage but is very warm."
msgstr "의인화된 황소상어 모양의 흉측한 전신 의상입니다. 꽤 크고 수납공간도 부족하지만, 매우 따뜻합니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "orca fursuit"
msgid_plural "orca fursuits"
msgstr[0] "범고래 퍼슈트"

#. ~ Description of variant "orca fursuit" of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A sleek looking full-body costume in the form of an anthropomorphic orca "
"whale.  It is quite encumbering and has little storage but is very warm."
msgstr "의인화된 범고래 형태의 매끈한 전신 의상입니다. 다소 무겁고 수납공간이 부족하지만 매우 따뜻합니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "dinosaur fursuit"
msgid_plural "dinosaur fursuits"
msgstr[0] "공룡 퍼슈트"

#. ~ Description of variant "dinosaur fursuit" of item "fursuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A full-body costume in the form of an anthropomorphic dinosaur.  It is quite"
" encumbering and has little storage but is very warm."
msgstr "의인화된 공룡의 모습을 한 전신 의상. 이 옷은 상당히 불편하며, 약간의 저장공간을 가지고 있고, 몹시 덥습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "thick wool onesie"
msgid_plural "thick wool onesies"
msgstr[0] "두꺼운 양모 원지"

#. ~ Description of "thick wool onesie"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"An encumbering wool suit covered in nice patterns.  It looks like full body "
"armor but it only protects against cold, sadly."
msgstr ""
"멋진 무늬의 양모 정장. 입고 있기 상당히 불편하며, 겉보기엔 전신을 보호해줄 것처럼 보이지만, 슬프게도 이것이 막아 주는 것은 "
"추위뿐입니다."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Variant name of item "devil onesie"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "devil onesie"
msgid_plural "devil onesies"
msgstr[0] "악마 원지"

#. ~ Description of "devil onesie"
#. ~ Description of variant "devil onesie" of item "devil onesie"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"An encumbering red wool suit with a hood adorned with cartoonish devil horns"
" and a devil's tail on the back.  It's for those who want to feel devilishly"
" warm in their sleep."
msgstr ""
"만화 속 악마 뿔로 장식된 후드와 등에 악마 꼬리가 달린, 거추장스러운 붉은색 울 슈트. 잠잘 때 악마처럼 따뜻한 기분을 느끼고 싶은 "
"분들을 위한 제품입니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "devil onesie"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "bunny onesie"
msgid_plural "bunny onesies"
msgstr[0] "토끼 원지"

#. ~ Description of variant "bunny onesie" of item "devil onesie"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"An encumbering and fluffy bunny onesie with a hood and adorned with a pair "
"of bunny ears.  Very fluffy."
msgstr "두건이 달린 푹신하고 무거운 토끼 원피스에 토끼 귀가 달려 있어요. 정말 푹신해요."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid "zentai"
msgid_plural "zentais"
msgstr[0] "전타이"

#. ~ Description of "zentai"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Short for 'zenshin taitsu', a zentai is a form-fitting full-body nylon and "
"spandex garment.  Though it covers your face, you can see through the thin "
"fabric.  With a couple of these and some friends, you could put on some "
"kabuki or harass a rival sports team."
msgstr ""
"\\\"전신용 타이즈\\\"의 줄임말인 이 옷은 말 그대로 전신을 덮는 나일론 및 스판덱스 소재의 의복입니다. 얼굴도 완전히 덮지만, "
"얇은 천 너머로 바깥을 볼 수 있습니다. 친구를 몇 명 모아 함께 이 옷을 입으면 가부키 공연을 하거나 라이벌 스포츠팀을 공격할 수 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "boiled leather armor"
msgid_plural "boiled leather armors"
msgstr[0] "튼튼한 가죽 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "boiled leather armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Thick leather body armor that has been hardened via chemical treatment.  "
"Light and strong."
msgstr "화학적 처리를 통해 강화시킨 두꺼운 가죽 갑옷. 가볍고 튼튼합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "chitinous scale mail suit"
msgid_plural "chitinous scale mail suits"
msgstr[0] "키틴 비늘 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "chitinous scale mail suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full body suit of chitin sections overlapping with each other, secured to "
"a leather backing.  The odd irregular shapes make full coverage impossible, "
"not helped by how poor of a material chitin is.  Seems to be made more out "
"of desperation than anything, and would benefit greatly from some underlying"
" armor."
msgstr ""
"키틴질 조각들이 서로 겹쳐진 전신 슈트로, 가죽 뒷면에 고정되어 있다. 기묘하게 불규칙한 모양 때문에 전신을 덮는 것은 불가능하며, "
"키틴질의 질 낮은 재질도 한몫한다. 절박한 상황에서 만든 것 같으며, 아래에 갑옷을 입혀주면 훨씬 더 좋을 것 같다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "biosilicified chitin armor"
msgid_plural "biosilicified chitin armors"
msgstr[0] "유기규소 키틴질 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "biosilicified chitin armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"Leg and body armor crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned "
"biosilicified exoskeletons of acidic ants.  Acid-resistant but brittle."
msgstr ""
"조심스럽게 다듬고 잘라낸 유기규소화된 산성 개미의 외골격으로 만들어진 다리와 몸통 보호구입니다.  산성액에 저항성이 있지만 잘 "
"부서집니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "fur body armor"
msgid_plural "fur body armors"
msgstr[0] "모피 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "fur body armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Thick body armor made from furs."
msgstr "몸을 보호하는 모피로 만든 두꺼운 갑옷."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "faux fur body armor"
msgid_plural "faux fur body armors"
msgstr[0] "인조 모피 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "faux fur body armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "Thick body armor made from faux furs."
msgstr "가짜 모피로 만든 두꺼운 방탄복."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "leather body armor"
msgid_plural "leather body armors"
msgstr[0] "가죽 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "leather body armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "A full suit of thick leather body armor.  Light and comfortable."
msgstr "두꺼운 가죽으로 만든 전신 갑옷. 가볍고 편안합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "junk plate armor"
msgid_plural "junk plate armors"
msgstr[0] "고철 판금 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "junk plate armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A suit of Gothic plate armor.  The metal shows signs of rust and corrosion, "
"and the leather straps are tattered."
msgstr "고딕 양식의 판금 갑옷입니다. 금속은 녹과 부식의 흔적이 있고, 가죽 끈은 낡아 있습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "sheet metal armor"
msgid_plural "sheet metal armors"
msgstr[0] "철판 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "sheet metal armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full set of armor hammered out from sheet metal and tied in place with "
"leather straps and belts.  It's crude, heavy, and uncomfortable, but damn "
"protective.  Now, you're a true Post-Apocalyptic Warrior."
msgstr ""
"판금으로 두드려 제작하고 가죽 끈과 벨트로 고정한 갑옷 세트. 투박하고 무겁고 불편하지만, 그래도 엄청난 보호력을 자랑합니다. 자, 이제"
" 당신은 진정한 포스트 아포칼립스 전사입니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "hardened sheet metal armor"
msgid_plural "hardened sheet metal armors"
msgstr[0] "표면경화강 철판 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "hardened sheet metal armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full set of armor hammered out from sheet metal and hardened for added "
"protection.  Perfect for keeping all your fleshy bits safe from zombie "
"teeth."
msgstr ""
"판금으로 두드려 제작하고 강화하여 더욱 안전하게 보호할 수 있는 갑옷 세트입니다. 좀비 이빨로부터 살덩어리를 보호하는 데 안성맞춤입니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "heavy sheet metal armor"
msgid_plural "heavy sheet metal armors"
msgstr[0] "중량 철판 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "heavy sheet metal armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full set of armor hammered out from sheet metal and tied in place with "
"leather straps and belts, with a doubly-thick chest guard to keep all your "
"important organs safe.  You might be as mobile as a refrigerator wearing all"
" this, but that's the price to pay to keep your flesh attached."
msgstr ""
"판금으로 두드려 제작하고 가죽 끈과 벨트로 고정한 갑옷 세트에, 두 배로 두꺼운 가슴 보호구가 당신의 모든 중요 장기를 안전하게 "
"보호합니다. 이 모든 것을 입고 있으면 냉장고처럼 움직일 수 있을지 몰라도, 살갗을 붙이려면 그만큼의 대가를 치러야 합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "heavy hardened sheet metal armor"
msgid_plural "heavy hardened sheet metal armors"
msgstr[0] "중량 표면경화강 철판 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "heavy hardened sheet metal armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full set of armor hammered out from sheet metal and hardened for extra "
"protection, with a doubly-thick chest guard.  The Ned Kelly gang would be "
"proud."
msgstr ""
"판금으로 두들겨 제작하고 강화하여 더욱 안전하게 보호할 수 있는 갑옷 세트에 두 배 두께의 가슴 보호구가 달려 있습니다. 네드 켈리 "
"갱단이 자랑스러워할 겁니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "junkyard plate armor"
msgid_plural "junkyard plate armors"
msgstr[0] "폐차장 판금 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "junkyard plate armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full set of steel armor made from sheet metal hammered into shape and "
"attached with chainmail covering the gaps.  For the modern knight on a "
"budget."
msgstr ""
"판금을 두드려 모양을 만들고, 틈새를 사슬 갑옷으로 막아 만든 완전한 강철 갑옷 세트입니다. 예산이 부족한 현대 기사에게 적합합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "heavy junkyard plate armor"
msgid_plural "heavy junkyard plate armors"
msgstr[0] "폐차장 중량 판금 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "heavy junkyard plate armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full set of steel armor made from sheet metal hammered into shape and "
"attached with chainmail covering the gaps, with an extra-thick chestpiece.  "
"About as heavy as a car but nowhere near as mobile, this suit is nonetheless"
" quite protective."
msgstr ""
"판금을 두드려 모양을 만들고, 틈새를 메우는 사슬 갑옷으로 고정한 강철 갑옷 세트. 매우 두꺼운 가슴 보호대가 달려 있다. 무게는 "
"자동차만큼 무겁지만 기동성은 전혀 떨어지지 않지만, 그럼에도 불구하고 상당히 보호력이 뛰어나다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "hardened junkyard plate armor"
msgid_plural "hardened junkyard plate armors"
msgstr[0] "표면경화강 폐차장 판금 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "hardened junkyard plate armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full set of steel armor made from sheet metal hammered into shape, "
"attached with chainmail, and case-hardened for extra strength.  It might be "
"crude and uncomfortably heavy, but it was clearly made by a skilled "
"metalworker and offers excellent protection."
msgstr ""
"판금을 두드려 모양을 만들고 사슬 갑옷을 부착한 후, 강도를 높이기 위해 표면 경화 처리를 한 강철 갑옷 세트입니다. 투박하고 불편할 "
"정도로 무겁지만, 숙련된 금속 세공인이 제작했음이 분명하며 뛰어난 방호력을 제공합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid "heavy hardened junkyard plate armor"
msgid_plural "heavy hardened junkyard plate armors"
msgstr[0] "표면경화강 중량 폐차장 판금 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "heavy hardened junkyard plate armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/suits_protection.json
msgid ""
"A full set of steel armor made from sheet metal hammered into shape, "
"attached with chainmail, with a double-thick chestpiece, and case-hardened "
"for extra strength.  Top-of-the-line in armor that looks like it was made "
"from banged-up lockers, for the skilled metalworker that values protection "
"over being able to move."
msgstr ""
"판금을 두드려 모양을 만들고 사슬 갑옷으로 고정한 강철 갑옷 세트입니다. 가슴 보호대는 두 배 두께로 제작되었으며, 강도를 높이기 위해 "
"표면 경화 처리되었습니다. 마치 낡은 사물함을 뜯어 만든 듯한 최고급 갑옷으로, 이동보다 보호를 중시하는 숙련된 금속 세공인에게 "
"적합합니다."

