#. ~ Description of "nomad bodyglove"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_underwear.json
msgid ""
"A simple, thin, skintight layer of breathable fabric that protects your "
"skin.  It has integrated feet and precisely placed rubberized pads to "
"protect critical points from impact and abrasion."
msgstr ""
"통기성이 좋은 원단으로 제작된 심플하고 얇고 피부에 딱 맞는 레이어가 피부를 보호합니다. 일체형 받침대와 정밀하게 배치된 고무 패드가 "
"중요 부위를 충격과 마모로부터 보호합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_underwear.json
msgid "nomad bodymesh"
msgid_plural "nomad bodymeshes"
msgstr[0] "방랑자 바디메쉬"

#. ~ Description of "nomad bodymesh"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/custom_underwear.json
msgid ""
"A simple, thin, skintight layer of breathable fabric that protects your "
"skin.  It has integrated feet and precisely placed rubberized pads to "
"protect critical points from impact and abrasion, and has been reinforced "
"with a loose mesh of advanced polymer threads."
msgstr ""
"통기성이 좋은 원단으로 제작된 심플하고 얇고 피부에 딱 맞는 레이어가 피부를 보호합니다. 일체형 받침대와 정밀하게 배치된 고무 패드가 "
"중요한 부분을 충격과 마모로부터 보호하며, 고급 폴리머 원사로 이루어진 느슨한 메시 소재로 보강되었습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "survivor fireboots (pair)"
msgid_plural "survivor fireboots (pair)"
msgstr[0] "생존자 방화 부츠 (한 쌍)"

#. ~ Description of "survivor fireboots (pair)"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid ""
"A pair of customized, Kevlar-armored Nomex boots.  These will keep you "
"alive, even when knee-deep in the flames."
msgstr "맞춤형 케블라 방탄 노멕스 부츠. 무릎까지 불길에 휩싸여도 살아남을 수 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "heavy survivor boots (pair)"
msgid_plural "heavy survivor boots (pair)"
msgstr[0] "무거운 생존자 부츠 (한 쌍)"

#. ~ Description of "heavy survivor boots (pair)"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid ""
"A pair of customized Kevlar boots that are heavily armored with steel.  "
"Favoring protection over comfort, these will keep you alive, especially when"
" knee-deep in the dead."
msgstr ""
"강철로 두껍게 무장한 맞춤형 케블라 부츠입니다. 편안함보다 보호를 중시하는 이 부츠는, 특히 무릎까지 죽음의 구렁텅이에 빠졌을 때 당신을"
" 살려줄 것입니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "heavy survivor gloves (pair)"
msgid_plural "heavy survivor gloves (pair)"
msgstr[0] "무거운 생존자 장갑 (한 쌍)"

#. ~ Description of "heavy survivor gloves (pair)"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid ""
"A pair of customized, steel-backed Kevlar gloves.  These are designed for "
"protection first."
msgstr "맞춤형 강철 케블라 장갑입니다. 보호 기능을 최우선으로 고려하여 설계되었습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "survivor firegloves (pair)"
msgid_plural "survivor firegloves (pair)"
msgstr[0] "생존자 방화 장갑 (한 쌍)"

#. ~ Description of "survivor firegloves (pair)"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid ""
"A pair of customized, Kevlar-armored Nomex gloves.  These are a post-"
"apocalyptic extension of what firefighters wore pre-Cataclysm."
msgstr "케블라 방호용 노멕스 장갑 한 켤레입니다. 대격변 이전 소방관들이 입었던 장갑의 종말 이후 버전입니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "survivor firehood"
msgid_plural "survivor firehoods"
msgstr[0] "생존용 방화후드"

#. ~ Description of "survivor firehood"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "A customized armored Nomex and Kevlar hood, strong and durable."
msgstr "맞춤형 노멕스와 케블라로 제작된 튼튼하고 내구성이 뛰어난 방탄 후드입니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "survivor firesuit"
msgid_plural "survivor firesuits"
msgstr[0] "생존용 방화복"

#. ~ Description of "survivor firesuit"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid ""
"Heavy, hand-built combination armor made from a cut-down bulletproof vest "
"and a reinforced flame-resistant Nomex jumpsuit.  Protects the wearer from "
"fire and the elements."
msgstr ""
"잘라낸 방탄조끼와 노멕스로 만들어진 강화된 방화 점프슈트를 사용해서 만든 무거운 수제 방어구. 화재와 각종 피해로부터 몸을 보호해줍니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "heavy survivor suit"
msgid_plural "heavy survivor suits"
msgstr[0] "중량 생존용 슈트"

#. ~ Description of "heavy survivor suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid ""
"A heavy, hand-built combination armor made from a reinforced bulletproof "
"vest and a metal-plated leather jumpsuit.  Protects from the elements as "
"well as from harm."
msgstr "강화된 방탄조끼와 금속을 덧댄 가죽제 점프슈트를 사용해서 만든 무거운 수제 방어구입니다. 각종 피해로부터 몸을 보호해줍니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "mercenary body armor"
msgid_plural "mercenary body armors"
msgstr[0] "용병 방탄복"

#. ~ Description of "mercenary body armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid ""
"Custom-made armor that combines a level II vest with a combat shirt and adds"
" extra padding to the arms for safety.  Fairly lightweight and ergonomic and"
" has numerous pockets for storage."
msgstr ""
"레벨 II 조끼와 전투용 셔츠를 결합한 맞춤형 갑옷으로, 안전을 위해 팔 부분에 패딩을 더했습니다. 가볍고 인체공학적이며, 수납을 위한 "
"여러 개의 주머니가 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "mercenary body armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "Shoulder pouch."
msgstr "어깨 주머니"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "mercenary body armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "Reinforced pen pouch."
msgstr "보강된 펜 주머니"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "mercenary body armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "Front torso pouch."
msgstr "전면 상체 주머니"

#. ~ Description of a pocket in item "mercenary body armor"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "Lower back pouch."
msgstr "후면 주머니"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "light survivor suit"
msgid_plural "light survivor suits"
msgstr[0] "경량 생존용 슈트"

#. ~ Description of "light survivor suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight, hand-built combination armor made from a cut-down bulletproof"
" vest and a reinforced fabric jumpsuit.  Protects from the elements as well "
"as from harm."
msgstr "잘라낸 방탄조끼와 천을 덧댄 잠수복을 사용해서 만든 경량 수제 방어구. 각종 피해로부터 몸을 보호해줍니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "survivor suit"
msgid_plural "survivor suits"
msgstr[0] "생존용 슈트"

#. ~ Description of "survivor suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid ""
"A hand-built combination armor made from a bulletproof vest and a reinforced"
" leather jumpsuit.  Protects from the elements as well as from harm."
msgstr "방탄조끼와 보강된 가죽을 덧댄 점프슈트를 사용해서 만든 수제 방어구. 각종 피해로부터 몸을 보호해줍니다."

#. ~ Description of "survivor suit"
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid ""
"A massive hand-built combination armor made from a bulletproof vest and a "
"reinforced leather jumpsuit.  Protects from the elements as well as from "
"harm."
msgstr "방탄조끼와 가죽 점프슈트를 이용해 만든 특대형 수제 방어구입니다. 각종 위험환경과 피해로부터 몸을 보호해줍니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/bespoke_armor/cuttingroom.json
msgid "winter survivor suit"
msgid_plural "winter survivor suits"
msgstr[0] "겨울형 생존용 슈트"

