"Printouts, held together by a staple, that explain work in different "
"applications, multimedia, the web, and basic work with hardware."
msgstr ""
"스테이플러로 고정된 인쇄물로, 다양한 응용 프로그램, 멀티미디어, 웹, 하드웨어를 사용한 기본 작업에 대한 설명이 들어 있습니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "Computer Science 101"
#: data/json/items/book/computer.json
msgid "Teaching Computing in Secondary Schools"
msgid_plural "copies of Teaching Computing in Secondary Schools"
