#. ~ Description of variant "Fundamentals of Software Architecture" of item
#. "Principles of Advanced Programming"
#: data/json/items/book/computer.json
msgid ""
"This book examines different architecture patterns and components of good "
"application."
msgstr "이 책은 다양한 아키텍처 패턴과 좋은 애플리케이션의 구성 요소를 살펴봅니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "Principles of Advanced Programming"
#: data/json/items/book/computer.json
msgid "Advanced Game Design: A Systems Approach"
msgid_plural "copies of Advanced Game Design: A Systems Approach"
