#. ~ Description of "Pro Hacker Secrets"
#. ~ Description of variant "Pro Hacker Secrets" of item "Pro Hacker Secrets"
#: data/json/items/book/computer.json
msgid ""
"A thinly veiled attempt at teaching kids coding skills.  Not nearly as "
"exciting as the authors might have hoped, but there's some real knowledge in"
" here."
msgstr "아이들에게 코딩 기술을 가르치려는 은근한 시도. 저자들이 기대했던 만큼 흥미롭지는 않지만, 진정한 지식을 담고 있습니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "Pro Hacker Secrets"
#: data/json/items/book/computer.json
msgid "First Steps in Coding: What's Decomposition?"
msgid_plural "copies of First Steps in Coding: What's Decomposition?"
msgstr[0] "코딩의 첫 단계: 분할이란 무엇인가?"

