msgid_plural "copies of La Vida Deliciosa: Definitive Mexican Cuisine"
msgstr[0] "라 비다 델리시오사: 완벽한 멕시코 요리"

#. ~ Description of "La Vida Deliciosa: Definitive Mexican Cuisine"
#: data/json/items/book/cooking.json
