msgid "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary: Deuteronomy"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of the Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary: Deuteronomy"
msgstr[0] "유대 출판 협회 토라 주석: 신명기"

#. ~ Description of variant "Jewish Publication Society Torah Commentary:
