#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid "fortified milk"
msgid_plural "fortified milk"
msgstr[0] "첨가된 우유"

#. ~ Description of "fortified milk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid ""
"Milk enriched with protein powder, it's extra healthy and doesn't taste too "
"bad."
msgstr "단백질 파우더가 강화된 우유는 매우 건강하고 맛도 나쁘지 않습니다."

#. ~ Conditional name for "fortified milk" when VITAMIN matches
