msgid_plural "protein smoothie"
msgstr[0] "단백질 스무디"

#. ~ Description of "protein smoothie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
msgid ""
"A thick and tasty smoothie made from pure refined protein and nutritious "
"fruit mixed into milk."
msgstr "순수 정제 단백질과 영양가 있는 과일을 우유에 섞어 만든 진하고 맛있는 스무디입니다."

#. ~ Conditional name for "protein smoothie" when VITAMIN matches
#. human_flesh_vitamin
#: data/json/items/comestibles/protein.json
