#. ~ Description of "mustard seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Some mustard seeds.  Could be ground into mustard powder."
msgstr "약간의 머스타드 씨앗. 갈면 머스타드(겨자) 가루가 됩니다."

