#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/json/items/gun/exodii.json
msgid "Exodii express gun"
msgid_plural "Exodii express guns"
msgstr[0] "엑소다이 익스프레스 건"

#. ~ Description of gun "Exodii express gun"
#. ~ Description of "Exodii express gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/exodii.json
msgid ""
"An over/under fowling piece with a long barrel, Brogyaga were favored for "
"their versatility in taking large game and fowl with their 27.3 x 110 Diyua "
"shells.  They would be pressed into combat during two global conflicts, "
"initially as 'light' wall guns, and later as the downsized and down-loaded "
"Brogyeki '23, before being brought along by the Exodii to dimensions "
"unknown.  Though unwieldy in combat as either a primary or secondary, "
"Brogyaga serve as useful parts donors for Brogyeki counterparts, fantastic "
"pieces for the occasional hunting party, and popular trade goods for the "
"locals."
msgstr ""
"수직쌍대 방식의 긴 총열을 가진 '수렵용' 총인, 27.3x110 디우아 탄을 사용하는 브로갸가는 큰 맹수와 들새를 잡는 데 특화되어 "
"많은 사람들이 선호했습니다. 세계 분쟁으로 일어난 두 번의 전투에서 '월건(Wall gun)'으로 사용되었으며, 나중에는 축소되어 지금의"
" 브로게키 '23가 되었고, 엑소다이가 이를 발견했습니다. 주무장이던 부무장이던 굉장히 다루기가 힘들지만, 브로게키에게 장기기증을 "
"해주거나, 특별한 날에 사냥을 나갈 때 쓰거나, 시장에서 거래하기 좋습니다."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "Exodii express gun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "Exodii express gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/exodii.json
msgid "Brogyaga express gun"
msgid_plural "Brogyaga express guns"
msgstr[0] "브로갸가 익스프레스 건"

#. ~ Description of variant "Exodii express gun" of gun "Brogyaga express gun"
#. ~ Description of variant "Brogyaga express gun" of item "Exodii express
#. gun"
