#. ~ Description of "bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid "A curious magazine-fed shotgun, made using bullpup scheme."
msgstr "불펍 방식을 사용하여 만든, 흥미로운 탄창식 산탄총입니다."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "bullpup shotgun"
