#. ~ Description of variant "GFY-1" of item "bullpup shotgun"
#: data/json/items/gun/shot.json
msgid ""
"A work of GForce Arms, this curious bullpup shotgun is compact, familiar to "
"any rifleman, and can use standard MKA 1919 magazines."
msgstr ""
"GForce Arms에서 만든 이 독특한 불펍 산탄총은 작고, 모든 소총수에게 친숙하며, 표준 MKA 1919 탄창을 사용할 수 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Variant name of gun "bullpup shotgun"
#. ~ Variant name of item "bullpup shotgun"
