" was adopted by multiple Turkish firearm manufacturers, and can be used with"
" almost any Turkish-manufactured mag-fed shotgun.  This one is a drum, and "
"can hold 20 shots."
msgstr ""
"이 유형의 탄창은 원래 Akdal MKA 1919와 함께 사용하도록 설계되었지만, 여러 터키 총기 제조업체에서 채택했으며, 거의 모든 "
