#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/criminal_2.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was fricking lucky for <the_cataclysm>.  I was squatting in a warehouse "
"out on the edge of town.  I was in a real shitty place, and my crew had "
"mostly just been arrested in a big drug bust, but I had skipped out.  I was "
"scared they were gonna think I ratted 'em out and come get me, but hey, no "
"worries about that now."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm> 덕분에 정말 운이 좋았어. 마을 외곽 창고에 웅크리고 있었거든. 정말 엉망진창인 곳에 있었고, 우리 팀원들은"
" 대규모 마약 단속 사건으로 거의 체포됐는데도 난 도망쳤어. 내가 밀고했다고 생각하고 날 잡으러 올까 봐 겁이 났지만, 뭐, 이제 그런 "
"걱정은 없겠지."

