#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
msgid "Where did things go from there?"
msgstr "그리고 어떻게 됐어?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/high_school_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I guess it got worse, because the faculty decided to put us in lockdown.  "
"For hours.  And then the school buses showed up to evacuate us.  Eventually,"
" they ran out of buses.  I was one of the lucky few who didn't have a bus to"
" get on.  The soldiers weren't much older than me… they didn't look like "
"they knew what was going on.  I lived just a few blocks away.  I snuck off."
msgstr ""
"상황이 더 악화된 것 같아요. 교직원들이 우리를 몇 시간 동안 봉쇄하기로 했거든요. 그러고 나서 학교 버스들이 나타나서 우리를 "
"대피시켰어요. 결국 버스가 다 떨어졌죠. 저는 버스를 탈 수 없는 몇 안 되는 운 좋은 사람 중 하나였어요. 군인들은 저보다 나이가 많지"
" 않았어요… 무슨 일이 벌어지고 있는지 모르는 것 같았죠. 저는 몇 블록 떨어진 곳에 살았거든요. 저는 몰래 빠져나왔어요."

