#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Okay, calm down…"
msgstr "알았어, 진정해..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "My… what do you mean?  How would YOU know what the sign says?"
msgstr "어… 무슨 말씀이세요? 표지판에 뭐라고 적혀 있는지 어떻게 아셨어요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I uh… found my way inside it a while ago.  The door was already open.  I "
"kinda went through it already assuming whoever owned it was dead."
msgstr "음… 얼마 전에 안으로 들어갔어요. 문이 이미 열려 있었거든요. 주인이 죽었을 거라고 생각하고 이미 안으로 들어갔었죠."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"So it WAS yours?  I broke in and stole a bunch of stuff from it.  Sorry, I "
"guess."
msgstr "그럼 네 거였어? 내가 침입해서 물건 좀 훔쳤어. 미안해."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Well, I got inside one and found a computer with a bunch of… conspiracy "
"theory documents?  I'm not sure how to put it.  It seemed like whoever wrote"
" it wasn't doing well."
msgstr ""
"음, 한 곳에 들어가 봤는데, 컴퓨터에… 음모론 문서가 잔뜩 있더라고요? 뭐라고 표현해야 할지 모르겠네요. 누가 썼는지는 모르겠지만, "
"뭔가 잘 안 되는 것 같았어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
