msgctxt "npc:f u:f"
msgid ""
"The door was open?  Was there anyone inside?  Why would you assume I was "
"dead?"
msgstr "문이 열려 있었어? 안에 누가 있었어? 왜 내가 죽었다고 생각했어?"

