msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, that's one way to say 'fuck you'!  I know it's been a while since shit"
" went down, but I didn't lock that door and put up that sign for no reason!"
"  How would you feel if I came and stole all the stuff that YOU locked away "
"for safe keeping?!"
msgstr ""
"음, '엿먹어'라는 표현이 딱 맞는 거 같네! 좆같은 일이 벌어진 지 꽤 됐지만, 내가 아무 이유 없이 문을 잠그고 표지판을 세운 건 "
"아니잖아! 네가 안전하게 보관하려고 잠가둔 물건들을 내가 훔쳐간다면 어떨 것 같아?!"

