#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Well…  I did.  And that's just how it goes.  It wasn't even that difficult."
msgstr "음... 그랬죠. 세상 일은 다 그렇게 돌아가는 거예요. 그렇게 어렵지도 않았어요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry.  I guess I just didn't know how to tell you I needed what was in "
"it."
msgstr "죄송해요. 그냥 그 안에 뭐가 필요한지 어떻게 말해야 할지 몰랐던 것 같아요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Just don't lie about it.  I understand your life was probably in danger.  I "
"can see past that.  Trust me, I've been in sticky situations before.  Tell "
"the truth next time."
msgstr ""
"거짓말은 하지 마. 네 목숨이 위험했던 건 이해해. 난 그 이상도 이하도 아니야. 믿어, 나도 전에 난처한 상황에 처한 적이 있거든. "
"다음엔 진실을 말해."

