#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I didn't say it was a SOLID theory, but maybe she's onto something.  This is"
" evil on a cosmic scale; I don't know how else to explain it.  Maybe she's "
"right.  Maybe the bones really are 'singing'."
msgstr ""
"확실한 이론이라고는 안 했지만, 어쩌면 그녀가 뭔가 알아차린 걸지도 몰라. 이건 우주적 규모로 보면 악한 거야. 어떻게 설명해야 할지 "
"모르겠어. 어쩌면 그녀가 맞을지도 몰라. 어쩌면 뼈들이 정말 '노래'를 부르는 걸지도 몰라."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I've been trying not to think about it, but you could be right.  The more "
"that I see, the less I can explain.  I don't know why humans would want "
"this, but if you're a brain-sucking alien, this is the place to be."
msgstr ""
"생각하지 않으려고 노력했는데, 당신 말이 맞을 수도 있겠어요. 더 많이 볼수록 설명이 더 어려워지네요. 인간이 왜 이걸 원하는지는 "
"모르겠지만, 뇌 빨아먹는 외계인이라면 여기가 바로 그곳이에요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
