#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "So… are you down to kick some alien ass with me?"
msgstr "그럼... 나랑 외계인 엉덩이 좀 걷어차줄래?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Let's not dwell on it.  <lets_go>"
msgstr "더 이상 깊이 생각하지 말자. <lets_go>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I can't accept that.  Everything was just fine for a while, but the bad "
"started some years ago, with bad people doing bad things.  I think we all "
"knew it was gonna end one way or another.  But there's got to be some sort "
"of deeper explanation for… this!  Someone is responsible!"
msgstr ""
"받아들일 수 없어. 한동안은 모든 게 괜찮았는데, 문제는 몇 년 전, 나쁜 사람들이 나쁜 짓을 하면서 시작됐어. 결국 어떻게든 끝날 "
"거라는 건 우리 모두 알고 있었을 거야. 하지만 분명 뭔가 더 깊은 이유가 있을 거야… 누군가는 책임이 있어!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Possibly, but we can never know for sure.  Sometimes bad things gather into "
"uncontrollable avalanches."
msgstr "그럴 수도 있지만, 확실히 알 수는 없습니다. 때로는 나쁜 일들이 걷잡을 수 없이 눈사태처럼 몰려오기도 합니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Those bad people are probably all dead now.  If bad things continue to "
"happen, it's just the nature of the universe.  Entropy and chaos are the "
"natural order of things."
msgstr ""
"그 나쁜 사람들은 아마 다 죽었을 거예요. 만약 나쁜 일들이 계속 일어난다면, 그건 그냥 우주의 자연스러운 현상일 뿐이에요. 엔트로피와 "
"혼돈은 만물의 자연스러운 질서예요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You're right, but I still think there's something bigger out there.  "
"Something evil.  It doesn't matter whether science can explain it because we"
" damn sure don't seem capable of defeating it."
msgstr ""
"네 말이 맞아. 하지만 난 아직도 더 큰 뭔가가 있다고 생각해. 사악한 뭔가. 과학이 그걸 설명할 수 있든 없든 상관없어. 우리는 그걸 "
"이길 능력이 전혀 없는 것 같으니까."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
