msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I'm sorry, 'officer'.  I didn't write the book of cop jokes, you know."
msgstr "죄송합니다, 경찰관님. 제가 경찰 농담 책을 쓴 건 아니잖아요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
