"accelerator."
msgstr "죄목만 들으면 실제보다 훨씬 멋지지: 미등록 입자가속기 보유."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
msgid ""
"I got a little bit into black market organ trading.  It sounds worse than it"
" was… but it was pretty bad."
msgstr "암시장 장기매매에 살짝 관여했어. 실제보다 더 끔찍하게 들리지만… 충분히 구린 일이지."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
