#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
msgid "How did you get out of lockup?"
msgstr "교도소에서 어떻게 빠져나온 거야?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prisoner_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I heard gunshots, even from down in lockup.  Didn't hear much screaming or "
"anything.  That was my first clue something was up.  Food stopped showing "
"up, next.  Then, the lights went out.  I was down there for maybe hours, "
"maybe days, when finally a flashlight in the bars blinded me.  It was a "
"guard.  He let me out, filled me in on what was going on.  I wanted to think"
" he was crazy, but something in his eyes… I believed him."
msgstr ""
"총소리가 들렸어요. 심지어 구치소 안에서도요. 비명 소리 같은 건 거의 들리지 않았어요. 그게 뭔가 이상하다는 첫 번째 단서였어요. "
"그다음엔 음식이 나오지 않았고, 그다음엔 불이 꺼졌어요. 몇 시간, 어쩌면 며칠 동안 거기에 있었는데, 마침내 철창에 비친 손전등에 눈이"
" 멀었어요. 경비원이었어요. 그는 저를 꺼내 주면서 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 설명해 줬어요. 그가 미쳤다고 생각하고 싶었지만, 그의 "
"눈빛에서 무언가… 저는 그를 믿었어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
