#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
msgid ""
"I could help you clear out your farm if you wanted.  You just have to show "
"me the way…"
msgstr "원하시면 농장 정리를 도와드릴 수 있어요. 방법만 알려주시면 돼요…"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
msgid "<npc_name> marks the location of the farm on your map."
msgstr "<npc_name>은 지도에서 농장의 위치를 표시합니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
msgid ""
"I guess you look sturdy enough to take them on.  I marked the spot for you."
msgstr "당신은 그들을 상대할 만큼 강해 보이네요. 제가 자리를 표시해 뒀어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
msgid ""
"I don't know if I trust you quite like that, just giving away so many "
"personal details all at once.  Maybe later…"
msgstr "그렇게 많은 개인 정보를 한꺼번에 공개하다니, 내가 당신을 그렇게 신뢰할 수 있을지 모르겠어. 나중에…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
msgid "Sorry, didn't mean to intrude."
msgstr "죄송합니다. 방해하고 싶지 않았습니다."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/OtherSurvivorStories/NC_Farmer_background.json
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Check out that farm"
msgstr "농장 확인하기"

#. ~ Description of mission "Check out that farm"
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
msgid "You were told to check out a farm that might be infested with zombies."
msgstr "좀비가 들끓을 수 있는 농장을 조사하라는 말을 들었습니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that farm"
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
msgid "Any luck finding the farm?"
msgstr "농장을 찾는 데 성공했나요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that farm"
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
msgid ""
"I don't know how I can ever make it up to you!  I barely made it out of this"
" place alive.  I wasn't sure I'd ever see it again, to be honest."
msgstr "어떻게 보상해 드릴 수 있을지 모르겠어요! 간신히 이곳에서 살아서 나왔거든요. 솔직히 다시 볼 수 있을지도 몰랐어요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that farm"
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_1.json
msgid "I guess I don't blame you.  I knew it wouldn't be easy."
msgstr "네 잘못은 아닌 것 같아. 쉽지 않을 거라는 건 알고 있었거든."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/rural_2.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Well, I lived on the edge of a small town.  Corner store and a gas station "
"and not much else.  We heard about the shit goin' down in the city, but we "
"didn't see much of it until the military came blazing through and tried to "
"set up a camp there.  They wanted to bottle us all up in town, and I wasn't "
"having with that, so my dog Buck and I, we headed out while they were all "
"sniffin' their own farts."
msgstr ""
"음, 저는 작은 마을 외곽에 살았어요. 구멍가게랑 주유소 하나 있고 그 외에는 별거 없었죠. 도시에서 무슨 일이 벌어지고 있다는 얘기는 "
"들었지만, 군대가 들이닥쳐 그곳에 진을 치려고 할 때까지는 별로 볼 게 없었어요. 그들은 우리 모두를 마을에 가두려고 했는데, 저는 그게"
" 싫었어요. 그래서 제 개 벅과 저는 그들이 자기 방귀 냄새를 맡고 있는 동안 밖으로 나갔죠."

