#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
msgid "I suppose you're right."
msgstr "그럴 수도 있겠네요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
msgid "You're mad.  You have to be stopped."
msgstr "당신은 화가 났어요. 당신을 막아야 해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
msgid "Whatever.  I'm leaving."
msgstr "뭐든 간에. 난 떠날 거야."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
msgid ""
"I knew a Kindred would not understand.  But I can't allow you to stop me.  "
"If you try, I'll have no option but to fight you.  But know that should you "
"win, you'll be ridding the world of the only hope it has."
msgstr ""
"킨드레드라면 이해 못 할 거라는 건 알았어. 하지만 네가 날 막게 둘 순 없어. 네가 시도하면, 난 너와 싸우는 수밖에 없어. 하지만 "
"네가 이긴다면, 이 세상의 유일한 희망을 잃게 될 거라는 걸 알아둬."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
msgid ""
"I can't allow you to stop me.  If you try, I'll have no option but to fight "
"you.  Maybe I'll die, or maybe you will.  But know that should you win, "
"you'll be ridding the world of the only hope it has."
msgstr ""
"날 막는 건 용납할 수 없어. 네가 시도하면, 너와 싸우는 수밖에 없어. 어쩌면 내가 죽을지도 모르고, 어쩌면 네가 죽을지도 몰라. "
"하지만 네가 이긴다면, 세상에서 유일한 희망을 잃게 될 거라는 걸 알아둬."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
msgid "All I'm ridding the world of is a dangerous madman.  Now die."
msgstr "내가 세상에서 없앨 건 위험한 미치광이뿐이다. 이제 죽어라."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
msgid "This is a waste of time not worth the risk.  I'm out of here."
msgstr "시간 낭비일 뿐이야. 위험을 감수할 가치도 없어. 난 여기서 나갈 거야."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Kindred/NPC_Darren_Cooper.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You're like me then, Kindred.  I'm glad I'm not the only one who realizes "
"what's necessary.  Perhaps one day, we'll be able to work together, but what"
" I do now, I must do alone."
msgstr ""
"그럼 너도 나와 비슷하구나, 킨드레드. 무엇이 필요한지 깨닫는 사람이 나 혼자가 아니어서 다행이야. 어쩌면 언젠가는 함께 일할 수 "
"있을지도 모르지만, 지금 내가 하는 일은 혼자 해야 해."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
