#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Yes.  Top floor is clear."
msgstr "네. 꼭대기 층은 비어 있습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Snippet in category "<its_safe>"
#. ~ NPC complaint when the danger level drops from significant to very low,
#. so things are 'safe'
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
msgid "Looks like that's over."
msgstr "저건 끝났구만."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_MISSION.json
msgid "Not yet."
msgstr "아직 아니야."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "<its_safe>  Let's clean the next floor."
msgstr "<its_safe> 다음 층을 청소하자."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "<its_safe>  Let's return to the first floor."
msgstr "<its_safe> 1층으로 돌아가자."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Did you find them, <name_g>?"
msgstr "찾았나요, <name_g>?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Did you find them, <name_g>?"
msgstr "찾았나요, <name_g>?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Did you find them, <name_g>?"
msgstr "찾았나요, <name_g>?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "We did it.  All safe."
msgstr "우리는 해냈습니다. 모두 안전했습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I failed you… I couldn't bring them alive…"
msgstr "미안하지만, 제가 실망했어요... 그들을 살려낼 수가 없었어요..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I failed you… I couldn't bring your wife alive…"
msgstr "미안하지만, 제가 당신을 실망시켰어요... 당신 아내를 살려낼 수가 없었어요..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I failed you… I couldn't bring your daughter alive…"
msgstr "미안하지만, 제가 당신을 실망시켰습니다... 당신의 따님을 살려낼 수 없었습니다..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Nothing, really."
msgstr "사실 아무것도 아닙니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"<name_g>… I entrusted you with the most valuable thing that I have left, and"
" you…"
msgstr "<name_g>… 내가 가진 가장 귀중한 것을 너에게 맡겼는데, 너는…"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Lighthouse"
msgstr "등대"

#. ~ Description of mission "Lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Lead Mikhail to lighthouse."
msgstr "미하일을 등대로 데려가세요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"We've been wandering around the state with my family for a long time since "
"<the_cataclysm>, and I realized that the safest hideout is the island.  I "
"left my family in a shelter, and went to explore the area, looking for some "
"island nearby, in a lake or in the ocean.  And you know, I found a sea map "
"marked with navigational beacons near here.  If you want, you can help me "
"get to one of these and take a good look at it."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm> 이후로 오랫동안 가족과 함께 이 주를 돌아다녔는데, 가장 안전한 은신처는 섬이라는 걸 깨달았어요. 가족을 "
"대피소에 남겨두고 근처 호수나 바다에 있는 섬을 찾아 주변을 탐험해 봤어요. 그리고 이 근처에서 항해 표지가 있는 해상 지도를 발견했죠."
" 원하시면 제가 이 지도 중 하나에 가서 자세히 볼 수 있도록 도와주셔도 돼요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Good.  I'll be right behind you."
msgstr "좋아요. 바로 뒤따르겠습니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lighthouse"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "House cleaning"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's family"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's boat"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fixing lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Well, it's your choice."
msgstr "글쎄요, 선택은 당신의 몫이에요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "First we need to find a transport to get there."
msgstr "먼저 그곳까지 갈 수 있는 교통수단을 찾아야 합니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "We finally reached it."
msgstr "우리는 마침내 그곳에 도착했습니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Looks nice, <name_g>.  Now I need to clean it from <zombies> somehow…"
msgstr "멋지네요, <name_g>. 이제 <zombies>들을 어떻게든 없애야겠어요…"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "House cleaning"
msgstr "집 청소"

#. ~ Description of mission "House cleaning"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Clean lighthouse from <zombies> with Mikhail."
msgstr "미하일을 이용해 <zombies>로부터 등대를 청소하세요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "House cleaning"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"So, we found the lighthouse.  Now, I need to clean it.  Want to help me with"
" it?"
msgstr "등대를 찾았어요. 이제 청소해야 해요. 도와주실래요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "House cleaning"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"Great.  Let's do it together.  I'll be right behind you.  We will clean "
"floor by floor.  If you decide that the floor is clean, tell me about it, "
"and we will move on to the next, and so on to the very top."
msgstr ""
"좋아요. 같이 하죠. 제가 바로 뒤따라갈게요. 층층별로 청소할 거예요. 바닥이 깨끗하다고 생각되면 말씀해 주세요. 그러면 다음 층으로, "
"맨 위층까지 계속 청소할 거예요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "House cleaning"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Be careful.  These <name_b>s are most dangerous in tight spaces."
msgstr "조심하세요. 이 <name_b>들은 좁은 공간에서 가장 위험합니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "House cleaning"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "<its_safe>"
msgstr "<its_safe>"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "House cleaning"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Great, incredibly great.  All that remains is to wash all the floors…"
msgstr "좋아요, 정말 최고예요. 이제 바닥을 다 닦는 일만 남았네요…"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Fisherman's family"
msgstr "어부의 가족"

#. ~ Description of mission "Fisherman's family"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Mikhail asked you to bring back his family."
msgstr "미하일이 당신에게 그의 가족을 데려오라고 부탁했습니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's family"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"We found the lighthouse and cleared it of <zombies>.  Now, I need to bring "
"my family here.  May I ask you for a favor?  Since you bring me here, can "
"you go back, find my family and bring them here?"
msgstr ""
"등대를 찾아서 <zombies>들을 제거했습니다. 이제 가족을 데려와야 합니다. 부탁 하나 드려도 될까요? 당신이 저를 데려왔으니, "
"돌아가서 제 가족을 찾아서 데려와 주시겠어요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's family"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"You are my savior!  I'll take a look around here for a while, prepare "
"everything here for their arrival."
msgstr "당신은 나의 구원자예요! 잠시 이곳을 둘러보고, 그들이 도착할 때를 대비해 모든 것을 준비할게요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's family"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Please be very careful.  I don't want to lose them…"
msgstr "정말 조심하세요. 잃어버리고 싶지 않아요…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's family"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"I don't even know how to thank you, <name_g>.  I am in eternal debt to you."
msgstr "<name_g>, 어떻게 감사드려야 할지 모르겠어요. 당신께 영원히 빚을 지고 있거든요."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Fisherman's boat"
msgstr "어부의 배"

#. ~ Description of mission "Fisherman's boat"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Help Mikhail make a boat.  Bring 250 nails."
msgstr "미하일이 배를 만드는 걸 도와주세요. 못 250개를 가져오세요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's boat"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"The building has been cleared of <zombies>, my family is here, everything is"
" going very well.  It remains only to provide ourselves with food, transport"
" and we can not worry about the future.  You helped me and my family so "
"much, can you help us with something else?  I need a boat for fishing, or "
"just to explore the area.  Can you help me make a boat?"
msgstr ""
"건물에서 <zombies>들이 모두 치워졌고, 저희 가족도 여기 있습니다. 모든 게 순조롭게 진행되고 있습니다. 이제 남은 건 음식과 "
"교통비만 해결하면 되니, 앞으로 걱정할 필요가 없습니다. 저와 저희 가족을 정말 많이 도와주셨는데, 혹시 다른 것도 도와주실 수 있나요?"
" 낚시나 주변을 탐험할 보트가 필요한데, 보트 제작을 도와주실 수 있나요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's boat"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"Thank you, <name_g>.  I need only 250 nails.  I'll find the planks, the rest"
" of the tools too, but the main problem is the nails.  Too much for one "
"boat, but I want to have resources in reserve, just in case."
msgstr ""
"<name_g> 님, 감사합니다. 못은 250개만 있으면 됩니다. 판자도 구하고 나머지 도구들도 구하겠지만, 가장 큰 문제는 못입니다. "
"배 한 척에 너무 많은데, 혹시 모르니 예비 물자를 갖고 있어야 합니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's boat"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"Please, if you can, don't disassemble furniture here.  It can still be "
"useful."
msgstr "가능하면 여기서 가구를 분해하지 마세요. 여전히 유용할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's boat"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite book.  Apocalypse Now"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite book.  Brave New
#. World."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite book.  Cat's Cradle."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite game.  Pathogen"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite game.  Steam Gears"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite game.  Terraforming
#. Mercury"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
msgid "Did you find it?"
msgstr "찾으셨나요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fisherman's boat"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"Very good, <name_g>, thank you!  Now we are not afraid of hunger, rain, or "
"other bad weather, he-he.  By the way, I have a small supply of fish, "
"tackle, baits and rods.  If you are interested, I can share some with you."
msgstr ""
"아주 좋아요, <name_g> 님, 감사합니다! 이제 배고픔, 비, 기타 악천후도 두렵지 않네요. ㅎㅎㅎ. 참고로, 제가 물고기, 낚시 "
"도구, 미끼, 낚싯대를 조금 가지고 있어요. 관심 있으시면 나눠드릴게요."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Fixing lighthouse"
msgstr "등대 고치기"

#. ~ Description of mission "Fixing lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"Mikhail asked you to find someone, who have enough expertise to fix the "
"mechanism of lighthouse."
msgstr "미하일은 등대의 메커니즘을 고칠 수 있는 전문 지식을 갖춘 사람을 찾아달라고 부탁했습니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fixing lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"My family is here, we have food, water, boat and a roof over our heads, all "
"thanks to you, <name_g>.  Now, I also want to help other survivors.  Here's "
"what I thought: if I can get this old lighthouse up and running, other "
"survivors will see its light from afar.  If they see it, they will think "
"that there are living people here, and will try to get here.  Can you help "
"me fix it?"
msgstr ""
"우리 가족이 여기 있고, 음식, 물, 배, 그리고 지붕까지 있는 건 모두 당신 덕분이에요, <name_g>. 이제 다른 생존자들도 돕고 "
"싶어요. 제 생각은 이렇습니다. 제가 이 낡은 등대를 다시 세워서 작동시킬 수 있다면, 다른 생존자들도 멀리서 그 빛을 볼 수 있을 "
"거예요. 만약 그들이 이 빛을 본다면, 여기 살아있는 사람들이 있다고 생각하고, 여기로 오려고 노력할 거예요. 제가 이 등대를 고치는 걸"
" 도와주실 수 있나요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fixing lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"I knew you wouldn't refuse!  But there is one problem: I have no idea how to"
" fix it.  Maybe if you met someone who have experience in electrical "
"engineering, we can figure out how to start this old junk."
msgstr ""
"거절하지 않을 거라는 건 알았어! 하지만 문제가 하나 있어. 어떻게 고쳐야 할지 모르겠어. 전기 공학에 경험이 있는 사람을 만나면 이 "
"오래된 쓰레기를 어떻게 다시 조립할지 알아낼 수 있을 것 같아."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fixing lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid ""
"I'm sure that not all burned in flames of <the_cataclysm> and you can find "
"someone suitable."
msgstr "<the_cataclysm>의 불길에 모두가 타버린 건 아닐 테고, 당신에게 적합한 사람을 찾을 수 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fixing lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Well, have you fixed it?"
msgstr "그럼, 고쳤나요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Fixing lighthouse"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_man.json
msgid "Splendid, <name_g>!  We can only wait now…"
msgstr "훌륭해요, <name_g>! 이제 기다릴 수밖에 없겠네요…"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_woman.json
msgid "Heather Frolova"
msgstr "헤더 프롤로바"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_woman.json
msgid "I'm scared.  Where is my husband?"
msgstr "무서워요. 남편은 어디 있는 걸까요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_woman.json
msgid ""
"Thank you for saving me.  It's a shame my Angelina didn't make it… you did "
"everything you could, and I don't blame you for it…"
msgstr ""
"날 구해줘서 고마워. 내 안젤리나가 살아남지 못해서 너무 아쉬워... 넌 할 수 있는 모든 걸 다 했고, 난 널 탓할 생각이 없어..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_woman.json
msgid "Poor, poor Angelina…"
msgstr "불쌍한 안젤리나…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_woman.json
msgid ""
"I don't have much to tell, sorry.  I'm busy with tiding this place, making "
"it our new home.  You should talk to my husband, he doesn't look busy right "
"now.  Or always…"
msgstr ""
"죄송하지만, 드릴 말씀이 별로 없어요. 여기 정리하고 새 보금자리 마련하느라 바빠서요. 남편이랑 이야기 좀 해 보세요. 지금은 안 바빠 "
"보이시잖아요. 아니면 항상…"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_woman.json
msgid "Protect fisherman's wife"
msgstr "어부의 아내를 보호하세요"

#. ~ Description of mission "Protect fisherman's wife"
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/NPC_lighthouse_woman.json
msgid "She looks like a nice woman.  Maybe you should not let her die?"
msgstr "그녀는 좋은 여자처럼 보이네요. 그녀를 죽게 두지 않는 게 어떨까요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "You said that you have experience in electrical engineering…"
msgstr "전기공학 분야에서 경험이 있다고 하셨는데요…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "I did, actually.  Why are you asking?"
msgstr "사실, 그랬어요. 왜 물어보시는 거예요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "We're here.  Ready to start?"
msgstr "이제 시작입니다. 시작할 준비가 되셨나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "Can you repair the mechanism of the lighthouse?"
msgstr "등대의 메커니즘을 수리할 수 있나요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid ""
"Sure thing, boss.  Take me there and in a few days it will be like new."
msgstr "물론입니다, 사장님. 저를 데려가 주시면 며칠 안에 새것처럼 될 거예요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "Hmm, looks shitty.  I'll do my best."
msgstr "음, 별로네요. 최선을 다해 볼게요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgid "Start working."
msgstr "일을 시작하세요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/TALK_fix_lighthouse.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Boss, here's the thing… just don't be mad, please.  I lied that I'm good at "
"this… I thought I could figure it out, but it's far beyond my comprehension."
"  I'm sorry."
msgstr ""
"사장님, 이거 좀… 화내지 마세요. 제가 이걸 잘한다고 거짓말했어요… 알아낼 수 있을 거라고 생각했는데, 도저히 이해할 수가 없네요. "
"죄송합니다."

