"  Unfortunately, during our joint fishing, we were attacked by a swarm of "
"underwater abominations, and my boat was smashed to pieces.  It was so "
"scary, we could barely sail away on Mikhail's ship."
msgstr ""
"며칠 전 이곳에서 배를 타고 왔습니다. 미하일과 그의 가족은 매우 친절했습니다. 하지만 안타깝게도 함께 낚시를 하던 중, 수중 괴물 떼의"
" 공격을 받아 제 배가 산산조각이 났습니다. 너무 무서웠기에 미하일의 배를 타고 간신히 빠져나올 수 있었습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Lighthouse_Family/npc_survivor.json
msgid "I'm glad you are OK."
msgstr "다행이에요, 괜찮아요."

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "balthazar"
msgstr "발타자르"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ trading will be implemented later
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "bunker voice"
msgstr "벙커 음성"

#. ~ Job description of "bunker voice" NPC class
#. ~ trading will be implemented later
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "Locked in a bunker."
msgstr "벙커에 갇혔어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "As soon as you walk up to the intercom it turns on"
msgstr "인터콤에 다가가자마자 켜집니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "Once you get close enough, the intercom crackles on"
msgstr "충분히 가까이 다가가면 인터콤이 딱딱거리며 켜집니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "The wiring on this intercom is out for anyone to see"
msgstr "이 인터콤의 배선은 누구나 볼 수 없도록 되어 있습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "You hear some static come through the tinny speaker"
msgstr "작은 스피커를 통해 잡음이 들리는 것을 들을 수 있습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid ""
"After some brief static you hear a voice coming through with a crackle and a"
" pop \"..llo?  Hello?  Is someone there?\""
msgstr "잠깐 잡음이 들린 후 딱딱거리는 소리와 펑 하는 소리가 들립니다. \"..요? 안녕하세요? 누가 계세요?\""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Speech from speaker aperture_potato, mon_mi_go, mon_mi_go_slaver
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
#: data/json/npcs/exodii/exodii_weaponmaster_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/exodii/exodii_workers.json
#: data/mods/CrazyCataclysm/crazy_speech.json
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr "무슨 일이야?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "[Clear your throat.]"
msgstr "[목을 가다듬으세요.]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "I'm here."
msgstr "저는 여기 있어요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "Who is this?"
msgstr "이 사람은 누구입니까?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr "흠?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "뭐야?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "Can we trade?"
msgstr "거래가 가능한가요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "Tell me your story."
msgstr "당신의 이야기를 들려주세요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "Why don't these robots attack me?"
msgstr "왜 로봇들은 나를 공격하지 않을까?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "Here are the solar panels."
msgstr "태양광 패널은 여기에 있습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "You brought solar panels?!"
msgstr "태양광 패널을 가져왔어?!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "Here you go."
msgstr "여기 있습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "On second thought, I need a bit longer."
msgstr "다시 생각해보니, 좀 더 시간이 필요한 것 같아요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "Thank you so much, I'll send some bullets and a gun over."
msgstr "정말 감사합니다. 총알과 총을 보내드리겠습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/exodii/common_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_fabricate.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_prototype.json
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom_prototypes.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/liam_chat.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_Commo.json
msgid "Thanks."
msgstr "고마워."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "Thank you so much, I'll give you all I have to give right now."
msgstr "정말 감사합니다. 지금 당장 제가 드릴 수 있는 모든 것을 다 드리겠습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid "Thank you so much.  As promised, all I can spare and a bot."
msgstr "정말 감사합니다. 약속드린 대로 제가 할 수 있는 모든 것을 다 봇으로 보내드리겠습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
msgid ""
"I'll first need to gather up some supplies before I can even consider "
"trading."
msgstr "거래를 고려하기 전에 먼저 몇 가지 물품을 모아야 할 것 같아요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Alright then."
msgstr "좋아."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid ""
"I'm Balthazar and have been stuck in this bunker ever since the sky "
"ruptured!  I don't really know what's happening out there and need someone "
"to help me.  The power to the bunker has been running low and the air & "
"water filtration are failing intermittently."
msgstr ""
"저는 발타자르입니다. 하늘이 무너진 이후로 이 벙커에 갇혀 있어요! 밖에서 무슨 일이 벌어지고 있는지 도저히 모르겠고 누군가의 도움이 "
"필요해요. 벙커에 전기가 부족하고 공기와 물 여과 장치가 간헐적으로 고장 나고 있어요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "What do you need help with?"
msgstr "무엇에 도움이 필요하신가요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "What's in it for me?"
msgstr "나에게 무슨 이익이 있나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "Hold on, why are you locked in here?"
msgstr "잠깐만요, 왜 여기에 갇혀있죠?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid "So who are you?"
msgstr "그럼 당신은 누구인가요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid ""
"The bunker has a field of solar panels nearby but some of the staff damaged "
"them badly when they turned into those… things.  I need you to gather at "
"least 12 panels so I can stabilize my power output."
msgstr ""
"벙커 근처에 태양광 패널이 있는데, 직원 몇몇이 그걸 그런… 물건으로 만들면서 심하게 손상시켰어요. 전력 출력을 안정화하려면 최소 "
"12개의 패널을 모아주세요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "Alright, I'll see what I can gather."
msgstr "좋아요, 무엇을 모을 수 있는지 알아보겠습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid ""
"You'll help me?!  Thank you so, so much.  I really wasn't looking forward to"
" dying a slow death in here.  I think the power will be enough for a while "
"but please hurry up."
msgstr ""
"도와주실 거예요?! 정말, 정말 감사합니다. 여기서 천천히 죽어가는 건 정말 기대 안 했어요. 당분간은 힘이 충분할 것 같은데, 제발 "
"빨리 해주세요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "What should I do once I bring them to you?"
msgstr "그것들을 당신에게 가져온 후에는 어떻게 해야 합니까?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid ""
"I can remotely control a few of the maintenance bots.  All I need you to do "
"is drop them off at the intercom I've managed to set up and I'll get to work"
" installing them."
msgstr "유지 보수 봇 몇 대는 원격으로 제어할 수 있어요. 제가 설치해 둔 인터콤에 봇을 맡겨 주시면 제가 설치 작업을 시작할게요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "알겠어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid ""
"I don't have much.  All I have in here is some MREs, bullets and a few guns "
"so I'll let you take your pick when you bring some panels."
msgstr ""
"별로 없어요. 여기 있는 건 MRE 몇 개, 총알, 그리고 총 몇 자루뿐이에요. 패널을 가져오시면 원하시는 걸 고르실 수 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "You're locked in there, right?  How would I get them?"
msgstr "거기 갇혀 있는 거 맞지? 어떻게 구하냐고?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "That doesn't sound too promising…"
msgstr "그다지 유망해 보이지는 않네요..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
msgid "Sounds good."
msgstr "그거 좋네."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid ""
"The airlock is the only part that is malfunctioning, luckily it's connected "
"to the ventilation systems so I made a bot that can traverse them."
msgstr ""
"에어록은 제대로 작동하지 않는 유일한 부분인데, 다행히 환기 시스템에 연결되어 있어서 그 안을 통과할 수 있는 로봇을 만들었습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid ""
"W-Wait no, n- no, I- I'll give you all I have.  All I request to keep is "
"some food, a gun, and a bullet for if things get bad."
msgstr ""
"잠깐, 아니, 아니, 내가 가진 모든 걸 줄게. 내가 갖고 싶어 하는 건 음식, 총, 그리고 상황이 나빠질 때를 대비한 총알뿐이야."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "How about a little more, huh?"
msgstr "좀 더 어때요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "That's better."
msgstr "그게 더 낫죠."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "I-I-What?  It's all I have, I can't give you more."
msgstr "저-저-뭐? 내가 가진 게 이게 전부인데, 더 줄 수가 없어."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "Surely you have something more exotic in there."
msgstr "분명 좀 더 이국적인 게 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "So you also don't have anything else in the \"control center\"?"
msgstr "그러면 \"제어 센터\"에는 다른 기능이 하나도 없나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
#: data/json/npcs/common_chat/TALK_COMMON_OTHER.json
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Fine."
msgstr "좋아."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "No deal."
msgstr "거래 없음."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "Y- You know what?  Fuck you, I'll just wait for someone else."
msgstr "야- 있잖아? 씨발, 난 그냥 다른 사람 기다릴게."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid ""
"This bunker has a control center for the local bots so I made them only "
"attack when attacked first."
msgstr "이 벙커에는 로컬 봇을 위한 제어 센터가 있으므로 먼저 공격받았을 때만 공격하도록 했습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid "Sounds useful."
msgstr "유용한 정보네요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "So you do have some tech you can give me."
msgstr "그러니까 당신이 줄 수 있는 기술이 있군요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid ""
"Wh- Alright, you got me, I can offer you a bot from the control center as "
"well, but that is truly all I have."
msgstr "어- 좋아요, 알겠습니다. 제어 센터의 봇도 제공해 드릴 수 있지만, 제가 제공할 수 있는 것은 그게 전부입니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "I knew you had more."
msgstr "당신이 더 많은 것을 가지고 있다는 것을 알았습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "Surely you have some more in there."
msgstr "분명 더 많은 게 있을 거예요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid ""
"When the riots were getting bad, we were assigned to hold this bunker for "
"some eggheads.  Then when the skies broke some of my comrades just started "
"shooting all around, so I fled into this bunker.  Something messed with the "
"doors and I've been locked in here since."
msgstr ""
"폭동이 심해지자, 우리는 이 벙커를 몇몇 지식인들을 위해 지키라는 임무를 받았습니다. 그러다 하늘이 무너지자 몇몇 동료들이 사방에서 "
"총격을 가하기 시작해서, 저는 이 벙커로 도망쳤습니다. 그런데 문에 뭔가 문제가 생겨서 그 이후로 갇힌 채로 있습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid "That sounds rough."
msgstr "힘든 일인 것 같네요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid "Just gotta keep my head down and focus on the now."
msgstr "그냥 머리를 숙이고 지금 이 순간에 집중해야겠어요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid "Good luck."
msgstr "행운을 빌어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid ""
"I'm a combat engineer who got sent here to hold this bunker.  I guess I'm "
"still accomplishing that, huh."
msgstr "저는 이 벙커를 지키기 위해 여기 파견된 전투 공병입니다. 아직도 그 임무를 완수하고 있는 것 같군요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Snippet in category "<acknowledged>"
#. ~ Generic acknowledgment of a command.
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I guess so."
msgstr "그럴 것 같아요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid "How come you're locked up?"
msgstr "왜 갇혀있니?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_first_meeting.json
msgid "I have no need for you right now."
msgstr "지금은 당신이 필요하지 않아요."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_missions.json
msgid "Gather solar panels for Balthazar"
msgstr "발타자르를 위해 태양광 패널 모으기"

#. ~ Description of mission "Gather solar panels for Balthazar"
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_missions.json
msgid ""
"Balthazar needs some solar panels to stabilize the power to their bunker."
msgstr "발타자르는 벙커 전력을 안정화하기 위해 태양광 패널이 필요합니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather solar panels for Balthazar"
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_missions.json
msgid ""
"The power in my bunker is failing and I need 12 solar panels to stabilize "
"them."
msgstr "벙커의 전기가 끊기고 있어서 안정화하려면 태양광 패널 12개가 필요해요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather solar panels for Balthazar"
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_missions.json
msgid ""
"Most commercial buildings have some solar panels or, if we're lucky, you "
"might find a solar farm."
msgstr "대부분의 상업용 건물에는 태양광 패널이 설치되어 있고, 운이 좋으면 태양광 발전소를 찾을 수도 있습니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather solar panels for Balthazar"
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_missions.json
msgid "Power is holding for now but I need those panels soon."
msgstr "지금은 전력이 공급되고 있지만 곧 패널이 필요해요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather solar panels for Balthazar"
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_missions.json
msgid "Where are the panels??"
msgstr "패널은 어디에 있나요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather solar panels for Balthazar"
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_missions.json
msgid "You shouldn't fail me, human."
msgstr "나를 실망시켜서는 안 돼, 인간이여."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_missions.json
msgid "Reach source of mysterious transmission"
msgstr "신비한 전파의 근원을 찾아내다"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid "Something forced me to hide in here.  Will you help me now?"
msgstr "뭔가가 날 여기 숨게 만들었어. 지금 도와줄래?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid "Fine, what do you need help with?"
msgstr "좋아요, 무엇에 도움이 필요하세요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid "Not until I know who you are."
msgstr "당신이 누구인지 알 때까지는 안 돼요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid "I wanted to know something else first…"
msgstr "먼저 다른 것을 알고 싶었는데요..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid ""
"I'm a combat engineer who got sent here to hold this bunker.  Can we get "
"down to business now?"
msgstr "저는 이 벙커를 지키기 위해 파견된 전투 공병입니다. 이제 본론으로 들어가도 될까요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid "I got a control center.  Anything else or will you hear me out now?"
msgstr "관제 센터를 찾았습니다. 다른 말씀이 있으신가요? 아니면 지금 제 말씀을 들어주시겠어요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/balthazar_fac/balthazar_smalltalk.json
msgid "There was something else…"
msgstr "또 다른 것이 있었습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Heya, scav."
msgstr "안녕, 수색꾼."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Did you build this place?"
msgstr "네가 여길 만들었나?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Why do you still use cash?"
msgstr "왜 아직도 현금을 쓰는거지?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgid "You're a trader?"
msgstr "넌 상인인가?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgid "I need some supplies."
msgstr "보급품이 필요한데."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgid "Need help with anything?"
msgstr "뭐 도와줄만한 일 있나?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/bunker_shop/TALK_BUNKER_MERCHANT.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"No, no… well, maybe a little.  It was just as wrecked down here as it is up "
"top when I found it, wasn't too hard to fix up.  You're welcome to stay in "
"the spare room awhile, just don't hog it.  You're not the only scav out "
"there."
msgstr ""
"아니, 아니… 뭐, 어쩌면 조금은 그럴지도 몰라. 내가 발견했을 때 여기도 윗층처럼 완전히 망가져 있었거든. 고치는 건 그렇게 어렵지 "
"않았어. 잠깐 예비실에 있어도 괜찮지만, 너무 독차지하지는 마. 너만 스캐브인 건 아니잖아."

