#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid ""
"I am expecting some new materials around <restock_time_point>, hopefully "
"some good escapism."
msgstr ""
"<restock_time_point>쯤에 새로운 자료가 나올 것으로 기대하고 있어요. 즐거운 일상 탈출이 될 수 있기를 바랍니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Thanks, I will make sure to check back."
msgstr "감사합니다. 다시 확인하도록 하겠습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid ""
"Before you ask, we can't lend out books anymore.  We've had too many stolen "
"and destroyed.  If you want to read something, either do it here or I will "
"need to sell it to you for something useful, like a book.  Oh, my name is "
"Elvira Fish, I run Circulations here.  I hope you learn something."
msgstr ""
"물어보시기 전에 말씀드리지만, 저희는 더 이상 책을 빌려드릴 수 없습니다. 도난당하고 파손된 책이 너무 많거든요. 읽고 싶은 게 있으면 "
"여기서 하세요. 아니면 제가 책처럼 유용한 물건으로 팔아야 할 거예요. 아, 저는 엘비라 피쉬입니다. 여기서 대출을 담당하고 있어요. "
"뭔가 배우셨으면 좋겠네요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Can you answer some questions for me?"
msgstr "몇 가지 질문에 답해 주실 수 있나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Let me look at what you have."
msgstr "당신이 가지고 있는 것을 살펴보겠습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "I just want to browse.  <end_talking_bye>"
msgstr "저는 그냥 둘러보고 싶어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Of course, how can I help?"
msgstr "물론입니다. 어떻게 도울 수 있을까요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "I would be happy to assist."
msgstr "저는 기꺼이 도와드리겠습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "Of course, please ask."
msgstr "물론입니다. 물어보세요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "What questions do you have?"
msgstr "어떤 질문이 있으신가요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "You can't lend out books?  What kind of library is that?"
msgstr "책을 빌려줄 수 없나요? 그게 무슨 도서관이에요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
msgid "You want even more books?"
msgstr "더 많은 책을 원하시나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Who's in charge here?"
msgstr "여기 책임자는 누구야?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Is there any way I can join your group?"
msgstr "당신네 일원으로써 합류할 수 있을까?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Snippet in category "<whats_up>"
#. ~ Friendly or neutral greetings.
#: data/json/npcs/campus/great_library_librarian_talk.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Aunt_Theresa.json
