#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "I must be seeing things again!  Stay away from me!"
msgstr "내가 또 뭔가를 보는 것 같아! 나한테서 떨어져!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "* eyes you menacingly with a scowl on his face.  \"What do you want?\""
msgstr "* 얼굴을 찡그린 채 위협적으로 당신을 쳐다봅니다. \"뭘 원하는 거야?\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "Hi, <name_g>.  It's good to see you again."
msgstr "안녕하세요, <name_g> 님. 다시 뵙게 되어 반갑습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid ""
"Hi, <name_g>.  Could I pat you on the shoulder?  I wanna be sure you're "
"here."
msgstr "안녕하세요, <name_g> 님. 어깨 좀 두드려 주시겠어요? 잘 지내시는지 확인하고 싶어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "Hi, <name_g>.  What's up?"
msgstr "안녕하세요, <name_g>. 무슨 일이세요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
msgid "Are you alright?"
msgstr "괜찮아?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Arturo_Maldonado.json
