#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "내가 할 수 있는 걸 찾아볼게."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to hear that <name_g>, but I don't feel like facing it either."
msgstr "<name_g> 님, 그런 말씀 듣게 되어 안타깝지만 저도 그 일을 겪고 싶지 않습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"After what you did for me, I'll follow you to the ends of the Earth!  No one"
" around here's stood up for me like that, I owe ya one."
msgstr ""
"네가 날 위해 해준 일을 생각하면, 지구 끝까지라도 따라갈게! 이 주변에 날 위해 그렇게 나서준 사람은 없어. 네게 빚진 게 하나 있어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
