msgstr ""
"네가 날 위해 해준 일을 생각하면, 지구 끝까지라도 따라갈게! 이 주변에 날 위해 그렇게 나서준 사람은 없어. 네게 빚진 게 하나 있어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid ""
"No chance!  Its not you, its the world out there I'm worried about.  All "
"those <freaking> monsters really give me the creeps, and as far as I know "
"this church is the last bastion of humanity in the <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr ""
"말도 안 돼! 네가 아니라 세상이 걱정이야. 그 <freaking> 괴물들 진짜 소름 돋아. 내가 아는 한 이 교회는 "
"<the_cataclysm>에서 인류의 마지막 보루야."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "That's understandable."
msgstr "이해할 만한 일이죠."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
msgid ""
"Could you be on your way, please?  We don't take kindly to sinners like you."
msgstr "가주시겠어요? 우리는 당신 같은 죄인을 좋게 여기지 않아요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
msgid "Could you be on your way, please?  I'm rather busy."
msgstr "좀 가주시겠어요? 좀 바빠서요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Hello again.  What do you need?"
msgstr "안녕하세요. 뭐가 필요하신가요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
msgid "*waves you over.  \"Hey <u_name>.  How's it going for you?\""
msgstr "*손짓으로 당신을 맞이합니다. \"안녕하세요, <u_name>님. 잘 지내시죠?\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/members/cook.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Hello stranger, I don't think we've met before.  Its nice to meet you, "
"name's Simon."
msgstr "안녕하세요, 낯선 분. 전에 만난 적이 없는 것 같네요. 만나서 반갑습니다. 제 이름은 사이먼입니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
