msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Ah, a rich man I see.  I think you have yourself a deal."
msgstr "아, 부자시군요. 좋은 거래가 성사된 것 같네요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
