msgid ""
"I'm just a man looking to help some poor folks out, caught word of this "
"place from one of those old FEMA bunkers, a group's holed up there.  I "
"figured I'd come out here and help these people out."
msgstr ""
"저는 그저 불쌍한 사람들을 돕고 싶은 사람일 뿐입니다. 옛 FEMA 벙커에서 이곳 소식을 들었는데, 어떤 단체가 거기에 숨어 있더군요. "
"그래서 여기 와서 이 사람들을 도와야겠다고 생각했습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "That's interesting.  Well, let's trade."
msgstr "흥미롭네요. 그럼, 거래해 볼까요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Can you give me directions to any of these other survivor groups?"
msgstr "다른 생존자 그룹으로 가는 길을 알려줄 수 있나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Thanks for chatting.  <end_talking_leave>"
msgstr "대화해주셔서 감사합니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"No offense, but my clients definitely would not like me giving strangers "
"directions to their hideouts.  You'll have to find them on their own terms."
msgstr ""
"기분 나쁘게 생각하진 않지만, 제 고객들은 제가 낯선 사람에게 은신처를 찾아가는 길을 알려주는 걸 절대 좋아하지 않을 겁니다. 고객들이 "
"알아서 찾아가셔야 할 겁니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "I can understand that.  Well, let's trade."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 그럼, 거래합시다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Heh, always good to do business."
msgstr "허허, 언제나 사업하는 건 좋은 일이지."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Actually, I had a little more to trade still."
msgstr "사실, 아직 거래할 것이 조금 더 남아 있었습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid "You got anything else?"
msgstr "다른 게 있나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Thanks.  What were we talking about before?"
msgstr "고맙습니다. 우리가 전에 무슨 이야기를 했었죠?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Thanks for that.  <end_talking_leave>"
msgstr "고맙습니다. <end_talking_leave>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Well, not right now.  Try again after around <restock_time_point>."
msgstr "지금은 안 됩니다. <restock_time_point>쯤에 다시 시도해 보세요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Okay.  About other things…"
msgstr "좋아요. 다른 것에 대해서는…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Like I said, I'm a businessman and business is my job.  Those other yahoos "
"you've been talkin' to don't know what they're doing."
msgstr "제가 말씀드렸듯이, 저는 사업가이고 사업이 제 직업입니다. 당신이 얘기했던 다른 야후들은 자기들이 뭘 하는지 모르는 거예요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"Like I said, I'm a businessman and business is my job.  Those other yahoos "
"you've been talkin' to don't know what they're doing."
msgstr "제가 말씀드렸듯이, 저는 사업가이고 사업이 제 직업입니다. 당신이 얘기했던 다른 야후들은 자기들이 뭘 하는지 모르는 거예요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Like I said, I'm a businessman and business is my job.  Those other yahoos "
"you've been talkin' to don't know what they're doing."
msgstr "제가 말씀드렸듯이, 저는 사업가이고 사업이 제 직업입니다. 당신이 얘기했던 다른 야후들은 자기들이 뭘 하는지 모르는 거예요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Alright.  I'd like to buy something."
msgstr "좋아요. 뭔가 사고 싶어요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"I think you're full of shit.  I know you're gouging for your own benefit, "
"and wouldn't it be a shame if this information were to get out?"
msgstr ""
"당신 말이 다 헛소리인 것 같아요. 당신 이익을 위해 돈을 갈취하는 거 알지만, 이 정보가 새어나가면 정말 안타까운 일이잖아요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/vampire_mentor.json
msgid "Alright.  What were we talking about before?"
msgstr "좋아요. 우리가 전에 무슨 이야기를 했었죠?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"Woah woah woah, cool your jets.  I can't let this spread about me, so name "
"your price and keep quiet, and I might give you a discount."
msgstr "와, 와, 와, 좀 진정해. 이 얘기가 내 입에 퍼지는 건 싫어. 가격 말하고 조용히 있으면 할인해 줄 수도 있어."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid "50 merch and you have a deal."
msgstr "50개의 머크만 있으면 거래가 성립됩니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"You know what, I don't want your <freaking> dirty money.  Go fuck yourself."
msgstr "있잖아, 난 네 <freaking> 더러운 돈은 필요 없어. 꺼져라."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid ""
"What proof do you have <name_b>?  Nothing is what you got, and your the only"
" one here who's full of shit."
msgstr "<name_b>, 무슨 증거가 있어? 네가 가진 건 아무것도 아니야. 그리고 여기서 헛소리하는 사람은 너뿐이야."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid "If you don't wanna cooperate, I'll stop this by force."
msgstr "협조하지 않으시면, 강제로 막겠습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/godco/visitors/TALK_CARAVAN_MERCHANT_PREDATORY.json
msgid "Get out of here, <name_b>."
msgstr "여기서 나가세요, <name_b>."

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
