#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"You know storms?  Used to be more.  Took me a lot of work, but there aren't "
"as many now.  That was me, I did that.  Fewer storms, pretty good.  There's "
"a big eagle, it's a long story really.  I'm good with rope though."
msgstr ""
"폭풍 알아? 예전에는 더 많았지. 엄청 힘들었는데, 지금은 그렇게 많지 않아. 내가 그랬지. 폭풍이 줄었으니 꽤 괜찮았어. 큰 독수리도 "
"있고, 사실 좀 긴 이야기지만. 그래도 밧줄은 잘 다루지."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "It's decided then.  I will be Glooscap.  Who will you be?"
msgstr "그럼 결정됐어. 나는 글로스캡이 될 거야. 너는 누구가 될 거야?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Glooscap?  That's a funny name.  Is it foreign?"
msgstr "글로스캡? 이름이 이상하네요. 외국 이름인가요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[INT 11]  Like the Wabanaki myth?"
msgstr "[INT 11] 와바나키 신화를 좋아하시나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "So.  You're dressed like a hunter.  Are you a hunter?"
msgstr "그럼, 사냥꾼처럼 차려입었군요. 사냥꾼이신가요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "Have you had any luck out there?"
msgstr "당신은 거기서 행운을 누렸나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"Whatever, I don't have time for whatever this is.  Try not to get your face "
"eaten I guess."
msgstr "뭐, 뭐 이런 거 할 시간 없어. 얼굴 뜯어먹히지 않도록 조심해."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm used to it.  No, Glooscap has been a name here for a very long time.  Is"
" your name foreign?"
msgstr "익숙하죠. 아니요, Glooscap은 여기서 아주 오래전부터 쓰인 이름이에요. 당신 이름은 외국 이름인가요?"

