#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[Offer Beer] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have some drinks with "
"me, want to have some?"
msgstr "[맥주 제안] 네, 당신의 미소에 정말 반했어요. 술 좀 있는데, 마실래요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[Offer India Pale Ale] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have some "
"drinks with me, want to have some?"
msgstr "[인디아 페일 에일 제공] 네, 당신의 미소에 정말 반했어요. 술 좀 있는데, 같이 마실래요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[Offer Cigarettes] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have some "
"cigarettes, want one with me?"
msgstr "[담배 권유] 네, 당신의 미소에 정말 반했어요. 담배가 있는데, 하나 드릴까요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"[Offer Joint] I am extremely into your smile yes.  I have something to "
"smoke, want to have some with me?"
msgstr "[공유 제안] 네, 당신의 미소에 정말 반했어요. 담배 피울 게 있는데, 같이 피울래요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid ""
"You seem cool but I don't have anything fun.  I'll try and find something "
"and come back so we can share."
msgstr "멋진 것 같은데, 재밌는 게 하나도 없네요. 뭔가 찾아서 다시 와서 같이 이야기 나눠볼게요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[PRETTY] That smile is very nice.  It makes me smile too."
msgstr "[예쁘다] 그 미소 참 예쁘네요. 저도 미소가 지어지네요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[GLORIOUS] Worship my beauty."
msgstr "[영광스러운] 내 아름다움을 경배하라."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[TERRIFYING] Fear me!  I am disgusting!"
msgstr "[무섭다] 무서워! 난 역겹다!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgid "[TERRIFYING] Destroy me!"
msgstr "[무서움] 나를 파괴해!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/NC_GLOOSCAP.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I do have a twin.  Malsumis is probably around here somewhere, very tricky."
"  You know I turned Malsumis to stone once?  I'm supposed to be the nice "
"one, but you know how much it hurts turning yourself back from stone?  It "
"takes days."
msgstr ""
"쌍둥이가 있어요. 말수미스가 아마 이 근처 어딘가에 있을 거예요. 아주 까다로워요. 제가 말수미스를 돌로 만든 적 있잖아요? 제가 착한 "
"아이로 태어났어야 했는데, 돌에서 다시 돌아오는 게 얼마나 힘든지 아세요? 며칠씩 걸리거든요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
