msgstr "나는 마을을 혼자 떠난 게 아니야. 여기에 혼자 도착했지."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "I didn't leave the town alone.  I arrived here alone."
msgstr "나는 마을을 혼자 떠난 게 아니야. 여기 혼자 도착했지."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry for your loss.  But you still can't give up.  You have a lot to "
"live for!"
msgstr "애도를 표합니다. 하지만 아직 포기할 순 없어요. 살아갈 이유가 많으니까요!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "We all lost someone.  No reason to sit down and die."
msgstr "우리 모두 누군가를 잃었습니다. 그렇다고 앉아서 죽을 이유는 없습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "You can't let yourself be consumed by grief.  It will get better."
msgstr "슬픔에 휩쓸려 버려선 안 돼요. 나아질 거예요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "No one gets out alive.  Always been that way.  So we keep going."
msgstr "아무도 살아서 나갈 수 없어. 늘 그래왔지. 그래서 우리는 계속 나아갈 거야."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I'm sure your loved one would want you to live on for them."
msgstr "당신의 사랑하는 사람은 당신이 그들을 위해 계속 살아가기를 바랄 것입니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I… I mean… huh.  I guess."
msgstr "나… 내 말은… 허. 그럴 것 같아."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Good.  Take care."
msgstr "좋아요. 조심하세요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "That's a start."
msgstr "시작이에요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Just leave me alone."
msgstr "나를 내버려 두세요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Alright.  Take care."
msgstr "알았어요. 조심하세요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "I dunno.  Waiting.  Seeing if something happens I guess."
msgstr "모르겠어. 기다리는 중이야. 무슨 일이 일어나는지 지켜보는 거지."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "You do realize there is an apocalypse going on, right?"
msgstr "당신은 종말이 다가오고 있다는 걸 알고 있나요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Yeah.  I do."
msgstr "네, 그렇습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "So shouldn't you be more concerned?  Trying to survive?"
msgstr "그러니 더 걱정해야 하지 않을까? 살아남으려고 노력하는 거잖아?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid ""
"For how long?  You've seen what's out there.  If we survive today, we'll die"
" the day after.  Or the day after that.  And if we live beyond that, we'll "
"just see everyone we care about die.  All of them.  Might as well get it "
"over with."
msgstr ""
"얼마나 오래? 밖에 뭐가 있는지 봤잖아. 오늘 살아남으면 모레에 죽을 거야. 아니면 그다음 날. 그리고 그보다 더 오래 산다면, 우리가 "
"아끼는 사람들이 다 죽는 걸 보게 될 거야. 전부 다. 어서 빨리 끝내는 게 낫겠어."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "So you're just going to give up?"
msgstr "그럼 그냥 포기할 거야?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Yeah.  I think I will."
msgstr "네. 그럴 것 같아요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid ""
"I dunno.  Maybe.  Might give me something to do while I think about all "
"this."
msgstr "모르겠어. 그럴지도. 이 모든 걸 생각하는 동안 뭔가 할 일이 생길지도 몰라."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I told you to just leave me alone."
msgstr "내가 그냥 나를 내버려두라고 했잖아."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
