#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid ""
"Do you still want to order your "
"<item_name:<u_val:general_artisans_blacksmith_weapon>> or would you like to "
"choose something else?"
msgstr ""
"여전히 <item_name:<u_val:general_artisans_blacksmith_weapon>>을 주문하시겠습니까? 아니면 다른"
" 것을 선택하시겠습니까?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "Yes, I want to order it."
msgstr "네, 주문하고 싶습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[200 merch, 3 days] I need a mace."
msgstr "[머크 200개, 3일] 메이스가 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[200 merch, 3 days] I need a steelshod quarterstaff."
msgstr "[머크 200개, 3일] 강철로 된 쿼터스태프가 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[250 merch, 4 days] I need a battle axe."
msgstr "[머크 250개, 4일] 전투도끼가 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[250 merch, 4 days] I need a longsword."
msgstr "[머크 250개, 4일] 롱소드가 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[250 merch, 4 days] I need a nodachi."
msgstr "[머크 250개, 4일] 노다치가 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[250 merch, 4 days] I need a zweihander."
msgstr "[머크 250개, 4일] 츠바이핸더가 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[200 merch, 3 days] I need an arming sword."
msgstr "[머크 200개, 3일] 무장검이 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[200 merch, 3 days] I need a broadsword."
msgstr "[머크 200개, 3일] 브로드소드가 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[200 merch, 3 days] I need a cavalry saber."
msgstr "[머크 200개, 3일] 기병 세이버가 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[200 merch, 3 days] I need a cutlass."
msgstr "[머크 200개, 3일] 커틀라스가 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[200 merch, 3 days] I need a katana."
msgstr "[머크 200개, 3일] 카타나가 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[170 merch, 3 days] I need a wakizashi."
msgstr "[머크 170개, 3일] 와키자시가 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[150 merch, 2 days] I need a kukri."
msgstr "[머크 150개, 2일] 쿠크리가 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[250 merch, 4 days] I need an estoc."
msgstr "[머크 250개, 4일] 에스톡이 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[200 merch, 3 days] I need a rapier."
msgstr "[머크 200개, 3일] 레이피어가 필요해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[70 merch, 2 days] I need a trench knife."
msgstr "[머크 70개, 2일] 참호칼이 필요해요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid ""
"Okay.  What about the steel grade?  Tempering will make your weapon much "
"more durable and a little sharper."
msgstr "좋아요. 강철 등급은 어떻게 되나요? 담금질을 하면 무기가 훨씬 더 튼튼해지고 조금 더 날카로워질 거예요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "No, high carbon steel is fine."
msgstr "아니요, 고탄소강이면 괜찮습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "[+50 merch, +2 days] Yes, tempered steel would be excellent."
msgstr "[+머크 50개, +2일] 네, 강화 강철이면 좋을 것 같아요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid ""
"Great, so I can make your "
"<item_name:<u_val:general_artisans_blacksmith_weapon>> for "
"<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_cost> merch and in "
"<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_wait> days.  Deal?"
msgstr ""
"좋습니다. 그러면 <item_name:<u_val:general_artisans_blacksmith_weapon>>을 "
"<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_cost> 머크에 "
"<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_wait>일 안에 만들어 드릴 수 있겠네요. 괜찮으시겠어요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid ""
"[<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_cost> merch] Deal.  See you in "
"<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_wait> days."
msgstr ""
"[<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_cost> 머크] 특가! "
"<u_val:number_artisans_blacksmith_weapon_wait>일 후에 뵙겠습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_cody_weaponsmith.json
msgid "It's all done!  Sorry for the long wait; hopefully it's worth it."
msgstr "모두 완료되었습니다! 오래 기다리게 해서 죄송합니다. 기다리신 만큼 보람이 있기를 바랍니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_item_groups.json
msgid "engineering notes"
msgid_plural "engineering notes"
msgstr[0] "공학 설계 노트"

#. ~ Description of "engineering notes"
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_item_groups.json
msgid ""
"A collection of sketches and CAD designs marked up with pencil.  There are "
"two peoples handwriting."
msgstr "연필로 끄적여진 초고 설계도와 컴퓨터 지원 설계가 그려져 있습니다. 자세히 보니 종이에 적힌 글씨체가 서로 다릅니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid ""
"You hit the nail on the head.  You bring me cartridges of one type, and I "
"reload them into another.  Ammo has its own exchange rate, for example, you "
"can exchange a hundred rifle rounds for three hundred pistol rounds or vice "
"versa."
msgstr ""
"핵심을 정확히 짚으셨네요. 한 종류의 카트리지를 가져오시면 제가 다른 카트리지에 재장전해 드리는 거죠. 탄약은 자체적인 교환 비율이 "
"있습니다. 예를 들어 소총 탄약 100발을 권총 탄약 300발로 교환할 수 있고, 그 반대로도 교환할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "Can we do that now?"
msgstr "지금 하자."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid ""
"Alright.  So, first you give me your rounds, I'll put them on your account, "
"and then I can reload them in another caliber of your choice.  What ammo do "
"you want to convert?"
msgstr ""
"좋아요. 그럼 먼저 탄약을 주시면 제가 당신 계정에 넣어 드리겠습니다. 그리고 나서 당신이 원하는 다른 구경으로 재장전해 드리겠습니다. "
"어떤 탄약으로 변환하시겠습니까?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"[Your credit: $<u_val:number_artisans_gunsmith_credit>]"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"[귀하의 크레딧: $<u_val:number_artisans_gunsmith_credit>]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/dialog_statue.json
msgid "That's all for now."
msgstr "이제 끝입니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/isolated_road/isolated_road_jay_convert.json
msgid "Now I want you to convert these rounds."
msgstr "이제 이 라운드를 변환해 보세요."

