#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Angry pizzaiolo"
msgstr "화난 피자이올로"

#. ~ Description of mission "Angry pizzaiolo"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Bring the pizzaiolo to <color_light_blue>their rival's house</color> and "
"don't forget to <color_yellow>bring at least 200 units of gasoline</color>."
"  After you got there, talk to the pizzaiolo to start burning the house."
msgstr ""
"피자 배달부를 <color_light_blue>라이벌의 집</color>으로 데려가세요. 그리고 <color_yellow>최소 "
"200유닛의 휘발유를 가져오세요</color>. 도착 후 피자 배달부와 대화하여 집을 불태우세요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pizzaiolo"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"I'm so angry!  I have an enemy that ruined my life, and I want revenge for "
"it!  I don't care about <the_cataclysm>, I just want to burn his <freaking> "
"restaurant!  Will you help me?"
msgstr ""
"너무 화가 나! 내 인생을 망친 원수가 생겼어. 복수하고 싶어! <the_cataclysm> 따위는 상관없어. 그냥 그놈의 "
"<freaking> 식당을 불태워 버리고 싶을 뿐이야! 도와줄래?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pizzaiolo"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Good.  Let's go to his restaurant and fucking burn it!  Oh, by the way, "
"could you bring gasoline with you, <name_g>?  I was so angry I forgot to "
"bring it with me…"
msgstr ""
"좋아. 걔 식당 가서 불이나 태워버려! 아, 그런데, 휘발유 좀 가져가 줄래, <name_g>? 너무 화가 나서 가져오는 걸 깜빡했네…"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pizzaiolo"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find TrueFoodperson"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pizza parlor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Family house"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "What?!  Why do you… ah, forget it."
msgstr "뭐?! 왜… 아, 잊어버리셨어요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Angry pizzaiolo"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Sweet, sweet revenge!  It smells so nice!  His restaurant burns, his legacy "
"is now ruined!  Even if he became a <zombie>, it still good."
msgstr ""
"달콤하고 달콤한 복수! 향기가 너무 좋아! 그의 레스토랑은 불타고, 그의 유산은 이제 망가졌어! 설령 그가 <zombies>가 되었다고 "
"해도, 여전히 좋아."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Find TrueFoodperson"
msgstr "TrueFoodperson 찾기"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find TrueFoodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Help pizzaiolo find TrueFoodperson and kick his ass."
msgstr "피자이올로가 TrueFoodperson을 찾아 그를 혼내줄 수 있도록 도와주세요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find TrueFoodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Ah, it's you, <name_g>.  Wanna continue on my revenge to all American "
"<name_b>s?"
msgstr "아, 당신이군요, <name_g>. 모든 미국 <name_b>들에게 복수를 계속하고 싶으신가요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find TrueFoodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Good.  Next stop, Foodplace.  I always hated that place, especially that "
"<freaking> <name_b> in his idiotic mask.  I know he's still alive, hiding in"
" his dumb parody of a restaurant.  Take this bat.  Let's take a visit to "
"him, <name_g>, and kick his <freaking> ass!"
msgstr ""
"좋아. 다음 목적지는 푸드플레이스야. 난 항상 그곳이 싫었어. 특히 그 멍청한 가면을 쓴 <freaking> <name_b>는. 걔가 "
"아직 살아서 그 멍청한 패러디 레스토랑에 숨어 있다는 걸 알아. 이 박쥐를 가져가. <name_g>, 걔한테 가서 <freaking> "
"엉덩이를 걷어차 주자!"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find TrueFoodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"I heard that these 'restaurants' use some kind of locking system for staff "
"room, so we would need to find a way to get there."
msgstr ""
"이런 '레스토랑'에서는 직원 휴게실에 어떤 종류의 잠금 장치를 사용한다고 들었어요. 그래서 거기까지 갈 방법을 찾아야 할 것 같아요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find TrueFoodperson"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pizza parlor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Family house"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "I'm waiting."
msgstr "기다리고 있어요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find TrueFoodperson"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Another one bite the dust!  We did good, <name_g>."
msgstr "또 한 마리가 죽었네요! 잘했어요, <name_g>."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Pizza parlor"
msgstr "피자 가게"

#. ~ Description of mission "Pizza parlor"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Help pizzaiolo take back his restaurant."
msgstr "피자이올로가 자신의 레스토랑을 되찾을 수 있도록 도와주세요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pizza parlor"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"I need to make a last step to achieve my revenge, and the step is - my pizza"
" parlor.  Before <the_cataclysm>, the bank took my place, and now, some "
"<freaking> <name_b>s occupied it and made it their base!  Just unbelievable,"
" I tell ya.  It's time for me to fight back, deal with this <freaking> "
"<name_b>s and regain my honor.  Are you with me, <name_g>?"
msgstr ""
"복수를 위해 마지막 한 걸음을 내딛어야 하는데, 그 첫걸음은 바로 피자 가게다. <the_cataclysm> 전에는 은행이 내 자리를 "
"차지했는데, 지금은 <freaking> <name_b> 놈들이 그 자리를 차지하고 자신들의 근거지로 삼았다니! 정말 믿기지 않는다. 이제"
" 내가 반격해서 이 <freaking> <name_b> 놈들을 상대하고 명예를 되찾아야 할 때다. <name_g>, 동의하는가?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pizza parlor"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Very good.  <lets_go>"
msgstr "아주 좋아요. <lets_go>"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pizza parlor"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"These <name_b>s might be heavily armed, so we need to prepare to face them."
msgstr "이 <name_b>들은 무장을 단단히 하고 있을 수도 있으니, 우리는 그들과 맞서 싸울 준비를 해야 합니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Pizza parlor"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Nice, very fucking nice.  Fuck, this placed is thrashed.  <freaking> "
"<name_b>s thrashed my restaurant!  Okay, calm down, calm down, will ya… At "
"least I retrieved my place.  Thank you, <name_g>.  I couldn't make it "
"without you."
msgstr ""
"좋아, 정말 씨발 좋아. 씨발, 여기 완전 망했어. <freaking> <name_b> 놈들이 내 식당을 망쳐놨어! 알았어, 진정해, "
"진정해, 응… 적어도 내 자리는 되찾았잖아. 고마워, <name_g>. 너 없이는 못 왔을 거야."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Family house"
msgstr "가족 주택"

#. ~ Description of mission "Family house"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"First bring pizzaiolo some chocolate cake then lead him to his family house."
msgstr "먼저 피자이올로에게 초콜릿 케이크를 가져다 주고, 그를 그의 가족 집으로 데려가세요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Family house"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"Now, as my competitors dead, their places are ruined, it's time to relax… I "
"know, let's celebrate it!  Lead me to my house.  Also, we need a cake for "
"that.  What celebration without a cake, right?  I can teach you how to cook "
"it, if you want."
msgstr ""
"자, 경쟁자들이 죽고, 자리도 망가졌으니 이제 좀 쉬어야지… 알았어, 축하하자! 우리 집으로 데려다줘. 그리고 케이크도 필요해. 케이크 "
"없이 무슨 축하를 하겠어? 케이크 만드는 법도 알려줄 수 있어. 원하면."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Family house"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Good.  Bring me chocolate cake and talk to me."
msgstr "좋아. 초콜릿 케이크 가져다 주시고 이야기 좀 나눠요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Family house"
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid ""
"If you listened to me very closely, it wouldn't be hard for you to make it."
"  Good luck, <name_g>."
msgstr "제 말을 잘 들으셨다면, 어렵지 않게 성공하실 수 있을 거예요. 행운을 빌어요, <name_g>."

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "You learn how to craft cake."
msgstr "케이크를 만드는 법을 배웁니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Are we there yet, <name_g>?  I can't wait to burn that building!"
msgstr "아직 도착 안 했어, <name_g>?  건물을 불태우고 싶어서 참을 수가 없어!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
#: data/mods/innawood/npcs/missiondef.json
msgid "We're here.  Let's do it!"
msgstr "도착했군.  질러버리자!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/NPC_pizzaiolo.json
msgid "Be patient, <name_g>, we're getting there soon."
msgstr "침착해, <name_g>, 곧 도착할 거야."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Finally, someone who isn't part of those <zombies>."
msgstr "마침내, <zombies>에 속하지 않은 사람이 나타났네요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, today's your lucky day.  Hand over your stuff, or you'll be one "
"yourself."
msgstr "응, 오늘 네 행운의 날이야. 네 물건 내놔, 안 그러면 너도 행운의 주인공이 될 거야."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Hey, nice to meet you."
msgstr "안녕하세요, 만나서 반갑습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "<greet>"
msgstr "<greet>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Who are you, exactly?"
msgstr "너는 대체 누구지?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Wanna buy something, maybe sell off what you don't need?"
msgstr "뭔가 사고 싶거나, 필요 없는 건 팔고 싶나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Could I buy one of your pets?"
msgstr "애완동물 한 마리 살 수 있을까요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I worked here before <the_cataclysm> dumped everything in the <freaking> "
"bin.  I took care of all the animals here, and when the <zombies> started "
"roaming the streets, I gathered every pet or stray I could.  I still take "
"care of them, just gotta worry about the <zombies> now on top of disease, "
"cleanliness, etc."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>이 <freaking> 쓰레기통에 모든 걸 버리기 전에 여기서 일했어요. 여기 있는 모든 동물들을 돌봤고, "
"<zombies>이 거리를 배회하기 시작했을 때는 애완동물이나 길 잃은 동물들을 모을 수 있는 한 모았죠. 지금도 돌보고 있지만, 이제는"
" <zombies>에 더해 질병, 청결 등등까지 걱정해야 하니까요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
