#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Yes, you can relax now."
msgstr "네, 지금은 편히 쉬셔도 됩니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Don't worry, we're getting there soon."
msgstr "걱정하지 마세요. 곧 도착할 거예요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"Thank you.  I will never forget your kindness, <name_g>.  Take this book as "
"token of my gratitude."
msgstr "감사합니다. 당신의 친절을 결코 잊지 않겠습니다, <name_g>. 이 책을 제 감사의 표시로 받아주세요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
