#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
msgid ""
"I'm going south.  Hopefully somebody down there fared better than the people"
" I knew up here.  Besides, I won't have to worry about freezing my "
"<freaking> butt off when winter comes."
msgstr ""
"남쪽으로 갈 거야. 거기 있는 사람들 중에 내가 위에서 아는 사람들보다 더 잘 지내는 사람이 있었으면 좋겠어. 게다가 겨울이 오면 "
"엉덩이가 얼어 죽을 걱정도 없겠지."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm going east, towards the coastline.  I heard some rumors that Rhode "
"Island was still holding itself together, so I'm going to go and check that "
"out.  Heck, I might just go out to sea myself, live on an old oil rig or "
"something like that."
msgstr ""
"동쪽, 해안선 쪽으로 갈 거야. 로드아일랜드가 아직 건재하다는 소문을 들었거든. 가서 확인해 봐야겠어. 뭐, 나도 바다에 나가서 낡은 "
"석유 굴착 장치 같은 데서 살 수도 있고."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
