msgid ""
"I found a small cabin out in the woods, someone was living there and had "
"some serious chemistry equipment.  I managed to get good medical supplies "
"from there.  They even had some oddball things too, like fucking napalm and "
"black powder."
msgstr ""
"숲속에서 작은 오두막을 발견했는데, 누군가 거기 살고 있었고, 제대로 된 화학 장비도 있었어. 거기서 괜찮은 의료품도 구할 수 있었지. "
"심지어 네이팜탄이랑 흑색 화약 같은 이상한 물건들도 있었어."

