#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "Caravan Guard"
msgstr "캐러밴 경호원"

#. ~ Job description of "Trader" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration_0.I/obsolete_npc_class.json
msgid "I'm collecting gear and selling it."
msgstr "난 장비를 모아서 팔아 먹고살지."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Well well, another traveler.  Don't try anything, you're outnumbered here "
"and we're well armed."
msgstr "으음, 또 다른 여행자. 아무것도 시도하지 마. 여기는 수적으로 열세고, 우리는 무장도 잘 돼 있어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
