msgstr "난 꼬마가 아냐, 알겠어? 난 열네살이라고."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "Sorry, I didn't mean anything by it.  What's up?"
msgstr "미안, 일부러 그런 건 아니야. 무슨 일이야?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "Sorry, I didn't mean anything by it.  <end_talking_leave>"
msgstr "죄송합니다. 아무 뜻 없이 한 말이었습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid ""
"We're just standing around here waiting, like a bunch of idiots.  We're "
"supposedly waiting to go downstairs to the shelter, but it's been over a "
"month.  I don't think it's happening.  I don't know what we're doing here.  "
"I've read all the books, and there's zombies outside so we're stuck in here."
"  We can hear them at night."
msgstr ""
"우리는 그냥 여기서 바보들처럼 기다리고 있을 뿐이야. 아래층 대피소로 내려가려고 기다리고 있다고 했는데, 한 달이 넘었어. 안 되는 것 "
"같아. 여기서 뭘 하고 있는 건지 모르겠어. 책도 다 읽었는데, 밖에 좀비들이 있어서 여기 갇혀 있어. 밤에 좀비 소리가 들려."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid ""
"I don't know what's up.  I'm not sure what we're even doing here.  They say "
"we're supposed to wait until we can be moved to the shelter downstairs, but "
"we've been here days and there's no word on how long we'll be waiting.  It's"
" all so stupid, and nobody can tell me anything.\"  She glances at the "
"shuttered windows.  \"Jenny figures they're never going to let us go down "
"there, so I guess we're going to sort it out up here, one way or another.  "
"It's not fair, but 'fair' doesn't mean much in my life anymore."
msgstr ""
"무슨 일인지 모르겠어요. 우리가 여기서 뭘 하고 있는 건지조차 모르겠어요. 아래층 대피소로 옮겨질 때까지 기다려야 한다고 하는데, 며칠째"
" 여기 있는데 얼마나 기다려야 할지 아무도 말 안 해줘요. 너무 어처구니가 없어요. 아무도 뭐라고 말해줄 수가 없어요.\" 그녀는 덧문이"
" 닫힌 창문을 흘끗 본다. \"제니는 절대 우리가 아래층으로 내려가는 걸 허락하지 않을 거라고 생각해요. 그러니 어떻게든 여기서 문제를 "
"해결해야겠죠. 공평하지 않지만, '공평하다'는 건 이제 제 삶에서 큰 의미가 없어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid ""
"*narrows her eyes, her words coming out hoarse and clipped.  \"You can't "
"just go asking people questions like that nowadays.  I'm a teenaged girl "
"alone in an evacuation center after, like, literally everyone in the world "
"died and came back as zombies.  What do you think my story is?  My entire "
"family died, came back as zombies, and I somehow wound up here.\""
msgstr ""
"*눈을 가늘게 뜨고, 쉰 목소리로 말을 잇지 못한다. \"요즘은 사람들에게 그런 질문을 함부로 할 수 없잖아요. 저는 십 대 소녀인데, "
"말 그대로 세상 모든 사람이 죽었다가 좀비가 되어 돌아온 후 대피소에 혼자 갇혀 있어요. 제 이야기는 어떤가요? 온 가족이 죽었다가 "
"좀비가 되어 돌아왔는데, 어쩌다 보니 제가 여기 오게 된 거죠.\""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "Who takes care of you here?"
msgstr "여기서 널 돌봐주는 사람은 없어?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid ""
"Nobody really.  I'm old enough to work and get merch for my rations.  Jenny "
"and Rhy look out for me though.  They think I don't notice that they're "
"looking out for me, but I do.  It's okay, they're both cool."
msgstr ""
"사실상 없어. 일도 할 수 있는 나이고 내 배급식량을 얻기 위해 필요한 교환품을 알아서 구할 수 있으니까. 그래도 제니랑 라이가 많이 "
"돌봐줬어. 그 둘이 편의를 봐주는 걸 내가 눈치못챘을 거라 생각하나본데, 사실 이미 알고있어. 괜찮아, 둘 다 착해."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid ""
"I don't have much of a hot take besides what I just said.  It's shit.  Not "
"enough to do to stay busy, not enough to eat, and even if I had internet, "
"all the YouTubers I follow are dead."
msgstr ""
"방금 말한 내용 말고는 딱히 추가할 말이 없네. 그냥 다 좆같아. 바쁘게 집중하면서 지낼만큼 할 거리도 없고, 먹을 것도 부족하고, "
"인터넷이 있었더라도 내가 팔로우하는 유튜버들도 전부 다 죽었을거야."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "What YouTubers did you follow?"
msgstr "어떤 유튜버를 팔로우하셨나요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid ""
"*looks you up and down, an uncharacteristic glint of humor in her eyes.  "
"\"Why, you thinking of subscribing?  I don't think you'd have heard of them,"
" and even if you had, there's definitely no way for them to get any new "
"content out.  Not anything worth watching anyway.\""
msgstr ""
"*당신을 위아래로 훑어보며 평소답지 않게 유머러스한 눈빛을 보냈다. \"왜, 구독하려고 하는 거야? 아마 들어보지도 못했을 거야. 설령 "
"들어봤다고 해도 새 콘텐츠를 올릴 방법이 전혀 없잖아. 어차피 볼 만한 콘텐츠도 없고.\""

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Alonso Lautrec"
msgstr "알론소 로트렉"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "al_relaxed"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Relaxed with Alonso"
msgstr "알론소와 함께 휴식을 취하다"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Relaxed with Alonso"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "You spent some pleasant time relaxing with someone."
msgstr "당신은 누군가와 함께 휴식을 취하며 즐거운 시간을 보냈습니다."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Relaxed with Alonso"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "You feel relaxed."
msgstr "당신은 편안함을 느낀다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "You seem a little forward…"
msgstr "좀 직설적인걸…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"[PER 10] What is up with you?  What's with the fake accent, and speaking in "
"the third person?"
msgstr "[PER 10] 왜 그래? 왜 가짜 악센트를 쓰고, 왜 3인칭으로 말하는 거야?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Why aren't you wearing any pants?"
msgstr "왜 바지를 안 입고 계세요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"About those special pants a sexy clown hid in a shop for mysterious reasons…"
msgstr "그 특별한 바지에 대해선 섹시한 광대가 신비한 이유로 어느 가게에 숨겨둔 것입니다..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"[PRETTY] Remember that nice thing I did for you?  Can you do something nice "
"for me?"
msgstr "[예쁘다] 내가 너한테 해줬던 그 좋은 일 기억나? 나한테 뭔가 좋은 거 해줄 수 있어?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "So about those condoms.  I thought of a good use for them…"
msgstr "콘돔에 대해 이야기해 볼까요? 콘돔을 잘 활용할 수 있는 방법이 생각났어요…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "[UGLY] I'm desperate.  You're my only chance."
msgstr "[못생김] 난 절박해. 넌 내 유일한 기회야."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"*is an uncharacteristically well-groomed young man, his hair trim and "
"slicked back.  In this stark setting, he looks like a cartoon character on a"
" live-action set piece.  \""
msgstr ""
"*그는 평소와 달리 단정한 차림새의 젊은 남자로, 머리를 깔끔하게 정돈하고 뒤로 넘겼다. 이 삭막한 배경 속에서 그는 마치 실사 영화 "
"세트장에 나오는 만화 캐릭터처럼 보인다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Oh my, it's good to see such a strong and handsome fellow around here"
msgstr "아, 이렇게 강하고 잘생긴 사람을 여기서 보니 기쁘네요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Oh my, you're a beautiful lady, so nice to see you"
msgstr "오, 당신은 아름다운 여인이군요. 당신을 만나서 정말 반가워요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
".\"  He slides his hand through his hair and smiles, his eyes half-lidded.  "
"\"They call me Alonso.\""
msgstr "\" 그는 머리카락을 쓸어 넘기며 미소 지었다. 눈을 반쯤 감았다. \"사람들은 나를 알론소라고 불러.\""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Alonso."
msgstr "만나서 반가워, 알론소."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Hi Alonso, nice to meet you.  <end_talking_leave>"
msgstr "안녕하세요 알론소, 만나서 반갑습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*leans casually against the brick wall of the shelter.  \"Hello again, "
"gorgeous\""
msgstr "*대피소의 벽돌 벽에 무심하게 기대며 \"안녕하세요, 예쁜 아가씨.\"라고 말했다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*leans casually against the brick wall of the shelter.  \"Hello again, "
"gorgeous\""
msgstr "*대피소의 벽돌 벽에 무심하게 기대며 \"안녕하세요, 예쁜 아가씨.\"라고 말했다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*leans casually against the brick wall of the shelter.  \"Hello again, "
"gorgeous\""
msgstr "*대피소의 벽돌 벽에 무심하게 기대며 \"안녕하세요, 예쁜 아가씨.\"라고 말했다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Hi, Alonso.  What's up?"
msgstr "안녕, 알론소. 무슨 일이야?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Hi Alonso.  <end_talking_leave>"
msgstr "안녕 알론소."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"Nice to meet you too.  Very nice.  It gets so lonely here in the center."
msgstr "나도 만나서 반가워. 아주 좋아. 센터에 있으면서 외로웠던 참이지."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"Well, it's a lot better now that you're here.  Nice to see a familiar face."
msgstr "음, 당신이 와주셔서 훨씬 나아졌어요. 낯익은 얼굴을 보니 반갑네요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"Now that you are here, everything.  Is there anything Alonso can… *do for "
"you*?"
msgstr "네가 여기 있으니 그게 전부야. 알론소가… *당신을 위해* 할 수 있는 일이 있을까?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "You know me, I gotta be me, right?"
msgstr "당신은 나를 알고 있고, 나는 나답게 행동해야 하지 않나요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Alonso cannot help himself, in the face of someone so fine as you."
msgstr "알론소는 너처럼 멋진 사람을 눈앞에 두고 있으면 자제할 수가 없게 돼버려."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Aw man"
msgstr "아, 남자야"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Aw come on"
msgstr "아, 어서요"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
", why you gotta be like that?  I'm just tryin' to get an air of mystery "
"okay?  Nobody wants to be with a slutty guy from Brooklyn, but Alonso the "
"mysterious is another story."
msgstr ""
"왜 그래야 해? 그냥 신비로운 분위기를 만들고 싶은 거야, 알았지? 브루클린에서 온 뻔뻔한 남자와 함께 있고 싶은 사람은 아무도 없잖아."
" 하지만 알론소의 신비로운 분위기는 또 다른 이야기지."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "And how is that working out for you?"
msgstr "그리고 그것이 당신에게는 어떻게 작용하고 있나요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Better'n you'd maybe think, okay?  Can we drop it?"
msgstr "생각한 것보다 좋은 편이야, 알겠지? 이 얘긴 그만해도 될까?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Just stop talking like that around me, maybe?  It's really obnoxious."
msgstr "내 주변에서 그런 말 좀 그만하면 안 될까? 정말 불쾌하거든."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "You know what?  You do you.  It's all good."
msgstr "있잖아? 네가 원하는 대로 해. 다 괜찮아."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "I'll leave you to it then."
msgstr "그럼 당신에게 맡기겠습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Fine.  As a favor to you, I'll be a guy from Brooklyn."
msgstr "좋아요. 부탁인데, 저는 브루클린 출신이에요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"Alonso thanks you for your kindness, and will remain his glorious self."
msgstr "알론소는 당신의 친절에 감사하며, 앞으로도 훌륭한 사람이 되겠습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Thanks.  <end_talking_leave>"
msgstr "고맙습니다. <end_talking_leave>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"I'm tryin' ta forget, y'know?  Don't like thinkin' about the past.  Better "
"to plan for the future, even if the future looks grim."
msgstr "잊으려고 노력하는 거야, 알지? 과거 생각하기 싫어. 미래가 암울해 보이더라도 미래를 계획하는 게 낫잖아."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"Alonso has many a tale to tell, all slow and drawn-out like, a sensual "
"seduction of the -- how you say?  Ears.  There are dark days ahead, but "
"perhaps together we can bring a little light?  Or at least a little heat.  "
"This is a science joke I make for you.  Friction, it is the joke."
msgstr ""
"알론소는 할 이야기가 많은데, 모두 느리고 질질 끌리는, 마치 관능적인 유혹처럼... 뭐라고 할까요? 귀. 앞으로 어두운 날들이 "
"펼쳐지겠지만, 어쩌면 우리가 함께 작은 빛을 가져올 수 있을지도 몰라요. 아니, 적어도 약간의 열기라도. 이건 제가 여러분을 위해 만든 "
"과학 농담이에요. 마찰, 바로 그 농담이죠."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I fucked up and got drunk at a kiddy party I crashed, broke into a van"
" with the party clown I was seein' (hey don't judge me, it took me a long "
"time to make that happen, clowns are very givin' lovers) and I lost my "
"pants, includin' all my money and all my triple magnum condoms I stole off a"
" dead priest at a bar.  I'd be mad, but at least I'm safe, I made it here.  "
"But I got no game here y'know?  I look like the clown when I should be knee "
"deep in hotness here.  Look around, it's straight hotties!"
msgstr ""
"응, 애들 파티에서 술에 취해서 사고 쳤고, 파티 광대랑 밴에 들이받았어 (뭐, 날 탓하지 마, 이렇게 되는 데 엄청 오래 걸렸잖아, "
"광대들은 정말 베푸는 사람들이니까). 그리고 바지도 다 날렸고, 돈도 다 날렸고, 술집에서 죽은 신부한테서 훔친 트리플 매그넘 콘돔도 다"
" 날렸어. 화낼지도 모르지만, 적어도 안전하니까 여기까지 왔지. 하지만 여기선 사냥감이 없잖아? 섹시함에 푹 빠져 있어야 할 텐데 "
"광대처럼 보이잖아. 주변을 봐, 진짜 섹시해!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"Why were you looking though?  I kid, I know she is hard to miss!  In "
"English, the special package she is a woman no?  No.  I see.  And so do you "
"it seems.  Yes.  There was such a clown, a clown of enormous physical "
"beauty.  The pale, perfect skin, the ruby red lips, amazing hair, and what a"
" sense of humor.  I laugh still, though I have lost everything.  My pants, "
"my money, my many illegal imported triple magnum condoms I stole from a "
"priest.  All lost to that one beautiful night.  The candles, the balloons, "
"the singing.  It was the most romantic children's birthday party you could "
"hope to imagine.  I would do it all again, and there was so much we did.  It"
" was the end of that party, but the beginning of something beautiful, for "
"several hours in that open minivan we found.  But you do not want to hear of"
" such pleasures, I do not want to get you excited, for what can I do when I "
"look so foolish, and lack the protection needed for more serious excitement."
"  Though and you must understand, Alonso's tongue is good for more than just"
" the telling of long and saucy stories yes?"
msgstr ""
"그런데 왜 찾고 있었어? 농담이야, 알아채기 힘든 거 알아! 영어로, 특별 패키지, 그 여자 아니냐고? 아니. 알겠어. 너도 그럴 것 "
"같아. 맞아. 정말 광대 같았어. 엄청난 미모의 광대였지. 창백하고 완벽한 피부, 루비처럼 붉은 입술, 멋진 머릿카락, 그리고 유머 "
"감각까지. 모든 걸 잃었지만, 나는 여전히 웃고 있어. 내 바지, 내 돈, 신부에게서 훔친 불법 수입 트리플 매그넘 콘돔까지. 그 "
"아름다운 밤에 모든 게 다 사라졌어. 촛불, 풍선, 노래. 상상할 수 있는 가장 로맨틱한 아이들 생일 파티였어. 다시 하고 싶은데, 정말"
" 많은 걸 했어. 그 파티는 끝났지만, 아름다운 무언가의 시작이었어. 우리가 찾은 그 오픈 미니밴 안에서 몇 시간 동안. 하지만 그런 "
"쾌락에 대해 듣고 싶지 않을 거야. 널 흥분시키고 싶지도 않아. 내가 그렇게 어리석어 보이고, 더 진지한 흥분에 필요한 보호 장치도 "
"없는데 뭘 할 수 있겠어. 하지만 알론소의 혀는 길고 흥미로운 이야기를 들려주는 데에만 유용한 게 아니라는 걸 꼭 알아야 하죠?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Can I help you out?"
msgstr "도와드릴까요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"Could be better.  I don't really got any friends here in the center, but "
"seeing travelers like you always brightens my day."
msgstr "더 나아질 수 있었을 텐데. 여기 중심지에는 친구가 별로 없지만, 당신 같은 여행자들을 보면 항상 기분이 좋아져요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"Here in the center, Alonso is a bit lonely.  We get a few brave, strong "
"travelers like yourself, though, and seeing them brightens Alonso's day.  "
"Normally I am more popular, but something seems to be troubling the spirits "
"of these people during these terrible times."
msgstr ""
"여기 중앙에 있는 알론소는 좀 외로워 보입니다. 하지만 당신처럼 용감하고 강한 여행자들도 몇 명 있어서, 그들을 보면 알론소의 하루가 "
"밝아지는 것 같습니다. 평소에는 제가 더 인기가 많지만, 이 끔찍한 시기에는 뭔가가 그들의 마음을 어지럽히는 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Alonso must have his special pants"
msgstr "알론소는 특별한 바지를 가져야 합니다."

#. ~ Description of mission "Alonso must have his special pants"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"Find Alonso's leather pants in the 'toy shop' Alonso has marked on your map."
msgstr "알론소가 지도에 표시한 '장난감 가게'에서 알론소의 가죽 바지를 찾으세요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alonso must have his special pants"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "I think I might know where those special pants might be though…"
msgstr "그 특별한 바지가 어디 있는지 알 것 같아요..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alonso must have his special pants"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"This clown was into some of the different things, not the vanilla, you "
"understand me?  Yes.  I think you will find my valuables in a toy shop not "
"so far."
msgstr "이 광대는 바닐라 말고 다른 것들에 관심이 많았어. 알겠지? 응. 내 귀중품은 멀지 않은 장난감 가게에 있을 거야."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alonso must have his special pants"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"You make me so happy I could give you little kisses, and some big kisses, "
"and then something else maybe."
msgstr "당신 때문에 너무 행복해서 작은 키스를 해주고 싶고, 큰 키스를 해주고 싶고, 그다음엔 뭔가 다른 걸 해주고 싶어요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alonso must have his special pants"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"I know that you cannot resist me long.  I will wait, and perhaps some other "
"pretty thing will help me instead?"
msgstr "당신이 나를 오래 참을 수 없을 거라는 걸 알아요. 기다릴게요. 어쩌면 다른 예쁜 게 날 도와줄지도 몰라요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alonso must have his special pants"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"It may be crowded no?  A popular place before, maybe is better to visit at "
"night.  Sounds like Alonso's apartment no?"
msgstr "붐빌 수도 있겠네요. 예전에는 인기 있는 곳이었는데, 밤에 가는 게 더 좋을 것 같아요. 알론소 아파트 같은 곳인가요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alonso must have his special pants"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"Have you found what it is that you seek?  There may be something in it for "
"you no?  Something big, but we take it slow yes?"
msgstr ""
"당신이 찾는 것을 찾으셨나요? 어쩌면 당신에게 도움이 될 만한 무언가가 있을지도 몰라요. 뭔가 큰 의미가 있겠지만, 천천히 해볼까요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alonso must have his special pants"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"This is the best news since those lonely teachers asked me to be a nude "
"model at the college for the blind.  Alas, the special condoms have all been"
" used.  This is not a surprise, few could resist this seductive clown.  You "
"find a condom, I find a use for it.  Safety, she was never more important "
"than now, in *so* many ways."
msgstr ""
"외로운 선생님들이 시각 장애인 대학에서 누드 모델을 해 달라고 부탁한 이후로 정말 기쁜 소식이네요. 아, 특수 콘돔이 다 쓰였네요. 놀랄"
" 일도 아니죠. 이 매혹적인 광대를 거부할 사람은 거의 없을 테니까요. 당신이 콘돔을 찾으면, 저는 그 용도를 찾아냅니다. 안전, 그녀의"
" 안전은 지금보다 더 중요했던 적은 없었습니다. *정말* 여러모로요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alonso must have his special pants"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "You give me confidence.  I trust you.  I do not know why this is."
msgstr "당신은 제게 자신감을 줍니다. 저는 당신을 믿습니다. 왜 그런지 모르겠습니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Alonso must have his special pants"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"Disaster, but I thank you for to try.  You want a backrub some time, it will"
" happen for sure.  And maybe you give me a rub too?"
msgstr ""
"재앙이긴 하지만, 시도해 주셔서 감사합니다. 언젠가 등 마사지 받고 싶으시다면, 꼭 받으실 거예요. 그리고 저도 마사지 좀 해 "
"주시겠어요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
