msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Yo, you're crazy hot!  I'm not stupid!"
msgstr "야, 너 진짜 섹시해! 난 바보가 아니야!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Yo, you're crazy hot!  I'm not stupid!"
msgstr "야, 너 진짜 섹시해! 난 바보가 아니야!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "My jewel of the New England, I give to you my biggest prize."
msgstr "뉴잉글랜드의 나의 보석, 내 가장 큰 상을 너에게 주겠다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"\"\n"
"\n"
"Liam gives you a sly wink, heads to the door, theatrically produces a sock from - somewhere, you're not sure where - slides it on the doorknob, and leaves the room."
msgstr ""
"\"\n"
"\n"
"리엄은 당신에게 은근한 윙크를 보내고 문으로 향합니다. 그리고 어딘가에서, 어디인지는 모르겠지만, 연극적으로 양말을 꺼내 문 손잡이에 걸고 방을 나갑니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Sigh.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "한숨. <done_conversation_section>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "All done.  <end_talking_leave>"
msgstr "모두 완료되었습니다. <end_talking_leave>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Yeeeeah it's on!"
msgstr "예에에에에에에에!시작이에요!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "I give to you what of I got.  And this is Alonso so I mean it's a lot."
msgstr "내가 가진 걸 너에게 줄게. 이건 알론소니까 정말 많은 거야."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Yeah.  <end_talking_leave>"
msgstr "네. <end_talking_leave>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"\"\n"
"\n"
"After shooting Alonso a smile of genuine respect, Liam gives you a sly wink, heads to the door, theatrically produces a sock from - somewhere, you're not sure where - slides it on the doorknob, and leaves the room."
msgstr ""
"\"\n"
"\n"
"알론소에게 진심 어린 존경의 미소를 보낸 후, 리암은 장난스럽게 윙크를 보내고 문으로 향합니다. 그리고 어딘가에서, 어디인지는 알 수 없지만, 양말을 꺼내 문 손잡이에 끼우고 방을 나갑니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Sorry kid, you're younger than my little sister was.  Seems wrong."
msgstr "미안해, 꼬마야. 넌 내 여동생보다 어려. 뭔가 이상한 것 같아."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Alonso thinks maybe we should wait a few years?"
msgstr "알론소는 아마 몇 년은 기다려야 할 것 같다고 생각하는가?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid "Sigh."
msgstr "한숨을 쉬다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry.  I… saw things back there, when it all went sideways.  I can't go"
" back, not for anything."
msgstr "미안해요. 저는… 모든 게 잘못됐을 때, 그때 상황을 봤어요. 돌아갈 수 없어요. 아무것도요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
msgid ""
"Alonso, alas, is sorry, but he cannot sully his hands with blood.  It is not"
" that he does not wish to prove his strength, but he… he is not strong "
"enough."
msgstr ""
"알론소는 아쉽지만, 피를 묻혀 손을 더럽힐 수는 없습니다. 자신의 힘을 증명하고 싶지 않은 게 아니라, 그는… 그는 충분히 강하지 "
"않습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid "Thanks anyway.  <done_conversation_section>"
msgstr "어쨌든 고맙습니다. <done_conversation_section>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Well, thanks anyway."
msgstr "뭐, 어쨋든 고마워."

#. ~ Unique name of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Boris Borichenko"
msgstr "보리스 보리첸코"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Boris, I'm sorry, but I could only find two people willing to help.  Can I "
"pitch in myself?  [Spend 5 hours helping]"
msgstr "보리스, 죄송하지만 도와줄 사람을 두 명밖에 못 찾았어요. 제가 좀 도와드릴까요? [5시간 동안 도와주세요]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Boris, I'm sorry, but I could only find three people willing to help.  Can I"
" pitch in myself?  [Spend 4 hours helping]"
msgstr "보리스, 죄송하지만 도와줄 사람을 세 명밖에 못 찾았어요. 제가 좀 도와드릴까요? [4시간 동안 도와주세요]"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"I spoke with everyone I could, but only four people agreed to help.  I can "
"pitch in if you want."
msgstr ""
"제가 할 수 있는 모든 사람과 이야기를 나눴지만, 도와주겠다고 한 사람은 네 명뿐이었습니다. 원하시면 제가 도와드릴 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Is there anything I can help you out with?"
msgstr "내가 도울 수 있는 일이 있을까?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Got anything else I can help out with?"
msgstr "내가 도와줄만한 일이 있을까?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"So, have you had a chance to get that laptop working and look at it yet?"
msgstr "노트북 켜서 확인해봤어?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Now that you've got your tools and shop set up, do you think you could teach"
" me a thing or two about construction?"
msgstr "이제 도구와 작업장도 마련했으니, 건설에 관해 한두 가지 가르쳐 주실 수 있을까요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "You don't seem to be doing great."
msgstr "제대로 하는 일이 없네."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Ah, another new face.  Hello.  I am Boris."
