msgid ""
"I've seen my share of zombies, I'm one of the ones that's ready to take em "
"on.  Nothing more."
msgstr "내가 봐야 할 좀비는 충분히 봤어. 가야 한다면 놈들을 데려갈 각오도 되어있고. 그거면 충분해."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Gotta earn my keep."
msgstr "내 돈을 벌어야지."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "It's honest work, and now and then I get to take a zombie down."
msgstr "정직한 일이지. 가서 좀비나 좀 잡을 시간이군."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Talk to one of the bosses about that.  You'd have to pay me to go back there"
" though, that's gonna be a hell of a job."
msgstr "그 문제에 대해 상사 중 한 명과 상의해 봐. 하지만 다시 거기로 돌아가려면 돈을 내야 할 거야. 정말 힘든 일이 될 거야."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"I don't have a lot of free time for that sort of thing.  Maybe talk to the "
"shopkeep, they know more about scheduling and stuff."
msgstr "그런 일 할 시간 여유가 별로 없어요. 가게 주인한테 물어보는 게 좋을 것 같아요. 일정 같은 건 더 잘 아시잖아요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "Nah."
msgstr "지금."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"I'd rather stand around looking threatening than scrub gore out of the "
"tiles."
msgstr "타일에 난 찌꺼기나 닦는 것보다는 주변을 순찰하며 위험한걸 찾는게 낫겠어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Not unless you pay me.  Try the shopkeep, they can sell our services just "
"like anything else."
msgstr "내게 제몫을 치를게 아니라면, 안돼. 상점 주인에게 가봐. 다른 상품들처럼 우리 서비스도 판매하고 있거든."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Sure yeah, I remember, I was on caravan duty when I saw it, it got caught in"
" of those weird storms, as we started driving away I heard a big splash "
"sound."
msgstr ""
"물론이죠. 기억나는데, 제가 캐러밴 근무를 하던 중에 그걸 봤어요. 이상한 폭풍에 휩쓸렸고, 차를 몰고 떠나려고 하는데 큰 물보라 소리가"
" 들렸어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "No, sorry…"
msgstr "아니요, 죄송합니다..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"I didn't see it myself but I heard the rumors about it, apparently it "
"crashed somewhere nearby but I haven't seen any smoke or corpse."
msgstr "저는 직접 본 적은 없지만 소문은 들었습니다. 근처 어딘가에 추락했다고 하지만 연기나 시체는 보지 못했습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Oh the helicopter?  Yeah, I tried finding the crash site around where the "
"guy said he heard the crash but I didn't find nothing."
msgstr "아, 헬리콥터요? 네, 그 남자가 추락 소리를 들었다고 한 곳 근처에서 추락 현장을 찾아보려고 했는데 아무것도 못 찾았어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"The crashed helicopter?  Eh, I'm pretty sure it's just a story, no one ever "
"found anything."
msgstr "추락한 헬리콥터? 에, 그냥 이야기일 뿐인 것 같아. 아무도 아무것도 찾지 못했거든."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Oh, yes, what a story, I almost wish I had been there to see it, almost."
msgstr "오, 맞아요, 정말 대단한 이야기예요. 제가 거기에 가서 보고 싶었을 정도예요. 거의요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Yeah I was part of the caravan that spotted it, it was headed east then when"
" the storm broke out it got caught by some kind of creature, I heard "
"gunshots then it started flying down rapidly, I heard it crash but I'm not "
"sure where exactly."
msgstr ""
"네, 저는 그 동물을 발견한 캐러밴의 일원이었습니다. 그 동물은 동쪽으로 향하고 있었고 폭풍이 몰아쳤을 때 어떤 생물에게 갇혔어요. "
"총소리가 들렸고 그 동물은 급격하게 날아가기 시작했어요. 충돌하는 소리도 들렸지만 정확히 어디로 갔는지는 모르겠어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"Yes I was told the story by the others, I'm glad I wasn't there though, I "
"hate those storms."
msgstr "네, 다른 사람들이 그 이야기를 들려줬어요. 하지만 제가 그 자리에 없어서 다행이었어요. 저는 그런 폭풍을 싫어하거든요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid "I dunno, I wasn't there but I overheard some guy talking about it."
msgstr "글쎄요, 저는 그 자리에 없었지만 어떤 남자가 그 이야기를 하는 걸 우연히 들었어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
msgid ""
"You know how it is, people talk, I mean sure, there was one of those weird "
"storms at the time but the helicopter story?  I don't believe it."
msgstr "아시죠, 사람들이 말하죠. 물론, 당시에 이상한 폭풍이 한 번 있었지만, 헬리콥터 이야기는요? 믿을 수가 없어요."

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Appears in the refugee center as a source of information and eventually
#. missions.  Works with the free merchant caravans.
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Teamster"
msgstr "캐러밴 운전사"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"So, have your caravans seen anything interesting out there in the wasteland?"
msgstr "그럼, 여러분의 캐러밴은 황무지에서 흥미로운 것을 보았나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"Do you know anything about a trader near the New England Church Community, "
"claims to be from here?"
msgstr "뉴잉글랜드 교회 지역 근처에 있는 상인에 대해 아시나요? 그 상인은 자신이 여기 출신이라고 주장합니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "I think I've got the evidence you were looking for."
msgstr "당신이 찾고 있던 증거를 찾은 것 같아요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"I wanted to tell you about a potential new trading partner I met recently."
msgstr "저는 최근에 만난 잠재적인 새로운 거래 파트너에 대해 말씀드리고 싶었습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"Well now, a new face.  Nice ta meet ya.  I'm the one sendin' out these here "
"caravans far and wide.  What can I do ya for?"
msgstr "자, 이제 새로운 얼굴이 생겼네요. 만나서 반가워요. 여기 캐러밴을 멀리까지 보내는 건 저예요. 뭘 도와드릴까요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "I've gotta run, nice talking to you."
msgstr "나는 가야만 해. 얘기 나누는 게 좋았어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Sure, got nothin' to load up just now."
msgstr "물론, 지금은 짐을 싣을 게 없어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"No, sorry.  Nothin' much worth notin' out there these days, just the odd "
"scattered survivor and they usually don't want random visitors."
msgstr ""
"아뇨, 죄송해요. 요즘은 딱히 주목할 만한 게 없어요. 흩어진 생존자들만 있을 뿐이고, 보통은 무작위 방문객을 원하지 않거든요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"Matter of fact, yeah.  Ran into a bunch of farmers.  They don't want much to"
" do with our caravans, but someone like you they might be OK with."
msgstr "사실, 맞아. 농부들 몇 명 만났어. 우리 캐러밴에는 별로 관심 없어 하지만 너 같은 사람은 괜찮을지도 몰라."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"There's been rumors.  Folks talkin' about some kind of secret lab, out in "
"the wilds, with survivors in it.  I haven't seen it myself, mind you."
msgstr "소문이 돌았어. 사람들이 야생에 비밀 연구소가 있다고 하더라. 그 안에 생존자들이 있다고. 물론, 난 직접 본 적은 없어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"There's been rumors.  Folks talkin' about some kind of secret lab, out in "
"the wilds, with survivors in it.  I haven't seen it myself, mind you."
msgstr "소문이 돌았어. 사람들이 야생에 비밀 연구소가 있다고 하더라. 그 안에 생존자들이 있다고. 물론, 난 직접 본 적은 없어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
