msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"There's been rumors.  Folks talkin' about some kind of secret lab, out in "
"the wilds, with survivors in it.  I haven't seen it myself, mind you."
msgstr "소문이 돌았어. 사람들이 야생에 비밀 연구소가 있다고 하더라. 그 안에 생존자들이 있다고. 물론, 난 직접 본 적은 없어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"Well, a few of my caravans have come back now talkin' about this giant metal"
" castle on top of a rock, in the middle of nowhere.  They ain't been crazy "
"enough to check it out, but you could if you want."
msgstr ""
"음, 제 캐러밴 몇 대가 돌아와서, 인적이 드문 바위 꼭대기에 있는 거대한 금속 성에 대해 얘기하더군요. 걔네들은 그 성을 볼 만큼 정신"
" 나간 건 아니지만, 원하시면 가보실 수도 있어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"A few of my people have come back now talkin' about some yuppie trying to "
"start a bank that uses bullets for money.  Silly idea but the lad lives on a"
" homestead with a woman who wouldn't let my guys leave without a full belly."
msgstr ""
"내 사람들 몇 명이 돌아와서 총알로 돈 버는 은행 차리려는 여피족 얘기를 하더라. 좀 바보 같은 생각이지만, 그 친구는 우리 애들이 "
"배불리 먹지 않으면 못 나가게 하는 여자랑 같이 농장에서 산다고 하더라."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "ERROR: out of bounds on randomize_directions."
msgstr "오류: randomize_directions의 범위를 벗어났습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "How do I get to that lab?"
msgstr "그 연구실에는 어떻게 가나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "How do I get to that castle?"
msgstr "그 성까지 어떻게 갈 수 있나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Hold on, what were you saying before?"
msgstr "잠깐만요, 아까 무슨 말씀을 하셨나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "<end_talking_leave>  <end_talking_later>"
msgstr "<end_talking_leave> <end_talking_later>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"*shows you on your map where to find it.  \"That should get you there.  Good"
" luck, I 'spect you'll need it.\""
msgstr "*지도에 위치를 표시합니다. \"그걸로 갈 수 있을 거예요. 잘 가요. 아마 필요할 거예요.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"&You describe the warehouse to the best of your ability.  The teamster "
"considers for a moment"
msgstr "&당신은 최선을 다해 창고를 설명했습니다. 트럭 운전사는 잠시 생각에 잠겼습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
", looking thoughtful.  \"Hmm.  I'm not sure, but I've heard of an odd "
"building that's a bit like you're describing.\""
msgstr ""
", 생각에 잠긴 듯 말했다. \"흠. 잘 모르겠지만, 당신이 묘사한 것과 좀 비슷한 이상한 건물이 있다는 얘기를 들어본 적이 있어요.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
