msgid ""
", looking thoughtful.  \"Hmm.  I'm not sure, but I've heard of an odd "
"building that's a bit like you're describing.\""
msgstr ""
", 생각에 잠긴 듯 말했다. \"흠. 잘 모르겠지만, 당신이 묘사한 것과 좀 비슷한 이상한 건물이 있다는 얘기를 들어본 적이 있어요.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Always lookin' for new places to trade.  What you got for me?"
msgstr "항상 새로운 거래처를 찾고 있죠. 뭐 드릴까요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "[Tell them about Rubik and the Exodii.]"
msgstr "[루빅과 엑소다이에 대해 말해 보세요.]"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"Well now, that's a hell of a story.  Some day, I'll see if we can get out "
"there an' look into it.  Sounds like there'd be some real interestin' trade."
msgstr ""
"음, 정말 대단한 이야기네요. 언젠가 우리가 나가서 조사해 볼 수 있을지 알아봐야겠어요. 정말 흥미로운 거래가 될 것 같네요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
