msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'll help out.  I've pretty much been waiting for someone to ask, the "
"mess is in my way but I've been too busy to organize it myself.  Boris is "
"the one to talk to, you say?  I'll let him know."
msgstr ""
"응, 도와줄게. 누가 부탁해 주기를 거의 기다리고 있었어. 어질러진 게 너무 많아서 내가 직접 정리할 시간이 없었거든. 보리스한테 "
"얘기해야 한다고? 알려줄게."

