"wouldn't cause too much trouble for them, so I sent them over there.  What "
"about them?"
msgstr "아, 맞아. 걔네는 우리 신입 대표잖아. 걔네한테 큰 문제 될 것 없겠다고 생각해서 보냈어. 걔네는 어쩌고?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "I think they're gouging the prices for the people living there."
msgstr "그들은 거기 사는 사람들의 가격을 폭등시키고 있다고 생각해요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"Is that so?  What makes you think that?  My accounting reports have come "
"back clean, just like everybody else."
msgstr "그렇습니까? 왜 그렇게 생각하십니까? 다른 사람들처럼 제 회계 보고서도 문제없이 나왔거든요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"Everything they sell I can buy for twice as less here, even a box of "
"crackers is an arm and a leg."
msgstr "여기서는 판매하는 모든 것을 두 배 싸게 살 수 있고, 크래커 한 상자도 엄청 비쌉니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "I guess you guys are a bunch of thieves if you charge that much."
msgstr "그렇게 비싼 가격을 요구한다면 당신들은 도둑놈들이겠군요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"Tell you what, if you can find some sort of evidence that proves they're "
"shafting customers and bring it to me, I'll send someone to look in to it."
msgstr "말해두겠는데, 그들이 고객을 속였다는 증거를 찾아서 내게 가져오면, 사람을 보내서 조사하게 할게."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Alright, you have yourself a deal."
msgstr "좋아요, 거래 성사됐어요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "What sort of \"evidence\" did you have in mind?"
msgstr "당신은 어떤 종류의 \"증거\"를 염두에 두고 있었나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Why do you want me to do it?"
msgstr "왜 내가 그걸 하길 원해요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"Look, I have limited manpower these days, and not everyone can go off of a "
"strangers word with no supporting evidence."
msgstr "요즘은 인력이 부족하고, 모든 사람이 뒷받침할 증거 없이 낯선 사람의 말을 그대로 믿을 수는 없습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Makes sense, I'll find you some evidence."
msgstr "그렇군요. 증거를 찾아볼게요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Forget it, since you're not interested in taking this seriously."
msgstr "잊어버려요. 당신은 이걸 심각하게 받아들이고 싶지 않거든요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"I guess sales records could work, or stock lists of inventory that give a "
"discrepancy between what's sold and what money comes in."
msgstr "판매 기록이나 실제 판매액과 실제 수입액의 차이를 알려주는 재고 목록이 도움이 될 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "I'll get right to it, see you later."
msgstr "바로 본론으로 들어가겠습니다. 나중에 뵙겠습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Who would have these sorts of things?"
msgstr "이런 종류의 물건을 누가 가질까요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "<end_talking_later>  <end_talking_leave>"
msgstr "<end_talking_later>  <end_talking_leave>"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"Well, there's somebody else who works there, handles all of the money "
"management.  I'd look into them first, should be in the same spot the other "
"guy is."
msgstr ""
"음, 거기 돈 관리 다 하는 다른 사람이 있거든요. 그 사람 먼저 알아보는 게 좋을 것 같아요. 그 사람하고 같은 자리에 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Makes sense, I'll get right to it."
msgstr "그렇군요. 바로 본론으로 들어가겠습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "I'm not doing any of this legwork for you, figure it out on your own."
msgstr "저는 여러분을 위해 이런 모든 일을 대신 해드리지 않습니다. 여러분이 직접 알아내세요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"*looks over the papers for a moment, before pocketing them.  \"I'd say this "
"is sufficient, here's some money for your trouble.  I'll get somebody on "
"this.\""
msgstr ""
"*잠시 서류를 훑어보다가 주머니에 넣는다. \"이 정도면 됐어. 수고하신 보답으로 돈 좀 드릴게요. 누군가를 불러서 처리해 드릴게요.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"*looks over the papers for a moment, before pocketing them.  \"This seems "
"perfectly alright to me.  I don't know what you have against them, but give "
"it up and quit wasting our time.\""
msgstr ""
"*잠시 서류를 훑어보다가 주머니에 넣는다. \"괜찮은 것 같군. 무슨 이유로 그들을 원망하는지 모르겠지만, 포기하고 시간 낭비하지 "
"마.\""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Alright then, <name_b>.  I guess that's what I get for my troubles."
msgstr "좋아요, <name_b>. 제가 수고한 보답이겠네요."

#. ~ Description of mission "Check out that farm"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that farm"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"Ran into a bunch of farmers.  They don't want much to do with our caravans, "
"but someone like you they might be OK with."
msgstr "농부들 무리를 만났어요. 우리 캐러밴에는 별로 관심이 없지만, 당신 같은 사람은 괜찮을 것 같아요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that farm"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that lab"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Nice."
msgstr "멋진."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that farm"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that lab"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that scrap metal castle"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that bullet bank"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Seems reasonable."
msgstr "그럴 만한 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that farm"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that lab"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Be careful.  It's rough out there."
msgstr "조심하세요. 날씨가 험악해요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that farm"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that lab"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that scrap metal castle"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that bullet bank"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Huh, go figure."
msgstr "허, 생각해 보세요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that farm"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that lab"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "It is what it is."
msgstr "그게 다예요."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Check out that lab"
msgstr "그 연구실을 확인해 보세요"

#. ~ Description of mission "Check out that lab"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that lab"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"There's been rumors.  Folks talkin' about some kind of secret lab, out in "
"the wilds, with survivors in it."
msgstr "소문이 돌았어. 사람들이 야생에 비밀 연구소가 있고, 그 안에 생존자들이 있다는 소문이었어."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Check out that scrap metal castle"
msgstr "저 폐금속 성을 보세요"

#. ~ Description of mission "Check out that scrap metal castle"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that scrap metal castle"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"A few of my caravans have come back now talkin' about this giant metal "
"castle on top of a rock, in the middle of nowhere.  They ain't been crazy "
"enough to check it out, but you could if you want."
msgstr ""
"내 캐러밴 몇 대가 돌아와서, 인적이 드문 바위 꼭대기에 있는 거대한 금속 성에 대해 얘기하고 있더군. 걔네들은 그 성을 볼 만큼 정신 "
"나간 건 아니지만, 원한다면 가볼 수도 있어."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that scrap metal castle"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Your funeral."
msgstr "당신의 장례식."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Check out that bullet bank"
msgstr "총알 은행 확인하기"

#. ~ Description of mission "Check out that bullet bank"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that bullet bank"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid ""
"A few of my people have come back now talkin' about some yuppie trying to "
"start a bank that uses bullets for money.  Silly idea, but the lad lives on "
"a homestead with a woman who wouldn't let my guys leave without a full "
"belly."
msgstr ""
"내 사람들 몇 명이 돌아와서 총알로 돈 버는 은행 차리려는 여피족 얘기를 하더라. 좀 바보 같은 생각이지만, 그 친구는 내 친구들이 "
"배불리 먹지 않으면 못 나가게 하는 여자랑 같이 농장에서 산다고 하더라."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that bullet bank"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Hopefully they are still around."
msgstr "바라건대 그들은 아직 살아있을 겁니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that bullet bank"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_teamster.json
msgid "Don't worry about the turrets they seem friendly to people."
msgstr "포탑은 사람들에게 친절해 보이니 걱정하지 마세요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Marshal…"
msgstr "육군 원수…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "Citizen…"
msgstr "시민…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "Can I trade for supplies?"
msgstr "물자와 교환할 수 있을까?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I'm a doctor, one of the several at the outpost.  We were the lucky ones.  "
"Came here right went things started to go wrong, never left."
msgstr ""
"난 의사야, 전초기지에서 일하는 사람들 중 한 명이지. 우린 그저 운이 좋았지. 여기 와서 대제앙 시작되기 시작했어, 절대 떠나지 "
"않을거야."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
