msgstr "& 당신이 다가가자 용병은 눈에 띄게 긴장한 듯 보입니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Nothing to report, Sir!"
msgstr "보고할 것이 없습니다, 선생님!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Hey boss."
msgstr "안녕하세요, 사장님."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Great to see you back in base."
msgstr "기지에서 다시 만나서 기쁘네요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Here's hoping I get out of guard duty soon."
msgstr "곧 경비 임무에서 벗어날 수 있기를 바랍니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Got anything good?"
msgstr "뭐 좋은 거 있어?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "On an errand from the box?"
msgstr "상자에서 심부름을 하러 가시나요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Up and at them again?"
msgstr "다시 일어나서 그들을 공격할 거야?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Up for a drink when my shift ends?"
msgstr "교대근무가 끝나면 술 한잔 하실래요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid ""
"Well I can't complain much, money and free food for standing around with a gun?\n"
"\n"
"Sure looks like a steal nowadays."
msgstr ""
"뭐, 불평할 건 별로 없네. 총 들고 서 있으면 돈도 주고 공짜 음식도 준다고?\n"
"\n"
"요즘은 정말 싸게 파는 것 같네."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "If you don't have any business here, you better get going."
msgstr "여기서 할 일이 없다면 빨리 떠나는 게 낫겠다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Terminal is down there, please move along."
msgstr "터미널은 저기 아래에 있습니다. 계속 가주세요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Please head right down, scavenger."
msgstr "바로 아래로 내려가세요, 청소부."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Are you here to do anything?"
msgstr "당신은 여기서 무엇을 하려고 하시나요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid ""
"If you are looking for the Terminal, it's in the first basement, right down "
"the stairs and to the left."
msgstr "터미널을 찾는다면 지하 1층, 계단을 내려가 왼쪽에 있습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Is there any way I can join your team?"
msgstr "제가 당신의 팀에 합류할 수 있는 방법이 있나요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid ""
"Me?  Just standing around, looking scary.  Think I'm doing a good job?\n"
"\n"
"Don't answer that."
msgstr ""
"나? 그냥 서서 무섭게 굴고 있는 거. 내가 잘하고 있다고 생각해?\n"
"\n"
"대답하지 마."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Just making sure people don't ask stupid questions."
msgstr "사람들이 어리석은 질문을 하지 않도록 주의하는 것뿐입니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "I'm just on watch, move along."
msgstr "저는 그냥 지켜보고 있을 뿐이니, 가세요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Getting paid for standing around.  And you are getting in the way."
msgstr "서서 일하면서 돈 받는 거잖아. 그리고 넌 방해가 되고 있어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid ""
"A few of us joined up to make this a safe house, and it's just my turn "
"watching the gates."
msgstr "우리 중 몇몇은 이곳을 안전한 집으로 만들기 위해 힘을 합쳤고, 이제 문을 지키는 건 내 차례일 뿐이야."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid "Just go down to the Terminal if you want in."
msgstr "원하시면 터미널로 가세요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/NPC_ANCILLA_HQ_GUARD.json
msgid ""
"Well you certainly look like you could.  Try ringing the box in the bunker "
"across the street, or see if someone in the Terminal has a need for help."
msgstr ""
"음, 당신은 정말 그럴 것 같네요. 길 건너편 벙커에 있는 전화함에 전화해 보시거나, 터미널에 있는 사람 중에 도움이 필요한 사람이 "
"있는지 알아보세요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Sorry I'd rather be left alone right now."
msgstr "미안하지만 지금은 혼자 있고 싶어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
