#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid "Sorry I'd rather be left alone right now."
msgstr "미안하지만 지금은 혼자 있고 싶어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&A grim expression and deep sunken eyes imply some malady that can't be "
"simply drowned with alcohol alone.  They interrupt you just as you were "
"about to introduce yourself.  \"This anchor I'm wearing, I don't think I'll "
"be needing it any more.  I-I'm just looking for someone to rid me of it.\""
msgstr ""
"험악한 표정과 깊게 움푹 들어간 눈은 술만으로는 도저히 낫지 않는 병을 암시하는 듯했다. 막 자기소개를 하려는 순간, 그들이 말을 "
"끊었다. \"내가 차고 있는 이 닻은 더 이상 필요 없을 것 같아. 그냥 누군가 내 닻을 없애줄 사람을 찾고 있을 뿐이야.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
