#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Offer to buy the anchor for 1 HGC."
msgstr "앵커를 1 HGC에 구매하겠다고 제안합니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Well, what's that thing for anyways?"
msgstr "글쎄, 그건 대체 무슨 용도인가요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Sorry, I don't think I can help you."
msgstr "죄송하지만, 제가 도와드릴 수 없을 것 같아요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Alright, see you around then."
msgstr "그럼, 그때 봐요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"It takes only a moment to retrieve a suitable coin from your pockets, and "
"yet your interlocutor found enough time to disappear, having left a sharp "
"emptiness both in memory and the chair before you.  The anchor has been "
"neatly folded on the table."
msgstr ""
"주머니에서 적당한 동전 하나를 꺼내는 데는 잠깐밖에 걸리지 않았지만, 대화 상대는 이미 사라져 버렸고, 기억과 당신 앞 의자에는 날카로운"
" 공허함이 남았다. 닻은 테이블 위에 깔끔하게 접혀 있었다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
