#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_drugs.json
msgid "Sure, let see what you offer."
msgstr "물론입니다. 무엇을 제공하는지 살펴보겠습니다."

#. ~ Job description of "Mercenary" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_gunrunner.json
msgid "Fighting for the name of Hub 01 and money, mostly money."
msgstr "허브 01의 이름과 돈, 주로 돈을 위해 싸우고 있습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_gunrunner.json
msgid ""
"&You find the gun runner intently assessing the swirling smoke of a stale cigarette.  <mypronoun> barely acknowledges your approach.  \"Let's cut it short, I have come upon an excess supply of exotic weaponry and let's say that it would be expedient for it to disappear and you seem like just the kind of person I'm looking for.\"\n"
"\n"
"<mypronoun> hands you an inventory list, loosely annotated in a piece of graph paper.\n"
"\n"
"\"No harm in looking right?\""
msgstr ""
"& 당신은 총기 밀매업자가 퀴퀴한 담배 연기를 뚫어져라 쳐다보는 것을 봅니다. <mypronoun>은 당신의 접근을 거의 알아채지 못합니다. \"간단히 말해서, 제가 이국적인 무기를 잔뜩 가지고 있는데, 그걸 없애는 게 좋을 것 같고, 당신이 바로 제가 찾는 사람인 것 같군요.\"\n"
"\n"
"<mypronoun>은 당신에게 모눈종이에 대충 주석을 단 재고 목록을 건넵니다.\n"
"\n"
"\"잘 찾아보는 게 나쁠 건 없지?\""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_gunrunner.json
msgid "Sure, let's see what you have to offer."
msgstr "물론이죠. 무엇을 제공할 수 있는지 살펴보죠."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_hireable.json
msgid ""
"I'm just looking for my next job.  So if you can't help with that, I rather "
"we be on our own separate ways."
msgstr ""
"저는 그냥 다음 직장을 찾고 있을 뿐이에요. 그러니 당신이 그 일을 도와줄 수 없다면, 우리 각자의 길을 가는 게 나을 것 같아요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_hireable.json
msgid "Well then, what does it cost to hire you."
msgstr "그럼, 당신을 고용하는 데 드는 비용은 얼마인가요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_hireable.json
msgid "Ha I prefer the cheerful sort anyways."
msgstr "하하, 저는 어쨌든 쾌활한 쪽을 더 좋아해요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_hireable.json
msgid "Well whatever."
msgstr "뭐, 뭐든 간에요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_hireable.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The mercenary's demeanor changes completely when they realize you aren't "
"here to waste time.  \"Alright, tell you what.  Get me twelve coins and "
"that's giving my skills away, just anything to be done with that voice on a "
"box.\""
msgstr ""
"당신이 시간 낭비하러 온 게 아니라는 걸 깨닫자 용병의 태도가 완전히 달라진다. \"좋아, 말해두지. 동전 12개만 가져오면 내 기술을 "
"훔쳐가는 거야. 상자 속 목소리로 뭐든 할 수 있으니까.\""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
