#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "Oh yes.  I actually have one right here."
msgstr "네. 사실 여기 하나 있어요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "I might be."
msgstr "그럴 수도 있겠네요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "No, but I might be looking to buy some."
msgstr "아니요. 하지만 사고 싶을 수도 있어요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "No, not at all."
msgstr "아니요, 전혀 그렇지 않습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid ""
"Most I can give is two gold coins.  I've arranged a drop in the nearby "
"woods, put the goods there and you can get your cash with the barkeep here."
msgstr "제가 드릴 수 있는 건 금화 두 개뿐입니다. 근처 숲에 물건을 넣어 두었으니, 여기 바텐더한테 가서 현금을 받으세요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "It'll get done."
msgstr "그것은 이루어질 것이다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_human_sample.json
msgid "Not interested after all?"
msgstr "전혀 관심이 없나요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
