#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "How about a beer to go with our conversation?"
msgstr "대화에 맥주 한잔 어때요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's crack open a cold one and have a good chat."
msgstr "차가운 맥주 한 잔을 따서 즐거운 대화를 나눠보자."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Let's grab a beer and forget the world's gone to shit, just for a moment."
msgstr "맥주 한 잔 하면서 세상이 망가졌다는 사실을 잠시나마 잊읍시다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's share a beer and shoot the breeze, <name_g>."
msgstr "맥주 한 잔 하며 수다 떠는 건 어떨까요, <name_g>."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Nothing like a beer to go with a good conversation."
msgstr "즐거운 대화와 함께 맥주 한 잔만 한 게 없죠."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Oh definitely, how about one of those beers you got?"
msgstr "물론이죠. 당신이 가지고 있는 맥주 한 잔은 어떨까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Open a beer and let's chat like it's old times."
msgstr "맥주 한 잔을 따서 옛날 이야기처럼 이야기를 나눠보자."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Pass me one and let's talk, <name_g>."
msgstr "<name_g>, 하나만 주시면 이야기해 볼까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Pop a top and let's talk."
msgstr "상의를 벗고 이야기해 봅시다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Share a beer with me and let's talk."
msgstr "나랑 맥주 한잔 하면서 이야기하자."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"While we chat, what say you we open a beer and just… pretend the world isn't"
" ending."
msgstr "우리가 이야기를 나누는 동안, 맥주 한 잔 따서 세상이 끝나지 않는 척하는 건 어떨까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Yeah sure, want to crack open one of them beers?"
msgstr "네, 물론이죠. 맥주 한 잔 따보고 싶으신가요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_booze>"
#. ~ Used when chit-chatting while the avatar has a beer; goes before a
#. general chitchat message
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Yeah you share those beers I see you hoarding and then we chat all you like!"
"  Only joking, heh."
msgstr "네, 맥주를 나눠 마시면서 쭉 모아놓고는 마음껏 얘기하는 걸 봤어요! 농담이에요, ㅎㅎ."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Ah, summer… remember when it meant vacations?"
msgstr "아, 여름... 휴가를 의미했던 때를 기억하시나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Another sweltering summer day, ugh."
msgstr "또다시 무더운 여름날이네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Can't wait for this summer to be over."
msgstr "이번 여름이 끝나기를 고대하고 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Enjoying the summer."
msgstr "여름을 즐기세요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Feels like the summer heat never lets up."
msgstr "여름의 더위가 꺾이지 않는 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Heatwave after heatwave, this summer is brutal."
msgstr "폭염이 잇따르면서 올해 여름은 정말 혹독하네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Hotter than ever this summer, huh?"
msgstr "올 여름은 그 어느 때보다 더 더운가요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Just trying to survive this summer heat."
msgstr "이 여름 더위를 살아남으려고 노력하고 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Kinda wishing it would cool off a bit, to be honest."
msgstr "솔직히 말해서, 날씨가 조금 더 시원해졌으면 좋겠어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Nothing beats a cold drink in this summer heat."
msgstr "이런 여름 더위에는 차가운 음료보다 더 좋은 것은 없습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Not quite like the summers from before, huh?"
msgstr "예전의 여름과는 좀 다르죠?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Summer days like these make me miss the old world."
msgstr "이런 여름날이면 옛날 세상이 그리워진다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Summer evenings are the best, don't you think?"
msgstr "여름 저녁이 제일 좋지 않나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Summer nights are getting shorter."
msgstr "여름밤이 점점 짧아지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Summer's here, time for some shade."
msgstr "여름이 왔네요. 그늘이 필요한 계절이죠."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Summer's here, time for some sunburns."
msgstr "여름이 왔네요. 햇볕에 타야 할 때입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "These summer bugs are driving me nuts."
msgstr "여름철 벌레들 때문에 미칠 지경이에요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "This summer air is thick enough to cut."
msgstr "올해 여름 공기는 너무 짙어서 칼로 썰 수 없을 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "This summer sun is relentless, isn't it?"
msgstr "올해 여름의 태양은 참 강렬하죠?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_summer>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Yeah, this summer heat is hitting me hard, you know?"
msgstr "응, 이 여름 더위가 너무 심하잖아."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Another day, another frostbite risk."
msgstr "또 다른 날, 또 다른 동상의 위험이 찾아왔습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Can't wait for this winter to be over."
msgstr "이 겨울이 끝나기를 고대하고 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Cold enough to see your breath out here."
msgstr "여기는 숨결이 보일 정도로 춥습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Everything's covered in ice."
msgstr "모든 것이 얼음으로 덮여 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Frozen ground makes everything harder."
msgstr "얼어붙은 땅은 모든 것을 더 어렵게 만든다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Gotta say, I'm not minding the snow."
msgstr "솔직히 말해서, 저는 눈이 별로 신경 쓰이지 않습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I miss the cozy warmth of a fireplace in winter."
msgstr "나는 겨울에 벽난로의 따뜻함이 그리워요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "It's so cold, even the air hurts to breathe."
msgstr "너무 추워서 숨쉬는 것조차 힘들 정도예요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "It's weird the zombies don't freeze."
msgstr "좀비가 얼지 않는 게 이상하네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Not quite like the winters from before, huh?"
msgstr "예전의 겨울과는 좀 다르죠?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "OK, maybe it'll stop me from freezing in this weather."
msgstr "좋아, 어쩌면 이 날씨에 얼어죽는 걸 막을 수 있을지도 몰라."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Shivering is my new constant state."
msgstr "떨림이 나의 새로운 끊임없는 상태입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Snow everywhere, makes it hard to get around."
msgstr "곳곳에 눈이 쌓여서 이동하기가 힘듭니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "The cold is relentless this year."
msgstr "올해는 추위가 끊이지 않습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "These short days and long nights are something else."
msgstr "이런 짧은 낮과 긴 밤은 또 다른 의미입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "This winter chill cuts right through you."
msgstr "이 겨울의 추위가 당신을 꿰뚫는다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Winter nights are the longest, aren't they?"
msgstr "겨울밤은 가장 길죠?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Winter's grip is tight this year."
msgstr "올해는 겨울이 엄청 혹독해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Winter's here, better bundle up."
msgstr "겨울이 왔으니, 따뜻하게 입는 게 좋겠어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_winter>"
#. ~ A sentence regarding the season to go before a more general chitchat
#. message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Winter winds are no joke."
msgstr "겨울 바람은 농담이 아닙니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Alright, but I'm feeling a bit under the weather."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 하지만 기분이 좀 안 좋아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "A nice chat might improve my health somewhat."
msgstr "그래도 같이 있어주니깐 기운이 생기네."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Even sick, I could use some company."
msgstr "아플지라도 누군가의 도움이 필요해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Even with this bug, I'm still up for a conversation."
msgstr "이 버그가 있어도 저는 여전히 대화를 나누고 싶습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Feeling kinda rough, but a conversation sounds good."
msgstr "기분이 좀 힘들지만, 대화하는 게 좋을 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Feeling like a zombie myself, but let's have a chat."
msgstr "나 자신이 좀비인 것 같은 기분인데, 이야기를 나눠보자."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I feel like death warmed over, but a chat might help."
msgstr "죽음이 다가온 것 같지만, 대화를 나누면 도움이 될 수도 있겠네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I'm a bit nauseous, but let's chat anyway."
msgstr "좀 메스꺼워요. 하지만 그래도 이야기해 볼까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I might need to lie down soon, but let's chat first."
msgstr "곧 누워야 할지도 모르겠지만, 먼저 이야기를 나눠보죠."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I'm not feeling too well, but I can still talk for a bit."
msgstr "기분이 썩 좋지는 않지만, 아직 잠깐 얘기할 수는 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I'm under the weather, but I'm up for a talk."
msgstr "몸이 좋지 않지만, 이야기 나누고 싶어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I've been better, but I'm here to talk."
msgstr "예전보다 나아졌지만, 여기서는 이야기하고 싶어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's talk, though I feel like I might keel over."
msgstr "이야기해 보자. 하지만 쓰러질 것 같은 기분이 든다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Sick as a dog, but let's talk."
msgstr "몹시 짜증나지만, 이야기해 보자."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Sure, but I'm battling a fever right now."
msgstr "물론이죠. 하지만 지금은 열이 있어서요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Sure, just know I might need to take a break if I start coughing."
msgstr "물론입니다. 기침이 시작되면 잠시 쉬어야 할 수도 있다는 걸 알아두세요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Sure thing, but don't get too close—I might be contagious."
msgstr "물론이죠. 하지만 너무 가까이 다가가지 마세요. 전염성이 있을지도 몰라요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Talking might help distract me from feeling like crap."
msgstr "말하면 기분이 나빠지는 걸 막는 데 도움이 될 수도 있겠어."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "We can talk, even though I'm not feeling too well."
msgstr "기분이 별로 좋지는 않지만, 이야기할 수 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_prefix_infected>"
#. ~ A sentence about being sick to go before a more general chitchat message.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Well, I'm feeling pretty sick… but sure."
msgstr "음, 몸이 좀 안 좋은데… 그래도 괜찮아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
msgstr "<thoughtfulchitchat>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Alright, you got something to get off your chest?"
msgstr "좋아, 가슴 속에 묵혀뒀던 말을 꺼내고 싶은 모양이구만?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Always ready for a good chat!  But why, you OK?"
msgstr "수다 떠는건 항상 환영이지! 근데 흠, 너 괜찮아?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Any new discoveries?"
msgstr "새로운 발견이 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Anything exciting happen to you lately?"
msgstr "최근에 신나는 일이 있었나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Anything you're looking forward to?"
msgstr "뭔가 기대되는 게 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Ever feel like there's still some good out there?"
msgstr "아직도 좋은 것이 세상에 있다고 느낀 적이 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Ever feel like we're living in a bad dream?"
msgstr "마치 나쁜 꿈 속에 살고 있는 것 같은 느낌을 받은 적이 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Ever wonder how we ended up here?"
msgstr "우리가 어떻게 여기에 오게 되었는지 궁금한 적이 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Fancy a chat?  I'm all ears."
msgstr "이야기 좀 나눌래요? 저는 다 듣고 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Feeling chatty?  I'm here for it."
msgstr "수다 떨고 싶으신가요? 제가 여기 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Got any good news to share?"
msgstr "공유할 만한 좋은 소식이 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Got any good stories from the road?"
msgstr "길에서 있었던 좋은 일화는 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Heard any good rumors?"
msgstr "좋은 소문 들으셨나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Hey, <name_g>, what's been on your mind?"
msgstr "안녕, <name_g>, 무슨 생각을 하고 있었어?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "How do you stay positive?"
msgstr "어떻게 긍정적인 태도를 유지하시나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "How's your day been so far?"
msgstr "오늘 하루는 어떠셨나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I feel great today.  Not sure what it is, just one of those days."
msgstr "오늘 기분이 좋아요. 왜 그런지는 모르겠지만, 그냥 그런 날 중 하나예요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I guess I can spare a few minutes, how's things?"
msgstr "잠깐 시간 내도 될까요? 잘 지내세요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I need a break anyway, how are you?"
msgstr "어쨌든 휴식이 필요해요. 잘 지내세요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I'm OK with that, what's up?"
msgstr "괜찮아, 무슨 일이야?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I'm game.  How you holding up?"
msgstr "괜찮아요. 어떻게 지내세요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I've been thinking a lot lately.  How about you?"
msgstr "요즘 생각이 많아졌는데, 당신은 어떠세요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I've got a few minutes.  What's new with you?"
msgstr "몇 분 정도 시간이 있어요. 무슨 일 있으세요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's catch up.  What's been happening?"
msgstr "잠깐 얘기 좀 하자. 요즘 무슨 일이 있었어?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's chat about something light.  What's up?"
msgstr "가벼운 얘기 좀 하죠. 무슨 일이야?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's forget the world for a while.  How you doin'?"
msgstr "잠시 세상을 잊자. 잘 지내?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's shoot the shit!  You OK, <name_g>?"
msgstr "자, 잡담 좀 하자! 괜찮아, <name_g>?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's swap stories.  What's yours?"
msgstr "이야기를 나눠볼까요? 당신의 이야기는 어떤가요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's take a breather.  Anything interesting going on?"
msgstr "잠깐 숨 좀 돌리자. 무슨 흥미로운 일 있어?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Let's take a mental break.  Got anything fun to share?"
msgstr "잠시 휴식을 취하자. 재밌는 이야기 공유해 줄까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Life's a mess, huh?  How're you holding up?"
msgstr "인생이 엉망이죠? 어떻게 지내세요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Life's been rough.  What's keeping you going?"
msgstr "삶이 정말 힘들었어요. 무엇이 당신을 계속 나아가게 하나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "My dogs've been barkin' lately, you know?"
msgstr "요즘 우리집 개들이 짖는 소리가 심하거든요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Nice of you to make time.  How's it been for you lately?"
msgstr "시간 내주셔서 감사합니다. 요즘 어떻게 지내셨나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "OK <name_g>, how are you coping?"
msgstr "알았어요 <name_g>, 잘 지내세요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "So, how about that weather, eh?"
msgstr "그럼, 날씨는 어때요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "So, how's it going?"
msgstr "그래서, 어떻게 되가?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "So, tell me something good."
msgstr "그럼, 좋은 얘기 좀 해 주세요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Sometimes, a good talk can make a day better.  What's up?"
msgstr "가끔은 좋은 대화가 하루를 더 좋게 만들 수도 있어요. 무슨 일이야?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Sure thing <name_g>, you good?"
msgstr "그럼. <name_g>, 넌 좀 어때?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Surviving's tough, but chatting helps.  How are you?"
msgstr "살아남는 건 힘들지만, 수다를 떨면 도움이 돼요. 잘 지내시죠?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Tell me about your last adventure."
msgstr "마지막 모험에 대해 말해주세요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "What the heck.  How's life been treating you?"
msgstr "뭐야. 요즘은 어떻게 지내?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "What's a goal you're working towards?"
msgstr "당신은 어떤 목표를 향해 노력하고 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "What's been your biggest challenge recently?"
msgstr "최근에 가장 큰 어려움은 무엇이었나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "What's the latest, <name_g>?"
msgstr "<name_g>님, 최근 소식은 뭐예요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "What's the strangest thing you've encountered?"
msgstr "당신이 경험한 가장 이상한 일은 무엇이었나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "You got a story to share?"
msgstr "공유하고 싶은 이야기가 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think the military's still out there somewhere?  Holed up, planning a"
" comeback?"
msgstr "군대가 아직 어딘가에 숨어서 복귀를 계획하고 있을까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think the oceans are safe?  Or is there stuff down there now, too?"
msgstr "바다가 안전하다고 생각하세요? 아니면 지금도 바다 아래에 뭔가가 있는 건가요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think there are still radio stations out there, broadcasting to no "
"one?"
msgstr "아직도 아무에게도 방송하지 않는 라디오 방송국이 있다고 생각하시나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think there are still secret labs out there, doing god knows what?"
msgstr "아직도 비밀 연구소가 존재해서 무슨 일을 하는지 알 수 없을까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think there's a place where people have rebuilt?  Like, a hidden "
"utopia?"
msgstr "사람들이 재건한 곳이 있다고 생각해? 숨겨진 유토피아 같은 곳 말이야?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think there's any hope left?  Or are we just clinging to a lost "
"cause?"
msgstr "희망이 남아 있다고 생각하시나요? 아니면 우리는 그저 희망 없는 목표에 매달리고 있는 걸까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think there's anyone out there who knows the full story?  Someone "
"with all the answers?"
msgstr "이 사건의 전말을 아는 사람이 있다고 생각하세요? 모든 답을 알고 있는 사람이요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think we'll ever find a place where we can just… be safe?  Truly "
"safe?"
msgstr "우리가… 정말 안전할 수 있는 곳을 찾을 수 있을 것 같아? 정말 안전한 곳 말이야?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think we'll ever have a moment of peace?  Just one day where we don't"
" have to worry."
msgstr "우리에게 평화로운 순간이 과연 올까요? 걱정 없이 지낼 수 있는 단 하루라도요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Do you think we'll ever rebuild?  Like, really rebuild?"
msgstr "우리가 언젠가 재건할 수 있을 것 같아? 정말 재건할 수 있을까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think we'll ever see a world without fear again?  A place where kids "
"can play outside?"
msgstr "두려움 없는 세상, 아이들이 밖에서 뛰어놀 수 있는 세상을 다시 볼 수 있을까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think we'll ever understand the full extent of what happened?  All "
"the whys and hows?"
msgstr "무슨 일이 일어났는지, 그 모든 이유와 과정을 우리가 온전히 이해할 수 있을 거라고 생각하세요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever hear about those places that supposedly have a natural immunity to the "
"virus?  Wonder if they're real."
msgstr "바이러스에 대한 자연 면역이 있다고 하는 곳들에 대해 들어보신 적 있나요? 정말 그럴까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever think about how future generations will look at us?  If there even are "
"future generations."
msgstr "미래 세대가 우리를 어떻게 볼까 생각해 본 적 있나요? 미래 세대가 존재한다면 말이죠."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever think about how the animals are coping with all this?  Mutants are one "
"thing, but what about the regular ones?"
msgstr "동물들이 이 모든 상황에 어떻게 대처하고 있는지 생각해 본 적 있나요? 돌연변이 동물은 괜찮지만, 일반 동물들은 어떨까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever think about how weird it is that we're still here, fighting to survive?"
"  Like, why us?"
msgstr "우리가 아직 여기 살아남기 위해 싸우고 있다는 게 얼마나 이상한지 생각해 본 적 있어? 왜 우리야?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever think about what you'd do differently if you knew this was coming?"
msgstr "이런 일이 일어날 줄 알았다면 무엇을 다르게 했을지 생각해 본 적이 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever wonder if the animals have it better than us now?  Less to worry about,"
" just surviving."
msgstr "동물들이 지금 우리보다 더 잘 살고 있을지 궁금해 본 적 있나요? 걱정할 것도 덜하고, 그저 살아남는 것만이 중요하죠."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever wonder if the plants and trees know what's happening?  If they feel it "
"too?"
msgstr "식물과 나무가 무슨 일이 일어나고 있는지 알고 있을까? 그들도 느낄 수 있을까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever wonder if there are places out there that haven't been touched by all "
"this?  Little pockets of normality?"
msgstr "이 모든 것에 영향을 받지 않은 곳이 어딘가에 있을지 궁금해 본 적 있나요? 평범함이 묻어나는 작은 공간들이 있을까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever wonder if we're just in some kind of experiment?  Like, some twisted "
"lab rat scenario?"
msgstr "우리가 어떤 실험에 참여하고 있는 건 아닌지 생각해 본 적 있나요? 마치 실험실 쥐 실험처럼요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Every time I close my eyes, I can still see the riots.  Do you get that, or "
"is it just me?"
msgstr "눈을 감을 때마다 폭동이 생생하게 떠올라요. 이해하시나요, 아니면 저만 그런가요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I been thinkin' about rearranging my gear.  It's a real mess.  Don't wanna "
"go for my weapon and accidentally pull out a granola bar, right?"
msgstr "장비 정리할까 고민 중이야. 진짜 엉망진창이야. 무기 꺼내려다가 실수로 그래놀라 바 하나 꺼내는 건 싫지?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I can't help but think there's more to this than we know.  Like, some big "
"secret waiting to be uncovered."
msgstr "우리가 아는 것보다 더 많은 게 있다는 생각이 들 수밖에 없어. 마치, 밝혀지기를 기다리는 엄청난 비밀 같은 거."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I can't shake the feeling that someone's watching us.  Like, we're not alone"
" in this."
msgstr "누군가 우리를 지켜보고 있다는 느낌을 떨칠 수가 없어요. 우리만 이런 게 아니잖아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I can't stop thinking about those conspiracy theories.  Aliens, government "
"experiments gone wrong…what if some of it's true?"
msgstr "그 음모론 생각만 해도 멈출 수가 없어요. 외계인, 정부 실험 실패… 혹시라도 일부가 사실이라면?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I heard a story about a place where the dead don't rise.  Sounds too good to"
" be true, right?"
msgstr "죽은 사람이 부활하지 않는 곳에 대한 이야기를 들었어요. 너무 좋아서 믿기지 않죠?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I just can't believe it's over.  I keep running my head back to the days it "
"all fell apart.  The riots.  The lies.  The psychos.  It never really felt "
"like it was going to go like this."
msgstr ""
"정말 끝났다는 게 믿기지 않아. 모든 게 무너져 내렸던 날들이 계속 머릿속에 떠올라. 폭동들. 거짓말들. 사이코들. 이렇게 될 줄은 정말"
" 몰랐어."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I keep having dreams that zombies still remember who they were as people, "
"and are just trapped inside the bodies watching everything happen.  Haven't "
"been sleeping well."
msgstr "좀비들이 사람일 때의 모습을 기억하고, 몸 안에 갇혀서 모든 일이 벌어지는 걸 지켜보는 꿈을 계속 꿔요. 잠을 잘 못 자요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I miss the little things, like traffic jams and crowded malls.  Never "
"thought I'd say that."
msgstr "교통 체증이나 붐비는 쇼핑몰 같은 사소한 것들이 그리워요. 이런 말을 하게 될 줄은 몰랐네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I miss the simple things.  Like a hot shower.  Think we'll ever have that "
"again?"
msgstr "소소한 것들이 그리워요. 따뜻한 샤워 같은 거요. 그런 거 다시 할 수 있을까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I miss the taste of fresh food.  Think we'll ever have that again?"
msgstr "신선한 음식 맛이 그리워요. 다시는 그런 맛을 볼 수 있을까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I sometimes think about all the places I wanted to visit.  Wonder what "
"they're like now."
msgstr "가끔은 내가 가보고 싶었던 모든 곳들을 떠올려요. 지금은 어떤 모습일까 궁금하죠."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I sometimes wonder if it's better to not know the full truth about what "
"caused all this."
msgstr "저는 가끔 이 모든 일의 원인에 대한 진실을 전부 알지 못하는 게 나을지 궁금해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I used to be scared of the dark.  Now it's the least of my worries."
msgstr "예전에는 어둠이 무서웠어요. 하지만 이제는 제 걱정 중 가장 사소한 것이에요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I used to dream about adventures.  This… this isn't what I had in mind."
msgstr "난 모험을 꿈꾸곤 했어. 이건… 이건 내가 생각했던 게 아니야."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I used to think the apocalypse would be more… glamorous, you know?  Less "
"dirt, more Mad Max."
msgstr "예전에는 종말이 더… 화려할 거라고 생각했었죠. 더럽지 않고, 매드 맥스에 더 가까울 거라고요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I used to think the end of the world would bring people together.  Guess I "
"was wrong."
msgstr "난 세상의 종말이 사람들을 하나로 모을 거라고 생각했어. 내가 틀렸나 봐."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I used to think the world was big.  Now it feels so small, so fragile."
msgstr "예전에는 세상이 넓다고 생각했는데, 이제는 너무 작고 연약하게 느껴져요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wish I could go bust a cap in one of those zombies right now, without all "
"the fuss about being scared for my life."
msgstr "지금 당장 좀비들 중 하나에 올라타서 한 방 쏘고 싶은데, 그러면 내 생명이 위험하다는 소란을 피울 수 없을 테니까."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wonder if I should be getting more religious now, or less.  You know what "
"I'm sayin', <name_g>?"
msgstr "이제 더 종교적인 사람이 되어야 할지, 아니면 덜 되어야 할지 고민이에요. 무슨 말인지 알겠죠, <name_g>?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I wonder if the government's still out there, holed up in some bunker."
msgstr "정부가 아직도 벙커에 숨어 있을지 궁금하네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wonder if there are other dimensions where things didn't go to hell.  "
"Parallel worlds where everything's fine."
msgstr "모든 게 엉망이 되지 않는 다른 차원이 있을지 궁금해. 모든 게 괜찮은 평행 세계도 있고."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wonder if we'll ever see real civilization again, or if this is just the "
"new normal."
msgstr "우리가 다시는 진정한 문명을 볼 수 있을지, 아니면 이것이 그저 새로운 표준일 뿐인지 궁금하네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I've heard rumors about entire towns just vanishing overnight.  No bodies, "
"no signs of struggle.  Creepy, huh?"
msgstr "하룻밤 사이에 마을 전체가 사라졌다는 소문을 들었어요. 시체도 없고, 싸움의 흔적도 없다고요. 으스스하죠?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I've heard whispers about groups out there, still trying to control things."
"  Like some shadow government or something."
msgstr "아직도 세상을 조종하려는 집단이 있다는 소문을 들었어요. 그림자 정부 같은 거요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "People used to laugh at preppers.  Who's laughing now, huh?"
msgstr "예전에는 사람들이 준비자들을 비웃곤 했는데, 지금은 누가 웃고 있는 거지?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Remember some of the crazy news from the end of the world?  The stuff that "
"got drowned out by the riot coverage I mean.  Like, didn't the governor of "
"Rhode Island secede from the Union or something?"
msgstr ""
"세상 종말에 대한 말도 안 되는 뉴스들 기억나? 폭동 보도 때문에 묻혀버린 것들 말이야. 로드아일랜드 주지사가 연방에서 탈퇴했거나 그런 "
"거 아니었어?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Remember those stories about underground cities?  Wonder if anyone's living "
"down there now."
msgstr "지하 도시에 대한 이야기 기억나? 지금 거기 사는 사람 있을까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Remember when people thought the internet would last forever?  Feels like a "
"joke now."
msgstr "사람들이 인터넷이 영원할 거라고 생각했던 시절 기억나? 지금은 농담처럼 들리네."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Some say the world ending was nature's way of hitting the reset button.  "
"What do you think?"
msgstr "어떤 사람들은 세상의 종말이 자연이 리셋 버튼을 누르는 방식이라고 말합니다. 당신은 어떻게 생각하시나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I think about those survivalist nutjobs.  Bet they're having the "
"last laugh now."
msgstr "가끔 그 생존주의자들 생각이 난다. 아마 지금쯤이면 마지막에 웃는 건 걔네들일 거야."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if the stars look different now.  Like, did they change "
"too?"
msgstr "가끔 별들이 지금과는 달라 보이는지 궁금해요. 별들도 변했을까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if the world ended for a reason.  Like, maybe we needed a"
" reset."
msgstr "가끔 세상이 어떤 이유로 끝났는지 궁금해요. 어쩌면 우리에게 재설정이 필요했던 걸까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if this is all some sort of punishment.  But for what, "
"who knows?"
msgstr "가끔 이 모든 게 다 일종의 벌인 건가 하는 생각이 들어요. 하지만 뭘 위한 벌인지, 누가 알겠어요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if this is some kind of test.  Like, we're being judged "
"on how we handle it."
msgstr "가끔 이게 일종의 시험인가 싶을 때가 있어요. 마치 우리가 이걸 어떻게 다루는지에 따라 평가받는 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if we're just delaying the inevitable.  Like, what's the "
"point?"
msgstr "가끔은 우리가 그저 피할 수 없는 일을 미루고 있는 건 아닌지 생각해. 도대체 무슨 소용이 있니?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"There's so much we don't know about what caused this.  You think we'll ever "
"get answers?"
msgstr "이 문제의 원인에 대해 우리가 모르는 게 너무 많아요. 과연 답을 얻을 수 있을까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Think any famous people made it through all this?  Celebrities hiding out "
"somewhere?"
msgstr "이 모든 걸 견뎌낸 유명인이 있을까요? 어딘가에 숨어 있는 유명인사들이 있을까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Those mind-control drugs they put in the water to make people riot… you "
"think they're still in there?"
msgstr "사람들을 폭동을 일으키려고 물에 넣는 마인드 컨트롤 약물이 아직도 거기에 있다고 생각하세요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"What do you think happened to all the rich and powerful?  Think they had a "
"plan for this?"
msgstr "그 모든 부유하고 권력 있는 사람들에게 무슨 일이 일어났다고 생각하세요? 그들이 이런 일을 계획했을까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"What if the cause of all this is still out there, waiting to finish the job?"
msgstr "만약 이 모든 일의 원인이 아직도 존재해서 일을 끝내려고 기다리고 있다면?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"What if there are survivors out there who have no idea what happened?  "
"Completely cut off from everything."
msgstr "만약 무슨 일이 일어났는지 전혀 모르는 생존자가 있다면 어떨까요? 모든 것과 완전히 단절된 채로 말이죠."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"When do you think you realized the world was ending?  For me, it was that "
"damned YouTube video with the lady killing the baby.  Holy shit, you know?"
msgstr ""
"세상이 끝나간다는 걸 언제 깨달았다고 생각해? 난 그 여자가 아기를 죽이는 그 빌어먹을 유튜브 영상이 제일 기억에 남았어. 맙소사, "
"알지?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever feel like the whole time before <the_cataclysm> was just a dream "
"you're waking up from?"
msgstr "<the_cataclysm> 이전의 모든 시간이 깨어나는 꿈일 뿐이라고 느낀 적이 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever feel like the whole world is just… tired?  Like it's ready to give "
"up?"
msgstr "온 세상이… 지쳐버린 것 같은 기분이 든 적이 있나요? 마치 포기하고 싶은 기분이 드는 것 같나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "You ever feel like the whole world is one big haunted house now?"
msgstr "온 세상이 하나의 거대한 유령의 집인 것 같은 느낌을 받은 적이 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever hear about that weird cult that was stockpiling supplies?  Bet "
"they're feeling pretty smug now."
msgstr "물자를 비축하던 이상한 사이비 종교 집단에 대해 들어본 적 있어? 걔네 지금 꽤 의기양양해하고 있겠지."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever hear about those secret bunkers?  Bet they're laughing at us from "
"their safe havens."
msgstr "비밀 벙커에 대해 들어본 적 있어? 걔네들은 안전한 은신처에서 우리를 비웃고 있을 거야."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think about all the tech we lost?  I mean, we were so close to AI, "
"now we're just scraping by."
msgstr "우리가 잃어버린 기술들에 대해 생각해 본 적 있어? AI에 아주 가까웠던 시절이었는데, 이제는 간신히 버티고 있는 거지."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think about all the things we took for granted?  Running water, "
"electricity, safety."
msgstr "우리가 당연하게 여겼던 모든 것들을 생각해 본 적 있나요? 흐르는 물, 전기, 안전."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think there's any truth to the crap they were spouting before the "
"world ended?  Mind control drugs in the water, bio-terrorism?  Some of it "
"would make sense, but it seems so far-fetched.  Then again, we're dealing "
"with actual zombies."
msgstr ""
"세상이 멸망하기 전에 그들이 떠벌렸던 헛소리에 진실이 있다고 생각해 본 적 있어? 물에 마인드 컨트롤 약물을 넣었다든가, 바이오 테러를 "
"했다든가? 어느 정도는 말이 되긴 하지만, 너무 억지스러워. 하지만, 우리는 진짜 좀비를 상대하고 있잖아."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think we'll see the sun rise on a world that's not falling apart?"
msgstr "세상이 무너지지 않는 곳에서 해가 뜨는 것을 볼 수 있을 거라고 생각해 본 적 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever wonder if the scientists who caused this are still out there, "
"hiding somewhere?"
msgstr "이런 일을 일으킨 과학자들이 아직도 어딘가에 숨어 있을지 궁금해 본 적이 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever wonder why we even bother?  We're all just gonna be zombies "
"eventually anyway.  I mean, not that I'm gonna stop fighting, but what's the"
" damn point?"
msgstr ""
"우리가 왜 굳이 싸우는지 생각해 본 적 있어? 어차피 결국엔 우리 다 좀비가 될 거잖아. 싸움을 멈출 생각은 없지만, 도대체 무슨 "
"소용이야?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think any of those doomsday bunkers actually worked?  Might be folks "
"underground right now, clueless about what's happened."
msgstr ""
"그 종말 벙커들 중 하나라도 실제로 작동했다고 생각해? 지금 지하에 있는 사람들이 무슨 일이 일어났는지 전혀 모른 채 있을지도 몰라."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think there are any places left untouched by all this?  Like, some "
"hidden paradise?"
msgstr "이 모든 것에 영향을 받지 않은 곳이 있다고 생각하세요? 숨겨진 낙원 같은 곳?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think there are still places where people live normal lives?  Kids going"
" to school, adults going to work?"
msgstr "아직도 사람들이 평범한 삶을 사는 곳이 있다고 생각하세요? 아이들은 학교에 가고, 어른들은 직장에 가잖아요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think there's a chance this was all just one big mistake?  Some accident"
" that spiraled out of control?"
msgstr "이 모든 게 하나의 큰 실수였을 가능성이 있다고 생각하세요? 걷잡을 수 없이 커져버린 사고였을 가능성이 있다고 생각하세요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think those sci-fi movies got anything right about how this would go "
"down?"
msgstr "당신은 공상과학 영화들이 이런 일이 어떻게 전개될지에 대해 옳았다고 생각하시나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever find a cure for the zombification?  Or is this it for "
"humanity?"
msgstr "좀비화에 대한 치료법을 찾을 수 있을 거라고 생각해? 아니면 이게 인류의 마지막인가?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever find a way to make sense of all this?  Or are we just "
"stumbling in the dark?"
msgstr "이 모든 걸 이해할 방법을 찾을 수 있을 거라고 생각해? 아니면 그냥 어둠 속에서 헤매고 있는 걸까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever get to a point where we can relax again?  Not just "
"survive, but live?"
msgstr ""
"우리가 다시 편히 쉴 수 있는 지경에 이를 수 있을 거라고 생각해? 단순히 살아남는 게 아니라, 살아갈 수 있는 그런 지경에?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever hear music again?  Real music, not just the sound of "
"our own fears?"
msgstr "우리가 다시 음악을 들을 수 있을까요? 우리 자신의 두려움을 표현하는 소리가 아닌, 진짜 음악을요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<thoughtfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for NPCs having big thoughts.  Tends to be
#. more about establishing game lore.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think we'll ever laugh again?  Like, really laugh, without any fear or "
"worry?"
msgstr "우리가 다시 웃을 수 있을까요? 정말, 두려움이나 걱정 없이 웃을 수 있을까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think any of the old world leaders survived?  If they did, what would"
" they be doing now?  Hiding, trying to rebuild, or something else entirely?"
msgstr ""
"옛 세계 지도자들 중에 살아남은 사람이 있다고 생각하시나요? 만약 살아남았다면, 지금쯤 뭘 하고 있을까요? 숨어 지내거나, 재건에 "
"힘쓰거나, 아니면 완전히 다른 일을 하고 있을까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever notice how some people seem almost unaffected mentally?  Like they're "
"perfectly adjusted to this new world.  Makes you wonder if they knew more "
"than they let on before everything went to hell."
msgstr ""
"어떤 사람들은 정신적으로 거의 영향을 받지 않는 것처럼 보이는 걸 본 적 있나요? 마치 새로운 세상에 완벽하게 적응한 것처럼요. 모든 게"
" 엉망이 되기 전에 그들이 겉으로 드러낸 것보다 더 많은 걸 알고 있었던 건 아닐까 하는 생각이 들게 합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever think about how some people seem to thrive in this chaos?  It's almost "
"like they were made for it.  Makes you wonder what they were like before "
"everything went to hell."
msgstr ""
"어떤 사람들은 이 혼란 속에서도 잘 살아가는 것 같다는 생각 해 본 적 있나요? 마치 그들은 이 혼란에 맞춰 태어난 것 같아요. 모든 게"
" 엉망이 되기 전에는 어떤 사람들이었을지 궁금해지네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Have you noticed how some zombies seem to be smarter than others?  It's like"
" there's a hierarchy among them, but that shouldn't be possible, right?"
msgstr ""
"어떤 좀비들은 다른 좀비들보다 더 똑똑해 보이는 걸 눈치채셨나요? 마치 그들 사이에 서열이 있는 것 같지만, 그럴 리가 없잖아요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Have you noticed injuries aren't healing the same as usual?  I started "
"spotting it before the world ended, but it's become more pronounced.  "
"There's hardly even a granulation step after a cut closes."
msgstr ""
"상처가 평소처럼 잘 아물지 않는 걸 느껴보셨나요? 세상이 끝나기 전부터 눈에 띄기 시작했는데, 요즘은 더 심해졌어요. 상처가 아문 후 "
"육아조직이 거의 없어지거든요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I can't shake the feeling that this was all planned.  Not the outbreak "
"itself, but the way it spread so quickly and efficiently."
msgstr "이 모든 게 계획된 일이라는 느낌을 떨칠 수가 없어요. 발병 자체가 아니라, 그토록 빠르고 효율적으로 확산된 방식이요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I can't stop wondering who fucked up to make all this happen.  Obviously we "
"can't trust the news, they claimed the zombies were 'rioters' for weeks.  "
"Why?  Where did this come from?"
msgstr ""
"도대체 누가 이 모든 일을 일으켰는지 궁금해서 견딜 수가 없어요. 뉴스를 믿을 수 없는 건 당연하죠. 좀비들이 몇 주 동안 '폭도'라고 "
"주장했잖아요. 왜죠? 어디서 나온 말인가요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I keep seeing these weird symbols in old buildings.  They look ancient, but "
"they're in places they shouldn't be.  Makes you wonder if someone was "
"preparing for this long before it happened."
msgstr ""
"오래된 건물에서 이상한 상징물들을 계속 봐요. 아주 오래돼 보이는데, 원래 있어야 할 곳에 있더라고요. 이런 일이 일어나기 훨씬 전부터 "
"누군가 이런 일을 대비하고 있었던 게 아닐까 하는 생각이 들 정도예요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I keep thinking about how fast society collapsed.  It was almost as if "
"something was waiting for the perfect moment to strike."
msgstr "사회가 얼마나 빨리 붕괴되었는지 계속 생각하게 됩니다. 마치 무언가가 완벽한 순간을 기다리고 있는 것 같았습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I read somewhere that human behavior changes in the presence of certain "
"frequencies.  What if someone was broadcasting those right before the "
"Cataclysm?"
msgstr ""
"어딘가에서 특정 주파수에 노출되면 인간의 행동이 변한다는 글을 읽었는데, 대격변 직전에 누군가 그 주파수를 방송했다면 어땠을까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I still don't understand how these zombies are powered.  They're like "
"perpetual motion machines."
msgstr "아직도 이 좀비들이 어떻게 작동하는지 모르겠어요. 마치 영구 운동 기계 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I used to think the world was big and complicated.  Now it feels like all "
"the complexity was just a facade, and the real rules of the game were hidden"
" from us."
msgstr ""
"예전에는 세상이 크고 복잡하다고 생각했어요. 하지만 이제는 그 모든 복잡함이 그저 겉모습일 뿐이고, 게임의 진짜 규칙은 우리에게서 가려져"
" 있는 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I've been thinking about the old myths and legends.  Zombies, monsters, the "
"end of the world… what if those stories were based on something real, "
"something that happened before?"
msgstr ""
"오래된 신화와 전설에 대해 생각해 봤어요. 좀비, 괴물, 세상의 종말... 만약 그 이야기들이 실제로 있었던 일, 예전에 일어났던 일을 "
"바탕으로 한 거라면 어떨까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I've been thinking about those old sci-fi movies where they talked about "
"alternate dimensions and parallel universes.  Maybe what happened here is "
"connected to something like that."
msgstr ""
"대체 차원과 평행 우주를 이야기하는 옛날 SF 영화들을 떠올려 봤어요. 어쩌면 여기서 일어난 일도 그런 것과 관련이 있을지도 몰라요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I've noticed the stars look different lately.  Maybe it's just me, but I "
"swear there are constellations I've never seen before."
msgstr "요즘 별들이 좀 달라 보이네요. 저만 그럴지 모르겠지만, 전에 본 적 없는 별자리들이 있는 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"If what they told us about the Chinese was even partly true, do you think "
"it's like this in China?  Or maybe the US is some kind of quarantine zone, "
"and at least some of the world is still out there."
msgstr ""
"만약 그들이 중국에 대해 우리에게 한 말이 조금이라도 사실이라면, 중국에서도 이런 일이 벌어지고 있다고 생각하시나요? 아니면 미국이 "
"일종의 격리 구역이고, 적어도 세계의 일부는 아직 그곳에 있는 걸까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Is it just me, or does it feel like we're being watched sometimes?  Not just"
" by other survivors, but something else, something more… omnipresent."
msgstr ""
"저만 그런 건가요, 아니면 가끔 누군가 우리를 지켜보고 있는 것 같은 느낌이 드는 건가요? 다른 생존자들뿐만 아니라, 뭔가 다른 것, "
"그보다 더… 어디에나 존재하는 무언가가 우리를 지켜보고 있는 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"So many parts of this still don't fit together.  Who created the zombies?  "
"What powers them?  Maybe the rumors of mind control drugs were true all "
"along, and someone found a way to bioengineer living dead."
msgstr ""
"아직도 많은 부분이 서로 맞지 않습니다. 누가 좀비를 만들었을까요? 무엇이 좀비의 힘을 뿜어내는 걸까요? 어쩌면 마인드 컨트롤 약물에 "
"대한 소문이 처음부터 사실이었고, 누군가 살아있는 시체를 생체공학적으로 만드는 방법을 찾아냈을지도 모릅니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if we're not alone in this.  Not just other survivors, "
"but something bigger, observing us, maybe even experimenting."
msgstr ""
"가끔은 우리만 이런 상황에 처해 있는 게 아닐까 하는 생각이 든다. 다른 생존자들뿐만 아니라, 더 큰 무언가가 우리를 지켜보고, 어쩌면 "
"실험까지 하고 있을지도 모른다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"The idea that this is all some kind of massive reset, a way for the Earth to"
" cleanse itself of us, keeps nagging at me.  What if it's true?"
msgstr ""
"이 모든 게 일종의 대대적인 재설정, 지구가 우리를 스스로 정화하는 과정이라는 생각이 자꾸만 머릿속을 맴돈다. 만약 이게 사실이라면?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"The more I see of this new world, the more I think we're missing some big "
"piece of the puzzle.  There's something out there we haven't figured out "
"yet."
msgstr ""
"이 새로운 세상을 더 많이 볼수록, 우리는 퍼즐의 큰 조각 하나를 놓치고 있다는 생각이 듭니다. 우리가 아직 알아내지 못한 무언가가 저 "
"밖에 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"The way plants have started growing in some areas, almost aggressively… it's"
" like nature is trying to take back control in a hurry."
msgstr "어떤 지역에서는 식물이 거의 공격적으로 자라기 시작한 것을 보면 자연이 서둘러 통제권을 되찾으려는 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"There's got to be more to the story about those 'safe zones' the government "
"talked about.  Why did they stop broadcasting?  What happened to them?"
msgstr "정부가 언급한 '안전지대'에 대해서는 더 많은 이야기가 있을 겁니다. 왜 방송을 중단했을까요? 무슨 일이 일어났을까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"There's something off about the way animals are mutating.  It's like they're"
" evolving at an accelerated pace, but not randomly.  There seems to be some "
"kind of pattern."
msgstr ""
"동물들이 돌연변이를 일으키는 방식에 뭔가 이상한 게 있어요. 마치 무작위로 진화하는 게 아니라 가속된 속도로 진화하는 것 같아요. 어떤 "
"패턴이 있는 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"What if the government knew this was coming and just didn't tell us?  Maybe "
"they thought they could control it and failed."
msgstr ""
"정부가 이런 일이 일어날 걸 알고도 우리에게 알려주지 않았다면 어땠을까요? 어쩌면 정부는 통제할 수 있다고 생각했지만 실패했을지도 "
"모릅니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever wonder if there's a cure out there, somewhere?  Not just for the "
"zombies, but for everything that's happened to the world."
msgstr ""
"혹시 어딘가에 치료법이 있을지 궁금해 본 적 있나요? 좀비뿐만 아니라, 세상에서 일어난 모든 일들을 치료할 수 있는 방법이요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever wonder why some people went feral and others didn't?  There has to "
"be more to it than just stress and fear."
msgstr ""
"왜 어떤 사람들은 야생으로 돌아갔고 어떤 사람들은 그렇지 않았는지 생각해 본 적 있나요? 스트레스와 두려움 이상의 이유가 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think all those conspiracy theorists were onto something?  The ones "
"talking about secret experiments and shadow governments?  It's starting to "
"look less crazy now."
msgstr ""
"그 모든 음모론자들이 뭔가를 알고 있다고 생각하세요? 비밀 실험과 그림자 정부에 대해 이야기하는 사람들 말이에요. 이제 좀 덜 이상해 "
"보이네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insightfulchitchat>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for intelligent or perceptive NPCs'
#. perspective on the world
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think the Earth itself is reacting to all this?  Like, on a geological "
"level?  Earthquakes, weather patterns, everything seems more intense."
msgstr "지구 자체가 이 모든 것에 반응한다고 생각하세요? 지질학적으로요? 지진, 기상 패턴 등 모든 게 더 격렬해 보이는데요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "<neutralchitchat>"
msgstr "<neutralchitchat>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think any of those doomsday preppers made it?  Bet they're feeling "
"pretty smug right about now."
msgstr "그 종말론자들 중에 살아남은 사람 있을 것 같아? 지금쯤 꽤 뿌듯해하고 있겠지."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think it's weird how we'll, like, open a locked building and find a "
"lone zombie inside?  How'd it even get there?"
msgstr "잠긴 건물을 열었는데 그 안에 좀비 한 마리가 혼자 있는 게 이상하다고 생각해? 어떻게 거기까지 온 거지?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think there are still places untouched by all this?  Like some remote"
" island or hidden valley where people are just living normal lives?"
msgstr ""
"아직도 이런 일이 일어나지 않은 곳이 있다고 생각하시나요? 사람들이 평범한 삶을 살고 있는 외딴 섬이나 숨겨진 계곡 같은 곳 말이죠?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Do you think we'll ever get back to a point where we can have holidays "
"again?  Celebrating seems like a distant dream."
msgstr "우리가 다시 휴일을 보낼 수 있는 날이 올까요? 축하하는 건 먼 꿈처럼 느껴져요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever think about how lucky we are to have found each other?  In a world this"
" messed up, having friends is everything."
msgstr "우리가 서로를 만난 게 얼마나 행운인지 생각해 본 적 있어? 이렇게 어지러운 세상에서 친구가 있다는 건 정말 소중한 거야."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Ever think about how quiet it is now?  No cars, no planes, just the wind and"
" the groans of the dead."
msgstr "지금 얼마나 조용한지 생각해 본 적 있나요? 차도, 비행기도 없이 바람 소리와 죽은 자들의 신음 소리만 들릴 뿐이죠."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"How do these zombies even keep going?  What are they eating?  Do you think "
"they'll ever rot away?"
msgstr "이 좀비들은 어떻게 살아갈까? 뭘 먹고 사는 거지? 썩어서 없어질 거라고 생각해?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I been thinkin', one of these days, we're gonna run out of toilet paper.  "
"What then?"
msgstr "생각해 봤는데, 언젠가는 화장지가 다 떨어질 거야. 그러면 어떻게 해야 할까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I miss fresh fruit.  There's something about biting into a juicy apple that "
"canned stuff just can't replicate."
msgstr "신선한 과일이 그리워요. 통조림 과일로는 따라 할 수 없는 즙이 많은 사과를 한 입 베어 물면 뭔가 특별한 게 있거든요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I miss music.  Remember concerts?  The energy of the crowd, the live sound."
"  Wonder if any musicians survived."
msgstr "음악이 그리워요. 콘서트 기억나세요? 관중의 에너지, 라이브 사운드. 살아남은 뮤지션이 있을지 궁금하네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I miss the little things.  Like the smell of fresh bread, or the sound of a "
"coffee machine in the morning."
msgstr "작은 것들이 그리워요. 갓 구운 빵 냄새나 아침에 커피 머신 돌아가는 소리 같은 거요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I never thought I'd miss doing laundry.  Wearing the same clothes day after "
"day gets old fast."
msgstr "빨래가 그리울 줄은 생각도 못 했어요. 매일 똑같은 옷을 입으면 금방 싫증나거든요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I used to complain about going to work.  Now I'd give anything for a boring "
"day at the office."
msgstr "예전에는 출근하는 게 너무 짜증 났었는데, 이제는 사무실에서 지루한 하루를 보낼 수만 있다면 뭐든 할 수 있을 것 같아."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I used to hate bugs, but now I see them as a sign of life.  Weird how "
"perspective changes."
msgstr "예전에는 벌레를 싫어했는데, 이제는 생명의 신호로 여기게 됐네요. 관점이 이렇게 바뀌는 게 신기하네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I was never much of a cook before, but now I can make a mean stew out of "
"almost anything.  Survival skills, I guess."
msgstr "전에는 요리를 별로 못 했는데, 이제는 거의 모든 재료로 맛있는 스튜를 만들 수 있어요. 생존 기술 덕분인 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wonder if anyone's tried to start a farm again.  Gotta be tough with all "
"the zombies, but food doesn't grow on trees."
msgstr "다시 농장을 시작해 본 사람 있을까? 좀비들 때문에 힘들겠지만, 나무에서 음식이 자라는 건 아니잖아."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wonder if kids born after all this will even understand what the world "
"used to be like.  Seems like a fairytale now."
msgstr ""
"이 모든 일이 있은 후에 태어난 아이들이 과연 세상이 옛날 어땠는지 이해할 수 있을지 궁금하네요. 지금은 동화 같은 이야기 같네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"I wonder if the power will ever come back on.  Can't imagine how much stuff "
"we took for granted before all this."
msgstr "전기가 다시 들어올지 궁금하네. 이 모든 일이 있기 전에는 우리가 얼마나 많은 것을 당연하게 여겼을지 상상도 안 가네."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's funny, I never appreciated the sunrise as much as I do now.  Every day "
"we're still here feels like a gift."
msgstr "웃긴 건, 난 지금처럼 일출을 좋아해 본 적이 없다는 거야. 우리가 여기 있는 매일매일이 선물처럼 느껴진다는 거야."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's funny, I used to hate the rain.  Now it's like a blessing, makes "
"everything feel a bit cleaner."
msgstr "웃기네요. 예전에는 비가 싫어했었는데, 이제는 축복 같아요. 모든 게 좀 더 깨끗해진 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's strange how some buildings are completely untouched, like time just "
"stopped in them.  Then you go next door, and it's a total wreck."
msgstr "어떤 건물들은 시간이 멈춘 듯 전혀 손대지 않은 모습이 참 이상해요. 그런데 옆집에 가면 완전히 폐허가 되어 있거든요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's strange how the stars seem brighter now without all the city lights.  "
"Almost beautiful, if it weren't so damn scary."
msgstr "도시의 불빛이 사라지니 별이 더 밝게 보이는 게 이상하네요. 무섭지만 않으면 아름답다고 할 수 있을 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"It's weird to think about all the things we used to stress over.  Traffic, "
"bills, deadlines.  None of that seems to matter now."
msgstr ""
"예전에는 스트레스 받던 모든 것들을 생각하면 이상하네요. 교통 체증, 청구서, 마감일. 지금은 그런 것들이 하나도 중요하지 않은 것 "
"같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder if we're all psychos, not just the ones that went crazy "
"and rioted.  I never would have thought I could do the things I've done "
"since the world ended."
msgstr ""
"가끔은 우리 모두가 사이코패스인 게 아닐까 하는 생각이 들어요. 미쳐서 폭동을 일으킨 사람들만 사이코패스가 되는 게 아니라고요. 세상이 "
"끝난 이후로 제가 해 온 일들을 제가 할 수 있을 거라고는 생각도 못 했어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes I wonder what the future will look like.  Will we rebuild, or is "
"this just how it is now?"
msgstr "가끔 미래가 어떻게 될지 궁금해요. 우리는 다시 일어설까요, 아니면 지금 이대로일까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"Think we'll ever figure out what really caused all this?  Sometimes I feel "
"like knowing would just make it worse."
msgstr "이 모든 일의 진짜 원인이 뭔지 알아낼 수 있을까요? 가끔은 아는 게 오히려 상황을 더 악화시킬 것 같은 생각이 들어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think about all the pets that were left behind?  Poor things didn't"
" ask for this any more than we did."
msgstr "남겨진 반려동물들 생각나세요? 불쌍한 녀석들도 우리 못지않게 이런 걸 바라지 않았잖아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think about space?  I mean, what's happening up there?  Are "
"astronauts just floating around, not knowing what happened down here?"
msgstr ""
"우주에 대해 생각해 본 적 있어? 그 위에서 무슨 일이 벌어지고 있는 거지? 우주인들은 그냥 떠다니면서 여기 아래에서 무슨 일이 "
"일어나는지 모르는 걸까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You ever think about what the first thing you'll do if things ever get back "
"to normal?  I think I'd just sit in a park and watch the world go by."
msgstr "상황이 정상으로 돌아온다면 제일 먼저 뭘 할지 생각해 본 적 있어? 그냥 공원에 앉아서 세상이 지나가는 걸 구경할 것 같아."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You know what I miss?  Movie theaters.  You think Hollywood survived this?  "
"Maybe there's a bunch of zombie actors out there, filmin' shit out of "
"reflex.  Hah, I'd watch that shit."
msgstr ""
"내가 뭔데 그리운지 알아? 영화관. 헐리우드가 이걸 견뎌냈을 거라고 생각해? 어쩌면 좀비 배우들이 반사적으로 그런 거 찍는 거 많을지도 "
"몰라. 하, 나도 그거 볼 거야."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "You read any good books lately?  I'm glad we still got books."
msgstr "요즘 좋은 책 읽었어요? 책이 아직 남아 있어서 다행이에요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<neutralchitchat_later>"
#. ~ General chit chat messages for further past the apocalypse
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid ""
"You think animals sense the zombies differently than we do?  They always "
"seem to know when something's off."
msgstr "동물들이 좀비를 우리와 다르게 감지한다고 생각하세요? 뭔가 이상하면 항상 알아채는 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Could be.  What do you think?"
msgstr "그럴 수도 있겠네요. 어떻게 생각하세요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Ever considered…?"
msgstr "생각해 본 적 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Good observation."
msgstr "좋은 관찰력이에요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "Got any more thoughts on that?"
msgstr "이에 대해 더 생각나는 게 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
msgid "I can relate to that."
msgstr "저도 공감해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<chitchat_player_responses>"
#. ~ General chit chat responses from the player
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_chat.json
