#. ~ NPC complaint that they are wounded but have medical equipment and are
#. stopping to heal themselves.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_combat.json
msgid ""
"Got to admit, stitching myself up gets easier every time.  Survival skills, "
