#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid ""
"Did we have a party last night and eat everything?  The larder's empty."
msgstr "어젯밤에 파티를 해서 다 먹었어? 식료품 저장실이 텅 비어 있어."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Empty larder, empty stomach.  Story of my life."
msgstr "텅 빈 식료품 저장실, 텅 빈 배. 내 인생 이야기."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Hey <name_g>, we're out of food."
msgstr "안녕하세요, <name_g>. 음식이 다 떨어졌어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Hey, the larder is empty!  We're going to starve."
msgstr "으악, 식료품 저장고가 텅 비었어! 굶게 생겠는걸."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I could swear there was food in here yesterday."
msgstr "어제는 여기에 음식이 있었던 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I don't suppose the larder will magically fill itself."
msgstr "식료품 저장실이 마법처럼 저절로 채워질 거라고는 생각하지 않아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I was hoping for a snack, but it looks like we're fresh out."
msgstr "간식을 기대했는데, 이미 다 떨어진 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid ""
"I'm starting to feel like a scavenger rather than a survivor with this empty"
" larder."
msgstr "이 텅 빈 식료품 저장실 때문에 나는 생존자라기보다는 청소부 같은 기분이 들기 시작했습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "It's a sad day when the larder's emptier than the wasteland outside."
msgstr "밖의 황무지보다 식료품 저장실이 더 텅 비어 있는 날은 슬픈 날이다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "It's official: we've reached peak emptiness in the larder."
msgstr "공식적으로는 식료품 저장실이 비어 있는 최대치에 도달했습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Larder is a little bare.  Really bare in fact."
msgstr "식료품 저장실이 좀 텅 비어 있어요. 사실 정말 텅 비어 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Larder is empty, completely cleared out."
msgstr "식료품 저장실은 비어 있고, 완전히 치워졌습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Looks like we forgot to restock the larder."
msgstr "식료품 저장실에 다시 채워 넣는 걸 깜빡한 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Looks like we're resorting to the 'starving survivor' diet again."
msgstr "우리는 다시 '굶어죽는 생존자' 다이어트에 의존하게 된 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid ""
"Next time someone finds food, let's put it in the larder instead of eating "
"it all."
msgstr "다음에 누군가 음식을 발견하면 다 먹어치우는 대신 식료품 저장실에 넣어두는 게 어떨까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Not even a crumb left.  Looks like we're foraging tonight."
msgstr "부스러기 하나 남지 않았네요. 오늘 밤에는 뭔가를 찾아야 할 것 같네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Note to self: raid the next grocery store we find.  Larder's bare."
msgstr "나 자신에게 메모: 다음에 발견하는 식료품점을 털자. 식료품 저장실이 텅 비어 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Seems like the larder fairy forgot to visit us last night."
msgstr "식료품 저장실 요정이 어젯밤에 우리를 찾아오는 걸 깜빡 잊은 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Someone's been raiding the larder, and it wasn't me."
msgstr "누군가 식료품 저장실을 털었는데, 그건 나가 아니었어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "There's no food in the larder!"
msgstr "식료품 저장실에 음식이 없어요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "This is why we can't have nice things, like a fully stocked larder."
msgstr "이것이 우리가 가득 채워진 식료품 저장실과 같은 좋은 것을 가질 수 없는 이유입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Uh-oh, the larder's as empty as my stomach."
msgstr "아, 식료품 저장실이 내 배처럼 비어 있네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid ""
"Uhm, <name_g>, I don't mean to criticize, but we should focus on "
"distributing some food into the basecamp larder."
msgstr ""
"음, <name_g>, 비난하려는 건 아니지만, 우리는 기지 캠프 식료품 저장고에 음식을 분배하는 데 집중해야 할 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "We need more food in the basecamp larder; it's empty."
msgstr "베이스캠프 식료품 저장실에 더 많은 음식이 필요합니다. 비어 있거든요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "We're going to need to hunt or scavenge for some grub."
msgstr "우리는 뭔가 먹을 것을 찾기 위해 사냥이나 수색을 해야 할 겁니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "We're outta grub, <name_g>."
msgstr "이제 먹을 게 없어, <name_g>."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "We're running on empty, both the larder and my stomach."
msgstr "식료품 저장실도, 내 배도 모두 비어가고 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Well, this is just great.  No food again."
msgstr "아, 정말 좋네요. 또 먹을 거 없어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<camp_larder_empty>"
#. ~ NPCs say this after trying to eat from a basecamp larder with no food.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid ""
"Who forgot to refill the larder?  We're going to have some hungry campers."
msgstr "누가 식료품 저장실 채우는 거 깜빡했나? 캠핑객들이 배고파할 것 같아."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "*yawn*"
msgstr "*따분한 사람*"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Can we rest for a while, <name_g>?"
msgstr "좀 쉴 수 있을까 <name_g>?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Can't remember the last time I had a proper kip."
msgstr "마지막으로 제대로 된 잠을 잔 게 언제인지 기억 나지 않아."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Did you know that lack of rest kills faster than lack of food?"
msgstr "수면 부족이 배고파서 죽는 것보다 빠르다는 거 알아?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Even a quick nap would be a blessing."
msgstr "잠깐 낮잠을 자는 것도 축복이 될 것입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Everything aches, I need to lie down."
msgstr "온몸이 아파요, 누워야겠어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Everything's a blur, I need sleep."
msgstr "모든 게 흐릿해요. 잠이 필요해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I awfully need to rest."
msgstr "나는 꼭 쉬어야 한다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I can barely focus, need rest."
msgstr "집중하기가 힘들어요, 휴식이 필요해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I can barely keep my eyes open."
msgstr "눈을 뜰 수가 없어."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I can't even think straight, need sleep."
msgstr "제대로 생각할 수도 없고, 잠이 필요해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I can't go on without some shut-eye."
msgstr "잠을 자지 않고는 살아갈 수 없어."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I can't keep going for long <name_g>.  I need some rest, bad."
msgstr "너무 오래 돌아다녔어, <name_g>. 좀 자야한다고."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I could sleep on a bed of nails right now."
msgstr "지금 당장 못박힌 침대에서 잠을 잘 수도 있을 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I could sleep standing up right now."
msgstr "지금 당장이라도 서서 잠들 수 있을 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I could use a siesta."
msgstr "낮잠이 필요해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I feel like a zombie, but worse."
msgstr "나는 좀비가 된 것 같은 기분이지만, 그보다 더 심하다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I just… gotta close my eyes for a bit, okay?"
msgstr "나… 잠깐 눈 좀 붙여야겠어, 괜찮지?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I might fall asleep while walking."
msgstr "걷다가 잠들 수도 있겠네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I need to hit the hay, pronto."
msgstr "나는 빨리 잠자리에 들어야겠다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I'll just go to sleep, okay?"
msgstr "그냥 자러 갈게요, 알았죠?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I'm fucking tired."
msgstr "난 진짜 피곤해."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I'm about to kick the bucket if we don't stop for a moment."
msgstr "우리가 잠시도 멈추지 않는다면 나는 죽을 것이다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I'm about to pass out on my feet."
msgstr "나는 발로 서서 기절할 것 같다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I'm at my limit, need to rest."
msgstr "나는 한계에 도달했어요. 휴식이 필요해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I'm really tired."
msgstr "정말 피곤해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I'm running on fumes here."
msgstr "여기 너무 지쳐요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "I'm tired…"
msgstr "피곤해…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "If I don't lie down soon, I'm gonna collapse."
msgstr "내가 곧 눕지 않으면 쓰러질 거야."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "If I don't rest soon, I'll be a goner."
msgstr "곧 쉬지 않으면 나는 망할 거야."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "If we don't stop soon, I'm done for."
msgstr "우리가 곧 멈추지 않으면, 나는 끝장이다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Imagine, being able to sleep peacefully."
msgstr "평화롭게 잠을 잘 수 있다고 상상해보세요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "It's like I'm moving through molasses, I need sleep."
msgstr "마치 당밀 속을 움직이는 것 같아요. 잠이 필요해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "Just a few minutes of rest, please."
msgstr "몇 분만 쉬세요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "My eyes are dropping, I need to rest."
msgstr "눈이 침침해지네요. 좀 쉬어야겠어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "My head feels like it's filled with cotton."
msgstr "내 머리는 마치 솜으로 가득 찬 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "My legs feel like lead, need to rest."
msgstr "다리가 납처럼 무거워요. 좀 쉬어야겠어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "My whole body is screaming for rest."
msgstr "온몸이 휴식을 갈망하고 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "What I wouldn't give for some rest."
msgstr "나는 휴식을 취할 수 있다면 무엇이든 할 수 있을 것 같다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
#. ~ Complaint when the NPC wants to sleep but overrides or rules prevent them
#. from sleeping.
#: data/json/npcs/snippets/talk_tags_follower.json
msgid "What time is it?"
msgstr "지금 몇 시지?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<yawn>"
