#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Flavor
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "Crop Overseer"
msgstr "작물 감독관"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I hope you are here to do business."
msgstr "비즈니스 이야기를 하러 온 거면 좋겠는데."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I figured you might be looking for some help…"
msgstr "아무래도 일손이 필요해 보이는데?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'm interested in investing in agriculture…"
msgstr "농업에 투자하는데 흥미가 좀 있는데…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'd like to discuss my field…"
msgstr "저는 제 전문 분야에 관해 이야기하고 싶습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/mods/No_Hope/NPC/NPC_Old_Guard_Captain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/npcs/prepnet_dialogue.json
msgid "What do you need done?"
msgstr "뭐 해야할 거라도 있나?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"My job is to manage our outpost's agricultural production.  I'm constantly "
"searching for trade partners and investors to increase our capacity.  If you"
" are interested, I typically have tasks that I need assistance with."
msgstr ""
"제 업무는 전초 기지의 농업 생산을 관리하는 것입니다. 생산 능력을 늘리기 위해 끊임없이 무역 파트너와 투자자를 찾고 있습니다. 관심이 "
"있으시면, 제가 주로 도움이 필요한 업무를 도와드릴 수 있습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "Back to check on your field?  What can I help you with?"
msgstr "밭을 점검하러 돌아가시나요? 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"There's a field on the other side of the house that isn't being used for "
"anything right now.  We're willing to let you purchase it for your own "
"agricultural enterprises if you're interested."
msgstr "집 맞은편에 지금은 아무 용도로도 사용하지 않는 밭이 있습니다. 관심 있으시면 농업 사업용으로 매입해 드리겠습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "Tell me more about this field."
msgstr "이 분야에 대해 더 자세히 알려주세요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "Can you build a fence around my field?"
msgstr "내 밭 주위에 울타리를 세워줄 수 있나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'm looking to expand my field…"
msgstr "저는 제 분야를 확장하고 싶습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'd like to plant some seeds…"
msgstr "나는 씨앗을 심고 싶습니다..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'd like to harvest some plants…"
msgstr "식물을 수확하고 싶습니다..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"We'll help plow the land and put up a sign to let everybody know it's yours."
"  Once it's plowed, you can hire some workers to plant or harvest the crops "
"for a small fee of course.  Oh, and if you're growing anything we have a "
"demand for, we'll gladly take it off your hands after the harvest."
msgstr ""
"저희가 땅을 갈아엎고, 모든 사람에게 당신 땅임을 알리는 표지판을 세워드리겠습니다. 밭을 갈아엎은 후에는 물론 소정의 비용으로 일꾼을 "
"고용하여 작물을 심거나 수확하실 수 있습니다. 아, 그리고 저희가 원하는 작물을 재배하신다면, 수확 후 기꺼이 가져가겠습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'm interested.  How much is it going to cost?"
msgstr "관심 있어요. 비용은 얼마나 들까요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"350 merch should be enough to cover the purchase and the labor to plow it."
msgstr "350개의 머크가면 구매 비용과 경작에 필요한 노동 비용을 충당하기에 충분할 것입니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[350 merch] Seems like a fair price.  I'll take it."
msgstr "[머크 350개] 적당한 가격인 것 같네요. 사겠습니다."

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"<npc_name> jots your name down on a ledger and yells out to nearby laborers "
"to begin plowing your new field."
msgstr "<npc_name>은 원장에 당신의 이름을 적고, 근처 노동자들에게 새로운 밭을 갈라고 소리칩니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I'm a bit short right now.  <end_talking_later>"
msgstr "지금은 좀 짧은 편이에요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"Sure, we could build a sturdy picket fence around it that will keep most "
"wildlife from nibbling at your crops.  Your crop yields will increase "
"slightly as well."
msgstr ""
"물론입니다. 튼튼한 울타리를 쳐서 대부분의 야생 동물이 농작물을 갉아먹지 못하게 할 수도 있습니다. 작물 수확량도 약간 늘어날 겁니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"We'll have to divert a decent amount of lumber from our other projects for "
"the fence, but we can get it done for 200 merch."
msgstr "울타리를 만들기 위해 다른 프로젝트에서 상당량의 목재를 빼내야 하겠지만, 200달러에 끝낼 수 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[200 merch] Alright, build me a fence."
msgstr "[200개 머크] 좋아, 울타리를 지어줘."

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"After counting your money, <npc_name> directs a nearby laborer to begin "
"constructing a fence around your plot…"
msgstr "<npc_name>은 돈을 세고 난 후, 근처에 있는 노동자에게 당신의 땅 주위에 울타리를 쌓으라고 지시합니다…"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "I don't have that much right now.  <end_talking_later>"
msgstr "지금은 그렇게 많지 않아요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"We'll have to divert a decent amount of lumber from our other projects for "
"the fence, but we can get it done for 300 merch."
msgstr "울타리를 만들기 위해 다른 프로젝트에서 상당량의 목재를 빼내야 하겠지만, 300달러에 끝낼 수 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[300 merch] Alright, build me a fence."
msgstr "[300개 머크] 좋아, 울타리를 지어줘."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"We can plow some more land around your field to give you room for more "
"plants.  Any existing plants or items in the way will be destroyed.  The "
"fence will also get moved and expanded.  Everything can be done for 200 "
"merch.  Still interested?"
msgstr ""
"밭 주변 땅을 더 갈아서 더 많은 식물을 심을 공간을 확보해 드리겠습니다. 기존 식물이나 방해되는 물건은 모두 제거해 드리겠습니다. "
"울타리도 옮기고 확장할 예정입니다. 모든 작업은 머크 200개로 가능합니다. 아직 관심 있으신가요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"We can plow some more land around your field to give you room for more "
"plants.  Any existing plants or items in the way will be destroyed.  It'll "
"only cost 100 merch to expand.  Still interested?"
msgstr ""
"밭 주변 땅을 더 갈아서 식물을 더 심을 공간을 확보해 드리겠습니다. 기존 식물이나 방해되는 물건은 모두 폐기합니다. 확장 비용은 머크 "
"100개뿐입니다. 아직 관심 있으신가요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[200 merch] Yeah, let's do it."
msgstr "[200개 머크] 네, 해보겠습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[100 merch] Yeah, let's do it."
msgstr "[100개 머크] 네, 해보겠습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"We'll plant the field with your choice of crop if you are willing to finance"
" it.  When the crop is ready to harvest, you can have us liquidate it or "
"harvest it for you.  Planting will cost 1 merch per plot."
msgstr ""
"자금 지원에 동의하시면 원하시는 작물을 밭에 심어드립니다. 작물이 수확기에 이르면 저희에게 청산을 의뢰하시거나 직접 수확하실 수 "
"있습니다. 심는 데는 밭당 머크 1개가 필요합니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[1 merch / plot] I'd like to plant some seeds."
msgstr "[1 머크 / 플롯] 씨앗을 심고 싶습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid ""
"You can either have us liquidate the crop and give you the cash or pay us to"
" harvest it for you.  Harvesting will cost 1 merch per plot."
msgstr ""
"작물을 청산하여 현금으로 돌려드리거나, 저희에게 비용을 지불하여 수확을 의뢰하실 수 있습니다. 수확 비용은 구획당 머크 1개입니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
msgid "[1 merch / plot] I'd like to harvest the field."
msgstr "[1 머크 / 플롯] 밭을 수확하고 싶습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "How can I help you today?"
msgstr "오늘은 어떻게 도와드릴까요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I'm sorry, I don't have time to help you at the moment."
msgstr "죄송합니다. 지금은 도와드릴 시간이 없습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Is there anything else I can help with?"
msgstr "제가 도와드릴 수 있는 다른 일이 있나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Maybe I could help you with something?"
msgstr "제가 뭔가 도와드릴 수 있을까요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I couldn't find any crutches, but I made these.  Will they work?"
msgstr "목발을 찾을 수가 없어서 직접 만들었어요. 괜찮을까요?"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "These will have to do…"
msgstr "이것들은 해야 할 것입니다…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I have other patients to attend to.  Come back later."
msgstr "다른 환자도 돌봐야 하니까 나중에 다시 오세요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I can't right now, I have other matters to attend to."
msgstr "지금은 할 수 없어요. 다른 일을 처리해야 하거든요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "[80 merch, 30m] I need you to patch me up."
msgstr "[머크 80개, 30분] 나를 좀 고쳐주세요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "[200 merch, 1h] I need you to patch my friends up."
msgstr "[머크 200개, 1시간] 친구들을 좀 위로해 줘야 해."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Take it easy now.  Wouldn't want you coming back here too soon."
msgstr "이제 좀 진정해. 너무 빨리 여기로 돌아오는 건 원치 않아."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Take it easy now.  Wouldn't want you coming back here too soon."
msgstr "이제 좀 진정해. 너무 빨리 여기로 돌아오는 건 원치 않아."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Take it easy now.  Wouldn't want you coming back here too soon."
msgstr "이제 좀 진정해. 너무 빨리 여기로 돌아오는 건 원치 않아."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "If you mean something like pacemaker, then maybe.  What's the trouble?"
msgstr "심박 조율기 같은 거 말씀하시는 거라면 그럴 수도 있겠네요. 뭐가 문제죠?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"If you mean something like pacemaker, we can't really do much without "
"anesthesia."
msgstr "심장 박동 조절기 같은 것을 말씀하시는 거라면 마취 없이는 별로 할 수 있는 게 없습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"No, i mean something, eeh, more sci-fi.  There are robo-guys in a stone "
"castle, they say they have such technology.  They even installed something "
"into me, look!"
msgstr ""
"아니, 뭔가 좀, 으, 좀 더 공상과학적인 거 말이야. 돌성 안에 로봇들이 있는데, 그런 기술이 있다고 하더라. 심지어 나한테도 뭔가 "
"심어놨다고, 봐!"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"No, i mean something, eeh, more sci-fi.  There are robo-guys in a stone "
"castle, they say they have such technology."
msgstr "아니, 뭔가 좀, 으음, 좀 더 공상과학적인 거 말이야. 돌성 안에 로봇들이 있는데, 그런 기술이 있다고 하더라."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Curious.  Sorry, i have no idea how it works, and i'd be afraid to even "
"touch this parts."
msgstr "궁금해요. 죄송하지만 어떻게 작동하는지 전혀 모르겠고, 이 부분은 만지는 것조차 두렵습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Are you all right?  Sci-fi bionic by robots in a stone castle?  I have some "
"antipsychotics, if it helps."
msgstr "괜찮아? 돌성에서 로봇이 하는 공상과학 바이오닉? 도움이 된다면 항정신병약 좀 먹어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"I'm running out of office supplies.  I know… of all the things to need at a "
"time like this!  I just need to be able to keep track of and organize "
"medical records so that I can focus on helping people.  Ten binders and a "
"ream of paper should tide me over until some shipments come in."
msgstr ""
"사무용품이 다 떨어져 가네요. 이런 시기에 필요한 게 얼마나 많은지… 알겠어요! 사람들을 돕는 데 집중할 수 있도록 진료 기록만 잘 "
"관리하면 돼요. 바인더 열 장과 종이 한 묶음이면 배송이 올 때까지 버틸 수 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "I'll see what I can find."
msgstr "내가 찾을 수 있는 게 있는지 알아보겠습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Thanks, this will help a lot."
msgstr "고맙습니다. 많은 도움이 될 것 같아요."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Collect Office Supplies"
msgstr "사무용품 수집"

#. ~ Description of mission "Collect Office Supplies"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"The doctor needs office supplies to keep track of medical records.  Bring "
"them 10 Book binders and 500 paper."
msgstr "의사님께서 진료 기록을 관리할 사무용품이 필요합니다. 책자 10개와 종이 500장을 가져오세요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect Office Supplies"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Have you found the supplies yet?"
msgstr "아직 필요한 물품을 찾지 못하셨나요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect Office Supplies"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Thanks!  This should help keep things organized for a while."
msgstr "고맙습니다! 이렇게 하면 당분간 정리하는 데 도움이 될 것 같아요."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "A Crutch to Lean on"
msgstr "의지할 수 있는 목발"

#. ~ Description of mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Bring the doctor some crutches."
msgstr "의사에게 목발을 가져다 주세요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"One of the laborers injured their foot pretty badly and I don't want them "
"walking on it for a few days at least.  Do you think you could find a pair "
"of crutches?"
msgstr ""
"노동자 한 명이 발을 심하게 다쳐서 적어도 며칠 동안은 그 상태로 걷지 못하게 하고 싶습니다. 혹시 목발을 구해 주실 수 있을까요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 12 Car Batteries"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 5 Backpacks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a copy of Homebrewer's Bible"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Gather 110lb (10000 units) of Sugar"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 30 Glass Sheets"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 100 Aspirin"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 3 Hotplates"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Collect 200 Multivitamin Pills"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 4 Charcoal Purifiers"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a Chemistry Set"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Filter Masks"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 4 Pairs of Rubber Gloves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 2 Scalpels"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find Advanced Emergency Care"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Simple Knife Spears"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 5 Headlamps"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 3 Leather Body Armor"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make 12 Molotov Cocktails"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
msgid "I'm counting on you."
msgstr "기대하고 있을게."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"You might be able to find some in hospitals, but some makeshift crutches "
"would be better than nothing."
msgstr "병원에서 찾을 수도 있겠지만, 임시 목발이라도 없는 것보다는 낫겠죠."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "A Crutch to Lean on"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Do you have the crutches?"
msgstr "목발이 있나요?"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
msgstr "의료용 장갑 5쌍을 찾으세요"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Bring the doctor 5 pairs of medical gloves."
msgstr "의사에게 의료용 장갑 5켤레를 가져오세요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"We're getting a lot of scrapes and bruises coming in right now, but it's "
"only a matter of time before we see a serious injury.  I'm not prepared for "
"when that happens and I'm hoping you can help.  To start off, I'm going to "
"need some more medical gloves to help prevent infections.  Can you bring me "
"5 pairs?"
msgstr ""
"지금 긁히고 멍이 많이 들고 있는데, 심각한 부상은 시간문제일 뿐이에요. 저는 그런 일이 일어날 준비가 안 돼 있어서 도와주시면 "
"좋겠어요. 우선, 감염 예방을 위해 의료용 장갑이 좀 더 필요할 것 같아요. 다섯 켤레만 가져다주실 수 있나요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 10 Syringes"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Hospitals or clinics might have a few sitting around."
msgstr "병원이나 진료소에 남은게 좀 있을거야."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 5 Pairs of Medical Gloves"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Do you have the medical gloves?"
msgstr "의료용 장갑이 있나요?"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
msgstr "의사를 위한 마취제"

#. ~ Description of mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"Bring the doctor 3000 units of anesthetic.  Ask around the commune for "
"assistance in building an anesthetic machine."
msgstr "의사에게 마취제 3000유닛을 가져다주세요. 마을 사람들에게 마취기 제작에 대한 도움을 요청하세요."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"I want to make sure we are setup to handle any major surgeries that come our"
" way, but pain management is going to be an issue.  For longer surgeries, "
"we're going to need some anesthetic.  Can you bring me 3000 units to start?"
"  We're also going to need an anesthetic machine to deliver it.  Maybe some "
"people around the commune can help with that?"
msgstr ""
"앞으로 닥칠 수 있는 큰 수술들을 감당할 수 있도록 준비하고 싶지만, 통증 관리가 문제가 될 것 같습니다. 장기 수술에는 마취제가 필요할"
" 것 같습니다. 3,000유닛을 먼저 가져다주실 수 있나요? 마취기를 가져다줄 기계도 필요합니다. 혹시 마을 사람들이 도와줄 수 "
"있을까요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Hospitals or clinics might have some.  Labs could have some as well."
msgstr "병원이나 진료소에도 있을 수 있고, 실험실에도 있을 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid "Any progress on getting some anesthetic or parts?"
msgstr "마취제나 부품을 구하는 데 진전이 있나요?"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Anesthetic for the Doctor"
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_doctor.json
msgid ""
"The scavengers found more medical equipment than I expected and with the "
"help from the scrappers, I've been able to get most of it up and running.  I"
" should be able to perform more operations now."
msgstr ""
"청소부들이 예상보다 더 많은 의료 장비를 찾아냈고, 고철 수집가들의 도움으로 대부분을 다시 가동할 수 있었습니다. 이제 더 많은 수술을 "
"할 수 있을 겁니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
msgid "I'd like to hire your services."
msgstr "널 고용하고 싶어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
msgid ""
"I was sent here to assist in setting up the farm.  Most of us have no real "
"skills that transfer from before the Cataclysm, so things are a bit of trial"
" and error."
msgstr ""
"저는 농장을 세우는 일을 돕기 위해 여기로 파견되었습니다. 저희 대부분은 대격변 이전부터 전수할 만한 실질적인 기술이 없어서 시행착오를 "
"겪을 수밖에 없습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, I don't have anything to trade.  The work program here splits "
"what we produce between the refugee center, the farm, and ourselves.  If you"
" are a skilled laborer, then you can trade your time for a bit of extra "
"income on the side.  Not much I can do to assist you as a farmer though."
msgstr ""
"죄송하지만, 바꿀 게 없어요. 여기 노동 프로그램은 우리가 생산한 것을 난민 센터, 농장, 그리고 우리 팀에 나눠주는 방식이에요. 숙련된"
" 노동자라면, 시간을 투자해서 부수입을 조금 더 얻을 수도 있겠죠. 하지만 농부로서 제가 도와드릴 수 있는 일은 많지 않아요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid "Oh."
msgstr "오."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
msgid "You mind?"
msgstr "어때?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
msgid ""
"I'm just a lucky guy that went from being chased by the undead to the noble "
"life of a dirt farmer.  We get room and board, but won't see a share of our "
"labor unless the crop is a success."
msgstr ""
"저는 언데드에게 쫓기다가 흙을 파는 농부의 고귀한 삶으로 돌아온, 그저 운 좋은 사람일 뿐입니다. 숙식은 제공되지만, 농사가 잘 되지 "
"않으면 노동의 몫은 전혀 받지 못할 겁니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
msgid "It could be worse…"
msgstr "더 나빠질 수도 있었어…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
msgid ""
"I've got no time for you.  If you want to make a trade or need a job, look "
"for the foreman or crop overseer."
msgstr "너한테 시간 내줄 시간 없어. 장사하고 싶거나 일자리가 필요하면, 작업반장이나 작물 감독관을 찾아."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
msgid "I'll talk with them then…"
msgstr "그 사람들과 이야기해보지…"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Appears at the ranch after you progress in the refugee center quests.
#. Faction critical.
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Foreman"
msgstr "현장감독"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Hello again.  If you have no other business with me, I'd like to talk to you"
" about something."
msgstr "안녕하세요. 혹시 저와 다른 용무가 없으시다면, 잠깐 이야기 나누고 싶은 게 있습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Can I help you, marshal?"
msgstr "뭘 도와드릴까요, 보안관님?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Morning sir, how can I help you?"
msgstr "좋은 아침입니다 선생님, 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Morning ma'am, how can I help you?"
msgstr "좋은 아침입니다 부인, 무엇을 도와드릴까요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"The merchant at the Refugee Center sent me to get a prospectus from you."
msgstr "난민 센터 상인이 귀사로부터 안내서를 받아오라고 했습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I heard you were setting up an outpost out here."
msgstr "여기 전초기지를 설치했다면서?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "What's your job here?"
msgstr "여기에서 무슨 일을 하고 있어?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Hey, are you looking for workers here?  I know a couple people back at the "
"refugee center that might be willing to come."
msgstr "이봐, 혹시 일꾼 필요해? 피난시설에 일할 의욕이 있어보이는 친구들을 좀 아는데."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Hey, are you looking for workers here?"
msgstr "안녕하세요, 여기서 일할 사람을 찾고 계신가요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I was starting to wonder if they were really interested in the project or "
"were just trying to get rid of me."
msgstr "그치들이 이 계획에 정말 관심이 있긴 한건지, 아니면 그냥 날 내쫓으려던건지 모르겠어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I was starting to wonder if they were really interested in the project or "
"were just trying to get rid of me."
msgstr "그치들이 이 계획에 정말 관심이 있긴 한건지, 아니면 그냥 날 내쫓으려던건지 모르겠어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I was starting to wonder if they were really interested in the project or "
"were just trying to get rid of me."
msgstr "그치들이 이 계획에 정말 관심이 있긴 한건지, 아니면 그냥 날 내쫓으려던건지 모르겠어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "I'm afraid I don't have anything to offer."
msgstr "죄송하지만 제가 드릴 수 있는 것은 아무것도 없습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"I don't have anything to offer, but maybe the scrappers could help find some"
" materials."
msgstr "제가 드릴 수 있는 건 없지만, 고철꾼들이 재료를 찾는 데 도움을 줄 수도 있을 것 같아요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"I don't have anything to offer, but maybe the scavenger boss could help find"
" some materials."
msgstr "제가 드릴 수 있는 건 없지만, 청소부 사장님이 재료를 찾는 데 도움을 주실 수도 있을 것 같아요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"I don't have anything to offer, but you could talk to the scavenger boss and"
" the scrappers; They might be able to help."
msgstr "제가 드릴 수 있는 건 없지만, 청소부 사장님과 폐차 담당자에게 물어보세요. 그들이 도와줄 수도 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "Thanks anyway."
msgstr "어쨌든 고맙습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid ""
"Ya, that representative from the Old Guard asked the two of us to come out "
"here and begin fortifying this place as a refugee camp.  I'm not sure how "
"fast he expects the two of us to get setup, but we were assured additional "
"men were coming out here to assist us. "
msgstr ""
"네, 그 구 경비대 대표가 우리 둘에게 여기 와서 난민 수용소로 요새화 작업을 시작하라고 했습니다. 그가 우리 둘이 얼마나 빨리 준비될지"
" 모르겠지만, 우리를 돕기 위해 더 많은 병력이 여기로 온다는 말을 들었습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgid "How many refugees are you expecting?"
msgstr "피난민이 어느정도 올거라고 생각하는 거야?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Could easily be hundreds as far as I know.  They chose this ranch because of"
" its rather remote location, decent fence, and huge cleared field.  With as "
"much land as we have fenced off we could build a village if we had the "
"materials.  We would have tried to secure a small town or something, but the"
" lack of good farmland and number of undead makes it more practical for us "
"to build from scratch.  The refugee center I came from is constantly facing "
"starvation and undead assaults."
msgstr ""
"제가 아는 한 수백 명은 될 겁니다. 그들이 이 목장을 선택한 이유는 외딴 위치, 괜찮은 울타리, 그리고 널찍한 개간지 때문입니다. "
"울타리로 막은 땅이 넓으니 재료만 있다면 마을을 지을 수 있을 겁니다. 작은 마을이나 그런 걸 만들려고 했지만, 좋은 농경지가 부족하고 "
"언데드도 많아서 아예 처음부터 짓는 게 더 현실적이죠. 제가 온 난민 센터는 끊임없이 굶주림과 언데드 공격에 시달리고 있습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-
#. DDA/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
