msgstr "작업장을 위한 토지 조사."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "faction_base_workshop_0"
#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "faction_base_workshop_2_0"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
