msgstr "풀무"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_workshop_room0_construction_northeast"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid ""
"We can use a workshop.  Let's start by building a spot to protect the "
"workers from the rain."
msgstr "작업장을 쓸 수 있겠네요. 우선 작업자들을 비로부터 보호할 수 있는 장소를 만드는 것부터 시작하죠."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_workshop_room0_construction_northeast"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "northeast wall"
msgstr "북동쪽 벽"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_workshop_room3_construction_north"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "Let's extend the north wall to the west and add some storage space."
msgstr "북쪽 벽을 서쪽까지 확장하고, 보관함도 좀 만듭시다."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_workshop_room3_construction_north"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "north wall"
msgstr "북쪽 벽"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_workshop_room4_construction_east"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid ""
"Let's expand our production by adding another charcoal kiln with walls."
msgstr "벽이 있는 숯 가마를 하나 더 추가하여 생산량을 확대해 보자."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_workshop_room4_construction_east"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "east forge wall"
msgstr "동쪽 대장간 벽"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_workshop_room5_construction_center"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid ""
"Let's expand work area with a wall, and add a bookshelf for our reference "
"books."
msgstr "벽을 만들어 작업 공간을 확장하고, 참고서를 위한 책장을 추가해 보겠습니다."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_workshop_room5_construction_center"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "west forge wall"
msgstr "서쪽 대장간 벽"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_workshop_room6_construction_north"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "Let's expand our production by adding a walled pottery kiln area."
msgstr "벽으로 둘러싸인 도자기 가마 구역을 추가하여 생산량을 확대해 보겠습니다."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_workshop_room6_construction_north"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "north pottery wall"
msgstr "북쪽 벽 도자기 가마"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_workshop_room7to9_construction_northwest"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid ""
"Let's enclose this pottery with walls and get some more storage set up."
msgstr "이 도자기를 벽으로 둘러싸고 보관 공간을 좀 더 마련해 보겠습니다."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_workshop_room7to9_construction_northwest"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "northwest and south pottery wall"
msgstr "북서쪽 및 남쪽 벽 도자기 가마"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_workshop_room11to12_construction_southeast"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid ""
"Let's expand the workspace for larger projects and add a drop hammer for "
"productivity with log pillars."
msgstr "더 큰 프로젝트를 위해 작업 공간을 확장하고, 통나무 기둥으로 드롭 해머를 추가하여 생산성을 높여보세요."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_modular_workshop_room11to12_construction_southeast"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_1/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "open air, covered work space"
msgstr "야외, 덮인 작업 공간"

