#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "faction_base_workshop_2_0"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid "Survey land for a workshop area."
msgstr "작업장으로 쓸 곳을 측량합니다."

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_1"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid ""
"Let's install a metal working forge in the smithy.  We'll need a few tools "
"too, so we'll include some storage space.  This will provide us with a first"
" couple of primitive crafting recipes."
msgstr ""
"대장간에 금속 가공용 단조로를 설치해 봅시다. 도구도 몇 가지 필요하니 보관 공간도 확보해야겠죠. 이렇게 하면 기본적인 제작 레시피 몇 "
"개를 얻을 수 있을 겁니다."

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_smithy_2"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid ""
"Let's install a couple of charcoal kilns outside of the smithy.  We'll add a"
" crucible as well.  This will allow us to produce a few additional things."
msgstr ""
"대장간 밖에 숯 가마 두 개를 설치해 봅시다. 도가니도 하나 더 설치할 거예요. 이렇게 하면 몇 가지 물건을 더 생산할 수 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_smithy_3"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid ""
"Let's install an anvil in the smithy, some quenching containers and a "
"workbench.  This will allow us to produce a few additional things."
msgstr "대장간에 모루와 담금질 용기, 그리고 작업대를 설치해 봅시다. 이렇게 하면 몇 가지 추가 물품을 생산할 수 있을 겁니다."

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_smithy_4"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid ""
"Let's add furniture and some more tools to the smithy.  This will allow us "
"to produce a few additional things."
msgstr "대장간에 가구와 도구를 추가해 봅시다. 그러면 몇 가지 물건을 더 생산할 수 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_smithy_4"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid "smithing tools"
msgstr "대장간 도구"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_smithy_5"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid ""
"Let's install a bellows for our forge and add some more tools.  This will "
"extend our recipe repertoire."
msgstr "대장간에 풀무를 설치하고 도구를 좀 더 추가해 봅시다. 이렇게 하면 레시피 목록이 더 넓어질 거예요."

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_smithy_6"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid ""
"Let's add a drop hammer to the smithy for productivity and add some more "
"tools.  This will allow us to reach our smithing potential."
msgstr ""
"생산성을 높이기 위해 대장간에 드롭 해머를 추가하고, 도구를 좀 더 추가해 봅시다. 이렇게 하면 대장간 작업의 잠재력을 최대한 발휘할 수"
" 있을 겁니다."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_smithy_6"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid "drop hammer"
msgstr "드롭 해머"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_pottery"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid "Let's build a kiln in the pottery to allow us to make a clay crucible."
msgstr "도자기 공장에 가마를 만들어서 진흙 도가니를 만들어 보자."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_pottery"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid "pottery kiln"
msgstr "도자기 가마"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_pottery_1"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid "Let's furnish the pottery."
msgstr "도자기를 꾸며보자."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_pottery_1"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid "pottery furniture"
msgstr "도자기 가구"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_glassblower"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid "Let's furnish the glassblower's cottage."
msgstr "유리 제작자의 오두막을 꾸며보자."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_glassblower"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid "glassblower furniture"
msgstr "유리 공예 가구"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_tanner"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid "Let's furnish the tannery."
msgstr "가죽공장에 가구를 공급하자."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_tanner"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid "tanner furniture"
msgstr "태너 가구"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_recreation"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid ""
"Let's add a bench and a fire barrel outside the pottery for recreation."
msgstr "도자기 작업장 밖에 벤치와 화덕을 추가하여 여가 활동을 즐겨보자."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_common_recreation"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_common.json
msgid "recreation area"
msgstr "휴양 지역"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_smithy_1_construction"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid ""
"We can use a smithy.  Let's start by building a spot to protect the workers "
"from the rain."
msgstr "대장간을 쓸 수도 있겠네요. 우선 일꾼들을 비로부터 보호할 수 있는 장소를 만드는 것부터 시작하죠."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_smithy_1_construction"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "smithy wall"
msgstr "대장간 벽"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_smithy_2_construction"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid ""
"Let's build a roof with pillars to protect future charcoal kilns from the "
"rain."
msgstr "미래의 숯가마를 비로부터 보호하기 위해 기둥으로 지붕을 만들어 보자."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_smithy_2_construction"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "charcoal kiln protection"
msgstr "숯가마 보호"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_smithy_3_construction"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "Let's build the final section of the smithy."
msgstr "대장간의 마지막 부분을 만들어 보자."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_smithy_3_construction"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "final smithy section"
msgstr "최종 대장간 섹션"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_pottery_construction"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "Let's build a pottery section."
msgstr "도자기 코너를 만들어 보자."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_pottery_construction"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "pottery section"
msgstr "도자기 섹션"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_glassblower_construction"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "Let's start building a glassblower's cottage."
msgstr "유리 제작자의 오두막을 지어보자."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_glassblower_construction"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "glassblower's cottage"
msgstr "유리 장인의 오두막"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_tanner_construction"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
msgid "Let's start building a tannery cottage."
msgstr "태너리 별장을 짓기 시작해 보자."

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_tanner_construction"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/expansion/recipe_modular_workshop/version_2/recipe_modular_workshop_construction.json
