#. ~ Snippet in category "billboard_ad_snippets"
#: data/json/snippets/billboard.json
msgid ""
"A billboard ad for Food Place, it reads: \"Food Place: food made by great "
"Americans… for great Americans!\""
msgstr "푸드 플레이스의 광고판에는 \"푸드 플레이스: 위대한 미국인이 위대한 미국인을 위해 만든 음식!\"이라는 문구가 적혀 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "billboard_ad_snippets"
#: data/json/snippets/billboard.json
msgid ""
"A billboard ad for a luxury car dealership: \"Drive the future.  Get your "
"next electric car from <family_name>'s car dealership!\""
msgstr ""
"고급 자동차 딜러십의 빌보드 광고: \"미래를 운전하세요. <family_name>의 자동차 딜러십에서 다음 전기 자동차를 "
"구입하세요!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "billboard_ad_snippets"
#: data/json/snippets/billboard.json
msgid ""
"A billboard ad for a security company, \"SecuriCorp\": \"Keeping you safe "
"since 1993\"."
msgstr "보안 회사 \"SecuriCorp\"의 빌보드 광고: \"1993년부터 여러분의 안전을 지켜드립니다\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "billboard_ad_snippets"
#: data/json/snippets/billboard.json
msgid "A billboard PSA here reads \"Better left unread than dead\"."
msgstr "여기의 광고판 공익광고에는 \"죽는 것보다 안 읽는 게 낫다\"라는 문구가 적혀 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "billboard_ad_snippets"
#: data/json/snippets/billboard.json
msgid ""
"A billboard PSA here reads \"Sometimes it takes a family of four to stop a "
"drunk diver\"."
msgstr "여기의 광고판 공익광고에는 \"술 취한 다이버를 막으려면 4인 가족이 필요할 때가 있습니다\"라고 적혀 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "billboard_ad_snippets"
#: data/json/snippets/billboard.json
msgid "A billboard ad for a funeral home reads \"Text and drive.\"."
msgstr "장례식장의 광고판에는 \"문자를 보내고 운전하세요\"라는 문구가 적혀 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "billboard_ad_snippets"
#: data/json/snippets/billboard.json
msgid ""
"A billboard ad for a local grocery shop \"Shop cheap & fresh at "
"<family_name>'s groceries\"."
msgstr "지역 식료품점의 광고판 광고 \"<family_name>의 식료품점에서 저렴하고 신선한 식료품을 구매하세요\"."

#. ~ Snippet in category "billboard_ad_snippets"
#: data/json/snippets/billboard.json
msgid "A billboard ad for a real estate agency with a featured listing."
msgstr "부동산 중개업체의 주요 매물을 소개하는 빌보드 광고입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "billboard_ad_snippets"
#: data/json/snippets/billboard.json
msgid "A billboard for a local politician."
msgstr "지역 정치인의 광고판."

#. ~ Snippet in category "billboard_ad_snippets"
#: data/json/snippets/billboard.json
msgid "A billboard ad for an upcoming movie."
msgstr "개봉 예정인 영화를 홍보하는 빌보드 광고."

#. ~ Snippet in category "billboard_ad_snippets"
#: data/json/snippets/billboard.json
msgid "A billboard ad by Play SchoolClothing Co. \"BAGS, BAGS, BAGS!\"."
msgstr "Play SchoolClothing Co.의 빌보드 광고. \"가방, 가방, 가방!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "billboard_ad_snippets"
#: data/json/snippets/billboard.json
msgid "Your ad here!"
msgstr "여기에 광고를 게재하세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<kid_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for kids' unisex backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and
#. similar items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"It's covered in shooting stars and glowing comets, the kind that people used"
" to wish upon."
msgstr "그곳은 사람들이 소원을 빌던 유성과 빛나는 혜성으로 뒤덮여 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<kid_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for kids' unisex backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and
#. similar items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"There's a big, confident-looking sun wearing sunglasses looking back at you "
"from its surface."
msgstr "선글라스를 쓴 커다랗고 자신감 넘치는 태양이 표면에서 당신을 바라보고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<kid_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for kids' unisex backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and
#. similar items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"As you examine it, its cartoon owl mascot stares back at you with big, "
"inscrutable eyes."
msgstr "당신이 그것을 자세히 살펴보면, 만화 올빼미 마스코트가 크고 불가사의한 눈으로 당신을 응시하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<kid_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for kids' unisex backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and
#. similar items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"It's covered in tiny paw prints, like an untrained pet left muddy tracks all"
" over it."
msgstr "마치 훈련받지 않은 애완동물이 진흙 발자국을 곳곳에 남긴 것처럼 작은 발자국이 뒤덮여 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<kid_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for kids' unisex backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and
#. similar items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"Various pieces of fruit with legs and arms beam up at you with smiling "
"faces, as if inviting you to eat them."
msgstr "다리와 팔이 달린 다양한 과일들이 웃는 얼굴로 당신에게 미소를 지으며, 마치 먹으라고 권하는 듯합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<kid_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for kids' unisex backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and
#. similar items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"An old cartoon character smiles jauntily from its surface, celebrating their"
" recently renewed return to television.  The TV stations shutting down "
"stopped that nostalgia grab before it started."
msgstr ""
"오래된 만화 캐릭터가 수면 위로 싱긋이 미소를 지으며, 최근 TV에 복귀한 것을 축하하고 있다. 하지만 방송국 폐쇄로 그 향수는 시작도 "
"하기 전에 멈췄다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<boy_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for boys' backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and similar
#. items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"It's decorated with a big cartoon dinosaur, crushing a helpless car beneath "
"it."
msgstr "그 아래에는 무력한 자동차가 깔려 있는 커다란 만화 공룡이 장식되어 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<boy_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for boys' backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and similar
#. items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"It's emblazoned with the logo of a superhero who was always stopping the end"
" of the world from happening.  Unfortunately, like most heroes, he was "
"fictional."
msgstr "세상의 종말을 항상 막던 슈퍼히어로의 로고가 새겨져 있습니다. 안타깝게도 대부분의 영웅처럼 그도 허구의 인물이었습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<boy_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for boys' backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and similar
#. items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"It features a colorful rocket ship fearlessly blasting off into an "
"unexplored, starry cosmos."
msgstr "이 그림에는 탐험되지 않은 별이 빛나는 우주로 두려움 없이 날아가는 다채로운 로켓선이 등장합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<boy_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for boys' backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and similar
#. items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"It's got a space-themed design, astronauts orbiting helplessly in the void "
"among asteroids and alien planets with rings."
msgstr ""
"우주를 주제로 한 디자인으로, 우주비행사들이 고리가 있는 소행성과 외계 행성 사이의 공허한 공간에서 무기력하게 궤도를 도는 모습이 담겨 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<boy_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for boys' backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and similar
#. items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"It features a rebellious skull and crossbones, like the merciless black flag"
" of a pirate."
msgstr "해적의 무자비한 검은 깃발처럼 반항적인 해골과 뼈가 특징입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<boy_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for boys' backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and similar
#. items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"It's patterned like an aged treasure map, complete with dotted lines and an "
"X marking the spot."
msgstr "그것은 오래된 보물 지도와 비슷한 무늬를 가지고 있으며, 점선과 X로 해당 위치를 표시하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<boy_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for boys' backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and similar
#. items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"It's covered in rampaging monster trucks, leaving criss-crossing trails of "
"muddy tire tracks in their wake."
msgstr "난동을 부리는 몬스터 트럭이 뒤덮여 있고, 지나간 자리에는 진흙투성이 타이어 자국이 엇갈려 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<boy_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for boys' backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and similar
#. items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"There's a sporty pattern of sneakers, soccer balls, and championship "
"trophies covering it."
msgstr "운동화, 축구공, 챔피언십 트로피가 스포티한 패턴으로 덮여 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<girl_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for girls' backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and similar
#. items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"Images of glowing magic wands and small fairies shedding pixie dust from "
"their wings cover its surface."
msgstr "빛나는 마법 지팡이와 날개에서 요정의 가루를 뿌리는 작은 요정의 이미지가 표면을 덮고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<girl_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for girls' backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and similar
#. items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid "Little cartoon ballerinas pose gracefully on a pastel background."
msgstr "파스텔 배경 위에 작은 만화 발레리나들이 우아하게 포즈를 취하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<girl_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for girls' backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and similar
#. items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"Little pink hearts and sparkles decorate the space around a single large, "
"central red heart.  A big sharp arrow has pierced straight through it, "
"coming out the other side."
msgstr ""
"작은 분홍색 하트와 반짝이가 중앙에 있는 커다란 빨간색 하트 하나를 둘러싼 공간을 장식하고 있습니다. 크고 날카로운 화살이 하트를 뚫고 "
"반대편으로 튀어나와 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<girl_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for girls' backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and similar
#. items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"It's covered in unicorns that prance under various rainbows arcing between "
"white, fluffy clouds."
msgstr "하얀 솜털 구름 사이로 다양한 무지개가 펼쳐지고, 유니콘이 뛰어다니는 모습이 보입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<girl_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for girls' backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and similar
#. items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"Bright flowers cover it, sprouting from tangles of long green vines that "
"converge on a central, half-hidden door."
msgstr "밝은 꽃들이 그 집을 덮고 있는데, 긴 녹색 덩굴이 얽혀 중앙의 반쯤 숨겨진 문에서 모여듭니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<girl_brand>"
#. ~ Suitable for girls' backpacks, lunchboxes, graphic tees, and similar
#. items.
#: data/json/snippets/branding.json
msgid ""
"It's covered in cartoon kittens playfully competing over balls of yarn.  One"
" kitten teeters precariously as if it's about to fall off the edge of the "
"drawing."
msgstr ""
"이 그림은 털실 뭉치를 놓고 장난스럽게 경쟁하는 새끼 고양이들의 만화로 가득 차 있습니다. 한 새끼 고양이는 그림 가장자리에서 떨어질 듯"
" 위태롭게 비틀거리고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Dad said he was going to get groceries two days ago.  he didnt come home "
"yet.  he told me to stay inside the shelter but im getting scared.  i think "
"i remember where the grocery store is.\""
msgstr ""
"\"아빠가 먹을거 사온다고 햇는데 2일이 지나도 오질 안았다. 집 안에 잇으라고 햇지만 나만 잇으니 무섭다. 아빠가 마트 가는 길을 "
"가리켜줫는데 아빠를 찻아야겟다.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"i calld 911 but no one was there\""
msgstr "\"경찰 아저씨가 안와\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"My window lit up at midnight.  I tried seeing what it was but it broke.  "
"My ears hurt.\""
msgstr "\"창문 밖에 빛이 나서 보려고 했는데 창문이 깨졌어 귀아퍼\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"I want mom's pancakes\""
msgstr "\"엄마 보고싶어요\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Uncle buried ms Carmichael after she got sick but she's not in the "
"backyard anymore.  Uncle isn't home either.\""
msgstr "\"카마이클 숙모가 아프셔서 삼촌이 뒷마당에 숙모를 묻어주셨는데 숙모가 없어졌다. 삼촌도 집에 안계신다.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Cooper killed the neighbors cat today.  dad shoot him.  He was not in the "
"backyart when we came home.\""
msgstr ""
"\"오늘 쿠퍼 아저시가 이웃집 고양이를 죽여따 그리고 우리 아빠가 쿠퍼 아저씨를 총으로 쐇다 집에 돌아오니 쿠퍼 아저시가 업어졋다\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"Today I saw a butterfly the size of my head\""
msgstr "\"오늘 엄청 큰 나비가 이썻다\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"I miss mom and dad.  Where is everyone?\""
msgstr "\"엄마 아빠 보고싶어요 어디갔어요?\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"DaIsy gOT eaTTEN by a giant roa… (the rest of the note is just unreadable "
"smudges)\""
msgstr "\"데이지가 엄정 크 바퀴버ㄹ (나머지는 읽을 수 없을 정도로 글씨가 휘갈겨져 있습니다.)\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"Mommy, where are you?  I miss you…\""
msgstr "\"엄마 어디갔어요? 보고싶어요\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"Daddy, where are you?  I'm scared…\""
msgstr "\"아빠 어디갔어요 지켜줘요\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"I'm hungry\""
msgstr "\"배고파\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
