msgstr "\"엄마 아빠께 드릴 그림을 그렸는데, 아직 집에 와서 보지 못하셨어요.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I don't like the dark.  It's scary and makes me feel alone.  I wish mommy "
"and daddy were here.\""
msgstr "\"어둠은 싫어요. 무섭고 외로움을 느껴요. 엄마 아빠가 여기 계셨으면 좋겠어요.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I heard a loud noise outside last night.  It sounded like a monster.  I'm "
"scared.\""
msgstr "\"어젯밤 밖에서 큰 소리가 들렸어요. 괴물 소리 같았어요. 무서워요.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found an old teddy bear in the attic.  It reminds me of when mommy and "
"daddy used to read me stories before bed.\""
msgstr "다락방에서 낡은 곰인형을 발견했어요. 엄마 아빠가 잠자리에 들기 전에 동화책을 읽어 주시던 때가 생각나네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"I don't want to be alone anymore.  I miss mommy and daddy so much.\""
msgstr "\"더 이상 혼자 있고 싶지 않아요. 엄마 아빠가 너무 보고 싶어요.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Mommy said she would be right back, but she hasn't come home yet.  I'm "
"really scared.\""
msgstr "\"엄마가 곧 돌아올 거라고 했는데 아직 안 오셨어요. 너무 무서워요.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"I heard mommy and daddy fighting last night.  I hope they are okay.\""
msgstr "\"어젯밤에 엄마 아빠가 싸우는 소리를 들었어요. 두 분이 무사하셨으면 좋겠어요.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I miss going to school and seeing my friends.  I hope we can go back "
"soon.\""
msgstr "\"학교에 가고 친구들을 만나고 싶어요. 곧 다시 학교에 갈 수 있으면 좋겠어요.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found an old book in the attic.  It has pictures of mommy and daddy when"
" they were young.  I wish I could ask them about it.\""
msgstr ""
"다락방에서 오래된 책을 발견했어요. 엄마 아빠의 젊은 시절 사진이 실려 있었거든요. 엄마 아빠께 그 사진에 대해 여쭤볼 수 있으면 "
"좋겠어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I heard a strange noise outside last night.  It sounded like someone "
"crying.  I'm scared.\""
msgstr "\"어젯밤 밖에서 이상한 소리를 들었어요. 누군가 우는 것 같았어요. 무서워요.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"I wish mommy and daddy would come home.  I miss them so much.\""
msgstr "\"엄마 아빠가 집에 왔으면 좋겠어요. 너무 보고 싶어요.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I saw a shooting star last night.  I made a wish that mommy and daddy "
"would come home.\""
msgstr "\"어젯밤에 별똥별을 봤어요. 엄마 아빠가 집에 오셨으면 좋겠다고 빌었어요.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found an old toy car in the attic.  It reminds me of when daddy used to "
"play with me.\""
msgstr "다락방에서 오래된 장난감 자동차를 발견했어요. 아빠가 저랑 놀아주셨던 때가 생각나네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I heard a loud noise outside last night.  It scared me so much.  I wish "
"mommy and daddy were here.\""
msgstr "\"어젯밤에 밖에서 큰 소리가 들렸어요. 너무 무서웠어요. 엄마 아빠가 여기 계셨으면 좋겠어요.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid "\"I miss playing outside with my friends.  I hope we can go back soon.\""
msgstr "\"친구들과 밖에서 놀던 게 그리워요. 곧 다시 갈 수 있으면 좋겠어요.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found an old photo album in the attic.  It has pictures of our family "
"trips.  I wish we could go on another trip.\""
msgstr ""
"다락방에서 오래된 사진 앨범을 발견했어요. 우리 가족 여행 사진들이 가득 들어 있었어요. 다시 여행을 갈 수 있다면 좋겠어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I heard mommy and daddy talking about leaving.  I don't want them to go.\""
msgstr "\"엄마 아빠가 떠나는 것에 대해 이야기하는 걸 들었어요. 떠나는 걸 원하지 않아요.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I miss mommy's hugs and daddy's bedtime stories.  I hope they come home "
"soon.\""
msgstr "\"엄마의 포옹과 아빠의 잠자리 이야기들이 그리워요. 빨리 집에 왔으면 좋겠어요.\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I found an old doll in the attic.  It reminds me of when mommy used to "
"play with me.\""
msgstr "다락방에서 오래된 인형을 발견했어요. 엄마가 저랑 놀아주셨던 기억이 나네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "note_child"
#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"I heard a strange noise outside last night.  It sounded like a monster.  "
"I'm really scared.\""
msgstr "\"어젯밤 밖에서 이상한 소리를 들었어요. 괴물 소리 같았어요. 정말 무서워요.\""

