#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "log_immersion27"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid "IMMERSION LOG: 27A, INCIDENT REPORT"
msgstr "침수 기록: 27A, 사고 보고서"

#. ~ Snippet in category "log_immersion27"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"IMMERSION LOG: 27A\n"
"\n"
"INCIDENT REPORT:\n"
"\n"
"SUMMARY:\n"
"Unforeseen EM interference source forced the team to remain in-phase between prime and sub-scape 27.  Expedition members reported observing a spheroid-entity ('PE-01') moving beneath the typically opaque t-substrate.  Interference readings and expedition testimony implies the PE-01 was a potent EM radiation source, and the origin of the interference.  After 30 min, PE-01 receded and the expedition was aborted in accordance of procedure EMER-12.  The expedition team suffered no injuries during the incident.\n"
"\n"
"It's become clear we have greatly underestimated the risk posed by phase immersions.  Engineering has been tasked with designing a new, improved protection suite, and has shown promising advances.  Updated emergency procedures are in-progress.\n"
"\n"
"Refer to file EXO-I-271 for full report."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"침수 기록: 27A\n"
"\n"
"사고 보고서:\n"
"\n"
"요약:\n"
"예상치 못한 전자기 간섭원으로 인해 팀은 주경계와 하위경계 27 사이의 위상을 유지해야 했습니다. 원정대원들은 일반적으로 불투명한 t-기판 아래에서 움직이는 구형체('PE-01')를 목격했다고 보고했습니다. 간섭 측정값과 원정대 증언에 따르면 PE-01은 강력한 전자기 복사원이었으며 간섭의 근원이었습니다. 30분 후, PE-01은 후퇴했고 EMER-12 절차에 따라 원정은 중단되었습니다. 원정대는 사고 동안 부상을 입지 않았습니다.\n"
"\n"
"상침수로 인한 위험을 크게 과소평가했음이 분명해졌습니다. 엔지니어링팀은 새롭고 개선된 보호 장비를 설계하는 임무를 맡았으며, 유망한 진전을 보였습니다. 업데이트된 비상 절차가 진행 중입니다.\n"
"\n"
"전체 보고서는 EXO-I-271 파일을 참조하십시오."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "artifact_scp"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid "AI-012-PA \"Bakelite Phone\" CONTAINMENT PROCEDURE"
msgstr "AI-012-PA \"베이클라이트 전화\" 격리 절차"

#. ~ Snippet in category "artifact_scp"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"DESIGNATION AI-012-PA\n"
"\"Bakelite Phone\"\n"
"\n"
"CONTAINMENT PROCEDURE:\n"
"The object should be kept within an anechoic chamber.  Chamber should be actively monitored in case of ████████ emission leakage.\n"
"\n"
"DESCRIPTION/PARATRONICS:\n"
"An Ericsson ED 702 Bakelite phone, red variant.  The original rotary dial has been replaced by a Bakelite copy of a Yage Y103d spherical doorknob.\n"
"The phone remains fully operational, and even when unconnected to a functional landline, █████████████████████ █████████████████████████████████ ████████████.\n"
"Organic matter reacts adversely to such emissions, and the following effects have been observed during live tests: disorientation and fugue states, ████████████████████████████████, disintegration, ████████████████ followed by death.\n"
"\n"
"BACKGROUND:\n"
"Recovered during immersion ███ within a manifested copy of ███ █████ office.  The object appearance and paratronic effects are believed to be an imprint of the popular perception surrounding the ██████████/██████ ███████, even although such ███████ never existed in this shape."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"명칭 AI-012-PA\n"
"\"베이클라이트 전화기\"\n"
"\n"
"격리 절차:\n"
"해당 물체는 무반향실에 보관해야 합니다. ████████ 방출 누출 발생 시 무반향실을 적극적으로 모니터링해야 합니다.\n"
"\n"
"설명/파라트로닉스:\n"
"에릭슨 ED 702 베이클라이트 전화기(빨간색 모델). 기존 회전식 다이얼은 베이클라이트로 제작된 Yage Y103d 구형 문손잡이로 교체되었습니다.\n"
"이 전화기는 완벽하게 작동하며, 유선 전화에 연결되지 않은 경우에도 ████████████████████████████████████████████ ███████████████████████████ ██████████████.\n"
"유기물은 이러한 방출에 악영향을 미치며, 실제 실험에서 다음과 같은 효과가 관찰되었습니다. 방향 감각 상실 및 둔주 상태, ██████████████████████████████████, 붕괴, █████████████████ 이후 사망.\n"
"\n"
"배경:\n"
"███ █████ 사무실의 복제품에 ███ 침수되는 동안 회수되었습니다. 물체의 외형과 파라트로닉스 효과는 █████████/██████ ███████에 대한 대중의 인식이 각인된 것으로 여겨지지만, 그러한 ███████가 이러한 형태로 존재하지 않았음에도 불구하고 그렇습니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "artifact_scp"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid "AI-017-PA \"Golden Comb\" CONTAINMENT PROCEDURE"
msgstr "AI-017-PA \"골든 콤\" 격리 절차"

#. ~ Snippet in category "artifact_scp"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"DESIGNATION AI-017-PA\n"
"\"Golden Comb\"\n"
"\n"
"CONTAINMENT PROCEDURE:\n"
"The object should be kept within a sealed chamber, procedure AI-G-12 should be followed while handling the object.\n"
"\n"
"DESCRIPTION/PARATRONICS:\n"
"Handle-less comb.  Dimensions: 9 by 4 cm.  Weight: 650g.  Surface lustre indicates a covering of 18-22 karat gold.  The comb's shaft is engraved with faded-rectangular patterns.  The possibility of such engravings representing an unknown language has been explored to inconclusive results.\n"
"\n"
"Resonant frequencies produced by stroking the █████ █████ can leak into ███ █████████ which might then produce time-spatial alterations within prime.\n"
"\n"
"BACKGROUND:\n"
"Found during immersion ███ by Agent Id.  ███ who kept a plastic comb of similar dimensions within their lab locker.  Original manifestation of the object might have been a synchronistic phenomenon."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"명칭 AI-017-PA\n"
"\"황금 빗\"\n"
"\n"
"격리 절차:\n"
"본 물체는 밀폐된 방에 보관해야 하며, 물체를 취급하는 동안 AI-G-12 절차를 따라야 합니다.\n"
"\n"
"설명/파라트로닉스:\n"
"손잡이 없는 빗. 크기: 9cm x 4cm. 무게: 650g. 표면 광택은 18~22캐럿 금으로 코팅되었음을 나타냅니다. 빗의 몸체에는 희미한 직사각형 무늬가 새겨져 있습니다. 이러한 무늬가 알려지지 않은 언어를 나타낼 가능성에 대한 연구가 진행되었지만, 확실한 결과는 나오지 않았습니다.\n"
"\n"
"█████ █████를 쓰다듬을 때 발생하는 공명 주파수가 ███ █████████로 누출되어 프라임 내에서 시공간적 변화를 일으킬 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"배경:\n"
"███ 요원이 침수 중 발견함. ███는 실험실 사물함에 비슷한 크기의 플라스틱 빗을 보관하고 있었습니다. 이 물체의 원래 모습은 동시성 현상이었을 가능성이 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "artifact_scp"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid "AI-009-PA \"Keyring\" CONTAINMENT PROCEDURE"
msgstr "AI-009-PA \"열쇠고리\" 격리 절차"

#. ~ Snippet in category "artifact_scp"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"DESIGNATION AI-009-PA\n"
"\"Keyring\"\n"
"\n"
"CONTAINMENT PROCEDURE:\n"
"███ █████████████████████████████████ ████████ inert ██████ ██████ ██████ █████████████████ ██████ ████████ away from personnel.\n"
"\n"
"Interaction █████ █████ angular ████████ ██████, ██ ████ ████ ███████ ███ premises ██ █████████.  ████████ ███████ '█████ ██ ████████' █████ ███ ███████████ ████████ security protocol ██-███.  SHOOT TO KILL.\n"
"\n"
"DESCRIPTION/PARATRONICS:\n"
"Smooth ███ ████ material unknown ████████ ███ ████ █████████████ █████ ████████ ████ impossible, ███ ██████ ██ ██ ██ discouraged.\n"
"\n"
"█████████ ███████ █████ ██████████ █████ ████████████ heavy explosives.  ████ ███████████ █████ █████████████████████████████████████████ ███████ ██████ █████████████ █████ ███ ██████████████████████ ██████████████████ ██████████████████ with luck ██ ████████ ███████████████.\n"
"\n"
"BACKGROUND:\n"
"█████ ██████ ███████ during immersion ███ was successfully intercepted █████████████████ ██████████ █████ rumored leak ██████████████████████████.\n"
"\n"
"QUEUED FOR DESTRUCTION."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"지정 AI-009-PA\n"
"\"열쇠고리\"\n"
"\n"
"격리 절차:\n"
"███ ████████████████████████████████████ ███████ 비활성 ██████ ██████ ██████ ███████████████ ████████ ████████ 인원으로부터 멀리하십시오.\n"
"\n"
"상호작용 █████ █████ 모난 ████████ ██████, ██ ████ ████ ███████ ███ 건물 ██ █████████. ████████ ███████ '█████ ██ ████████' █████ ███ ███████████ █████████ 보안 프로토콜 ██-███. 사살하라.\n"
"\n"
"설명/파라트로닉스:\n"
"매끄러운 ███ ████ 알려지지 않은 물질 ████████ ███ ████ ████████████ ████ ████████ ████ 불가능, ███ ██████ ██ ██ ██ 권장하지 않음.\n"
"\n"
"█████████ ███████ █████ ███████████ █████ ████████████ 중화기. ████ ███████████ █████ ██████████████████████████████████████████ ██████ ██████ ████████████████ █████ ████████████████████ ██████████████████ █████████████████ █████████████████ 행운을 빌어 ██ ████████ ███████████████.\n"
"\n"
"배경:\n"
"█████ ██████ ███████ 침수 중 ███가 성공적으로 차단되었습니다. ██████████████████ ██████████ █████ 누출 소문이 돌았습니다. ███████████████████████████.\n"
"\n"
"파기 대기 중."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "artifact_scp"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid "AI-021-PA \"Rubik's Cube\" CONTAINMENT PROCEDURE"
msgstr "AI-021-PA \"루빅 큐브\" 격리 절차"

#. ~ Snippet in category "artifact_scp"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"DESIGNATION AI-021-PA\n"
"\"Rubik's Cube\"\n"
"\n"
"CONTAINMENT PROCEDURE:\n"
"The object should be kept within a sealed chamber and away from sight.\n"
"\n"
"DESCRIPTION/PARATRONICS:\n"
"Solid t-substrate cube.  The dimensions and engravings of the object match those found on a Rubik's Cube.\n"
"\n"
"Prolonged observation of the cube might produce ███████ ████████████ in sensitive individuals.  Direct interaction with the object will reproduce the effects with greater consistence.\n"
"\n"
"BACKGROUND:\n"
"Found within the quarters of away team ███ after immersion ███.  Interrogative procedures confirmed the claims that the object █████████████ ██████████.  The implementation of M█████████ assisted isolation protocols have prevented similar incidents."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"명칭 AI-021-PA\n"
"\"루빅 큐브\"\n"
"\n"
"격리 절차:\n"
"해당 물체는 밀폐된 방 안에 보관하고 시야에서 멀리해야 합니다.\n"
"\n"
"설명/파라트로닉스:\n"
"단단한 T-기판 큐브. 물체의 크기와 문양은 루빅 큐브에서 발견되는 것과 일치합니다.\n"
"\n"
"큐브를 장시간 관찰할 경우 민감한 사람에게 ███████ █████████████ 현상이 나타날 수 있습니다. 물체와 직접 상호 작용하면 효과가 더욱 일관되게 재현됩니다.\n"
"\n"
"배경:\n"
"███ 침수 후 ███ 팀 숙소 내에서 발견되었습니다. 심문 절차를 통해 해당 물체가 █████████████ ██████████라는 주장이 확인되었습니다. M█████████ 지원 격리 프로토콜을 시행하여 유사한 사건이 예방되었습니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "monitoring_equipment"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid "MONITORING USING SEISMOGRAPHIC RECORDING"
msgstr "지진계 기록을 이용한 모니터링"

#. ~ Snippet in category "monitoring_equipment"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"SEISMOGRAPHIC RECORDING\n"
"\n"
"A  ████████████████ seismograph, originally brought to serve as office decoration, proved sensitive to the energy signatures produced by trans-planar resonances following a ████████ ██████ event.  The cause of this sensitivity remains unknown, with leading theories speculating that the steel alloy used for its fabrication might contain trace amounts of exotic elements; or that the design of the seismograph itself might somehow reflect trans-planar configurations, allowing it to serve as 5-point-antenna.  We have already requested the acquisition of several identical seismographs, for further experimentation."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"지진 기록\n"
"\n"
"원래 사무실 장식용으로 사용되었던 ████████████████ 지진계는 ████████ ██████ 사건 이후 평면 간 공진으로 생성된 에너지 신호에 민감하게 반응하는 것으로 나타났습니다. 이러한 민감도의 원인은 아직 밝혀지지 않았으며, 주요 이론으로는 지진계 제작에 사용된 강철 합금에 미량의 이질적인 원소가 포함되어 있거나, 지진계 자체의 설계가 평면 간 구조를 반영하여 5점 안테나 역할을 할 수 있다는 추측이 있습니다. 추가 실험을 위해 이미 동일한 지진계 여러 대를 요청했습니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "monitoring_equipment"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid "SECURITY ADVISORY"
msgstr "보안 권고"

#. ~ Snippet in category "monitoring_equipment"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"SECURITY ADVISORY\n"
"\n"
"When approaching or examining exotic material, ensure your 5-point-anchor remains active at all times.  You might not feel any different, but it will keep your insides from become physics during an unexpected resonance event."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"보안 권고\n"
"\n"
"이색적인 물질에 접근하거나 조사할 때는 5점 앵커를 항상 활성화해 두십시오. 별다른 변화는 없을 수 있지만, 예상치 못한 공명 현상 발생 시 내부가 물리적인 충격을 받는 것을 방지할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "monitoring_equipment"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid "scp complaint"
msgstr "SCP 불만"

#. ~ Snippet in category "monitoring_equipment"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid ""
"Whoever decided to transcribe my lab reports into farcical entries of the 'SCP Foundation' and proceeded to distribute the edited reports across the lab should be aware that: not only did I not find this 'joke' funny, but that such actions are also considered to be in breach of your confidentiality agreement.  A breach that I will see appropriately punished.\n"
"\n"
"------\n"
"Dr. Ethan Catherwood\n"
"Physics Department"
msgstr ""
"제 연구 보고서를 'SCP 재단'이라는 우스꽝스러운 항목으로 바꿔 쓰고 편집된 보고서를 연구실 전체에 배포한 사람은 다음 사실을 알아야 합니다. 저는 이 '농담'이 재미없을 뿐만 아니라, 그러한 행위는 기밀 유지 계약을 위반하는 것으로 간주됩니다. 이러한 위반 행위는 마땅히 처벌받을 것입니다.\n"
"\n"
"------\n"
"이선 캐서우드 박사\n"
"물리학과"

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "t-substrate"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid "ANALYSIS OF TRANSPLANAR MATERIALS: \"T-SUBSTRATE\""
msgstr "평면을 넘나드는 재료의 분석: \"T-기판\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "t-substrate"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"ANALYSIS OF TRANSPLANAR MATERIALS\n"
"\n"
"T-SUBSTRATE\n"
"\n"
"SUMMARY:\n"
"The material henceforth named t-substrate is the naturally occurring 'floor' material of phase-space.  Samples of t-substrate were first recovered during IMMERSION-25A, when upon return to prime the samples violently █████████████, exhibiting what are now known as 'plane-uneven' physical properties.  The following report will examine such variances to the best extent of our knowledge.\n"
"\n"
"Refer to file EXO-M-312 for full report."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"평면상 물질 분석\n"
"\n"
"T-기판\n"
"\n"
"요약:\n"
"이제부터 t-기판으로 명명되는 물질은 상공간의 자연적으로 발생하는 '바닥' 물질입니다. t-기판 시료는 IMMERSION-25A 실험 중에 처음 회수되었으며, 프라이밍을 위해 다시 투입되었을 때 시료는 격렬하게 ██████████████로 변성되어 현재 '평면-불균형'으로 알려진 물리적 특성을 나타냈습니다. 다음 보고서에서는 이러한 변이를 저희가 아는 한 최대한 자세히 검토할 것입니다.\n"
"\n"
"전체 보고서는 EXO-M-312 파일을 참조하십시오."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "HAADF_t-substrate"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid "ANALYSIS OF TRANSPLANAR MATERIALS: \"T-SUBSTRATE\", HAADF MICROGRAPH"
msgstr "평면을 넘나드는 재료 분석: \"T-기판\", HAADF 현미경 사진"

#. ~ Snippet in category "HAADF_t-substrate"
#: data/json/snippets/dimensional_exploration.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"ANALYSIS OF TRANSPLANAR MATERIALS\n"
"\n"
"T-SUBSTRATE\n"
"\n"
"HAADF MICROGRAPH:\n"
"An atomic-scale photograph shows only a completely smooth red surface.  In the lower left corner the phrase 'Not made of atoms?!' is scrawled with a blue pen.\n"
"\n"
"Refer to file EXO-M-312 for full report."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"평면상 물질 분석\n"
"\n"
"T-기판\n"
"\n"
"HAADF 현미경 사진:\n"
"원자 크기의 사진은 완전히 매끄러운 붉은색 표면만을 보여줍니다. 왼쪽 하단에는 '원자로 만들어지지 않았어?!'라는 문구가 파란색 펜으로 휘갈겨 쓰여 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"전체 보고서는 EXO-M-312 파일을 참조하십시오."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Fallen government transmission"
msgstr "타락한 정부 전파"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"EAS_apr_25,_15.57.mp3\n"
"\n"
"The file begins with complete silence, but then, a tired voice breaks the stillness:\n"
"\n"
"\"My name is Clayton Gore, I am the head of [unintelligible].\n"
"\n"
"I'm sorry, I WAS the head of [unintelligible].\n"
"\n"
"I am speaking to you using the remains of the Emergency Alert System, with everything we have left here.\n"
"\n"
"This is the final message.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"The government has fallen.\n"
"\n"
"There is nothing left.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"No help is coming.  Use your weapons, clubs, fists and teeth to survive this hard time.\n"
"\n"
"No one will arrest you.\n"
"\n"
"No one will help you.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"You're on your own.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"End of transmission.\""
msgstr ""
"EAS_apr_25,_15.57.mp3\n"
"\n"
"파일은 완전한 침묵으로 시작하지만, 곧 지친 목소리가 정적을 깨뜨린다.\n"
"\n"
"\"제 이름은 클레이튼 고어입니다. 저는 [알아들을 수 없음]의 수장입니다.\n"
"\n"
"죄송합니다. 저는 [알아들을 수 없음]의 수장이었습니다.\n"
"\n"
"저는 비상 경보 시스템의 잔해와 여기에 남은 모든 것을 사용하여 여러분께 말씀드립니다.\n"
"\n"
"이것이 마지막 메시지입니다.\n"
"\n"
"정부는 무너졌습니다.\n"
"\n"
"아무것도 남지 않았습니다.\n"
"\n"
"아무도 도와주지 않을 것입니다. 무기, 곤봉, 주먹, 이빨을 사용하여 이 힘든 시기를 견뎌내십시오.\n"
"\n"
"아무도 당신을 체포하지 않을 것입니다.\n"
"\n"
"아무도 당신을 도와주지 않을 것입니다.\n"
"\n"
"당신은 스스로 해내야 합니다.\n"
"\n"
"송신 종료.\""

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Photo of riots"
msgstr "폭동 사진"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"IMG_202X0401_111567.jpg\n"
"\n"
"A high quality photo of an angry civil mob that suppressed a line of shielded policemen.  There are a few dead people on the edge of the photo, one of which lays with a chopped off head."
msgstr ""
"IMG_202X0401_111567.jpg\n"
"\n"
"방패를 두른 경찰들을 진압하는 분노한 시민 군중의 고화질 사진입니다. 사진 가장자리에는 시신 몇 구가 보이는데, 그중 한 명은 머리가 잘린 채 누워 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "HR mail of some company"
msgstr "어떤 회사의 인사 메일"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"apps/myMail\n"
"\n"
"by:dnance@mymail.com\n"
"to:All\n"
"Subject: Tragic Loss of Rob Dixon\n"
"\n"
"Dear Colleagues,\n"
"\n"
"It is with a heavy heart that I have to inform you all of the passing of the head of the supply chain department, Rob Dixon.  He was at the office late last night trying to ensure that everything was under control when he was caught in one of the riots that have been happening all over the city.  Despite all the efforts, Rob did not make it.\n"
"Rob was more than just a boss to us, he was a friend and a mentor to many of us.  Rob always put the company and its employees first and he will be deeply missed.\n"
"Please keep Rob's family and loved ones in your thoughts and prayers during this difficult time.  The company is working closely with the authorities to ensure that Rob's death is fully investigated.\n"
"\n"
"In the meantime, all of Rob's responsibilities will be temporarily handled by James Sullivan, his senior assistant.  If you have any urgent matters, please reach out to James.\n"
"We will provide updates as they become available and further details on arrangements to celebrate Rob's life.\n"
"\n"
"Sincerely,\n"
"Dahila Nance\n"
"Head of HR department."
msgstr ""
"apps/myMail\n"
"\n"
"by:dnance@mymail.com\n"
"to:All\n"
"Subject: 롭 딕슨의 비극적인 죽음\n"
"\n"
"동료 여러분께,\n"
"\n"
"공급망 부서 책임자였던 롭 딕슨의 부고를 진심으로 전합니다. 그는 어젯밤 늦게 사무실에서 모든 것을 통제하려 애쓰다가 최근 도시 곳곳에서 벌어지고 있는 폭동 중 하나에 휘말렸습니다. 모든 노력에도 불구하고 롭은 세상을 떠났습니다.\n"
"롭은 우리에게 단순한 상사가 아니라 친구이자 멘토였습니다. 롭은 항상 회사와 직원을 최우선으로 생각했으며, 그의 죽음은 깊이 애도될 것입니다.\n"
"이 어려운 시기에 롭의 가족과 사랑하는 사람들을 항상 생각하며 기도해 주시기 바랍니다. 회사는 롭의 죽음에 대한 철저한 조사를 위해 당국과 긴밀히 협력하고 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"그동안 롭의 모든 업무는 그의 수석 비서인 제임스 설리번이 임시로 맡을 예정입니다. 긴급한 사항이 있으시면 James에게 연락해 주세요.\n"
"Rob의 추모 행사에 대한 자세한 내용과 최신 소식이 나오는 대로 알려드리겠습니다.\n"
"\n"
"감사합니다.\n"
"Dahila Nance\n"
"인사부장"

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "chat about mutants"
msgstr "뮤턴트에 대해 이야기하다"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"apps/Harmony\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: Dude, just met the most fucking terrifying thing in my life.  I was on my way home and I saw this deer on the side of the road and I had to do a double take because it had EIGHT legs!\n"
"\n"
"W. F. Gibson (real): bro are you high?\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: I'm serious!\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: I almost pissed my pants!\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: There was also something wrong with the eyes, but I didn't focus\n"
"\n"
"W. F. Gibson (real): Did you take a picture or something?\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: I think I got it on my dashcam, but I don't think it worked well - I stepped on a gas with full force because it started to approach me, almost killed myself\n"
"\n"
"W. F. Gibson (real): Mad things happened in the last few weeks, yeah\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: Yeah, it was bad.  I've been hearing all these stories about weird things happening and now I've seen it for myself\n"
"\n"
"W. F. Gibson (real): Maybe I need to buy a shotgun or two."
msgstr ""
"apps/Harmony\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: 야, 방금 내 인생에서 제일 끔찍한 걸 봤어. 집에 가는 길에 길가에 사슴이 있길래 두 번이나 봤어. 다리가 여덟 개나 있더라고!\n"
"\n"
"W. F. Gibson (진짜): 형, 약 먹었어?\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: 진심이야!\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: 바지에 오줌 누는 줄 알았어!\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: 눈에도 뭔가 문제가 있었는데 초점을 못 잡았어.\n"
"\n"
"W. F. Gibson (진짜): 사진이라도 찍었어?\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: 블랙박스에 찍힌 것 같은데, 잘 안 된 것 같아. 사슴이 다가오길래 가속 페달을 힘껏 밟았는데, 거의 죽을 뻔했어.\n"
"\n"
"W. F. Gibson (진짜): 지난 몇 주 동안 정말 끔찍한 일들이 많았지.\n"
"\n"
"legendary_steak: 응, 정말 심했어. 이상한 일들이 벌어진다는 이야기를 많이 들었는데, 이제 직접 봤습니다.\n"
"\n"
"W. F. 깁슨(실제): 산탄총 한두 자루 사야 할 것 같아요."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Selfie with a monster"
msgstr "괴물과 셀카"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"One of the more recent photos is a bald man with a beard taking a selfie on "
"a trail, with a tall black figure - that you recognize as one of the "
"monsters you saw mindlessly wandering around - in the midground facing him."
"  The man's face is a mixture of confusion and an awkward smile."
msgstr ""
"최근 사진 중 하나는 수염을 기른 대머리 남자가 오솔길에서 셀카를 찍고 있는 모습입니다. 사진 한가운데에는 키 큰 검은 형체가 있는데, "
"그 형체는 당신이 정신없이 돌아다니던 괴물 중 하나로 알고 있는 인물입니다. 남자의 얼굴은 혼란스러움과 어색한 미소가 뒤섞여 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Rat infestation"
msgstr "쥐 침입"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"This is a video that was taken in a subway train.  Someone is obviously "
"giggling at someone reading a comically large newspaper when the train "
"suddenly halts and an unnaturally big rat scurries off into the darkness, "
"barely visible but its eyes reflect the light from the interior of the "
"train.  You can hear a muffled \"What the fuck\" and the video ends with the"
" train continuing to the next station."
msgstr ""
"지하철 안에서 촬영된 영상입니다. 누군가 우스꽝스러울 정도로 큰 신문을 읽는 모습을 보고 낄낄거리는 순간, 갑자기 기차가 멈추고 "
"비정상적으로 큰 쥐 한 마리가 어둠 속으로 쏜살같이 사라집니다. 쥐의 눈은 기차 내부의 빛을 반사하며 거의 보이지 않습니다. \"뭐야, "
"씨발\"이라는 웅얼거리는 소리가 들리고, 영상은 기차가 다음 역으로 향하는 장면으로 끝납니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Forum question about unknown plant"
msgstr "알 수 없는 식물에 대한 포럼 질문"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"A screenshot of a post in a very vintage looking forum about plants.\n"
"\n"
"Subject: Help identifying these weeds\n"
"Author: WildVariety\n"
"\n"
"\"I tried making my garden more suitable for bees and other insects by using native flora but these poppies are looking unusual.  Are these really poppies?  I can't stand their smell, it makes me feel woozy.\"\n"
"\n"
"An image is attached, showing a giant red flower with roots visible above ground."
msgstr ""
"식물에 대한 아주 고풍스러운 포럼에 올라온 글의 스크린샷입니다.\n"
"\n"
"제목: 이 잡초들을 구별하는 데 도움을 주세요\n"
"작성자: WildVariety\n"
"\n"
"\"토종 식물을 사용해서 벌과 다른 곤충들이 살기 좋은 정원을 만들려고 했는데, 이 양귀비들이 좀 이상해 보이네요. 정말 양귀비인가요? 냄새를 참을 수가 없어요. 어지러워요.\"\n"
"\n"
"첨부된 사진에는 땅 위로 뿌리가 드러난 거대한 붉은 꽃이 보입니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Kitten on hunting"
msgstr "사냥하는 새끼 고양이"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"untitled2047-1803.mp4\n"
"\n"
"The video shows a patio door and some happy meowing can be heard.\n"
"\"Aww, Muffin, have you slain a leaf or grass hopper again?\" a feminine voice asks.  A cat appears in front of the door and drops a crow, dripping with black goo.  \"Eww, you shouldn't hunt birds!\", she turns around and is visibly nervous.  \"Honey, what the hell is that?  Was that poor bird caught in an oil spill?\""
msgstr ""
"untitled2047-1803.mp4\n"
"\n"
"동영상에는 파티오 문이 보이고, 행복한 야옹 소리가 들립니다.\n"
"\"아, 머핀, 또 나뭇잎이나 메뚜기를 죽였어?\" 여자 목소리가 묻습니다. 고양이 한 마리가 문 앞에 나타나 검은 점액이 뚝뚝 떨어지는 까마귀를 떨어뜨립니다. \"으, 새 사냥하면 안 돼!\" 그녀는 돌아서서 눈에 띄게 불안해합니다. \"여보, 저게 뭐야? 저 불쌍한 새가 기름 유출 사고에 휘말린 거야?\""

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Some meme"
msgstr "어떤 밈"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"An image of a man labeled \"Trends this year\" is gawking at a woman labeled"
" \"Prepping\".  An obviously jealous girlfriend right next to him is labeled"
" \"Hoverboarding\"."
msgstr ""
"\"올해의 트렌드\"라고 적힌 남자가 \"준비 중\"이라고 적힌 여자를 멍하니 바라보고 있다. 그의 바로 옆에는 질투심이 가득한 "
"여자친구가 \"호버보딩 중\"이라고 적혀 있다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Zombie photos"
msgstr "좀비 사진"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"A series of 39 photographs were taken in the span of 2 minutes, all of them "
"blurry and only lit by the phone's camera flash, of a street in the dark.  "
"The final 2 photographs have the vague outline of several zombies in the "
"background, the camera flash reflecting in their eyes."
msgstr ""
"2분 동안 39장의 사진이 촬영되었는데, 모두 흐릿하고 휴대폰 카메라 플래시로만 비춰진 어둠 속 거리의 모습입니다. 마지막 두 장의 "
"사진에는 배경에 좀비 여러 마리의 윤곽이 희미하게 드러나 있고, 카메라 플래시가 좀비들의 눈에 반사되어 보입니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "notes.txt"
msgstr "메모.txt"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"notes.txt\n"
"\n"
"Don't go in <city>, big horde 25-50\n"
"Watch for black goop\n"
"They get up after death, smash corpse\n"
"Gov building outside town, almost died, secrets???\n"
"Feed Besse 3 times daily\n"
"Don't eat the <zombie>s\n"
"Big community up north, good spot?\n"
"Rhode Island still good?  Heard rumors"
msgstr ""
"notes.txt\n"
"\n"
"<city>에 가지 마세요. 25~50명 규모의 큰 무리가 있습니다.\n"
"검은색 끈적끈적한 것을 조심하세요.\n"
"죽은 후에 일어나 시체를 부수세요.\n"
"마을 바깥에 정부 청사가 있는데, 거의 죽을 뻔했어요. 비밀이 있나요???\n"
"베시에게 하루에 세 번 먹이를 주세요.\n"
"<zombies>를 먹지 마세요.\n"
"북쪽에 큰 마을이 있는데, 괜찮은 곳인가요?\n"
"로드아일랜드는 아직도 괜찮은가요? 소문을 들었어요."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "unsent message"
msgstr "보내지 않은 메시지"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"A series of messages from the chat app\n"
"\"HONEY!!!\"\n"
"\"Take the kids and hide in the basement, I don't care if the roach exterminator hasn't arrived yet, there is a huge riot happening out there!  I will come back from work once the riot has settled down, i stuck in traffic.  Please stay safe!  I love you!\"\n"
"The message is highlighted in red, as it was not sent."
msgstr ""
"채팅 앱에서 온 일련의 메시지\n"
"\"여보!!!\"\n"
"\"아이들 데리고 지하실에 숨어. 바퀴벌레 퇴치업체가 아직 안 와도 상관없어. 밖에서 엄청난 소란이 벌어지고 있어! 소란이 가라앉으면 퇴근할게. 교통 체증에 갇혀 있어. 제발 안전히 있어! 사랑해!\"\n"
"메시지는 전송되지 않았으므로 빨간색으로 강조 표시되어 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "video of mutated crabs"
msgstr "돌연변이 게의 영상"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"untitled2047-1919.mp4\n"
"The video is taken by a person poking a black motionless crab-looking creature with a stick.  They try to flip the creature over, when it moves and suddenly jumps towards the camera.  You hear a scream and some distant shuffling, but for the next 2 hours and 24 minutes the video seems to contain only clouds slowly passing by the dropped smartphone until its battery dies."
msgstr ""
"untitled2047-1919.mp4\n"
"이 영상은 한 남자가 검은색의 움직이지 않는 게처럼 생긴 생물을 막대기로 찌르는 장면입니다. 그들은 그 생물을 뒤집으려 하는데, 생물이 움직이더니 갑자기 카메라를 향해 뛰어듭니다. 비명 소리와 멀리서 들려오는 발소리가 들리지만, 이후 2시간 24분 동안은 떨어진 스마트폰을 천천히 지나가는 구름만 보이며, 배터리가 방전될 때까지 영상은 계속됩니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "photo of fungalized house"
msgstr "곰팡이가 핀 집 사진"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Photo of a square, white room with no furniture apart from a fridge against "
"the farthest wall, and some sort of mucus coating the floor."
msgstr "가장 먼 벽에 냉장고가 있고, 바닥에는 어떤 종류의 점액이 덮여 있는 정사각형의 흰색 방의 사진입니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "video of caseless handgun"
msgstr "무탄피 권총 영상"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Downloads/taufledermaus_8x40_shooting.mp4.\n"
"\n"
"A middle aged man in a field shows off some pricey looking caseless cartridges for an even pricier looking handgun, before shooting them at a range of targets.  A slo-mo camera catches the shots ripping through a block of ballistic gel like air."
msgstr ""
"다운로드/taufledermaus_8x40_shooting.mp4\n"
"\n"
"들판에서 한 중년 남성이 더 비싼 권총을 위해 값비싼 무탄피 카트리지를 자랑스럽게 보여주며, 여러 표적에 총을 쏘고 있습니다. 슬로모션 카메라는 탄도 젤처럼 생긴 공기 덩어리를 뚫고 지나가는 총탄을 포착합니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "LARP went wrong"
msgstr "LARP가 잘못되었습니다"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"One big footage for some live-action roleplay game, which is mostly "
"unremarkable until some guy with bloodstained clothes arrives running and "
"panting.  \"We need to evacuate.  Hayneth went crazy and someone brought "
"real steel weapons.  It's a bloodbath.  Everyone fights against everyone and"
" it has become one hell of a brawl.  Tim, call the cops right NOW.\" As the "
"camera man utters \"Are… are you serious, dude?\" in disbelief, a bloodied "
"warrior clad in foam armor can be seen in the distance and emits a "
"bloodcurdling war cry.  \"Shit!\", the camera man turns around.  After a "
"couple seconds of very shaky forest floor impressions, the video ends."
msgstr ""
"실사 롤플레잉 게임용 대형 영상 하나. 피 묻은 옷을 입은 남자가 헐떡이며 달려오기 전까지는 별 볼일 없어 보인다. \"대피해야 해. "
"헤이네스가 미쳐서 누군가 진짜 강철 무기를 가져왔어. 피바다야. 모두가 서로 싸우고, 그야말로 난장판이 됐어. 팀, 당장 경찰에 "
"신고해.\" 카메라맨이 믿을 수 없다는 듯 \"진짜야, 친구?\"라고 중얼거리는 순간, 멀리서 폼 갑옷을 입은 피투성이 전사가 나타나 "
"소름 끼치는 함성을 질렀다. \"젠장!\" 카메라맨이 돌아섰다. 몇 초 동안 숲 속 바닥을 훑는 듯한 장면이 나온 후 영상이 끝났다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Some Harry Potter meme"
msgstr "해리포터 밈"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"An image of a big, matted man from some movie, with text \"You're a feral, "
"Harry\"."
msgstr "어떤 영화에서 나온 덩치 크고 털이 엉킨 남자의 사진과 함께 \"너는 야만인이야, 해리\"라는 글이 적혀 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "CCTV of nuclear detonation"
msgstr "핵폭발 CCTV"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"A short, silent CCTV tape of some small rest stop near a highway.  The whole"
" video is pretty glitched, and some parts are completely pitch black.  Near "
"the end, a huge explosion can be seen on the horizon, all while the camera "
"obviously malfunctions.  After a second, a grim and unnervingly familiar "
"mushroom cloud rises from the same spot, and the video ends."
msgstr ""
"고속도로 근처 작은 휴게소를 담은 짧고 조용한 CCTV 영상. 영상 전체가 꽤 깨져 있고, 어떤 부분은 완전히 어둡습니다. 영상이 끝나갈"
" 무렵, 지평선에서 거대한 폭발이 보이는데, 카메라가 제대로 작동하지 않는 게 분명합니다. 잠시 후, 같은 지점에서 음침하고도 불안하게 "
"익숙한 버섯구름이 솟아오르고 영상은 끝납니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Video of conspiracy theorist"
msgstr "음모론자의 영상"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Downloads/government_lies_to_you.mp4\n"
"\n"
"A 20 minute video of some freak with a lot of trinkets on his body, who tries to explain that the mass hysteria cases aren't caused by Chinese mind control agents.  His own version, that it was the work of \"mushroom people I saw a few days ago\" doesn't sound correct either."
msgstr ""
"다운로드/government_lies_to_you.mp4\n"
"\n"
"온몸에 장신구를 잔뜩 달고 다니는 괴짜가 등장하는 20분짜리 영상에서, 그는 집단 히스테리 사건이 중국 마인드 컨트롤 요원들의 소행이 아니라고 설명하려 합니다. \"며칠 전에 본 버섯 사람들\"의 소행이라는 그의 주장도 옳지 않아 보입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"An image from some movie, featuring a funky long-haired man, that says \"The"
" last 24 hours have been really exciting\"."
msgstr "어떤 영화의 한 장면. 긴 머리의 멋진 남자가 등장하는데, \"지난 24시간은 정말 흥미진진했습니다\"라는 문구가 적혀 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Weird CCTV footage"
msgstr "이상한 CCTV 영상"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"Monochrome security camera footage of an intersection that was recorded on April 15th.\n"
"\n"
"23:39: A person tries to cross the road, when suddenly a car hits them at full speed.  The driver drives away from the accident, while the body is left where it is.\n"
"23:50: Another person tries to cross the road, when suddenly a car runs the person over at full speed.  The driver drives away from the accident, while the body is left near the first victim.\n"
"00:01: Some person tries to cross the road, when suddenly a car hits the person at full speed.  The driver drives away from the accident, with the third body near the original two\n"
"The tape was cut here, to show the very end of the story\n"
"4:15: you see a giant pile of corpses, of at least two dozen bodies, each wearing the same set of clothes.  Despite this, it seems that both drivers and pedestrians do not care about it, simply trying to drive around the pile.  Another person tries to cross the road, when suddenly a car hits them at breakneck speed.  The driver seems unable to drive away, as the car is stuck in the pile, so they leave the car, and try to push it out.  Some passing pedestrians try to help them, and with some help the car gets unstuck.  The driver drives away from the intersection, and the tape ends."
msgstr ""
"4월 15일에 촬영된 교차로의 흑백 CCTV 영상입니다.\n"
"\n"
"23:39: 한 사람이 길을 건너려 하는데 갑자기 차 한 대가 전속력으로 사람을 들이받습니다. 운전자는 사고 현장에서 차를 몰고 도망가고, 시신은 그 자리에 그대로 버려집니다.\n"
"23:50: 또 다른 사람이 길을 건너려 하는데 갑자기 차 한 대가 전속력으로 사람을 들이받습니다. 운전자는 사고 현장에서 차를 몰고 도망가고, 시신은 첫 번째 희생자 근처에 그대로 버려집니다.\n"
"00:01: 한 사람이 길을 건너려 하는데 갑자기 차 한 대가 전속력으로 사람을 들이받습니다. 운전자는 사고 현장에서 차를 몰고 도망가고, 세 번째 시신은 원래 두 시신 근처에 그대로 버려집니다.\n"
"이 영상은 사건의 마지막 장면을 보여주기 위해 편집되었습니다.\n"
"4:15: 최소 20구 이상의 시신이 산더미처럼 쌓여 있는 모습이 보입니다. 모두 같은 옷을 입고 있습니다. 하지만 운전자와 보행자 모두 시신 더미를 신경 쓰지 않고 그저 그 주변을 돌아가려고만 합니다. 또 다른 사람이 길을 건너려는데, 갑자기 차 한 대가 숨 막히는 속도로 그를 덮칩니다. 차가 엉켜 있는 탓에 운전자는 차를 몰고 나갈 수 없어 차에서 내려 밀어내려고 합니다. 지나가던 보행자들이 그들을 도우려 하고, 몇몇의 도움으로 차는 빠져나옵니다. 운전자는 교차로를 벗어나고, 테이프는 끝납니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Photo of sliced piece of house"
msgstr "집의 일부를 잘라낸 사진"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"The photo depicts a serene and well-maintained terrace basked in warm, clear"
" weather.  The central part of the picture is an intriguing sight, where a "
"section of the terrace and a portion of the building behind it appear to "
"have been cleanly removed, as if erased from reality.  To the side, there is"
" a shattered flower pot, spilling out its soil and a plant with long, broad "
"leaves, some of which have also been cut away in a sharp, clean fashion, "
"almost as if sliced with a knife."
msgstr ""
"이 사진은 따뜻하고 맑은 날씨에 고요하고 잘 관리된 테라스를 담고 있습니다. 사진의 중앙 부분은 흥미로운 광경으로, 테라스의 일부와 그 "
"뒤편 건물의 일부가 현실에서 지워진 듯 깨끗하게 제거된 것처럼 보입니다. 옆에는 흙이 쏟아져 나온 깨진 화분과 길고 넓은 잎을 가진 "
"식물이 있는데, 그중 일부는 마치 칼로 자른 것처럼 날카롭고 깔끔하게 잘려 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid "Footage of army assault"
msgstr "군대 공격 영상"

#. ~ Snippet in category "local_files_simple"
#. ~ mostly work of random people: chat logs, SMSes, popular photos and videos
#. that people share, or something they can film by themselves.
#: data/json/snippets/e_logs.json
msgid ""
"untitled2047-2842.mp4\n"
"The video starts with a shaky view of a deserted city street, filmed through a pane of glass framed by drawn curtains.  The grind of tracks and base-growl of an engine dominate the choppy audio as an Abrams tank rumbles into view, flanked by several squads of armed soldiers running beside the vehicle.  Locked behind the rubber shell of a gas mask, each man carries an automatic rifle, skulking carefully along the sides of the tank as the group proceeds down the road.  As the view pans, a soldier leading the column briefly pauses by a blown-open cellar, the cameraman audibly whispering hurried prayers as the infantryman trains their rifle on the abyss.  The view jerks sharply as a glistening, artery-like appendage writhes from an unseen point, crashing through the soldier's mask and bursting out the back of their skull before yanking them from the ground.  The desperate liturgies grow louder as the view tilts up and reveals the opposite building's roof line, thickly coated in a crust of churning cytoplasm and organ-like flesh, and over which the hapless soldier's body is dragged out of sight, before a waterfall of blood erupts and spurts across the convoy.  As the cameraman whimpers in terror, a nightmarish, spidery amalgamation of flesh and bones clambers over the roof's edge and plunges into the amassed soldiers.  The scene erupts in a mass of gunfire and frantic screams."
msgstr ""
"untitled2047-2842.mp4\n"
"영상은 커튼이 드리워진 유리창을 통해 촬영된, 황량한 도시 거리의 흔들리는 장면으로 시작됩니다. 에이브럼스 전차가 덜컹거리며 시야에 들어오고, 그 옆으로는 무장한 병사들이 여러 분대를 이끌고 달려오면서, 쉴 새 없이 달리는 소리가 끊기는 소리를 압도합니다. 고무 방독면 뒤에 숨은 병사들은 각자 자동 소총을 들고, 전차 옆면을 따라 조심스럽게 움직이는 동안, 병사들은 길을 따라 나아갑니다. 화면이 회전하는 동안, 대열을 이끄는 병사가 열린 지하실 옆에서 잠시 멈춰 섭니다. 보병이 심연을 향해 소총을 겨누는 동안, 카메라맨은 다급하게 기도를 속삭입니다. 반짝이는 동맥 같은 부속물이 보이지 않는 곳에서 꿈틀거리며 병사의 가면을 뚫고 나와 두개골을 뚫고 나와 병사를 땅에서 잡아당기자, 화면이 급격히 흔들립니다. 절박한 예배 소리가 점점 더 커지면서, 시야가 위로 기울어지며 반대편 건물의 지붕선이 드러납니다. 지붕선은 펄펄 끓는 세포질과 장기처럼 생긴 살덩어리로 두껍게 뒤덮여 있고, 그 위로 불운한 병사의 시신이 끌려나갑니다. 그리고 피가 폭포처럼 쏟아져 나와 호송대를 가로질러 솟구칩니다. 카메라맨이 공포에 질려 훌쩍이는 동안, 살과 뼈가 거미줄처럼 뒤엉킨 악몽 같은 존재가 지붕 가장자리를 기어올라 몰려든 병사들에게 뛰어듭니다. 그 장면은 총성과 광란의 비명으로 가득 찹니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "local_files_simple"
