#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_field_dress_failed"
#. ~ Displayed after unsuccessfully field dressing a corpse (from butchery
#. menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You unskillfully hack up the corpse and chop off some excess body parts.  "
"You're left wondering how you did so poorly."
msgstr ""
"서투른 솜씨로 시체를 가르며 몇 가지 필요없는 부위들을 잘라내었습니다.  어떻게 이렇게 형편없을 수 있는 지 당신조차 의문입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_field_dress_failed"
#. ~ Displayed after unsuccessfully field dressing a corpse (from butchery
#. menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Your unskilled hands slip and damage the corpse.  You still hope it's not a "
"total waste though."
msgstr "서투른 손이 미끄려져 시체를 손상시킵니다.  적어도 완전히 망치지 않았기를 바랄 뿐입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_field_dress_failed"
#. ~ Displayed after unsuccessfully field dressing a corpse (from butchery
#. menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You did something wrong and hacked the corpse badly.  Maybe it's still "
"recoverable."
msgstr "무언가 잘못되어 시체를 잘못 잘라냅니다.  아직까진 복구 가능할지도 모릅니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_field_dress_success"
#. ~ Displayed after successfully field dressing a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "You field dress the corpse."
msgstr "시체의 내장을 제거했습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_field_dress_success"
#. ~ Displayed after successfully field dressing a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You slice the corpse's belly and remove intestines and organs, until you're "
"confident that it will not rot from inside."
msgstr "시체의 복부를 가르고 내부에서 부패하지 않을 거라는 확신이 들 때까지 내장과 장기들을 덜어냅니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_field_dress_success"
#. ~ Displayed after successfully field dressing a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "You remove guts and excess parts, preparing the corpse for later use."
msgstr "시체를 나중에 쓰기 위해 시체의 내장과 필요없는 부위들을 제거합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_dissect_success"
#. ~ Displayed after successfully dissecting a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "You finish dissecting the corpse."
msgstr "시체를 해부하는 것을 마쳤습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_dissect_failed"
#. ~ Displayed after unsuccessfully dissecting a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You hack up the corpse so unskillfully, that there is nothing left to "
"salvage from this bloody mess."
msgstr "시체를 너무 대충 가른 결과, 이 지저분한 살덩이에서 얻을만한 것이 없습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_dissect_failed"
#. ~ Displayed after unsuccessfully dissecting a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You wanted to cut the corpse, but instead you hacked the meat, spilled the "
"guts all over it, and made a bloody mess."
msgstr "사체를 자르려고 했으나, 대신 사체를 내리쳐 내장을 모두 쏟아내고 피투성이 더미를 만들었습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_dissect_failed"
#. ~ Displayed after unsuccessfully dissecting a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You made so many mistakes during the process that you doubt even vultures "
"will be interested in what's left of it."
msgstr "도축 과정에서 너무 실수를 많이 저질러서 하이에나조차 남은 것을 먹지 않을 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_skinning"
#. ~ Displayed after skinning a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "You skin the corpse."
msgstr "시체의 가죽을 벗겼습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_skinning"
#. ~ Displayed after skinning a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "You carefully remove the hide from the corpse."
msgstr "시체의 가죽을 조심스럽게 벗겨냈습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_skinning"
#. ~ Displayed after skinning a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "The corpse is challenging to skin, but you get a good hide from it."
msgstr "시체의 가죽은 벗기기 힘들지만, 좋은 가죽을 얻을 수 있었습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_skinning"
#. ~ Displayed after skinning a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "With a few deft slices you take the skin from the corpse."
msgstr "솜씨 좋은 손짓 몇 번으로 시체의 가죽을 벗겨냅니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_dismember"
#. ~ Displayed after dismembering a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "You hack the corpse apart."
msgstr "당신은 시체를 난도질합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_dismember"
#. ~ Displayed after dismembering a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "You lop the limbs off the corpse."
msgstr "당신은 시체의 사지를 잘라냈습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_dismember"
#. ~ Displayed after dismembering a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "You cleave the corpse into pieces."
msgstr "시체를 조각내었습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_quick_butcher"
#. ~ Displayed after performing a quick butcher on a corpse (from butchery
#. menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You apply few quick cuts to the corpse and leave what's left of it for "
"scavengers."
msgstr "시체를 몇 번 가르고 남은 것은 청소동물이 먹도록 내버려둡니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_full_butcher"
#. ~ Displayed after performing a full butcher on a corpse (from butchery
#. menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "You finish butchering the corpse."
msgstr "도축을 마쳤습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_default_bleed"
#. ~ Displayed after bleeding a corpse (from butchery menu)
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "You bleed the corpse."
msgstr "시체의 혈액을 추출합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_mutagen_field_dress"
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You notice some strange organs, perhaps harvestable via careful dissection."
msgstr "신중한 해부를 거치면 얻을 수 있을지 모르는 이상한 장기를 발견했습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_bionic_field_dress"
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You suspect there might be bionics implanted in this corpse, that careful "
"dissection might reveal."
msgstr "이 시체를 조심스럽게 해부하면 설치된 바이오닉을 찾아낼 수 있을 거라 생각합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_mutagen_butcher"
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Your butchering tool destroys a strange organ.  Perhaps a more surgical "
"approach would allow harvesting it."
msgstr "도축 도구가 이상한 장기를 파괴했습니다. 수술적인 접근법을 사용했다면 채취할 수 있었을텐데요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_bionic_butcher"
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Your butchering tool encounters something implanted in this corpse, but your"
" rough cuts destroy it."
msgstr "도축용 도구가 이 시체에 이식된 무언가에 걸렸지만, 거친 칼질 탓에 그걸 파괴해버렸습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_bionic_butcher"
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You find traces of implants in the body, but you care only for the flesh."
msgstr "시체에 뭔가 이식물이 있지만, 지금 중요한건 살덩이 뿐입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_bionic_butcher"
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You found some bionics in the body, but harvesting them would require more "
"surgical approach."
msgstr "시체에서 바이오닉을 발견했습니다. 회수하려면 좀 더 수술적인 접근법이 필요합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_mutagen_dissect_failed"
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "You discover only damaged organs."
msgstr "손상된 장기들만 찾아내었습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_tissue_dissect_failed"
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "You don't find much besides damaged tissue."
msgstr "손상된 조직 외에는 발견하지 못했습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "harvest_drop_bone_dissect_failed"
#: data/json/snippets/harvest_drop_msgs.json
msgid "You discover some shattered bones."
msgstr "조각난 뼈들을 발견했습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "sr1_mess"
#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"Subj: Security Reminder\n"
"To: all SRCF staff\n"
"From: Constantine Dvorak, Undersecretary of Nuclear Security\n"
"\n"
"  I want to remind everyone on staff: do not open or examine containers above your security-clearance.  If you have some question about safety protocols or shipping procedures, please contact your SRCF administrator or on-site military officer.  When in doubt, assume all containers are Class-A Biohazards and highly toxic.  Take full precautions!"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"제목: 보안 공지\n"
"받는이: 모든 제한방호 격리시설 직원\n"
"보낸이: 콘스탄틴 드보락 핵안전부차관\n"
"\n"
"  모든 직원에게 공지합니다. 다음 사항을 명심해주십시오. 자신의 보안레벨보다 높은 용기는 다루지 마십시오. 보안 프로토콜이나 물품 이송 절차에 질문이 있다면 관리자나 장교에게 문의하십시오. 모든 내용물이 확실하지 않은 용기는 1등급 생화학 독극물과 같이 취급하십시오. 안전이 최우선임을 명심해주시기 바랍니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "sr2_mess"
#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"Subj: Security Reminder\n"
"To: all SRCF staff\n"
"From: Constantine Dvorak, Undersecretary of Nuclear Security\n"
"\n"
"  From today onward medical wastes are not to be stored anywhere near radioactive materials.  All containers are to be re-arranged according to these new regulations.  If your facility currently has these containers stored in close proximity, you are to work with armed guards on duty at all times.  Report any unusual activity to your SRCF administrator at once."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"제목: 보안 공지\n"
"받는이: 모든 제한방호 격리시설 관리 직원\n"
"보낸이: 콘스탄틴 드보락 핵안전부차관\n"
"\n"
"  모든 직원에게 공지합니다. 오늘부터 시행되는 보관절차에 따라 의료 폐기물과 방사성 물질을 같이 보관하는 것을 금지합니다. 모든 저장용기는 빠른 시일 내에 새 보관절차에 따라 재배치되어야 합니다. 보관절차를 위반하는 저장용기를 다루는 경우, 무장 경비의 보호 아래 작업해주시기 바랍니다. 특이사항을 발견하면 관리자에게 즉시 보고 하시기 바랍니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "sr3_mess"
#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"Subj: Security Reminder\n"
"To: all SRCF staff\n"
"From: Constantine Dvorak, Undersecretary of Nuclear Security\n"
"\n"
"  Worker health and safety is our number one concern!  As such, we are instituting weekly health examinations for all SRCF employees.  Report any unusual symptoms or physical changes to your SRCF administrator at once."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"제목: 보안 공지\n"
"받는이: 모든 제한방호 격리시설 관리 직원\n"
"보낸이: 콘스탄틴 드보락 핵안전부차관\n"
"\n"
"  모든 직원에게 공지합니다. 직원의 건강증진과 안전유지를 위해 매주 목요일마다 건강검진이 시행될 예정입니다. 질병이나 신체의 변화 등 증상이 발생할 경우 즉시 관리자에게 보고하시기 바랍니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "sr4_mess"
#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
msgid ""
"\n"
"Subj: Security Reminder\n"
"To: all SRCF staff\n"
"From: Constantine Dvorak, Undersecretary of Nuclear Security\n"
"\n"
"  All compromised facilities will remain under lock down until further notice.  Anyone who has seen or come in direct contact with the creatures is to report to the home office for a full medical evaluation and security debriefing."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"제목: 보안 공지\n"
"받는이: 모든 제한방호 격리시설 관리 직원\n"
"보낸이: 콘스탄틴 드보락 핵안전부차관\n"
"\n"
"  모든 직원에게 공지합니다. 오늘부터 시행되는 보안절차에 따라 사고가 발생한 시설은 차후 지시가 있을 때 까지 폐쇄격리 처리 합니다. 특이 생물체 목격자나 접촉 의심자는 정밀검사와 안전 브리핑을 위해 즉시 관리자에게 보고하시길 바랍니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "scrf_1_mess"
#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
msgid ""
"Subj: EPA: Report All Potential Containment Breaches 3873643\n"
"To: all SRCF staff\n"
"From: Robert Shane, Director of the EPA\n"
"\n"
"  All hazardous waste dumps and sarcophagi must submit three samples from each operational leache system to the following addresses:\n"
"\n"
"CDC Bioterrorism Lab\n"
"Building 10\n"
"Corporate Square Boulevard\n"
"Atlanta, GA 30329\n"
"\n"
"EPA Region 8 Laboratory\n"
"16194 W. 45th Drive\n"
"Golden, CO 80403\n"
"\n"
"  These samples must be accurate and any attempts to cover incompetencies will result in charges of Federal Corruption and potentially Treason.\n"
"\n"
"Director of the EPA,\n"
"  Robert Shane"
msgstr ""
"제목: 환경보호청: 잠재적 격리 실패 보고 요청 [3873643]\n"
"받는이: 모든 제한방호 격리시설 관리 직원\n"
"보낸이: 로버트 쉐인 환경보호청 장관\n"
"\n"
"   공지합니다. 모든 폐기물 매립지와 격리시설은 시설에 설치된 채취 밸브에서 각각 3개의 샘플을 확보해 다음의 주소로 제출하시길 바랍니다.\n"
"\n"
"조지아주 아틀란타 코퍼레이트 스퀘어 대로\n"
"질병예방보건부 빌딩 10\n"
"생화학테러 연구소 로버트 쉐인 귀하\n"
"30329\n"
"\n"
"콜로라도주 골든 45번 국도 16194\n"
"\n"
"환경보호청 8구역 연구소\n"
"로버트 쉐인 귀하\n"
"80403\n"
"\n"
"   조작되거나 거짓된 샘플을 제출하는 등 격리실패사건을 은폐하려는 행위가 적발될 경우 생화학 테러 행위로 간주하며 반역죄로 처벌이 가능함을 알려 드립니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "scrf_2_1_mess"
#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
msgid ""
"Subj: SRCF: Internal Memo, EPA [2918024]\n"
"To: all SRCF admin staff\n"
"From: Constantine Dvorak, Undersecretary of Nuclear Security\n"
"\n"
"  Director Grimes has released a new series of accusations that will soon be investigated by a Congressional committee.  Below is the message that he sent me.\n"
"--------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"Subj: Congressional Investigations\n"
"To: Constantine Dvorak, Undersecretary of Nuclear Safety\n"
"From: Robert Shane, director of the EPA\n"
"\n"
"  The EPA has opposed the Security-Restricted Containment Facility (SRCF) project from its inception.  We were horrified that these facilities would be constructed so close to populated areas, and only agreed to sign-off on the project if we were allowed to freely examine and monitor the sarcophagi.  But that has not happened.  Since then, the DOE has employed any and all means to keep EPA agents from visiting the SRCFs, using military secrecy, emergency powers, and inter-departmental gag orders to surround the project with an impenetrable thicket of red tape."
msgstr ""
"제목: 내부 공지, 환경보호청 [2918024]\n"
"받는이: 모든 제한방호 격리시설 관리 직원\n"
"보낸이: 콘스탄틴 드보락 핵안전부차관\n"
"\n"
"  질병보건부 그림즈 이사가 국회의원회에 여러 건의 고발을 제출했습니다. 정부의 조사를 대비하시길 바랍니다. 아래 첨부된 이메일을 참조해 주십시오.\n"
"--------------------------------------------------------------\n"
"제목: 국회이사회 조사 관련\n"
"받는이: 콘스탄틴 드보락 핵안전부차관\n"
"보낸이: 로버트 쉐인 환경보호청장관\n"
"\n"
"환경보호청는 제한방호 격리시설, SRCF 프로젝트를 처음부터 반대해온 바 있고, 지금도 지지할 생각이 없습니다. 대량의 위험 폐기물을 민간 주거시설 근처에 묻는다는 것은 용납할 수 없는 행위이며, 환보청 측에서 독립적인 감시를 시행할 자격조차 주어지지 않았습니다. 에너지부 또한 우리 환보청 측의 감시를 피하기 위해 온갖 말도 안 되는 방법을 사용했고, 이는 군사력의 낭비 및 부서 내의 뇌물 수회 또한 의심되는 행동입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "scrf_2_2_mess"
#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
msgid ""
"Although our agents have not been allowed inside, our atmospheric testers in nearby communities have detected high levels of toxins and radiation, and we've found dozens of potentially dangerous unidentified compounds in the ground water.  We now have conclusive evidence that the SRCFs are a threat to the public safety.  We are taking these data to state representatives and petitioning for a full Congressional inquiry.  They should be able to force open your secret vaults, and the world will see what you've been hiding.\n"
"\n"
"If you had any hand in this outbreak I hope you will rot in hell.\n"
"\n"
"Director of the EPA,\n"
"  Robert Shane"
msgstr ""
"격리시설 주변에 설치한 대기오염 측정기의 결과에 따르면 민간 거주지역 근처에서도 치사량에 가까운 양의 독극물과 방사능이 검출되었습니다. 시설 주변 지하 암반수에 대한 검사 또한 확인되지 않은 위험물질이 검출됨을 확인하였습니다. 이러한 증거를 토대로 환경보호청은 SRCF 시설이 공공의 안녕과 질서에 위협이 된다는 결론을 내렸습니다. 우리는 이러한 정보를 주 대표에게 제출하였으니 조만간 국정원 측에서 조사령을 발령할 계획입니다.\n"
"\n"
"이번 전염병 유행 건에 관련이 조금이라도 있었다면 감옥에서 평생 썩을 각오나 하십시오. 감사합니다.\n"
"\n"
"환경보호청 장관\n"
"로버트 쉐인"

#. ~ Snippet in category "scrf_3_mess"
#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
msgid ""
"Subj: CDC: Internal Memo, Standby [2918115]\n"
"To: all SRCF staff\n"
"From: Ellen Grimes, Director of the CDC\n"
"\n"
"  Your site along with many others has been found to be contaminated with what we will now refer to as [redacted]. It is vital that you standby for further orders.  We are currently awaiting the President to decide our course of action in this national crisis.  You will proceed with fail-safe procedures and rig the sarcophagus with C-4 as outlined in Publication 4423.  We will send you orders to either detonate and seal the sarcophagus or remove the charges.  It is of the utmost importance that the facility be sealed immediately when the orders are given.  We have been alerted by Homeland Security that there are potential terrorist suspects that are being detained in connection with the recent national crisis.\n"
"\n"
"Director of the CDC,\n"
"  Ellen Grimes"
msgstr ""
"제목: 질병통제예방센터: 잠재적 격리 실패 보고 요청 [3873643]\n"
"받는이: 모든 제한방호 격리시설 관리 인원\n"
"보낸이: 엘렌 그림즈 질병통제예방센터 장관\n"
"\n"
"   귀하의 시설을 포함한 대부분의 SRCF 시설에서 [검열됨] 으로 명명된 감염원이 검출되었습니다. 현재 국가위기에 대한 대통령령을 대기 중이며, 그 동안 하달되는 지령을 신속히 따라 주십시오. 긴급절차 4423에 따라 모든 격리 시설에 C-4 붕괴폭탄을 설치하여 주십시오. 조만간 보건부 측에서 시설을 붕괴시키거나 폭탄을 제거하라는 지령이 하달될 예정이니, 지령 접수 즉시 행동이 가능하도록 준비해주시기 바랍니다. 또한, 국가위기에 연관된 몇몇 주요인원이 국토안보부 명령에 따라 테러 혐의로 구속될 예정입니다.\n"
"\n"
"감사합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "scrf_seal_order"
#: data/json/snippets/hazardous_waste_sarcophagus.json
msgid ""
"Subj: USARMY: SEAL SRCF [987167]\n"
"To: all SRCF staff\n"
"From: Major General Cornelius, U.S. Army\n"
"\n"
"  As a general warning to all civilian staff: the 10th Mountain Division has been assigned to oversee the sealing of the SRCF facilities.  By direct order, all non-essential staff must vacate at the earliest possible opportunity to prevent potential contamination.  Low yield tactical nuclear demolition charges will be deployed in the lower tunnels to ensure that recovery of hazardous material is impossible.  The Army Corps of Engineers will then dump concrete over the rubble so that we can redeploy the 10th Mountain into the greater Boston area.\n"
"\n"
"Cornelius,\n"
"Major General, U.S. Army\n"
"Commander of the 10th Mountain Division"
msgstr ""
"제목: 미육군: 격리시설 봉쇄 절차 [987167]\n"
"받는이: 모든 제한방호 격리시설 관리 인원\n"
"보낸이: 미육군 코넬리우스 소장\n"
"\n"
"SRCF 시설에서 근무중인 민간인원에게 알린다. 모든 격리시설의 봉쇄작업은 제10산악사단이 직접 감독할 예정이다. 명령에 따라 모든 민간인원 및 비주요 인원은 신속히 대피하여 추가적 감염을 방지하도록 한다. 위험물질 접근을 막기 위해 시설 하부 터널에 전술 핵이 설치될 예정이며, 제10산악사단의 재배치를 위해 시설 전체에 콘크리트를 부어 밀봉할 예정이다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You feel great!  It doesn't seem like wounds could even slow you down for "
"more than a day."
msgstr "기분이 끝내줍니다! 부상조차도 당신을 하루 넘게 붙잡고 늘어지지는 못하는군요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Within moments you're ready and up.  You don't feel like anything could stop"
" you today!"
msgstr "한순간이 지나고, 당신은 모든 준비가 끝났습니다. 오늘은 무엇도 당신을 막을 수 없을 듯한 기분이 듭니다!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes open and your entire body feels like it is just bursting with "
"energy to burn!"
msgstr "일어나자마자 온몸에 활력이 넘치는 것 같은 기분이 듭니다!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You feel like a rubber ball; whatever hits you, you'll just bounce back!"
msgstr "고무공 같은 느낌이 듭니다. 뭔가가 당신을 때린다면, 도로 튀어올라줄 수 있죠!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You're up and you feel fantastic.  No sickness is going to keep you down "
"today!"
msgstr "무척 기분좋게 일어났습니다. 오늘은 어떤 아픔도 당신을 좌절하게 만들지 못할 것 같습니다!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You wake up feeling invincible, ready to take on any challenge that comes "
"your way."
msgstr "당신은 무적의 기분으로 깨어나, 앞으로 닥칠 어떤 도전에도 맞설 준비가 되어 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Your body feels as light as a feather, every movement effortless and smooth."
msgstr "몸이 깃털처럼 가볍고, 모든 움직임이 수월하고 부드럽습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You wake up with a smile, knowing today is going to be a great day."
msgstr "오늘은 정말 좋은 하루가 될 거라는 걸 알고 미소를 지으며 깨어납니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "Strength and vitality surge through you, making you feel unstoppable."
msgstr "힘과 활력이 당신을 휩쓸어 아무도 멈출 수 없다고 느끼게 됩니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_great"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You feel a powerful sense of well-being, as if every cell in your body is "
"thriving."
msgstr "마치 몸의 모든 세포가 잘 자라는 듯한 강렬한 행복감을 느끼게 됩니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You're up and going rather quickly, and all the little aches from yesterday "
"are gone."
msgstr "정신이 맑아졌고, 몸놀림도 가벼워졌습니다. 간밤에 겪던 자잘한 통증은 말끔히 날아갔습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You get up feeling pretty good, as if all your little aches were fading "
"faster."
msgstr "잠에서 일어나니 몸에 있던 자잘한 통증이 씻겨 내려간 듯 기분이 좋아집니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Getting up comes easy to you, your muscles revitalized after your rest."
msgstr "어렵지 않게 잠에서 깨어나면, 몸에 활력이 돕니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You're up and your little pains from before seem to have faded away rather "
"quickly."
msgstr "잠에서 깨어나자, 이전에 느껴지던 약간의 통증이 더 빠르게 사라지는 느낌이 듭니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Awareness comes fast, your body coming quickly to attention after your rest."
msgstr "잠에서 깨자 몸이 홀가분합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You feel refreshed and ready to start the day with enthusiasm."
msgstr "당신은 상쾌함을 느끼고 열정적으로 하루를 시작할 준비가 되었습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Your body feels rejuvenated, as if you've been given a new lease on life."
msgstr "마치 새로운 삶을 얻은 것처럼 몸이 활력을 되찾은 듯한 느낌이 듭니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You wake up feeling revitalized, your energy levels high and stable."
msgstr "당신은 활력이 넘치고 에너지 수준이 높고 안정적인 기분으로 깨어납니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Any lingering fatigue from yesterday has vanished, leaving you feeling "
"strong and capable."
msgstr "어제의 피로감이 모두 사라지고, 당신은 더 강하고 유능하다고 느낍니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You stretch and feel a wonderful sense of vitality coursing through your "
"body."
msgstr "몸을 쭉 뻗고, 몸 전체에 활력이 흐르는 놀라운 감각을 느껴보세요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You feel good.  Healthy living does seem to have some rewards."
msgstr "기분이 좋습니다. 건강한 생활방식 덕분에 얻는 이득이군요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Getting out of bed doesn't seem too hard today.  You could get used to this!"
msgstr "오늘은 침대에서 나서는게 어렵지 않군요. 늘 이랬으면 좋겠습니다!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Alertness comes somewhat fast, and your muscles stretch easier than before "
"you went to bed."
msgstr "의식이 꽤 빠르게 돌아오고, 자기 전보다 몸이 가벼워졌습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You feel extra alert, and your body feels ready to go."
msgstr "정신은 맑고, 몸은 어디든 갈 수 있을 정도로 가볍습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Your body stretches with ease, and you feel ready to take on the world."
msgstr "기지개가 쭉쭉 펴집니다. 바깥으로 나서기에 완벽하군요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You wake up feeling clear-headed and ready to tackle the day ahead."
msgstr "아침에 일어나면 머리가 맑아지고 앞으로의 하루를 맞이할 준비가 된 기분입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "Your body feels responsive and agile, making movement a pleasure."
msgstr "몸이 반응하고 민첩해져서 움직이는 것이 즐겁습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You stretch and feel a pleasant sense of readiness in your muscles."
msgstr "몸을 늘리면 근육에 기분 좋은 준비감이 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You feel energized and alert, ready to face whatever the day throws at you."
msgstr "당신은 활력이 넘치고 경계심이 강하며, 하루가 어떤 일로 닥치든 대처할 준비가 되어 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_good"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You wake up with a sense of purpose, feeling good about the day ahead."
msgstr "당신은 오늘 하루를 즐겁게 보낼 수 있다는 기분과 목적의식을 가지고 깨어납니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You feel cruddy.  Maybe you should consider eating a bit healthier."
msgstr "몸상태가 별로입니다. 몸에 좋은걸 좀 먹어야겠습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You get up with a bit of a scratch in your throat."
msgstr "일어나니 목이 따끔거립니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You stretch, but your muscles don't seem to be doing so good today."
msgstr "기지개를 쭉 펴보지만, 오늘은 썩 개운하지 않습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Your stomach gurgles.  It's probably nothing, but maybe you should look into"
" eating something healthy."
msgstr "뱃속이 구륵거립니다. 아마 아무 일도 아니겠지만, 몸에 좋은걸 좀 먹어야 할지도 모르겠습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You struggle to awareness.  Being awake seems somewhat harder to reach "
"today."
msgstr "힘겹게 눈을 뜹니다. 오늘은 평소보다 잠에서 깨어나기가 힘들군요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You wake up feeling a bit off, as if something is not quite right."
msgstr "뭔가 잘못된 것 같은, 기분이 약간 이상한 채로 깨어납니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "Your body feels sluggish, making every movement an effort."
msgstr "몸이 둔해져서 모든 움직임이 힘들어집니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You get up feeling like you didn't get enough rest, even if you slept for "
"hours."
msgstr "몇 시간이나 잤는데도, 충분한 휴식을 취하지 못했다는 기분으로 일어납니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"There's a nagging discomfort in your body, making it hard to focus on "
"anything else."
msgstr "몸에 끊임없는 불편함이 있어서 다른 것에 집중하기 힘듭니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You feel a general sense of malaise, as if something is draining your "
"energy."
msgstr "당신은 마치 무언가가 당신의 에너지를 빨아들이는 듯한 전반적인 불쾌감을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Getting out of bed only comes with great difficulty, and your muscles resist"
" the movement."
msgstr "침대에서 나오는 일이 엄청나게 힘들었습니다. 움직일 때마다 근육이 저항하는 게 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Getting up seems like it should be easy, but all you want to do is go back "
"to bed."
msgstr "일어나긴 했지만, 당장에라도 다시 잠자리로 돌아가고 싶습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Tired hands rub at your eyes, the little aches of yesterday protesting your "
"stretches."
msgstr "눈을 비비면서 몸을 일으키고 기지개를 켜자 어제 겪었던 통증이 약하게 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Alertness seems flighty today, and your body argues when you move towards "
"it."
msgstr "몸이 잘 움직이다가 가끔 둔해집니다. 둔해진 몸을 억지로 움직이자 몸이 삐걱거립니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You're up, but your body seems like it would rather stay in bed."
msgstr "일어나긴 했지만 몸은 아직도 침대에 있고 싶어하는 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You wake up feeling drained, as if you haven't slept at all."
msgstr "당신은 마치 잠을 전혀 자지 못한 것처럼 기운이 빠진 채로 깨어납니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Every movement feels like a chore, your muscles aching with every step."
msgstr "모든 움직임이 힘든 일처럼 느껴지고, 걸음을 옮길 때마다 근육이 아픕니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You feel a pervasive sense of exhaustion, making it hard to even think "
"clearly."
msgstr "당신은 극심한 피로감을 느끼고, 명확하게 생각하기조차 힘듭니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Your body feels heavy and uncooperative, resisting every effort to get up."
msgstr "몸이 무겁고 협조적이지 않아 일어나려는 모든 노력이 저항됩니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_very_bad"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You wake up with a sense of dread, knowing today will be a struggle."
msgstr "당신은 오늘이 힘든 날이 될 거라는 걸 알면서 두려움을 느끼며 깨어납니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You get up feeling horrible, as if something was messing with your body."
msgstr "끔찍한 기분으로 일어났습니다. 뭔가가 당신을 가지고 장난치는 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You feel awful, and every ache from yesterday is still there."
msgstr "기분이 끔찍합니다. 어제의 고통이 아직도 남아있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Your eyes struggle to open, and your muscles ache like you didn't sleep at "
"all."
msgstr "눈을 힘겹게 뜨고 일어나자, 마치 한숨도 못 잔 것처럼 근육에서 통증이 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Bleary-eyed and half-asleep, you consider why you are doing this to "
"yourself."
msgstr "비몽사몽하여 게슴츠레한 눈으로 왜 이 짓을 하고 있는지 생각했습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Awareness seems to only come with a battle… and your body seems to be on its"
" side."
msgstr "인식은 싸움을 통해서만 얻어지는 것 같습니다. 그리고 당신의 몸은 그 편에 서 있는 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You wake up feeling like you've been hit by a truck, every part of your body"
" protesting."
msgstr "마치 트럭에 치인 것 같은 기분으로 깨어나고, 온몸이 저항하는 듯한 느낌을 받습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"A deep, bone-weary exhaustion fills you, making it hard to even lift your "
"head."
msgstr "깊고 뼈가 빠질 듯한 피로감이 몰려와 머리를 드는 것조차 힘듭니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You feel a persistent ache in your body, as if you were fighting off a "
"severe illness."
msgstr "당신은 마치 심각한 질병과 싸우는 것처럼 몸에 지속적인 통증을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "Every joint and muscle screams in protest as you try to get up."
msgstr "일어나려고 하면 모든 관절과 근육이 항의하듯 비명을 지른다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "health_horrible"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You wake up feeling completely depleted, with no energy to face the day."
msgstr "당신은 완전히 지쳐버린 채로 깨어나고, 하루를 맞이할 에너지가 전혀 없습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_starving"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You're too weak to be hungry anymore.  Is this what starving to death feels "
"like?"
msgstr "이제 배고프다는 말로는 표현할 수 없습니다. 굶어죽는다는게 이런 느낌일까요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_starving"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "Your body feels like it's eating itself from the inside out."
msgstr "당신의 몸은 마치 안에서부터 자기 자신을 먹어치우는 것 같은 느낌을 받습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_starving"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Every movement feels like a monumental effort, your limbs trembling from "
"weakness."
msgstr "모든 움직임이 엄청난 노력처럼 느껴지고, 팔다리가 약해져서 떨립니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_starving"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You can't remember the last time you had a proper meal, and it's starting to"
" take its toll."
msgstr "제대로 된 식사를 한 게 언제였는지 기억도 나지 않고, 점점 힘들어지기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_starving"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You feel a deep, gnawing emptiness in your stomach that never goes away."
msgstr "당신은 결코 사라지지 않는 깊고 괴로운 공허함을 배 속에서 느낍니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "starving"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Even though you've eaten not too long ago you still feel drained of energy."
"  It will take more than that to get you back up."
msgstr "빈 속이 구르륵거립니다. 진짜 뭘 좀 먹어야 합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "starving"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You feel like a bottomless pit, no amount of food seems to satisfy your "
"hunger."
msgstr "당신은 바닥없는 구덩이에 빠진 것 같은 기분이며, 아무리 많이 먹어도 배고픔을 채울 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "starving"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Your body is crying out for nourishment, every cell feeling the lack of "
"sustenance."
msgstr "당신의 몸은 영양분을 갈망하고 있으며, 모든 세포는 영양 부족을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "starving"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You feel dizzy and lightheaded from the constant hunger."
msgstr "끊임없는 배고픔으로 인해 어지럽고 머리가 멍해집니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "starving"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "Your hands tremble as you try to find something, anything, to eat."
msgstr "당신은 무엇인가 먹을 것을 찾으려고 애쓰면서 손이 떨립니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_emaciated"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "Your empty stomach gnaws at you.  You really need something to eat."
msgstr "빈 속이 구르륵거립니다. 진짜 뭘 좀 먹어야 합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_emaciated"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You feel like a shadow of your former self, your body wasting away."
msgstr "당신은 예전의 자신의 그림자처럼 느껴지고, 당신의 몸은 쇠퇴해 가고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_emaciated"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "Every rib is visible, your skin stretched thin over your bones."
msgstr "모든 갈비뼈가 보이고, 뼈 위로 피부가 얇게 늘어져 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_emaciated"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You feel a deep, bone-deep weariness, as if your body is giving up."
msgstr "당신은 마치 몸이 포기하는 것처럼 깊고 뼈 속까지 느껴지는 피로감을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_emaciated"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "Your muscles are wasting away, leaving you feeling weak and frail."
msgstr "근육이 쇠약해지면서 몸이 약하고 허약함을 느끼게 됩니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "emaciated"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You are EMACIATED!"
msgstr "수척해진 상태입니다!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "emaciated"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "Your body is little more than skin and bones."
msgstr "당신의 몸은 피부와 뼈에 불과합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "emaciated"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You feel a constant, gnawing hunger that never seems to go away."
msgstr "당신은 결코 사라지지 않을 듯한 끊임없는 괴로움을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "emaciated"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "Every movement is an effort, your body weak and frail."
msgstr "모든 움직임은 노력이고, 몸은 약하고 허약합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "emaciated"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You feel like you're wasting away, your body slowly consuming itself."
msgstr "당신은 몸이 점점 쇠약해지고, 몸이 천천히 스스로를 먹어치우는 듯한 느낌을 받습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_malnutrition"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You feel weak due to malnutrition."
msgstr "영양실조 때문에 몸이 약해지는 기분입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_malnutrition"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Your body feels starved of essential nutrients, leaving you feeling weak and"
" sick."
msgstr "신체는 필수 영양소가 부족하여 약하고 아픈 느낌을 받습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_malnutrition"
#. ~ Snippet in category "malnutrition"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You feel a persistent ache in your bones, a sign of severe malnutrition."
msgstr "심각한 영양실조의 징후인 뼈에 지속적인 통증을 느낀다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_malnutrition"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Your skin is pale and sallow, a sign of your body's desperate need for "
"nutrients."
msgstr "피부가 창백하고 칙칙한 것은 신체가 영양분을 절실히 필요로 한다는 신호입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_malnutrition"
#. ~ Snippet in category "malnutrition"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You feel a constant sense of fatigue, your body struggling to function."
msgstr "당신은 끊임없이 피로감을 느끼고, 신체는 제대로 기능하지 못합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "malnutrition"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Despite having something in your stomach, you still feel like you haven't "
"eaten in days…"
msgstr "배 속에 뭔가 들어있긴 하지만, 요즘 들어 아무 것도 먹지 않은 기분입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "malnutrition"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You feel a persistent sense of hunger, even after eating."
msgstr "식사 후에도 계속 배고픔을 느낀다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "malnutrition"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "Your body feels weak and frail, a sign of severe malnutrition."
msgstr "몸이 약하고 허약하다고 느껴지는 것은 심각한 영양실조의 징후입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_low_cal"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You've lost quite a bit of weight recently.  You might want to eat more "
"food."
msgstr "최근에 체중이 꽤 많이 줄었어요. 음식을 더 많이 드시는 게 좋을 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_low_cal"
#. ~ Snippet in category "low_cal"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"Your clothes hang loosely on your frame, a sign of your recent weight loss."
msgstr "옷이 몸에 느슨하게 걸려 있는 것은 최근 체중 감량의 신호입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_low_cal"
#. ~ Snippet in category "low_cal"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid ""
"You feel a persistent sense of fatigue, your body struggling to function."
msgstr "당신은 지속적인 피로감을 느끼고, 신체가 제대로 기능하지 못합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_low_cal"
#. ~ Snippet in category "low_cal"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "Your body feels weak and frail, a sign of your recent weight loss."
msgstr "몸이 약하고 허약하다고 느끼는 것은 최근 체중이 감소했다는 신호입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "empty_low_cal"
#. ~ Snippet in category "low_cal"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You feel a constant sense of hunger, your body desperate for calories."
msgstr "당신은 끊임없이 배고픔을 느끼고, 몸은 칼로리를 갈망합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "low_cal"
#: data/json/snippets/health_msgs.json
msgid "You feel that you need to consume more calories."
msgstr "당신은 더 많은 칼로리를 섭취해야 한다고 느낀다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A brightly lit photo depicting several large pine trees.  A beautiful "
"brunette-haired woman is standing next to a small gray owl on a wooden "
"perch.  She seems nervous standing next to the scowling owl."
msgstr ""
"밝은 조명 아래 여러 그루의 큰 소나무가 보이는 사진. 아름다운 갈색 머리의 여성이 나무 횃대에 앉은 작은 회색 올빼미 옆에 서 있다. "
"그녀는 찡그린 얼굴을 한 올빼미 옆에 서 있어 긴장한 듯 보인다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A man in a polo shirt and sunglasses stands in front of a fence, holding a "
"leafy branch.  The man grins ear to ear as a giraffe reaches down and "
"messily chews the leaves off of the branch."
msgstr ""
"폴로셔츠와 선글라스를 쓴 남자가 울타리 앞에 서서 잎이 무성한 나뭇가지를 잡고 있다. 남자는 기린이 나뭇가지에 손을 뻗어 잎을 어지럽게 "
"뜯어 먹는 모습을 보며 활짝 웃는다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"This is a worn family photo.  A group of people stand in front of a pier "
"next to a shimmering lake.  In the rear center of the crowd stands a tall, "
"well-built man in his 60s.  He is flanked by six children of various ages, "
"all smiling awkwardly for the camera."
msgstr ""
"낡은 가족 사진입니다. 반짝이는 호숫가 부두 앞에 사람들이 서 있습니다. 군중 뒤쪽 중앙에는 키가 크고 건장한 60대 남성이 서 "
"있습니다. 그의 양옆에는 다양한 연령대의 아이들 여섯 명이 카메라를 향해 어색하게 미소 짓고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"This blurry photo appears to have been taken at some sort of party.  A group"
" of three people strike goofy poses as a bride and groom laugh heartily in "
"the background."
msgstr ""
"이 흐릿한 사진은 어떤 파티에서 찍은 것으로 보입니다. 세 사람이 우스꽝스러운 포즈를 취하고 있고, 신랑 신부는 배경에서 활짝 웃고 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A family photo of a snowy morning.  Two young girls, bundled up in heavy "
"winter clothing, stand in front of a mountain far in the background — which "
"mountain it was, you couldn't say.  The girls are cheerfully smiling."
msgstr ""
"눈 내리는 어느 날 아침의 가족 사진. 두꺼운 겨울옷을 두른 두 어린 소녀가 멀리 배경의 산 앞에 서 있다. 어느 산인지 알 수 없었다."
" 소녀들은 환하게 웃고 있었다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A photo of a group of young people in costumes.  They are all dressed in "
"various anime character costumes and are striking poses for the camera.  In "
"the background, the entrance of a convention center has, written large on "
"its entrance, 'Animaine'."
msgstr ""
"의상을 차려입은 젊은이들의 사진입니다. 모두 다양한 애니메이션 캐릭터 의상을 입고 카메라를 향해 강렬한 포즈를 취하고 있습니다. 배경에는"
" 컨벤션 센터 입구에 '아니메인'이라고 크게 적혀 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A looming storm dominates the space of this photo; dark clouds are "
"scattered, promising miserable rain.  Towards the bottom right of the photo "
"stands a bearded man in a raincoat, carrying a fishing rod in one hand and a"
" hooked fish in the other.  He is brightly lit by the camera's flash, which "
"reveals his broad grin.  Written in permanent marker on the picture frame is"
" the phrase, 'In and out just in time!'"
msgstr ""
"이 사진 속 공간은 다가오는 폭풍우로 가득 차 있습니다. 검은 구름이 흩어지며 끔찍한 비를 예고하고 있습니다. 사진 오른쪽 아래에는 수염"
" 난 남자가 비옷을 입고 한 손에는 낚싯대를, 다른 한 손에는 낚시 바늘에 걸린 물고기를 들고 서 있습니다. 카메라 플래시가 밝게 비추자"
" 그의 환한 미소가 드러납니다. 액자에는 유성펜으로 '적시에 도착하고 출발!'이라는 문구가 적혀 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"Two adult men stand front and center in this picture, comically covered all "
"over in small splashes of paint and wearing paintball masks.  Two boys and a"
" girl surround them with masks still on, cheerfully holding their paintball "
"guns in the air in celebration of victory."
msgstr ""
"이 사진의 정중앙에는 두 명의 성인 남자가 서 있습니다. 온몸에 페인트 얼룩이 우스꽝스럽게 묻어 있고, 페인트볼 마스크를 쓴 모습입니다."
" 두 소년과 한 소녀가 마스크를 쓴 채 그들을 둘러싸고, 승리를 축하하며 페인트볼 총을 하늘 높이 들고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A smiling young woman wearing a band t-shirt is in the driver seat of a car,"
" with an older man sitting in the passenger seat next to her, sweating "
"profusely.  Written in colorful Sharpie at the bottom of the frame is, 'Dad "
"teaching me how to drive a manual for my drivers license'."
msgstr ""
"밴드 티셔츠를 입은 젊은 여성이 운전석에 앉아 미소를 짓고 있고, 그녀 옆 조수석에는 나이 든 남성이 땀을 흠뻑 흘리고 앉아 있습니다. "
"프레임 아래쪽에는 알록달록한 샤피 펜으로 '아빠가 운전면허증 설명서를 보며 운전하는 법을 가르쳐 주셔요'라고 적혀 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"Two dogs are perched on a couch.  One appears to be a rottweiler; the other "
"is a black corgi mix.  Both are staring hungrily at the chip the "
"photographer is holding just below the camera."
msgstr ""
"두 마리의 개가 소파에 앉아 있습니다. 한 마리는 로트와일러처럼 보이고, 다른 한 마리는 검은색 웰시코기 믹스견입니다. 두 마리 모두 "
"사진작가가 카메라 바로 아래에 들고 있는 칩을 굶주린 듯 응시하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A photograph of an open field of verdant grass.  A golden retriever is "
"joyfully chasing a young boy through the field.  The boy is smiling and "
"trailing a small piece of rope as he runs, and the dog seems intent on "
"catching it.  Written in black marker is 'James at grandpa's ranch.'"
msgstr ""
"푸른 풀이 무성한 넓은 들판 사진입니다. 골든 리트리버 한 마리가 들판에서 어린 소년을 즐겁게 쫓아가고 있습니다. 소년은 미소를 지으며 "
"작은 밧줄을 끌고 달리고 있고, 개는 그것을 잡으려는 듯합니다. 검은색 마커로 '할아버지 목장에 있는 제임스'라고 쓰여 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A framed clipping of a local newspaper article.  Displayed in bold font, the"
" headline reads, 'Local Firefighter Saves Family of 7 from House Fire!'  A "
"picture of a burning house surrounded by firetrucks and scrambling "
"firefighters is displayed in full color."
msgstr ""
"지역 신문 기사를 오려낸 액자 사진입니다. 굵은 글씨로 표시된 제목은 '지역 소방관, 주택 화재에서 7인 가족 구출!'입니다. 소방차와 "
"소방관들이 분주히 움직이는 모습의 불타는 집 사진이 풀컬러로 표시되어 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A framed clipping of a newspaper article.  It's a picture of an opening "
"ceremony for a pristine park, with a group of people standing behind the "
"ribbon spanning the entrance, just as it is being cut."
msgstr ""
"신문 기사를 오려낸 액자 사진입니다. 자연 그대로의 공원 개장식 사진인데, 입구에 걸린 리본을 자르는 순간, 사람들이 공원 입구에 서 "
"있는 모습입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A framed clipping of a newspaper article.  'Annual Chili Cook-off Winner'.  "
"Enclosed is a small article about the winner and the secret recipe."
msgstr ""
"신문 기사 스크랩(액자 포함). '연례 칠리 요리 대회 우승자'. 우승자와 비법 레시피에 대한 짧은 기사가 동봉되어 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"An old black-and-white photo from many years ago.  It features a group of "
"people at a long table dressed for a fancy dinner party.  Inscribed across "
"it is 'Grey Moose Lodge Christmas Party 1973.'"
msgstr ""
"오래전 흑백 사진입니다. 화려한 저녁 파티 차림으로 긴 테이블에 앉아 있는 사람들이 담겨 있습니다. 사진에는 '그레이 무스 롯지 "
"크리스마스 파티 1973'이라는 문구가 새겨져 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A picture of a group of several people at a painting class.  They each "
"display their attempt at painting a sunset over waves.  The people are "
"smiling and laughing at the varied quality of each painting, with wine "
"glasses perched in one hand and their pictures in the other."
msgstr ""
"그림 수업에 참여한 여러 사람의 모습입니다. 각자 파도 위로 지는 노을을 그리려는 시도를 하고 있습니다. 사람들은 한 손에는 와인잔을, "
"다른 한 손에는 그림을 든 채, 각 그림의 다채로운 색감에 미소 짓고 웃고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A picture of a house under construction.  Several men are evidently in the "
"midst of working on the building; however, they have all stopped to face the"
" camera and smile for the picture."
msgstr ""
"건설 중인 집 사진입니다. 몇몇 남자들이 건물 공사를 한창 진행 중인 듯 보이지만, 모두 멈춰 서서 카메라를 바라보며 미소를 짓고 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A picture of a Renaissance Fair.  A petite woman in ornate medieval clothing"
" is holding a gigantic turkey leg and dramatically biting into it with "
"exaggerated force."
msgstr ""
"르네상스 박람회 사진. 화려한 중세 의상을 입은 작은 체구의 여성이 거대한 칠면조 다리를 들고 과장된 힘으로 극적으로 물어뜯고 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"An older black man with a greying beard sits proudly on a chopper "
"motorcycle, his beaming smile directed towards the camera.  To his side are "
"several other men on their own motorcycles, smiling in the same manner.  "
"Scribbled on the photo's edge is 'Told you we could fix it up!'"
msgstr ""
"희끗희끗한 수염을 기른 나이든 흑인 남성이 헬리콥터 오토바이에 당당하게 앉아 카메라를 향해 환한 미소를 짓고 있다. 그의 옆에는 각자 "
"오토바이를 타고 있는 다른 남자 몇 명이 같은 미소를 짓고 있다. 사진 가장자리에는 \"고칠 수 있다고 했잖아!\"라는 글귀가 휘갈겨 "
"쓰여 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"This appears to be a photo of a woman a distance away from a city.  She's "
"taking a selfie and trying to get as much of the city in frame as possible "
"as the clouds hover over the town, with the sun beaming between them "
"gloriously."
msgstr ""
"도시에서 멀리 떨어진 한 여성의 사진인 듯합니다. 그녀는 셀카를 찍으며 도시를 최대한 많이 담으려고 애쓰고 있습니다. 구름이 마을 위로 "
"떠 있고, 그 사이로 찬란하게 햇살이 비치는 가운데 말입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A photo of a large crowd enjoying an air show.  Several jets streak overhead"
" high in the distant sky."
msgstr "많은 사람들이 에어쇼를 즐기는 모습. 멀리 하늘 높이 여러 대의 제트기가 활주하고 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A photo of eight people celebrating some manner of victory.  They are in the"
" lobby of an escape room and have 'Secret of the Tomb' 'completed in 57 "
"minutes and 12 seconds' displayed behind them."
msgstr ""
"여덟 명이 승리를 자축하는 사진. 탈출실 로비에 있는 그들의 모습. 뒤에는 '무덤의 비밀'이 '57분 12초 만에 완료'라는 문구가 적혀"
" 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A worn painting.  It depicts a brown deer running through trees and is "
"signed, 'A. Whitmer'."
msgstr "낡은 그림. 갈색 사슴이 나무 사이를 달리는 모습이 묘사되어 있으며, 'A. 휘트머'라는 서명이 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A framed family photo.  The family stands together among autumn leaves.  "
"They stand in front of a large house with pillars near the front door."
msgstr "액자에 담긴 가족사진. 가을 단풍 사이에 가족이 함께 서 있다. 현관 근처에 기둥이 있는 큰 집 앞에 서 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A framed photo of a beautiful woman gazing sadly out of view.  She is "
"looking downward, and her profile is partly obscured by her hair."
msgstr ""
"아름다운 여인이 슬픈 표정으로 밖을 응시하는 사진이 액자에 들어 있습니다. 그녀는 아래를 내려다보고 있으며, 머리카락에 가려져 옆모습이 "
"부분적으로 보이지 않습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A framed sketch of a young couple.  They are seated on a bench and are "
"embracing each other lovingly."
msgstr "젊은 커플의 액자 스케치. 벤치에 앉아 서로를 사랑스럽게 껴안고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"This is a jigsaw puzzle that has been glued and framed.  It depicts a "
"chestnut brown horse trotting towards the foreground and a cloudy blue sky "
"above.  You can't help but wonder how long it took to finish it."
msgstr ""
"이 퍼즐은 풀칠해서 액자에 넣은 작품입니다. 앞쪽으로는 밤색 말이 경쾌하게 걸어오고, 그 위로는 흐린 푸른 하늘이 그려져 있습니다. "
"완성하는 데 얼마나 오랜 시간이 걸렸을지 상상이 갑니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"This is an ink impression of a pair of baby feet.  'Congratulations, "
"grandpa!' is written in exuberant cursive."
msgstr ""
"이것은 아기 발 한 쌍을 잉크로 그린 그림입니다. '할아버지, 축하드려요!'라는 문구가 생동감 넘치는 필기체로 적혀 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A photo of a laughing mother hugging her mud-covered son.  He's covered from"
" head to toe and is squinting from behind his mud-caked face."
msgstr ""
"진흙투성이 아들을 껴안고 웃는 어머니의 사진. 아들은 머리부터 발끝까지 진흙투성이에 뒤덮여 있고, 진흙투성이 얼굴 뒤로 눈을 가늘게 뜨고"
" 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A photo of a young girl playing a cello almost as large as she is.  Her "
"sister stands behind her, smiling for the camera."
msgstr "어린 소녀가 자기 키만큼이나 큰 첼로를 연주하는 사진. 그녀의 언니가 그녀 뒤에 서서 카메라를 향해 미소 짓고 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A framed photo of a dog—it's a slightly bug-eyed mutt with a goofy "
"expression.  Printed on the wooden frame is 'Missing you every day.'"
msgstr ""
"액자에 넣은 강아지 사진입니다. 살짝 눈이 휘둥그레진 잡종견인데, 우스꽝스러운 표정을 짓고 있습니다. 나무 액자에는 \"매일 당신을 "
"그리워합니다\"라고 적혀 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A photo of a man standing atop a large rock on a beach's shore, waving to "
"the camera.  You can see a small city and piers in the distance behind him."
msgstr "해변의 큰 바위 위에 서서 카메라를 향해 손을 흔드는 한 남자의 사진입니다. 그의 뒤로 멀리 작은 도시와 부두가 보입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A framed newspaper article.  'New Restaurant Opened by Famous Chef'.  A "
"middle-aged woman stands proudly in front of the restaurant's doors, "
"gesturing as if to welcome the viewer within."
msgstr ""
"액자에 넣은 신문 기사. '유명 셰프가 새 레스토랑을 오픈했습니다'. 중년 여성이 레스토랑 문 앞에 당당하게 서서 마치 안으로 들어오는 "
"손님을 환영하는 듯 손짓을 하고 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"This is an amateur still-life painting depicting a table of fruit and a "
"bottle of wine.  It is signed 'V.A.' in the bottom right."
msgstr "이 그림은 과일 테이블과 와인 한 병을 묘사한 아마추어 정물화입니다. 오른쪽 하단에 'V.A.'라는 서명이 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<home_pictures>"
#. ~ These are meant to be personal pictures with family or friends. The sort
#. of things you would have in a picture frame around the house. Nothing
#. anomalous or Cataclysm-related should show up in these pictures; however,
#. they could be linked to game lore, locations, or events. Feel free to
#. contribute more, as this gives more variety to houses and people from
#. before the Cataclysm.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A gloomy painting of a man in a boat during a storm.  The man is rowing "
"towards a lighthouse in the distance."
msgstr "폭풍 속 배에 탄 남자를 묘사한 우울한 그림. 남자는 멀리 있는 등대를 향해 노를 저어 가고 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<hp_nested>"
#. ~ Snippets for Pictures, I split them from the home_pictures list because
#. these include nesting of other snippets and I thought it might get
#. confusing.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid "A scaled-down image of a famous movie poster!  <movie_poster>"
msgstr "유명 영화 포스터의 축소판 이미지! <movie_poster>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<hp_nested>"
#. ~ Snippets for Pictures, I split them from the home_pictures list because
#. these include nesting of other snippets and I thought it might get
#. confusing.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A framed photo from a graduation ceremony.  It features <grad_base>, wearing"
" a <color> gown.  <grad_details>"
msgstr ""
"졸업식 사진 액자입니다. <grad_base>가 <color> 색상의 가운을 입고 있는 모습이 담겨 있습니다. <grad_details>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<hp_nested>"
#. ~ Snippets for Pictures, I split them from the home_pictures list because
#. these include nesting of other snippets and I thought it might get
#. confusing.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"Someone took the time to frame this small puzzle.  It depicts <puzzle_desc>"
msgstr "누군가 시간을 내어 이 작은 퍼즐을 만들었습니다. 이 퍼즐에는 <puzzle_desc>가 그려져 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<movie_poster>"
#. ~ These snippets are for movie posters in hp_nested, look at hp_nested_1
#. for formatting around them.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"An imposing figure stands in an old-fashioned diving suit, the mask "
"radiating faint, electric blue light!  The poster is signed by a few members"
" of the cast."
msgstr ""
"구식 잠수복을 입은 위풍당당한 인물이 서 있고, 가면에서 희미한 푸른색 전기빛이 뿜어져 나옵니다! 포스터에는 몇몇 출연진의 사인이 들어 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<movie_poster>"
#. ~ These snippets are for movie posters in hp_nested, look at hp_nested_1
#. for formatting around them.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"It shows an overlap of two faces: on the left is a small boy, and on the "
"right, a dead-eyed killer!"
msgstr "두 얼굴이 겹쳐져 있는 모습이 그려져 있습니다. 왼쪽은 어린 소년이고, 오른쪽은 눈빛이 죽은 살인마입니다!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<movie_poster>"
#. ~ These snippets are for movie posters in hp_nested, look at hp_nested_1
#. for formatting around them.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"It features a horrifically mutated but vaguely humanoid reptile, cowering in"
" a dark corner.  Across the bottom, oozing text reads \"Prehistoric "
"Pandemonium, February 14, 2021.\""
msgstr ""
"끔찍하게 돌연변이를 일으켰지만 어렴풋이 인간과 닮은 파충류가 어두운 구석에 웅크리고 있는 모습이 묘사되어 있습니다. 바닥에는 \"선사시대"
" 대혼란, 2021년 2월 14일\"이라는 글이 흘러내립니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<movie_poster>"
#. ~ These snippets are for movie posters in hp_nested, look at hp_nested_1
#. for formatting around them.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"Harsh light spills across a woman's face.  In the shadows behind her, a "
"masked figure lurks with a sickle in hand!"
msgstr "강렬한 빛이 한 여자의 얼굴에 쏟아진다. 그녀 뒤의 그림자 속에는 낫을 든 가면 쓴 형체가 숨어 있다!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<movie_poster>"
#. ~ These snippets are for movie posters in hp_nested, look at hp_nested_1
#. for formatting around them.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A man is dressed in horrible green makeup, arms outstretched, broken teeth "
"bared in an attempt to scare the viewer.  It looks like a cheesy zombie "
"movie from the '80s."
msgstr ""
"한 남자가 끔찍한 녹색 분장을 하고 팔을 쭉 뻗은 채 부러진 이를 드러내며 보는 사람을 겁주려 하고 있습니다. 80년대의 유치한 좀비 "
"영화처럼 보입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<movie_poster>"
#. ~ These snippets are for movie posters in hp_nested, look at hp_nested_1
#. for formatting around them.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"It features two attractive people, arms crossed.  All these movie posters "
"look the same…"
msgstr "두 매력적인 사람이 팔짱을 끼고 있는 모습이 담겨 있습니다. 이 영화 포스터들은 다 똑같아 보이는데요…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<movie_poster>"
#. ~ These snippets are for movie posters in hp_nested, look at hp_nested_1
#. for formatting around them.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"Two men are in a diner, one a waiter and the other a customer.  Both are "
"smiling coyly, their eyes locked, fingertips barely touching beside a mug of"
" coffee."
msgstr ""
"두 남자가 식당에 있는데, 한 명은 웨이터이고 다른 한 명은 손님이다. 두 사람 모두 수줍게 미소 짓고, 눈을 마주치며, 커피 잔 옆에 "
"놓인 손끝이 간신히 맞닿아 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<movie_poster>"
#. ~ These snippets are for movie posters in hp_nested, look at hp_nested_1
#. for formatting around them.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"Two women stand on opposite sides of the poster, one with a little girl and "
"one with a little boy.  Both of the children are pouting, but the women "
"smile placidly.  Across the middle is text that reads \"Your Mom Can't Date "
"My Mom!\""
msgstr ""
"포스터 양쪽에는 두 여자가 서 있는데, 한 명은 어린 여자아이를, 다른 한 명은 어린 남자아이를 안고 있습니다. 두 아이는 모두 뿌루퉁해"
" 보이지만, 두 여자는 태연하게 미소 짓고 있습니다. 포스터 중앙에는 \"네 엄마는 우리 엄마랑 사귈 수 없어!\"라는 문구가 적혀 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<movie_poster>"
#. ~ These snippets are for movie posters in hp_nested, look at hp_nested_1
#. for formatting around them.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A short, petite woman with frizzy blonde hair is pointing her finger angrily"
" at the face of the man next to her.  By comparison, he's tall, with dark, "
"tanned skin and a huge beard, his muscles bulging beneath a flannel shirt.  "
"The title across the poster reads \"Coed vs Lumberjack\" with text that "
"promises hijinks."
msgstr ""
"곱슬거리는 금발 머리를 한 작고 아담한 여자가 옆에 앉은 남자의 얼굴을 향해 화난 듯 손가락으로 가리키고 있다. 그에 비해 그는 키가 "
"크고 검고 그을린 피부에 덥수룩한 수염을 기르고 있으며, 플란넬 셔츠 아래로 불룩한 근육이 드러난다. 포스터에는 \"여학생 vs "
"벌목꾼\"이라는 제목과 함께 장난스러운 장면이 나올 것 같은 문구가 적혀 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<movie_poster>"
#. ~ These snippets are for movie posters in hp_nested, look at hp_nested_1
#. for formatting around them.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A nerdy, dark-skinned teenager peers down from the balcony of his college "
"dorm.  On the ground, a strikingly beautiful young woman is tending to the "
"flowers in her garden.  The title reads \"The Goddess Next Door.\""
msgstr ""
"까무잡잡하고 피부색이 어두운 십 대 소녀가 대학 기숙사 발코니에서 아래를 내려다보고 있다. 바닥에는 눈부시게 아름다운 젊은 여성이 정원의"
" 꽃을 가꾸고 있다. 제목은 \"옆집의 여신\"이다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<movie_poster>"
#. ~ These snippets are for movie posters in hp_nested, look at hp_nested_1
#. for formatting around them.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"It features a bald, angry man holding a gun in one hand and a cellphone in "
"the other.  Text across the poster reads \"Hope Dies… THIS SUMMER.\""
msgstr ""
"한 손에는 총을, 다른 한 손에는 휴대폰을 든 대머리의 화난 남자가 등장합니다. 포스터에는 \"희망은… 이번 여름에 사라진다\"라는 "
"문구가 적혀 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<movie_poster>"
#. ~ These snippets are for movie posters in hp_nested, look at hp_nested_1
#. for formatting around them.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A black woman stands in an action pose, a katana held in a two-handed grip."
"  Around her are men in suits holding a variety of weapons.  The title "
"simply reads \"Grace.\""
msgstr ""
"흑인 여성이 액션 포즈를 취하고 서 있다. 카타나를 양손으로 잡고 있다. 그녀 주변에는 정장을 입은 남자들이 다양한 무기를 들고 서 "
"있다. 제목은 \"그레이스\"라고만 적혀 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<movie_poster>"
#. ~ These snippets are for movie posters in hp_nested, look at hp_nested_1
#. for formatting around them.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"There's horror movie lettering in green and red that reads \"The Christmas "
"Ghoul.\"  The main imagery is a rotten, decaying cartoon monstrosity wearing"
" a Santa hat."
msgstr ""
"녹색과 빨간색으로 \"크리스마스 구울\"이라고 적힌 공포 영화 글자가 있습니다. 주된 이미지는 산타 모자를 쓴 썩어가는 만화 괴물입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<movie_poster>"
#. ~ These snippets are for movie posters in hp_nested, look at hp_nested_1
#. for formatting around them.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"It features a young man with a chiseled jaw, dressed in a World War II-era "
"uniform.  He's struggling to raise a tattered American flag."
msgstr ""
"이 그림에는 날카로운 턱을 가진 젊은 남자가 2차 세계 대전 당시 군복을 입고, 낡은 미국 국기를 게양하려고 애쓰는 모습이 담겨 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_base>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2, featuring basic
#. descriptions of a person, potentially useable elsewhere.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid "a grinning, excited <character_gender_adjective>"
msgstr "웃고, 흥분한 <character_gender_adjective>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_base>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2, featuring basic
#. descriptions of a person, potentially useable elsewhere.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid "a serious-looking <character_gender_adjective>"
msgstr "진지해 보이는 <character_gender_adjective>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_base>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2, featuring basic
#. descriptions of a person, potentially useable elsewhere.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid "a gently smiling but still reserved <character_gender_adjective>"
msgstr "부드럽게 미소 짓지만 여전히 내성적인 <character_gender_adjective>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_base>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2, featuring basic
#. descriptions of a person, potentially useable elsewhere.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid "a nervous <character_gender_adjective>"
msgstr "긴장한 <character_gender_adjective>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_base>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2, featuring basic
#. descriptions of a person, potentially useable elsewhere.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid "a vaguely sleepy-looking <character_gender_adjective>"
msgstr "막연히 졸린 듯한 <character_gender_adjective>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_base>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2, featuring basic
#. descriptions of a person, potentially useable elsewhere.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid "a bespectacled <character_gender_adjective>"
msgstr "안경을 쓴 <character_gender_adjective>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_details>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2.  They are meant
#. to add a little fluff/additional information.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid "Nearby friends are waving at the camera."
msgstr "근처에 있는 친구들이 카메라를 향해 손을 흔든다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_details>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2.  They are meant
#. to add a little fluff/additional information.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid "An older woman stands with a hand on the new graduate, smiling."
msgstr "나이 든 여성이 새로 졸업한 사람에게 손을 얹고 미소 짓고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_details>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2.  They are meant
#. to add a little fluff/additional information.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A young woman stands beside the graduate, love and adoration etched on her "
"face."
msgstr "젊은 여성이 졸업생 옆에 서 있는데, 그녀의 얼굴에는 사랑과 숭배가 새겨져 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_details>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2.  They are meant
#. to add a little fluff/additional information.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"A proud father stands with a hand on the shoulder of the recent graduate."
msgstr "자랑스러운 아버지가 갓 졸업한 학생의 어깨에 손을 얹고 서 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_details>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2.  They are meant
#. to add a little fluff/additional information.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"Someone in the background holds a sign that reads \"No More Teachers' Dirty "
"Looks!\""
msgstr "배경에 있는 누군가가 \"선생님의 더러운 눈빛은 이제 그만!\"이라고 적힌 표지판을 들고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_details>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2.  They are meant
#. to add a little fluff/additional information.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid "A cap and tassel lie discarded in the grass."
msgstr "모자와 술이 풀밭에 버려진 채 놓여 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<grad_details>"
#. ~ These snippets are for graduation photos in hp_nested_2.  They are meant
#. to add a little fluff/additional information.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid ""
"The recent graduate isn't alone; a much younger sibling stands with their "
"face buried in the folds of the gown."
msgstr "최근 졸업한 사람은 혼자가 아니다. 훨씬 어린 동생이 가운의 주름 속에 얼굴을 파묻고 서 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<puzzle_desc>"
#. ~ Snippets for puzzle descriptions.
#: data/json/snippets/home_pictures.json
msgid "a serene park scene with a family having a picnic."
