#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid ""
"Ed McMahon stands here, lost in thought.  Seeing you, he bellows, \"YES "
"SIR!\""
msgstr "에드 맥마흔이 선 채로 생각에 잠겨있습니다. 당신을 보자 힘차게 소리칩니다. \"충성!\""

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "…thingy???"
msgstr "…뭐야???"

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "It's 1000 secrets the government doesn't want you to know!"
msgstr "천 가지 기밀사항. 정부는 당신이 이것의 내용을 보는 걸 원치 않을 겁니다!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Original items from 1997 DOS version of robotfindskitten
