msgstr "황동 세탁 토큰 몇 개."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Other miscellaneous items
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "A plastic bin containing an assortment of spatulas."
msgstr "다양한 종류의 주걱이 들어 있는 플라스틱 통."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Other miscellaneous items
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "A power dongle belonging to a long-lost electronic gadget."
msgstr "오랫동안 잃어버렸던 전자 기기에 들어 있던 전원 동글."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Other miscellaneous items
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "A potato clock that someone forgot to change for Daylight Saving Time."
msgstr "누군가가 일광 절약 시간제로 바꾸는 것을 잊어버린 감자 시계."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Other miscellaneous items
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "Ninety-nine red balloons."
msgstr "99개의 빨간 풍선."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Other miscellaneous items
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "A bobble-head statue of Genghis Khan winking at you."
msgstr "징기스칸의 흔들리는 머리 조각상이 당신에게 윙크를 하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Other miscellaneous items
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "Your sense of dignity."
msgstr "당신의 존엄성."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Other miscellaneous items
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "The One Paperclip, forged in the fires of Mount Doom."
msgstr "운명의 산의 불길 속에서 만들어진 단 하나의 종이클립."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Other miscellaneous items
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid ""
"That one screw you were missing to finish building an Ikea desk three years "
"ago."
msgstr "3년 전 이케아 책상을 만드는 데 빠졌던 나사 하나가 있죠."

#. ~ Snippet in category "non_kitten_items"
#. ~ Other miscellaneous items
#: data/json/snippets/robot_finds_kitten.json
msgid "A kitten!  No… wait, it's a turkey."
msgstr "새끼 고양이! 아니… 잠깐, 칠면조예요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Hey, can you hear me?"
msgstr "안녕.내 말 들려?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I think I know what I'm doing."
msgstr "내가 뭘 하는지 아는 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Don't touch me."
msgstr "나를 만지지마."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "What's your name?"
msgstr "이름이 뭐야?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I thought you were my friend."
msgstr "난 네가 내 친구인 줄 알았어."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Shut up!  Don't lie to me."
msgstr "닥쳐! 거짓말하지마."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "How do I bring you back?"
msgstr "어떻게 하면 당신을 다시 데려올 수 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "They're all gone…"
msgstr "그들은 모두 사라졌습니다…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Why did you leave me?"
msgstr "왜 나를 떠났어?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Oh, there you are."
msgstr "아, 거기 계시군요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "…and just where have you been?"
msgstr "…그럼 당신은 어디에 계셨나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You hungry?  I've got plenty of food."
msgstr "배고프세요? 음식은 많이 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You thirsty?  I've got water."
msgstr "목마르세요? 물이 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Please don't go."
msgstr "가지 마세요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Don't leave me alone!"
msgstr "날 혼자 두지 마!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "No way man."
msgstr "안 돼, 친구."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Do you really think so?"
msgstr "정말 그렇게 생각해?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Is it really time for that?"
msgstr "정말 그것을 할 시간이야?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Sorry, I can't hear you."
msgstr "미안, 못 들었어."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You've told me already."
msgstr "넌 이미 말했어…."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I know!"
msgstr "나 알아!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Where the hell am I?"
msgstr "난 도대체 어디에 있는 거지?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Why are you following me?"
msgstr "왜 나를 미행하는 거야?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "This place is dangerous, we shouldn't be here."
msgstr "이곳은 위험한 곳이야. 우리가 여기 있으면 안 돼."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "That's not true, is it?"
msgstr "사실이 아니겠지?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Are you hurt?"
msgstr "다쳤어?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Tell me where it hurts."
msgstr "어디가 아픈지 말해줘."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Why can't you see them?"
msgstr "왜 보이지 않나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Who are you really?"
msgstr "당신은 진짜 누구인가요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "What are you hiding from me?"
msgstr "나한테 뭘 숨기는 거야?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're lying, aren't you?"
msgstr "거짓말하는 거죠?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "What if they come back?"
msgstr "만약 그들이 돌아온다면?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Do you know the way out?"
msgstr "당신은 탈출구를 알고 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Can you keep a secret?"
msgstr "비밀을 지킬 수 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Don't trust anyone."
msgstr "누구도 믿지 마세요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Everything is a lie."
msgstr "모든 것이 거짓말이에요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "They're watching us."
msgstr "그들은 우리를 지켜보고 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "It's all a game, isn't it?"
msgstr "모두 게임이잖아요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "We're just pawns in their game."
msgstr "우리는 그들의 게임에서 꼭두각시일 뿐이에요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Why can't I remember?"
msgstr "왜 기억이 나지 않는 걸까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "What did they do to you?"
msgstr "그들은 당신에게 무슨 짓을 했나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Why did you betray me?"
msgstr "왜 나를 배신했니?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You have to believe me."
msgstr "당신은 나를 믿어야 해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Why won't you listen to me?"
msgstr "왜 내 말을 듣지 않으세요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I know what I saw."
msgstr "나는 내가 본 것을 알고 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Do you think I'm crazy?"
msgstr "내가 미쳤다고 생각해?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I heard them talking about us."
msgstr "그들이 우리에 대해 이야기하는 것을 들었습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Why can't you see it?"
msgstr "왜 보이지 않나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Everything is falling apart."
msgstr "모든 것이 무너지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I can't trust my own mind."
msgstr "나는 내 마음을 믿을 수 없어."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Why are they doing this to me?"
msgstr "왜 그들은 나에게 이런 짓을 하는 걸까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You know it's true."
msgstr "그게 사실이라는 걸 알잖아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Why won't anyone help me?"
msgstr "왜 아무도 나를 도와주지 않을까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I feel like I'm losing control."
msgstr "나는 통제력을 잃어가는 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Do you hear that noise?"
msgstr "저 소리가 들리나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I can't escape this nightmare."
msgstr "나는 이 악몽에서 벗어날 수 없어."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Hey, let's go kill that %1$s!"
msgstr "이봐, 나%1$s(을)를 죽이러 가자!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Did you see that %1$s!?  Be careful."
msgstr "%1$s! 보셨나요? 조심하세요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Look out!  That creature is dangerous!"
msgstr "조심하세요! 저 괴물은 위험해요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "I want to kill that %1$s!"
msgstr "나는 %1$s(을)를 죽이고 싶어!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "That intruder looks like it wants to party."
msgstr "저 침입자는 파티를 하고 싶어하는 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "I think that %1$s wants to talk to you."
msgstr "%1$s님이 당신과 대화하고 싶어하는 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "That %1$s wants to be your friend!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 당신의 친구가 되고 싶어해요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Arrest that %1$s!"
msgstr "%1$s을 체포하세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "That %1$s hasn't met its quota."
msgstr "%1$s은(는) 할당량을 충족하지 못했습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "That guy deserves a raise!"
msgstr "저 사람은 급여 인상을 받을 자격이 있어요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "We should give that %1$s a stern talking to."
msgstr "우리는 그 %1$s에게 엄하게 질책해야 합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Maybe we can reason with that creature!"
msgstr "어쩌면 우리는 그 생물과 논리적으로 대화할 수 있을지도 몰라요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "That %1$s must be pulling the strings…"
msgstr "저 %1$s가 실마리를 잡고 있는 모양이네요…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Let me kill that %1$s!  Please?"
msgstr "%1$s을(를) 죽여주세요! 제발요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "I need to kill that %1$s!"
msgstr "%1$s을 죽여야 해!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "I want to watch that %1$s bleed!"
msgstr "나는 %1$s(이)가 피 흘리는걸 보고싶어!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Wait, that %1$s needs to die!"
msgstr "잠깐, %1$s(은)는 죽여야 해!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Go kill that %1$s!  NOW!"
msgstr "지금 당장 %1$s를 죽여라!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Stop!  Look at that monster."
msgstr "잠깐! 저 괴물 좀 봐."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "That %1$s doesn't deserve to live!"
msgstr "그 %1$s(은)는 살 자격이 없어!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "That %1$s is a menace!"
msgstr "%1$s는 위협적이야!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Take down that %1$s!"
msgstr "%1$s을 없애세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Eliminate that %1$s!"
msgstr "%1$s을 제거하세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "That %1$s is pure evil!"
msgstr "그 %1$s은 정말 사악해요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Destroy that %1$s before it gets you!"
msgstr "%1$s이 당신을 잡기 전에 파괴하세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "That %1$s wants to kill you!"
msgstr "저 %1$s가 당신을 죽이려고 해요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Don't let that %1$s get away!"
msgstr "%1$s이 빠져나가도록 두지 마세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Show that %1$s no mercy!"
msgstr "%1$s에게 자비를 베풀지 마세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "That %1$s is our enemy!"
msgstr "저 %1$s는 우리의 적입니다!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Terminate that %1$s!"
msgstr "%1$s을 종료하세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "That %1$s is hiding something!"
msgstr "%1$s이 뭔가를 숨기고 있어요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "You can't trust that %1$s!"
msgstr "%1$s은 믿을 수 없어!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "That %1$s has to die!"
msgstr "저 %1$s는 죽어야 해!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "No more chances for that %1$s!"
msgstr "%1$s에 대한 기회는 더 이상 없습니다!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "That %1$s is a traitor!"
msgstr "그 %1$s는 배신자예요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Finish that %1$s now!"
msgstr "지금 %1$s을 끝내세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Take out that %1$s before it takes us out!"
msgstr "우리도 멸망하기 전에 %1$s을 제거해!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "That %1$s is laughing at us!"
msgstr "저 %1$s가 우리를 비웃고 있어요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "That %1$s knows we're here!"
msgstr "%1$s는 우리가 여기 있다는 걸 알고 있어요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_monster>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#, c-format
msgid "Silence that %1$s forever!"
msgstr "%1$s을 영원히 침묵시켜라!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Hey, you're hurt."
msgstr "야, 너 다쳤잖아."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Your wound looks pretty bad."
msgstr "너 상처가 많이 않 좋아보여."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Shouldn't you put a bandage on that?"
msgstr "붕대좀 감아야 될거같은데?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You look hurt, did I do that?  I'm sorry."
msgstr "상처받은 것 같은데, 내가 그랬나요? 죄송해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Please don't die!  No one else lets me kill things!"
msgstr "죽으면 안돼! 네가 없으면 누구랑 같이 저것들을 죽여야 해!?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Are you supposed to be bleeding?"
msgstr "피를 흘리기로 한 거야?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're not going to die are you?"
msgstr "당신은 죽지 않을 거예요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're bleeding you know."
msgstr "당신은 피를 흘리고 있다는 걸 알고 있죠."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "That's not jelly on your coat lad, that's blood!"
msgstr "당신 코트에 묻은 건 젤리가 아니라 피예요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Take out a few more before you die!"
msgstr "죽기 전에 몇 개 더 꺼내보세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Oh God.  Please don't die.  Not now!"
msgstr "오, 신이시여. 제발 죽지 마세요. 지금은 안 돼요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "'Tis but a flesh wound."
msgstr "그것은 단지 육체적 상처일 뿐이야."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Gross, you're bleeding all over me."
msgstr "으악, 내 몸 전체에 피가 흐르고 있잖아."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Hold fast, you can do this."
msgstr "굳게 붙잡으세요. 당신은 할 수 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "When's your next doctor's appointment?"
msgstr "다음 병원 예약은 언제인가요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Do you need a medic?"
msgstr "의료진이 필요하신가요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Don't bleed out on me!"
msgstr "내 몸에서 피 흘리지 마!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're leaking, fix it!"
msgstr "누수가 발생하고 있습니다. 고쳐주세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Patch that up quickly!"
msgstr "빨리 고쳐주세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You can't fight if you're bleeding like that!"
msgstr "그렇게 피를 흘리면 싸울 수 없어!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Hey, you're making a mess!"
msgstr "야, 너 정말 엉망진창이잖아!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Your blood is everywhere!"
msgstr "당신의 피가 도처에 흐르고 있어요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You need to stop that bleeding!"
msgstr "출혈을 멈춰야 해요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "That's a lot of blood…"
msgstr "피가 정말 많네요..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Are you feeling faint?"
msgstr "현기증을 느끼시나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Do something about that wound!"
msgstr "그 상처를 어떻게든 치료하세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Your injury looks serious."
msgstr "부상이 심각해 보이네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "We need to find help, fast!"
msgstr "우리는 빨리 도움을 받아야 해요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You won't last long like this!"
msgstr "이렇게는 오래 버틸 수 없을 거야!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're in bad shape!"
msgstr "당신은 나쁜 상태에 있어요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Can you still move?"
msgstr "아직 움직일 수 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're losing too much blood!"
msgstr "피를 너무 많이 흘리고 있어요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Stay with me, don't pass out!"
msgstr "내 말을 잘 들어요, 기절하지 마세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You look like you're about to collapse."
msgstr "당신은 쓰러질 것 같은 표정을 짓고 있군요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Can you make it?"
msgstr "만들 수 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're hurt bad, aren't you?"
msgstr "당신은 심하게 다쳤죠?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "We need to stop the bleeding now!"
msgstr "지금 당장 출혈을 멈춰야 해요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Don't let it get worse!"
msgstr "더 악화되지 않도록 하세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_bleeding>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You need medical attention immediately!"
msgstr "즉시 의료 처치가 필요합니다!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Hey, fix me up will ya?"
msgstr "야, 나 좀 고쳐줄래?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I need healing!"
msgstr "나 치료가 필요해!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "It hurts all over…"
msgstr "온몸이 아프다…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You can put me back together, right?"
msgstr "나를 다시 합류시키겠지, 그렇지?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I… I can't move my legs!"
msgstr "다… 다리가 안 움직여!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Medic!"
msgstr "의사!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You gonna let me die too?!"
msgstr "나도 죽게 둘 거야?!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "No!  I can't die now!"
msgstr "안돼! 지금은 죽을 수 없어!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I can still fight, don't replace me!"
msgstr "난 여전히 싸울 수 있어, 날 교체하지 마!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "They got me!"
msgstr "그들이 날 잡았어!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're nothing without me, NOTHING!"
msgstr "너는 나 없이는 아무것도 아니야, 아무것도!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "*cough cough* Go on without me…"
msgstr "켁켁, 난 놔두고 빨리 가…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Am I gonna die?"
msgstr "내가 죽게 되?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Is anybody here a doctor!?"
msgstr "여기 의사분 계신가요!?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm falling apart!"
msgstr "나는 무너져가고 있어!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Repair me, quick!"
msgstr "빨리 고쳐주세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm not functioning properly!"
msgstr "제 기능이 제대로 작동하지 않아요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Help, I'm damaged!"
msgstr "도와주세요, 제가 다쳤어요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Can't you see I'm broken?"
msgstr "내가 망가졌다는 걸 모르겠어?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I need repairs!"
msgstr "수리해야 해요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm losing integrity!"
msgstr "나는 정직성을 잃어가고 있어요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Don't abandon me like this!"
msgstr "나를 이렇게 버리지 마세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm malfunctioning!"
msgstr "제 기능이 작동하지 않아요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm in bad shape, fix me!"
msgstr "내 상태가 안 좋아요, 고쳐주세요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I can't keep going like this!"
msgstr "이렇게 계속할 수는 없어!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm breaking down!"
msgstr "나는 무너지고 있어!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Can you fix me?"
msgstr "나를 고칠 수 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm all busted up!"
msgstr "난 완전히 망가졌어!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "They did a number on me!"
msgstr "그들은 나에게 엄청난 짓을 저질렀어요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Don't let me fall apart!"
msgstr "나를 무너뜨리지 말아요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I need some serious repairs!"
msgstr "심각한 수리가 필요해요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm in pieces over here!"
msgstr "나는 여기 산산조각이 났어요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Can you put me back together?"
msgstr "나를 다시 조립해 줄 수 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I've seen better days!"
msgstr "더 좋은 날도 봤어요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm not as tough as I used to be!"
msgstr "나는 예전만큼 강하지 않아!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "This isn't looking good for me!"
msgstr "이건 나에게 좋지 않은 일이야!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm falling to bits!"
msgstr "나는 망가져가고 있어!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_damaged>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm barely holding together!"
msgstr "나는 간신히 버티고 있어!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Let me kill something already!"
msgstr "뭔가를 죽이게 해줘!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm bored."
msgstr "지루해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "What's for dinner?"
msgstr "저녁은 뭐 먹지?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Wow!  Everything looks so… nevermind."
msgstr "와! 모든 게 너무… 괜찮아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You seriously need friends."
msgstr "당신에게는 정말 친구가 필요해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "So, got any hobbies?"
msgstr "그럼, 취미가 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I spy with my little eye… oh right, I don't have eyes."
msgstr "나는 내 작은 눈으로 살펴보았다... 아, 맞다, 나는 눈이 없다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Lovely weather we're having, huh?"
msgstr "날씨가 참 좋죠?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "So what if everyone you know is dead, you've still got me, right?"
msgstr "아는 사람들이 다 죽었다고 해도, 난 아직 살아있잖아, 그렇지?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Best friends forever!"
msgstr "영원한 가장 친한 친구!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Come on!  What're we doing here?!"
msgstr "어서! 우리 여기서 뭐 하는 거야?!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "This trip was pointless."
msgstr "이 여행은 무의미했습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're gonna die out here."
msgstr "너는 여기서 죽을 거야."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're in charge?  We're screwed."
msgstr "네가 책임자라고? 우리는 망했어."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Dang, you look terrible."
msgstr "아, 정말 끔찍해 보이네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You should take a shower."
msgstr "샤워를 해야죠."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "We should go home, it's not safe here."
msgstr "우리는 집에 가야 해요. 여기는 안전하지 않아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "We're in over our heads!"
msgstr "우리는 도저히 감당할 수 없는 상황에 처해 있어요!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "There's something following us, I can feel it."
msgstr "뭔가 우리를 따라오는 게 느껴져요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm your best friend, right?"
msgstr "난 너의 제일 친한 친구야, 그렇지?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Sorry about earlier, can you forgive me?"
msgstr "아까 죄송했는데 용서해 주시겠어요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Do you think it'll rain today?"
msgstr "오늘 비가 올 것 같아요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I love you!"
msgstr "난 너를 사랑해!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Shhh… I think I heard something."
msgstr "쉿… 뭔가 들리는 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Did you hear that?"
msgstr "방금 이상한 소리 들었어?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Try not to drop me."
msgstr "나를 떨어트리지 마."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "How many do you think we've killed?"
msgstr "우리가 몇 명이나 죽였을까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'll keep you safe."
msgstr "내가 당신을 안전하게 지켜줄게요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Do you ever wonder why we're here?"
msgstr "우리가 왜 여기에 있는지 궁금한 적이 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I think we should turn back."
msgstr "우리는 돌아가야 할 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Is this real life?"
msgstr "이게 현실인가요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You can't survive without me."
msgstr "당신은 나 없이는 살 수 없어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Do you believe in fate?"
msgstr "당신은 운명을 믿나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "What if this is all a dream?"
msgstr "만약 이 모든 것이 꿈이라면?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Are we being followed?"
msgstr "우리를 미행하는 사람이 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I think we're lost."
msgstr "우리는 길을 잃은 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm the only one you can trust."
msgstr "당신이 믿을 수 있는 사람은 나뿐이에요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Do you remember the good old days?"
msgstr "옛날 좋았던 시절을 기억하시나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You're not alone, you have me."
msgstr "당신은 혼자가 아니에요. 당신과 같은 사람이 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Everything is going to be fine."
msgstr "모든 것이 잘 될 거예요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I'm feeling chatty today."
msgstr "오늘은 수다스러운 기분이네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Ever had one of those days?"
msgstr "그런 날이 있었던 적이 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "What's the plan now?"
msgstr "이제 계획은 뭐야?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I miss the old days."
msgstr "옛날이 그리워요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "It's awfully quiet around here."
msgstr "여기 주변은 정말 조용해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You need a hobby."
msgstr "취미가 필요해요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Have you ever seen anything like this?"
msgstr "이런 것을 본 적이 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "We should rest soon."
msgstr "우리는 곧 휴식을 취해야 합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I've got your back."
msgstr "내가 당신을 지킬게요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "We make a great team."
msgstr "우리는 훌륭한 팀을 이루었습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "This place gives me the creeps."
msgstr "이곳은 소름이 끼친다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Got any stories to share?"
msgstr "공유하고 싶은 이야기가 있나요?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I think we're being watched."
msgstr "누군가가 우리를 지켜보고 있는 것 같아요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/npc/TALK_FORGE_PIRATE.json
msgid "Watch your step."
msgstr "발걸음을 조심하세요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I've seen worse."
msgstr "더 나쁜 것도 봤어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "I think I'm growing on you."
msgstr "나도 점점 너와 친해지는 것 같아."

#. ~ Snippet in category "<schizo_weapon_talk_misc>"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "What's our next move?"
msgstr "우리의 다음 움직임은 무엇일까?"

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel like the world is out to get you."
msgstr "온 세상이 당신을 괴롭히는 기분이 듭니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel a mounting sense of impending doom."
msgstr "가까워지는 멸망에 대한 기분이 당신을 짓누릅니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_grandiose"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid ""
"You gain the sudden realization that you must have been responsible for the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr "당신이 이 종말에 대한 책임이 있다는 갑작스러운 깨달음이 찾아옵니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You get the odd feeling that your thoughts are not your own."
msgstr "당신의 생각을 스스로 떠올린게 아닌 것 같다는 기이한 기분이 듭니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid ""
"You feel as if everyone in the world must be playing a sick prank on you."
msgstr "온 세상의 모두가 당신을 상대로 개같은 장난을 치는 기분이 듭니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You are being watched… by THEM."
msgstr "놈들이… 당신을 지켜보고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel like you should get back home."
msgstr "당신은 집으로 돌아가야 할 것 같은 기분이 듭니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You can feel your heart racing, something is watching you."
msgstr "심장이 쿵쾅거리는 것을 느낄 수 있고, 누군가 당신을 지켜보고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel lost.  Painfully and irrevocably lost."
msgstr "당신은 길을 잃은 듯한 느낌을 받습니다. 고통스럽고 돌이킬 수 없을 정도로 길을 잃은 듯한 느낌입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You know someone is following you."
msgstr "누군가가 당신을 쫓고 있다는 것을 알고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel eyes on you, but see no one."
msgstr "당신은 누군가 당신을 지켜보고 있다는 것을 느끼지만 아무도 보이지 않습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Everyone is conspiring against you."
msgstr "모두가 당신을 상대로 음모를 꾸미고 있어요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You hear whispers behind your back."
msgstr "당신은 등 뒤에서 속삭이는 소리를 듣습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "They are trying to control your mind."
msgstr "그들은 당신의 마음을 통제하려고 합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel like a puppet on strings."
msgstr "마치 줄에 매달린 인형 같은 기분이 든다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You suspect your food is poisoned."
msgstr "음식에 독이 들어 있다고 의심됩니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Every shadow hides an enemy."
msgstr "모든 그림자 속에는 적이 숨어 있다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You can't trust anyone, not even yourself."
msgstr "당신은 누구도 믿을 수 없고, 심지어 자신도 믿을 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Someone is listening to your thoughts."
msgstr "누군가 당신의 생각을 듣고 있습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Your mind feels like it's being invaded."
msgstr "당신의 마음은 침략당하는 것 같은 느낌을 받습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You hear footsteps behind you, but see no one."
msgstr "뒤에서 발소리가 들리지만 아무도 보이지 않습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel like you're being hunted."
msgstr "마치 사냥당하는 듯한 기분이 든다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Your thoughts are not your own."
msgstr "당신의 생각은 당신 자신의 것이 아닙니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You sense danger around every corner."
msgstr "당신은 모든 모퉁이에서 위험을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel like you're being watched constantly."
msgstr "당신은 끊임없이 감시당하는 듯한 느낌을 받습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You hear voices whispering secrets."
msgstr "비밀을 속삭이는 목소리가 들립니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You can't shake the feeling of dread."
msgstr "당신은 공포감을 떨칠 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel like you're in a nightmare."
msgstr "마치 악몽 속에 있는 것 같은 느낌이 듭니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Every sound makes you jump."
msgstr "모든 소리에 깜짝 놀라요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel like a target."
msgstr "당신은 표적이 된 것 같은 기분이 든다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You can't trust what you see."
msgstr "당신은 자신이 보는 것을 믿을 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel a presence behind you."
msgstr "당신은 당신 뒤에 누군가의 존재를 느낍니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
