#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You feel like you're going mad."
msgstr "미칠 것 같은 기분이 든다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "You can't escape the feeling of being watched."
msgstr "누군가가 당신을 지켜보고 있다는 느낌은 피할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_delusion_paranoid"
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
