#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_dissection_with_prof"
#. ~ This is a dissection, and we are trained for dissection, so no morale
#. penalty, anger, and lighter flavor text.
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You grit your teeth and get to work."
msgstr "당신은 이를 악물고 일을 시작합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_dissection_with_prof"
#. ~ This is a dissection, and we are trained for dissection, so no morale
#. penalty, anger, and lighter flavor text.
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "The task at hand is unpleasant, but you steel your nerves regardless."
msgstr "눈앞에 놓인 일은 즐겁지 않지만, 당신은 그럼에도 불구하고 마음을 단단히 먹습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_dissection_with_prof"
#. ~ This is a dissection, and we are trained for dissection, so no morale
#. penalty, anger, and lighter flavor text.
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"Hopefully whatever you can glean from this autopsy is worth the effort."
msgstr "부검을 통해 얻을 수 있는 정보가 그만한 가치가 있기를 바랍니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_dissection_no_prof"
#. ~ Message indicating we are dissecting without the stomach for it, but not
#. actually butchering.  Lower morale penalty
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"This is nothing like dissecting a frog in biology class.  You feel sick "
"inside."
msgstr "생물학 수업 때 했던 개구리 해부 실험과는 비교조차 되지도 않습니다. 속이 안좋군요…"

#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_dissection_no_prof"
#. ~ Message indicating we are dissecting without the stomach for it, but not
#. actually butchering.  Lower morale penalty
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You wonder how anyone manages to do this ghastly work."
msgstr "어떻게 이런 끔찍한 일을 해낼 수 있는지 궁금하네요."

#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_dissection_no_prof"
#. ~ Message indicating we are dissecting without the stomach for it, but not
#. actually butchering.  Lower morale penalty
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"The grim nature of your task deeply upsets you, leaving you feeling "
"disgusted with yourself."
msgstr "당신이 맡은 업무의 암울한 성격은 당신을 깊이 화나게 하고, 당신 자신에게 혐오감을 느끼게 합니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_butchery"
#. ~ Message showing a character disgust of butchering a fellow human.  Do not
#. include dissection or dismemberment.
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "You clench your teeth at the prospect of this gruesome job."
msgstr "이 소름끼치는 작업을 생각해보고 이를 악물었습니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_butchery"
#. ~ Message showing a character disgust of butchering a fellow human.  Do not
#. include dissection or dismemberment.
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid "This will haunt you in your dreams."
msgstr "꿈자리가 뒤숭숭할 것입니다."

#. ~ Snippet in category "msg_human_butchery"
#. ~ Message showing a character disgust of butchering a fellow human.  Do not
#. include dissection or dismemberment.
#: data/json/snippets/snippets.json
msgid ""
"You try to look away, but this gruesome image will stay on your mind for "
"some time."
msgstr "머리에서 지우려고 했지만, 그 끔찍한 광경이 계속해서 머리에 남아 있습니다."

