#. ~ Snippet in category "<good_job>"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/praise.json
msgid "I say, smashing job!"
msgstr "지워버려라!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<good_job>"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/praise.json
msgid "Like, totally gnarly!"
msgstr "없애버려라!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<good_job>"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/praise.json
msgid "Nice, <u_name>!"
msgstr "잘했다, <u_name>!"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<good_job>"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/praise.json
msgid "Good job, <u_name>!"
msgstr "대단하구나, <u_name>!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_radio_infusion_true" in nested EOCs
#. on true condition in effect in EoC "EOC_radio_infusion"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/radio_infusion.json
msgid ""
"You focus on what you are holding, and suddenly it starts glowing green."
msgstr "당신이 손에 든 것에 집중하면, 갑자기 그것이 녹색으로 빛나기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_rage_against_the_unnatural_penalty"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/rage_against_the_unnatural.json
msgid "Red Rage"
msgstr "붉은 분노"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Red Rage"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/rage_against_the_unnatural.json
msgid "You are filled with a furious rage that is sending your swings wide."
msgstr "당신은 맹렬한 분노에 사로잡혀 휘두르기가 힘들어집니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Red Rage"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/rage_against_the_unnatural.json
msgid ""
"Crimson clouds your vision as a rage fills you at the presence of these "
"hell-spawn.  You must slay them!  It is they who should feel the sting of "
"your blade, not the rabble!"
msgstr ""
"이 지옥의 자식들 앞에서 분노가 치밀어 오르고 시야가 붉게 물든다. 놈들을 처치해야 한다! 네 칼날에 찔릴 사람은 폭도들이 아니라 바로 "
"저들이다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_can_hunting"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/recycler.json
msgid "Someone left a perfectly good can of soda on the ground!"
msgstr "누가 땅에 상태가 좋은 탄산음료를 두고 갔군요!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_can_finder_on"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/recycler.json
msgid "You start hunting for cans"
msgstr "깡통을 찾기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_can_finder_off"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/recycler.json
msgid "You stop looking for cans"
msgstr "깡통을 찾는 걸 멈춥니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PERK_SECOND_CHANCE_PREVENTION"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/second_chance.json
msgid "As the wounds overtake you, you feel a surge of inner strength."
msgstr "상처가 당신을 압도하면서 내면의 힘이 솟구치는 것을 느낀다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_perk_second_chance"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/second_chance.json
msgid "Surge of Energy"
msgstr "에너지의 급증"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Surge of Energy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/second_chance.json
msgid "You are filled with vitality!"
msgstr "당신은 활력으로 가득 차 있습니다!"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Surge of Energy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/second_chance.json
msgid "Your surge of vitality fades away!"
msgstr "활력이 솟구치던 것이 사라져 버립니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_perk_sight_beyond_sight_ON"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/sight_beyond_sight.json
msgid "You close your eyes and feel the air."
msgstr "당신은 눈을 감고 주변을 의식하기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_perk_sight_beyond_sight_ON"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/sight_beyond_sight.json
msgid "You open your eyes."
msgstr "눈을 뜹니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/skeleton.json
msgid "skeletal plate"
msgid_plural "skeletal plates"
msgstr[0] "골격 갑옷"

#. ~ Description of "skeletal plate"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/skeleton.json
msgid "A full body multilayered suit of skeletal plate armor."
msgstr "몸을 둘러싼 뼈로 이루어진 판금 갑옷입니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PERK_PORTAL_STORM_BIRD_MUTATOR"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PERK_PORTAL_STORM_FELINE_MUTATOR"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PERK_PORTAL_STORM_INSECT_MUTATOR"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PERK_PORTAL_STORM_LUPINE_MUTATOR"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PERK_PORTAL_STORM_PLANT_MUTATOR"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PERK_PORTAL_STORM_SPIDER_MUTATOR"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/stormwrought.json
msgid "Your whole body pulses in time with the raging storm."
msgstr "당신의 몸이 폭풍의 리듬을 타듯 진동하는 것이 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/thick_skull.json
msgid "thick skull"
msgid_plural "thick skull"
msgstr[0] "두꺼운 머리"

#. ~ Description of "thick skull"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/thick_skull.json
msgid ""
"You've taken so many hits to the head that your skull's gotten thicker."
msgstr "머리을 하도 얻어맞은 탓에 돌머리가 됐군요."

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC "EOC_troubleseeking"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/troubleseeker.json
msgid "You suddenly feel that you have found some trouble."
msgstr "판 좀 벌일 녀석을 찾은 듯 합니다."

#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC "EOC_troubleseeking"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/troubleseeker.json
msgid "You suddenly feel that you have found a lot of trouble."
msgstr "판 좀 크게 벌일 녀석을 찾은 듯 합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_troubleseek_on"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/troubleseeker.json
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perkdata/troubleseeker.json
msgid "You start seeking trouble."
msgstr "판을 벌일 준비가 되었습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_troubleseek_off"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/troubleseeker.json
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perkdata/troubleseeker.json
msgid "You stop seeking trouble for now."
msgstr "판을 벌이는 걸 그만둡니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Twice Shy"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/twice_shy.json
msgid "That first time really smarts.  +2 effective dodge, +1 dodge attempt."
msgstr "처음엔 정말 짜증나. 효과적인 회피 +2, 회피 시도 +1."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Undying Loyalty"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/undying_loyalty.json
msgid "You'll protect your allies no matter the cost."
msgstr "무슨 일이 있어도 동료를 보호할겁니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_unopenable_grip_toggle_check" in
#. nested EOCs on true condition in effect in EoC "EOC_unopenable_grip"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/unopenable_grip.json
msgid "You focus on your grip, making it impossible to drop what you hold."
msgstr "당신은 잡는 데 집중하기 때문에 잡은 것을 떨어뜨리는 일이 불가능합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_unopenable_grip_toggle_attempt" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_unopenable_grip_toggle_check" in
#. nested EOCs on true condition in effect in EoC "EOC_unopenable_grip"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/unopenable_grip.json
msgid ""
"You loosen your grip on what you're holding.  You can now drop it if you "
"want."
msgstr "지금 쥐고 있는 것을 놓으세요. 이제 원하면 버릴 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_unopenable_grip_toggle_attempt" in nested EOCs in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_unopenable_grip_toggle_check" in nested EOCs on true condition in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_unopenable_grip"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/unopenable_grip.json
msgid ""
"You cannot get a proper grip on this item, so your attempts to hold it with "
"all your might are fruitless."
msgstr "당신은 이 물건을 제대로 잡을 수 없으므로, 온 힘을 다해 잡으려는 시도는 무위로 돌아갑니다."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#. ~ Description of JSON flag "IS_GRIPPED"
#: data/mods/BombasticPerks/perkdata/unopenable_grip.json
msgid ""
"You are holding this object really hard, so hard it cannot be removed from "
"your hand unless you die.  Activate the unopenable grip perk again to be "
"able to drop this object."
msgstr ""
