"<color_yellow>Skynet</color>: (Robots have decided that humans are the "
"enemy!)"
msgstr "<color_yellow>스카이넷</color>: (로봇은 인간이 적이라고 판단했습니다!)"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
