msgstr "상인 거래를 비활성화합니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid "Enable merchant trading."
msgstr "상인 거래를 활성화합니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid "Disable special waves."
msgstr "특수파동을 비활성화합니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid "Enable special waves."
msgstr "특수파동을 활성화합니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid "Disable portal storms."
msgstr "포털 폭풍을 비활성화합니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid "Enable portal storms."
msgstr "포털 스톰을 활성화합니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid "Disable random events."
msgstr "무작위 이벤트를 비활성화합니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid "Enable random events."
msgstr "무작위 이벤트를 활성화합니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid "How hard do you want your game to be?"
msgstr "당신은 얼마나 어려운 게임을 원하시나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid ""
"<color_yellow>Easy</color>: No additional enemies spawn per wave, and you "
"get a second chance when you die the first time.  Good for newcomers or "
"those not familiar with isometric horde fighters."
msgstr ""
"<color_yellow>쉬움</color>: 웨이브마다 추가 적이 생성되지 않으며, 처음 죽을 때 두 번째 기회를 얻습니다. 초보자나 "
"등각 투영 호드 전투에 익숙하지 않은 플레이어에게 적합합니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid ""
"<color_yellow>Normal</color>: The basic way to play, no additional enemies, "
"with no safety nets.  This is considered the default."
msgstr ""
"<color_yellow>일반</color>: 추가 적이나 안전장치가 없는 기본적인 플레이 방식입니다. 기본값으로 간주됩니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid ""
"<color_yellow>Difficult</color>: More enemies spawn per wave, but nothing "
"too extreme.  You'll have to fight harder to live, but more loot comes with "
"it too."
msgstr ""
"<color_yellow>어려움</color>: 웨이브마다 더 많은 적이 생성되지만, 지나치게 심각하지는 않습니다. 살아남으려면 더 "
"열심히 싸워야 하지만, 그만큼 더 많은 전리품도 얻을 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid ""
"<color_yellow>Hard</color>: Twice the number of enemies will spawn per wave."
"  A true challenge to test your metal."
msgstr ""
"<color_yellow>어려움</color>: 웨이브당 적의 수가 두 배로 증가합니다. 실력을 시험해 볼 수 있는 진정한 도전입니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid ""
"<color_yellow>Nightmare</color>: Three times the number of enemies will "
"attack you, making things a long and brutal slog though guts and blood.  "
"Come prepared to possibly fail a few times."
msgstr ""
"<color_yellow>악몽</color>: 세 배나 많은 적들이 당신을 공격할 것입니다. 피와 내장을 찢으며 길고 잔혹한 싸움을 "
"벌여야 합니다. 몇 번 실패할 수도 있다는 것을 각오하고 오세요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid ""
"<color_yellow>DOOM</color>: Fives times the number of enemies will attack "
"you.  Armies will come to your door, and what they will be met with is up to"
" you to decide.  Incredibly difficult."
msgstr ""
"<color_yellow>둠</color>: 적의 수가 5배나 증가하여 공격해 옵니다. 군대가 문 앞까지 들이닥치고, 그들이 어떤 공격을"
" 할지는 당신의 선택에 달려 있습니다. 엄청나게 어렵습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid "Make a custom difficulty."
msgstr "사용자 정의 난이도를 만듭니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid ""
"What difficulty modifier would you prefer?  Current modifier: "
"<global_val:diffulty_modifier>."
msgstr "어떤 난이도 수정치를 선호하시나요? 현재 수정치는 <global_val:diffulty_modifier>입니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid "Increase by 1"
msgstr "1만큼 증가"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid "Increase by 5"
msgstr "5만큼 증가"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid "Decrease by 1"
msgstr "1만큼 감소"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid "Decrease by 5"
msgstr "5만큼 감소"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/dialogue/menu_screen.json
msgid "Choose a preset difficulty."
msgstr "사전 설정된 난이도를 선택하세요."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "defense_mode_game_start_final_setup"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/effects_on_condition/backend_eocs.json
msgid "Get ready for the first wave, it's not that far away!"
msgstr "첫 번째 물결을 맞이할 준비를 하세요. 그리 멀지 않았습니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "defense_mode_caravan_spawn"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/effects_on_condition/backend_eocs.json
msgid "A caravan approaches!"
msgstr "캐러밴이 다가옵니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "DEFENSE_MODE_FORTRESS_TRAP"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/effects_on_condition/backend_eocs.json
msgid "You can't leave your fortress behind!"
msgstr "요새를 뒤에 남겨둘 수는 없어!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DEFENSE_MODE_PREVENT_DEATH"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/effects_on_condition/backend_eocs.json
msgid ""
"For an instant that is also an eternity, you exist only in an empty void.  "
"Then you feel something vast, alien, and merciless reach through a "
"preexisting connection to give you just enough energy to exist.  Its motives"
" for doing so are not likely to be benign."
msgstr ""
"영원과도 같은 한 순간, 당신은 텅 빈 공허 속에만 존재합니다. 그때 당신은 광활하고 낯선, 그리고 무자비한 무언가가 기존의 연결을 통해"
" 당신에게 존재하기에 딱 필요한 에너지를 주는 것을 느낍니다. 그 에너지가 당신에게 닿는 이유는 분명 선하지 않을 것입니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "DEFENSE_MODE_WAVE_CONTROL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "DEFENSE_MODE_WAVE_CONTROL_ACTUAL"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/effects_on_condition/wave_eocs.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/defense_mode/premonition_instances.json
msgid "Welcome to wave <global_val:wave_number>!"
msgstr "<global_val:wave_number> 웨이브에 오신 것을 환영합니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "DEFENSE_MODE_WAVE_SPECIAL_FERALS"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/effects_on_condition/wave_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You hear the wild howls of crazed individuals and unintelligible, carnal "
"gibberish and slavering cries.  Something is coming, and it doesn't have "
"your best interest in mind."
msgstr ""
"미친 자들의 거친 울부짖음과 알아들을 수 없는 육욕적인 헛소리, 그리고 침 흘리는 듯한 외침이 들립니다. 무언가가 다가오고 있는데, "
"그것은 당신의 최선의 이익을 염두에 두지 않습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "DEFENSE_MODE_WAVE_SPECIAL_RATKIN"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/effects_on_condition/wave_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Squeaking and chittering can be heard nearby, with the pattering of many "
"feet, like a swarm of rats traveling quickly.  However, this sounds more, "
"organized?  Almost like they're all walking in formation."
msgstr ""
"근처에서 끽끽거리는 소리와 지저귐 소리가 들리고, 여러 발소리가 쿵쾅거리며 마치 쥐 떼가 빠르게 움직이는 것 같다. 하지만 이게 더 "
"조직적으로 들리는 건가? 마치 모두 대열을 지어 걷는 것 같다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "DEFENSE_MODE_WAVE_SPECIAL_MILITARY"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/effects_on_condition/wave_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You hear crazed, half-pronounced orders screamed from afar.  The tamping of "
"boots and off-beat shouts of two-three-four sound like the signs of an "
"approaching army, but all the footfall is out of tune."
msgstr ""
"멀리서 미친 듯이, 어눌하게 외치는 명령 소리가 들린다. 부츠 밟는 소리와 엇갈린 두, 세, 네 외침은 다가오는 군대의 신호처럼 "
"들리지만, 모든 발소리는 음이 어긋난다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "DEFENSE_MODE_WAVE_SPECIAL_SHADOW"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/effects_on_condition/wave_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your vision flickers with black, blob-like creatures for a moment.  An "
"intense feeling of paranoia washes over you, as if the world itself is now "
"out to kill you, the night itself reaching for your mind to rip it apart.  "
"Somethings wicked comes this way, and it wants you dead."
msgstr ""
"검은 덩어리 같은 생물들이 잠시 시야에 스쳐 지나간다. 마치 세상 자체가 당신을 죽이려 하고, 밤 자체가 당신의 마음을 갈기갈기 "
"찢어놓으려는 듯 강렬한 편집증이 당신을 덮친다. 무언가 사악한 것이 이쪽으로 다가와 당신을 죽이려 한다."

#. ~ Description of species "DINOSAUR"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/DinoMod/species.json
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/dinosaur.json
msgid "a dinosaur"
msgstr "공룡"

