#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid "Money Makin' Mercenary"
msgstr "돈 버는 용병"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Money Makin' Mercenary"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've always had a knack for finding the value in life, whether it's $200 "
"or $50 for a life.  You get more money from completing hordes."
msgstr ""
"당신은 항상 삶의 가치를 찾아내는 재주가 있었습니다. 200달러든 50달러든, 삶에 가치를 부여하는 데 능숙했죠. 무리를 완료하면 더 "
"많은 돈을 벌 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid "Slice n' Dice"
msgstr "슬라이스 앤 다이스"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Slice n' Dice"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've become very skilled with cutting weapons of all sorts, and know how "
"to use them better."
msgstr "당신은 온갖 종류의 무기를 자르는 데 매우 능숙해졌고, 무기를 더 잘 사용하는 방법도 알게 되었습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid "Bash n' Mash"
msgstr "배쉬 앤 매쉬"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bash n' Mash"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've become very skilled with blunt instruments of all sorts, and know how"
" to use them better."
msgstr "당신은 온갖 종류의 둔기 도구를 다루는 데 매우 능숙해졌고, 그것을 더 잘 사용하는 방법도 알고 있습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid "Knifey"
msgstr "칼날 같은"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Knifey"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid "You're very in tune with the ways of stabbing somebody."
msgstr "당신은 누군가를 찌르는 방법에 매우 능숙하군요."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid "Melee Master"
msgstr "근접전 마스터"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Melee Master"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid "You've become a master of melee, and are skilled with melee weapons."
msgstr "당신은 근접 공격의 달인이 되었고, 근접 무기를 다루는 데 능숙해졌습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid "Gym Rat King"
msgstr "체육관 쥐 왕"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Gym Rat King"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Your time exercising has gotten you used to being winded, and has vastly "
"expanded your stamina.  You can go for longer and harder now."
msgstr "운동하는 동안 숨이 차는 것에 익숙해졌고, 지구력도 크게 향상되었습니다. 이제 더 오래, 더 강하게 운동할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid "Living on a Prayer"
msgstr "기도로 사는 삶"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Living on a Prayer"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You're like a cat, and it always seemed to you like you've had nine lives.  "
"When things get rough, by pure luck or divine intervention, you can get out "
"of it."
msgstr ""
"당신은 마치 고양이 같아요. 마치 아홉 번이나 산 것처럼 항상 느껴져요. 상황이 어려워지면, 순전히 운이든 신의 개입이든, 당신은 그 "
"상황을 벗어날 수 있어요."

#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perkdata/mysterious_stranger.json
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid "Mysterious Stranger"
msgstr "신비한 낯선 사람"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mysterious Stranger"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Someone must be watching over you!  Whenever you're in combat, you can call "
"for the help of a stranger for a short amount of time."
msgstr "누군가 당신을 지켜보고 있는 게 분명해요! 전투 중일 때는 낯선 사람에게 잠깐 도움을 요청할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "mysterious_stranger_activate"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perkdata/mysterious_stranger.json
msgid "Nobody hears you…"
msgstr "아무도 당신의 말을 듣지 못한다…"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "mysterious_stranger_cooldown"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perkdata/mysterious_stranger.json
msgid "Mysterious Stranger's Break"
msgstr "신비한 낯선 사람의 휴식"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mysterious Stranger's Break"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mysterious Stranger's Break"
#: data/mods/Defense_Mode/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perkdata/mysterious_stranger.json
msgid "The stranger will be back…"
msgstr "낯선 사람이 돌아올 것이다…"

