#. ~ Description of monster "Moab Masher"
#. ~ Description of monster "Haplosmashosaurus"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"Huge, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur corpse with a long tail.  Its entire"
