msgid_plural "Haplosmashosaurus"
msgstr[0] "하플로스매시사우루스"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid "Spiked Dreadnaught"
msgid_plural "Spiked Dreadnaughts"
msgstr[0] "징박힌 거대괴수"

#. ~ Description of monster "Spiked Dreadnaught"
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
msgid ""
"Huge, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur corpse with two parallel rows of "
"tall spines down its neck and back and a whip-like tail.  Its entire body "
"bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"거대하고 긴 목과 네 발 달린 공룡의 사체. 목과 등에는 두 줄로 뻗은 긴 가시가 나 있고, 채찍 같은 꼬리가 달려 있다. 온몸은 "
"불룩하게 부풀어 오른 근육과 부어오르고 곪아가는 상처로 가득하다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zinosaur_upgrade.json
