msgid_plural "skeletal falcarius brutes"
msgstr[0] "골격 팔카리우스 짐승"

#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal falcarius brute"
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal therizinosaurus brute"
#. ~ Description of monster "skeletal nothronychus brute"
