#. ~ Skill name
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/skills.json
msgid "sorcery"
msgstr "마법"

#. ~ Description of skill "sorcery"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/skills.json
msgid "Your ability to control the hidden forces behind reality."
msgstr "현실 뒤에 숨겨진 힘을 통제하는 능력."

#. ~ Name of spell "iso_eldritch_basic_attack"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid "Baleful Flames of Abhorrach"
msgstr "아보라흐의 불길한 불꽃"

#. ~ Description of spell "iso_eldritch_basic_attack ( Baleful Flames of
#. Abhorrach )"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid ""
"Summon up a bolt of black flame from the Outer Dark that alternately burns "
"and freezes its target."
msgstr "바깥 어둠으로부터 검은 불꽃을 소환하여 대상을 번갈아가며 태우고 얼립니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "iso_eldritch_stun_blind_deaf"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid "Inescapable Tesseract of Thought"
msgstr "피할 수 없는 생각의 테서랙트"

#. ~ Description of spell "iso_eldritch_stun_blind_deaf ( Inescapable
#. Tesseract of Thought )"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid ""
"Lock the target's mind away from its senses, leaving it incapable of "
"perceiving the outside world in any way."
msgstr "대상의 정신을 감각에서 떼어내어 외부 세계를 어떤 식으로든 인식할 수 없게 만듭니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "iso_eldritch_summon_hindering_darkness"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid "The Crawling Tendrils of Utternight"
msgstr "Utternight의 기어가는 덩굴"

#. ~ Description of spell "iso_eldritch_summon_hindering_darkness ( The
#. Crawling Tendrils of Utternight )"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid ""
"Summon a darkness so thick as to be tangible, wrapping around the limbs of "
"those in the target area and hindering their movements."
msgstr "대상 지역에 있는 사람들의 팔다리를 휘감아 움직임을 방해하는, 만질 수 있을 만큼 두꺼운 어둠을 소환합니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "iso_eldritch_line_biting_acid"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid "The Thousandfold Maws of the Black Goat"
msgstr "검은 염소의 천 개의 입"

#. ~ Description of spell "iso_eldritch_line_biting_acid ( The Thousandfold
#. Maws of the Black Goat )"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid ""
"Weaken the fabric of reality in a small area, allowing the Black Goat to "
"smell any prey within.  Its terrible mouths will manifest, biting and "
"slavering its caustic juices over all unfortunate targets."
msgstr ""
"작은 영역의 현실 구조를 약화시켜 검은 염소가 그 안의 모든 먹잇감의 냄새를 맡을 수 있게 합니다. 무시무시한 입이 드러나, 모든 불운한"
" 표적을 물어뜯고 침을 뱉으며 부식성 액체를 뿜어냅니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "iso_eldritch_cone_lightning"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid "Stormtenders' Fulminating Fury"
msgstr "스톰텐더의 맹렬한 분노"

#. ~ Description of spell "iso_eldritch_cone_lightning ( Stormtenders'
#. Fulminating Fury )"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid ""
"Unleash a cone of lashing lightnings that scourge your enemies.  This "
"enchantment also briefly stuns robotic enemies."
msgstr "적을 괴롭히는 원뿔 모양의 번개를 방출합니다. 이 마법은 로봇형 적을 잠시 기절시킵니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "iso_eldritch_cold_damage_blast"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid "The Frozen Heart of R'shothai"
msgstr "R'shothai의 얼어붙은 심장"

#. ~ Description of spell "iso_eldritch_cold_damage_blast ( The Frozen Heart
#. of R'shothai )"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid ""
"Summon the pure chill of the Outer Dark into a target location, freezing and"
" slowing all enemies within.  Be careful not to be caught in the blast.  "
"This enchantment has no effects on the creatures of the Nether."
msgstr ""
"목표 지점에 어둠의 순수한 냉기를 소환하여 그 안의 모든 적을 얼리고 이동 속도를 감소시킵니다. 폭발에 휘말리지 않도록 조심하세요. 이 "
"마법은 네더의 생물에게는 효과가 없습니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "iso_eldritch_blink"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid "The Transportations of Immenar"
msgstr "임메나르의 이동"

#. ~ Description of spell "iso_eldritch_blink ( The Transportations of Immenar
#. )"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid "Discorporates your body and reconstitutes it a short distance nearby."
msgstr "신체를 분해하여 가까운 거리에 재구성합니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "iso_eldritch_damage_shield"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid "Impenetrable Coruscating Scales of Vishkan"
msgstr "비슈칸의 뚫을 수 없는 반짝이는 비늘"

#. ~ Description of spell "iso_eldritch_damage_shield ( Impenetrable
#. Coruscating Scales of Vishkan )"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid ""
"Summon the power of an elder wyrm, creating a shell of impenetrable dragon "
"scales around your body.  The scales will withstand a number of blows before"
" the enchant collapse, though their lambent glow will give away your "
"position in the dark.  The enchantment will last several blows before "
"collapsing, and may be canceled at any time."
msgstr ""
"엘더 와임의 힘을 소환하여 몸 주위에 뚫을 수 없는 용의 비늘 껍질을 생성합니다. 비늘은 마법이 무너지기 전까지 여러 번의 타격을 "
"견뎌내지만, 그 눈부신 빛은 어둠 속에서 당신의 위치를 드러낼 것입니다. 마법은 무너지기 전까지 여러 번의 타격을 견뎌내며, 언제든지 "
"취소할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "iso_eldritch_destroy_nether"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid "Thricefold Abjuration of the Outside"
msgstr "외부의 세 배의 포기"

#. ~ Description of spell "iso_eldritch_destroy_nether ( Thricefold Abjuration
#. of the Outside )"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid ""
"Sever the bonds that tie a single Nether creature to this world, instantly "
"forcing it back from whence it came."
msgstr "네더 생물 하나를 이 세계에 묶어두는 끈을 끊어, 즉시 원래 있던 곳으로 돌려보냅니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "iso_eldritch_polymorph"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid "Tsath's Horrific Metamorphosis"
msgstr "차스의 끔찍한 변신"

#. ~ Description of spell "iso_eldritch_polymorph ( Tsath's Horrific
#. Metamorphosis )"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid ""
"Twist the target's body, mutating them into a stumbling mass of flesh whose "
"many mouths can only keen out the song of their suffering."
msgstr "대상의 몸을 뒤틀어 비틀거리는 살덩어리로 변형시키고, 그 수많은 입은 고통의 노래만 냅니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "iso_eldritch_imprisonment"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_iso_eldritch_imprisonment"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery_effects.json
msgid "The Adamantine Gaol of Emthys"
msgstr "엠티스의 아다만틴 감옥"

#. ~ Description of spell "iso_eldritch_imprisonment ( The Adamantine Gaol of
#. Emthys )"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery.json
msgid ""
"Create an impenetrable shell of force around the target, preventing them "
"from moving or acting for the enchantment's duration.  The shell works in "
"two directions and the target is also immune to all harm."
msgstr ""
"대상 주변에 뚫을 수 없는 힘의 막을 생성하여 마법 지속 시간 동안 움직이거나 행동할 수 없게 합니다. 이 막은 양방향으로 작용하며, "
"대상은 모든 피해에 면역이 됩니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_iso_eldritch_damage_shield"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery_effects.json
msgid "Coruscating Scales"
msgstr "반짝이는 비늘"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Coruscating Scales"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery_effects.json
msgid "The glowing scales protecting you collapse."
msgstr "당신을 보호하던 빛나는 비늘이 무너진다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_iso_eldritch_cold_damage_blast"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery_effects.json
msgid "Void-chilled"
msgstr "공허하게 냉각됨"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Void-chilled"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery_effects.json
msgid "You are frozen to the bone."
msgstr "당신은 뼈까지 얼어붙었습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Void-chilled"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery_effects.json
msgid "The chill fades away."
msgstr "추위가 사라진다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "The Adamantine Gaol of Emthys"
#. ~ Description of effect type "Adamantine Gaol"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery_effects.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are totally immobile and invulnerable."
msgstr "당신은 완전히 움직이지 못하고 무적입니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "The Adamantine Gaol of Emthys"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Adamantine Gaol"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Baleful Gaze"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Grip of Winter"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Immobilized"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/sorcery_effects.json
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects.json
msgid "You can move again."
msgstr "다시 움직일 수 있어요."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/traits.json
msgid "Lab Diver"
msgstr "랩 다이버"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lab Diver"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/traits.json
msgid ""
"Secret anchor point trait for gameplay enchantments.  Mod will break if you "
"purify this trait."
msgstr "게임플레이 마법 부여를 위한 비밀 앵커 포인트 특성입니다. 이 특성을 정화하면 모드가 파괴됩니다."

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/enchantments.json
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
msgid "The Deliverator"
msgstr "배달자"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "The Deliverator"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/enchantments.json
msgid "Always on the clock."
msgstr "항상 근무 중."

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/enchantments.json
msgid "The Backup"
msgstr "백업"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "The Backup"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/enchantments.json
msgid "We have a situation here."
msgstr "우리는 이런 상황을 겪고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/enchantments.json
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
msgid "Hypocrite's Oath"
msgstr "위선자의 맹세"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Hypocrite's Oath"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/enchantments.json
msgid "OH you aren't getting away with that."
msgstr "아, 그러면 당신은 그걸로 벗어날 수 없을 거야."

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/enchantments.json
msgid "Ancient vow"
msgstr "고대의 맹세"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Ancient vow"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/enchantments.json
msgid ""
"Lightless monster!  I give you oblivion!\n"
"\n"
" Deal 15% more damage and regen 100% more stamina per turn when fighting high danger enemies."
msgstr ""
"빛 없는 괴물! 망각을 선사할게!\n"
"\n"
"위험도가 높은 적과 싸울 때 매 턴마다 15% 더 많은 피해를 입히고 100% 더 많은 스태미나를 회복합니다."

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/enchantments.json
msgid "Assassin's Drive"
msgstr "어쌔신 드라이브"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Assassin's Drive"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/enchantments.json
msgid "Hey man, it's just business."
msgstr "야, 그냥 사업일 뿐이야."

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/enchantments.json
msgid "Scion of the Dreaming City"
msgstr "꿈꾸는 도시의 후예"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Scion of the Dreaming City"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/enchantments.json
msgid "Your people may be gone, but you survive."
msgstr "당신의 사람들은 떠났을지 몰라도 당신은 살아남을 것입니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "iso_heal"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perk_effect.json
msgid "Rapid Healing"
msgstr "빠른 치유"

#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "geas_monster"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perk_eoc.json
msgid "You cannot flee from the abomination."
msgstr "당신은 혐오스러운 것에서 도망칠 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "geas_monster"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perk_eoc.json
msgid "Oh ho!  Then come as close as you like."
msgstr "오호! 그럼 원하는 만큼 가까이 와 보세요."

#. ~ Name of spell "iso_robolove_charm_1"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perk_spells.json
msgid "Its a teapot!"
msgstr "찻주전자예요!"

#. ~ Description of spell "iso_robolove_charm_1 ( Its a teapot! )"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perk_spells.json
msgid "Makes a robot friendly for a very long time."
msgstr "로봇을 매우 오랫동안 친화적으로 만들어줍니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "iso_robolove_charm_2"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perk_spells.json
msgid "robot charm"
msgstr "로봇 매력"

#. ~ Description of spell "iso_robolove_charm_2 ( robot charm )"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perk_spells.json
msgid "!"
msgstr "!"

#. ~ Description of mutation "The Deliverator"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Every night you brave the highway, life-bound to a single promise: \"Your pie in thirty minutes or you can have it free.\"  People can respect that.  You are a role model.  A hero to the hungry.\n"
"\n"
"You gain +1 quickness for each level of normality distortion."
msgstr ""
"매일 밤 당신은 단 하나의 약속에 얽매인 채 고속도로를 질주합니다. \"30분 안에 파이를 가져오지 않으면 공짜로 주겠다.\" 사람들은 당신의 약속을 존중합니다. 당신은 롤모델이자 배고픈 자들의 영웅입니다.\n"
"\n"
"정상성 왜곡 1단계당 민첩성 +1을 얻습니다."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Hypocrite's Oath"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"I swear by Apollo the Healer, by Asclepius, by Hygieia, by Panacea, and by all the gods and goddesses, making them my witnesses, that I shall deliver, according to my ability and judgment, death.\n"
"\n"
"You temporarily deal 50% more damage after being hurt.  The first time you bandage or disinfect a limb, it instantly heals by 10hp in addition to normal effects."
msgstr ""
"나는 치유자 아폴로, 아스클레피오스, 히기에이아, 파나케이아, 그리고 모든 신과 여신들을 증인으로 삼아 맹세하노니, 내 능력과 판단에 따라 죽음을 내리리라.\n"
"\n"
"다치면 일시적으로 50% 더 많은 피해를 입힙니다. 팔다리에 처음으로 붕대를 감거나 소독하면 일반 효과 외에 즉시 10마력이 회복됩니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
msgid "Backup"
msgstr "지원"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Backup"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"We call this a tactical retreat.\n"
"\n"
"You gain +50 movement speed for few moments after successfully dealing ballistic damage."
msgstr ""
"이것을 전술적 후퇴라고 부릅니다.\n"
"\n"
"탄도 피해를 성공적으로 입힌 후 잠시 동안 이동 속도가 +50 증가합니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
msgid "Machine Whisperer"
msgstr "머신 위스퍼러"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Machine Whisperer"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Error.  418 //I am a teapot.\n"
"\n"
"Every 20 seconds, there's a small chance for nearby robots to become permanently friendly."
msgstr ""
"오류. 418 //저는 찻주전자입니다.\n"
"\n"
"20초마다 근처 로봇이 영구적으로 우호적인 관계가 될 확률이 낮습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
msgid "Ancient Vow"
msgstr "고대의 맹세"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Ancient Vow"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"A lifetime ago you swore to protect your vanished homeland.  This oath binds you still.\n"
"\n"
"You cannot flee from high danger enemies but gain increased damage and stamina regeneration when fighting them."
msgstr ""
"오래전, 당신은 사라진 고향을 지키겠다고 맹세했습니다. 그 맹세는 아직도 당신을 옭아매고 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"위험도가 높은 적에게서 도망칠 수는 없지만, 그들과 싸울 때 공격력과 지구력 재생력이 증가합니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
msgid "Power Drain"
msgstr "전력 소모"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Power Drain"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Your cybernetic implants are constantly losing power, but a quirk of their design allows you regain power through murder.\n"
"\n"
"You lose bionic power every second, but melee kills restore power, scaling with the danger level of your target."
msgstr ""
"사이버네틱 임플란트는 끊임없이 전력을 소모하지만, 그 설계상의 특이점 덕분에 살인을 통해 전력을 회복할 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"매초마다 바이오닉적 능력을 잃지만, 근접 공격으로 적을 처치하면 전력이 회복되며, 회복량은 대상의 위험 수준에 따라 달라집니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
msgid "Archmagister of the Gloaming Tower"
msgstr "황혼의 탑의 대마법사"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Archmagister of the Gloaming Tower"
#: data/mods/Isolation-Protocol/Player/Perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You have spent long centuries poring over mouldering tomes and wresting knowledge from spirits who dwell within the translunary spheres and have forgotten more enchantments than some upstart conjurer will ever learn.\n"
"\n"
"When you pick up a ranged weapon, you will absorb its power into a new spell."
msgstr ""
"당신은 오랜 세월 동안 썩어가는 고서를 탐독하고, 달을 넘는 영역에 사는 영혼들로부터 지식을 갈취하며, 어떤 신출내기 마법사도 결코 배울 수 없을 만큼 많은 마법을 잊어버렸습니다.\n"
"\n"
"원거리 무기를 집어 들면 그 힘을 흡수하여 새로운 주문으로 만들어낼 수 있습니다."

