#. ~ Description of the category "prosthetic arms"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/recipes.json
msgid ""
"Recipes related to constructing prosthetic arms of varying materials and "
"designs."
msgstr "다양한 소재와 디자인으로 의수를 만드는 것과 관련된 요리법입니다."

#. ~ name of the nested group
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/recipes.json
msgid "prosthetic legs"
msgstr "의족"

#. ~ Description of the category "prosthetic legs"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/recipes.json
