#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Sound Bomb)"
msgstr "다블러(사운드 밤)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Sound Bomb)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Sound Bomb.  You mostly used it for jokes, to play pranks on"
" your friends and annoy the neighborhood dogs, but it's proven its worth now"
" at the end of the world."
msgstr ""
"당신은 단 하나의 주문만 아는 수억 명 중 하나였습니다. 당신의 경우는, 사운드 밤이었죠. 당신은 주로 농담이나 친구들에게 장난을 치고 "
"동네 개들을 짜증나게 하는 데 사용했지만, 세상이 끝나가는 지금, 그 주문의 가치가 증명되었습니다."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Dabbler (Sound Bomb)"
msgstr "다블러(사운드 밤)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Sound Bomb)" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
