"됐습니다."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Summon Watcher Spirit)"
msgstr "다블러(감시자 영혼 소환)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Summon Watcher Spirit)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Summon Watcher Spirit.  You initially learned it to keep an "
"eye on your cat while you were doing chores around the house, but it ended "
"up being even more valuable than you thought once the world ended."
msgstr ""
"당신은 단 하나의 주문만 아는 수억 명의 사람 중 하나였습니다. 당신의 경우에는 감시자 영혼 소환 주문이었죠. 처음에는 집안일을 할 때 "
"고양이를 감시하기 위해 배웠지만, 세상이 멸망하고 나니 생각보다 훨씬 더 귀중한 주문이 되었습니다."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Dabbler (Summon Watcher Spirit)"
msgstr "다블러(감시자 영혼 소환)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Summon Watcher Spirit)" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
