#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Finger Firelighter)"
msgstr "다블러(손가락 불쏘시개)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Finger Firelighter)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Finger Firelighter.  You had a lot of great conversations "
"with people, late at night outside clubs and restaurants, when they'd ask "
"for a light and you'd just snap your fingers.  Lately, though, you've used "
"it to cook food more than light cigarettes and haven't had anyone to talk "
"to, but at least the fires at night are warm."
msgstr ""
"당신은 단 하나의 주문만 아는 수억 명의 사람 중 하나였습니다. 당신의 경우, 손가락 불쏘시개(Finger Firelighter)였죠. "
"밤늦게 클럽이나 식당 밖에서 사람들이 불을 달라고 하면 손가락을 튕기며 사람들과 멋진 대화를 많이 나누곤 했습니다. 하지만 요즘은 담배에"
" 불을 붙이는 것보다 요리하는 데 더 많이 사용했고, 이야기할 사람도 없었지만, 적어도 밤에는 불이 따뜻하잖아요."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Dabbler (Finger Firelighter)"
msgstr "다블러(손가락 불쏘시개)"

