#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Faerie Fire)"
msgstr "다블러(요정의 불꽃)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Faerie Fire)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell."
"  In your case, Faerie Fire.  Maybe it wasn't a great use of your time, but "
"it was fun at parties and one time when your cat ran off it made it very "
"easy to find her.  Since the Cataclysm, though, your magical powers have "
"become much more useful."
msgstr ""
"당신은 단 하나의 주문만 아는 수억 명의 사람 중 하나였습니다. 당신의 경우는 요정의 불꽃이었죠. 시간을 잘 활용하지는 못했을지 몰라도,"
" 파티에서는 재밌었고, 한 번은 고양이가 도망갔을 때 찾기도 아주 쉬웠죠. 하지만 대격변 이후 당신의 마법 능력은 훨씬 더 "
"유용해졌습니다."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Dabbler (Faerie Fire)"
msgstr "다블러(요정의 불꽃)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Faerie Fire)" for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
