#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Elf (Species)"
msgstr "엘프 (종족)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Elf (Species)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are one of the Firstborn, called \"alfar\" or \"sidhe\" or, more "
"recently, \"elves\" by the humans.  Your people had integrated into human "
"society before the Cataclysm, doing jobs involving animals and nature since "
"modern industry was never to your liking.  Had technological development "
"continued, you might have been forced to make some unpleasant compromises, "
"but not as unpleasant as you have during the end of the world."
msgstr ""
"당신은 첫 번째 태생 중 한 명이며, 인간들에게는 \"알파\"나 \"시드\", 더 최근에는 \"엘프\"라고 불립니다. 당신들은 대격변 "
"이전부터 인간 사회에 통합되어, 현대 산업이 당신들의 취향에 맞지 않았기 때문에 동물과 자연과 관련된 일을 해왔습니다. 만약 기술 발전이"
" 계속되었다면, 당신들은 불편한 타협을 감수해야 했을지도 모르지만, 세상의 종말 때처럼 불편하지는 않았을 것입니다."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Elf (Species)"
msgstr "엘프 (종족)"

