#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Wild Druid"
msgstr "야생 드루이드"

#. ~ Description of profession "Wild Druid" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For a long time you lived in the wild, free of interference from whatever "
"inhabited outside the woods, now that the woods are collapsing you finally "
"return to civilization."
msgstr ""
"오랫동안 당신은 숲 밖에 서식하는 어떤 것의 방해도 받지 않고 야생에서 살았습니다. 이제 숲이 무너지면서 당신은 마침내 문명 세계로 "
"돌아왔습니다."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Wild Druid"
msgstr "야생 드루이드"

