#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Archer Druid"
msgstr "궁수 드루이드"

#. ~ Description of profession "Archer Druid" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a skillful and committed archer druid, making constant excursions "
"to the forests in which you dedicated yourself to living off of and with "
"what nature had to offer you.  You were returning from your last travel when"
" civilization fell upon itself."
msgstr ""
"당신은 능숙하고 헌신적인 궁수 드루이드였습니다. 끊임없이 숲으로 모험을 떠나 자연이 선사하는 모든 것을 누리며 살아가는 데 헌신했습니다."
" 마지막 여정에서 돌아오던 길에 문명이 스스로 무너졌습니다."

