#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_MAGICLYSM_SI_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_MOM_SI_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_SI_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mod_interactions/skyisland/translocation_handling.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/skyisland/teleporter_handling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/skyisland/teleporter_handling.json
msgid ""
"You briefly see the familiar sights of the floating island before you feel a"
" wrenching sensation and you're suddenly back on the surface.  Whatever "
"powers have put you in this situation must not be happy with you trying to "
"circumvent the rules."
msgstr ""
"떠다니는 섬의 익숙한 풍경을 잠깐 보다가, 갑자기 아찔한 감각이 느껴지고는 다시 수면 위로 올라옵니다. 당신을 이런 상황에 빠뜨린 그 "
"힘은 당신이 규칙을 어기려는 것을 달가워하지 않는 모양입니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_MAGICLYSM_SI_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_MOM_SI_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_SI_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mod_interactions/skyisland/translocation_handling.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/skyisland/teleporter_handling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/skyisland/teleporter_handling.json
msgid ""
"As you come out of the darkness and the cold and see the surface, you feel a"
" sudden wrenching sensation.  Pain washes over your entire body as your "
"vision goes red, and the air burns as you take in a ragged breath.  The "
"powers behind your situation are not happy at your attempt to circumvent "
"their rules."
msgstr ""
"어둠과 추위에서 벗어나 수면 위로 올라오는 순간, 갑자기 찌릿한 감각이 느껴집니다. 온몸에 고통이 밀려오며 시야가 붉어지고, 거친 숨을 "
"들이쉬자 공기가 타는 듯합니다. 당신의 상황을 만든 세력들은 당신이 규칙을 어기려는 시도를 달가워하지 않습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_MAGICLYSM_SI_PRE_TELEPORT_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_MOM_SI_PRE_TELEPORT_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_SI_PRE_TELEPORT_POST_TELEPORT_FOLLOWUP"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/mod_interactions/skyisland/translocation_handling.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/skyisland/teleporter_handling.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/skyisland/teleporter_handling.json
msgid "With an internal twist, you're suddenly back on the island."
msgstr "내부적인 반전이 있는데, 당신은 갑자기 섬으로 돌아옵니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/demon_spider.json
msgid "demon spiderling"
msgid_plural "demon spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "새끼 악마거미"

#. ~ Description of monster "demon spiderling"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/demon_spider.json
msgid ""
"Despite it being the size of a small dog, you can tell this is a very young "
"spider.  Its red color is why you gave it this name; you have never seen "
"this creature before the Cataclysm.  It is quick, and its large fangs drip "
"with venom."
msgstr ""
"작은 개 크기이지만 아주 어린 새끼 거미입니다.  대격변 이전까지는 본 적이 없는 생물로, 붉은 색은 왜 이런 이름이 붙었는지 알게 "
"해줍니다. 매우 빠르며, 커다란 송곳니에서는 맹독이 뚝뚝 흐릅니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/demon_spider.json
msgid "demon spider"
msgid_plural "demon spiders"
msgstr[0] "악마거미"

#. ~ Description of monster "demon spider"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/demon_spider.json
msgid ""
"This spider is the size of a car.  Its huge compound eyes seem to be "
"infinite pools of blackness that seem to suck the light out of the air.  Its"
" maroon carapace is studded with wicked-looking spikes that drip with some "
"kind of viscous black liquid that sizzles when it touches the ground.  The "
"air around it wavers with heat."
msgstr ""
"이 거미는 자동차만 한 크기입니다. 거대한 겹눈은 마치 공기 중의 빛을 빨아들이는 듯한 끝없는 검은 웅덩이처럼 보입니다. 적갈색 "
"등딱지에는 끈적끈적한 검은 액체가 뚝뚝 떨어지는 흉측한 가시들이 박혀 있는데, 땅에 닿으면 지글지글 소리를 냅니다. 거미 주변의 공기는 "
"열기로 진동합니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "demon spider"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/demon_spider.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s breathes a fan of flames!"
msgstr "%1$s 님이 불꽃을 뿜어냅니다!"

