msgstr "%1$s가 마법의 말을 외치고 <npcname>이 뾰족한 나무 조각을 간신히 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_wizards.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s screams words of magic and your %2$s is impacted by jagged shards of "
