"The works of civilization crack as plants force their way through to the "
"sun."
msgstr "식물이 태양을 향해 나아가면서 문명의 작품들은 금이 간다."

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_rock_floor_no_roof"
#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_rock_floor"
#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_rock"
#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_dirt"
#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_dirt_underground"
