msgstr "%s가 쓰러졌고, 중요 부위가 보호받지 못했습니다!"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/modinfo.json
msgid "Megafauna"
msgstr "메가파우나"

#. ~ Description of MOD "Megafauna"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Adds extinct pleistocene megafauna to the game, replacing modern day and "
"introduced animals."
msgstr "멸종된 플라이스토세 거대 동물들을 게임 속에 추가해주며, 오늘날의 동물들과 대체합니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid "glyptodont-shell shelter"
msgstr "글립토돈트 껍질 은신처"

#. ~ Description of terrain "glyptodont-shell shelter"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-manufactured.json
msgid ""
"Improvised shelter made of a glyptodont shell, providing a little bit of "
"protection against the elements or predators."
msgstr "글립토돈트 껍질로 만든 임시 보호소로, 날씨나 포식자로부터 약간 보호해줍니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/animal_products.json
msgid "mammoth tusk"
msgid_plural "mammoth tusks"
msgstr[0] "매머드 상아"

#. ~ Description of "mammoth tusk"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/animal_products.json
msgid "A huge curved tusk of a mammoth."
msgstr "매머드의 커다랗고 굽은 엄니."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/animal_products.json
msgid "great auk egg"
msgid_plural "great auk eggs"
msgstr[0] "큰바다오리 알"

#. ~ Description of "great auk egg"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/animal_products.json
msgid "An egg laid by a great auk.  Prized for its big, nutritious yolk."
msgstr "큰바다쇠오리가 낳은 알. 크고 영양가 있는 노른자로 귀중하게 여겨진다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/animal_products.json
msgid "titanis walleri egg"
msgid_plural "titanis walleri eggs"
msgstr[0] "티타니스 발레리 알"

#. ~ Description of "titanis walleri egg"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/animal_products.json
msgid ""
"A large egg laid by a titanis walleri.  Prized for its big, nutritious yolk."
msgstr "티타니스 월레리가 낳은 큰 알. 크고 영양가 있는 노른자로 유명합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/animal_products.json
msgid "glyptotherium shell"
msgid_plural "glyptotherium shells"
msgstr[0] "글립토테리움 껍질"

#. ~ Description of "glyptotherium shell"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/animal_products.json
msgid "A huge shell laboriously carved from a glyptotherium."
msgstr "글립토테리움에서 힘들게 조각한 거대한 조개껍질."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/tool/shelters.json
msgid "mammoth shelter kit"
msgid_plural "mammoth shelter kits"
msgstr[0] "맘모스 대피소 키트"

#. ~ Description of "mammoth shelter kit"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/tool/shelters.json
msgid ""
"This is a small shelter, made of large bones, mammoth tusks, and skins.  Use"
" it to place."
msgstr "이건 큰 뼈, 매머드 상아, 가죽으로 만든 작은 은신처입니다. 이걸 사용해서 집을 짓습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/tool/shelters.json
msgid "large mammoth shelter kit"
msgid_plural "large mammoth shelter kits"
msgstr[0] "대형 맘모스 대피소 키트"

#. ~ Description of "large mammoth shelter kit"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/items/tool/shelters.json
msgid ""
"This is a big shelter, made of large bones, mammoth tusks, and skins.  Use "
"it to place."
msgstr "이건 커다란 뼈, 매머드 상아, 가죽으로 만든 커다란 은신처예요. 이걸 이용해서 집을 짓으세요."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "shrub-ox"
msgid_plural "shrub-ox"
msgstr[0] "유케라테리움"

#. ~ Description of monster "shrub-ox"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A massively built bovine sometimes found browsing in the woods.  It has "
"dark, long wool and two big, curved horns."
msgstr "숲에서 풀을 뜯는 모습이 가끔 발견되는 거대한 우제류. 검고 긴 털과 두 개의 크고 휘어진 뿔을 가지고 있다."

#. ~ Feed message of monster "shrub-ox"
#. ~ Feed message of monster "wood-ox"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to like you!  It lets you pat its shaggy-haired head and seems "
"friendly."
msgstr "%s가 당신을 좋아하는 것 같아요! 덥수룩한 머리를 쓰다듬어 주면 다정해 보여요."

#. ~ Pet message of monster "shrub-ox"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "wood-ox"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s lets you pet its shaggy-haired head, mooing loudly in satisfaction."
msgstr "%s는 덥수룩한 머리카락을 쓰다듬으며 만족스럽게 큰 소리로 울부짖습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "shrub-ox calf"
msgid_plural "shrub-ox calves"
msgstr[0] "유케라테리움 유체"

#. ~ Description of monster "shrub-ox calf"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "A juvenile shrub-ox.  It's horns and wool have not grown far yet."
msgstr "어린 관목소입니다. 뿔과 털이 아직 많이 자라지 않았습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "wood-ox"
msgid_plural "wood-ox"
msgstr[0] "부테리움"

#. ~ Description of monster "wood-ox"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A large-built bovine sometimes found browsing in high altitude woods.  It "
"has a thick, long coat of wool and two short, curved horns."
msgstr "고산 숲에서 풀을 뜯는 모습이 가끔 발견되는 몸집이 큰 우제류. 두껍고 긴 털과 두 개의 짧고 휘어진 뿔을 가지고 있다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "wood-ox calf"
msgid_plural "wood-ox calves"
msgstr[0] "부테리움 유체"

#. ~ Description of monster "wood-ox calf"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "A juvenile wood-ox.  It's horns and wool have not grown far yet."
msgstr "어린 나무소입니다. 뿔과 털이 아직 많이 자라지 않았습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "Mayfield's goat"
msgid_plural "Mayfield's goat"
msgstr[0] "황소"

#. ~ Description of monster "Mayfield's goat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"Soergelia mayfieldi - a sturdily built ruminant, not unlike a goat but more "
"massively built.  It has light-brown wool and two vicious looking horns that"
" are curved forward."
msgstr ""
"소에르겔리아 마이필디(Soergelia mayfieldi)는 튼튼한 체격의 반추동물로, 염소와 비슷하지만 더 덩치가 큽니다. 연한 갈색 "
"털과 앞으로 굽은 사나운 두 개의 뿔을 가지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Feed message of monster "Mayfield's goat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to tolerate you!  It cocks its head and stares at you with its "
"strange goat-eyes as you approach."
msgstr "%s가 당신을 참아주는 것 같네요! 당신이 다가가자 고개를 갸웃거리며 기묘한 염소 눈으로 당신을 빤히 쳐다봅니다."

#. ~ Pet message of monster "Mayfield's goat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s lets you scratch its big belly, letting of a sonorous bleat in "
"satisfaction."
msgstr "%s는 큰 배를 긁게 하고, 만족스럽게 울부짖는 듯한 소리를 냅니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "Mayfield's goat kid"
msgid_plural "Mayfield's goat kids"
msgstr[0] "황소 유체"

#. ~ Description of monster "Mayfield's goat kid"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile Mayfield's goat.  It's horns have not grown far yet, and its wool"
" is still short, white, and quite fluffy."
msgstr "어린 메이필드 염소입니다. 뿔은 아직 크게 자라지 않았고, 털은 아직 짧고 하얗고 꽤 푹신합니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "ancient bison"
msgid_plural "ancient bison"
msgstr[0] "고대 들소"

#. ~ Description of monster "ancient bison"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A massive, meaty bovid that roams the steppes in large herds.  It is "
"insulated against the cold with a thick layer of wool.  Two short horns "
"appear from its bushy head wool."
msgstr ""
"초원을 무리 지어 돌아다니는 거대하고 육질의 소과 동물입니다. 두꺼운 털로 추위를 막아줍니다. 덥수룩한 머리털에서 두 개의 짧은 뿔이 "
"솟아 있습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "ancient bison calf"
msgid_plural "ancient bison calves"
msgstr[0] "새끼 고대 들소"

#. ~ Description of monster "ancient bison calf"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "A juvenile ancient bison.  It's horns and wool have not grown far yet."
msgstr "어린 고대 들소입니다. 뿔과 털이 아직 많이 자라지 않았습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "Scott's horse"
msgid_plural "Scott's horses"
msgstr[0] "에쿠우스 스코티"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "Scott's horse foal"
msgid_plural "Scott's horse foals"
msgstr[0] "에쿠우스 스코티 (유체)"

#. ~ Description of monster "Scott's horse foal"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile horse.  It gallops around its parent excitedly, throwing around "
"its head joyously."
msgstr "어린 말. 부모 말 주위를 신나게 뛰어다니며, 즐겁게 머리를 흔들고 있다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "giant horse"
msgid_plural "giant horses"
msgstr[0] "거대 말"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant horse"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A massive species of Equus that looks like a draft horse, just bigger.  If "
"you dare come close to it, you might be able to get this one to trust you "
"enough to ride it."
msgstr ""
"짐 나르는 말처럼 보이는 거대한 에쿠스 종입니다. 다만 더 크죠. 용기 내어 가까이 다가가면, 이 녀석이 당신을 믿고 탈 수 있을지도 "
"몰라요."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "giant horse foal"
msgid_plural "giant horse foals"
msgstr[0] "거대 망아지"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant horse foal"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile giant horse.  It gallops around its parent excitedly, throwing "
"around its head joyously."
msgstr "어린 거대 말. 부모 말 주위를 신나게 뛰어다니며, 즐겁게 머리를 흔든다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "Camelops"
msgid_plural "Camelops"
msgstr[0] "카멜롭스"

#. ~ Description of monster "Camelops"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A huge, woolly two-humped camel that roams far and wide across the American "
"continent.  It looks at you irritated, chewing on some long grass."
msgstr "아메리카 대륙을 넓게 누비는 두 혹의 털북숭이 거대 낙타. 긴 풀을 뜯어먹으며 짜증스러운 표정으로 당신을 쳐다봅니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "Camelops foal"
msgid_plural "Camelops foals"
msgstr[0] "카멜롭스 (유체)"

#. ~ Description of monster "Camelops foal"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile camelops.  Its humps haven't grown to full size yet, but it is "
"already covered in a thin layer of wool."
msgstr "어린 낙타입니다. 혹은 아직 완전히 자라지 않았지만, 이미 얇은 털로 덮여 있습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "flat-headed peccary"
msgid_plural "flat-headed peccaries"
msgstr[0] "납작머리 페커리"

#. ~ Description of monster "flat-headed peccary"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A stocky, short-legged, pig-like animal with coarse brown fur.  It is "
"smaller than a wild boar, its distant European cousin, and also a bit "
"smaller than its close relative, the long-nosed peccary.  Different to "
"these, it is a quite social and friendly creature - unless its young are "
"threatened."
msgstr ""
"땅딸막하고 다리가 짧으며 돼지처럼 생긴 동물로, 거친 갈색 털을 가지고 있습니다. 먼 유럽 사촌인 야생 멧돼지보다 작고, 가까운 친척인 "
"긴코페커리보다도 약간 작습니다. 다른 동물들과는 달리, 새끼들이 위협받지 않는 한 매우 사교적이고 우호적인 동물입니다."

#. ~ Feed message of monster "flat-headed peccary"
#. ~ Feed message of monster "flat-headed peccary piglet"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  It squeals happily as you pet it."
msgstr "%s가 당신을 좋아하는 것 같아요! 당신이 쓰다듬어 주자 행복하게 꽥꽥거립니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "flat-headed peccary piglet"
msgid_plural "flat-headed peccary piglets"
msgstr[0] "납작머리 페커리 새끼"

#. ~ Description of monster "flat-headed peccary piglet"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile flat-headed peccary - a stocky, short-legged, pig-like animal.  "
"Its playful squeaks delight your heart."
msgstr "어린 납작머리 페커리 - 땅딸막하고 다리가 짧은 돼지 같은 동물. 장난기 어린 끽끽거리는 소리가 마음을 즐겁게 합니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "long-nosed peccary"
msgid_plural "long-nosed peccaries"
msgstr[0] "긴코 페커리"

#. ~ Description of monster "long-nosed peccary"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A stocky, short-legged, pig-like animal with coarse brown fur.  It just a "
"bit smaller than a wild boar, its distant European cousin, but considerably "
"bigger than its close relative, the flat-headed peccary.  Different to the "
"latter, they are solitary and more aggressive, but still appreciate good "
"food."
msgstr ""
"땅딸막하고 다리가 짧은 돼지 같은 동물로, 거친 갈색 털을 가지고 있습니다. 먼 친척인 유럽산 멧돼지보다는 약간 작지만, 가까운 친척인 "
"납작머리 페커리보다는 훨씬 큽니다. 납작머리 페커리와는 달리, 이들은 혼자 지내고 더 공격적이지만, 여전히 좋은 먹이를 좋아합니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid "long-nosed peccary piglet"
msgid_plural "long-nosed peccary piglets"
msgstr[0] "긴코 페커리 새끼"

#. ~ Description of monster "long-nosed peccary piglet"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_domestic.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile long-nosed peccary - a stocky, short-legged, pig-like animal.  "
"Its playful squeals delight your heart."
msgstr "어린 긴코페커리 - 땅딸막하고 다리가 짧은 돼지 같은 동물. 장난기 어린 울음소리가 마음을 즐겁게 합니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "dire wolf"
msgid_plural "dire wolves"
msgstr[0] "흉측한 늑대"

#. ~ Description of monster "dire wolf"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"A large, muscular species of wolf, with incredibly strong and sharp teeth "
"capable of penetrating the thick hides of mammoths and giant sloths."
msgstr ""
"거대하고 근육질의 늑대 종으로, 매머드와 거대 나무늘보의 두꺼운 가죽을 뚫을 수 있을 만큼 튼튼하고 날카로운 이빨을 가지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Feed message of monster "dire wolf"
#. ~ Feed message of monster "stag moose"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to tolerate you.  It cautiously lets you pat its head and seems"
" friendly for now."
msgstr "%s는 당신을 참아주는 것 같습니다. 조심스럽게 머리를 쓰다듬어 주며, 일단은 친근해 보입니다."

#. ~ Pet message of monster "dire wolf"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s reluctantly wags its tail while you pat their massive head."
msgstr "%s는 당신이 그들의 거대한 머리를 쓰다듬는 동안 마지못해 꼬리를 흔든다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "dire wolf cub"
msgid_plural "dire wolf cubs"
msgstr[0] "새끼 다이어 울프"

#. ~ Description of monster "dire wolf cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile dire wolf.  It runs around as excited as aimless, occasionally "
"barking joyously."
msgstr "어린 늑대. 흥분해서 정신없이 돌아다니고, 가끔은 즐겁게 짖기도 한다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "sabre-toothed cat"
msgid_plural "sabre-toothed cats"
msgstr[0] "검치호"

#. ~ Description of monster "sabre-toothed cat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"This tiger-sized, but more robustly built creature has a sand-colored, "
"spotted coat and a short tail.  Its eponymous sabre-like upper canine teeth "
"look menacing."
msgstr ""
"호랑이 크기지만 더욱 튼튼한 체격을 가진 이 동물은 모래색의 점박이 털과 짧은 꼬리를 가지고 있습니다. 이름에서 알 수 있듯이 세이버처럼"
" 생긴 윗송곳니는 위협적으로 보입니다."

#. ~ Feed message of monster "sabre-toothed cat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  It emits a growling purr as you pet it."
msgstr "%s가 당신을 좋아하는 것 같아요! 쓰다듬어 주면 으르렁거리는 가르랑거리는 소리가 나요."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "sabre-toothed cat cub"
msgid_plural "sabre-toothed cat cubs"
msgstr[0] "새끼 검치호"

#. ~ Description of monster "sabre-toothed cat cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile sabre-toothed cat.  Still sizable, but much less dangerous than "
"its parent, which will fight fiercely to protect its offspring."
msgstr "어린 세이버 이빨 고양이. 여전히 몸집은 크지만, 새끼를 지키기 위해 맹렬하게 싸우는 어미 고양이보다는 훨씬 덜 위험합니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "cave lion"
msgid_plural "cave lions"
msgstr[0] "동굴사자"

#. ~ Description of monster "cave lion"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"This fierce looking sister of the European cave lion is a fast hunter, but "
"usually likes to spend its days laying in the sun."
msgstr "유럽 동굴사자의 사나운 자매인 이 사자는 빠른 사냥꾼이지만, 보통은 햇볕 아래 누워서 낮을 보내는 것을 좋아합니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "cave lion cub"
msgid_plural "cave lion cubs"
msgstr[0] "새끼 동굴사자"

#. ~ Description of monster "cave lion cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile cave lion.  Still sizable, but much less dangerous than its "
"parent, which will fight fiercely to protect its offspring."
msgstr "어린 동굴사자. 여전히 몸집은 크지만, 어미보다 훨씬 덜 위협적입니다. 어미는 새끼를 지키기 위해 맹렬하게 싸웁니다."

#. ~ Feed message of monster "bobcat"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s seems to like you!  It emits a satisfied purr as you pet it."
msgstr "%s가 당신을 좋아하는 것 같아요! 쓰다듬어 주자 만족스러운 갸르릉 소리를 냅니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "bobcat cub"
msgid_plural "bobcat cubs"
msgstr[0] "밥캣(유체)"

#. ~ Description of monster "bobcat cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile bobcat.  It already moves with enthusiasm, but with much less "
"grace and dexterity than its parent."
msgstr "어린 살쾡이. 벌써 열정적으로 움직이지만, 부모에 비해 우아함과 민첩함이 훨씬 떨어진다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "titanis walleri"
msgid_plural "titani walleri"
msgstr[0] "티타니스 왈렐리"

#. ~ Description of monster "titanis walleri"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"A large predatory flightless bird with monstrous beak and strong legs.  "
"Truly, the dinosaurs never went extinct, they just grew more feathers."
msgstr ""
"거대한 날지 못하는 포식성 새, 기괴한 부리와 튼튼한 다리를 가진. 정말이지, 공룡은 멸종된 게 아니라 깃털이 더 많이 자랐을 뿐이야."

#. ~ Feed message of monster "titanis walleri"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to like you!  It clicks its beak a few times and lowers its "
"head, allowing you to pet it."
msgstr "%s가 당신을 좋아하는 것 같아요! 부리를 몇 번 튕기고 고개를 숙여 쓰다듬어 줄 수 있게 해 주세요."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid "titanis walleri chick"
msgid_plural "titanis walleri chicks"
msgstr[0] "병아리 (티타니스 와렐리)"

#. ~ Description of monster "titanis walleri chick"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_predators.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile titanis walleri.  It is already large for a bird, but it is still"
" far from its parent."
msgstr "어린 티타니스 왈레리. 새치고는 이미 크지만, 부모와는 아직 거리가 멀다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "giant beaver"
msgid_plural "giant beavers"
msgstr[0] "거대 비버"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant beaver"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A big rodent feeding off of wood, known for building dams that set entire "
"regions under water.  About the size of a calf."
msgstr "나무를 먹고 사는 큰 설치류로, 지역 전체를 물에 잠기게 하는 댐을 짓는 것으로 유명합니다. 송아지 크기 정도입니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "giant beaver cub"
msgid_plural "giant beaver cubs"
msgstr[0] "새끼 거대 비버"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant beaver cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A juvenile giant beaver.  Pretty big already."
msgstr "어린 거대 비버. 벌써 꽤 컸어요."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "large claw sloth"
msgid_plural "large claw sloths"
msgstr[0] "땅늘보"

#. ~ Description of monster "large claw sloth"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A huge lumbering sloth standing at over 3 meters, gracefully wandering "
"through the woods at a glacial tempo.  It is constantly in search for food "
"to support its massive body weight."
msgstr ""
"키가 3미터가 넘는 거대한 나무늘보가 빙하기처럼 빠른 속도로 숲 속을 우아하게 거닐고 있습니다. 거대한 몸무게를 지탱할 먹이를 끊임없이 "
"찾고 있습니다."

#. ~ Feed message of monster "large claw sloth"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to like you!  It lets you pat its head, giving off a bassy hum."
msgstr "%s가 당신을 좋아하는 것 같아요! 머리를 쓰다듬으면 저음의 웅웅거리는 소리가 나요."

#. ~ Pet message of monster "large claw sloth"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s turns on its back and lets you scratch its huge, moss-overgrown "
"belly."
msgstr "%s는 등을 돌리고 이끼로 뒤덮인 거대한 배를 긁게 해줍니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "large claw sloth cub"
msgid_plural "large claw sloth cubs"
msgstr[0] "새끼 땅늘보"

#. ~ Description of monster "large claw sloth cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A juvenile large claw sloth.  Pretty big already."
msgstr "어린 큰 발톱 나무늘보. 벌써 꽤 컸네."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "stag moose"
msgid_plural "stag moose"
msgstr[0] "거대 무스"

#. ~ Description of monster "stag moose"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A big deer-like creature, standing more than 2m tall with impressive antlers"
" crowning their head."
msgstr "키가 2m가 넘고 머리 위에 인상적인 뿔이 있는 거대한 사슴과 비슷한 동물입니다."

#. ~ Pet message of monster "stag moose"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s bows down its massive antlered head to nuzzle your face."
msgstr "%s는 거대한 뿔이 달린 머리를 숙여 당신의 얼굴에 얼굴을 묻습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "stag moose cub"
msgid_plural "stag moose cubs"
msgstr[0] "새끼 거대 무스"

#. ~ Description of monster "stag moose cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile stag moose.  Pretty big already, but its antlers have not grown "
"yet."
msgstr "어린 사슴입니다. 벌써 꽤 컸는데, 뿔은 아직 자라지 않았습니다."

#. ~ Feed message of monster "stag moose cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to like you.  It lets you pat its head and seems friendly for "
"now."
msgstr "%s가 당신을 좋아하는 것 같아요. 머리를 쓰다듬어도 괜찮고, 일단은 친근해 보여요."

#. ~ Pet message of monster "stag moose cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s nuzzles you, pressing its head against your petting hand."
msgstr "%s가 당신을 꼭 껴안고, 쓰다듬는 손에 머리를 기댄다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "woolly mammoth"
msgid_plural "woolly mammoths"
msgstr[0] "털매머드"

#. ~ Description of monster "woolly mammoth"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A huge elephant-like animal covered in thick, long hair, shielding it "
"against the cold.  Its trunk lazily swings around its two massive, upward-"
"curving tusks."
msgstr ""
"두껍고 긴 털로 뒤덮인 거대한 코끼리 같은 동물이 추위를 막아줍니다. 코는 위로 휘어진 두 개의 거대한 상아 주위를 느긋하게 휘감고 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "woolly mammoth cub"
msgid_plural "woolly mammoth cubs"
msgstr[0] "새끼 털매머드"

#. ~ Description of monster "woolly mammoth cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"This big baby mammoth is already covered in thick brown wool, but the "
"menacing tusks of their parents have not grown yet."
msgstr "이 거대한 아기 매머드는 이미 두꺼운 갈색 털로 덮여 있지만, 부모 매머드의 위협적인 엄니는 아직 자라지 않았습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "mastodon"
msgid_plural "mastodons"
msgstr[0] "마스토돈"

#. ~ Description of monster "mastodon"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"Shorter, but more massive than a woolly mammoth, and - crucially - much less"
" hairy.  Its trunk lazily swings around its two massive, upward-curving "
"tusks."
msgstr ""
"털매머드보다 키는 작지만 몸집은 더 크고, 결정적으로 털이 훨씬 적습니다. 코는 위로 휘어진 두 개의 거대한 엄니 주위를 느긋하게 휘감고"
" 있습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "mastodon cub"
msgid_plural "mastodon cubs"
msgstr[0] "새끼 마스토돈"

#. ~ Description of monster "mastodon cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"This big baby mastodon is already quite muscular, but the menacing tusks of "
"their parents have not grown yet."
msgstr "이 큰 아기 마스토돈은 이미 근육질이 꽤 발달해 있지만, 부모의 위협적인 엄니는 아직 자라지 않았습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "giant short-faced bear"
msgid_plural "giant short-faced bears"
msgstr[0] "짧은얼굴곰"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant short-faced bear"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A bear weighing about a ton, standing at literal eyelevel with man, as long "
"as it isn't towering above you on it's long, muscular hind legs.  Has a "
"wide, short snout, giving it's face an almost feline expression.  Its not "
"particularly aggressive, but doesn't tolerate threats to itself or its cubs."
msgstr ""
"몸무게가 약 1톤에 달하는 곰이 사람과 눈높이를 맞춰 서 있습니다. 다만, 길고 근육질의 뒷다리로 사람보다 우뚝 솟아 있지는 않아야 "
"합니다. 넓고 짧은 주둥이는 마치 고양이 같은 표정을 짓게 합니다. 특별히 공격적이지는 않지만, 자신이나 새끼에게 위협이 되는 것은 "
"용납하지 않습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "giant short-faced bear cub"
msgid_plural "giant short-faced bear cubs"
msgstr[0] "새끼 짧은얼굴곰"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant short-faced bear cub"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile giant short-faced bear.  Still a massive bear and a considerable "
"threat on its own, but the real danger will come from its highly protective "
"parent."
msgstr ""
"어린 거대 단얼굴 곰입니다. 여전히 몸집이 크고 그 자체로도 상당한 위협이 되지만, 진짜 위협은 보호 본능이 강한 부모에게서 나옵니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "great auk"
msgid_plural "great auks"
msgstr[0] "늑대 유리"

#. ~ Description of monster "great auk"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A large flightless sea bird that bears some resemblance to penguins, "
"although it has a much larger beak.  It has a black and white coat with a "
"characteristic white spot around its eyes."
msgstr ""
"펭귄과 닮은 날지 못하는 큰 바닷새로, 부리가 훨씬 더 큽니다. 검은색과 흰색의 털을 가지고 있으며, 눈 주변에는 특징적인 흰색 반점이 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "white chick"
msgid_plural "white chicks"
msgstr[0] "흰 병아리"

#. ~ Description of monster "white chick"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A tiny grey-colored chick, it could be from a number of different species."
msgstr "작은 회색빛 병아리로, 여러 종이 있을 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "glyptotherium"
msgid_plural "glyptotherii"
msgstr[0] "글립토테리움"

#. ~ Description of monster "glyptotherium"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A huge herbivore that almost resembles a giant tortoise due to its hard "
"outer shell, although it is a close relative to armadillos.  Normally, this "
"species prefers much warmer climates.  This individual probably lost its way"
" at some point."
msgstr ""
"딱딱한 껍질 때문에 거대거북과 거의 비슷한 거대한 초식동물이지만, 아르마딜로와 가까운 친척입니다. 일반적으로 이 종은 훨씬 더 따뜻한 "
"기후를 선호합니다. 아마도 어느 순간 길을 잃었을 것입니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "glyptotherium young"
msgid_plural "glyptotherium youngs"
msgstr[0] "글립토테리움(유체)"

#. ~ Description of monster "glyptotherium young"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile glyptotherium.  Its shell is not quite fully developed, having an"
" almost leathery feel to it."
msgstr "어린 글립토테리움입니다. 껍질이 완전히 발달하지 않아 가죽 같은 질감을 가지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "American zebra"
msgid_plural "American zebras"
msgstr[0] "미국 얼룩말"

#. ~ Description of monster "American zebra"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid "A hooved grazing mammal with a brown-and-white striped coat."
msgstr "갈색과 흰색 줄무늬가 있는 털을 가진 발굽이 있는 방목 포유류입니다."

#. ~ Description of monster "Scott's horse foal"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/monsters/mf_wild.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile American zebra.  It gallops around its parent excitedly, throwing"
" around its head joyously."
msgstr "어린 미국 얼룩말입니다. 부모 얼룩말 주위를 신나게 뛰어다니며, 즐겁게 머리를 흔듭니다."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/mods/Megafauna/proficiencies/mf_weakpoints.json
msgid "Megafaunal Biology"
msgstr "거대동물 생물학"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Megafaunal Biology"
#: data/mods/Megafauna/proficiencies/mf_weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You are familiar with the general anatomy of megafauna, and can exploit "
"potential weaknesses."
msgstr "당신은 거대동물의 일반적인 해부학적 구조에 익숙하며, 잠재적인 약점을 이용할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Calm Mind"
msgstr "차분한 마음"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Calm Mind"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid ""
"While you still have a few stray thoughts, you have an easy time slipping "
"into the mindframe to use psionic powers."
msgstr "여전히 몇 가지 잡념이 남아 있는 동안에는 쉽게 정신 상태로 들어가 초능력을 사용할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of event statistic "num_gains_metaphysics_level_4"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Metaphysics skill level 4 gained"
msgid_plural "Metaphysics skill level 4 gained"
msgstr[0] "형이상학 기술 레벨 4 획득"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "No-Mind"
msgstr "무심"

#. ~ Description of achievement "No-Mind"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid ""
"With a moment's concentration you can slip into the mind-state necessary to "
"channel Netherum energies."
msgstr "잠깐만 집중하면 네더럼 에너지를 전달하는 데 필요한 정신 상태에 빠질 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of event statistic "num_gains_metaphysics_level_7"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Metaphysics skill level 7 gained"
msgid_plural "Metaphysics skill level 7 gained"
msgstr[0] "형이상학 기술 레벨 7 획득"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Galaxy Brain"
msgstr "갤럭시 브레인"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Galaxy Brain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid ""
"You are one with the Nether and the Nether is with you.  Even powerful "
"psionic manipulations are like child's play."
msgstr "당신은 네더와 하나이고, 네더는 당신과 함께합니다. 강력한 사이오닉 조작조차도 아이들 장난과 같습니다."

#. ~ Description of event statistic "num_gains_metaphysics_level_10"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Metaphysics skill level 10 gained"
msgid_plural "Metaphysics skill level 10 gained"
msgstr[0] "형이상학 기술 레벨 10 획득"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Better, Faster, Stronger."
msgstr "더 나은, 더 빠른, 더 강한."

#. ~ Description of achievement "Better, Faster, Stronger."
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Awaken as a biokinetic."
msgstr "바이오키네틱으로 깨어나기."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Sight Beyond Sight."
msgstr "시야 너머의 시야."

#. ~ Description of achievement "Sight Beyond Sight."
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Awaken as a clairsentient."
msgstr "투시능력을 지닌 존재로 깨어나다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "1.21 Jigawatts"
msgstr "1.21 지가와트"

#. ~ Description of achievement "1.21 Jigawatts"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Awaken as an electrokinetic."
msgstr "일렉트로키네틱으로 깨어나기."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Let There Be Light"
msgstr "빛이 있으라"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Let There Be Light"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Awaken as a photokinetic."
msgstr "포토키네틱으로 깨어나기."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Firestarter"
msgstr "방화광"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Firestarter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Awaken as a pyrokinetic."
msgstr "파이로키네틱으로 깨어나기."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Unequal and Opposite Reaction"
msgstr "불평등하고 반대되는 반응"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Unequal and Opposite Reaction"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Awaken as a telekinetic."
msgstr "텔레키네틱으로 깨어나기."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Free Your Mind"
msgstr "마음을 자유롭게 하세요"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Free Your Mind"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Awaken as a telepath."
msgstr "텔레파시로 깨어나다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Wherever You Go, There You Are"
msgstr "어디를 가든, 당신은 거기에 있습니다"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Wherever You Go, There You Are"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Awaken as a teleporter."
msgstr "순간이동자로 깨어납니다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "First, Do No Harm"
msgstr "첫째, 해를 끼치지 마십시오"

#. ~ Description of achievement "First, Do No Harm"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Awaken as a vitakinetic."
msgstr "바이타키네틱으로 깨어나기."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "I Feel A Tingling"
msgstr "나는 따끔거림을 느낀다"

#. ~ Description of achievement "I Feel A Tingling"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Gained any level of Nether Attunement."
msgstr "네더 조율 능력을 어느 정도 얻었습니다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "It's Starting to Affect Me"
msgstr "나에게 영향을 미치기 시작했어"

#. ~ Description of achievement "It's Starting to Affect Me"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Gained four levels of Nether Attunement."
msgstr "네더 조율 능력을 4단계까지 얻었습니다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "I Can Feel It Flowing Through Me"
msgstr "나는 그것이 나를 통해 흐르는 것을 느낄 수 있습니다"

#. ~ Description of achievement "I Can Feel It Flowing Through Me"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Gained eight levels of Nether Attunement."
msgstr "네더 조율 8레벨을 얻었습니다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Power Overwhelming"
msgstr "압도적인 힘"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Power Overwhelming"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Gained maximum possible level of Nether Attunement."
msgstr "가능한 최대 레벨의 네더 조율을 얻었습니다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Haste Makes Waste"
msgstr "서두르면 낭비가 생긴다"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Haste Makes Waste"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid ""
"Learned the methods of extended channeling, enabling a safer way to draw on "
"the Nether."
msgstr "확장된 채널링 방법을 배워서 네더에서 더 안전하게 마법을 사용할 수 있게 되었습니다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Rider on the Storm"
msgstr "폭풍 속의 라이더"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Rider on the Storm"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid ""
"Learned the methods of torrential channeling, enabling greater power at "
"correspondingly greater risk."
msgstr "더 큰 위험에 상응하는 더 큰 힘을 발휘할 수 있는 집중적인 채널링 방법을 배웠습니다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "One-Punch Man"
msgstr "원펀맨"

#. ~ Description of achievement "One-Punch Man"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Mastered the VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols."
msgstr "VERDANT HAND 전투 프로토콜을 마스터했습니다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#. ~ This is a reference to the sound that the X-man Nightcrawler makes when
#. teleporting
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Bamf"
msgstr "밤프"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Bamf"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid ""
"Mastered the TURQUOISE KEYSTONE protocols and learned the Flickerflash "
"Stance power."
msgstr "TURQUOISE KEYSTONE 프로토콜을 완벽하게 익히고 Flickerflash 스탠스의 힘을 배웠습니다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#. ~ This is a reference to Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Secrets of the Ooze"
msgstr "진흙의 비밀"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Secrets of the Ooze"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid ""
"Mastered the EMERALD VANGUARD techniques and learned the Guided Evolution "
"power."
msgstr "에메랄드 뱅가드 기술을 완벽하게 터득하고 가이드 에볼루션 능력을 습득했습니다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "They Are Lean and Athirst!"
msgstr "그들은 마른 체형에 목마르다!"

#. ~ Description of achievement "They Are Lean and Athirst!"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid ""
"\"In an awful light that was not light, in a silence that shrieked, I saw them.\"\n"
"\n"
"Use of your powers attracted the attention of the Hounds.  Run."
msgstr ""
"\"빛이 아닌 끔찍한 빛 속에서, 비명을 지르는 침묵 속에서, 나는 그들을 보았다.\"\n"
"\n"
"당신의 능력을 사용하자 사냥개들의 주의를 끌었습니다. 도망치세요."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "These Aren't The Droids You're Looking For"
msgstr "이건 당신이 찾고 있는 드로이드가 아닙니다"

#. ~ Description of achievement "These Aren't The Droids You're Looking For"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Used telepathy to get away with theft."
msgstr "텔레파시를 이용해 도둑질을 저질렀다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Jaunt"
msgstr "소풍"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Jaunt"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid ""
"It's longer than you think, pal!  Longer than you think!\n"
"\n"
"Sent the refugee center traitor on a very, very long trip."
msgstr ""
"생각보다 훨씬 길잖아, 친구! 생각보다 훨씬 길다고!\n"
"\n"
"난민 센터 반역자를 아주아주 먼 여행으로 보냈어."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "Quantum Leapt"
msgstr "퀀텀 리프"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Quantum Leapt"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid ""
"There's so many worlds out there.  Why stick with just one?\n"
"\n"
"Used your powers to teleport offworld during a raging portal storm."
msgstr ""
"세상은 정말 많은데, 왜 하나만 고집해야 하죠?\n"
"\n"
"거센 차원문 폭풍 속에서 당신의 능력을 사용해 다른 세계로 순간이동했습니다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "By the Rivers of Babylon"
msgstr "바빌론의 강가에서"

#. ~ Description of achievement "By the Rivers of Babylon"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid ""
"\"Not once, in a dozen or a hundred or you know not how many worlds, was there anything left to save.\"\n"
"\n"
"Learned Rubik's history through telepathy."
msgstr ""
"\"열두 개든 백 개든, 아니 몇 개의 세상이든, 단 한 번도 구할 것이 남아 있지 않았어.\"\n"
"\n"
"텔레파시를 통해 루빅의 역사를 알게 되었다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid "In ie Tlecujlixquac, in ie Tlamamatlac"
msgstr "In ie Tlecujlixquac, in ie Tlamamatlac"

#. ~ Description of achievement "In ie Tlecujlixquac, in ie Tlamamatlac"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/achievements.json
msgid ""
"\"Already at the edge of the fire, already at the stairway.\"\n"
"\n"
"Found the body of the ocēlōpilli soldier."
msgstr ""
"\"이미 불 가에, 이미 계단에 다다랐어.\"\n"
"\n"
"오켈로필리 병사의 시신을 발견했다."

#. ~ Verb in activity "ACT_PSI_PHOTOKIN_RADIATION_STERILIZATION"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/activity_types.json
msgid "sterilizing"
msgstr "살균"

#. ~ Verb in activity "ACT_PSI_TELEPORTER_ATTUNING"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/activity_types.json
msgid "attuning to area"
msgstr "지역에 맞춰 조정"

#. ~ Verb in activity "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_ADJUSTING_MENTALITY"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/activity_types.json
msgid "adjusting mentality"
msgstr "사고방식 조정"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/bionics.json
msgid "Dangersight Eyes"
msgstr "위험한 눈"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Dangersight Eyes"
#. ~ Description of bionic "Ohuicatlachiyaliztimeh"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Minute quantities of matrix crystal interface with your optic nerves, "
"allowing you to detect the presence of living beings that seek to do you "
"harm.  Activate to toggle on."
msgstr ""
"미세한 양의 매트릭스 크리스털이 시신경과 상호작용하여 당신을 해치려는 생명체의 존재를 감지할 수 있습니다. 활성화하여 켜세요."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/bionics.json
msgid "Ohuicatlachiyaliztimeh"
msgstr "오우이카틀라치얄리즈티메"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/bionics.json
msgid "Ikpitikayotecontli System"
msgstr "이크피티카요테콘틀리 시스템"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Ikpitikayotecontli System"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/bionics.json
msgid "A Compact Bionics Module that increases your power capacity by 600 kJ."
msgstr "전력 용량을 600kJ 증가시키는 컴팩트 바이오닉스 모듈입니다."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/bionics.json
msgid "Tlacuallichicahualiztli Transformer"
msgstr "틀라쿠알리치카후알리즈틀리 변압기"

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/bionics.json
msgid "Teōchicāhualiztli Booster"
msgstr "테오치카우알리즐리 부스터"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Teōchicāhualiztli Booster"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A series of implants along your skeleton and in major muscle groups can be "
"activated to greatly increase your strength and agility.  Activate to toggle"
" on."
msgstr "골격과 주요 근육군에 삽입된 일련의 임플란트를 활성화하면 근력과 민첩성이 크게 향상됩니다. 활성화하여 켜세요."

#. ~ Name of a bionic
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/bionics.json
msgid "Tapayaxitilmàtli"
msgstr "타파야시틸마틀리"

#. ~ Description of bionic "Tapayaxitilmàtli"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Implants under your skin throughout your body that bend light around you "
"when activated, making it much harder to spot you from a distance.  While "
"not invisibility, it can keep you unseen when it counts.  Activate to toggle"
" on."
msgstr ""
"몸 전체 피부 아래에 이식된 이 장치는 활성화되면 빛을 주변으로 굴절시켜 멀리서 당신을 발견하기 훨씬 어렵게 만듭니다. 투명화는 "
"아니지만, 중요한 순간에 당신을 보이지 않게 해 줄 수 있습니다. 활성화하여 켜세요."

