#. ~ NPC message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_DAMAGE_PSYSHIELD_CHECK_2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_DAMAGE_PSYSHIELD_CHECK"
