#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Arising Electrokinetic"
msgstr "떠오르는 일렉트로키네틱"

#. ~ Description of profession "Arising Electrokinetic" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Something happened during the storms that raged during the Cataclysm, and "
"now you can do things that would have once seemed impossible.  You an hurl "
"lightning bolts from your hands, like some kind of superhero, and your "
"smartphone still has a full charge even though you haven't plugged it in "
"weeks.  Some kind of huge wasp attacked you in the woods and there was a "
"crackle like thunder and it fell to the ground twitching.  You didn't stop "
"to check if it would move again."
msgstr ""
"대격변 당시 맹렬하게 몰아쳤던 폭풍 속에서 무슨 일이 일어났고, 이제는 한때 불가능해 보였던 일들을 할 수 있게 되었습니다. 마치 "
"슈퍼히어로처럼 손에서 번개를 쏘아대고, 몇 주 동안 충전하지 않았는데도 스마트폰은 여전히 완충 상태였습니다. 숲속에서 거대한 말벌이 "
"당신을 공격했고, 천둥 같은 탁탁거리는 소리가 나더니 스마트폰이 움찔거리며 땅에 떨어졌습니다. 당신은 스마트폰이 다시 움직일지 확인하려고"
" 멈추지도 않았습니다."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/hobbies.json
