#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Cuāuhpilli Special Forces"
msgstr "쿠아우필리 특수부대"

#. ~ Description of profession "Cuāuhpilli Special Forces" for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on guard duty when the ship was preparing to enter Tliltilhuicaātl "
"and had just braced for the jump when something went wrong.  The ship seemed"
" like it was turning inside out, then you seemed like you were turning "
"inside out, and suddenly you were planetside in the ruins of a dying world."
"  You've served the Excān Tlahtōlōyān on a dozen worlds, taken five "
"captives, and even have clearance for contact with huecachane civilizations,"
" but none of that has prepared you for the Cataclysm"
msgstr ""
"우주선이 틀릴틸후이카틀 행성에 진입할 준비를 하고 있을 때, 당신은 경계 근무를 서고 있었고, 막 점프를 준비하던 중 무언가 "
"잘못되었습니다. 우주선이 뒤집히는 듯했고, 당신도 뒤집히는 듯했고, 갑자기 죽어가는 행성의 폐허가 된 행성에 갇히게 되었습니다. 당신은 "
"엑칸 틀라톨로얀을 위해 열두 개의 행성을 전전했고, 다섯 명의 포로를 잡았으며, 심지어 우에카카네 문명과 접촉할 수 있는 허가까지 "
"받았지만, 그 어떤 것도 대격변에 대비하지 못했습니다."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/professions.json
