msgstr "당신의 성격을 개선하세요"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Be Optimistic!"
msgstr "낙관적이 되세요!"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Cure your Seasonal Affective Disorder"
msgstr "계절성 정서 장애를 치료하세요"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Cure Topographagnosia"
msgstr "지형지각실인증 치료"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Become a Scout"
msgstr "스카우트가 되세요"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Become a Masochist"
msgstr "피학성애자가 되기"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Stop being a Masochist"
msgstr "피학성애자가 되기 그만하기"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Embrace your Spirituality"
msgstr "영성을 받아들이세요"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Reject your Spirituality"
msgstr "영성을 거부하다"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Neglect your Table Manners"
msgstr "식탁 예절을 소홀히 하다"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Fix your Inattentiveness"
msgstr "부주의함을 고치세요"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_END_PSI_POWERS_SPECIFIC"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_power_effects.json
msgid "cancel"
msgstr "취소"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You will no longer care about harming your fellow humans and other innocent "
"creatures."
msgstr "당신은 더 이상 동료 인간이나 다른 무고한 생물을 해치는 것에 대해 신경 쓰지 않을 것입니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"The suffering of your fellows will affect you.  How could you possibly live "
"like that?"
msgstr "동족의 고통이 당신에게도 영향을 미칠 텐데, 어떻게 그런 식으로 살 수 있겠어요?"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Lose your pacifistic desires to do no harm.  Even thinking about what you "
"might do afterwards unnerves you."
msgstr "해를 끼치지 않겠다는 평화주의적 욕망을 버리세요. 나중에 무슨 짓을 할지 생각하는 것조차 불안해집니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Stop caring about all the little ups and downs of the Cataclysm.  You feel "
"this is only possible due to your extensive consumption of Medical mutagen."
msgstr "대격변의 사소한 변화에 신경 쓰지 마세요. 당신은 의료 뮤타젠을 대량으로 섭취했기 때문에 이런 일이 가능하다고 생각합니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Let yourself be affected by all the ups and downs of the Cataclysm.  "
"Hopefully more up than down."
msgstr "대격변의 모든 기복을 직접 경험해 보세요. 기복보다는 상승이 더 많기를 바랍니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Perform a comprehensive and corrective surgery to cure your fear of the "
"dark.  No longer will you be paralyzed by errant shadows."
msgstr "어둠에 대한 두려움을 치료하기 위해 포괄적이고 교정적인 수술을 받으세요. 더 이상 떠도는 그림자에 얽매이지 않으실 겁니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Deflate your perfectly logical, justified, and factual acknowledgement of "
"your beauty.  How could you deprive everyone else of your looks?"
msgstr ""
"당신의 아름다움에 대한 완벽하게 논리적이고, 정당하며, 사실적인 인정을 꺾어 버리세요. 어떻게 다른 사람들의 외모를 빼앗을 수 있겠어요?"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Rather than expanding your palette the normal way, use your incredible "
"telepathic powers to force yourself to be OK with untasty looking food.  At "
"least it gets the job done."
msgstr ""
"평소처럼 입맛을 돋우는 대신, 놀라운 텔레파시 능력을 사용해서 보기 흉한 음식도 괜찮게 여기도록 노력해 보세요. 적어도 효과는 있잖아요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Force yourself to appreciate the company of others by making yourself an "
"extrovert.  Hopefully you'll be able to find people to interact with."
msgstr "외향적인 사람이 되어 다른 사람들과의 교류를 소중히 여기세요. 그러면 소통할 사람을 찾을 수 있을 거예요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Stop yourself from enjoying the company of others by removing your "
"extroversion.  It's not like there's anybody around anyways, right?"
msgstr "외향적인 모습을 버려 다른 사람들과 어울리는 즐거움을 누리지 마세요. 어차피 주변에 아무도 없잖아요, 그렇죠?"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Force yourself to require the company of others by making yourself "
"incredibly sociable.  Hopefully you have friends."
msgstr "자신을 엄청나게 사교적인 사람으로 만들어 다른 사람들과 함께하고 싶어하도록 하세요. 친구가 있으면 좋겠네요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Work on yourself by stopping your need for other's presence.  A workable "
"lifestyle turned problem which started with the death of everyone you knew "
"and loved."
msgstr ""
"다른 사람의 존재에 대한 욕구를 멈추고 스스로를 발전시키세요. 당신이 알고 사랑했던 모든 사람의 죽음으로 시작된, 평범했던 삶의 방식이 "
"문제로 변했습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Make sure that you're happy alone by making yourself an introvert.  With "
"near everyone dead, this mindset just got a lot more viable."
msgstr ""
"스스로를 내성적인 사람으로 만들어 혼자서도 행복해지세요. 거의 모든 사람이 죽은 지금, 이런 사고방식은 훨씬 더 현실적이 되었습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Stop yourself from enjoying being alone by removing your introversion.  You "
"now feel positively neutral."
msgstr "내성적인 성향을 제거하여 혼자 있는 것을 즐기는 것을 멈추세요. 이제 당신은 긍정적이고 중립적인 기분을 느끼게 됩니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Force yourself to hate interacting with others.  What would have been a "
"debilitating mentality in pre-Cataclysm life might actually help you.  "
"What's the chance you'll actually have to talk to someone now?"
msgstr ""
"다른 사람들과 교류하는 것을 싫어하도록 스스로에게 강요하세요. 대격변 이전에는 쇠약하게 느껴졌을 사고방식이 실제로는 도움이 될 수도 "
"있습니다. 지금 누군가와 실제로 대화할 기회가 얼마나 될까요?"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Your instinctive hatred of social interaction is probably a bit much.  For "
"all that meeting other survivors is rare you should probably be more "
"receptive to their presence."
msgstr ""
"사회적 교류에 대한 당신의 본능적인 혐오감은 아마도 좀 지나친 것 같습니다. 다른 생존자들을 만나는 일이 드물긴 하지만, 그들의 존재에 "
"더 귀 기울이는 것이 좋을 것입니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"As much as you currently hate water, you can begrudgingly accept that it "
"would be easier if you didn't feel that way."
msgstr "지금은 물을 싫어하지만, 그렇게 느끼지 않는다면 물을 마시는 게 더 쉬울 거라는 걸 마지못해 받아들일 수도 있습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You now have a lot more reasons to be outside while it's raining.  Being wet"
" doesn't really hurt you physically, and with your telepathic power you can "
"make sure it doesn't hurt you mentally either."
msgstr ""
"이제 비가 오는 동안 밖에 나갈 이유가 훨씬 많아졌습니다. 젖는다고 해서 육체적으로 큰 피해를 입지는 않을 뿐만 아니라, 당신의 텔레파시"
" 능력 덕분에 정신적으로도 피해를 입지 않도록 할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Replace therapy and many other normal, healthy options for getting over your"
" inability to use guns.  At least this method is quick."
msgstr "총기 사용 불능을 극복하기 위해 치료법과 기타 여러 정상적이고 건강한 방법을 대체하세요. 적어도 이 방법은 빠르죠."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Drastic times require dramatic measures.  Whatever your reason for not "
"driving, you can get over it with a small dose of major psychic surgery."
msgstr "힘든 시기에는 극적인 대처가 필요합니다. 운전을 하지 않는 이유가 무엇이든, 약간의 심리적 수술만으로도 극복할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"As much as you love travelling you can see the benefits of staying in one "
"place.  Psychically remove your desire to keep exploring."
msgstr ""
"여행을 아무리 좋아하더라도 한곳에 머무르는 것의 이점을 알 수 있을 겁니다. 탐험을 계속하고 싶은 욕구를 정신적으로 없애세요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"As much as it hurts you you just cannot get over the dullness of familiar "
"places.  With a bit of psychic surgery, that dullness can get a good bit "
"brighter."
msgstr ""
"아무리 아프더라도 익숙한 장소의 지루함은 극복할 수 없습니다. 약간의 심령 수술만 받으면 그 지루함은 훨씬 더 밝아질 수 있습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Even taking the time to consider this alteration of your head is making you "
"incredibly unhappy at your lack of travel.  You should really fix this."
msgstr ""
"이런 마음의 변화를 생각할 시간을 갖는 것만으로도 여행이 부족하다는 사실에 엄청나게 불만스러워질 겁니다. 이 문제는 정말 고쳐야 합니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Logically speaking, your refusal to wear tainted clothing really isn't that "
"bad.  There may be some benefit to reducing your squeamishness, though."
msgstr ""
"논리적으로 보면, 오염된 옷을 입는 것을 거부하는 건 그렇게 나쁜 일이 아닙니다. 하지만 비위가 약해지는 걸 줄이는 데는 어느 정도 "
"도움이 될 수 있습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Finding time to DM a game is probably not going to happen again.  Even so, "
"by spending an inordinate amount of time studying a DM'ing guide while under"
" the effect of your psychic powers you think you can get some ideas on how "
"to do it again but quicker."
msgstr ""
"게임 DM을 할 시간을 찾는 건 다시는 불가능할 겁니다. 하지만 초능력의 영향을 받는 동안 DM 가이드를 공부하는 데 지나치게 많은 "
"시간을 쏟으면, 어떻게 하면 더 빨리 DM을 할 수 있을지 아이디어를 얻을 수 있을 거라고 생각하는 건 무리겠죠."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"The government is gone and so are the owners of all these buildings.  And "
"trees.  And really everything flammable.  You think you can make yourself "
"enjoy the act a lot more than you may already do, but this may have some "
"side effects."
msgstr ""
"정부는 사라졌고, 이 모든 건물의 주인들도 사라졌습니다. 나무도, 그리고 모든 가연성 물질도 사라졌습니다. 당신은 지금보다 훨씬 더 이 "
"행위를 즐길 수 있을 거라고 생각하지만, 이는 몇 가지 부작용을 초래할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"As fun as it is, you can begrudgingly agree that there's better things to do"
" than setting fires.  Put a hypothetical therapist out of business with your"
" psychic powers and fix that."
msgstr ""
"재밌긴 하지만, 불을 지르는 것보다 더 좋은 일이 있다는 데 마지못해 동의할 수도 있겠죠. 당신의 초능력으로 가상의 치료사를 파산시키고 "
"그 문제를 해결해 보세요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Being able to lie could be an important part of your life… if there was even"
" anyone to lie to.  You doubt this would help you much."
msgstr ""
"거짓말을 할 수 있다는 건 당신 삶에 중요한 부분이 될 수도 있어요… 거짓말할 상대가 있다면 말이죠. 하지만 그게 당신에게 큰 도움이 될"
" 거라고는 생각하지 않아요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"There's still a couple of survivors around, and being good at lying to them "
"might give you some opportunities you otherwise would lack.  It might also "
"get you in trouble."
msgstr "아직 생존자들이 몇 명 남아 있는데, 그들에게 거짓말을 잘하면 다른 기회는 없을지도 몰라. 곤경에 처할 수도 있고."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Even the thought of doing this makes you incredibly uncomfortable, but of "
"all the reasons to quite veganism, the complete destruction of your entire "
"world probably qualifies."
msgstr ""
"이런 생각을 하는 것만으로도 엄청나게 불편하겠지만, 채식주의를 그만두는 모든 이유 중에서도 당신의 세상 전체가 완전히 파괴되는 것은 "
"아마도 그 이유에 해당할 것입니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Logically speaking, those things that kind of look human really aren't.  It "
"might currently feel uncomfortable, but it's hard to think of a real "
"argument against eating them.  May as well get over your emotions.  "
"Telepathically!"
msgstr ""
"논리적으로 보면, 사람처럼 보이는 것들은 사실 사람이 아니에요. 당장은 불편할 수 있지만, 먹는 것에 반대할 만한 진짜 이유를 "
"생각해내기는 어려워요. 차라리 감정을 극복하는 게 나을 거예요. 텔레파시로요!"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You feel just fine eating those not-humans, but a tiny part of your brain "
"tells you that this might be a slippery slope.  It might not be logical, but"
" you can stop this immediately."
msgstr ""
"인간이 아닌 것들을 먹어도 괜찮다고 생각하지만, 뇌의 아주 작은 부분이 이게 위험한 길일지도 모른다고 경고합니다. 논리적으로 맞지 않을 "
"수도 있지만, 당장 멈출 수 있습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Completely disgusting, and potentially quite unhealthy.  However, given the "
"times it may be your only option.  Can you force yourself to enjoy the taste"
" of human flesh?"
msgstr ""
"정말 역겹고 건강에도 해로울 수 있습니다. 하지만 요즘 같은 시대에는 이게 유일한 선택지일 수도 있습니다. 인육의 맛을 억지로라도 즐길 "
"수 있을까요?"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"As tasty as humans are, it's gotten you some negative looks from other "
"survivors when you accidently referred to your 'taste.'  Are you willing to "
"change yourself just to meet their expectations?"
msgstr ""
"인간도 맛있지만, 실수로 '맛'이라고 언급했을 때 다른 생존자들에게서 부정적인 시선을 받았던 적이 있습니다. 그들의 기대에 부응하기 위해"
" 자신을 바꿀 의향이 있나요?"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Help balance your mood by fixing the centers of your brain that are "
"responsible for regulating it.  Be a little more at peace with yourself."
msgstr "기분 조절을 담당하는 뇌의 중추를 바로잡아 기분을 조절하세요. 자신과 좀 더 평화롭게 지내세요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You've heard stories of people who heavily specialize in certain skills at "
"the expense of all others.  With a bit of work, you think you can replicate "
"this in yourself."
msgstr ""
"다른 모든 기술을 희생하고 특정 기술에만 집중하는 사람들의 이야기를 들어보셨을 겁니다. 조금만 노력하면 당신도 그런 능력을 발휘할 수 "
"있다고 생각합니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Can you really care about all those other things that don't matter or even "
"make that much sense.  With a bit of telepathic brain surgery you can!"
msgstr "중요하지도 않고, 그다지 의미가 없는 다른 모든 것들에 정말 신경 쓸 수 있나요? 텔레파시로 뇌 수술을 받으면 가능합니다!"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You can begrudgingly admit that an old candy wrapper might not be the most "
"useful thing in the world.  Help yourself physically drop it by mentally "
"dropping your hording sensibilities."
msgstr ""
"낡은 사탕 포장지가 세상에서 가장 쓸모없는 물건일 수도 있다는 것을 마지못해 인정할 수도 있습니다. 쌓아두려는 마음을 정신적으로 버리는 "
"것으로, 물리적으로 사탕 포장지를 버리는 데 도움이 될 것입니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"At least one of the voices recommended you do this, and they seemed "
"trustworthy."
msgstr "적어도 한 목소리는 당신에게 이렇게 하라고 권고했고, 그들은 신뢰할 만한 것처럼 보였습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"It takes you a while to process information, far longer than the average "
"person.  You think you've identified the locations of your brain responsible"
" for this, and with a bit of telepathic power you can fix that."
msgstr ""
"당신은 정보를 처리하는 데 시간이 꽤 걸립니다. 일반인보다 훨씬 더 오랜 시간이 걸리죠. 당신은 뇌의 어떤 부분이 이 문제를 일으키는지 "
"파악했다고 생각하지만, 약간의 텔레파시 능력만 있다면 그걸 고칠 수 있을 거라고 생각합니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"With some deep analysis of how your brain works while reading with your "
"Speed Reading power, you think you can replicate some of the efficiency "
"caused by it.  This will allow you to permanently read quicker."
msgstr ""
"속독 능력을 활용하여 읽는 동안 뇌가 어떻게 작용하는지 심층적으로 분석하면, 그로 인해 발생하는 효율성을 어느 정도 재현할 수 있다고 "
"생각합니다. 이렇게 하면 영구적으로 더 빨리 읽을 수 있게 될 것입니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Help yourself stop getting addicted to things by analyzing the relevant "
"pathways and closing them up.  You won't be extra addictive anymore, but you"
" won't necessarily have any special resistance either."
msgstr ""
"중독을 멈추려면 관련 경로를 분석하고 차단하세요. 더 이상 중독성이 심해지지는 않지만, 특별한 저항력도 생기지 않을 것입니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Increase your inhibitions with a bit of psychic surgery.  Even beyond the "
"normal reasons, a good supply of alcohol and really any other addictive "
"substance is hard to come by nowadays.  Make sure you don't need them any "
"more than usual."
msgstr ""
"약간의 심령 수술로 자제력을 키우세요. 일반적인 이유 외에도 요즘은 술이나 다른 중독성 물질을 충분히 구하기가 어렵습니다. 평소보다 더 "
"많이 필요하지 않도록 하세요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Fix your damaged memory regions to allow you to remember all of that "
"important stuff better."
msgstr "손상된 메모리 영역을 복구하면 중요한 내용을 더 잘 기억할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Improve the memory regions within your brain, allowing you to recall "
"information far more easily.  Help make sure you don't forget things ever "
"again."
msgstr "뇌의 기억 영역을 향상시켜 정보를 훨씬 더 쉽게 기억할 수 있도록 하세요. 다시는 잊어버리지 않도록 도와주세요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Sugar already tastes pretty good.  You can increase those feelings and make "
"it taste even better."
msgstr "설탕은 원래도 꽤 맛있어요. 그 맛을 더하고 더 맛있게 만들 수 있어요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Sugar may taste amazing, but eating so much of it probably isn't healthy.  "
"Enforce your new diet by making it taste worse."
msgstr ""
"설탕은 맛있을지 몰라도, 너무 많이 먹으면 건강에 좋지 않을 수 있습니다. 맛을 더 나쁘게 만들어서 새로운 식단을 강요하세요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"As annoying as books may be, you think that it would be useful to not be so "
"bored while reading them.  Fix that with psychic power."
msgstr "책이 아무리 귀찮더라도, 읽는 동안 지루하지 않으면 좋겠다고 생각합니다. 초능력으로 해결하세요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Reading has been one of the most important skills that has let humanity rise"
" as far as it once did.  Make sure you spend more time doing it by making "
"sure that you love it."
msgstr ""
"독서는 인류가 과거처럼 발전할 수 있도록 해준 가장 중요한 기술 중 하나입니다. 독서를 사랑하고, 독서에 더 많은 시간을 투자하세요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Improve the areas relegated to learning new information in your brain that "
"you've noticed are operating a little poorly.  This has no downsides."
msgstr "뇌에서 새로운 정보를 학습하는 데 필요한 영역이 제대로 작동하지 않는 것을 발견하면 그 영역을 개선하세요. 단점은 없습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Take some notes on how you brain functions while you're in concentration "
"trances and permanently replicate a small part of that efficiency in your "
"head to help you learn everything quicker."
msgstr ""
"집중 상태에 있는 동안 뇌가 어떻게 기능하는지 메모하고, 그 효율성의 일부를 머릿속에서 영구적으로 복제하여 모든 것을 더 빨리 배우는 데"
" 도움을 받으세요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Improve your 3D awareness and planning by adjusting your brain.  There's "
"definitely ways of packing that you're currently missing."
msgstr "뇌를 조정하여 3D 인식 능력과 계획력을 향상시키세요. 현재 당신이 놓치고 있는 짐 싸는 방법이 분명히 있을 겁니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Dramatically improve your 3D awareness by making several efficiency "
"alterations to your brain.  Seeing how things fit together will get a lot "
"easier."
msgstr ""
"뇌의 효율성을 여러 가지 변화시켜 3D 인식 능력을 극적으로 향상시키세요. 사물들이 어떻게 서로 연결되는지 보는 것이 훨씬 쉬워질 "
"것입니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You already have enough to be angry about right now, you don't need your "
"brain naturally being pissed off as well.  Instead of pills or therapy, use "
"your telepathic powers!"
msgstr "지금 당장도 화낼 일은 충분히 많으니, 뇌까지 자연스럽게 화낼 필요는 없어. 약이나 심리 치료 대신, 텔레파시 능력을 써!"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"With a couple of notes from your Mood Stabilization power, you can "
"permanently alter your brain to make you happier."
msgstr "기분 안정화 능력에서 얻은 몇 가지 메모로, 당신은 영구적으로 당신의 뇌를 바꿔 당신을 더 행복하게 만들 수 있습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Winter already has some real issues for your survival.  There's no need for "
"you to be depressed on top of it.  Fix that up with some intricate mental "
"surgery."
msgstr ""
"겨울은 이미 당신의 생존에 심각한 문제를 안겨줍니다. 그 위에 우울함을 더할 필요는 없습니다. 정교한 정신 수술로 해결하세요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Fix your inability to remember locations and direct yourself by connecting "
"locations of your brain that were erroneously disconnected."
msgstr "위치를 기억하지 못하고 방향을 잡지 못하는 문제를 해결하려면 잘못 연결되었던 뇌의 위치를 연결하세요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"With a deep analysis of how you remember locations you think you can improve"
" your ability to do so."
msgstr "기억하는 장소를 어떻게 생각하는지에 대한 심층 분석을 통해 기억 능력을 향상시킬 수 있습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Rewire your way of feeling pain into something slightly positive.  It will "
"still be incredibly distracting and debilitating, but at least you'll enjoy "
"it.  Hopefully not enough to intentionally seek it out."
msgstr ""
"고통을 느끼는 방식을 조금은 긍정적인 쪽으로 바꿔보세요. 여전히 엄청나게 산만하고 힘들겠지만, 적어도 즐길 수는 있을 거예요. 의도적으로"
" 고통을 찾아 헤맬 정도는 아니길 바랍니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Your enjoyment of pain has lead to too many bad decisions.  Get rid of it "
"before a zombie gets rid of you."
msgstr "고통을 즐기는 탓에 잘못된 결정이 너무 많았어. 좀비가 널 없애기 전에 고통을 없애버려."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"The dream of a person struggling with their faith.  Force yourself to see "
"spirituality in everything by mentally adjusting your brain to mirror "
"somebody else's faith.  It may not be the typical way of finding "
"spirituality, but you reckon the end result will be similar."
msgstr ""
"신앙으로 고군분투하는 사람의 꿈. 다른 사람의 신앙을 반영하도록 뇌를 정신적으로 조정하여 모든 것에서 영성을 보도록 노력하세요. 영성을 "
"찾는 전형적인 방법은 아닐지 몰라도, 최종 결과는 비슷할 거라고 생각합니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Even your immense spirituality cannot compete with the horrors around you.  "
"Intentionally lose a major element of who you are so you don't have to deal "
"with it."
msgstr ""
"당신의 엄청난 영성조차도 주변의 공포에 맞설 수 없습니다. 당신의 정체성 중 중요한 부분을 의도적으로 잃어버려서 그 공포에 맞서지 않도록"
" 하세요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Use your psychic powers to forget all of your memories mandating you eat "
"with good manners; hopefully, you won't lose anything else important."
msgstr ""
"예의 바르게 식사하라는 명령에 대한 모든 기억을 잊기 위해 초능력을 사용하세요. 그러면 다른 중요한 것은 아무것도 잃지 않을 겁니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Fix up the regions of your brain responsible for predicting the actions of "
"others.  A surprisingly comprehensive surgery."
msgstr "타인의 행동을 예측하는 뇌 영역을 치료하세요. 놀라울 정도로 포괄적인 수술입니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Do something else"
msgstr "다른 것을 하세요"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPATHIC_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You feel that you need to be an incredibly powerful telepath to make this "
"work"
msgstr "이 작업을 수행하려면 엄청나게 강력한 텔레패스가 필요하다고 느낍니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "It's a good thing that all of those people don't really matter."
msgstr "다행히 그 사람들이 모두 별로 중요하지 않은 것 같아요."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Looking back at your past actions, you really hope you didn't do anything "
"that you will now regret."
msgstr "과거의 행동을 돌이켜보면, 지금 후회할 만한 짓은 하지 않았으면 좋겠다고 진심으로 바랍니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Your past desires were really holding you back.  Now you're more at ease "
"with what you must do."
msgstr "과거의 욕망이 당신을 정말로 짓누르고 있었죠. 이제 당신은 무엇을 해야 할지 더 편안하게 생각할 수 있게 되었어요."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Nothing seems to matter anymore."
msgstr "더 이상 아무것도 중요하지 않은 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Compared to your prior state, you are suddenly overwhelmed with emotion!"
msgstr "이전 상태와 비교해보면 갑자기 감정이 넘쳐흐르네요!"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"How could you ever have let just a little bit of darkness affect you so "
"much?"
msgstr "어떻게 당신은 아주 약간의 어둠에도 그토록 큰 영향을 받을 수 있었을까요?"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"How could you have ever thought that way?  Of all the silly things to feel, "
"especially in times like these"
msgstr "어떻게 그런 생각을 할 수 있었을까? 이런 바보 같은 생각들 중에서도, 특히 이런 시기에"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Your mind and stomach simultaneously grown in relief at your food palette "
"expanding."
msgstr "음식의 풍미가 확장되면서 마음과 배가 동시에 안도감을 느낀다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Since there's so few people left alive, you're at least happy that you "
"generally enjoy their company."
msgstr "살아남은 사람이 너무 적기 때문에, 당신은 적어도 그들과 함께 있는 시간을 즐긴다는 사실에 행복감을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Getting your energy from interacting with others was not the worst idea in "
"the world, but also not the best."
msgstr "다른 사람과 교류하면서 에너지를 얻는 것은 세상에서 최악의 생각은 아니지만, 최고의 생각도 아닙니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You absolutely love and absolutely need to be able to talk to people.  You "
"cannot believe that the Cataclysm is getting in the way of that!"
msgstr "당신은 사람들과 대화하는 걸 정말 좋아하고, 또 꼭 해야 합니다. 대격변 때문에 그런 걸 방해받는다는 게 믿기지 않네요!"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"As much as you enjoy a good conversation, you've gotten over the reality "
"that people just aren't around anymore.  You'll have to live with that."
msgstr "좋은 대화를 즐기는 만큼, 사람들이 더 이상 곁에 없다는 현실을 극복했을 거예요. 그 현실을 받아들이고 살아가야 할 거예요."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Since there's so few people left alive, you are no longer forced to talk "
"with anyone."
msgstr "살아남은 사람이 너무 적기 때문에 더 이상 누구와도 대화를 나눌 필요가 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"There's definitely someone out there right?  Its a shame you cannot enjoy "
"your solitude anymore."
msgstr "분명 누군가 있을 거야, 그렇지? 더 이상 혼자만의 시간을 즐길 수 없다니 안타깝네."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You absolutely detest having to interact with anyone else!  Its a good thing"
" you'll never have to again!"
msgstr "다른 사람과 교류하는 걸 정말 싫어하잖아! 다시는 그럴 일이 없어서 다행이야!"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Your prior level of hatred of social interaction was a bit much.  You no "
"longer enjoy the solitude quite as much but you definitely don't have a "
"problem with other people anymore."
msgstr ""
"이전에 사회적 교류를 싫어했던 수준이 좀 심했어요. 더 이상 혼자 있는 시간을 그렇게 즐기지는 않지만, 다른 사람들과의 관계에서 문제가 "
"있는 것도 확실히 없어졌어요."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Earlier you was over-reacting a bit.  You cannot really connect with why "
"water was just that bad."
msgstr "아까 좀 과민반응하셨잖아요. 물이 왜 그렇게 나빴는지 제대로 공감할 수가 없어요."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Being wet is just a natural part of living.  Especially now."
msgstr "물에 젖는 건 삶의 자연스러운 일부예요. 특히 요즘 같은 시대에요."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"The thought of getting shot may still scare you, but the thought of not "
"being able to fight back is on another level.  How did you ever let yourself"
" not use these tools?"
msgstr ""
"총에 맞는다는 생각만 해도 여전히 두려울 수 있지만, 반격할 수 없다는 생각은 또 다른 차원의 두려움을 불러일으킵니다. 어떻게 이런 "
"도구들을 사용하지 않을 수 있었을까요?"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"No buses, no trains, no planes.  You've been met with a simultaneous need to"
" travel distances and a vast reduction in your tools to do so.  Forcing "
"yourself to be able to drive cars was a good idea."
msgstr ""
"버스도, 기차도, 비행기도 없습니다. 먼 거리를 이동해야 하는 필요성과 그에 필요한 도구가 엄청나게 줄어든 상황에 동시에 직면하게 "
"되었습니다. 자동차 운전을 할 수 있도록 스스로를 강요한 것은 좋은 생각이었습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "You cannot wait to finally settle down."
msgstr "당신은 마침내 정착하기를 고대하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"The thought of that far-away place seems just a little less necessary.  You "
"still want to go there though."
msgstr "저 멀리 있는 곳에 대한 생각은 조금 덜 필요해 보인다. 그래도 여전히 가고 싶은 마음이 든다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Perhaps you can wait a couple of minutes before leaving."
msgstr "떠나기 전에 몇 분 정도 기다려 보는 게 어떨까요?"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Tainted clothes are still gross, and with other options you'll obviously "
"never use them.  There's probably some situation out there though that could"
" make it worth it."
msgstr ""
"오염된 옷은 여전히 역겨운데, 다른 방법이 있다면 당연히 안 쓸 거예요. 하지만 그럴 만한 가치가 있는 상황이 분명 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You know, maybe you can find some people to DM with.  If not though, you "
"think that there's probably some side benefits to adjusting your head this "
"way."
msgstr ""
"있잖아, 같이 DM할 사람을 찾을 수도 있을 것 같아. 하지만 그렇지 않다면, 머리를 이렇게 조정하면 뭔가 부수적인 이점이 있을 거라고 "
"생각해."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Nothing's preventing you from starting fires, but nothing's forcing you to "
"do so either.  Flame just seems less attractive."
msgstr ""
"불을 피우는 걸 막을 수 있는 건 없지만, 그렇다고 불을 피우라고 강요하는 것도 아닙니다. 그저 불꽃이 덜 매력적으로 보일 뿐입니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "You can now lie to your hearts content!  Mostly to a mirror."
msgstr "이제 마음껏 거짓말을 할 수 있겠지! 주로 거울에 대고."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You can instinctively tell ways to mislead others.  Their reactions are just"
" so predictable."
msgstr "당신은 본능적으로 다른 사람들을 속이는 방법을 알아낼 수 있어요. 그들의 반응은 너무나 예측 가능하죠."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Its hard to tell yourself, but you feel that your face got a lot more tells."
msgstr "스스로에게 말하기는 어렵지만, 당신은 당신의 얼굴이 더 많은 것을 말해준다고 느낀다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "You could use a hamburger."
msgstr "햄버거가 필요해요."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "How were you able to eat those humany things so easily?"
msgstr "어떻게 그렇게 쉽게 인간적인 음식을 먹을 수 있었나요?"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "What have you done?"
msgstr "당신은 무엇을 했나요?"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You cannot wait to start living life without all those distracting and "
"conflicting emotions."
msgstr "당신은 산만하고 갈등하는 감정 없이 삶을 살기를 고대할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Its hard to even understand how you used to think.  There's only one thing "
"that makes sense now."
msgstr "예전에는 어떻게 생각했는지조차 이해하기 힘들어요. 지금 이해가 되는 건 단 하나뿐이에요."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"All that information that you didn't used to be able to really handle just "
"got a lot easier to process.  Unfortunately, your prior favorite subject "
"just got a lot more harder to process."
msgstr ""
"예전에는 제대로 다룰 수 없었던 모든 정보가 훨씬 더 쉽게 처리될 수 있게 되었어요. 안타깝게도, 예전에 좋아했던 과목은 훨씬 더 "
"처리하기 어려워졌어요."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "You almost sigh in relief at all the stuff you can get rid of."
msgstr "당신은 제거할 수 있는 모든 물건에 안도감을 느낄 정도입니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Its been so long since you've been alone in your head."
msgstr "당신이 머릿속으로 혼자 있었던 지 너무 오래 됐네요."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Compared to before, you think you can blow through a textbook if you wanted."
msgstr "예전에 비하면, 원한다면 교과서를 다 읽을 수 있다고 생각하게 됐죠."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "No amount of reading assignments will ever get you down."
msgstr "아무리 많은 독서 과제를 해도 낙담할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"Nothing immediately changes, but you do feel like you're less likely to "
"become obsessed with things now."
msgstr "당장은 아무것도 바뀌지 않지만, 이제는 어떤 것에 집착할 가능성이 줄어든 것 같은 느낌이 듭니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly feel that you're less likely to become unhealthily obsessed "
"with things."
msgstr "갑자기 뭔가에 대해 건강에 해로운 강박관념에 빠질 가능성이 낮아졌다고 느낀다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Everything in the past seems just a little clearer."
msgstr "과거의 모든 일이 조금 더 명확해진 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "The past, your skills, really just everything seems so much clearer."
msgstr "과거, 기술, 모든 것이 훨씬 더 명확해 보입니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "You'd love to have a snicker."
msgstr "당신은 웃음을 터뜨리고 싶어할 겁니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "Candy.  Meh."
msgstr "사탕. 으음."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid ""
"A survival guide may be useful information now.  You could see yourself "
"giving it a look."
msgstr "생존 가이드는 지금 유용한 정보가 될 수 있습니다. 여러분도 한번 살펴보시는 게 어떨까요?"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "You cannot wait to curl up with a good book for a couple of hours."
msgstr "몇 시간 동안 좋은 책을 읽으며 웅크리고 있고 싶을 때가 많습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "New ideas seem to piece together normally."
msgstr "새로운 아이디어는 보통 조각조각 모여서 나오는 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "You can piece together new concepts even now."
msgstr "지금도 새로운 개념을 조각해 낼 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
msgid "It just became quicker to sort out your backpack."
msgstr "배낭을 정리하는 것이 더 빨라졌습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in effect in EoC
#. "ACT_PSI_TELEPATH_MENTAL_ENGINEERING_FINISH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effectoncondition/eoc_mental_engineering.json
