#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Dazed"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "Your body twitches under the electrical assault!"
msgstr "당신의 몸은 전기 공격에 경련을 일으킵니다!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_radiation_aura"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "Eerie Glow"
msgstr "섬뜩한 빛"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Eerie Glow"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_ZAP_ENEMIES_INITIATE"
#. ~ Message of spell "afs_electrokinetic_zap_enemies ( [Ψ]Electrical
#. Discharge )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid "Your skin tingles."
msgstr "피부가 따끔거립니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hardened Skin"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "You are more resilient than normal."
msgstr "당신은 보통 사람보다 회복력이 더 강합니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Heightened Reflexes"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are enhancing your speed and senses."
msgstr "당신은 속도와 감각을 향상시키고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_monster_neuro_acceleration"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_monster_neuro_acceleration_enhanced"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "Neuro-Acceleration"
msgstr "신경 가속"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Neuro-Acceleration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "You are enhancing your speed."
msgstr "당신은 속도를 향상시키고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_electrokin_revive_debuff"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "Revivified"
msgstr "부활하다"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_photokinetic_illuminate_enemy"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_photokinetic_illumination"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_photokin_lumination_overload"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_photokin_enemy_light"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_penalty.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Illuminated"
msgstr "조명"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Illuminated"
#. ~ Description of effect type "Moon's Cold Glow"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are glowing slightly."
msgstr "당신은 약간 빛나고 있습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Illuminated"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "A faint glow springs up around you!"
msgstr "당신 주위에서 희미한 빛이 솟아오릅니다!"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Illuminated"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Moon's Cold Glow"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The faint glow around you fades away."
msgstr "당신 주변의 희미한 빛이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Illuminated"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid ""
"You are glowing.  The light is a color you have no name for, a kind of "
"actinic purple-red."
msgstr "당신은 빛나고 있습니다. 그 빛은 당신이 이름을 붙일 수 없는 색깔인데, 일종의 광화학적인 보라빛 붉은색입니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Illuminated"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "A harsh glow springs up around you!"
msgstr "당신 주위로 강렬한 빛이 솟아오릅니다!"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Illuminated"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "The harsh glow around you fades away."
msgstr "당신 주변의 강렬한 빛이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Flame Immunity"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "You are immune to fire."
msgstr "당신은 불에 면역입니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Momentum Alteration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "You are altering the motion of nearby objects in your favor."
msgstr "당신은 주변 물체의 움직임을 당신에게 유리하게 바꾸고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Inertial Barrier"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "A barrier of telekinetic force is protecting you."
msgstr "염력의 장벽이 당신을 보호하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Telepathic Shield"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "You have a shield up to prevent telepathic detection and attack."
msgstr "당신은 텔레파시 감지와 공격을 막기 위한 방패를 가지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_whispering_amalgamation_whispers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "Maddening Whispers"
msgstr "짜증나는 속삭임"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maddening Whispers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid ""
"Your mind is filled with whispers just below the threshold of understanding,"
" making it almost impossible to think."
msgstr "당신의 마음은 이해하기 어려운 속삭임으로 가득 차 있어서 생각하기가 거의 불가능합니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Maddening Whispers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid ""
"A chorus of whispers just below the threshold of understanding fills your "
"mind."
msgstr "이해의 한계 바로 아래에서 속삭임의 합창이 당신의 마음을 채웁니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Maddening Whispers"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "The whispers finally fall silent"
msgstr "속삭임은 마침내 잠잠해졌다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Reactive Displacement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"You will automatically teleport enemies that strike you away from yourself."
msgstr "당신을 공격하는 적은 자동으로 순간이동됩니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warped Strikes"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid ""
"Your melee attacks travel further than the range of your weapons makes it "
"seem like they should."
msgstr "근접 공격은 무기의 사거리보다 더 멀리 날아가는 것처럼 보입니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_riftwalker_teleport"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_portal_storm_teleport"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_penalty.json
msgid "Dimensionally Unstable"
msgstr "차원적으로 불안정함"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dimensionally Unstable"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_penalty.json
msgid "You feel like you're barely part of the world."
msgstr "당신은 마치 세상의 일부인 것 같은 느낌을 받습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Dimensionally Unstable"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_penalty.json
msgid "With a jolt, you feel more solid again."
msgstr "충격을 받으면 다시 더 단단해진 느낌이 듭니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_teleporting_lock"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "Caught in the Angles"
msgstr "각도에 갇히다"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Caught in the Angles"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "The strange, inward force suddenly vanishes."
msgstr "이상하고 내면적인 힘이 갑자기 사라진다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vitakinetic_health_down"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "Feeling Unwell"
msgstr "몸이 좋지 않다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Feeling Unwell"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "You feel weak and shaky."
msgstr "당신은 약하고 몸이 떨리는 것을 느낀다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Feeling Unwell"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Feeling Very Unwell"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Feeling Extremely Unwell"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "The feeling of weakness fades away."
msgstr "약하다는 느낌이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vitakinetic_healing_down"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "Feeling Very Unwell"
msgstr "매우 기분이 좋지 않음"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Feeling Very Unwell"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "You feel fatigued and shaky."
msgstr "피곤하고 몸이 떨립니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vitakinetic_healing_down_super"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "Feeling Extremely Unwell"
msgstr "매우 몸이 좋지 않음"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Feeling Extremely Unwell"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "You feel exhausted and shaky."
msgstr "당신은 지치고 몸이 떨리는 것을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Deteriorating"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "Your skin seems to be slowly crumbling as you watch."
msgstr "당신이 지켜보는 동안 당신의 피부는 천천히 무너져 내리는 듯합니다."

#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "pigeon_aura"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "Blood sample contains noetic steroid particles and pigeon dander."
msgstr "혈액 샘플에서 노에틱 스테로이드 입자와 비둘기 비듬이 검출되었습니다."

#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "pigeon_aura_prep"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_monster.json
msgid "Patient has allergens in blood stream."
msgstr "환자의 혈류에 알레르겐이 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_disease_psionic_drain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Nether-Attunement"
msgstr "네더 조율"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Nether-Attunement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid ""
"You feel a little odd and your control over your powers isn't as sure as it "
"was.  There might be unexpected results of you channeling psionics now."
msgstr ""
"조금 이상한 기분이 들고, 능력 제어도 예전만큼 확실하지 않습니다. 지금 사이오닉 능력을 활용하면 예상치 못한 결과가 나올지도 모릅니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Nether-Attunement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid ""
"You feel a little odd, like you've just awoken from a dream.  All that "
"psionic channeling might have unexpected effects."
msgstr "마치 꿈에서 막 깨어난 것처럼 기분이 좀 이상해요. 그 모든 사이오닉 채널링이 예상치 못한 효과를 가져올지도 몰라요."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Nether-Attunement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid ""
"Your mind thrums with power.  It's intoxicating, but growing increasingly "
"harder to control."
msgstr "당신의 마음은 힘으로 가득 차 있습니다. 황홀하지만, 점점 통제하기 어려워집니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Nether-Attunement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid ""
"Your whole body pulses with a raging torrent of energy.  It's taking almost "
"all of your concentration to hold on."
msgstr "온몸이 맹렬한 에너지의 급류로 고동칩니다. 그 에너지를 붙잡으려면 거의 모든 집중력을 쏟아야 합니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Nether-Attunement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid ""
"You take a deep breath as the strange feelings fade.  You are in full "
"control of your powers once again."
msgstr "이상한 감정이 사라지는 것을 느끼며 심호흡을 합니다. 다시 한번 당신의 능력을 완벽하게 제어할 수 있게 되었습니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Nether-Attunement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid ""
"The constant hum of power fades, just a little.  It's easier to think now."
msgstr "끊임없이 들려오던 힘의 웅웅거림이 아주 조금 잦아든다. 이제 생각하기가 더 수월해졌다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Nether-Attunement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid ""
"The roar of the Nether subsides.  You can finally hear your own thoughts "
"again."
msgstr "네더의 포효가 가라앉는다. 마침내 당신의 생각을 다시 들을 수 있다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "psi_nether_attention"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Observed"
msgstr "관찰됨"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Observed"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid ""
"You have the strong impression that someone, or something, is watching you."
msgstr "당신은 누군가 또는 무언가가 당신을 지켜보고 있다는 강한 느낌을 가지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Observed"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "The endless feeling of being watched finally fades away."
msgstr "끝없는 감시당하는 느낌은 마침내 사라진다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_nether_attunement_raiser"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Nether Conduit"
msgstr "네더 도관"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Nether Conduit"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "The tingling sensation finally vanishes."
msgstr "마침내 따끔거림이 사라졌습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_nether_attunement_attenuation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Nether Attenuation"
msgstr "네더 감쇠"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Nether Attenuation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "You have to work extra hard to draw enough energy to use your powers."
msgstr "당신은 당신의 능력을 사용하기 위해 충분한 에너지를 끌어내기 위해 특별히 열심히 노력해야 합니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Nether Attenuation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Your difficulty in drawing on the Nether fades."
msgstr "네더에서 그림을 그리는 데 어려움이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_nether_attunement_clair_blurred_sight"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_photokin_myopia_overload"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_penalty.json
msgid "Blurred Sight"
msgstr "흐릿한 시야"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Blurred Sight"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Your vision is blurry."
msgstr "시야가 흐릿해요."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Blurred Sight"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Your vision finally clears."
msgstr "마침내 시야가 맑아졌습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_nether_attunement_extra_kcal"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Gnawing Hunger"
msgstr "갉아먹는 배고픔"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Gnawing Hunger"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Whenever you use your powers, your stomach rumbles."
msgstr "당신이 능력을 사용할 때마다 배가 울립니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Gnawing Hunger"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Your stomach finally calms down."
msgstr "당신의 배가 마침내 진정됩니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_nether_attunement_feedback"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "피드백"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Feedback"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "You feel a persistent itching that will not go away."
msgstr "당신은 사라지지 않는 지속적인 가려움을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id
#. "effect_nether_attunement_electrokinetic_power_drain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Power Void"
msgstr "파워 보이드"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Power Void"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Is it cold in here?"
msgstr "여기 추워요?"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Power Void"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "The unearthly chill fades away."
msgstr "기괴한 추위가 사라진다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_nether_attunement_biokinetic_inversion"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Metabolic Inversion"
msgstr "대사 역전"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Metabolic Inversion"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "You're getting pretty hungry and thirsty."
msgstr "당신은 점점 배고프고 목마르게 됩니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Metabolic Inversion"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Your gnawing hunger finally fades away."
msgstr "마침내 당신의 갉아먹는 배고픔이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Short of Breath"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "You're having a hard time getting enough air."
msgstr "충분한 공기를 얻는 데 어려움을 겪고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Short of Breath"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "You finally manage to catch your breath"
msgstr "마침내 숨을 돌릴 수 있게 됐네요"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_nether_attunement_pyrokinetic_fever"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_pyrokin_overload"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_penalty.json
msgid "Feverish"
msgstr "열이 나는"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Feverish"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "Your fever finally breaks."
msgstr "마침내 열이 내립니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hunted"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid ""
"You feel the sensation of watching eyes and see prowling forms out of the "
"corners of your vision.  Using further teleportation powers would be very "
"unwise."
msgstr ""
"마치 눈을 바라보는 듯한 감각이 느껴지고, 시야 구석구석에서 어슬렁거리는 형체들이 보입니다. 순간이동 능력을 더 사용하는 것은 매우 "
"어리석은 일입니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Hunted"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "The prowling forms finally fade away."
msgstr "마침내 돌아다니던 형체들이 사라져 버립니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "effect_nether_attunement_pyrokinetic_fog"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "A roiling fog coalesces out of the surrounding air."
msgstr "주변 공기에서 짙은 안개가 모여든다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "effect_nether_attunement_pyrokinetic_fog"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_nether_attunement.json
msgid "The roiling fog surrounding you dissipates."
msgstr "당신을 둘러싼 흐릿한 안개가 사라집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_electrokinetic_speed_boost_npc"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_electrokinetic_speed_boost"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_npc.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Neuro-Accelerated"
