#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_potions.json
msgid ""
"The concoction's effects fade and you suddenly feel stretched, like "
"something unseen is pulling at you."
msgstr ""
"이 약물의 효과가 사라지고 갑자기 몸이 늘어지는 듯한 느낌이 들며, 보이지 않는 무언가가 당신을 잡아당기는 듯한 느낌이 듭니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_teleport_potion_comedown"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_potions.json
msgid "Blue Elixir Aftereffects"
msgstr "블루 엘릭서 후유증"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vitakin_potion"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_potions.json
msgid "Green Elixir"
msgstr "그린 엘릭서"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Green Elixir"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_potions.json
msgid ""
"The concoction's effects fade and you stagger as you suddenly feel faint."
msgstr "그 혼합물의 효과가 사라지고 갑자기 기절할 것 같은 느낌이 들면서 비틀거립니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vitakin_potion_comedown"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_potions.json
msgid "Green Elixir Aftereffects"
msgstr "그린 엘릭서 후유증"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_noetic_resilience"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_potions.json
msgid "Noetic Resilience"
msgstr "노에틱 회복력"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Noetic Resilience"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_potions.json
msgid "You are fortified against too strong a connection with the Nether."
msgstr "당신은 네더와 너무 강한 관계를 맺지 않도록 강화되었습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Noetic Resilience"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_potions.json
msgid "Your protection against too much connection to the Nether fades away."
msgstr "네더와 지나치게 연결되지 않도록 하는 보호 기능이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_noetic_resilience_comedown"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_potions.json
msgid "Noetically Fragile"
msgstr "지적으로 연약하다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Noetically Fragile"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_potions.json
msgid ""
"Your psionic capacity, and physical stamina, are reduced by the aftereffects"
" of the noetic resilience treatment."
msgstr "당신의 정신적 능력과 신체적 체력은 노에틱 회복력 치료의 후유증으로 인해 감소합니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Noetically Fragile"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_potions.json
msgid "You feel a sudden weakness in your body."
msgstr "갑자기 몸이 약해지는 것을 느낀다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Noetically Fragile"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_potions.json
msgid ""
"You feel your strength and ability to channel your powers finally return to "
"normal."
msgstr "당신은 마침내 자신의 힘과 능력을 정상으로 돌아오는 것을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_psi_intense_concentration"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_afs_psi_intense_concentration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
msgid "Intense Concentration"
msgstr "강렬한 집중"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Intense Concentration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
msgid "It's taking a lot of concentration to maintain your powers."
msgstr "당신의 힘을 유지하려면 많은 집중이 필요합니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_nether_attunement_power_surge"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Power Surge"
msgstr "파워 서지"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Power Surge"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are filled with power!"
msgstr "당신은 힘으로 가득 차 있습니다!"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Enhanced Prowess"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are enhancing your physical prowess."
msgstr "당신은 신체적 능력을 향상시키고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Enhanced Prowess"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The surge of power fades away."
msgstr "힘의 급증은 사라진다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_pkill_1"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Overcoming Minor Pain"
msgstr "사소한 고통 극복하기"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Overcoming Minor Pain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your powers are slightly lessening the pain you feel."
msgstr "당신의 능력은 당신이 느끼는 고통을 약간이나마 덜어주고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Overcoming Minor Pain"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Overcoming Pain"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Overcoming Major Pain"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Overcoming Extreme Pain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your wounds ache once again."
msgstr "당신의 상처는 다시 한번 아프다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Overcoming Minor Pain"
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Overcoming Pain"
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Overcoming Major Pain"
#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Overcoming Extreme Pain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The pain you've been keeping away is starting to creep back in."
msgstr "당신이 억누르고 있던 고통이 다시 찾아오기 시작했습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_pkill_2"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_pkill_3"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Overcoming Pain"
msgstr "고통 극복"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Overcoming Pain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your powers are lessening the pain you feel."
msgstr "당신의 힘은 당신이 느끼는 고통을 줄여줍니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_pkill_4"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_pkill_5"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Overcoming Major Pain"
msgstr "극심한 고통 극복"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Overcoming Major Pain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your powers are greatly lessening the pain you feel."
msgstr "당신의 능력은 당신이 느끼는 고통을 크게 줄여줍니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_pkill_6"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Overcoming Extreme Pain"
msgstr "극심한 고통 극복"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Overcoming Extreme Pain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your powers are enormously lessening the pain you feel."
msgstr "당신의 능력은 당신이 느끼는 고통을 엄청나게 줄여줍니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Oxygen Absorption"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You can absorb oxygen through your skin."
msgstr "피부를 통해 산소를 흡수할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_flexibility"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Flexibility"
msgstr "유연성"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Flexibility"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are enhancing your range of motion."
msgstr "운동 범위가 넓어지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Flexibility"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your joints creak as your limbs lose their flexibility."
msgstr "사지의 유연성이 떨어지면 관절이 삐걱거립니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hardened Skin"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your skin is more resilient thanks to psionic energy."
msgstr "사이오닉 에너지 덕분에 피부의 회복력이 더욱 강화됩니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_climate_control"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Climate Controlled"
msgstr "기후 조절"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Climate Controlled"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are better at dealing with extremes of heat and cold."
msgstr "당신은 극심한 더위와 추위에 더 잘 대처합니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Climate Controlled"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The temperature feels uncomfortable again."
msgstr "온도가 다시 불편하게 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Climate Controlled"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The temperature is really starting to get to you."
msgstr "기온이 정말 오르기 시작하네요."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Climate Controlled"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your adaptation to extreme temperatures is fading."
msgstr "극한 기온에 대한 적응력이 떨어지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_enhance_mobility"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Enhanced Mobility"
msgstr "향상된 이동성"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Enhanced Mobility"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You find it much easier to move in encumbering gear."
msgstr "무거운 장비를 착용하면 움직이는 것이 훨씬 수월해집니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Enhanced Mobility"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your gear suddenly seems to weigh you down."
msgstr "갑자기 당신의 장비가 무거워지는 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hammerhand"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your bare hands substitute for several common tools."
msgstr "여러 가지 흔한 도구를 맨손으로 대체할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Hammerhand"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You're no longer capable of hammering in a nail with your thumb."
msgstr "더 이상 엄지손가락으로 못을 박을 수 없게 되었습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_sealed"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Sealed System"
msgstr "밀폐형 시스템"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sealed System"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are protected from the dangers of the world."
msgstr "당신은 세상의 위험으로부터 보호받습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Sealed System"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You let out your breath in a rush."
msgstr "당신은 서둘러 숨을 내쉬었다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Sealed System"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You need to take a new breath, and soon!"
msgstr "곧 새로운 호흡을 해야 합니다!"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Sealed System"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your lungs are straining with the effort of holding your breath."
msgstr "숨을 참는 데에 노력이 많이 들어가 폐가 힘들어집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_metabolism_enhance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Hyperenhanced Metabolism"
msgstr "과증가된 신진대사"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hyperenhanced Metabolism"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your metabolism is far more efficient than before."
msgstr "당신의 신진대사는 이전보다 훨씬 더 효율적입니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Hyperenhanced Metabolism"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your stomach rumbles."
msgstr "배가 울린다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Combat Dance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are a dynamo of death."
msgstr "당신은 죽음의 원동력입니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Combat Dance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your movements return to normal."
msgstr "움직임이 정상으로 돌아옵니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_guided_evolution_backfire"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Evolving Backfire"
msgstr "진화하는 역화"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Evolving Backfire"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"Your biology is running out of control.  Perhaps extensively drawing on the "
"netherium was a bad idea."
msgstr "네 몸 상태가 통제 불능이 됐어. 네테리움을 잔뜩 끌어다 쓰는 건 나쁜 생각이었나 봐."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Evolving Backfire"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"Netherium energy surges through your cells, changing them in an unknowable "
"way.  Something is about to change."
msgstr "네테리움 에너지가 당신의 세포 속으로 솟구치며 알 수 없는 방식으로 변화합니다. 무언가가 바뀌려 하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Guided Evolution"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"Whenever you mutate, you may pick the resulting mutation from a selection of"
" options."
msgstr "돌연변이를 일으킬 때마다 여러 옵션 중에서 결과 돌연변이를 선택할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Guided Evolution"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are no longer controlling your evolution."
msgstr "당신은 더 이상 자신의 진화를 통제할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Perfected Motion"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You feel like you can outrun a locomotive."
msgstr "마치 기관차보다 빨리 달릴 수 있는 것 같은 기분이 든다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Perfected Motion"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The world returns to normal speed."
msgstr "세상은 정상 속도로 돌아갑니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Perfected Motion"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your movements are slower and slower now."
msgstr "당신의 움직임은 점점 더 느려지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Perfected Motion"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The world begins speeding up around you."
msgstr "당신 주변의 세상이 더욱 빨라지기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_hurricane_blows"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Hurricane Blows"
msgstr "허리케인 강타"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hurricane Blows"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You can attack faster than thought."
msgstr "생각보다 빠르게 공격할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_biokin_vitaminosis"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Vitaminosis"
msgstr "비타민증"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Vitaminosis"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are steadily converting calories into vitamins."
msgstr "당신은 꾸준히 칼로리를 비타민으로 전환하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Heightened Senses"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are enhancing your mundane senses."
msgstr "당신은 평범한 감각을 강화하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_better_senses_pain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Sensory Pain"
msgstr "감각통증"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sensory Pain"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Sensory Pain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your senses are overwhelmed!"
msgstr "당신의 감각은 압도당했습니다!"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Night Eyes"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You can sense your surroundings in the dark."
msgstr "어둠 속에서도 주변 환경을 감지할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Night Eyes"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The darkness hides your surroundings again."
msgstr "어둠이 다시 주변을 감춥니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Speed Reader"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are absorbing knowledge from books like a sponge absorbs water."
msgstr "당신은 스펀지가 물을 흡수하듯이 책에서 지식을 흡수하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Premonition"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are preternaturally aware of nearby movement and possible dangers."
msgstr "당신은 주변의 움직임과 발생할 수 있는 위험을 초자연적으로 감지합니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Premonition"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your preternatural awareness fades."
msgstr "당신의 초자연적인 인식이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Aura Sight"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Swirling colors are visible around others, revealing their emotions."
msgstr "다른 사람 주변에서 소용돌이치는 색깔이 눈에 띄어, 그 사람의 감정을 드러냅니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Aura Sight"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The colors fade away."
msgstr "색깔이 희미해집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_weak_point"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Weaknesses Discerned"
msgstr "약점 식별"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weaknesses Discerned"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your vulnerabilities have been laid open."
msgstr "당신의 취약점이 드러났습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weaknesses Discerned"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You suddenly feel terribly vulnerable."
msgstr "당신은 갑자기 몹시 취약함을 느낀다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Weaknesses Discerned"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You no longer feel so exposed."
msgstr "당신은 더 이상 노출된 느낌을 받지 않습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_ranged_enhance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Dead Aim"
msgstr "데드 에임"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dead Aim"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your powers make aiming much easier for you."
msgstr "당신의 능력 덕분에 조준이 훨씬 쉬워졌습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Dead Aim"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The world lurches as apparent distances snap back into place."
msgstr "세상은 멀어져 가는 것처럼 보였지만, 거리가 다시 제자리로 돌아오면서 세상은 흔들립니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_sense_rads_self"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Sensing Radiation"
msgstr "방사선 감지"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sensing Radiation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You can detect environmental radiation."
msgstr "환경 방사선을 감지할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Sensing Radiation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your radiation sense is gone."
msgstr "당신의 방사선 감각은 사라졌습니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Sensing Radiation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The ambient glow of radiation is almost invisible now."
msgstr "주변의 방사선 빛은 이제 거의 보이지 않습니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Sensing Radiation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your ability to sense radiation is fading."
msgstr "방사선을 감지하는 능력이 약해지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_sense_hostile_creatures"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Sense Hostility"
msgstr "적대감을 느끼다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sense Hostility"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You will know when there's something out there that means you harm."
msgstr "당신에게 해를 끼칠 만한 일이 세상에 있다는 것을 알게 될 것입니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Sense Hostility"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"The sense of dangerous creatures fades away, but you know the danger "
"remains."
msgstr "위험한 생물에 대한 감각은 사라지지만 위험은 여전히 남아 있다는 것을 알고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "moving_creature"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You sense a danger here."
msgstr "여기서 위험을 감지합니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_dodge"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Anticipating Attack"
msgstr "공격 예상"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Anticipating Attack"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You can see your enemies' attacks in advance."
msgstr "적의 공격을 미리 볼 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Anticipating Attack"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The fore-images of your enemies fade away."
msgstr "적의 전면 이미지가 사라집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_craft_bonus"
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Intuitive Artistry"
msgstr "직관적인 예술성"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Intuitive Artistry"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"You just know what you need to do next.  It's harder for you to pay "
"attention to anything else due to the shifting futures, however, and you "
"will lose awareness of the outside world entirely when making something."
msgstr ""
"다음에 무엇을 해야 할지 딱 알죠. 하지만 미래가 바뀌면서 다른 것에 주의를 기울이기가 더 어려워지고, 무언가를 만들다 보면 외부 세계에"
" 대한 인식을 완전히 잃게 될 겁니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_perfect_shot"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "One Perfect Shot"
msgstr "완벽한 한 방"

#. ~ Description of effect type "One Perfect Shot"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Do it.  Take the shot."
msgstr "하세요. 사진을 찍어보세요."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_clear_sight"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Truesight"
msgstr "트루사이트"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Truesight"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your powers allow you to see the true shape of reality."
msgstr "당신의 능력은 현실의 진정한 모습을 볼 수 있게 해줍니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Truesight"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The world seems wrapped in gauze compared to before."
msgstr "전보다 세상이 거즈로 싸여 있는 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_astral_projection"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Astrally Projecting"
msgstr "아스트랄 투사"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Astrally Projecting"
#. ~ Description of effect type "Etheric Form"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your spirit wanders the world."
msgstr "당신의 영혼은 세상을 떠돌아다닙니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_group_tactics_other"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_group_tactics_self"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Prescient Tactics"
msgstr "선견지명 있는 전술"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Prescient Tactics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You're being informed of the best way to fight."
msgstr "당신은 싸우는 가장 좋은 방법을 알고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Prescient Tactics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"You're calling out tactics to your followers.  It's much harder to "
"concentrate on your own defense."
msgstr "팔로워들에게 전략을 외쳐야 하죠. 자기 방어에 집중하는 게 훨씬 더 어려워요."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Prescient Tactics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "As the visions fade, you stop calling out orders."
msgstr "환상이 사라지면서, 당신은 명령을 내리는 것을 멈춥니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_clair_omniscence"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_super_clairvoyance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Omniscience"
msgstr "전지"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Omniscience"
#. ~ Message of spell "clair_omniscience ( [Ψ]Omniscence )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You can see forever."
msgstr "당신은 영원히 볼 수 있어요."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Omniscience"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your senses snap back to your physical body."
msgstr "당신의 감각은 다시 신체로 돌아옵니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Spark Sight"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
msgid "Your powers reveal electrical creatures and robots to you."
msgstr "당신의 능력은 전기 생물과 로봇을 보여줍니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Spark Sight"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
msgid "You can no longer sense the flow of current."
msgstr "더 이상 전류의 흐름을 느낄 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Electrical Discharge"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
msgid "Your body is filled with electrical currents."
msgstr "당신의 몸은 전류로 가득 차 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Electrical Discharge"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
msgid "The tingling on your skin fades."
msgstr "피부의 따끔거림이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Voltaic Strikes"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your melee attacks unleash electrical blasts."
msgstr "근접 공격 시 전기 폭발을 일으킵니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Voltaic Strikes"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your hands no longer spark with electricity."
msgstr "당신의 손은 더 이상 전기로 가득 차지 않습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hacking Interface"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You have constructed an electrical interface to hack nearby devices."
msgstr "근처 장치를 해킹하기 위한 전기 인터페이스를 구축했습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Hacking Interface"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
msgid "You can no longer manipulate the circuitry of nearby devices."
msgstr "더 이상 근처 장치의 회로를 조작할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Electron Overflow"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
msgid "You are generating a wireless aura of electrical power."
msgstr "당신은 무선으로 전기 에너지를 생성하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Electron Overflow"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
msgid "You stop the flow of electricity to your devices."
msgstr "기기에 전기가 흐르는 것을 멈춥니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_electrokin_paralysis"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Neural Spasms"
msgstr "신경 경련"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Neural Spasms"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your muscles are twitching and won't obey you!"
msgstr "근육이 경련을 일으키며 말을 듣지 않아요!"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Neural Spasms"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your spasms stop."
msgstr "경련이 멈춥니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Pain Suppression"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "When it hurts, it won't hurt as much."
msgstr "아플 때는 그렇게 아프지 않을 거예요."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Pain Suppression"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your nerves burn for a moment as a surge of pain hits them."
msgstr "순간적으로 극심한 고통이 몰려오면서 신경이 타오른다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_electrokinetic_pain_immune"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Analgesic Block"
msgstr "진통 차단"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Analgesic Block"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"You can't feel anything.  That means everything is fine, right?  Everything "
"is fine."
msgstr "아무것도 느낄 수 없어요. 그러니까 다 괜찮다는 뜻이잖아요, 그렇죠? 다 괜찮아요."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Analgesic Block"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "All of your pain rushes back in!"
msgstr "모든 고통이 다시 밀려온다!"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Analgesic Block"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your wounds are starting to ache."
msgstr "상처가 아프기 시작했어요."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Analgesic Block"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your wounds sting a bit."
msgstr "상처가 좀 따끔하네요."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Neuro-Accelerated"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are enhancing your nervous system."
msgstr "당신은 신경계를 강화하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Galvanic Aura"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Anyone nearby risks being blasted by lightning."
msgstr "근처에 있는 사람은 번개를 맞을 위험이 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Galvanic Aura"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The thrum in the air around you dissipates."
msgstr "당신 주변의 공기 속의 웅얼거림이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Galvanic Aura"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The crackling aura around you is fading quickly."
msgstr "당신 주변의 딱딱거리는 기운이 빠르게 사라지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Galvanic Aura"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The lightning blasts are growing less powerful."
msgstr "번개의 힘이 약해지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_electrokinetic_lightning_aura_aftershock"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Galvanic Aftershock"
msgstr "갈바닉 여진"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Galvanic Aftershock"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"You still remain immune to the effects of electricity, if only briefly."
msgstr "비록 잠깐이기는 하지만, 당신은 여전히 전기의 영향으로부터 면역이 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_photokin_light_local"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Candle's Light"
msgstr "촛불의 빛"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Candle's Light"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The air above your hand glows faintly."
msgstr "손 위의 공기가 희미하게 빛납니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Candle's Light"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "A faint light springs up over your hand."
msgstr "당신의 손 위로 희미한 빛이 솟아오릅니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Candle's Light"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The glow above your hand fades."
msgstr "손 위의 빛이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Illuminated"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The air around you is glowing."
msgstr "당신 주변의 공기가 빛나고 있습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Illuminated"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are outlined in light."
msgstr "당신은 빛으로 윤곽이 그려져 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Trick of the Light"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"You are surrounded by shifting illusions, and your enemies struggle to see "
"where your true form is."
msgstr "당신은 변화하는 환영에 둘러싸여 있고, 적들은 당신의 진정한 모습이 어디 있는지 파악하기 위해 애쓰고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Trick of the Light"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The illusions around you suddenly vanish!"
msgstr "주변의 환상이 갑자기 사라집니다!"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Chameleoflage"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You bending nearby light to make yourself more difficult to spot."
msgstr "주변 빛을 굴절시켜 자신을 발견하기 어렵게 만듭니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Chameleoflage"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You stop bending light around your location."
msgstr "당신은 당신의 위치 주변으로 빛을 휘게 하는 것을 멈춥니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lucent Barrier"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are protected from extremes of light and radiation."
msgstr "당신은 극한의 빛과 방사선으로부터 보호받습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Lucent Barrier"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The surrounding air shimmers once more as your light barrier fades."
msgstr "빛의 장벽이 사라지면서 주변 공기가 다시 반짝인다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mirror-Mask"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"You're just another survivor.  There's definitely nothing odd about you at "
"all."
msgstr "당신은 그저 또 다른 생존자일 뿐이에요. 당신에게는 이상한 점이 전혀 없어요."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Mirror-Mask"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The illusions around you fall away."
msgstr "당신 주변의 환상은 사라집니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Radio Transception"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You can interpret and transmit radio waves."
msgstr "당신은 전파를 해석하고 전송할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Radio Transception"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You stop paying attention to the radio waves around you."
msgstr "당신은 주변의 전파에 주의를 기울이지 않습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Invisibility"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The obscuring veil of light fades, revealing your presence."
msgstr "빛의 베일이 사라지고 당신의 존재가 드러납니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_photokin_arms"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "refraction of arms"
msgstr "팔의 굴절"

#. ~ Description of effect type "refraction of arms"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"Your arms refract light to create the illusion of having multiple arms and "
"their wielded items."
msgstr "팔이 빛을 굴절시켜 여러 개의 팔과 그 팔로 휘두르는 물품이 있는 듯한 착각을 불러일으킵니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "refraction of arms"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The light around your arms returns to normal."
msgstr "팔 주변의 조명이 정상으로 돌아옵니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "refraction of arms"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your illusionary arms are obviously translucent."
msgstr "당신의 환상적인 팔은 분명히 반투명하네요."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "refraction of arms"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your illusionary arms are losing some of their solid appearance."
msgstr "당신의 환상적인 팔은 견고한 모습을 잃어가고 있습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Blind"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are blinded!"
msgstr "당신은 눈이 멀었습니다!"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Blinding Radiance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are glowing like the sun."
msgstr "당신은 태양처럼 빛나네요."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Blinding Radiance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The last light finally dies."
msgstr "마지막 빛이 마침내 꺼진다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_psi_post_cauterize"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Cauterized"
msgstr "소작하다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cauterized"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"You used your powers to cauterize a wound here.  Whether it worked or not, "
"it still stings terribly."
msgstr "네 능력을 써서 여기 상처를 지져버렸잖아. 효과가 있었든 없었든, 아직도 엄청 따끔거려."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Banked Flames"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "A flame is burning over one of your palms."
msgstr "당신의 손바닥 중 하나 위에 불꽃이 타고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cloak of Warmth"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The air around you has its temperature controlled."
msgstr "주변 공기의 온도는 조절됩니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Incandescent Lance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "A thin beam of searing plasma extends from one finger."
msgstr "뜨거운 플라스마의 얇은 광선이 한 손가락에서 뻗어나온다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Blazing Aura"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are surrounded by flames."
msgstr "당신은 불꽃에 둘러싸여 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Blazing Aura"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The flames surrounding you gutter out."
msgstr "당신을 둘러싼 불꽃이 꺼져간다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_pyrokinetic_aura_damage"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Burning Air"
msgstr "불타는 공기"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Burning Air"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The air is intolerably hot."
msgstr "공기가 참을 수 없을 정도로 더워요."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Burning Air"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The air cools down."
msgstr "공기가 식는다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Flame Immunity"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are completely immune to fire."
msgstr "당신은 불에 전혀 면역입니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Flame Immunity"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are once again vulnerable to fire."
msgstr "당신은 다시 한번 불에 취약해졌습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telekinetic_momentum"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_afs_telekinetic_momentum"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
msgid "Altered Momentum"
msgstr "변화된 모멘텀"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Altered Momentum"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
msgid ""
"Your powers are affecting movement around you; dangerous objects are slowed "
"and your own speed is increased."
msgstr "당신의 능력이 주변의 움직임에 영향을 미칩니다. 위험한 물체의 속도가 느려지고 당신의 속도가 증가합니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Altered Momentum"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
msgid "Nearby movement returns to normal."
msgstr "주변 움직임이 정상으로 돌아옵니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telekinetic_water_walking"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_hedge_walk_on_water_magic_square"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Water-Walking"
msgstr "워터워킹"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Water-Walking"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You can walk over liquids without sinking into them."
msgstr "액체 위로 걸어도 빠지지 않습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Water-Walking"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your feet are firm on the ground."
msgstr "당신의 발은 땅에 굳건히 딛고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Slowfall"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The ground isn't as eager to receive you."
msgstr "땅은 당신을 기꺼이 받아들이지 않습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Slowfall"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You suddenly feel much heavier."
msgstr "갑자기 몸이 훨씬 무거워진 느낌이 듭니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lifting Field"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You can hover a single item nearby, at the ready."
msgstr "필요한 항목 하나를 근처에 놓으면 됩니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Lifting Field"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your lifting field dissipates."
msgstr "당신의 리프팅 필드가 사라집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telekinetic_strength"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Telekinetic Strength"
msgstr "텔레키네틱 힘"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Telekinetic Strength"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are greatly enhancing your ability to lift and break things."
msgstr "당신은 물건을 들어올리고 부수는 능력을 크게 향상시키고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Telekinetic Strength"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The force supporting your muscles suddenly vanishes."
msgstr "근육을 지탱하던 힘이 갑자기 사라집니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Inertial Barrier"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The barrier of force around you falls apart."
msgstr "당신 주변의 힘의 장벽이 무너집니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Levitation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are floating in defiance of gravity."
msgstr "당신은 중력에 반하여 떠다니고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Levitation"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Smoke-Walking"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Wind-Walking"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your feet touch the ground once again."
msgstr "당신의 발은 다시 한번 땅을 짚습니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Levitation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are sinking despite your best efforts."
msgstr "당신은 최선을 다했지만 가라앉고 있습니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Levitation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You wobble briefly downward before recovering."
msgstr "잠시 아래로 흔들린 후 회복합니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telekinetic_aegis"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Aegis"
msgstr "보호"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Aegis"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are nearly invincible."
msgstr "당신은 거의 무적입니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Aegis"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The air loses its structure and you are vulnerable once again."
msgstr "공기는 구조를 잃고 당신은 다시 취약해집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telepathic_learning_bonus"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Trance State"
msgstr "트랜스 상태"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Trance State"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are in a focused mental state, increasing the ease of learning."
msgstr "당신은 집중된 정신 상태에 있으며, 이는 학습의 용이성을 증가시킵니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Trance State"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You shake your head as you become aware of the outside world again."
msgstr "당신은 다시 바깥 세상을 의식하게 되면서 고개를 저었습니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Trance State"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your enhanced concentration is fading like a dream."
msgstr "당신의 집중력은 꿈처럼 사라지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Trance State"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The outside world is impinging itself on your awareness."
msgstr "외부 세계가 당신의 의식에 영향을 미치고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telepath_sense_minds"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_afs_telepath_sense_minds"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/obsoletion/effects.json
msgid "Sensing Minds"
msgstr "감각하는 마음"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sensing Minds"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/obsoletion/effects.json
msgid "You are looking out for other minds."
msgstr "당신은 다른 마음을 찾고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Sensing Minds"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/obsoletion/effects.json
msgid "Your awareness of other minds fades away."
msgstr "다른 사람의 마음에 대한 인식이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "sense_minds"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
msgid "You sense something sapient here."
msgstr "여기서 당신은 뭔가 지적인 것을 느낀다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telepath_mesmerize_tracker"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_hypnotism"
#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lilin_mesmerize_tracker"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Mesmerized"
msgstr "매료되다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mesmerized"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are in a daze."
msgstr "당신은 멍한 상태에 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Mesmerized"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You snap out of your trance."
msgstr "당신은 황홀경에서 깨어납니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telepathic_morale"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Stabilized Mood"
msgstr "안정된 기분"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stabilized Mood"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"You are editing out your most negative thoughts.  When you think about it, "
"is the Cataclysm really the worst thing that could have happened?"
msgstr "가장 부정적인 생각들을 삭제하고 있는 겁니다. 생각해 보면, 대격변이 정말 일어날 수 있는 최악의 사건이었을까요?"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Stabilized Mood"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You let your thoughts return to their normal flow."
msgstr "당신은 생각이 다시 정상적인 흐름으로 흐르도록 둡니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "telepathic_ignorance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Ignorance"
msgstr "무지"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Ignorance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You're positive that no one is there."
msgstr "당신은 거기에 아무도 없다고 확신합니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Ignorance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Wait a minute, there *is* someone there!"
msgstr "잠깐만요, 거기 누군가 *있어요*!"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Telepathic Shield"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/obsoletion/effects.json
msgid "Your mind is warded against telepathic attack or detection."
msgstr "당신의 정신은 텔레파시 공격이나 감지로부터 보호됩니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Telepathic Shield"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/effects_esper.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/obsoletion/effects.json
msgid "Your thoughts are once again unguarded."
msgstr "당신의 생각은 다시 한번 방심하게 됩니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telepathic_primal_terror"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Terrorized"
msgstr "공포에 질리다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Terrorized"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are overcome with overwhelming dread."
msgstr "당신은 엄청난 공포에 휩싸입니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Terrorized"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your heart races as a sudden feeling of dread grips you."
msgstr "갑자기 공포감이 밀려오면서 심장이 쿵쾅거립니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Terrorized"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The heart-freezing terror fades as suddenly as it began."
msgstr "가슴을 얼어붙게 하는 공포는 시작했던 것처럼 갑자기 사라진다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_telepath_network_effect"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Telepathic Network"
msgstr "텔레파시 네트워크"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Telepathic Network"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"You are in constant communication with your allies, looking out for each "
"other in combat."
msgstr "당신은 동맹군과 끊임없이 소통하며 전투에서 서로를 돕습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Telepathic Network"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Silence fills your mind."
msgstr "고요함이 당신의 마음을 채웁니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Telepathic Network"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The inner voices of your allies are only a whisper now."
msgstr "당신 동맹의 내면의 목소리는 이제 단지 속삭임일 뿐입니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Telepathic Network"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The inner voices of your allies begin to fade."
msgstr "동맹국의 내면의 목소리가 사라지기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Ephemeral Walk"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"You exist slightly outside of baseline reality, allowing you to effortlessly"
" walk through solid matter."
msgstr "당신은 기준 현실에서 약간 벗어난 곳에 존재하기 때문에 고체 물질 속을 아무런 노력 없이 걸을 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Ephemeral Walk"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Reactive Displacement"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The surrounding matter feels real again."
msgstr "주변의 물질이 다시 현실적으로 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Loci Establishment"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"You are concentrating on your locus.  You can teleport there at will with "
"the [Ψ]Loci Technique."
msgstr "당신은 자신의 위치에 집중하고 있습니다. [Ψ]Loci 기술을 사용하면 원하는 대로 그곳으로 순간이동할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Loci Establishment"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You've forgotten your locus!"
msgstr "당신은 위치를 잊어버렸어요!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_teleport_slow"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Stutterstepping"
msgstr "스터터스테핑"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stutterstepping"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your steps aren't taking you as far as your eyes tell you they should."
msgstr "당신의 발걸음은 눈이 말하는 만큼 멀리 가지 않습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Stutterstepping"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The air ripples and you stumble."
msgstr "공기가 흔들리고 당신은 비틀거린다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Stutterstepping"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your eyes and your legs agree with each other again."
msgstr "당신의 눈과 다리가 다시 일치합니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extended Stride"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Every step takes you further than your eyes tell you it should."
msgstr "한 걸음 한 걸음이 눈으로 보는 것보다 더 멀리까지 당신을 데려갑니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Extended Stride"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Muffled"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your steps are normal once again."
msgstr "당신의 걸음걸이는 다시 정상화되었습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warped Strikes"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"Your melee attacks extend much further than would normally be possible."
msgstr "근접 공격은 일반적으로 가능한 것보다 훨씬 더 멀리까지 확장됩니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Warped Strikes"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your reach goes back to normal."
msgstr "도달 범위가 정상으로 돌아왔습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Flickerflash Stance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"Through constant teleports and warping of space, your combat prowess is "
"increased."
msgstr "끊임없는 순간이동과 공간 왜곡을 통해 전투력이 향상됩니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Flickerflash Stance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your constant teleporting slows to a stop."
msgstr "당신의 끊임없는 순간이동이 멈춥니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Coagulation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "For just a moment, you feel your blood rushing through your veins."
msgstr "잠시 동안, 당신은 혈관 속의 피가 흐르는 것을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Coagulation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You bleed much less than normal and sometimes not at all."
msgstr "평소보다 출혈이 훨씬 적거나 전혀 없을 때도 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Healthy Glow"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You feel amazing."
msgstr "기분이 정말 좋아지네요."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Healthy Glow"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "The surge of vitality leaves you in a rush."
msgstr "활력의 급증으로 당신은 서두르게 됩니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Leukocyte Accumulation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is receiving the bulk of your body's healing resources."
msgstr "%s는 신체의 치유 자원 대부분을 받고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Leukocyte Accumulation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You stop concentrating your healing."
msgstr "당신은 치유에 집중하지 않습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vita_cure_disease"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Immunostimulated"
msgstr "면역 자극"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Immunostimulated"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"You are not going to get sick.  You absolutely refuse.  And if you do, "
"you're going to get better."
msgstr "당신은 아프지 않을 거예요. 절대 안 그럴 거예요. 그리고 아프더라도 괜찮아질 거예요."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vitakin_healing_trance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Revitalizing Meditation"
msgstr "활력을 되찾는 명상"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Revitalizing Meditation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Thanks to your meditations you are healing much more quickly"
msgstr "명상 덕분에 당신은 훨씬 더 빨리 치유되고 있습니다"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vitakin_hurt"
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
msgid "Enervating Touch"
msgstr "무기력한 터치"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vitakin_purge_rads"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Radiation Purge"
msgstr "방사선 퍼지"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Radiation Purge"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are using your powers to cleanse yourself of radiation."
msgstr "당신은 자신의 능력을 이용해 방사능을 정화하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vitakin_purge_rads_sideeffects"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Radiation Purge Side Effects"
msgstr "방사선 제거 부작용"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Radiation Purge Side Effects"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"You are using your powers to cleanse yourself of radiation, but there are "
"some side effects."
msgstr "당신은 자신의 능력을 이용해 방사선을 정화하고 있지만, 몇 가지 부작용이 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Anabolic Rejuvenation"
#. ~ Description of effect type "effect_vita_super_heal_return_from_death"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You are healing extraordinarily quickly."
msgstr "놀라울 정도로 빨리 회복되고 있어요."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Anabolic Rejuvenation"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "effect_vita_super_heal_return_from_death"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Your body aches as your preternatural healing slows to a stop."
msgstr "초자연적인 치유가 느려지면서 몸이 아프다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vita_degenerating_touch"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Degenerating"
msgstr "퇴화하다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Degenerating"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "You flesh is withering and decaying!"
msgstr "너의 살은 시들어 썩어가고 있구나!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vita_super_heal_pain_allayed"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid "Overflowing Vitality"
msgstr "넘치는 활력"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Overflowing Vitality"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"The energy of your accelerated resuscitation is preventing you from feeling "
"the pain you obviously should be, for the moment."
msgstr "당신이 지금 당장 느껴야 할 고통을, 가속 소생술의 에너지 때문에 느끼지 못하게 막고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Accelerated Resuscitation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_psionic.json
msgid ""
"If you suffer potentially-fatal damage, your powers will attempt to save "
"you."
msgstr "만약 당신이 치명적인 피해를 입으면, 당신의 힘은 당신을 구하려고 할 것입니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id
#. "effect_scenario_heart_of_fire_awake_attunement_gain"
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/scenario.json
msgid "Heart of Fire"
msgstr "불타오르는 심장"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Heart of Fire"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
msgid ""
"The flames in your heart have kindled, fueling a connection to the Nether.  "
"Your Nether Attunement will not reduce with time."
msgstr "당신의 마음속 불꽃이 타올라 네더와의 연결에 불을 지폈습니다. 네더 조율은 시간이 지나도 약해지지 않습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id
#. "effect_scenario_heart_of_fire_asleep_attunement_gain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
msgid "Heart of Cinders"
msgstr "재의 심장"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Heart of Cinders"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
msgid ""
"The flames in your heart smolder, maintaining your connection to the Nether."
"  Your Nether Attunement will reduce with time, but more slowly."
msgstr ""
"당신의 가슴 속 불꽃이 타오르며 네더와의 연결을 유지합니다. 네더 조율은 시간이 지남에 따라 감소하지만, 그 속도는 더 느립니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_scenario_heart_of_fire_need_to_channel"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
msgid "Let the Fire Burn"
msgstr "불을 타오르게 하세요"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Let the Fire Burn"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
msgid "The power twists inside you.  Let it out.  Let the flames rise."
msgstr "당신 안에서 힘이 뒤틀립니다. 그것을 풀어주세요. 불꽃이 치솟게 하세요."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Let the Fire Burn"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
msgid "A fire burns within you."
msgstr "당신 안에서 불이 타오릅니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_scenario_heart_of_fire_damage"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
msgid "Inner Blaze"
msgstr "이너 블레이즈"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_scenario_heart_of_fire_damage"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
msgid "Inner Inferno"
msgstr "내면의 지옥"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Inner Blaze, Inner Inferno"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
msgid "You feel far too warm."
msgstr "너무 따뜻하다고 느껴져요."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Inner Blaze, Inner Inferno"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
msgid "You feel far, far too warm."
msgstr "당신은 너무나 따뜻함을 느낀다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Inner Blaze, Inner Inferno"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/effects/effects_scenario.json
msgid "You are burning up!"
msgstr "당신은 불타고 있어요!"

#. ~ Description of creature revealed by special vision "moving_creature"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/enchantments/enchantment_bionic.json
msgid "You sense a hostile target here."
msgstr "여기서 적대적인 표적을 감지합니다."

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/enchantments/enchantment_item.json
msgid "Targeting assistance"
msgstr "타겟팅 지원"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Targeting assistance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/enchantments/enchantment_item.json
msgid ""
"Your gear relays targeting data to your weapons, reducing dispersion by 25%."
msgstr "장비는 무기에 조준 데이터를 전달하여 분산을 25% 줄여줍니다."

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/appliance_lighting.json
msgid "standing matrix lamp"
msgstr "스탠딩 매트릭스 램프"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "standing matrix lamp"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/appliance_lighting.json
msgid "An lamp enhanced with matrix technology."
msgstr "매트릭스 기술로 강화된 램프."

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/appliance_misc.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/medical.json
msgid "noetic resonance detector"
msgid_plural "noetic resonance detectors"
msgstr[0] "누에틱 공명 탐지기"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "noetic resonance detector"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/appliance_misc.json
msgid ""
"A strange device, a bit like one of those eyesight testing machines you look"
" into in an optometrist's office.  The main housing has a place to rest your"
" chin and a pair of binocular-like tubes, but there is also a headband "
"attached to a set of wires hanging from a hook on the side and an armband "
"hanging from the other side.  It's supposed to be used for measuring your "
"\"noetic potential\"."
msgstr ""
"검안소에서 흔히 볼 수 있는 시력 검사기와 비슷한 이상한 장치입니다. 본체에는 턱을 올려놓는 공간과 쌍안경처럼 생긴 튜브 한 쌍이 있고,"
" 측면 고리에 와이어가 달린 머리띠와 반대쪽에는 암밴드가 달려 있습니다. \"노에틱 잠재력\"을 측정하는 데 사용된다고 합니다."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid "Transporter Beacon"
msgstr "트랜스포터 비콘"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Transporter Beacon"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A transporter beacon, placed on the ground with a stable set of coordinates."
"  (e)xamine to finish the setup."
msgstr "안정적인 좌표 집합을 갖춘 지상에 설치된 전송 비콘입니다. (e)조사하여 설정을 완료합니다."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid "telepathic amplifier"
msgstr "텔레파시 증폭기"

#. ~ Description of furniture "telepathic amplifier"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A bulky machine with a chair and a hat-like mechanism designed to fit over "
"the wearer's head, like something you would find in a hair salon.  You have "
"no idea how to operate it, but you could scavenge it for parts."
msgstr ""
"의자와 모자 같은 장치가 달린 덩치 큰 기계. 마치 미용실에서 볼 법한, 착용자의 머리에 씌우도록 설계되었다. 작동법은 전혀 모르지만, "
"부품을 찾아낼 수는 있을 것이다."

#. ~ Description of furniture "noetic resonance detector"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A table and chair topped with what looks like something you'd seen in an "
"optometrist's office for testing vision, except this also has a headband and"
" an armband hanging off the side connected to the main apparatus by cables."
"  There is a full-sized keyboard and several dials on the opposite side from"
" the chair where the subject is supposed to sit; without a set of "
"instructions, you'd have no idea how to operate this."
msgstr ""
"테이블과 의자 위에는 시력 검사실에서 봤던 것처럼 보이는 것이 놓여 있는데, 측면에는 헤드밴드와 암밴드가 달려 있고, 케이블로 본체와 "
"연결되어 있습니다. 피험자가 앉아야 할 의자 반대편에는 풀사이즈 키보드와 여러 개의 다이얼이 있습니다. 설명서가 없으면 어떻게 작동하는지"
" 전혀 알 수 없을 겁니다."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid "portal stabilizer"
msgstr "문맥 안정제"

#. ~ Description of furniture "portal stabilizer"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A strange machine that looks a little like a large gyroscope.  Multiple "
"concentric rings are built around a central matrix crystal, all connected to"
" an antenna.  How it was used is unclear, since there doesn't seem to be a "
"keyboard or any input device."
msgstr ""
"커다란 자이로스코프처럼 생긴 이상한 기계입니다. 중앙의 매트릭스 크리스털 주위에 여러 개의 동심원이 형성되어 있으며, 모두 안테나에 "
"연결되어 있습니다. 키보드나 입력 장치가 없어 어떻게 사용되었는지는 불분명합니다."

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/terrain.json
msgid "glowing crystal"
msgstr "빛나는 수정"

#. ~ Description of furniture "glowing crystal"
#. ~ Description of terrain "glowing crystal"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/obsolete/terrain.json
msgid ""
"An irregular chunk of glowing crystal.  The fitful glow sheds no "
"illumination on the nearby terrain."
msgstr "불규칙하게 빛나는 수정 덩어리. 불규칙하게 빛나는 빛은 주변 지형을 비추지 않는다."

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alien_meadow.json
msgid "alien plant"
msgstr "외래 식물"

#. ~ Description of furniture "alien plant"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An alien plant, a knee-high tightly-coiled bundle of reddish-yellow stalks "
"with jagged leaves extending every which way.  It looks very difficult to "
"walk through."
msgstr ""
"외래 식물. 무릎 높이까지 자라는 붉은빛이 도는 노란색 줄기가 촘촘히 꼬여 있고, 뾰족한 잎들이 사방으로 뻗어 있는, 마치 덩굴식물 "
"같았다. 걸어 들어가기가 매우 어려워 보였다."

#. ~ Description of furniture "alien plant"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An alien plant, a collection of delicate bluish-white strands with small "
"white globes along their length.  They seem to float almost like seaweed, "
"despite being a terrestrial plant."
msgstr ""
"외래 식물. 섬세한 청백색 가닥들이 모여 있고, 그 길이를 따라 작고 하얀 공 모양 돌기가 나 있다. 육지 식물임에도 불구하고 마치 "
"해초처럼 떠다니는 듯하다."

#. ~ Description of furniture "alien plant"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An alien plant, a single, cylindrical dark-red trunk with a small cluster of"
" leaves on top.  It makes a hollow sound when struck."
msgstr "외래종 식물. 짙은 붉은색 원통형 줄기 하나에 작은 잎들이 뭉쳐 있는 형태입니다. 두드리면 텅 빈 소리가 납니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid "black stone"
msgstr "검은 돌"

#. ~ Description of terrain "black stone"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid ""
"A perfectly smooth patch of black stone, like carved and polished obsidian."
msgstr "완벽하게 매끄러운 검은 돌 조각은 마치 조각하고 윤이 난 흑요석과 같습니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid "black water"
msgstr "검은 물"

#. ~ Description of terrain "black water"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid ""
"An expanse of some sort of black liquid.  The air nearby is chill, and its "
"surface is perfectly smooth and undisturbed by ripples or wind.  You have no"
" idea how deep it is."
msgstr ""
"뭔가 검은 액체가 넓게 퍼져 있습니다. 주변 공기는 차갑고, 표면은 잔물결이나 바람에 흔들리지 않고 매끈합니다. 얼마나 깊은지 상상도 할"
" 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien grass"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid ""
"An area of something that almost looks like grass.  The blades are rolled up"
" into curls, similar to ferns, but they seem to all unroll at once and then "
"roll up again in a steady pattern.  They're a color you can only describe as"
" \"purplish-yellow\"."
msgstr ""
"마치 풀처럼 보이는 부분. 잎들이 고사리처럼 말려 올라가 있는데, 마치 한꺼번에 펼쳐졌다가 다시 일정한 패턴으로 말려 올라가는 것 "
"같습니다. \"보라빛이 도는 노란색\"이라고밖에 표현할 수 없는 색깔입니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien grass"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid ""
"An area of something that almost looks like grass.  The blades are less than"
" an inch high and a blue so dark it's almost black.  When you look closer, "
"many blades seemed to be fused together at the top, forming small clusters."
msgstr ""
"마치 풀처럼 보이는 부분. 잎은 2.5cm도 안 되고, 푸른색은 거의 검은색에 가까울 정도로 어둡습니다. 자세히 보니, 윗부분에서 여러 "
"개의 잎이 서로 뭉쳐 작은 덩어리를 이루고 있는 것 같았습니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien grass"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid ""
"An area of something that almost looks like grass.  It's the familiar green "
"of terrestrial grass, but each blade has a large pink bulb at the top that "
"bobs and moves in the breeze."
msgstr ""
"마치 풀처럼 보이는 부분. 육지 풀의 익숙한 녹색이지만, 각 풀잎 꼭대기에는 커다란 분홍색 전구가 있어 바람에 흔들리고 있습니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid "alien vines"
msgstr "외계 덩굴"

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien vines"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid ""
"An area of something that almost looks like vines, or perhaps tree roots.  A"
" thick ropy cluster of white tendrils streaked with red, twining around each"
" other and branching off in all directions before meeting up in new "
"clusters.  Sometimes, one of the vines twitches."
msgstr ""
"마치 덩굴이나 나무뿌리처럼 보이는 무언가가 있는 곳. 붉은 줄무늬가 있는 하얀 덩굴손이 굵고 끈처럼 뭉쳐져 서로 얽히고설키며 사방으로 "
"뻗어 나가 새 덩굴손으로 모여든다. 가끔 덩굴손 중 하나가 꿈틀거린다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid "alien moss"
msgstr "외계 이끼"

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien moss"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid ""
"An area of something that almost looks like moss.  It's a pale bluish color "
"and clumps of it seem to be very slowly moving across the ground."
msgstr ""
"이끼처럼 보이는 무언가가 있는 구역입니다. 옅은 푸른색을 띠고, 이끼 덩어리가 땅 위를 아주 천천히 움직이는 것처럼 보입니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien moss"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid ""
"An area of something that almost looks like moss.  It's close to an inch "
"thick, a dark yellowish-red, and glistens wetly."
msgstr "마치 이끼처럼 보이는 무언가가 있는 부분입니다. 두께는 약 2.5cm 정도이고, 짙은 황적색이며, 축축하게 반짝입니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid "alien tree"
msgstr "외계 나무"

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid ""
"A short tree, or something that's vaguely shaped like one.  It has long, "
"needle-like leaves that twitch rhythmically and its dark reddish-purple "
"bark(?) has a scale-like pattern, with glowing nodules irregularly spaced "
"along its trunk.  Bluish-green globules hang from the end of some of the "
"branches."
msgstr ""
"키가 작은 나무, 혹은 어렴풋이 나무와 비슷한 모양. 길고 바늘처럼 생긴 잎들이 리드미컬하게 흔들리고, 짙은 적자색 나무껍질(?)에는 "
"비늘 무늬가 있고, 줄기를 따라 빛나는 혹들이 불규칙하게 나 있다. 몇몇 가지 끝에는 청록색 작은 공들이 매달려 있다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid ""
"A tall alien plant.  It has long, needle-like leaves that twitch "
"rhythmically and its dark reddish-purple bark(?) has a scale-like pattern, "
"with glowing nodules irregularly spaced along its trunk."
msgstr ""
"키가 큰 외래 식물입니다. 바늘처럼 길고 긴 잎이 리드미컬하게 흔들리고, 짙은 적자색 나무껍질(?)에는 비늘 무늬가 있고, 줄기를 따라 "
"빛나는 혹들이 불규칙하게 배열되어 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid ""
"A tall, thin alien plant.  From a distance it seems more like a column than "
"a tree, but when you get closer you can see that it's made up of a series of"
" broad, serrated leaves all folded so closely together that they form a "
"single stalk."
msgstr ""
"키가 크고 가느다란 외계 식물입니다. 멀리서 보면 나무라기보다는 기둥처럼 보이지만, 가까이 다가가 보면 넓고 톱니 모양의 잎들이 서로 "
"촘촘히 접혀 하나의 줄기를 이루고 있는 것을 알 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien.json
msgid ""
"A large alien plant.  It looks like a series of bulbous mushrooms that have "
"all grown together at the base, rising into a flaring series of branches "
"that curve up before hanging down and ending in reddish-brown spheres."
msgstr ""
"커다란 외래종 식물입니다. 마치 뿌리 부분에서 모두 함께 자라난 구근 버섯처럼 생겼는데, 가지가 활짝 핀 듯 위로 휘어져 아래로 "
"늘어지면서 붉은 갈색 공 모양으로 끝납니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien grass"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An area of something that vaguely resembles grass, except it's a light "
"reddish color and the stalks are much broader.  Some kind of waxy residue "
"seems to rub off onto your clothes when you walk through it."
msgstr ""
"풀과 어렴풋이 닮은 무언가의 영역인데, 색깔은 연한 붉은색이고 줄기가 훨씬 넓습니다. 그 위를 걸으면 어떤 종류의 왁스 같은 잔여물이 "
"옷에 묻어나는 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid "long alien grass"
msgstr "긴 외계 풀"

#. ~ Description of terrain "long alien grass"
#. ~ Description of terrain "tall alien grass"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An area of something that vaguely resembles grass.  Dark red in color and "
"almost waist-high, each stalk splits into two to four other stalks which "
"similarly split on various places along their length, ending in fine fern-"
"like fronds."
msgstr ""
"풀과 어렴풋이 닮은 무언가의 영역. 짙은 붉은색에 거의 허리 높이까지 자라는 줄기는 두 개에서 네 개로 갈라지고, 이 줄기들도 길이를 "
"따라 여러 군데에서 갈라져 고사리 같은 가는 잎으로 끝납니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid "tall alien grass"
msgstr "키 큰 외래종 풀"

#. ~ Description of terrain "tall alien grass"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An area of something that vaguely resembles grass.  Head high and such a "
"dark red as to be nearly black, the ends of the long stalks are a burst of "
"fine fronds all tangled into and around each other, forming a canopy."
msgstr ""
"풀과 어렴풋이 닮은 무언가가 있는 지역. 머리 높이까지 자라며 거의 검은색에 가까운 짙은 붉은색을 띠고, 긴 줄기 끝은 가느다란 잎들이 "
"서로 얽히고설켜 지붕처럼 솟아 있다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid "alien bush"
msgstr "외계 덤불"

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien bush"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An alien plant, dark blue-green in color.  The leaves are all interwoven, "
"forming a sphere except for spots where the leaves have been eaten away by "
"some predator or pathogen.  It glows faintly in the dark."
msgstr ""
"외래 식물로, 짙은 청록색을 띱니다. 잎들이 서로 얽혀 구형을 이루지만, 포식자나 병원균에 갉아먹힌 부분만 남습니다. 어둠 속에서 "
"희미하게 빛납니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien bush"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An alien bush, but one that looks very similar to a terrestrial bush despite"
" the dark purple leaves.  There are even clusters of white berries growing "
"from it."
msgstr "외래종 관목이지만, 짙은 보라색 잎을 제외하면 육지 관목과 매우 흡사합니다. 심지어 하얀 열매가 송이 맺혀 있기도 합니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien bush"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An alien bush, but one that looks very similar to a terrestrial bush despite"
" the dark purple leaves."
msgstr "외래종 관목이지만, 짙은 보라색 잎을 가지고 있음에도 불구하고 지구상의 관목과 매우 비슷해 보입니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid "alien shrub"
msgstr "외래 관목"

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien shrub"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An alien plant.  The branches split and split again into very fine tendrils "
"with bulbs on the end that float upward, holding its yellow leaves(?) up to "
"the sun.  Every gust of wind makes the entire plant sway."
msgstr ""
"외래 식물. 가지가 갈라지고 또 갈라져 아주 가는 덩굴손을 이루는데, 끝에는 구근이 달려 위로 솟아올라 노란 잎(?)을 햇빛을 향해 뻗고"
" 있습니다. 바람이 불 때마다 식물 전체가 흔들립니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An alien tree, a group of individual dark-colored trunks that intertwine to "
"the point whether you can't tell whether it's a single plant or a group of "
"them.  The branches have nodes of dark red leaves interspersed along their "
"lengths.  You're not entirely sure it's moving with the wind."
msgstr ""
"외계 나무, 짙은 색 줄기들이 얽혀 마치 한 그루인지 여러 그루인지 분간하기 어려울 정도로 빽빽하게 서 있는 모습. 가지에는 짙은 붉은색"
" 잎들이 마디마다 흩어져 있다. 바람에 흔들리는지도 확실하지 않다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An alien tree, looking vaguely like a willow with yellow leaves.  As you "
"look more closely, you see that the branches that touch the ground have put "
"down roots and are forming secondary trunks."
msgstr ""
"노란 잎을 가진 버드나무처럼 보이는 외계 나무. 자세히 보니 땅에 닿은 가지들이 뿌리를 내리고 2차 줄기를 형성하고 있는 것이 보입니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An alien tree, with the trunk lifted off the ground on a cluster of roots.  "
"Giant dark-red globes the size of watermelons hang from its branches amidst "
"clusters of dark-red leaves."
msgstr ""
"뿌리가 뭉쳐 땅에서 줄기가 솟아 있는 외계 나무. 수박만 한 거대한 짙은 붉은색 구체가 짙은 붉은색 잎사귀들 사이로 가지에 매달려 있다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An alien tree, with the trunk lifted off the ground on a cluster of roots.  "
"The branches have clusters of long, dark-red leaves."
msgstr "뿌리가 땅에서 뭉쳐나온 듯한 외계 나무. 가지에는 길고 짙은 붉은색 잎들이 뭉쳐 있다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien tree"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"An alien tree, a group of thick dark-colored trunks half-fused together.  "
"The drooping branches have nodes of dark red leaves interspersed along their"
" lengths.  You're not entirely sure it's moving with the wind."
msgstr ""
"외계 나무, 짙은 색의 두꺼운 줄기들이 반쯤 합쳐진 모습. 축 늘어진 가지에는 짙은 붉은색 잎들이 마디마다 흩어져 있다. 바람에 "
"흔들리는지도 확실하지 않다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "alien roots"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"A cluster of dark roots from an alien tree are visible here.  Did one of "
"them just move?"
msgstr "외계 나무의 검은 뿌리들이 여기 보입니다. 방금 그 중 하나가 움직인 걸까요?"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid "strange pool"
msgstr "이상한 수영장"

#. ~ Description of terrain "strange pool"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_alien_meadow.json
msgid ""
"A pool of some very thick, nearly-opaque liquid.  The surface is almost "
"perfectly smooth."
msgstr "아주 걸쭉하고 거의 불투명한 액체가 고여 있습니다. 표면은 거의 완벽하게 매끄럽습니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "oak tree"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"A massive deciduous tree belonging to the 'Quercus' genus, commonly found "
"throughout the New England region.  If you look closely, you can see some "
"acorns the squirrels haven't gotten yet.  If you look near the top, you can "
"see a gigantic birds nest.  There are large bones sticking out of the edges "
"of the nest."
msgstr ""
"'Quercus' 속에 속하는 거대한 낙엽수로, 뉴잉글랜드 지역 전역에서 흔히 볼 수 있습니다. 자세히 보면 다람쥐들이 아직 먹지 못한 "
"도토리가 보입니다. 꼭대기 부근을 보면 거대한 새 둥지가 보입니다. 둥지 가장자리로 커다란 뼈들이 튀어나와 있습니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_tanks.json
msgid "Osiris chamber"
msgstr "오시리스의 방"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Osiris chamber"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_tanks.json
msgid ""
"A vat full of faintly-glowing solution, large enough to hold an adult human "
"with room to spare.  It was obviously used for some kind of scientific "
"experiments, and, based on the glowing lights on the base and the still-"
"active computer terminal next to it, could be used for such again."
msgstr ""
"희미하게 빛나는 용액이 가득 담긴 통. 성인 한 명이 들어갈 만큼 크고 넉넉했다. 분명 어떤 과학 실험에 사용되었을 것 같았고, "
"받침대에서 빛나는 불빛과 그 옆에 있는 컴퓨터 단말기가 여전히 작동하는 것으로 보아, 그런 용도로 다시 사용될 가능성이 있었다."

#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/ammo.json
msgid "Pulse rifle charge"
msgstr "펄스 소총 충전"

#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/ammo.json
msgid "matrix charge"
msgid_plural "matrix charge"
msgstr[0] "매트릭스 전력"

#. ~ Name of an ammunition type
#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/ammo.json
msgid "noetic energy"
msgid_plural "noetic energy"
msgstr[0] "지식 전력"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/ammo.json
msgid "LV429 pulse shot"
msgid_plural "LV429 pulse shot"
msgstr[0] "LV429 펄스 샷"

#. ~ Description of "LV429 pulse shot"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/ammo.json
msgid "A charge for the LV429."
msgstr "LV429에 대한 요금."

#. ~ Description of "matrix charge"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/ammo.json
msgid "Power charge for matrix technology."
msgstr "매트릭스 기술에 대한 전력 충전."

#. ~ Description of "noetic energy"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/ammo.json
msgid "Power charge for psychic phenomena."
msgstr "심령 현상에 대한 강력한 충전."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/batteries.json
msgid "light electronoetic battery"
msgid_plural "light electronoetic batteries"
msgstr[0] "경량 전자누에틱 배터리"

#. ~ Description of magazine "light electronoetic battery"
#. ~ Description of "light electronoetic battery"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/batteries.json
msgid ""
"A light battery but with the casing devoid of branding or symbols other than"
" a plus and minus on opposite ends.  It's surprisingly heavy."
msgstr "가벼운 배터리지만 케이스에 브랜드나 기호가 없고, 양 끝에 플러스와 마이너스만 있습니다. 생각보다 무겁습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/batteries.json
msgid "light refined electronoetic battery"
msgid_plural "light refined electronoetic batteries"
msgstr[0] "경량 정제 전자누에틱 배터리"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/batteries.json
msgid "medium electronoetic battery"
msgid_plural "medium electronoetic batteries"
msgstr[0] "중형 전자누에틱 배터리"

#. ~ Description of magazine "medium electronoetic battery"
#. ~ Description of "medium electronoetic battery"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/batteries.json
msgid ""
"A medium battery but with the casing devoid of branding or symbols other "
"than a plus and minus on opposite ends.  It's surprisingly heavy."
msgstr "중간 크기 배터리지만 케이스에 브랜드나 기호가 없고, 양 끝에 플러스와 마이너스 표시만 있습니다. 생각보다 무겁습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/batteries.json
msgid "medium refined electronoetic battery"
msgid_plural "medium refined electronoetic batteries"
msgstr[0] "중형 정제 전자누에틱 배터리"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/batteries.json
msgid "electronoetic tool battery"
msgid_plural "electronoetic tool batteries"
msgstr[0] "전자누에틱 도구 배터리"

#. ~ Description of magazine "electronoetic tool battery"
#. ~ Description of "electronoetic tool battery"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/batteries.json
msgid ""
"A battery cell, compatible with all kinds of industrial-grade equipment and "
"portable tools, but with the casing devoid of branding or symbols other than"
" a plus and minus on opposite ends.  It's surprisingly heavy."
msgstr ""
"모든 종류의 산업용 장비 및 휴대용 공구와 호환되는 배터리 셀입니다. 케이스에는 양 끝에 플러스와 마이너스 표시 외에는 브랜드나 기호가 "
"없습니다. 무게도 놀라울 정도로 무겁습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Magazine name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/batteries.json
msgid "refined electronoetic tool battery"
msgid_plural "refined electronoetic tool batteries"
msgstr[0] "정제 전자누에틱 도구 배터리"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
msgid "Strange Eye CBM"
msgid_plural "Strange Eye CBMs"
msgstr[0] "이상한 눈 CBM"

#. ~ Description of "Strange Eye CBM"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"You can tell this CBM is meant to be installed around your eyes, but what "
"exactly it will do, you have no idea."
msgstr "이 CBM은 눈 주위에 설치하도록 만들어졌다는 것은 알 수 있지만, 정확히 무슨 역할을 할지는 알 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
msgid "Ohuicatlachiyaliztimeh CBM"
msgid_plural "Ohuicatlachiyaliztimeh CBMs"
msgstr[0] "오후이카틀라치얄리스티메 CBM"

#. ~ Description of "Ohuicatlachiyaliztimeh CBM"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A set of Ohuicatlachiyaliztimeh, this CBM uses matrix technology to detect "
"hostility from nearby targets, acting as an infallible IFF."
msgstr ""
"오우이카틀라치얄리즈티메 세트인 이 CBM은 매트릭스 기술을 사용하여 근처 목표물의 적대감을 감지하고, 틀림없는 IFF 역할을 합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
msgid "Ikpitikayotecontli System CBM"
msgid_plural "Ikpitikayotecontli System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "이크피티카요테콘틀리 시스템 CBM"

#. ~ Description of "Ikpitikayotecontli System CBM"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"An extremely-efficent form of bionic power storage, using integral matrix "
"dust to increase the efficiency of possible storage multiple times."
msgstr "통합 매트릭스 먼지를 사용하여 가능한 저장 효율성을 여러 배로 높이는 매우 효율적인 생체 에너지 저장 형태입니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
msgid "Tlacuallichicahualiztli Transformer CBM"
msgid_plural "Tlacuallichicahualiztli Transformer CBMs"
msgstr[0] "틀라쿠알리치카후알리스틀리 변압기 CBM"

#. ~ Description of "Tlacuallichicahualiztli Transformer CBM"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A connection between the user's metabolism and their power storage allows "
"this CBM to convert burned calories into bionic energy."
msgstr "사용자의 신진대사와 전력 저장 장치를 연결함으로써 이 CBM은 소모된 칼로리를 생체 에너지로 전환할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
msgid "Teōchicāhualiztli Booster CBM"
msgid_plural "Teōchicāhualiztli Booster CBMs"
msgstr[0] "테오치카후알리스틀리 부스터 CBM"

#. ~ Description of "Teōchicāhualiztli Booster CBM"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"A series of implants along the skeleton and in major muscle groups allow a "
"dramatic increase in the user's strength and agility."
msgstr "골격과 주요 근육군을 따라 일련의 임플란트를 삽입하면 사용자의 힘과 민첩성이 극적으로 증가합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
msgid "Tapayaxitilmàtli CBM"
msgid_plural "Tapayaxitilmàtli CBMs"
msgstr[0] "타파야시틸마트리 CBM"

#. ~ Description of "Tapayaxitilmàtli CBM"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/bionics.json
msgid ""
"Implants under the skin throughout the body that bend light when activated, "
"making it much harder to spot the user from a distance."
msgstr "신체 전체의 피부 아래에 이식되어 활성화되면 빛이 굴절되어 멀리서 사용자를 발견하기가 훨씬 어렵습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Meditation and You"
msgid_plural "copies of Meditation and You"
msgstr[0] "명상과 당신"

#. ~ Description of "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A description of simple meditation and breathing techniques, intended for a "
"beginner."
msgstr "초보자를 대상으로 한 간단한 명상과 호흡 기술에 대한 설명입니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Zen Mind, Beginner's Mind"
msgid_plural "copies of Zen Mind, Beginner's Mind"
msgstr[0] "선(禪)의 마음, 초심자의 마음"

#. ~ Description of variant "Zen Mind, Beginner's Mind" of item "Meditation
#. and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"This is a transcription of lectures given by Suzuki Shunryū, a Buddhist monk"
" who founded the first Zen Buddhist monastery in the United States, "
"containing discussion about Zen meditation and practice."
msgstr ""
"이 책은 미국 최초의 선불교 사원을 창건한 불교 승려 스즈키 슌류의 강의 내용을 담은 책으로, 선 명상과 수행에 대한 논의를 담고 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "How to Meditate: A Practical Guide to Making Friends with Your Mind"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of How to Meditate: A Practical Guide to Making Friends with Your "
"Mind"
msgstr[0] "명상하는 법: 당신의 마음과 친구가 되는 실용 가이드"

#. ~ Description of variant "How to Meditate: A Practical Guide to Making
#. Friends with Your Mind" of item "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A book on meditation written for a general audience, containing simple "
"techniques on breathing and mindfulness."
msgstr "일반 대중을 대상으로 쓰인 명상 책으로, 호흡과 마음챙김에 대한 간단한 기술을 담고 있습니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "The Wandering Mind: What Medieval Monks Tell Us about Distraction"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Wandering Mind: What Medieval Monks Tell Us about Distraction"
msgstr[0] "방황하는 마음: 중세 수도사들이 우리에게 알려주는 산만함에 대하여"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Wandering Mind: What Medieval Monks Tell Us
#. about Distraction" of item "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A history of monastic attempts at finding calm and peace in the midst of a "
"profane world.  There are far fewer daily distractions now than pre-"
"Cataclysm but there's still some useful techniques you could gain here."
msgstr ""
"세속적인 세상 한가운데서 고요와 평화를 찾으려는 수도사들의 노력의 역사. 대격변 이전보다 일상의 방해 요소가 훨씬 줄어들었지만, 여전히 "
"유용한 기술들을 얻을 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"The Miracle of Mindfulness: An Introduction to the Practice of Meditation"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Miracle of Mindfulness: An Introduction to the Practice of "
"Meditation"
msgstr[0] "마음챙김의 기적: 명상 수행 입문"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Miracle of Mindfulness: An Introduction to
#. the Practice of Meditation" of item "Meditation and You"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A translation of a letter written by Thich Nhat Hanh to colleagues in Viet "
"Nam, this book focuses on mindfulness and breathwork."
msgstr "이 책은 틱낫한이 베트남 동료들에게 쓴 편지를 번역한 것으로, 마음챙김과 호흡법에 초점을 맞추고 있습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgid_plural "copies of Secrets of the Zen Masters"
msgstr[0] "선사의 비밀"

#. ~ Description of "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"This book purports to contain hidden tips that will make you serene and calm"
" in the face of the most grievous calamities.  Cataclysms, one might say."
msgstr ""
"이 책은 가장 극심한 재난, 대격변에 직면했을 때에도 당신을 평온하고 차분하게 만들어 줄 숨겨진 조언들을 담고 있다고 주장합니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"The Mind Illuminated: A Complete Meditation Guide Integrating Buddhist "
"Wisdom and Brain Science for Greater Mindfulness"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of The Mind Illuminated: A Complete Meditation Guide Integrating "
"Buddhist Wisdom and Brain Science for Greater Mindfulness"
msgstr[0] "깨달은 마음: 불교 지혜와 뇌 과학을 통합하여 더 큰 마음챙김을 위한 완전한 명상 가이드"

#. ~ Description of variant "The Mind Illuminated: A Complete Meditation Guide
#. Integrating Buddhist Wisdom and Brain Science for Greater Mindfulness" of
#. item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"Written by a neuroscientist and meditator practitioner, this book offers a "
"ten-step meditation program that combines science with traditional "
"meditation techniques."
msgstr "신경과학자이자 명상 수행자가 쓴 이 책은 과학과 전통 명상 기법을 결합한 10단계 명상 프로그램을 제공합니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"Mastering the Core Teachings of the Buddha: An Unusually Hardcore Dharma "
"Book"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Mastering the Core Teachings of the Buddha: An Unusually Hardcore "
"Dharma Book"
msgstr[0] "부처님의 핵심 가르침 마스터하기: 이례적으로 하드코어한 다르마 서적"

#. ~ Description of variant "Mastering the Core Teachings of the Buddha: An
#. Unusually Hardcore Dharma Book" of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"This book argues that meditation is not an eternal progression but can be "
"mastered just like any other skill, and it will tell you how to do it."
msgstr "이 책은 명상이 영원한 진보가 아니며 다른 기술과 마찬가지로 숙달할 수 있다고 주장하며, 그 방법을 알려줍니다."

#. ~ Variant name of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Not Always So: Practicing the True Spirit of Zen"
msgid_plural "copies of Not Always So: Practicing the True Spirit of Zen"
msgstr[0] "항상 그런 것은 아닙니다: 참된 선(禪)의 정신을 실천하기"

#. ~ Description of variant "Not Always So: Practicing the True Spirit of Zen"
#. of item "Secrets of the Zen Masters"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A continuation of the lessons expounded on in \"Zen Mind, Beginner's Mind\","
" this book contains a myriad of parables and koans to help the student grasp"
" the nature of meditation."
msgstr ""
"\"초심선심(初心禪心) 강의의 후속편인 책으로, 학습자가 명상의 본질을 이해하는 데 도움이 되는 많은 비유와 공안이 수록되어 있습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Lab Journal-Otomo"
msgid_plural "copies of Lab Journal-Otomo"
msgstr[0] "실험실 일지-오토모"

#. ~ Description of "Lab Journal-Otomo"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"This notebook is mostly a series of fanciful speculations about something "
"the author alternately calls \"Matrix Mechanics,\", \"Dimensional "
"Metaphysics,\" or \"Netherium Mathematics,\" sometimes using more than one "
"in the same sentence.  Most of it is incoherent, but there is some "
"experimental data about \"Conscious redirection of nether energy\" that "
"catches your eye."
msgstr ""
"이 노트는 저자가 \"행렬 역학\", \"차원 형이상학\", \"네더리움 수학\" 등으로 번갈아 가며 부르는 것에 대한 기발한 추측들을 "
"주로 담고 있으며, 때로는 한 문장에 여러 용어를 사용하기도 합니다. 대부분은 앞뒤가 맞지 않지만, \"네더 에너지의 의식적 방향 "
"전환\"에 대한 실험 데이터가 눈길을 사로잡습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Report: Channeling Protocol PGS38"
msgid_plural "copies of Report: Channeling Protocol PGS38"
msgstr[0] "보고서: 채널링 프로토콜 PGS38"

#. ~ Description of "Report: Channeling Protocol PGS38"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A formal report on a process to reduce the unpredictable effects of long-"
"term psionic use.  It describes a special meditation technique, performed "
"with the aid of a matrix crystal, though it does warn that the process: "
"\"puts extreme stress on the focus object.  Further refinement is "
"required.\""
msgstr ""
"장기 사이오닉 사용의 예측 불가능한 효과를 줄이는 과정에 대한 공식 보고서입니다. 매트릭스 크리스털을 사용하여 수행되는 특수 명상 기법을"
" 설명하지만, 이 과정이 \"초점 대상에 극심한 스트레스를 가한다. 추가적인 개선이 필요하다\"고 경고합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Training Manual: Method of Loci and Dimensional Metaphysics"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Training Manual: Method of Loci and Dimensional Metaphysics"
msgstr[0] "훈련 매뉴얼: 장소의 방법과 차원 형이상학"

#. ~ Description of "Training Manual: Method of Loci and Dimensional
#. Metaphysics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A formal report on a series of training procedures to allow the practitioner"
" to hold images and ideas in their head for long periods of time without "
"being distracted or losing their train of thought.  The report concludes, "
"\"While the human mind is not adept at holding static images or scenes in "
"place, some minor variation can be allowed for without suffering any adverse"
" effects from the flow of Netherum energy.  Method of Loci allows the "
"mathematician to maintain their thoughts within this area of variation while"
" still exerting effective control over the mathematics.\""
msgstr ""
"수련자가 주의가 산만해지거나 생각의 흐름을 잃지 않고 오랫동안 머릿속에 이미지와 생각을 유지할 수 있도록 하는 일련의 훈련 절차에 대한 "
"공식 보고서입니다. 보고서는 다음과 같이 결론짓습니다. \"인간의 정신은 정적인 이미지나 장면을 제자리에 유지하는 데 능숙하지 않지만, "
"네테룸 에너지의 흐름으로 인한 부정적인 영향 없이 약간의 변화는 허용될 수 있습니다. 위치법(Method of Loci)은 수학자가 "
"이러한 변화 영역 내에서 생각을 유지하면서도 수학을 효과적으로 통제할 수 있도록 해줍니다.\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Training Manual: VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols"
msgid_plural "copies of Training Manual: VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols"
msgstr[0] "훈련 매뉴얼: VERDANT HAND 전투 프로토콜"

#. ~ Description of "Training Manual: VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A formal report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project "
"PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"VERDANT HAND - EYES ONLY\" centered "
"underneath.  Contrary to your initial assumption, it is not a martial arts "
"training manual.  Instead, it describes a series of meditations and "
"visualization exercises designed to \"increase the subject's unarmed combat "
"prowess fivefold\".  There are several charts showing the results of a "
"VERDANT HAND combatant against training opponents armed with weapons or "
"firearms at various engagement distances.  It's clearly still not as good as"
" just having a rifle, but the data look pretty promising if you can get "
"these exercises down."
msgstr ""
"표지는 거의 빈칸이고, 상단에는 Project PHAVIAN 로고가 찍혀 있고, 하단에는 빨간색 \"VERDANT HAND - EYES "
"ONLY\"라고 적힌 공식 보고서입니다. 처음 생각과는 달리, 무술 훈련 매뉴얼은 아닙니다. 오히려 \"대상의 비무장 전투력을 5배로 "
"높이기\" 위해 고안된 일련의 명상과 시각화 연습을 설명합니다. 다양한 교전 거리에서 무기나 총기로 무장한 상대를 훈련시키는 "
"VERDANT HAND 전투원의 성과를 보여주는 여러 차트가 있습니다. 소총만 가지고 있는 것만큼 좋지는 않지만, 이 연습들을 숙지한다면"
" 데이터는 꽤 유망해 보입니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Progress Report: EMERALD VANGUARD"
msgid_plural "copies of Progress Report: EMERALD VANGUARD"
msgstr[0] "진행 보고서: 에메랄드 선봉대"

#. ~ Description of "Progress Report: EMERALD VANGUARD"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A formal report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project "
"PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"EMERALD VANGUARD - EYES ONLY\" centered "
"underneath.  Skimming through it, it seems to be a report of a series of "
"tests involving mixing \"PE050\" and \"BURNT NOVEMBER\" together.  Near the "
"end of the report is a series of \"noetic exercises\" designed to allow the "
"\"mathematician\" to exert conscious control over \"the progressive changes "
"made by exposure to XE037\". There's a lot of jargon in here but the "
"instructions seem like you might be able to puzzle them out."
msgstr ""
"표지는 거의 빈 상태였고, 상단에는 Project PHAVIAN 로고가 찍혀 있었고, 하단에는 빨간색 \"EMERALD VANGUARD "
"- EYES ONLY\"라고 적힌 공식 보고서가 있었습니다. 훑어보니 \"PE050\"과 \"BURNT NOVEMBER\"를 혼합한 "
"일련의 실험 보고서인 듯합니다. 보고서 끝부분에는 \"수학자\"가 \"XE037에 노출되어 일어나는 점진적 변화\"를 의식적으로 통제할 "
"수 있도록 고안된 일련의 \"노에틱 연습\"이 있습니다. 전문 용어가 많지만, 설명서를 보면 충분히 이해할 수 있을 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Proposal: TURQUOISE KEYSTONE"
msgid_plural "copies of Proposal: TURQUOISE KEYSTONE"
msgstr[0] "제안서: 터쿼이즈 키스톤"

#. ~ Description of "Proposal: TURQUOISE KEYSTONE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A formal report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project "
"PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"TURQUOISE KEYSTONE - EYES ONLY\" "
"centered underneath.  Skimming through it, you see a lot of very worrying "
"phrases in light of recent events, like \"…the sudden but so-far unexplained"
" increase in our mathematicians' prowess…\" or \"…E71 is now capable of "
"passing through two meters of solid matter.\"  The main topic of the "
"document seems to be using teleportation (\"LOST RAIN\", as the report calls"
" it) in combat.  By lengthening the space between the teleporter and their "
"target to build up momentum on their strikes, warping space to make near-"
"misses turn into hits, or teleporting fractions of a meter to avoid incoming"
" attacks or put themselves in a better position to make strikes, the "
"TURQUOISE KEYSTONE practitioner can vastly increase their prowess in close-"
"quarters combat.  Written at the bottom of the last page is, \"We had better"
" test this soon--I think we're going to need it.\""
msgstr ""
"거의 빈 표지에 프로젝트 파비안 로고가 상단에 찍혀 있고, 그 아래 중앙에는 빨간색 \"터콰이즈 키스톤 - 시각 전용\"이라는 문구가 "
"적힌 공식 보고서입니다. 훑어보면 최근 사건들을 고려했을 때 매우 우려스러운 문구들이 많이 나옵니다. \"…우리 수학자들의 기량이 "
"갑자기, 그러나 아직 설명되지 않은 수준으로 향상되었다…\" 또는 \"…E71은 이제 2미터 두께의 고체 물질을 통과할 수 있다\"와 "
"같은 문구들입니다. 이 문서의 주요 주제는 전투에서 순간이동(보고서에서는 \"LOST RAIN\"이라고 부름)을 사용하는 것으로 "
"보입니다. 순간이동기와 표적 사이의 거리를 늘려 공격의 추진력을 높이거나, 공간을 왜곡하여 아슬아슬한 상황을 명중으로 전환하거나, 1미터"
" 미만의 거리를 순간이동하여 적의 공격을 피하거나 공격에 유리한 위치를 점하는 등, 터콰이즈 키스톤 수련자는 근접전에서 기량을 크게 "
"향상시킬 수 있습니다. 마지막 페이지 하단에는 \"이것을 곧 테스트해보는 게 좋을 것 같아요. 필요할 것 같아요.\"라는 글이 적혀 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid "Lab Report: PATIENT MOSAIC process"
msgid_plural "copies of Lab Report: PATIENT MOSAIC process"
msgstr[0] "실험 보고서: PATIENT MOSAIC 공정"

#. ~ Description of "Lab Report: PATIENT MOSAIC process"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/books.json
msgid ""
"A thick lab report with a mostly-blank cover page, stamped with the Project "
"PHAVIAN logo at the top and a red \"PATIENT MOSAIC - EYES ONLY\" centered "
"underneath.  According to the summary, the report details how a powerful "
"GRAY DAWN participant may use a specifically attuned focusing tool to allow "
"themselves to induce permanent changes in their personality and other "
"segments of their brain.  The report details little success in GRAY DAWN "
"participant applying this process to others."
msgstr ""
"표지는 거의 빈 두꺼운 실험 보고서로, 상단에는 Project PHAVIAN 로고가 찍혀 있고, 하단에는 빨간색 \"환자 모자이크 - "
"눈으로만\"이라는 문구가 중앙에 적혀 있습니다. 요약에 따르면, 이 보고서는 강력한 GRAY DAWN 참가자가 특수 조율된 집중 도구를 "
"사용하여 자신의 성격과 뇌의 다른 부분에 영구적인 변화를 유도하는 방법을 자세히 설명합니다. 하지만 이 과정을 다른 사람들에게 적용한 "
"GRAY DAWN 참가자의 성공 사례는 미미합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/chemicals.json
msgid "psychoreactive catalyst"
msgid_plural "psychoreactive catalyst"
msgstr[0] "정신 반응 촉매"

#. ~ Description of "psychoreactive catalyst"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/chemicals.json
msgid ""
"A thick liquid, mixed with ground matrix crystal and ready to be catalyzed."
"  In total darkness, it glows very faintly."
msgstr "걸쭉한 액체에 분쇄된 매트릭스 결정을 섞어 촉매 작용을 준비했습니다. 칠흑 같은 어둠 속에서는 매우 희미하게 빛납니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestible_overrides.json
msgid "compound XV471 \"Panaceus\""
msgid_plural "doses of compound XV471 \"Panaceus\""
msgstr[0] "화합물 XV471 \"파나세우스\""

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
msgid "pink crystalline elixir"
msgid_plural "pink crystalline elixir"
msgstr[0] "분홍색 결정질 비약"

#. ~ Description of "pink crystalline elixir"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Refined matrix crystal mixed directly into water.  The liquid has a faint "
"pink glow."
msgstr "정제된 매트릭스 결정을 물에 직접 섞은 것입니다. 액체는 은은한 분홍색 빛을 띱니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
msgid "gray crystalline elixir"
msgid_plural "gray crystalline elixir"
msgstr[0] "회색 결정질 비약"

#. ~ Description of "gray crystalline elixir"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Refined matrix crystal mixed directly into water.  The liquid has a faint "
"grayish glow."
msgstr "정제된 매트릭스 결정을 물에 직접 섞은 것입니다. 액체는 희미한 회색 빛을 띱니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
msgid "cyan crystalline elixir"
msgid_plural "cyan crystalline elixir"
msgstr[0] "청록색 결정질 비약"

#. ~ Description of "cyan crystalline elixir"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"Refined matrix crystal mixed directly into water.  The liquid has a faint "
"sky-blue glow."
msgstr "정제된 매트릭스 결정을 물에 직접 섞은 것입니다. 액체는 희미한 하늘색 빛을 띱니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
msgid "golden crystalline elixir"
msgid_plural "golden crystalline elixir"
msgstr[0] "황금색 결정질 비약"

#. ~ Description of "golden crystalline elixir"
