#. ~ Description of "alien fruit"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"A bluish-green ovoid globule, firm to the touch but looking more like "
"gelatin than something you plucked from a tree.  It has a strong acrid odor."
msgstr "청록색 타원형의 작은 공. 만져보면 단단하지만 나무에서 딴 것이라기보다는 젤라틴처럼 보입니다. 매캐한 냄새가 강합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
msgid "cockatrice egg"
msgid_plural "cockatrice eggs"
msgstr[0] "독사 알"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
msgid "black liquid"
msgid_plural "black liquid"
msgstr[0] "검은 액체"

#. ~ Description of "black liquid"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"You don't know what this is but now that you've gotten a closer look it's "
"definitely not water.  It's completely opaque and freezing cold to the "
"touch, but when you pull your fingertip out of it, your skin is dry as a "
"bone."
msgstr ""
"이게 뭔지는 모르겠지만, 자세히 보니 확실히 물은 아니네요. 완전히 불투명하고 만지면 얼어붙을 듯 차가워요. 하지만 손가락 끝을 빼내면 "
"피부가 뼈처럼 바싹 말라 있어요."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
msgid "handful of alien berries"
msgid_plural "handfuls of alien berries"
msgstr[0] "외계 베리 한 줌"

#. ~ Description of "handful of alien berries"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"A handful of white berries plucked from an otherworldly bush.  You're not "
"sure if eating them is a good idea, but they sure look tasty."
msgstr "이 세상 어딘가의 덤불에서 따온 하얀 열매 한 줌. 먹는 게 좋을지 잘 모르겠지만, 정말 맛있어 보인다."

#. ~ Description of "alien fruit"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/comestibles.json
msgid ""
"A large fruit pulled from an alien tree.  The rind is extremely hard and "
"you'll need to cut into it to eat it."
msgstr "외계 나무에서 따온 커다란 과일입니다. 껍질이 매우 딱딱해서 먹기 위해서는 잘라야 합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/files_and_post_it.json
msgid "private note"
msgid_plural "private notes"
msgstr[0] "개인 메모"

#. ~ Description of "private note"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/items/files_and_post_it.json
msgid ""
"Some paper with what looks to be private communication on it.  The writer "
"would be very annoyed at you for reading this if they weren't almost-"
"certainly shambling around looking for brains."
msgstr ""
"뭔가 개인적인 대화가 담긴 듯한 종이가 있네. 글쓴이는 아마 뇌나 찾으려고 어슬렁거리고 있지 않았으면, 이 글을 읽는 당신에게 엄청 "
"짜증을 냈을 거야."

