#. ~ Description of mutation ""
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/paraclesians.json
msgid ""
"The Ierde's mind has the resilience of iron, and they cannot be affected by "
"delusions, hallucinations, or other mental problems.  In addition, they are "
"immune to telepathic attack."
msgstr ""
"아이르더의 정신은 강철과 같은 회복력을 지녔으며, 망상이나 환각, 또는 다른 정신적 문제에 영향을 받지 않습니다. 게다가, 그들은 "
"텔레파시 공격에도 면역입니다."

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Mobile Task Force: Psi 7 \"Sleepwalkers\""
msgstr "기동특무부대: 사이 7 \"몽유병자\""

#. ~ Description of profession "Mobile Task Force: Psi 7 "Sleepwalkers"" for
#. male
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a member of Psi 7, your job was to take out the dangerous rogue psychics "
"that popped up with increasing frequency as the strangeness in the world "
"increased.  Even before the end of the world you had seen enough bizarre "
"things to write a dozen books, but nothing compares to what you've seen "
"during the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"사이오닉 7의 일원으로서, 당신의 임무는 세상의 기이함이 커짐에 따라 점점 더 빈번하게 나타나는 위험한 악당 초능력자들을 제거하는 "
"것이었습니다. 세상이 멸망하기 전에도 당신은 열두 권의 책을 쓸 만큼 기괴한 광경을 목격했지만, 대격변 당시 당신이 목격한 것에 비할 "
"것은 아무것도 없었습니다."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Mobile Task Force: Psi 7 \"Sleepwalkers\""
msgstr "기동특무부대: 사이 7 \"몽유병자\""

