#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "lab_file_phavian_private"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/snippets.json
msgid "Note on the back of a schedule printout"
msgstr "일정표 출력물 뒷면의 참고사항"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_file_phavian_private"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/snippets.json
msgid ""
"I don't want one of those assignments ever again.  They call themselves \"Offworld Acquisitions\" but do you know what they actually do?  They're butchers!  I can only sit through so many lectures about how \"only humans have human rights\" before I want to just start trying to adjust their thought processes.  Give me an hour alone in a room with each one of them and they'll never want to hurt a fly.\n"
"\n"
"Mark my words, those maniacs are making enemies that we can't afford to make.  We don't know everything that's out there beyond the gates and it's pure luck we haven't made contact with a civilization that wants to hunt US for something WE have.  Unless we have and some of those immersion teams that went missing were actually captured.  They're playing with fire and we're all going to get burned."
msgstr ""
"다시는 그런 임무는 받고 싶지 않아. 놈들은 스스로를 \"외계 획득\"이라고 부르지만, 정작 놈들이 뭘 하는지 알아? 도살자야! \"인간만이 인권을 가진다\"는 식의 설교를 몇 번이나 들어도 그들의 사고방식을 바꿔보려고 애쓰고 싶어. 놈들 한 명 한 명과 한 방에 한 시간씩만이라도 있으면, 놈들은 파리 한 마리도 해치고 싶어 하지 않을 거야.\n"
"\n"
"내 말 명심해, 그 미치광이들은 우리가 감당할 수 없는 적을 만들고 있어. 우리는 문 너머에 있는 모든 것을 알지 못하고, 우리가 가진 것을 노리고 우리를 사냥하려는 문명과 접촉하지 않은 건 순전히 운에 의한 거야. 만약 우리가 접촉했고, 실종된 그 몰입팀 중 일부가 실제로 포로로 잡혔다면 말이지. 놈들은 불장난을 하고 있고, 우리 모두 화상을 입을 거야."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "lab_file_photokinesis"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/snippets.json
msgid "Re: CE225"
msgstr "제목: CE225"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_file_photokinesis"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/snippets.json
msgid ""
"As instructed, we brought L85 to the subject's location and subjected it to increasingly-higher-lumen concentrations, all to no effect.  We got up to 50K lumens with no effect other than making everyone except L85 and (footage later showed) the subject blind briefly.  The subject simply laughed.\n"
"\n"
"It wasn't laughing when we took it down the hall and threw it into the room with the open windows, though."
msgstr ""
"지시받은 대로 L85를 피험자 위치로 가져와 점점 더 높은 루멘 농도에 노출시켰지만 아무 효과가 없었습니다. 최대 5만 루멘까지 도달했지만, L85와 (나중에 영상에서 볼 수 있듯이) 피험자를 제외한 모든 사람의 시력이 잠시 실명한 것 외에는 아무런 효과도 없었습니다. 피험자는 그저 웃기만 했습니다.\n"
"\n"
"하지만 복도로 끌고 가서 창문이 열린 방에 던졌을 때는 웃지 않았습니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "lab_file_telepathy"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/snippets.json
msgid "incident report: 223741"
msgstr "사건 보고서: 223741"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_file_telepathy"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/snippets.json
msgid ""
"At 0411 this morning, a GLASS ANVIL mathematician seconded to XEDRA-40 discovered an anomaly in one of the returning immersion teams during a routine random security scan.  While monitoring Dr. Mahika Mittal, the mathematician suddenly screamed and grabbed their head before collapsing to the floor.  In the ensuing confusion, Dr. Mittal attempted to grab Sgt Adams's rifle before making a gesture and \"causing the temperature in the room to drop to freezing\".  Following this, Dr. Mittal grabbed Dr. McDowell and dragged him back through the still-open dive aperture just before it closed.  An attempt to reopen the aperture to the previous destination was unsuccessful at producing a stable connection; further efforts are ongoing.\n"
"\n"
"When awakened, mathematician U72 stated that during her attempt to make contact she felt \"Something cold, icy, like a glacier.  Inhuman.  It wasn't Dr. Mahika, it was something that looked like her, or had taken her place or…I don't know.\"  When told that Dr. Mittal had escaped, U72 was emphatic that it (she only ever used the word it) had to be captured for study and to prevent similar incidents from happening again.\n"
"\n"
"Questioning of the other dive team members is ongoing.  None of them said Dr. Mittal showed any suspicious behavior either before or during the dive."
msgstr ""
"오늘 아침 4시 11분, XEDRA-40에 파견된 글래스 앤빌(GLASS ANVIL) 소속 수학자가 정기적인 무작위 보안 검색 중 복귀하는 잠수팀 중 한 곳에서 이상 징후를 발견했습니다. 마히카 미탈 박사를 감시하던 중, 이 수학자는 갑자기 비명을 지르며 그들의 머리를 붙잡고 바닥에 쓰러졌습니다. 이어진 혼란 속에서 미탈 박사는 아담스 상사의 소총을 잡으려다 손짓을 하며 \"방 안의 온도가 영하로 떨어지게\" 했습니다. 이후 미탈 박사는 맥도웰 박사를 붙잡아 아직 열려 있던 잠수구가 닫히기 직전에 다시 끌어당겼습니다. 이전 목적지로의 잠수구를 다시 열려고 시도했지만 안정적인 연결을 확보하지 못했습니다. 추가 시도가 진행 중입니다.\n"
"\n"
"깨어났을 때, 수학자 U72는 접촉을 시도하는 동안 \"차갑고 얼음처럼 차가운, 빙하 같은 무언가가 느껴졌다. 비인간적이었다. 마히카 박사가 아니라, 그녀와 닮은 무언가가 있었거나, 그녀의 자리를 차지했거나… 잘 모르겠다\"라고 진술했습니다. 미탈 박사가 탈출했다는 말을 듣자, U72는 (그녀는 항상 '그것'이라는 단어만 사용했다) 연구를 위해 포획해야 하며, 유사한 사건이 재발하지 않도록 해야 한다고 단호하게 주장했습니다.\n"
"\n"
"다른 잠수팀원들에 대한 심문은 계속 진행 중입니다. 그들 중 누구도 미탈 박사가 잠수 전이나 잠수 중에 의심스러운 행동을 보였다고 말하지 않았습니다."

#. ~ Name of a snippet in category "lab_file_vitakinesis"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/snippets.json
msgid "a partial interview transcript"
msgstr "일부 인터뷰 내용"

#. ~ Snippet in category "lab_file_vitakinesis"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/xedra_evolved/snippets.json
msgid ""
"\"…summary of your sensations, please.\"\n"
"M33: \"Uh, okay.  Well, it's hard to describe this, you know, but a normal…sorry, sorry, a standard person has a kind of glow to them.  If they're sick, or tired, or injured in some way, it affects the glow.  [REDACTED]…oh, sorry, I mean, uh, the CE473 had that same glow but it was muted\"\n"
"Interviewer: \"Muted?\"\n"
"M33: \"Like, the glow was just…lower, you know?  Like she was sick or something, but she wasn't.  I couldn't find anything wrong with her at all.  I did a full scan, as much as I could, you know, and she was in perfect health.  Better, even.  The, uh, CE473 is in her mid-40s?\"\n"
"Interviewer: \"That's correct.\"\n"
"M33: \"I never would have believed that if I wasn't told it.  She doesn't just look good for her age, she's physically younger.\"\n"
"Interviewer: \"What was your impression of the subject on your second examination?\"M33: \"Oh, at the end of the day?  Well, I'm not sure how to describe it, she was…red.\"\n"
"Interviewer: \"What do you mean by that?\"\n"
"M33: \"Yeah, like she was even paler than usual and there were these kind of red streaks.  And it felt, uh…\"\n"
"*fifteen second pause*\n"
"\n"
"Interviewer: \"Please continue.  Your impressions are very important to the success of the experiment.\"\n"
"*six second pause*\n"
"M33: \"Hungry.  It felt hungry.\""
msgstr ""
"\"…느낌을 요약해 주세요.\"\n"
"M33: \"음, 알겠습니다. 뭐, 설명하기는 어렵네요. 하지만 일반적인… 죄송해요, 죄송해요, 평범한 사람은 뭔가 빛이 나요. 아프거나 피곤하거나 뭔가 다치면 그 빛이 영향을 받죠. [삭제됨]… 아, 죄송해요. CE473도 똑같은 빛이 났지만 약했어요.\"\n"
"면담자: \"약했어요?\"\n"
"M33: \"그냥… 빛이 좀 약했어요. 뭔가 아픈 것 같았는데, 전혀 이상이 없었어요. 최대한 정밀 검사를 했는데, 건강 상태가 완벽했어요. 심지어 더 좋아지기도 했고요. CE473은 40대 중반이신가요?\"\n"
"면담자: \"맞습니다.\"\n"
"M33: \"말씀 안 들으셨으면 절대 믿지 않았을 거예요. 나이에 비해 외모가 좋은 게 아니라, 체격적으로 더 젊었어요.\"\n"
"면접관: \"두 번째 시험 때 피험자에 대한 인상은 어땠나요?\" M33: \"아, 결국엔요? 글쎄요, 어떻게 표현해야 할지 모르겠지만, 피험자는… 빨개졌어요.\"\n"
"면접관: \"무슨 말씀이세요?\"\n"
"M33: \"네, 평소보다 더 창백해졌고, 붉은 줄무늬가 있었어요. 그리고 뭔가…\"\n"
"*15초간 멈춤*\n"
"\n"
"면접관: \"계속 말씀해 주세요. 피험자의 인상은 실험 성공에 매우 중요합니다.\"\n"
"*6초간 멈춤*\n"
"M33: \"배고프네요. 배고픈 것 같았어요.\""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
msgid "radiant amalgamation"
msgid_plural "radiant amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "빛나는 융합체"

#. ~ Description of monster "radiant amalgamation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
msgid ""
"A four-legged creature with bulbous body and a small head with a fanged maw,"
" with three multi-jointed limbs waving above it in the air.  The limbs emit "
"a soft glow, occasionally brightening into a eye-searing flare."
msgstr ""
"네 발 달린 생물. 둥근 몸통에 송곳니가 난 작은 머리, 그리고 그 위로 여러 관절이 달린 세 개의 팔다리가 공중에서 흔들리고 있다. "
"팔다리는 은은한 빛을 내뿜으며, 가끔은 눈을 찌르는 섬광으로 변하기도 한다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "radiant amalgamation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
msgid "The air erupts into an eye-searing flash and a loud screech of static!"
msgstr "공기 중에 눈이 시릴 듯한 섬광이 터지고 큰 잡음이 들립니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
msgid "phosphorescent amalgamation"
msgid_plural "phosphorescent amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "인광 융합체"

#. ~ Description of monster "phosphorescent amalgamation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
msgid ""
"A large creature with a sleek body running on seven multi-jointed legs, with"
" four large mandibles dominating what you are forced by necessity to call "
"its face.  It glows with an eerie blue light that gives you an uneasy "
"feeling."
msgstr ""
"일곱 개의 다관절 다리로 이루어진 매끈한 몸통을 가진 거대한 생물. 네 개의 커다란 턱이 어쩔 수 없이 얼굴이라고 부르게 된 부분을 "
"압도한다. 섬뜩한 푸른빛이 번쩍이는데, 이는 불안감을 안겨준다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "phosphorescent
#. amalgamation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
#, c-format
msgid "The glow of %1$s suddenly brightens into a flash!"
msgstr "%1$s의 빛이 갑자기 번쩍이며 밝아졌습니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
msgid "guardian amalgamation"
msgid_plural "guardian amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "수호 융합체"

#. ~ Description of monster "guardian amalgamation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
msgid ""
"A four-legged creature with a crab-like shell, with two eyes on stubby "
"stalks and a small mouth filled with sharp fangs.  Three additional limbs "
"with bulbous growths on their ends wave around, seemingly randomly except "
"when they point briefly at one of the walking dead."
msgstr ""
"게 같은 등껍질을 가진 네 발 달린 생물, 뭉툭한 줄기에 두 눈이 있고, 작은 입에는 날카로운 송곳니가 가득하다. 끝에 뭉툭한 돌기가 난"
" 세 개의 팔다리가 마치 무작위로 흔들리는 듯하지만, 걸어다니는 시체 중 하나를 잠깐 가리킬 때는 예외다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "guardian amalgamation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its three appendages in the air."
msgstr "%1$s가 세 개의 부속지를 공중으로 흔든다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
msgid "whispering amalgamation"
msgid_plural "whispering amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "속삭이는 융합체"

#. ~ Description of monster "whispering amalgamation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
msgid ""
"A smooth, round body skittering around on seven jointed legs, this "
"abomination does not seem to have any sensory organs at all.  When you look "
"at it, you hear faint whispers in the back of your mind."
msgstr ""
"매끈하고 둥근 몸통에 일곱 개의 관절이 있는 다리로 휙휙 움직이는 이 흉측한 괴물은 감각 기관이 전혀 없는 듯합니다. 이 괴물을 보면 "
"마음속 깊은 곳에서 희미한 속삭임이 들려옵니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
msgid "enervating amalgamation"
msgid_plural "enervating amalgamations"
msgstr[0] "쇠약하게 하는 융합체"

#. ~ Description of monster "enervating amalgamation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
msgid ""
"An elongated body moving irregularly on five legs, with two flexible "
"tentacles waving in the air as it moves.  It seems to have no head, with a "
"ring of black spots on top that might be sensory organs.  Its skin is "
"perfectly smooth and greyish-white, without a single spot or blemish."
msgstr ""
"길쭉한 몸통에 다섯 개의 다리가 달려 불규칙하게 움직이며, 두 개의 유연한 촉수가 움직일 때마다 공중에서 흔들린다. 머리는 없는 듯하고,"
" 머리 위에는 감각 기관으로 추정되는 검은 반점들이 고리 모양으로 나 있다. 피부는 완벽하게 매끈하고 회백색이며, 점이나 잡티 하나 "
"없다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s touches you and you feel weaker!"
msgstr "%1$s가 당신을 만지면 당신은 약해지는 걸 느껴요!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s touches <npcname> and they flinch!"
msgstr "%1$s가 <npcname>을 만지자 그들은 움찔합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to touch you, but you dodge!"
msgstr "%1$s가 당신을 만지려고 하지만, 당신은 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s tries to touch <npcname>, but they dodge!"
msgstr "%1$s가 <npcname>을 만지려고 하지만, 그들은 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#. ~ Named after the American folkloric monster.
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "hidebehind"
msgid_plural "hidebehinds"
msgstr[0] "하이드비하인드"

#. ~ Description of monster "hidebehind"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Even looking directly at this cougar and knowing that it is there, a part of"
" your brain simply refuses to see it.  It flickers in and out of sight in a "
"way that makes your eyes hurt, and if you turn your attention away from it "
"even for a moment, it disappears completely."
msgstr ""
"이 퓨마를 똑바로 쳐다보고 그것이 거기에 있다는 것을 알면서도, 뇌의 한 부분은 그것을 보려 하지 않습니다. 눈이 아플 정도로 "
"깜빡거리고, 잠깐이라도 시선을 돌리면 완전히 사라집니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "bandersnatch"
msgid_plural "bandersnatches"
msgstr[0] "밴더스내치"

#. ~ Description of monster "bandersnatch"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"An American black bear.  A large omnivorous scavenger, it has powerful claws"
" and jaws, and is an effective ambush hunter.  This one is distinguished "
"from its fellows by its intent expression, its lack of caution in your "
"presence, and the fact that it's hovering six inches off the ground."
msgstr ""
"미국 흑곰입니다. 대형 잡식성 청소 동물로, 강력한 발톱과 턱을 가지고 있으며, 효과적인 매복 사냥꾼입니다. 이 곰은 다른 곰들과 달리 "
"진지한 표정, 주변에서 경계하지 않는 모습, 그리고 땅에서 15cm 높이로 맴돌고 있다는 점이 특징입니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "bandersnatch"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Dr. Brain"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral mindhand"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unstoppable force"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "The air around %1$s distorts."
msgstr "%1$s 주변의 공기가 왜곡됩니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "fear hawk"
msgid_plural "fear hawks"
msgstr[0] "공포 매"

#. ~ Description of monster "fear hawk"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"A hawk with striking golden eyes.  Its call seems to pierce deep into your "
"psyche even when it's not directed at you."
msgstr "눈길을 사로잡는 금빛 눈을 가진 매. 그 울음소리는 당신을 향한 것이 아니더라도 당신의 마음속 깊이 파고드는 듯합니다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s shrieks at you!"
msgstr "%1$s이 당신에게 비명을 지릅니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s shrieks at <npcname>!"
msgstr "%1$s가 <npcname>에게 비명을 지릅니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s's shriek radiates at you, but you dodge!"
msgstr "%s의 비명이 당신에게 울려퍼지지만, 당신은 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s's shriek radiates at <npcname>, but they dodge!"
msgstr "%s의 비명이 <npcname>에게 울려퍼졌지만, 그들은 피했습니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's shriek radiates out at you without doing any damage."
msgstr "%1$s의 비명이 아무런 피해도 입히지 않고 당신에게 울려 퍼집니다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's shriek radiates out at <npcname> without doing any damage."
msgstr "%1$s의 비명은 <npcname>에게 아무런 피해도 입히지 않고 퍼져 나갑니다."

#. ~ Description of monster "cow"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"The domestic cow, a baleful, ruminating farm animal.  She is quite muscular,"
" and would be a great source of milk if domesticated or of meat and leather "
"if slaughtered.  This one moves with an oddly fluid grace."
msgstr ""
"가축화된 소는 불길하고 반추동물인 농장 동물입니다. 근육이 매우 발달되어 있어 가축화하면 우유를, 도축하면 고기와 가죽을 얻을 수 있는 "
"훌륭한 공급원이 될 것입니다. 이 소는 기묘하게 유연하게 움직입니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "cow"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "hodag"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s moves too quickly for the eye to follow!"
msgstr "%1$s은(는) 눈으로 따라가기에는 너무 빨리 움직입니다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "cow"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "hodag"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "baby hodag"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral security guard, Ψ
#. Division"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral dervish"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "human whirlwind"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's skin takes on a slightly waxen appearance."
msgstr "%1$s의 피부가 약간 왁스처럼 보입니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "hodag"
msgid_plural "hodags"
msgstr[0] "호댁"

#. ~ Description of monster "hodag"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This is very similar to a cow, though the bone spikes growing from its back "
"and its clawed feet separate it from any cow you've ever seen.  Despite its "
"fearsome armaments, it grazes placidly on grass."
msgstr ""
"소와 매우 비슷하지만, 등에서 돋아난 뼈 가시와 발톱 달린 발은 지금까지 본 어떤 소와도 확연히 다릅니다. 무시무시한 무장에도 불구하고,"
" 이 녀석은 풀밭에서 평화롭게 풀을 뜯습니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "hodag"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "gremlin"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral dervish"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s begins moving more quickly."
msgstr "%1$s이 더 빨리 움직이기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "baby hodag"
msgid_plural "baby hodags"
msgstr[0] "아기 호댁"

#. ~ Description of monster "baby hodag"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This is very similar to a calf, though the short bone spikes growing from "
"its back and its clawed feet separate it from any calf you've ever seen.  "
"Despite its fearsome armaments, it grazes placidly on grass."
msgstr ""
"송아지와 매우 비슷하지만, 등에서 자라는 짧은 뼈 가시와 발톱이 달린 발은 지금까지 본 어떤 송아지와도 다릅니다. 무시무시한 무장에도 "
"불구하고, 이 송아지는 풀밭에서 평화롭게 풀을 뜯습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "cockatrice"
msgid_plural "cockatrices"
msgstr[0] "코카트리스"

#. ~ Description of monster "cockatrice"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This strange mutant bird gains its name from its odd appearance.  Although "
"its features seem to be becoming more reptilian, it doesn't appear "
"dangerous.  However, it looks at you like it understands you in some way."
msgstr ""
"이 기묘한 돌연변이 새는 그 기묘한 외모에서 이름을 따왔습니다. 겉모습이 점점 파충류처럼 변해가는 듯하지만, 위험해 보이지는 않습니다. "
"하지만 마치 당신을 마치 이해하는 듯 쳐다봅니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "cockatrice"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares and lets out a silent cry!"
msgstr "%1$s가 응시하며 소리 없이 비명을 지른다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "strange chick"
msgid_plural "strange chicks"
msgstr[0] "이상한 병아리"

#. ~ Description of monster "strange chick"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"A strange tiny chick, it could be from a number of different species if it "
"weren't for the patches of scales between its feathers."
msgstr "이상하게 작은 병아리인데, 깃털 사이에 비늘 조각이 없다면 여러 다른 종에 속하는 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "pigeon passenger"
msgid_plural "pigeon passengers"
msgstr[0] "비둘기 승객"

#. ~ Description of monster "pigeon passenger"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"A gentle, plump, small-billed bird with a third eye, between its bill and "
"forehead.  On the ground, it struts about with a characteristic bobbing of "
"the head.  It is a strong, swift flier thanks to its long wings and powerful"
" flight muscles.  Is it following you?"
msgstr ""
"부리와 이마 사이에 제3의 눈이 있는 온순하고 통통한 작은 부리의 새입니다. 땅에서는 특유의 고개 흔들림으로 활보합니다. 긴 날개와 "
"강력한 비행 근육 덕분에 강력하고 빠르게 비행합니다. 따라오고 있나요?"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "pigeon passenger"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s's third eye opens and it coos!"
msgstr "%s의 제3의 눈이 열리고 으르렁거립니다!"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_pigeon_passenger_chick"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"A tiny darkly-colored chick, it could be from a number of different species "
"if it weren't for the third eye below the center of its forehead."
msgstr "이 새끼는 어두운 색깔의 작은 병아리인데, 이마 중앙 아래에 세 번째 눈이 없었다면 여러 다른 종에 속했을 가능성이 큽니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "gremlin"
msgid_plural "gremlins"
msgstr[0] "그렘린"

#. ~ Description of monster "gremlin"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"The red fox, an omnivorous canine and largest of the true foxes, it is a "
"wily hunter with a combative, suspicious temperament.  Sparks occasionally "
"crackle over its fur and its body distorts oddly as it moves, covering more "
"ground with each stride than the length of its legs would indicate."
msgstr ""
"붉은 여우는 잡식성 개과 동물이자 진짜 여우 중 가장 큰 종으로, 교활한 사냥꾼이며 호전적이고 의심 많은 기질을 가지고 있습니다. 털 "
"위로 가끔씩 불꽃이 튀고, 움직일 때마다 몸이 이상하게 뒤틀리며, 한 걸음 한 걸음이 다리 길이보다 더 넓은 땅을 덮습니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "gremlin"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "Sparks flicker over %1$s's fur."
msgstr "%1$s의 털 위로 불꽃이 번쩍인다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "direhound"
msgid_plural "direhounds"
msgstr[0] "다이어하운드"

#. ~ Description of monster "direhound"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This large canid has grown to terrifying proportions, roughly three times "
"the size of some of its brethren.  Its teeth give steak knives a run for "
"their money, and it looks to be the social center of any surrounding dogs."
msgstr ""
"이 거대한 개과 동물은 무시무시한 크기로 성장하여, 다른 개들보다 약 세 배나 큽니다. 날카로운 이빨은 스테이크 나이프와도 경쟁할 수 "
"있을 정도이며, 주변 개들의 사회적 중심이 되어 줄 듯합니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "direhound"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "The direhound gazes upon its allies, and lets out a howl!"
msgstr "디어하운드는 동료들을 바라보며 울부짖는다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "hellhound"
msgid_plural "hellhounds"
msgstr[0] "헬하운드"

#. ~ Description of monster "hellhound"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This once-average Labrador mixed-breed dog has clearly gone feral.  Though "
"it likely still instinctively trusts humans, it's probably far from domestic"
" by now.  The air around it wavers like the haze over summer asphalt."
msgstr ""
"한때 평범했던 이 래브라도 믹스견은 분명 야생으로 돌아갔습니다. 본능적으로는 여전히 사람을 신뢰하겠지만, 이제는 집고양이와는 거리가 멀 "
"것입니다. 주변 공기는 여름 아스팔트 위의 안개처럼 흔들립니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "hellhound"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s barks out a stream of flame!"
msgstr "%1$s가 불꽃을 뿜어냅니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "hellpup"
msgid_plural "hellpups"
msgstr[0] "헬펍"

#. ~ Description of monster "hellpup"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless Labrador puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult "
"dog.  Its breath is very hot."
msgstr "사랑스럽고 무방비 상태인 래브라도 강아지. 성견보다 길들이기가 훨씬 안전합니다. 입김이 아주 뜨겁습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "king of the wood"
msgid_plural "kings of the wood"
msgstr[0] "숲의 왕"

#. ~ Description of monster "king of the wood"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"The northern woodland white-tailed deer, a quick and strong grazing animal."
"  Favored prey of coyotes, wolves, and giant spider mutants.  This one has "
"an almost regal aura of calm about it and gazes at the forest around it "
"without fear."
msgstr ""
"북부 삼림 지대의 흰꼬리사슴은 빠르고 강한 초식 동물입니다. 코요테, 늑대, 그리고 거대 거미 돌연변이들이 선호하는 먹이입니다. 이 "
"사슴은 거의 왕족처럼 고요한 분위기를 풍기며, 주변 숲을 두려움 없이 바라봅니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "king of the wood"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s turns its head sideways and looks directly at %3$s."
msgstr "%1$s은 머리를 옆으로 돌린 뒤 %3$s를 바라본다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "king of the wood"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s raises its head with an air of authority."
msgstr "%1$s은 머리를 들고 권위를 내뿜는다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "prince of the wood"
msgid_plural "princes of the wood"
msgstr[0] "숲의 왕자"

#. ~ Description of monster "prince of the wood"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"A juvenile northern woodland white-tailed deer, a quick and strong grazing "
"animal.  Favored prey of coyotes, wolves, and giant spider mutants.  This "
"one doesn't seem as skittish as most deer are."
msgstr ""
"북부 삼림 지대의 어린 흰꼬리사슴으로, 빠르고 강한 초식 동물입니다. 코요테, 늑대, 그리고 거대 거미 돌연변이들이 즐겨 먹는 "
"먹이입니다. 이 사슴은 대부분의 사슴처럼 겁이 없어 보입니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_devourer_lab_sec"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral slider"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "ephemeral riftwalker"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s glances at %3$s and the world lurches."
msgstr "%1$s가 %3$s를 흘끗 보자 세상이 흔들렸다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_devourer_lab_sec"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral slider"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "ephemeral riftwalker"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid riftcaller"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "The space around %1$s distorts."
msgstr "%1$s 주변의 공간이 왜곡됩니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mon_devourer_lab_sec"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#, c-format
msgid "The air around %3$s wavers and shapes appear!"
msgstr "%3$s 주변의 공기가 흔들리고 모양이 나타납니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "mathematician A57"
msgid_plural "mathematician A57s"
msgstr[0] "수학자 A57"

#. ~ Description of monster "mathematician A57"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid ""
"No one could mistake this person for a human; they move with astonishing "
"speed and grace, but every motion is precisely controlled.  As they catch "
"sight of you, a momentary grimace mars the perfection of their unnaturally "
"beautiful face, and as they move quickly toward you, they make a quick "
"gesture and some debris on the floor moves out of their way."
msgstr ""
"아무도 이 사람을 사람으로 착각할 수 없었다. 놀라운 속도와 우아함으로 움직이지만, 모든 동작은 정밀하게 제어되어 있었다. 당신을 "
"보자마자, 순간적인 찡그린 표정이 부자연스러울 정도로 아름다운 얼굴의 완벽함을 망쳐놓았다. 그리고 당신을 향해 빠르게 다가오면서 재빠른 "
"손짓을 하자 바닥에 있던 잔해들이 치워졌다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#, c-format
msgid "Mathematician A57 hits your %2$s with a pipe in a blur of motion!"
msgstr "수학자 A57이 흐릿한 동작으로 파이프로 %2$s을 때렸습니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Mathematician A57 hits <npcname>'s %2$s with a pipe in a blur of motion!"
msgstr "수학자 A57이 흐릿한 동작으로 파이프를 던져 <npcname>의 %2$s를 때렸습니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "Mathematician A57 tries to hit you, but you barely dodge!"
msgstr "수학자 A57이 당신을 때리려고 하지만, 당신은 간신히 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "Mathematician A57 tries to hit <npcname>, but they barely dodge!"
msgstr "수학자 A57이 <npcname>을 공격하려고 하지만, 그들은 간신히 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#, c-format
msgid "Mathematician A57 hits your %2$s without penetrating your armor."
msgstr "수학자 A57은 갑옷을 뚫지 않고 %2$s을 공격했습니다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Mathematician A57 hits <npcname>'s %2$s without penetrating their armor."
msgstr "수학자 A57은 <npcname>의 %2$s를 갑옷을 뚫지 않고 공격합니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mathematician A57"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "Mathematician A57's skin takes on a slightly waxen appearance."
msgstr "수학자 A57의 피부는 약간 밀랍처럼 보인다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mathematician A57"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "Mathematician A57 begins moving much more quickly."
msgstr "수학자 A57은 훨씬 더 빨리 움직이기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "Mathematician A57 blurs as they explode into motion!"
msgstr "수학자 A57이 폭발적으로 움직이면서 흐릿해진다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mathematician A57"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Mathematician A57 stares at %3$s and %3$s is lifted up and pulled towards "
"them!"
msgstr "수학자 A57이 %3$s를 응시하고 있고 %3$s가 들어올려져 그들에게로 끌려갑니다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mathematician A57"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "The air around Mathematician A57Mathematician A57 wavers."
msgstr "수학자 A57수학자 A57 주변의 공기가 흔들린다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mathematician A57"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "The air around Mathematician A57 distorts."
msgstr "수학자 A57 주변의 공기가 왜곡됩니다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "Mathematician A57 touches you and wounds open on your flesh!"
msgstr "수학자 A57이 당신을 만지고 당신의 살에 상처를 입힙니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "Mathematician A57 touches <npcname> and wounds open on their flesh!"
msgstr "수학자 A57이 <npcname>을 건드려 살에 상처를 입혔습니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "Mathematician A57 tries to touch you, but you dodge!"
msgstr "수학자 A57이 당신을 만지려고 하지만, 당신은 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "Mathematician A57 tries to touch <npcname>, but they dodge!"
msgstr "수학자 A57이 <npcname>을 만지려고 하지만 그들은 피한다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "Mathematician A57 touches you but only hits your armor."
msgstr "수학자 A57이 당신을 만지지만 갑옷만 때릴 뿐입니다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "Mathematician A57 touches <npcname> but only hits their armor."
msgstr "수학자 A57이 <npcname>을 만졌지만 갑옷만 맞았다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "Mathematician A57 touches you and you feel weaker!"
msgstr "수학자 A57이 당신을 만지고 당신은 약해지는 걸 느낀다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid "Mathematician A57 touches <npcname> and they flinch!"
msgstr "수학자 A57이 <npcname>을 만지자 그들은 움찔합니다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mathematician A57"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid ""
"Mathematician A57 closes their eyes and their wounds begin healing at a "
"rapid pace!"
msgstr "수학자 A57이 눈을 감자 상처가 빠른 속도로 치유되기 시작했습니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid "bellicose brawler"
msgid_plural "bellicose brawlers"
msgstr[0] "호전적인 싸움꾼"

#. ~ Description of monster "bellicose brawler"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This bloodshot-eyed berserker hurls themselves at the zombie horde.  Despite"
" their crude technique, they are moving faster than you've ever seen a human"
" move, and some of their attacks send the zombies flying."
msgstr ""
"충혈된 눈을 한 광전사가 좀비 무리를 향해 돌진합니다. 엉성한 기술에도 불구하고, 그들은 인간의 움직임보다 훨씬 빠르게 움직이며, 어떤 "
"공격은 좀비들을 날려버립니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid "agitated augur"
msgid_plural "agitated augurs"
msgstr[0] "격앙된 예언자"

#. ~ Description of monster "agitated augur"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This individual looks wildly all around them, constantly muttering to "
"themselves the entire time."
msgstr "이 사람은 주위를 사방으로 둘러보며, 끊임없이 중얼거린다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid "voltaic vigilante"
msgid_plural "voltaic vigilantes"
msgstr[0] "볼타 전압 자경단원"

#. ~ Description of monster "voltaic vigilante"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This person's skin occasionally crackles with lightning.  Their eyes have an"
" eerie blue glow and sparks drip from their hands as they hurl themselves at"
" the zombie hordes."
msgstr ""
"이 사람의 피부는 가끔씩 번개처럼 번쩍인다. 눈은 기괴한 푸른빛을 띠고, 좀비 무리에게 몸을 던질 때마다 손에서 불꽃이 뚝뚝 떨어진다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "voltaic vigilante"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s unleashes a burst of sparks!"
msgstr "%1$s가 불꽃을 뿜어냅니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid "miserable magician"
msgid_plural "miserable magicians"
msgstr[0] "비참한 마법사"

#. ~ Description of monster "miserable magician"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This person seems to be afraid of his own illusionary tricks, not being used"
" to his 'magic' actually working.  He doesn't seem to be able to control it "
"very well, or willfully."
msgstr ""
"이 사람은 자신의 환상적 속임수를 두려워하는 듯합니다. 자신의 '마법'이 실제로 작동하는 것에 익숙하지 않기 때문입니다. 그는 마법을 "
"잘, 혹은 고의로 통제하지 못하는 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "miserable magician"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral radiant"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral beacon"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "atom splitter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s fires a photon beam!"
msgstr "%1$s가 광자빔을 발사합니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid "furious firestarter"
msgid_plural "furious firestarters"
msgstr[0] "격렬한 방화범"

#. ~ Description of monster "furious firestarter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid ""
"The air around this person wavers slightly like summer heat, and flames "
"occasionally flicker around their upraised hand.  There is a focused look in"
" their eyes, and they seem to think they can kill every zombie in sight with"
" their powers."
msgstr ""
"이 사람 주변의 공기는 여름의 열기처럼 살짝 흔들리고, 치켜든 손 주위에서는 불꽃이 가끔씩 깜빡인다. 눈빛에는 집중력이 담겨 있고, 마치"
" 자신의 힘으로 눈에 보이는 모든 좀비를 죽일 수 있다고 생각하는 듯하다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "furious firestarter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s summons a blast of flame!"
msgstr "%1$s가 불꽃을 소환합니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid "panic-stricken psychokinetic"
msgid_plural "panic-stricken psychokinetics"
msgstr[0] "공황에 빠진 사이코키네틱"

#. ~ Description of monster "panic-stricken psychokinetic"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid ""
"They stare around at the monsters nearby, occasionally making throwing "
"motions with their hands.  Sometimes, when they make a throwing motion, one "
"of the zombies is hurled through the air."
msgstr ""
"그들은 주변의 괴물들을 멍하니 바라보며, 가끔씩 손으로 던지는 동작을 합니다. 가끔은 던지는 동작을 할 때, 좀비 한 마리가 공중으로 "
"던져지기도 합니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid "manic mutterer"
msgid_plural "manic mutterers"
msgstr[0] "광적인 중얼거리는 자"

#. ~ Description of monster "manic mutterer"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Holding their head in their hands, they barely seem aware of the world "
"around them, but they still try to escape the zombies.  Looking at them, you"
" feel an eerie sensation like fingers scratching at your mind."
msgstr ""
"두 손으로 머리를 감싸 쥐고 있는 그들은 주변 세상을 거의 의식하지 못하는 듯하면서도, 좀비에게서 벗어나려고 안간힘을 쓴다. 그들을 보면"
" 마치 손가락이 머릿속을 긁는 듯한 섬뜩한 감각이 느껴진다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid "jittery jumper"
msgid_plural "jittery jumpers"
msgstr[0] "초조한 점퍼"

#. ~ Description of monster "jittery jumper"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This person looks vacantly around them with a blank expression on their "
"face.  Then, in an instant, they are gone."
msgstr "그 사람은 멍하니 주변을 둘러보며 멍하니 표정을 짓는다. 그리고 순식간에 사라져 버린다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "jittery jumper"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s suddenly vanishes!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 갑자기 사라졌어요!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid "confused curer"
msgid_plural "confused curers"
msgstr[0] "혼란스러운 치료사"

#. ~ Description of monster "confused curer"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/civilian_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This person mutters to themselves, glancing to and fro with bloodshot eyes."
"  They seem remarkably unscathed for someone in the midst of the apocalypse."
msgstr "이 사람은 충혈된 눈으로 이리저리 훑어보며 중얼거린다. 종말의 한가운데 있는 사람치고는 놀라울 정도로 멀쩡해 보인다."

#. ~ Message of spell "teleport_summon_monster ( [Ψ]Breach Monster )"
#. ~ Message of spell "teleport_summon ( [Ψ]Breach )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/death_effects.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation.json
msgid "The air nearby fractures and something comes through!"
msgstr "근처의 공기가 깨지고 무언가가 들어옵니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
msgid "Dr. Brain"
msgid_plural "Dr. Brains"
msgstr[0] "닥터 브레인"

#. ~ Description of monster "Dr. Brain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
msgid ""
"An ordinary-looking scientist lost amid the carnage, were it not for the "
"bloodshot eyes, the enlarged cranium, and the fact that the zombies ignore "
"them.  Bits of paper and chemistry equipment lazily float in the air near "
"them."
msgstr ""
"충혈된 눈과 커진 두개골, 그리고 좀비들이 그들을 무시한다는 사실이 아니었다면, 평범해 보이는 과학자가 그 학살 속에서 길을 잃은 "
"듯했다. 그들 근처 공중에는 종이 조각과 화학 장비들이 느릿느릿 떠다녔다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Dr. Brain"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral esper"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral brainburner"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "instiller of nightmares"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go mindrender"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/mi_go.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "A roar fills %3$s's mind and the world is blotted out!"
msgstr "%3$s의 머릿속에 포효가 가득 차고 세상이 사라졌습니다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Dr. Brain"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral esper"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral brainburner"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "instiller of nightmares"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
