#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at %3$s!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) %3$s을(를) 응시합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at you and your %2$s is hammered with psionic force!"
msgstr "%1$s가 당신을 응시하고 당신의 %2$s가 사이오닉 힘으로 타격을 받습니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s stares at <npcname> and their %2$s is hammered with psionic force!"
msgstr "%1$s가 <npcname>을 응시하고, 그들의 %2$s가 사이오닉 힘으로 타격을 입습니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at you and you narrowly avoid an unseen attack!"
msgstr "%1$s이 당신을 응시하고 당신은 보이지 않는 공격을 간신히 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares and <npcname> narrowly avoids an unseen attack!"
msgstr "%1$s가 응시하고, <npcname>이 보이지 않는 공격을 간신히 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s stares at you, but the telekinetic attack rebounds off your armor."
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 당신을 응시하지만, 텔레키네틱 공격은 당신의 갑옷에 반사됩니다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s stares at <npcname>, but the telekinetic attack rebounds off their "
"armor."
msgstr "%1$s는 <npcname>을 응시하지만, 텔레키네틱 공격은 갑옷에 반사됩니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "Dr. Brain"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral PKer"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral mindhand"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unstoppable force"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "The air around %1$s wavers."
msgstr "%1$s 주변의 공기가 흔들립니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
msgid "feral security guard, Ψ Division"
msgid_plural "feral security guard, Ψ Divisions"
msgstr[0] "야생 보안 요원, Ψ 부서"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral security guard, Ψ Division"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
msgid ""
"A security guard gone feral, or so you thought.  As you look closer, you "
"notice the relatively-normal appearance, the clear eyes, and the patch on "
"their uniform with a Ψ shape in front of the logo of XEDRA.  The zombies "
"around them ignore them as they move smoothly and purposefully through the "
"ruins."
msgstr ""
"야만적인 경비원이라고 생각했는데. 자세히 보니 비교적 평범한 외모, 맑은 눈, 그리고 제드라 로고 앞에 Ψ 모양이 새겨진 제복 패치가 "
"눈에 띈다. 주변의 좀비들은 그들을 무시하며, 그들이 폐허 속을 부드럽고 단호하게 움직이는 모습을 지켜본다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
msgid "feral security captain, Ψ Division"
msgid_plural "feral security captain, Ψ Divisions"
msgstr[0] "야생 보안 대장, Ψ 부서"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral security captain, Ψ Division"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
msgid ""
"A feral security guard with a military-style uniform, bearing the XEDRA logo"
" and some kind of rank insignia.  Their movements are precise, controlled, "
"and inhumanly smooth, and while their eyes are still bloodshot, they have a "
"spark lacking in most ferals you've seen."
msgstr ""
"군복 차림에 XEDRA 로고와 일종의 계급장을 단 야성적인 경비원. 그들의 움직임은 정확하고, 절제되어 있으며, 비인간적일 정도로 "
"매끄럽습니다. 눈은 아직 충혈되어 있지만, 당신이 봐왔던 대부분의 야성적인 경비원들에게서는 찾아볼 수 없는 활기를 띠고 있습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_lab_psychics.json
msgid "project EMERALD VANGUARD participant"
msgid_plural "project EMERALD VANGUARD participants"
msgstr[0] "프로젝트 에메랄드 뱅가드 참가자"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral adept"
msgid_plural "feral adepts"
msgstr[0] "야생 숙련자"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral adept"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This feral human moves with a disturbing fluid grace.  Despite that, they "
"bear the same crazed expression as all the others."
msgstr ""
"이 흉포한 인간은 불안할 정도로 유려한 우아함으로 움직인다. 그럼에도 불구하고, 다른 모든 존재들과 마찬가지로 광기 어린 표정을 짓고 "
"있다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral dervish"
msgid_plural "feral dervishes"
msgstr[0] "야생 데르비시"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral dervish"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Despite their appearance, this creature moves too quickly and smoothly to be"
" truly human.  Bloodshot eyes are the only indicator that they are not some "
"kind of perfectly precise android."
msgstr ""
"겉모습과는 달리, 이 생명체는 너무 빠르고 매끄럽게 움직여서 진정한 인간이라고는 할 수 없다. 충혈된 눈만이 그들이 완벽하게 정밀한 "
"안드로이드가 아니라는 것을 보여준다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "human whirlwind"
msgid_plural "human whirlwinds"
msgstr[0] "인간 회오리바람"

#. ~ Description of monster "human whirlwind"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"With inhumanly precise movements, this feral moves toward you.  They are "
"clearly still alive, but their mouth is closed and their chest does not rise"
" or fall.  As you watch, they suddenly blur into rapid motion."
msgstr ""
"이 야생 동물은 인간적이지 않을 만큼 정밀한 움직임으로 당신을 향해 다가옵니다. 분명히 살아 있지만, 입은 닫혀 있고 가슴은 "
"오르락내리락하지 않습니다. 당신이 지켜보는 동안, 그들은 갑자기 빠르게 움직이기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "human whirlwind"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "avatar of the storm"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go juggernaut"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/mi_go.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s begins moving much more quickly."
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 훨씬 더 빨리 움직이기 시작했습니다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s blurs as they explode into motion!"
msgstr "%1$s이 폭발하면서 흐릿해집니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral seer"
msgid_plural "feral seers"
msgstr[0] "야생 예언자"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral seer"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This feral human completely lacks the crazed look most of their compatriots "
"have.  Instead, they fix their bloodshot eyes straight at you, seeming to "
"gaze right into your soul, and raise their weapon."
msgstr ""
"이 흉포한 인간은 대부분의 동족들이 지닌 광기 어린 표정과는 전혀 다릅니다. 대신, 그들은 충혈된 눈으로 당신을 똑바로 바라보며 마치 "
"당신의 영혼을 꿰뚫어 보는 듯 무기를 들어 올립니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral visionary"
msgid_plural "feral visionaries"
msgstr[0] "야생 환상가"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral visionary"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"By the time you see this feral, they have already noticed you.  They stare "
"straight at you, regardless of obstruction or any obstacle in between, "
"clutching a weapon in one hand."
msgstr ""
"당신이 이 야성을 볼 때쯤이면, 그들은 이미 당신을 알아차리고 있을 겁니다. 그들은 어떤 방해물이나 장애물이 있어도 당신을 똑바로 "
"쳐다보며, 한 손에는 무기를 움켜쥐고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral visionary"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "The feral visionary throws a rock!"
msgstr "야생의 선견자가 돌을 던진다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "pattern screamer"
msgid_plural "pattern screamers"
msgstr[0] "패턴 스크리머"

#. ~ Description of monster "pattern screamer"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This feral's eyes are closed, but they move with no hesitation, effortlessly"
" avoiding all obstacles in their path, and clutching a large rock in one "
"hand and a long bit of debris in the other.  When you look at them, you hear"
" a static crackling, just on the threshold of inaudibility."
msgstr ""
"이 야생 동물은 눈을 감고 있지만, 조금도 망설임 없이 움직입니다. 앞길에 있는 모든 장애물을 애써 피하며, 한 손에는 커다란 바위를, "
"다른 한 손에는 긴 잔해를 움켜쥐고 있습니다. 그들을 바라보면, 거의 들리지 않을 정도로 정적인 탁탁거리는 소리가 들립니다."

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "pattern screamer"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "With inhuman accuracy, the pattern screamer throws a rock!"
msgstr "비인간적인 정확도로 패턴 스크리머가 돌을 던졌습니다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "pattern screamer"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "Static fills your hearing for a moment, blotting out all other sounds!"
msgstr "잡음이 순간적으로 귀를 가득 채우고 다른 소리는 모두 가려버립니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral sparker"
msgid_plural "feral sparkers"
msgstr[0] "야생 스파커"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral sparker"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This feral has the standard bloodshot eyes and erratic movements, but in "
"addition, some of their gestures unleash a shower of sparks.  They seem "
"totally unphased by the light or the crackling sounds."
msgstr ""
"이 야생 동물은 충혈된 눈과 불규칙한 움직임을 보이지만, 그 외에도 몇몇 몸짓에서 불꽃이 튀는 듯한 느낌을 줍니다. 빛이나 탁탁거리는 "
"소리에도 전혀 동요하지 않는 듯합니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral sparker"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral dynamo"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "avatar of the storm"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's touches %3$s with a jolt!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) %3$s을(를) 갑자기 건드렸습니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral dynamo"
msgid_plural "feral dynamos"
msgstr[0] "야생 다이너모"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral dynamo"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Lightning crackles across this feral's skin, occasionally discharging into "
"the surrounding environment.  Their bloodshot eyes have an eerie blue glow."
msgstr "이 야생 동물의 피부에 번개가 번쩍이며, 가끔 주변 환경으로 방전됩니다. 충혈된 눈은 기괴한 푸른빛을 띱니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral dynamo"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "avatar of the storm"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's unleashes a bolt of lightning!"
msgstr "%1$s가 번개를 발사합니다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral dynamo"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "avatar of the storm"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's waves a hand at %3$s and sparks crackle over their skin!"
msgstr "%1$s가 %3$s에게 손을 흔들자 피부 위에서 불꽃이 튀었습니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "avatar of the storm"
msgid_plural "avatar of the storms"
msgstr[0] "폭풍의 아바타"

#. ~ Description of monster "avatar of the storm"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This feral is barely visible, their body constantly wreathed in bolts of "
"lightning.  A harsh actinic glow casts their surroundings into sharp relief "
"while leaving their own features concealed.  Crackling lightning nearly-"
"constantly explodes from their body and grounds itself nearby."
msgstr ""
"이 야생 동물은 거의 보이지 않으며, 온몸에 끊임없이 번개가 꽂혀 있습니다. 강렬한 광휘가 주변을 선명하게 비추는 반면, 자신의 모습은 "
"감춰져 있습니다. 끊임없이 터지는 번개가 몸에서 터져 나와 근처에 꽂힙니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "avatar of the storm"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's gestures and lighting crackles around them!"
msgstr "%1$s의 몸짓과 그 주변에서 번쩍이는 딱딱거리는 소리!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral radiant"
msgid_plural "feral radiants"
msgstr[0] "야생 광휘"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral radiant"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This feral's skin has some sort of radiance.  Their eyes are bright with "
"light and there's a slight shimmer around their form."
msgstr "이 야생 동물의 피부는 어딘가 광채가 납니다. 눈은 빛으로 가득 차 있고, 몸 주변에는 희미한 빛이 있습니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral radiant"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral beacon"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "atom splitter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's form is shifting with illusions!"
msgstr "%1$s의 모습이 환상으로 변하고 있어요!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral radiant"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral beacon"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "atom splitter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's looks at you for a moment."
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 당신을 잠시 바라봅니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral beacon"
msgid_plural "feral beacons"
msgstr[0] "야생 비콘"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral beacon"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Almost blinding light radiates from this feral's skin.  They seem to have "
"greater control over their powers than most ferals, but they are still "
"clearly insane."
msgstr ""
"이 야생 동물의 피부에서는 눈부실 정도로 강렬한 빛이 뿜어져 나온다. 대부분의 야생 동물보다 자신의 힘을 더 잘 제어하는 듯하지만, "
"그래도 분명히 제정신이 아닌 듯하다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral beacon"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "atom splitter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s concentrates and unleashes a super-luminous flash!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 집중하여 매우 밝은 섬광을 발사합니다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral beacon"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at %3$s and %3$s is enveloped in an eerie glow!"
msgstr "%1$s가 %3$s를 응시하고, %3$s는 섬뜩한 빛에 싸여 있습니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "atom splitter"
msgid_plural "atom splitters"
msgstr[0] "원자 분열기"

#. ~ Description of monster "atom splitter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This feral glows brighter than streetlamp, casting their surroundings into "
"sharp relief amid the glow.  They are clearly still lucid but their "
"expression is blank and their eyes are unfocused."
msgstr ""
"이 야생 동물은 가로등보다 더 밝게 빛나며, 그 빛 속에서 주변이 선명하게 드러납니다. 여전히 정신은 또렷하지만, 표정은 멍하고 눈은 "
"초점이 없습니다."

#. ~ Death message of monster "atom splitter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s shrieks and unleashes a powerful blinding flash!"
msgstr "%1$s가 비명을 지르며 눈부시게 강력한 섬광을 발사합니다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "atom splitter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at you and you are enveloped in an eerie glow!"
msgstr "%1$s가 당신을 응시하고 당신은 섬뜩한 빛에 휩싸입니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral burner"
msgid_plural "feral burners"
msgstr[0] "야생 버너"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral burner"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This feral human looks a little more composed than most, but only a little."
"  Their clothes are singed and the air around them shimmers like a summer "
"heat haze."
msgstr ""
"이 야생 인간은 대부분보다 조금 더 차분해 보이지만, 아주 조금일 뿐이다. 옷은 그을렸고, 주변 공기는 여름의 아지랑이처럼 희미하게 "
"빛난다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and your %2$s is engulfed in flames!"
msgstr "%1$s의 제스처와 함께 %2$s가 불길에 휩싸입니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and <npcname>'s %2$s is engulfed in flames!"
msgstr "%1$s의 몸짓과 <npcname>의 %2$s이(가) 불길에 휩싸였습니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and you narrowly avoid a burst of flame!"
msgstr "%1$s 제스처를 하자 불꽃이 터지는 것을 간신히 피했습니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and <npcname> narrowly avoids a burst of flame!"
msgstr "%1$s가 몸짓을 하고 <npcname>이 불꽃 폭발을 간신히 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s gestures and your %2$s is engulfed in flames, but they do not burn you."
msgstr "%1$s의 몸짓과 당신의 %2$s가 불길에 휩싸이지만, 당신은 타지 않습니다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s gestures and <npcname>'s %2$s is engulfed in flames, but it does not "
"burn them."
msgstr "%1$s의 몸짓과 <npcname>의 %2$s이(가) 불길에 휩싸였지만, 그들을 태우지는 못했습니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral burner"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral inferno"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unending conflagration"
#. ~ Message of spell "pyrokinetic_flash ( [Ψ]Brilliant Flash )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "The air erupts into an eye-searing flash!"
msgstr "공기가 눈을 찌르는 듯한 섬광으로 폭발합니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral inferno"
msgid_plural "feral infernos"
msgstr[0] "야생 인페르노"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral inferno"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Through a cloud of smoke and fire, you can see a human form.  Their body is "
"barely visible through the flames."
msgstr "연기와 불길 사이로 사람의 형체가 보입니다. 불길 속에서 그들의 몸은 거의 보이지 않습니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral inferno"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unending conflagration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and summons a conflagration!"
msgstr "%1$s가 손짓하며 대화재를 불러일으킨다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "unending conflagration"
msgid_plural "unending conflagrations"
msgstr[0] "끝없는 대화재"

#. ~ Description of monster "unending conflagration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Occasionally through the fire and smoke, you can see a human form.  Their "
"flesh blackens and withers in the heat, then the burns retreat and healthy "
"skin replaces it, over and over again."
msgstr ""
"이따금 불과 연기 사이로 사람의 형체가 보입니다. 살은 열기에 검게 변하고 시들다가, 화상이 사라지고 건강한 피부로 다시 태어나기를 "
"반복합니다."

#. ~ Death message of monster "unending conflagration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s screams and the flames around them burst outward!"
msgstr "%1$s가 비명을 지르며 그들 주변의 불꽃이 터져나왔습니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral PKer"
msgid_plural "feral PKers"
msgstr[0] "야생 PKer"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral PKer"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Though they still have a maniacal expression, this feral human is "
"distinguished by the rocks floating in the around around them."
msgstr "그들은 여전히 광적인 표정을 짓고 있지만, 이 야만적인 인간은 주변에 떠다니는 바위로 구별됩니다."

#. ~ Death message of monster "feral PKer"
#. ~ Death message of monster "feral mindhand"
#. ~ Death message of monster "unstoppable force"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "As the %1$s dies, a wave of force explodes outward!"
msgstr "%1$s가 죽자 힘의 파동이 바깥쪽으로 폭발합니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral mindhand"
msgid_plural "feral mindhands"
msgstr[0] "야생 마인드핸드"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral mindhand"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This feral human moves quickly across uneven terrain and, when you look more"
" closely, you see that they are floating just above the ground.  The air "
"around them is distorted strangely, like looking through the surface of "
"water."
msgstr ""
"이 야생 인간은 울퉁불퉁한 지형을 빠르게 이동하는데, 자세히 보면 땅 바로 위에 떠 있는 것이 보입니다. 주변 공기는 마치 수면을 통해 "
"보는 것처럼 이상하게 왜곡되어 있습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "unstoppable force"
msgid_plural "unstoppable forces"
msgstr[0] "멈출 수 없는 힘"

#. ~ Description of monster "unstoppable force"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Hovering half a meter off the ground, this feral human is surrounded by a "
"whirling cloud of rock, dust, splintered wood, and various household "
"objects.  As they move, the ground occasionally shakes."
msgstr ""
"지면에서 50cm 정도 높이에 떠 있는 이 야생 인간은 돌, 먼지, 쪼개진 나무 조각, 그리고 온갖 집안 물건들이 소용돌이치는 구름에 "
"둘러싸여 있습니다. 그들이 움직일 때마다 땅이 가끔씩 흔들립니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unstoppable force"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s gestures and the ground bursts apart!"
msgstr "%1$s 제스처를 하자 땅이 터져 나갑니다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "unstoppable force"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s closes their eyes and the ground shakes!"
msgstr "%1$s가 눈을 감자 땅이 흔들립니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral esper"
msgid_plural "feral espers"
msgstr[0] "야생 에스퍼"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral esper"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This feral human lacks the crazed look most of their kind have.  Instead, "
"their gaze is unfocused, as though listening to voices only they can hear."
msgstr ""
"이 야성적인 인간은 대부분의 동족들이 지닌 광기 어린 표정을 지니지 않았다. 오히려 그들의 시선은 마치 자신만 들을 수 있는 목소리에 귀"
" 기울이는 듯 흐릿했다."

#. ~ Death message of monster "feral esper"
#. ~ Death message of monster "feral brainburner"
#. ~ Death message of monster "instiller of nightmares"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "As the %1$s dies, a scream fills your mind!"
msgstr "%1$s가 죽자, 당신의 머릿속에는 비명이 울려퍼집니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral brainburner"
msgid_plural "feral brainburners"
msgstr[0] "야생 브레인버너"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral brainburner"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Before you see them, you can feel it--a sensation like spiders crawling "
"along your brain.  As you shudder, this feral human looks at you and smiles "
"slightly."
msgstr ""
"그들을 보기도 전에, 당신은 그것을 느낄 수 있습니다. 마치 거미가 뇌를 따라 기어가는 듯한 감각이죠. 당신이 몸을 떨자, 이 야생 "
"인간이 당신을 바라보며 살짝 미소 짓습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "instiller of nightmares"
msgid_plural "instillers of nightmares"
msgstr[0] "악몽을 심는 자"

#. ~ Description of monster "instiller of nightmares"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Just another feral, with the typical bloodshot eyes and intense expression."
"  You have only a moment to think that before your heart starts racing in "
"your chest and the hair stands up on the back of your neck as every instinct"
" screams at you to run."
msgstr ""
"충혈된 눈과 강렬한 표정을 지닌, 그저 또 다른 야생 동물일 뿐이다. 그 생각을 하는 순간, 심장이 쿵쾅거리기 시작하고 목덜미에 소름이 "
"돋으며 모든 본능이 도망치라고 소리친다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "instiller of nightmares"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s eyes suddenly go wide!"
msgstr "%1$s의 눈이 갑자기 커졌어요!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "instiller of nightmares"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at %3$s and they freeze like a frightened rabbit!"
msgstr "%1$s가 %3$s를 응시하자 두 사람은 겁에 질린 토끼처럼 굳어버렸습니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral jumper"
msgid_plural "feral jumpers"
msgstr[0] "야생 점퍼"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral jumper"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"What was once empty air suddenly contains this feral human.  They have the "
"same crazed expression as their fellows, but their gaze is focused on more "
"distant locations.  A sturdy piece of debris from some ruin dangles from one"
" of their hands."
msgstr ""
"한때 텅 비어 있던 공간에 갑자기 이 흉포한 인간이 깃들었다. 그들은 동료들과 마찬가지로 광기 어린 표정을 짓고 있지만, 시선은 더 먼 "
"곳을 향하고 있다. 그들의 손에는 어떤 폐허에서 나온 튼튼한 잔해 조각이 매달려 있다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral jumper"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s looks at %3$s and the world lurches."
msgstr "%1$s가 %3$s를 바라보자 세상이 흔들린다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral slider"
msgid_plural "feral sliders"
msgstr[0] "야생 슬라이더"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral slider"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Every time you blink, this debris-wielding feral is in a different place.  "
"They are always in motion without actually crossing the intervening space."
msgstr ""
"눈을 깜빡일 때마다 이 잔해를 휘두르는 야생 동물은 다른 곳에 있습니다. 항상 움직이고 있을 뿐, 실제로는 중간 공간을 넘지 않습니다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The air around %1$s's hands distorts and they hit your %2$s with their "
"weapon!"
msgstr "%1$s의 손 주변의 공기가 왜곡되고 그들은 무기로 %2$s를 공격합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The air around %1$s's hands distorts and they hit <npcname>'s %2$s with "
"their weapon!"
msgstr "%1$s의 손 주변의 공기가 왜곡되고, 그들은 무기로 <npcname>의 %2$s를 공격합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s tries to hit you as the air around their hands warps, but you dodge!"
msgstr "%1$s가 손 주변의 공기를 휘감으며 당신을 때리려 하지만, 당신은 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s tries to hit <npcname> as the air around their hands warps, but they "
"dodge!"
msgstr "%1$s가 손 주변의 공기가 뒤틀리자 <npcname>을 공격하려 하지만, 그들은 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The air around %1$s's hands distorts and they hit your %2$s without "
"penetrating your armor."
msgstr "%1$s의 손 주변의 공기가 왜곡되어 갑옷을 뚫지 못한 채 %2$s에게 타격을 입힙니다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The air around %1$s's hands distorts and they hit <npcname>'s %2$s without "
"penetrating their armor."
msgstr "%1$s의 손 주변의 공기가 왜곡되어 <npcname>의 %2$s의 갑옷을 뚫지 못하고 공격합니다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s touches you and the world shifts around you!"
msgstr "%1$s가 당신을 만지고, 당신 주변의 세상이 바뀝니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s touches <npcname> and the world shifts around them!"
msgstr "%1$s가 <npcname>을 터치하자 그들 주변의 세상이 움직입니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s reaches for you but you avoid their touch!"
msgstr "%s가 당신에게 다가가지만 당신은 그들의 접촉을 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s reaches for <npcname> but they dodge!"
msgstr "%s가 <npcname>에게 다가가지만 그들은 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral slider"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "ephemeral riftwalker"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "The air around %1$s's hands wavers."
msgstr "%1$s의 손 주변의 공기가 흔들린다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "ephemeral riftwalker"
msgid_plural "ephemeral riftwalkers"
msgstr[0] "덧없는 균열 보행자"

#. ~ Description of monster "ephemeral riftwalker"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This feral barely seems to exist in the real world.  They constantly vanish "
"and reappear, weird light and strange mist following in their wake."
msgstr ""
"이 야성은 현실 세계에 거의 존재하지 않는 듯합니다. 끊임없이 사라졌다가 다시 나타나며, 그 뒤를 기묘한 빛과 안개가 따라다닙니다."

#. ~ Death message of monster "ephemeral riftwalker"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "As the %1$s dies, the air warps around them!"
msgstr "%1$s가 죽자, 그들 주변의 공기가 휘어집니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The air around %1$s's hands distorts and they hit your %2$s seemingly out of"
" nowhere!"
msgstr "%1$s의 손 주변의 공기가 왜곡되어 갑자기 %2$s에게 닿습니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The air around %1$s's hands distorts and they hit <npcname>'s %2$s seemingly"
" out of nowhere!"
msgstr "%1$s의 손 주변의 공기가 왜곡되면서 갑자기 <npcname>의 %2$s에게 타격을 입힙니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s touches you and the world warps around you!"
msgstr "%1$s가 당신을 만지면 당신 주변의 세상이 뒤틀립니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s touches <npcname> and the world warps around them!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) <npcname>을(를) 만지자 그 주변 세계가 뒤틀립니다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "ephemeral riftwalker"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s touches %3$s and the world around %3$s wavers."
msgstr "%1$s이(가) %3$s에 닿으면 %3$s 주변 세계가 흔들립니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "ephemeral riftwalker"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "The lights around %1$s waver and shapes appear near %3$s."
msgstr "%1$s 주변의 불빛이 흔들리고, %3$s 근처에 모양이 나타납니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral mender"
msgid_plural "feral menders"
msgstr[0] "야생 수리공"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral mender"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"Other than the intense expression, this feral human looks to be the picture "
"of health.  They could have starred in a healthcare advertisement before the"
" Cataclysm.  Only the jagged bit of wood clutched like a club indicates "
"something is wrong."
msgstr ""
"강렬한 표정을 제외하면, 이 야생 인간은 건강해 보인다. 대격변 이전에 건강 광고에 나왔을 법한 모습이었다. 곤봉처럼 움켜쥐고 있는 "
"뾰족한 나무 조각만이 뭔가 잘못되었다는 것을 보여준다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s touches you but only hits your armor."
msgstr "%1$s가 당신을 만지지만 갑옷에만 닿습니다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s touches <npcname> but only hits their armor."
msgstr "%1$s가 <npcname>을 터치했지만 갑옷만 때렸습니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "feral regenerator"
msgid_plural "feral regenerators"
msgstr[0] "야생 재생자"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral regenerator"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This feral human doesn't even have bloodshot eyes.  Their skin shines, their"
" eyes are clear, and they move with a relaxed confidence among the "
"apocalypse.  Only the indifference of the nearby zombies indicates something"
" is deeply wrong."
msgstr ""
"이 흉포한 인간은 눈조차 충혈되지 않았다. 윤기 나는 피부에, 맑은 눈망울에, 마치 종말의 공포 속에서 느긋하고 자신감 넘치는 모습으로 "
"움직였다. 주변 좀비들의 무관심만이 무언가 심각하게 잘못되었다는 것을 보여준다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s touches you and wounds open on your flesh!"
msgstr "%1$s가 당신을 만지고 살에 상처가 생겼어요!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s touches <npcname> and wounds open on their flesh!"
msgstr "%1$s가 <npcname>을 건드려 살에 상처를 입혔습니다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral regenerator"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "font of vitality"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s closes their eyes and their wounds begin healing at a rapid pace!"
msgstr "%1$s는 눈을 감고 상처가 빠른 속도로 치유되기 시작합니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid "font of vitality"
msgid_plural "fonts of vitality"
msgstr[0] "활력의 샘"

#. ~ Description of monster "font of vitality"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This is the healthiest person you've even seen, especially after the end of "
"the world.  Their skin positively glows, and as you watch them brush past a "
"jagged chunk of wood to get to you, the wound they receive immediately stops"
" bleeding and rapidly begins to close."
msgstr ""
"이 사람은 당신이 본 사람 중 가장 건강한 사람입니다. 특히 세상이 끝난 후라면 더욱 그렇습니다. 피부는 밝게 빛나고, 그들이 뾰족한 "
"나무 조각을 스쳐 지나 당신에게 오는 모습을 지켜보는 동안, 그들이 입은 상처는 즉시 피가 멈추고 빠르게 아물기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Death message of monster "font of vitality"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/feral_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "As %s succumbs to their wounds, they suddenly rise up with new vigor!"
msgstr "%s가 상처에 굴복하자, 그들은 갑자기 새로운 활력을 얻어 일어납니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/mi_go.json
msgid "mi-go juggernaut"
msgid_plural "mi-go juggernauts"
msgstr[0] "미-고 저거너트"

#. ~ Description of monster "mi-go juggernaut"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/mi_go.json
msgid ""
"This creature resembles the smaller mi-go like a grizzly bear resembles a "
"human.  Its enormous, thick body is covered in an iridescent segmented "
"carapace, like a scarab crossed with an isopod.  It boasts several pairs of "
"deadly looking claws and other appendages, and it moves with a strange, slow"
" grace, like an otherworldly dancer.  Sometimes, it moves so quickly that "
"its movements are only a blur."
msgstr ""
"이 생물은 작은 미고와 닮았는데, 마치 회색곰이 인간을 닮았듯이 말입니다. 거대하고 두꺼운 몸은 마치 등각류와 스카라베를 합친 듯한 "
"무지갯빛의 마디진 등딱지로 덮여 있습니다. 여러 쌍의 치명적인 발톱과 다른 부속 기관을 자랑하며, 마치 이 세상의 무용수처럼 기묘하고 "
"느리게 우아하게 움직입니다. 때로는 너무 빨리 움직여서 움직임이 흐릿하게 보일 때도 있습니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mi-go juggernaut"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/mi_go.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s moves so quickly it's nothing but a blur!"
msgstr "%1$s은(는) 너무 빨리 움직여서 아무것도 보이지 않습니다!"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/mi_go.json
msgid "mi-go lightbringer"
msgid_plural "mi-go lightbringers"
msgstr[0] "미-고 라이트브링어"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/mi_go.json
msgid "mi-go mindrender"
msgid_plural "mi-go mindrenders"
msgstr[0] "미-고 마인드렌더"

#. ~ NPC message in effect in EoC "EOC_VITAKIN_FERAL_VITA3_DEGENERATING_TOUCH"
#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VITAKIN_FERAL_VITA3_DEGENERATING_TOUCH"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_eoc_attacks.json
msgid "Your flesh begins decaying before your eyes!"
msgstr "당신의 살이 눈앞에서 썩기 시작합니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_EATER_DRAIN_2"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_eoc_spells.json
msgid "You feel a sudden emptiness."
msgstr "갑자기 공허함을 느낀다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_NULL_BREAK_CONCENTRATION"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_eoc_spells.json
msgid ""
"Icy fingers crawl across the surface of your mind, but your powers repel "
"them."
msgstr "차가운 손가락이 당신의 마음 표면을 기어다니지만, 당신의 힘은 그것을 막아냅니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_NULL_BREAK_CONCENTRATION_3" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_NULL_BREAK_CONCENTRATION_2" in nested
#. EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_NULL_BREAK_CONCENTRATION"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_eoc_spells.json
msgid "An icy dagger seems to stab into your brain."
msgstr "얼음 단검이 당신의 뇌를 찌르는 듯합니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_NULL_BREAK_CONCENTRATION_3" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_NULL_BREAK_CONCENTRATION_2" in nested
#. EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_NULL_BREAK_CONCENTRATION"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_NULL_BREAK_CONCENTRATION_2" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_NULL_BREAK_CONCENTRATION"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_eoc_spells.json
msgid "Icy fingers crawl across your brain for a moment."
msgstr "차가운 손가락이 잠시 당신의 뇌를 스쳐 지나간다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ELECTROKIN_MONSTER_PARALYSIS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_eoc_spells.json
msgid ""
"Your control over your own nerve impulses prevent the attack from taking "
"hold."
msgstr "자신의 신경 자극을 통제하면 공격이 시작되는 것을 막을 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of spell "whispering_amalgamation_apply_mindsight ( Eater
#. apply mindsight )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_eoc_spells.json
msgid "Add the effect to give the whispering_amalgamation mindsight."
msgstr "속삭임_혼합에 통찰력을 주기 위해 효과를 추가합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SILENT_ONE_DRAINING_POWER"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_eoc_spells.json
msgid "You feel a sudden wave of fatigue!"
msgstr "갑자기 피로감이 밀려오네요!"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SILENT_ONE_DETECT_PSIONIC_ACTIVITY"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_eoc_spells.json
msgid ""
"The hairs rise on the back of your neck as you feel a sudden sense of "
"menace."
msgstr "당신은 갑자기 위협을 느끼면서 목덜미에 소름이 돋습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_SILENT_ONE_DETECT_PSIONIC_ACTIVITY_AGGRESSIVE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_eoc_spells.json
msgid "A chill aura emanates from the silent one."
msgstr "조용한 사람에게서 차가운 기운이 느껴진다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
msgid "mindhunter"
msgid_plural "mindhunters"
msgstr[0] "마인드헌터"

#. ~ Description of monster "mindhunter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
msgid ""
"A hulking zombie swollen to the size of six men.  Its inky black eyes are "
"locked on you, gleaming with malign intent.  No matter how far you run, it "
"always seems to find you."
msgstr ""
"여섯 명 크기로 부풀어 오른 거대한 좀비. 새까만 눈이 당신을 노려보며 악의를 품고 번뜩인다. 아무리 멀리 달려도, 항상 당신을 찾아내는"
" 듯하다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's wounds begin healing at a rapid pace!"
msgstr "%1$s의 상처가 빠른 속도로 치유되기 시작했습니다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "zombie null"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "zombie breaker"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s looks at %3$s and the static on the edge of your vision flickers."
msgstr "%1$s이 %3$s을 바라보고 시야 가장자리의 정전기가 깜빡인다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares at you and a powerful force hurls you through the air!"
msgstr "%1$s이 당신을 응시하고 강력한 힘으로 당신을 공중으로 던집니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s stares at <npcname> and a powerful force hurls them through the air!"
msgstr "%1$s가 <npcname>을 응시하자 강력한 힘이 그들을 공중으로 던졌습니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s stares at you, and you feel a crushing pressure for a moment before the "
"feeling vanishes!"
msgstr "%s가 당신을 응시하고, 당신은 잠시 동안 엄청난 압박감을 느낀 후 그 느낌이 사라집니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s stares at <npcname> but nothing happens!"
msgstr "%s가 <npcname>을 응시하지만 아무 일도 일어나지 않습니다!"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mindhunter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_overrides.json
#, c-format
msgid "Lightning crackles around %1$s!"
msgstr "%1$s 주변에서 번개가 번쩍입니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s shrieks at your %2$s!"
msgstr "%1$s이(가) 당신의 %2$s에게 비명을 지릅니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s looks at you and your mind reels!"
msgstr "%1$s이 당신을 보고 당신의 마음이 흔들립니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s looks at <npcname> and they flinch as if struck!"
msgstr "%1$s가 <npcname>을 보더니, 마치 맞은 듯이 움찔합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s looks at you but nothing happens!"
msgstr "%s가 당신을 바라보지만 아무 일도 일어나지 않습니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
#, c-format
msgid "%s looks at <npcname> but nothing happens!"
msgstr "%s가 <npcname>을 보지만 아무 일도 일어나지 않습니다!"

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
msgid "hurled rubble"
msgid_plural "hurled rubbles"
msgstr[0] "투척용 자갈"

#. ~ Description of gun "hurled rubble"
#. ~ Description of "hurled rubble"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monster_special_attacks.json
msgid "Stone at the ready to crush that which isn't part of the blob."
msgstr "블롭의 일부가 아닌 것들에 부딪혀 부숴버릴 준비가 끝난 돌입니다."

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokin_flamethrower_hellhound_monster (
#. [Ψ]Flamethrower Hellhound )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monsters_spells.json
msgid "Spray fire in a cone in front of you, if you're a hellhound."
msgstr "당신이 지옥의 사냥개라면, 당신 앞에 원뿔 모양으로 불을 뿜으세요."

#. ~ Sound description of spell "telekinetic_hammer_monster ( [Ψ]Mindhammer
#. Monster )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monsters_spells.json
msgid "a thud"
msgstr "쿵 하는 소리"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "telekinetic_explosion_monster ( Wrecking Ball
#. Monster )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "telekinetic_explosion ( [Ψ]Wrecking Ball )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monsters_spells.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
msgid "a loud crash!"
msgstr "큰 충돌음!"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "telekinetic_earthshaker_monster_real (
#. Earthshaker Monster )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "telekinetic_earthshaker ( [Ψ]Earthshaker )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monsters_spells.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/telekinesis.json
msgid "the ground shaking!"
msgstr "땅이 흔들린다!"

#. ~ Sound description of spell "telepathic_shrieking_monster ( [Ψ]Telepathic
#. Shrieking Monster )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monsters_spells.json
msgid "static"
msgstr "공전"

#. ~ Description of spell "hidebehind_apply_mindsight ( Hidebehind apply
#. mindsight )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monsters_spells.json
msgid "Add the effect to give the hidebehind mindsight."
msgstr "숨어 있는 사람에게 통찰력을 주는 효과를 추가합니다."

#. ~ Description of spell "eater_apply_mindsight ( Eater apply mindsight )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/monsters_spells.json
msgid "Add the effect to give the eater mindsight."
msgstr "먹는 사람에게 통찰력을 주는 효과를 추가합니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/nether.json
msgid "eater"
msgid_plural "eaters"
msgstr[0] "먹는 자"

#. ~ Description of monster "eater"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A thicket of opalescent, faintly-glowing diaphanous fronds, lazily waving in"
" the air, with parts of them constantly vanishing and reappearing.  The "
"central core, if it exists, is obscured by their constant motion.  There are"
" no obvious sensory organs, but as you approach the motion of the fronds "
"changes slightly."
msgstr ""
"유백색의 희미하게 빛나는 반투명한 잎들이 공중에서 느릿느릿 흔들리며, 그 일부는 끊임없이 사라졌다 다시 나타났다 합니다. 중심부가 "
"존재한다면, 그 끊임없는 움직임 때문에 그 모습은 보이지 않습니다. 뚜렷한 감각 기관은 없지만, 가까이 다가가면 잎들의 움직임이 조금씩 "
"달라집니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "eater"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/nether.json
msgid "The eater's fronds lazily drift to and fro."
msgstr "먹는 자의 잎사귀가 느긋하게 앞뒤로 떠다닌다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/nether.json
msgid "silent one"
msgid_plural "silent ones"
msgstr[0] "침묵하는 자"

#. ~ Description of monster "silent one"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A patch of gray cloud that sometimes collapses into the distinct form of a "
"robed and cowled figure.  The depths of the cowl are empty, and no hands or "
"legs extend out of the robe.  It floats above the ground, the cowl never "
"looking to the left or the right, but you have the uncanny sense that it's "
"watching you."
msgstr ""
"회색 구름 덩어리가 가끔씩 로브와 두건을 쓴 형체로 뚜렷하게 변하는 모습이다. 두건의 안쪽은 텅 비어 있고, 손이나 다리도 로브 밖으로 "
"나오지 않는다. 두건은 좌우로 흔들리지 않고 땅 위에 떠 있지만, 마치 당신을 지켜보고 있는 듯한 기묘한 예감이 든다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "silent one"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's empty cowl turns toward %3$s."
msgstr "%1$s의 빈 카울이 %3$s 쪽으로 향합니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/psi_summons.json
msgid "warm air"
msgid_plural "warm airs"
msgstr[0] "따뜻한 공기"

#. ~ Description of monster "warm air"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/psi_summons.json
msgid "A patch of warm air, heated by pyrokinesis."
msgstr "열분해로 인해 가열된 따뜻한 공기 덩어리."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/psi_summons.json
msgid "Lucid Shadow"
msgid_plural "Lucid Shadows"
msgstr[0] "명료한 그림자"

#. ~ Description of monster "Lucid Shadow"
#. ~ Description of monster "Phantom Legionnaire"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/psi_summons.json
msgid "A light illusion made to look like yourself."
msgstr "자신처럼 보이도록 만든 가벼운 환상."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/psi_summons.json
msgid "Phantom Legionnaire"
msgid_plural "Phantom Legionnaires"
msgstr[0] "환영 군단병"

#. ~ Death message of monster "Phantom Legionnaire"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/psi_summons.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s explodes in a brilliant burst of light!"
msgstr "%s가 눈부신 빛으로 폭발합니다!"

#. ~ Description of species "PSI_NULL"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/species_new.json
msgid "a being immune to psionics"
msgstr "사이오닉스에 면역이 있는 존재"

#. ~ Description of species "TELEKIN_PUSHPULL_NULL"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/species_new.json
msgid "a being immune to being thrown telekinetically"
msgstr "텔레키네틱으로 던져지는 것에 면역이 있는 존재"

#. ~ Description of species "YRAX_CONSTRUCT"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/species_new.json
msgid ""
"a robot, maybe, but one far more advanced than anything Earth could dream of"
" producing"
msgstr "로봇일 수도 있지만 지구가 꿈꿀 수 있는 것보다 훨씬 더 진보된 로봇일 수도 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of species "PLANT_INFLAMMABLE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/species_new.json
msgid "a plant with no fear of fire"
msgstr "불을 두려워하지 않는 식물"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
msgid "triffid seedseer"
msgid_plural "triffid seedseers"
msgstr[0] "트리피드 씨앗 예언자"

#. ~ Description of monster "triffid seedseer"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
msgid ""
"A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered "
"stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  "
"You have the distinct sense that it's watching you."
msgstr ""
"무스만큼 키가 큰, 덩굴처럼 뻗은 이동식 식물입니다. 나무껍질로 덮인 줄기 하나가 꽃이 만발한 머리를 지탱하고, 그 안에 마비시키는 "
"독침이 숨겨져 있습니다. 마치 당신을 지켜보고 있다는 듯한 예감이 듭니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid seedseer"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid greenseer"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s's fronds quiver."
msgstr "%1$s의 잎사귀가 떨립니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
msgid "triffid flamebreaker"
msgid_plural "triffid flamebreakers"
msgstr[0] "트리피드 불꽃 파괴자"

#. ~ Description of monster "triffid flamebreaker"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
msgid ""
"A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered "
"stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  "
"The air around it wavers slightly, like a summer haze."
msgstr ""
"무스만큼 키가 큰, 덩굴처럼 뻗은 이동식 식물. 나무껍질로 덮인 줄기 하나가 꽃이 만발한 머리를 지탱하고, 그 안에는 마비시키는 독침이 "
"숨겨져 있다. 주변 공기는 여름 안개처럼 살짝 흔들린다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its fronds and your %2$s is engulfed in flames!"
msgstr "%1$s가 잎사귀를 흔들고 당신의 %2$s가 불길에 휩싸입니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its fronds and <npcname>'s %2$s is engulfed in flames!"
msgstr "%1$s가 잎사귀를 흔들고 <npcname>의 %2$s가 불길에 휩싸입니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its fronds and you narrowly avoid a burst of flame!"
msgstr "%1$s가 잎사귀를 흔들자 불꽃이 터져 나오는 것을 간신히 피했습니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its fronds and <npcname> narrowly avoids a burst of flame!"
msgstr "%1$s가 잎사귀를 흔들고, <npcname>이 불꽃을 간신히 피합니다!"

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s waves its fronds and your %2$s is engulfed in flames, but they do not "
"burn you."
msgstr "%1$s가 잎사귀를 흔들고 당신의 %2$s가 불길에 휩싸이지만, 당신은 타지 않습니다."

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s waves its fronds and <npcname>'s %2$s is engulfed in flames, but it "
"does not burn them."
msgstr "%1$s가 잎사귀를 흔들고 <npcname>의 %2$s가 불길에 휩싸이지만, 태우지는 않습니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid flamebreaker"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its fronds and the flames gutter and die."
msgstr "%1$s가 잎사귀를 흔들자 불꽃이 타오르며 죽습니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid flamebreaker"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid riftcaller"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s waves its fronds at %3$s."
msgstr "%1$s이(가) %3$s에게 잎사귀를 흔듭니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
msgid "triffid riftcaller"
msgid_plural "triffid riftcallers"
msgstr[0] "트리피드 균열 소환자"

#. ~ Description of monster "triffid riftcaller"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
msgid ""
"A creeping mobile plant, as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-covered "
"stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed within.  "
"Occasionally it vanishes and reappears elsewhere."
msgstr ""
"무스만큼 키가 큰 덩굴성 이동식 식물입니다. 나무껍질로 덮인 줄기 하나가 꽃이 만발한 머리를 지탱하고 있는데, 그 안에는 마비시키는 "
"독침이 숨겨져 있습니다. 가끔 사라졌다가 다른 곳에 다시 나타나기도 합니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "triffid riftcaller"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/triffids.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s waves its fronds at %3$s and the air around %3$s solidifies into "
"shapes."
msgstr "%1$s가 %3$s에게 잎사귀를 흔들고, %3$s 주변의 공기가 모양을 갖추어 굳어집니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
msgid "zombie blank"
msgid_plural "zombie blanks"
msgstr[0] "블랭크 좀비"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie blank"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
msgid ""
"This zombie looks fairly ordinary, other than walking slightly more quickly "
"than the standard shambling.  But there's something subtly wrong about it.  "
"When you look directly at it, gray static flickers on the edge of your "
"vision and you hear a very low droning hum."
msgstr ""
"이 좀비는 일반적인 어슬렁거리는 걸음걸이보다 약간 더 빠른 걸음걸이를 제외하면 겉보기에는 평범해 보입니다. 하지만 뭔가 미묘하게 이상해 "
"보입니다. 좀비를 똑바로 쳐다보면 시야 가장자리에 회색 잡음이 깜빡이고, 아주 낮게 웅웅거리는 듯한 웅웅거리는 소리가 들립니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
msgid "zombie null"
msgid_plural "zombie nulls"
msgstr[0] "널 좀비"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie null"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
msgid ""
"This zombie's limbs are elongated and its torso is stretched, causing it to "
"occasionally drop on all fours to skitter faster than a normal walk.  When "
"you look directly at it, gray static flickers on the edge of your vision and"
" you hear a very low droning hum."
msgstr ""
"이 좀비는 팔다리가 길고 몸통이 팽팽하게 당겨져 있어, 가끔 네 발로 엎드려 평소 걸음걸이보다 더 빠르게 쏜살같이 달려갑니다. 좀비를 "
"직접 보면 시야 가장자리에 회색 잡음이 깜빡이고, 아주 낮고 웅웅거리는 소리가 들립니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
msgid "zombie breaker"
msgid_plural "zombie breakers"
msgstr[0] "브레이커 좀비"

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie breaker"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
msgid ""
"An enormous hump takes up most of this zombie's back, fusing its head "
"directly into its torso.  It moves slowly but seems more aware than most of "
"its kind, constantly looking around rather than staring blankly ahead.  When"
" you look directly at it, you feel a cold chill at the base of your skull."
msgstr ""
"거대한 혹이 이 좀비의 등 대부분을 차지하고 있어 머리가 몸통에 바로 붙어 있습니다. 움직임은 느리지만 대부분의 다른 좀비들보다 더 "
"의식이 있는 듯하며, 멍하니 앞만 바라보는 대신 끊임없이 주변을 살핍니다. 놈을 똑바로 쳐다보면 두개골 아래쪽에 차가운 한기가 "
"느껴집니다."

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
msgid "nether-void"
msgid_plural "nether-voids"
msgstr[0] "네더-공허"

#. ~ Description of monster "nether-void"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
msgid ""
"Thoughts of old creepy Internet memes arise unbidden as you see this zombie."
"  It's almost ten feet tall but incredibly thin, with spindly legs and with "
"arms that hang down almost all the way to the ground.  Occasionally, it "
"drops on all fours to clamber with uncanny speed over some bit of rubble.  "
"When you look directly at it, gray static flickers on the edge of your "
"vision and you hear a very low droning hum."
msgstr ""
"이 좀비를 보면 옛날 으스스한 인터넷 밈이 저절로 떠오릅니다. 키는 거의 3미터에 달하지만 믿을 수 없을 정도로 마르고, 가느다란 다리와"
" 거의 땅바닥까지 늘어진 팔을 가지고 있습니다. 가끔씩 네 발로 기어올라 돌무더기 위로 기괴한 속도로 기어오릅니다. 직접 보면 시야 "
"가장자리에 회색 잡음이 깜빡이고 아주 낮게 웅웅거리는 소리가 들립니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "nether-void"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/zombies.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%1$s looks at %3$s and the static on the edge of your vision creeps inward "
"for a moment."
msgstr "%1$s가 %3$s를 바라보자 시야 가장자리의 잡음이 잠시 안쪽으로 스며든다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/path_mutations.json
msgid "Noetic Flexibility"
msgstr "노에틱 유연성"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Noetic Flexibility"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/path_mutations.json
msgid ""
"Your expanded mind is far more capable of understanding Netherum Mathematics"
" than a mere human's.  You have an greater chance of awakening new psionic "
"paths."
msgstr ""
"당신의 확장된 정신은 단순한 인간보다 네더럼 수학을 이해하는 데 훨씬 더 뛰어납니다. 새로운 사이오닉 경로를 깨울 가능성이 더 높습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Headblind"
msgstr "깜깜한 정신"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Headblind"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid "You have a normal human (lack of) capacity for psionic powers."
msgstr "당신은 평범한 인간과 같은 초능력을 가지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid "Efficient System"
msgstr "고효율 신체"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Efficient System"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid ""
"Thanks to your powers, you need less food and drink than the average person "
"and are more efficient at processing it."
msgstr "당신의 능력 덕분에 당신은 평균적인 사람보다 음식과 음료가 덜 필요하고, 이를 처리하는 효율성도 더 높습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid "Psionic Senses"
msgstr "사이오닉 감각"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Psionic Senses"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid ""
"Your powers protect you from some sensory disruption and allow you to detect"
" creatures from beyond."
msgstr "당신의 능력은 당신을 감각적 혼란으로부터 보호하고, 그 너머의 생물을 감지할 수 있게 해줍니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid "Galvanic Armor"
msgstr "갈바닉 아머"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Galvanic Armor"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid ""
"Your powers help protect you from electrical damage and slightly reduce the "
"intensity of pain you feel."
msgstr "당신의 능력은 전기적 손상으로부터 당신을 보호하고 당신이 느끼는 고통의 강도를 약간 줄이는 데 도움이 됩니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid "Photon Regulation"
msgstr "광자 통제"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Photon Regulation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid "Your powers passively filter the amount of photons your eyes receive."
msgstr "당신의 능력은 당신의 눈이 받는 광자의 양을 수동적으로 걸러냅니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid "Internal Fire"
msgstr "내면의 불꽃"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Internal Fire"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid ""
"You naturally heat the air around you slightly, making it more comfortable "
"in the cold.  It also helps prevent you from getting too wet."
msgstr "자연스럽게 주변 공기가 약간 따뜻해져 추위에 더 편안해집니다. 또한, 너무 젖는 것도 방지하는 데 도움이 됩니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid "Grasping Hand"
msgstr "움켜쥐는 손아귀"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Grasping Hand"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid ""
"Thanks to a minor application of telekinesis, the items you want to grab are"
" always quick to hand."
msgstr "약간의 텔레키네시스 기술만 적용하면, 원하는 아이템을 언제나 손쉽게 손에 넣을 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid "Telepathic Suggestion"
msgstr "텔레파틱 설득"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Telepathic Suggestion"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid "You are subtly influencing the minds of the people you speak to."
msgstr "당신은 대화하는 사람들의 마음에 미묘한 영향을 미치고 있습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid "Spacial Recalibration"
msgstr "공간 보정"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Spacial Recalibration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid ""
"You can keep otherworldly eyes off you to some extent, and you will "
"sometimes instinctively teleport to avoid danger."
msgstr "당신은 어느 정도 다른 세계의 시선을 피할 수 있으며, 때로는 위험을 피하기 위해 본능적으로 순간이동하기도 합니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid "Bloom of Vitality"
msgstr "활력의 꽃"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Bloom of Vitality"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/psi_passives.json
msgid ""
"Your psionic powers speed your healing slightly and increase your overall "
"resilience, and any broken limbs you have mend straight and true."
msgstr "당신의 심령 능력은 치유 속도를 약간 높여주고, 전반적인 회복력을 증가시키며, 부러진 팔다리를 똑바로 고쳐줍니다."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Heart of Fire"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/scenario.json
msgid "The fire in your soul rises and falls, but never truly goes out."
msgstr "당신의 영혼 속의 불은 오르기도 내리기도 하지만, 결코 꺼지지 않습니다."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Intuitive Artistry"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Gazing into the near future lets you know what part goes where."
msgstr "가까운 미래를 내다보면 어떤 부분이 어디에 있는지 알 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Lifting Hand"
msgstr "들어올리는 손"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Lifting Hand"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid ""
"With a modicum of concentration you can carry a single item with your "
"powers."
msgstr "조금만 집중하면 당신의 힘으로 단 하나의 물건만 운반할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Elixir PK Surge"
msgstr "엘릭서 PK 서지"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Elixir PK Surge"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid ""
"Thanks to the crystalline elixir, you can lash out with unfocused surges of "
"telekinetic power."
msgstr "수정 비약 덕분에 집중되지 않은 텔레키네틱 힘의 폭발을 일으킬 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Elixir PK Surge" to
#. "TELELIXIRDOWN_active"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "You unleash your powers."
msgstr "당신은 당신의 힘을 해방합니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Elixir PK Surge (active)"
msgstr "엘릭서 PK 서지(활성화)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Elixir PK Surge (active)"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "You are lashing out with your elixir-forged telekinetic powers."
msgstr "당신은 비약으로 강화된 텔레키네틱으로 맹렬히 공격하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Elixir PK Surge (active)" to
#. "TELELIXIRDOWN"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "You rein your powers back in for now."
msgstr "지금은 당신의 힘을 다시 제어하세요."

#. ~ Player spell casting message in effect in EoC "EOC_TELELIXIR_CAST"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Your crystal-fueled powers activate!"
msgstr "당신의 수정으로 구동되는 힘이 활성화됩니다!"

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Psionic negation"
msgstr "사이오닉 부정"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Psionic negation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "The anchor crown you're wearing is shutting down your psionic powers."
msgstr "당신이 쓰고 있는 앵커 크라운이 당신의 사이오닉 능력을 차단하고 있어요."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Telepathic Dampening"
msgstr "텔레파시 감쇠"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Telepathic Dampening"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "The telepathic dampener you're wearing is protecting your mind."
msgstr "당신이 착용하고 있는 텔레파시 완충 장치는 당신의 정신을 보호하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Golden Radiance"
msgstr "황금빛 광채"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Golden Radiance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "You can make the air around you emit a strong light."
msgstr "주변 공기가 강한 빛을 내도록 만들 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Golden Radiance" to
#. "PHOTOLIXIR_LIGHT_active"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "The air around you starts glowing brightly."
msgstr "당신 주변의 공기가 밝게 빛나기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "Golden Radiance (on)"
msgstr "골든 라디언스 (켜짐)"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Golden Radiance (on)"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "The air around you is emitting a bright light."
msgstr "당신 주변의 공기가 밝은 빛을 발산하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Message when transforming from mutation  "Golden Radiance (on)" to
#. "PHOTOLIXIR_LIGHT"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/temporary.json
msgid "The air around you loses its radiance."
msgstr "당신 주변의 공기는 빛을 잃습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Biokinetic"
msgstr "각성한 바이오키네틱"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Biokinetic"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Mental control over bodily processes."
msgstr "신체적 과정에 대한 정신적 통제."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Clairsentient"
msgstr "각성한 클레어센션트"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Clairsentient"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "The ability to extend the senses beyond the body."
msgstr "신체 너머로 감각을 확장하는 능력."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Electrokinetic"
msgstr "각성한 일렉트로키네틱"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Electrokinetic"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Mental control of lightning and electricity."
msgstr "번개와 전기를 정신적으로 조종하는 능력."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Photokinetic"
msgstr "각성한 바이오키네틱"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Photokinetic"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Mental control of visible light and electromagnetic waves."
msgstr "가시광선과 전자파에 대한 정신적 제어."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Pyrokinetic"
msgstr "각성한 파이로키네틱"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Pyrokinetic"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Mental control of heat and flame."
msgstr "열과 불꽃에 대한 정신적 조절."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Telepath"
msgstr "각성한 텔레패스"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Telepath"
#. ~ Description of mutation "Telepathy"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/mutations/esper.json
msgid "The ability to read thoughts and influence others' minds."
msgstr "다른 사람의 생각을 읽고 그들의 마음에 영향을 미칠 수 있는 능력."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Telekinetic"
msgstr "각성한 텔레키네틱"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Telekinetic"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Mental control over the motion of objects and people at a distance."
msgstr "멀리 있는 물체와 사람의 움직임을 정신적으로 통제하는 능력."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Teleporter"
msgstr "각성한 텔레포터"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Teleporter"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"The ability to move without crossing the intervening space, as well as some "
"control over space itself."
msgstr "중간 공간을 넘지 않고 이동할 수 있는 능력과 공간 자체에 대한 어느 정도의 통제력을 의미합니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Awakened Vitakinetic"
msgstr "각성한 바이타키네틱"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Awakened Vitakinetic"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Mental control over health and vitality."
msgstr "건강과 활력에 대한 정신적 통제."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Headblind"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"You've seen people do some crazy things after the Cataclysm, but you've "
"never managed to figure out how they do it.  You can never learn psionic "
"powers."
msgstr ""
"대격변 이후 사람들이 미친 짓을 하는 걸 봤지만, 어떻게 그런 짓을 하는지는 알아내지 못했어. 사이오닉 능력은 절대 배울 수 없지."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Latent Psion"
msgstr "잠재적 사이온"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Latent Psion"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"Before the Cataclysm, you were lucky in some way.  Maybe you never lost your"
" keys, or maybe you always made that last green light before getting home, "
"or maybe you never had to take a sick day in your life.  Now after the "
"Cataclysm, you have the potential for even more power.  Your first attempt "
"to awaken psionic powers will always be successful."
msgstr ""
"대격변 이전에는 어떤 면에서는 운이 좋았을지도 몰라요. 열쇠를 잃어버리지 않았을 수도 있고, 집에 돌아오기 전 마지막 신호에 항상 "
"응답했을 수도 있고, 아니면 평생 병가를 낸 적이 없었을 수도 있죠. 이제 대격변 이후에는 더 큰 힘을 얻을 가능성이 있습니다. 사이오닉"
" 능력을 깨우려는 첫 시도는 항상 성공할 겁니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Limited Awakening"
msgstr "제한된 각성"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Limited Awakening"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"You managed to awaken psionic powers, but it was a struggle and you're not "
"sure you'll be able to do it again.  You are subject to the random odds of "
"awakening new powers."
msgstr ""
"당신은 사이오닉 능력을 깨우는 데 성공했지만, 쉽지 않았고 다시 할 수 있을지 확신할 수 없습니다. 새로운 능력을 깨울 확률은 "
"무작위입니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Fifth Sun People"
msgstr "다섯 번째 태양 사람들"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Fifth Sun People"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"You were born in the Ēxcān Tlahtōlōyān, maybe on Tlalticpactli, perhaps even"
" in Anáhuac, or maybe on one of the colony worlds like Demeter or Yathrib or"
" Tài Suì.  You enlisted in the Imperial Navy for your own reasons.  Perhaps "
"you are a scion of the Huey Calpulli following in your ancestors' footsteps,"
" or perhaps you are one of the mācēhualtin seeking the social benefits of a "
"completed tour of military service.  Regardless, now you are here, in the "
"ashes of a dying world, and have to find a way to survive."
msgstr ""
"당신은 엑산 틀라톨로얀에서 태어났고, 틀랄틱팍틀리에서 태어났을 수도 있고, 아나우악에서 태어났을 수도 있고, 아니면 데메테르나 야스리브,"
" 타이 수이 같은 식민지 행성에서 태어났을 수도 있습니다. 당신은 각자의 이유로 제국 해군에 입대했습니다. 어쩌면 조상의 발자취를 따라 "
"휴이 칼풀리의 후예일 수도 있고, 군 복무를 마치고 사회적 혜택을 누리고 싶어 하는 마체우알틴 중 한 명일 수도 있습니다. 어쨌든 당신은"
" 지금 죽어가는 세상의 잿더미 속에 있으며, 살아남을 방법을 찾아야 합니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Psychic Vampire"
msgstr "사이킥 뱀파이어"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Psychic Vampire"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"You can drain a bit of vital energy from victims when attacking their minds "
"with telepathy or their bodies with vitakinesis."
msgstr ""
"텔레파시로 피해자의 정신을 공격하거나 비타키네시스로 피해자의 몸을 공격하면 피해자에게서 약간의 생명력을 빨아들일 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols"
msgstr "VERDANT HAND 전투 프로토콜"

#. ~ Description of mutation "VERDANT HAND Combat Protocols"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"Who needs weapons?  Thanks to your biokinesis, you deal more melee damage "
"while fighting with your bare hands.  This damage improves as your unarmed "
"skill and biokinetic prowess increase."
msgstr ""
"무기가 필요하냐고요? 바이오키네틱 능력 덕분에 맨손으로 싸울 때 근접 공격 피해가 증가합니다. 이 피해는 맨손 기술과 바이오키네틱 능력이"
" 향상될수록 증가합니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Improved Concentration"
msgstr "향상된 집중력"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Improved Concentration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"You can keep your mind on something even if there are plenty of "
"distractions.  The number of psionic powers you can maintain at once is "
"increased by 1."
msgstr "방해 요소가 많더라도 마음을 한곳에 집중할 수 있습니다. 동시에 유지할 수 있는 사이오닉 능력의 개수가 1만큼 증가합니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Easily Distracted"
msgstr "쉽게 산만해짐"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Easily Distracted"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"Any day now you're going to buckle down and oh hey is that a butterfly?  The"
" number of psionic powers you can maintain at once is reduced by 1."
msgstr ""
"이제 언제든 \"어머, 저거 나비였어?\"라고 생각하며 정신줄을 놓을 수 있겠지? 동시에 유지할 수 있는 사이오닉 능력의 개수가 1개 "
"줄어듭니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Debug Concentration"
msgstr "Debug Concentration"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Debug Concentration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"You could keep every single bug in the game in mind simultaneously with this"
" one."
msgstr "이 버그를 사용하면 게임의 모든 버그를 동시에 염두에 둘 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Extended Channeling"
msgstr "연장된 채널링"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Extended Channeling"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"You can take more time and care in channeling your powers.  It will take 25x"
" as long to evoke them, but it will be much easier to activate them and you "
"will be less likely to gain Nether Attunement while doing so."
msgstr ""
"힘을 집중하는 데 더 많은 시간과 노력을 들일 수 있습니다. 능력을 불러내는 데 25배의 시간이 걸리지만, 활성화하기가 훨씬 쉬워지고, "
"활성화하는 동안 네더 조율을 얻을 가능성도 줄어듭니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid "Torrential Channeling"
msgstr "급격한 채널링"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Torrential Channeling"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mutations/traits.json
msgid ""
"You can draw deeply on the Nether, increasing the strength of your powers "
"but making making them harder to initiate and control."
msgstr "네더를 깊이 끌어들여 능력의 강도를 높이지만, 이를 시작하고 제어하기가 더 어려워집니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "I am the heart of the storm!"
msgstr "나는 폭풍의 심장이야!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "&They smile as lightning crackles over their skin."
msgstr "& 그들은 번개가 피부 위로 번쩍이는 것을 보며 미소 짓는다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "How are you doing that?"
msgstr "어떻게 그렇게 하시나요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "*Back away slowly*"
msgstr "*천천히 뒤로 물러나세요*"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "I have the power of the storm!  I will save this world!"
msgstr "난 폭풍의 힘을 가졌어! 이 세상을 구하겠어!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "&They say nothing, merely looking at you with glowing eyes."
msgstr "&그들은 아무 말도 하지 않고, 단지 빛나는 눈으로 당신을 바라볼 뿐입니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid ""
"This isn't real…  It's just tricks right?  Haha.  It's just tricks and "
"lights…"
msgstr "이거 진짜 아니야... 그냥 트릭일 뿐이지? 하하. 그냥 트릭이랑 조명일 뿐이야..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "It's not like any tricks I've ever seen…"
msgstr "지금까지 본 어떤 트릭과도 다릅니다…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "Hahaha!!  Burn!  BURN!!"
msgstr "하하하!! 타버려! 타버려!!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "&They cackle loudly as flames burst from their outstretched hand."
msgstr "&그들은 뻗은 손에서 불꽃이 터져나오자 큰 소리로 깔깔거린다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "All will burn!"
msgstr "모두 불타버릴 것이다!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "Isn't it beautiful?  BURN THEM ALL!"
msgstr "정말 아름답지 않나요? 다 불태워버려요!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "The flames have chosen me!"
msgstr "불꽃이 나를 선택했다!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "Get out of here!"
msgstr "여기서 나가!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "No, no no!  Go away!"
msgstr "안 돼, 안 돼, 안 돼! 가버려!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/psi_civilians.json
msgid "*doesn't look at you at all.  They just keep yelling at the horde."
msgstr "*당신을 전혀 쳐다보지도 않아요. 그냥 무리에게 계속 소리만 지르는 거예요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid "What's with those clusters of weird plants I've seen around?"
msgstr "주변에서 이상한 식물들이 모여 있는 건 무슨 일인가요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Oh, right, the alien plants.  The portals bring them.  As far as I've
#. seen in the past, it's just going to keep getting worse.
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid ""
"Sure, the plants o' otherworlds.  Them as comes from the wibbles.  Like as "
"this'n's seen, 'tis all down 'n down, an I'm ken."
msgstr "물론이지, 다른 세계의 식물들이지. 그것들은 위블에서 온 거야. 여기 보이는 것처럼, 다 쓰러지고 쓰러졌어. 난 알아."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid " 'Down 'n down'?  So it's going to keep happening until…what?"
msgstr "'다운 앤 다운'? 그럼 계속 이런 일이 벌어지겠네… 그럼 뭐?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid "From the portals…like you, right?  You've seen this before?"
msgstr "포털에서… 너처럼 말이지, 그렇지? 이거 전에 본 적 있어?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid "I've gotta go.  See you later, Rubik."
msgstr "가 봐야겠다. 나중에 봐, 루빅."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Until the normal world is covered in alien biomes and then all falls to
#. dust.  That's just how it goes.
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid ""
"Til the green and brown be yellowred and blue afore it be to grey and black."
"  'Tis the course."
msgstr "녹색과 갈색이 노랗고 빨갛고 파랗게 변한 후 회색과 검은색이 될 때까지. 그게 당연한 일이야."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid ""
"Is there any way to stop it?  Can we cut them down or burn them or "
"something?"
msgstr "막을 방법이 있을까요? 잘라내거나 태우거나 어떻게든 할 수 있을까요?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid "The course?  What's going to happen?"
msgstr "그 과정은? 무슨 일이 일어날까요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You could burn it, but the portals will just bring it back.  No, there's
#. no stopping it at this point.  Even if you burned every single one you
#. found, you're just one person and there's an endless supply of them, so
#. it's futile.  There's only one way this goes.
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid ""
"Aye, mayhap, but more'll dribble through the wobbles.  You can't athwart all"
" o' the bridges.  If'n you light each and every, you're only one against "
"many.  'Twould be no point.  The road only goes one way."
msgstr ""
"그래, 어쩌면 그럴지도 몰라. 하지만 더 많은 사람들이 요동치는 다리 사이로 흘러들어올 거야. 모든 다리를 가로지를 수는 없어. 하나하나"
" 불을 밝히면, 너는 수많은 사람들 중 하나일 뿐이야. 아무 소용없어. 길은 일방통행이니까."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid "Well, we'll see about that.  Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr "음, 두고 봐야겠네요. 다른 얘기 좀 할 수 있을까요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Many times.  It doesn't always go the same, and sometimes they only show
#. up right before we leave the world, but they always do.
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid ""
"Time an' time.\"  Rubik pauses for a moment.  \"There be eddies and ripples,"
" aye, an' sometime they come just afore we make to wobble on, but they "
"surely do."
msgstr ""
"시간이 흐르고 또 흐르죠.\" 루빅은 잠시 멈췄다. \"회오리바람과 잔물결이 일어나기도 하고, 때로는 우리가 흔들리기 직전에 나타나기도 "
"하지만, 분명 그렇게 되죠."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/portal_future_you.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "[Premonition] *Check for anything amiss*"
msgstr "[예감] *뭔가 이상한 게 있는지 확인해 보세요*"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "[Sense Hostility] *Determine if <npc_name> is a threat*"
msgstr "[적대감 감지] *<npc_name>이 위협인지 판단*"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid ""
"&You extend your senses, alert for danger, and are surprised at the result."
"  There is danger here, but it's muted, and certainly Rubik doesn't seem to "
"bear you any malice.  If any place is safe in the hell that the Earth has "
"become, this is it."
msgstr ""
"& 당신은 감각을 확장하고 위험을 경계하다가 그 결과에 깜짝 놀란다. 위험은 존재하지만, 그 위험은 미미하고, 루빅은 분명 당신에게 "
"악의를 품고 있지 않은 듯하다. 지옥으로 변해버린 지구에서 안전한 곳이 있다면 바로 이곳이다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid ""
"&You extend your senses, probing at Rubik's attitude, and come away with a "
"sense of relief.  Rubik certainly doesn't plan any violent action at this "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"& 당신은 감각을 확장하며 루빅의 태도를 살피고, 안도감을 느낀다. 루빅은 지금 이 순간 폭력적인 행동을 계획하고 있지 않다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_generic.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "[Telepathy] *Read <npc_name>'s mind*"
msgstr "[텔레파시] *<npc_name>의 마음을 읽습니다*"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid ""
"&You weren't expecting to be able to understand Rubik's thoughts.  Whatever "
"language it is, this \"Anglic\", the resemblance to English is clearly a "
"fortunate coincidence.  But you are surprised that your telepathic scan "
"doesn't pick up anything at all.  Just a faint static hum, rising and "
"falling in an irregular pattern."
msgstr ""
"루빅의 생각을 이해할 수 있을 거라고는 생각도 못 했을 거야. 무슨 언어든, 이 \"앵글리안\" 언어가 영어와 비슷한 건 분명 행운의 "
"우연일 거야. 하지만 텔레파시 스캔이 아무것도 잡아내지 못해서 놀라는 건 어쩔 수 없지. 희미한 잡음만 불규칙하게 오르락내리락할 뿐이야."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/refugee_guards_traitor.json
msgid "*Withdraw from <npc_name>'s mind*."
msgstr "<npc_name>의 마음에서 물러납니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid "[Telepathy] *Go deeper*."
msgstr "[텔레파시]*더 깊숙이 들어간다.*"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid ""
"&Your awareness of the outside world fades as you fall into Rubik's mind.\n"
"\n"
"You see a child in a thriving metropolis, doing odd jobs for spare coins, playing in the alleys with friends, coming home at dusk for supper.  You see a young adult running from a group of zombies.  You see this castle, or near enough--some towers are missing, some missing towers are there, but obviously the same--and its denizens fending off an attack from a group of winged things.  You see a conversation in a language you've never heard before among a group of Exodii, before everyone files into rooms, secures themselves with restraints, and there's a brief moment of searing pain and then darkness, filled with static and bursts of light half-glimpsed in your peripheral vision.\n"
"\n"
"You see worlds.  World after world, in a procession over…decades?  Centuries?  You can't tell; you have no sense of time during the vision.  Most worlds were less advanced than the Earth, and the few survivors fought the dead with human wave tactics and trench warfare, or lines of musketeers, or archers from behind the trees.  Sometimes, doughty warriors clad in iron or bronze hurled themselves at the enemy with sword and shield in hand, until they fell and their corpses rose again.  In one world, the survivors fought with powered armor and particle-beam weapons.  But on every world, slowly, inexorably, the dead or the fungus or the walking trees or things you have no name for ground down the defenders until humanity was on the brink of extinction and, with a few survivors in tow, the Exodii powered up their jump devices and continued the Long Retreat.\n"
"\n"
"In the end, not once, in a dozen or a hundred or you know not how many worlds, was there anything left to save."
msgstr ""
"루빅의 마음속으로 빠져들면서 바깥세상에 대한 당신의 의식은 희미해진다.\n"
"\n"
"번화한 대도시에서 한 아이가 잉여 동전을 위해 잡일을 하고, 골목에서 친구들과 놀다가, 해질녘에 저녁을 먹으러 집으로 돌아오는 모습이 보인다. 좀비 무리에게서 도망치는 청년이 보인다. 이 성, 아니 어쩌면 거의 비슷한 모습이 보인다. 탑 몇 개가 없어졌고, 몇 개는 없어졌지만, 분명 같은 탑이다. 그리고 그 안에 사는 사람들이 날개 달린 괴물 무리의 공격을 막아내고 있다. 엑소다이우스 무리 사이에서 전에 들어본 적 없는 언어로 대화하는 모습이 보인다. 모두가 방으로 들어가 제지당하고, 잠시 타는 듯한 고통이 느껴지고, 그다음 어둠이 찾아온다. 주변 시야에 잡음과 빛의 폭발이 어렴풋이 보인다.\n"
"\n"
"여러 세계가 보인다. 수십 년? 수백 년에 걸쳐 이어지는 행렬처럼. 무슨 세계인지 알 수 없다. 이 환영 속에서는 시간 감각이 없다. 대부분의 세계는 지구보다 덜 발전되어 있었고, 소수의 생존자들은 인간형 공세 전술과 참호전, 또는 머스킷티어 대열이나 나무 뒤의 궁수로 죽은 자들과 싸웠습니다. 때로는 철이나 청동으로 무장한 용맹한 전사들이 손에 칼과 방패를 들고 적에게 몸을 던지기도 했습니다. 쓰러지고 시체가 다시 일어설 때까지 말입니다. 어떤 세계에서는 생존자들이 강화 갑옷과 입자 빔 무기를 들고 싸웠습니다. 하지만 모든 세계에서는 천천히, 거침없이, 죽은 자나 곰팡이, 걸어다니는 나무, 또는 이름 모를 존재들이 방어자들을 짓밟아 인류가 멸종 직전에 이르렀고, 몇몇 생존자들을 이끌고 엑소다이족은 점프 장치에 동력을 공급하고 긴 퇴각을 계속했습니다.\n"
"\n"
"결국, 단 한 번도, 십여 개, 백 개, 아니 몇 개의 세계에서도 구할 것이 남아 있지 않았습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid "*Withdraw from Rubik's mind*."
msgstr "*루빅의 마음에서 물러나세요*."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid "&Rubik is looking at you oddly.  The silence is palpable."
msgstr "루빅이 당신을 이상하게 바라보고 있습니다. 침묵이 확연히 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/Rubik.json
msgid ""
"Sorry, I must have zoned out for a moment there.  It's been a long day.  You"
" were saying?"
msgstr "죄송해요, 제가 잠깐 멍했던 것 같아요. 오늘 하루 정말 힘들었거든요. 말씀하신 게 뭔가요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/computer_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Project OBSIDIAN RING.\n"
"\n"
"Project BURNT NOVEMBER.\n"
"\n"
"Enter login credentials."
msgstr ""
"흑요석 반지 프로젝트.\n"
"\n"
"불타버린 11월 프로젝트.\n"
"\n"
"로그인 정보를 입력하세요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/computer_dialogue.json
msgid "Try a random username and password"
msgstr "임의의 사용자 이름과 비밀번호를 시도해 보세요"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/computer_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Project OBSIDIAN RING.\n"
"\n"
"Project NOBLE HORIZON.\n"
"\n"
"Enter login credentials."
msgstr ""
"프로젝트 흑요석 반지.\n"
"\n"
"프로젝트 고귀한 지평선.\n"
"\n"
"로그인 정보를 입력하세요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/computer_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Project OBSIDIAN RING.\n"
"\n"
"Project GRAY DAWN.\n"
"\n"
"Enter login credentials."
msgstr ""
"프로젝트 OBSIDIAN RING.\n"
"\n"
"프로젝트 GRAY DAWN.\n"
"\n"
"로그인 정보를 입력하세요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/computer_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Project OBSIDIAN RING.\n"
"\n"
"Project LOST RAIN.\n"
"\n"
"Enter login credentials."
msgstr ""
"프로젝트 흑요석 반지.\n"
"\n"
"프로젝트 잃어버린 비.\n"
"\n"
"로그인 정보를 입력하세요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/computer_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"&You input the first combination of username and password that comes to "
"mind, and of course it doesn't work.  Rather than trigger a lockout due to "
"too many attempts, you decide to come back when you have some idea what to "
"do."
msgstr ""
"& 머릿속에 떠오르는 첫 번째 사용자 이름과 비밀번호 조합을 입력했는데, 당연히 작동하지 않습니다. 너무 많이 시도해서 계정이 잠기는 "
"대신, 어떻게 해야 할지 생각이 나면 다시 로그인하기로 했습니다."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "[Vitakinesis] I noticed that you're really sick."
msgstr "[비타키네시스] 당신이 정말 아픈 것 같아요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "[Vitakinesis] You don't look so good."
msgstr "[비타키네시스] 별로 좋아 보이지 않네요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "[Vitakinesis] Is there something wrong with your eyes?"
msgstr "[비타키네시스] 눈에 문제가 있나요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "And?"
msgstr "그리고?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Yeah, it is what it is."
msgstr "네, 그게 사실이에요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Those storms at the end of world…  I was fine before them."
msgstr "세상의 끝에 찾아온 폭풍… 그 전에는 괜찮았는데."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "You noticed, did you?"
msgstr "당신은 알아차렸나요?"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I've had it for years at this point.  Not much I can do about it now, "
"though."
msgstr "네, 벌써 몇 년째 앓고 있어요. 하지만 이제 와서 어쩔 수 있는 건 별로 없어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Really wish I had gotten some more treatment before, you know."
msgstr "사실, 좀 더 일찍 치료를 받았으면 좋았을 텐데요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "I can cure your illness for you."
msgstr "나는 당신의 병을 고쳐줄 수 있어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "We'll talk about that after you're done operating that vehicle."
msgstr "차량 운전을 마친 후에 그 문제에 대해 이야기해 보겠습니다."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "I don't want to talk about that while I'm operating a vehicle!"
msgstr "운전하는 동안은 그 이야기를 하고 싶지 않아요!"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "I'm too tired, let me rest first."
msgstr "너무 지쳤어, 조금만 쉬게 해줘."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "I already told you no.  Let it go."
msgstr "난 이미 안 된다고 말했잖아. 그냥 넘어가."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "I have some reason to refuse healing."
msgstr "내가 치료를 거부할 이유가 있어."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "* coughs.  \"Yeah, I'm not feeling so great"
msgstr "* 기침. \"응, 기분이 별로 안 좋아"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "No.  No I don't."
msgstr "아니요. 아니요, 그렇지 않아요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Yeah, I think I'm coming down with something."
msgstr "네, 뭔가 아픈 것 같아요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Ugh, yeah.  If only I could call in sick, you know?"
msgstr "으, 맞아. 아프다고 전화할 수만 있다면, 알겠지?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "I can cure it for you."
msgstr "제가 당신을 위해 치료해 드릴 수 있어요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "They just itch like crazy at all time lately."
msgstr "요즘은 항상 미친 듯이 가려워요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Yeah, I guess.  Must have got something in them."
msgstr "네, 그럴 것 같아요. 뭔가 들어있었을 거예요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "You're going to what?  How are you going to do that?"
msgstr "뭘 하려고 하는 거야? 어떻게 할 거야?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"You've seen what I can do, right?  Let me try.  (Note: By doing this you "
"will absorb <npc_name>'s disease into yourself.)"
msgstr ""
"내가 뭘 할 수 있는지 봤지? 한번 해 볼게. (참고: 이렇게 하면 <npc_name>의 질병을 당신 자신에게 흡수하게 됩니다.)"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Never mind then."
msgstr "그럼 됐어."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Forget it, let's get going."
msgstr "됐다, 어서 가자."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"I don't think so.  I know there are zombies out there and the world is all "
"fucked up, but I'd rather keep that fucked-up-ness as far away from me as "
"possible.  No offense."
msgstr ""
"그렇게 생각하지 않아요. 세상에 좀비가 있고 세상이 엉망인 건 알지만, 그 엉망인 현실은 최대한 멀리하고 싶어요. 기분 나쁘게 생각하지 "
"마세요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Alright, if you insist."
msgstr "알겠습니다. 고집하신다면요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Alright, it can't be worse than what I'm already going through."
msgstr "좋아, 내가 지금 겪고 있는 것보다 더 나쁠 수는 없을 거야."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Sure, I'll try anything at this point."
msgstr "물론이죠. 이제부터는 무엇이든 시도해 볼게요."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"Okay.  The medicine's going to run out someday and then I'll really be "
"fucked.  If this works…"
msgstr "좋아. 언젠가 약이 다 떨어지고 나면 난 정말 망할 거야. 이게 효과가 있다면…"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Yeah, I feel awful.  What have I got to lose?"
msgstr "응, 기분이 너무 안 좋아. 내가 잃을 게 뭐 있어?"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid "Hold still.  *Remove <npc_name>'s cold*"
msgstr "가만히 계세요. *<npc_name>의 감기를 제거*"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/npcs/dialogue/follower_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"You touch <npc_name> and reach out with your powers, looking for the illness"
" within them.  You soon find it, a shadow over their lungs, and draw it into"
" yourself."
msgstr ""
