#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid "MoM Artifact Attention"
msgstr "마인드 오버 매터 유물 주의 집중"

#. ~ Description of spell "MoM_AEA_ATTENTION ( MoM Artifact Attention )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid ""
"You're not quite sure what you did, but something is watching you for it."
msgstr "뭘 한건지는 잘 모르겠지만, 방금 그것 때문에 무언가가 당신을 지켜보기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "MoM_AEA_REMOVE_PAIN ( MoM Artifact Remove Pain )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid "It doesn't hurt as much anymore!"
msgstr "더 이상 그렇게 아프지 않아요!"

#. ~ Message of spell "MoM_AEA_SPEED_BURST ( MoM AEA Add Extra Speed )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid "The movements of everything nearby slow to a crawl."
msgstr "주변에 있는 모든 것의 움직임이 느려집니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "MoM_AEA_STAMINA_BURST ( MoM AEA Stamina Restore )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid "Your body is filled with vigor."
msgstr "당신의 몸은 활력으로 가득 차 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "MoM_AEA_MUTATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid "Artifact Mutate"
msgstr "유물 변이"

#. ~ Description of spell "MoM_AEA_MUTATE ( Artifact Mutate )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid "Mutates you randomly."
msgstr "당신을 무작위로 변이시킵니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "MoM_AEA_PHYSICAL_ENHANCEMENT ( MoM AEA Add Physical
#. Boost )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid "You feel more capable."
msgstr "당신은 더 유능하다고 느낀다."

#. ~ Message of spell "MoM_AEA_HARDEN_SKIN ( MoM AEA Add Hardened skin )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid "Your skin itches."
msgstr "피부가 가렵습니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "MoM_AEA_EXTRA_MOVEMENT_EXERTION ( MoM AEA Extra
#. Movement Exertion )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid "Walking seems harder."
msgstr "걷는 것이 더 힘들어졌다."

#. ~ Message of spell "MoM_AEA_CLAIRVOYANCE ( Artifact Local Clairvoyance )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid "You have a vision of the nearby area…"
msgstr "가까운 지형이 한눈에 들어옵니다..."

#. ~ Message of spell "MoM_AEA_ZAPPED ( MoM AEA Zap Self )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid "A jolt passes through your body!"
msgstr "몸에 충격이 전해진다!"

#. ~ Message of spell "MoM_AEA_APPLIANCE_RECHARGE ( MoM AEA Appliance Recharge
#. )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid "Sparks crackle over the nearby ground."
msgstr "근처 땅 위에서 불꽃이 터진다."

#. ~ Message of spell "MoM_AEA_FIELD_OF_LIGHTNING ( MoM AEA Field of Lightning
#. )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid "The air erupts with lightning!"
msgstr "공기가 번개로 부글거린다!"

#. ~ Message of spell "MoM_AEA_AREA_PARALYSIS ( MoM AEA Area Paralysis )"
#. ~ Message of spell "MoM_AEA_ROBOT_KILL ( MoM AEA Robot Kill )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/artifacts.json
msgid "The air crackles."
msgstr "공기가 갈라진다."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_physical_enhance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Physical Enhancement (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]육체 강화 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_physical_enhance ( [Ψ]Physical Enhancement
#. (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"You can improve your strength and agility with your powers.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"당신은 당신의 능력을 통해 힘과 민첩성을 향상시킬 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_overcome_pain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Overcome Pain (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]고통 이겨내기 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_overcome_pain ( [Ψ]Overcome Pain (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"You can lessen the impact of pain on your performance, though this has no effect on the underlying injuries.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"통증이 운동 능력에 미치는 영향을 줄일 수는 있지만, 이는 근본적인 부상에는 아무런 영향을 미치지 않습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 힘은 <color_yellow>집중력</color>을 통해 유지되며, <color_yellow>집중력이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_breathe_skin"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Oxygen Absorption (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]산소 흡수 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_breathe_skin ( [Ψ]Oxygen Absorption (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"You can make the entire surface of your skin selectively permeable, allowing you to 'breathe' through it.  You can breathe in low-oxygen environments or underwater, but are more vulnerable to toxic gas.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  Oxygen Absorption <color_red>cannot be active</color> with Sealed System."
msgstr ""
"피부 표면 전체를 선택적으로 투과성으로 만들어 '호흡'할 수 있습니다. 산소가 부족한 환경이나 수중에서도 호흡할 수 있지만, 유독 가스에 더 취약합니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>농도에 의해 유지</color>되며, <color_yellow>농도가 방해</color>받으면 <color_red>산소 흡수가 <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>. Sealed System에서는 산소 흡수가 <color_red>활성화</color>될 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_flexibility"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Flexibility"
msgstr "[Ψ]유연성"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_flexibility ( [Ψ]Flexibility )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"You can make your limbs move far beyond the normal human range of motion, "
"allowing you to twist out of others' grasp and reduce fall damage."
msgstr ""
"당신은 팔다리를 일반적인 인간의 움직임 범위를 훨씬 넘어서 움직일 수 있어서, 다른 사람의 손아귀에서 벗어나 넘어질 때의 피해를 줄일 수"
" 있습니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "biokin_flexibility ( [Ψ]Flexibility )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "You body begins twisting in unbelievable ways."
msgstr "당신의 몸은 믿을 수 없을 정도로 뒤틀리기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_dash"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Burst of Speed"
msgstr "[Ψ]폭발하는 속도"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_dash ( [Ψ]Burst of Speed )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Like a cheetah, you can run with incredible speed for a short distance."
msgstr "치타처럼, 당신은 짧은 거리를 믿을 수 없을 만큼 빠른 속도로 달릴 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_change_appearance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Flesh of Clay"
msgstr "[Ψ]찰흙살점"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_change_appearance ( [Ψ]Flesh of Clay )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"You can reshape your physical appearance, changing hair, skin, or eye color."
"  Your own mother wouldn't recognize you when you're done."
msgstr "머리카락, 피부, 눈 색깔을 바꾸는 등 외모를 바꿀 수 있어요. 다 바꾸면 어머니도 못 알아보실 거예요."

#. ~ Message of spell "biokin_change_appearance ( [Ψ]Flesh of Clay )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "You physical appearance shifts!"
msgstr "당신의 외모가 바뀌어요!"

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_armor_skin"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Hardened Skin (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]피부 경화 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_armor_skin ( [Ψ]Hardened Skin (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"You can increase the strength of your skin, making it almost like armor while still allowing you to move freely.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"피부의 강도를 높여 갑옷처럼 만들면서도 자유롭게 움직일 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_ylow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_ylow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_adrenaline"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Adrenaline Trigger"
msgstr "[Ψ]아드레날린 트리거"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_adrenaline ( [Ψ]Adrenaline Trigger )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"With a moment of concentration, you can trigger a surge of adrenaline.  This"
" provides a speed boost, albeit at a draining cost when the boost expires."
msgstr ""
"잠깐 집중하면 아드레날린이 솟구쳐 오를 수 있습니다. 이는 속도 향상 효과를 제공하지만, 효과가 사라지면 엄청난 에너지 소모가 "
"발생합니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "biokin_adrenaline ( [Ψ]Adrenaline Trigger )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "Your heartbeat surges as your body floods with adrenaline."
msgstr "당신의 몸은 아드레날린으로 가득 차면서 심장 박동이 빨라집니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_climate_control"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Temperature Adaptability (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]온도 적응 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_climate_control ( [Ψ]Temperature
#. Adaptability (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"You can increase the heat dissipation and retention of your body, allowing you to function in a much wider range of temperatures.  Temperature Adaptability and Sealed System <color_red>will cancel each other</color>.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"신체의 열 발산 및 보존력을 높여 훨씬 더 넓은 온도 범위에서 활동할 수 있습니다. 온도 적응력과 밀폐 시스템은 <color_red>서로 상쇄됩니다</color>.\n"
"\n"
"이 힘은 <color_yellow>집중력에 의해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중력이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_enhance_mobility"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Enhance Mobility (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]기동성 강화 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_enhance_mobility ( [Ψ]Enhance Mobility (C)
#. )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Increase your range of motion and flexibility such that you can move more easily even in encumbering gear.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"무거운 장비를 착용하더라도 더 쉽게 움직일 수 있도록 동작 범위와 유연성을 높이세요.\n"
"\n"
"이 힘은 <color_yellow>집중력</color>을 통해 유지되며, <color_yellow>집중력이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_hammerhand"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Hammerhand (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]망치손 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_hammerhand ( [Ψ]Hammerhand (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Who needs tools?  You can apply enough raw force or torque with your bare hands to substitute for many simple tools.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"도구가 필요할까요? 맨손으로도 충분한 힘이나 토크를 가하면 여러 간단한 도구를 대체할 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 힘은 <color_ylow>집중을 통해 유지</color>되며, <color_ylow>집중이 방해</color>받으면 <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_reflex_enhance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Heightened Reflexes (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]강화된 반사신경 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_reflex_enhance ( [Ψ]Heightened Reflexes (C)
#. )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"You can improve your sensory acuity and the speed at which your brain processes sensory inputs.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"감각 예민함과 뇌가 감각 입력을 처리하는 속도를 향상시킬 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중력</color>을 통해 유지되며, <color_yellow>집중력이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>저하될 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_sealed_system"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Sealed System"
msgstr "[Ψ]이물질 차단"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_sealed_system ( [Ψ]Sealed System )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"With a deep breath, you lock your body off from the outside world.  Gas, poison, blood, bile, electricity--nothing gets in, nothing gets out.\n"
"\n"
"Sealed System <color_red>cannot be active</color> with either Temperature Adaptability or Oxygen Absorption."
msgstr ""
"심호흡을 하면 몸이 외부 세계로부터 차단됩니다. 가스, 독, 피, 담즙, 전기 등 아무것도 들어오지 않고, 아무것도 나가지 않습니다.\n"
"\n"
"밀폐된 시스템은 온도 적응력이나 산소 흡수력으로 인해 <color_red>활성화될 수 없습니다</color>."

#. ~ Message of spell "biokin_sealed_system ( [Ψ]Sealed System )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "You take a deep breath and seal your lips."
msgstr "당신은 심호흡을 하고 입술을 다물었습니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_metabolism_enhance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Metabolic Hyperefficiency (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]초고효율 신진대사 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_metabolism_enhance ( [Ψ]Metabolic
#. Hyperefficiency (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"You can supercharge your metabolism, allowing you to eat, drink, and sleep much less than normal.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"신진대사를 극대화하여 평소보다 훨씬 적게 먹고, 마시고, 잠을 잘 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_ylow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_ylow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>. <color_red>전투에 참여하면 효과가 취소됩니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_vitaminosis"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Vitaminosis"
msgstr "[Ψ]비타민 오버도스"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_vitaminosis ( [Ψ]Vitaminosis )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Enter a trance and hyper focus on a narrow segment of your metabolism, "
"supercharging your body's ability to create vitamins and expanding it beyond"
" its normal range.  These vitamins will be created directly from your stored"
" calories."
msgstr ""
"트랜스 상태에 빠져 신진대사의 좁은 영역에 집중하면 신체의 비타민 생성 능력이 극대화되어 정상 범위를 넘어 확장됩니다. 이러한 비타민은 "
"저장된 칼로리에서 직접 생성됩니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "biokin_vitaminosis ( [Ψ]Vitaminosis )"
#. ~ Message of spell "vita_healing_trance ( [Ψ]Revitalizing Meditation )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/vitakinesis.json
msgid "You enter a trance and submerge your awareness into your body."
msgstr "당신은 황홀경에 빠져 자신의 의식을 몸 속으로 잠기게 됩니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_guided_evolution"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Guided Evolution (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]통제된 진화 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_guided_evolution ( [Ψ]Guided Evolution (C)
#. )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"With a large amount of focus, you can maintain a targeted control over any alterations to your body.  Whenever you mutate, you will have additional options to select from.  This power does not cause you to mutate on its own.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more concentration</color> than usual."
msgstr ""
"집중력이 높으면 신체의 모든 변화에 대한 통제력을 유지할 수 있습니다. 돌연변이를 일으킬 때마다 선택할 수 있는 추가 옵션이 제공됩니다. 이 능력은 스스로 돌연변이를 일으키지 않습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지</color>되며, <color_yellow>집중이 방해</color>받으면 <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>. <color_red>전투에 참여하면 취소</color>됩니다. 평소보다 <color_yellow>더 많은 집중</color>이 필요합니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_combat_dance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Combat Dance (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]컴뱃 댄스 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_combat_dance ( [Ψ]Combat Dance (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"You can flood your body with psionic power to enhance your combat prowess."
msgstr "당신은 전투 능력을 강화하기 위해 신체에 사이오닉 능력을 주입할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_perfected_motion"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Perfected Motion (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]완전한 운동(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_perfected_motion ( [Ψ]Perfected Motion (C)
#. )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Your control over your body allows you to move incredibly quickly.  While this does not allow you to attack more quickly, you can cross distances in the blink of an eye and outrun a cheetah.  You could even run on water, though not walk on it.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more concentration</color> than usual.\n"
"\n"
"Perfected Motion <color_red>cannot be active</color> with Hurricane Blows."
msgstr ""
"신체를 자유자재로 조종할 수 있어 놀라울 정도로 빠르게 움직일 수 있습니다. 공격 속도가 빨라지는 것은 아니지만, 눈 깜짝할 새에 먼 거리를 가로질러 치타보다 빠르게 달릴 수 있습니다. 심지어 물 위를 달릴 수도 있지만, 걷지는 못합니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_ylow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_ylow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>. 평소보다 <color_ylow>더 많은 집중</color>이 필요합니다.\n"
"\n"
"완벽한 동작은 허리케인 강타와 함께 <color_red>활성화될 수 없습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "biokin_hurricane_blows"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Hurricane Blows"
msgstr "[Ψ]허리케인 강타"

#. ~ Description of spell "biokin_hurricane_blows ( [Ψ]Hurricane Blows )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid ""
"You can now strike so quickly that you don't even seem to move at all.  Before an opponent can even finish blinking, you can strike them multiple times, executing your final blow before they feel the pain of the first.  Moving while using Hurricane Blows will disrupt your concentration, ending the effect.\n"
"\n"
"Hurricane Blows <color_red>cannot be active</color> with Perfected Motion."
msgstr ""
"이제 전혀 움직이지 않는 것처럼 보일 정도로 빠르게 공격할 수 있습니다. 상대가 눈 깜짝할 새에 여러 번 공격하여 첫 번째 공격의 고통을 느끼기 전에 마지막 일격을 가할 수 있습니다. 허리케인 타격을 사용하는 동안 움직이면 집중력이 흐트러져 효과가 종료됩니다.\n"
"\n"
"완벽한 동작 중에는 허리케인 타격을 <color_red>활성화할 수 없습니다</color>."

#. ~ Message of spell "biokin_hurricane_blows ( [Ψ]Hurricane Blows )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis.json
msgid "The world around you slows down to a stop."
msgstr "당신 주변의 세상이 느려지고 멈춥니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_PAIN_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You breathe deeply and your pain lessens."
msgstr "심호흡을 하면 통증이 줄어듭니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_PHYSICAL_ENHANCE_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You enhance your physical prowess."
msgstr "당신은 신체적 능력을 향상시킵니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_BREATHE_SKIN_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "As you seal your lips, your chest still rises and falls."
msgstr "당신이 입술을 다물고 있는 동안에도 당신의 가슴은 여전히 오르락내리락합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_HARDENED_SKIN_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "Your skin itches slightly and takes on a waxy appearance."
msgstr "피부가 약간 가려워지고 밀랍처럼 변합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_CLIMATE_CONTROL_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You feel much more comfortable."
msgstr "훨씬 더 편안함을 느낄 겁니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_ENHANCE_MOBILITY_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "Your gear doesn't seem to encumber you as much."
msgstr "당신의 장비는 그다지 부담스럽지 않은 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_HAMMERHAND_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You flex your fingers."
msgstr "손가락을 구부립니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_REFLEX_ENHANCE_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You enhance your speed and sensory prowess."
msgstr "속도와 감각 능력이 향상됩니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_METABOLISM_ENHANCE_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You supercharge your metabolism."
msgstr "신진대사를 극대화하세요."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_GUIDED_EVOLUTION_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You begin targeting your future mutations."
msgstr "당신은 미래의 돌연변이를 목표로 삼기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_COMBAT_DANCE_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid ""
"A surge of power fills your body and you begin moving with terrible purpose!"
msgstr "엄청난 힘이 당신의 몸을 채우고 당신은 끔찍한 목적을 가지고 움직이기 시작합니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_PERFECTED_MOTION_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "The world around you slows down to a crawl"
msgstr "당신 주변의 세상이 기어가는 것처럼 느려집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_DASH_CHECKER"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_eoc.json
msgid "You move almost faster than the eye can see."
msgstr "당신은 눈으로 볼 수 있는 것보다 훨씬 빠르게 움직입니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_DASH_CHECKER"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_eoc.json
msgid "Your circumstances prevent you from moving freely right now."
msgstr "당신의 상황 때문에 지금은 자유롭게 움직일 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_ADRENALINE_TRIGGER"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_eoc.json
msgid "You already have a surge of adrenaline in your system!"
msgstr "당신의 시스템에는 이미 아드레날린이 급증하고 있습니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PERFECTED_MOTION_WATER_RUN_CONTINUANCE" in nested EOCs in effect in
#. EoC "EOC_PERFECTED_MOTION_WATER_RUN"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_ZEPHYR_WATER_RUN_FOLLOWUP"
#. in nested EOCs in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VAMPIRE_ZEPHYR_WATER_RUN"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_eoc.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/vampire_trait_eocs.json
msgid "You are moving too slowly and fall into the water."
msgstr "너무 느리게 움직여서 물에 빠지게 됩니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BIOKIN_VITAMINOSIS_REMOVE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/biokinesis_eoc.json
msgid "You exit your trance and feel somehow fuller."
msgstr "당신은 황홀경에서 벗어나면서 왠지 더 충만함을 느낀다."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_better_senses"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Heightened Senses (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]감각이 강화됨(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_better_senses ( [Ψ]Heightened Senses (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"All of your senses are heightened, allowing you to see further and hear better, and at higher levels even see in murky water or use minor vibrations and small sounds to determine moving creatures nearby.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"모든 감각이 예민해져 더 멀리 보고 더 잘 들을 수 있으며, 더 높은 수준에서는 탁한 물 속을 보거나 미세한 진동과 작은 소리를 사용하여 근처의 움직이는 생물을 감지할 수도 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_ylow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_ylow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_speed_reading"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Speed Reader (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]스피드 리더(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_speed_reading ( [Ψ]Speed Reader (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"Your powers make words fairly leap off the page directly into your mind, allowing you to read much faster and better absorb what you read.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력은 단어들을 페이지에서 바로 머릿속으로 쑥쑥 들어오게 하여 훨씬 더 빨리 읽고 읽은 내용을 더 잘 흡수할 수 있도록 합니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_ylow>집중력</color>을 통해 유지되며, <color_ylow>집중력이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>. <color_red>전투에 참여하면 효과가 사라집니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_danger_sense"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Premonition (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]예감(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_danger_sense ( [Ψ]Premonition (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"You can sense nearby movement and sometimes gain an advance warning of dangerous events.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"근처의 움직임을 감지할 수 있으며, 때로는 위험한 사건에 대한 사전 경고를 받을 수도 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>능력이 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_night_vision"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Night Eyes (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]나이트 아이즈 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_night_vision ( [Ψ]Night Eyes (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"You are able to sense your surroundings in areas of low light, and you can even \"see\" in pitch darkness.  Strictly speaking, this is not vision, and you cannot discern fine details or read.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"빛이 약한 곳에서도 주변을 감지할 수 있으며, 칠흑 같은 어둠 속에서도 \"볼\" 수 있습니다. 엄밀히 말하면 이는 시력이 아니며, 세부 사항을 분별하거나 읽을 수는 없습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중력</color>을 통해 유지되며, <color_yellow>집중력이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>능력이 저하될 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_spot_weakness"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Discern Weakness"
msgstr "[Ψ]약점을 분별하다"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_spot_weakness ( [Ψ]Discern Weakness )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "Your powers let you pinpoint exactly where your enemies are weak."
msgstr "당신의 능력을 사용하면 적의 약점이 정확히 어디인지 알아낼 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "clair_spot_weakness ( [Ψ]Discern Weakness )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "The vulnerabilities of your enemy are revealed."
msgstr "적의 취약점이 드러납니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_see_auras"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Aura Sight (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]오라 사이트 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_see_auras ( [Ψ]Aura Sight (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"You can see people's emotions and physical state as a hazy swirl of color around their body.  This makes it much easier to get them to do what you want.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"사람들의 감정과 신체 상태는 몸 주위의 흐릿한 색깔 소용돌이로 볼 수 있습니다. 이를 통해 원하는 대로 행동하게 하는 것이 훨씬 쉬워집니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지</color>되며, <color_yellow>집중이 방해</color>받으면 <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>. <color_red>전투에 참여하면 취소됩니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_sense_rads"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Radiation Sense"
msgstr "[Ψ]방사선 감지"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_sense_rads ( [Ψ]Radiation Sense )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "You can open your tenses to the tell-tale glow of radiation."
msgstr "당신은 방사선의 뚜렷한 빛에 긴장을 풀 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_ranged_enhance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Marksman's Eye (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]사격수의 눈 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_ranged_enhance ( [Ψ]Marksman's Eye (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"With your enhanced senses, you can increase the effective range and accuracy of your ranged attacks.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"강화된 감각으로 원거리 공격의 유효 사거리와 정확도를 높일 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_examine_item"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Psychometry"
msgstr "[Ψ]심리측정학"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_examine_item ( [Ψ]Psychometry )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"You can examine an item and use your enhanced senses to determine its "
"properties that may not be obvious to the eye."
msgstr "여러분은 물건을 살펴보고 향상된 감각을 사용하여 눈으로는 알 수 없는 속성을 파악할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_sense_hostile_creatures"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Sense Hostility (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]적대감 감지 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_sense_hostile_creatures ( [Ψ]Sense Hostility
#. (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"You can sense the presence of the things that wish to do you harm.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"당신은 당신을 해치려는 존재의 존재를 감지할 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 힘은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_voyance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Clairvoyance"
msgstr "[Ψ]투시력"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_voyance ( [Ψ]Clairvoyance )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"The classic example of a clairsentient's powers, you can see through walls "
"and reveal everything nearby."
msgstr "클레어센티언트 능력의 전형적인 예로, 벽을 투과하여 주변의 모든 것을 볼 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "clair_voyance ( [Ψ]Clairvoyance )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "You open your inner eye."
msgstr "당신은 내면의 눈을 뜨게 됩니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_dodge_power"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Combat Sense (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]전투 감각 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_dodge_power ( [Ψ]Combat Sense (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"By gazing just a few moments into the future, you can be wherever your enemies are not attacking.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"단 몇 분만 미래를 응시해도 적이 공격하지 않는 곳 어디든 갈 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_craft_bonus"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Intuitive Artisan (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]직관적인 장인 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_craft_bonus ( [Ψ]Intuitive Artisan (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"Opening yourself up to the immediate future, you can see the best option to take when crafting or working on a task.  However, due to the intensity of the visions you will be <color_red>blind</color> to the outside world while crafting anything.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"가까운 미래에 마음을 열면 제작이나 작업 시 최선의 선택지를 찾을 수 있습니다. 하지만 환영의 강도가 너무 강해서 제작하는 동안 외부 세계를 <color_red>볼 수 없게</color> 됩니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해</color> 유지되며, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받는 경우</color> <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>. 전투에 참여하면 <color_red>취소됩니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_perfect_shot"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]One Perfect Shot"
msgstr "[Ψ]완벽한 한 방"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_perfect_shot ( [Ψ]One Perfect Shot )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"Gaze into the future and, taking your enemy's future movements into account,"
" fire at the perfect moment.  This power will only last for a single attack."
msgstr "미래를 내다보고 적의 미래 움직임을 고려하여 완벽한 순간에 사격하십시오. 이 힘은 단 한 번의 공격에만 지속됩니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "clair_perfect_shot ( [Ψ]One Perfect Shot )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "It's time to take the shot."
msgstr "이제 사진을 찍을 시간입니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_see_map"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Satellite View"
msgstr "[Ψ]위성 보기"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_see_map ( [Ψ]Satellite View )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"You can extend your senses over the landscape, becoming aware of every hill,"
" building, and valley within a large area."
msgstr "여러분은 감각을 풍경 너머로 확장하여 넓은 지역 내의 모든 언덕, 건물, 계곡을 알아차릴 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "clair_see_map ( [Ψ]Satellite View )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"You close your eyes and concentrate, and you can see the landscape spread "
"out as though you were a bird on the wing."
msgstr "눈을 감고 집중하면 마치 날아다니는 새처럼 풍경이 펼쳐지는 것을 볼 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_clear_sight"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Clarity (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]명확성(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_clear_sight ( [Ψ]Clarity (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"Thanks to your powers, nothing can stop you from seeing the world as it is.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력 덕분에 세상을 있는 그대로 보는 것을 막을 수 있는 것은 아무것도 없습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중력</color>을 통해 유지되며, <color_yellow>집중력이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_astral_projection"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Astral Projection"
msgstr "[Ψ]아스트랄 투영"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_astral_projection ( [Ψ]Astral Projection )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"After a short period of concentration and meditation, cast your spirit forth"
" from your body, wandering the world disembodied.  You will move at the "
"speed of thought but cannot use further powers or interact with the world "
"while your spirit is wandering.  Follow your silver cord to return back to "
"your body."
msgstr ""
"잠시 집중과 명상을 한 후, 영혼을 몸에서 꺼내어 육체를 벗어난 채 세상을 떠돌아다니세요. 생각의 속도로 움직이지만, 영혼이 떠도는 "
"동안에는 더 이상의 능력을 사용하거나 세상과 소통할 수 없습니다. 은빛 끈을 따라 몸으로 돌아오세요."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_astral_projection_return"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Follow the Silver Cord"
msgstr "[Ψ]은줄을 따라가세요"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_astral_projection_return ( [Ψ]Follow the
#. Silver Cord )"
#. ~ Description of spell "hedge_astral_projection_return ( Follow the Silver
#. Cord )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "Follow the silver cord back to your body."
msgstr "은색 끈을 따라 몸으로 돌아오세요."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_group_tactics"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Prescient Tactician (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]예지력 있는 전술가 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_group_tactics ( [Ψ]Prescient Tactician (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"Gazing into the near future, you can call out warnings to your followers so they can avoid attacks before they occur.  This will greatly increase their defensive capability, though it will be harder for you to defend yourself.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more concentration</color> than usual."
msgstr ""
"가까운 미래를 내다보며 추종자들에게 경고를 보내 공격이 발생하기 전에 피할 수 있도록 할 수 있습니다. 이렇게 하면 추종자들의 방어력이 크게 향상되지만, 당신은 스스로를 방어하기 더 어려워집니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중력</color>을 통해 유지되며, <color_yellow>집중력이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>. 평소보다 <color_yellow>더 많은 집중력</color>이 필요합니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "clair_omniscience"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid "[Ψ]Omniscence"
msgstr "[Ψ]전지전능"

#. ~ Description of spell "clair_omniscience ( [Ψ]Omniscence )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience.json
msgid ""
"Extend your senses to a supernal degree, perceiving everything within the "
"nearby area.  Every creature, every object, every blade of grass, "
"everything.  <color_red>EVERYTHING</color>."
msgstr ""
"감각을 최고 수준으로 확장하여 주변 지역의 모든 것을 감지하세요. 모든 생물, 모든 사물, 모든 풀잎, 모든 것. "
"<color_red>모든 것</color>."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_BETTER_SENSES_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "All of your senses are enhanced."
msgstr "모든 감각이 강화됩니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_REMOVE_BETTER_SENSES"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "The world now seems separated from you by a thin veil."
msgstr "이제 세상은 얇은 베일로 당신과 분리된 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_NIGHT_EYES_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You open your senses to the world."
msgstr "당신은 세상에 대한 감각을 엽니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_SPEED_READING_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You feel like sitting down with a good book."
msgstr "좋은 책을 들고 앉아서 읽고 싶은 기분입니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_REMOVE_SPEED_READ"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "Your eyes ache a bit.  Maybe it's time to put the book down."
msgstr "눈이 좀 아프네요. 이제 책을 내려놓을 때가 된 것 같네요."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_SEE_AURAS_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "Swirling colors coalesce around others' bodies"
msgstr "다른 사람의 몸 주위로 소용돌이치는 색깔들이 합쳐진다"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_DANGER_SENSE_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You become preternaturally aware of possible dangers."
msgstr "당신은 초자연적으로 발생할 수 있는 위험을 알게 됩니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RANGED_ENHANCE_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Distances seem to narrow and your enemies' movements seem to slow as their "
"vulnerabilities are laid bare."
msgstr "거리가 좁아지고 적의 움직임이 느려지면서 적의 취약점이 드러납니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CLAIR_SENSE_HOSTILE_CREATURES_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You open your senses to the dangers of the world."
msgstr "당신은 세상의 위험에 감각을 엽니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_DODGE_POWER_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You can see a premonition of your enemies' attacks like a ghostly image."
msgstr "적의 공격에 대한 예감을 유령의 이미지처럼 볼 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_CRAFT_BONUS_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You can see how it all fits together, and how it *should* fit together."
msgstr "모든 것이 어떻게 조화를 이루는지, 그리고 *어떻게* 조화를 이루어야 하는지 볼 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_CLEAR_SIGHT_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "Your senses sharpen and all distractions vanish."
msgstr "감각이 예민해지고 모든 방해 요소가 사라집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_GROUP_TACTICS_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_concentration_eocs.json
msgid ""
"As the visions overtake you, you start involuntarily calling out warnings to"
" your allies."
msgstr "환상이 당신을 사로잡으면서, 당신은 무의식적으로 동맹국들에게 경고를 외치기 시작합니다."

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
msgid "Check yourself"
msgstr "자신을 확인하세요"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
msgid "Check your surroundings"
msgstr "주변을 확인하세요"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Cast your subtle senses over yourself, seeing if you are contaminated with "
"radiation."
msgstr "미묘한 감각을 통해 자신이 방사능에 오염되었는지 확인해보세요."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Open your inner eye, searching your environment for dangerous radiation."
msgstr "내면의 눈을 뜨고 주변 환경에서 위험한 방사선을 찾아보세요."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Turning your senses on yourself, you see none of the insidious glow typical "
"of radiation.  You are in the clear, for now."
msgstr "감각을 돌려 자신에게로 향했지만, 방사선에서 흔히 볼 수 있는 은밀한 빛은 전혀 보이지 않습니다. 일단은 안전합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_2" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Turning your senses on yourself, you see a few dull glimmers, hidden deep in"
" your flesh.  The damage is minimal for now, but you had best not let it "
"fester."
msgstr ""
"정신을 차려보니, 살갗 깊숙이 숨겨진 희미한 희미한 빛이 보입니다. 당장은 피해가 미미하지만, 더 악화시키지 않는 게 최선입니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_3" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_2" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Turning your senses on yourself, you see a dull glow along your core.  Your "
"radiation is climbing, though it's still not in the danger zone."
msgstr ""
"감각을 돌려 자신에게로 향하니, 몸 중심부를 따라 희미한 빛이 보입니다. 방사능 수치가 상승하고 있지만, 아직 위험 수준은 아닙니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_4" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_3" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_2" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Turning your senses on yourself, you see a faint glow spreading outward from"
" your core to your limbs.  You're getting closer to dangerous levels--you "
"should deal with it before it gets worse."
msgstr ""
"정신을 차려보니 희미한 빛이 몸 중심에서 팔다리로 퍼져 나가는 게 보입니다. 위험 수준에 가까워지고 있습니다. 더 악화되기 전에 대처해야"
" 합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_5" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_4" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_3" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_2" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Turning your senses on yourself, you see a glow along your bones.  You had "
"best seek treatment, and soon."
msgstr "감각을 자신에게로 돌리자 뼈를 따라 빛이 새어 나오는 것을 보았습니다. 빨리 치료를 받는 것이 최선입니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_6" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_5" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_4" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_3" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT_2" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_RAD_SENSE_SELF_REPORT"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Turning your senses on yourself, you see a steady glow all along your "
"muscles and bones.  You are in real trouble if you don't deal with your "
"radiation immediately."
msgstr ""
"감각을 돌려보면 근육과 뼈 전체에 꾸준한 빛이 비치는 것을 볼 수 있습니다. 방사선 치료를 즉시 받지 않으면 정말 큰일 납니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CLAIR_EXAMINE_ITEM_DETECTION" in nested EOCs on true condition in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_EXAMINE_ITEM_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
msgid ""
"The strange object has an otherworldly resonance about it (about "
"<color_light_cyan><context_val:artifact_resonance></color> resonance )."
msgstr ""
"이 이상한 물체는 이 세상에서 찾아볼 수 없는 "
"공명(<color_light_cyan><context_val:artifact_resonance></color> 정도의 공명)을 가지고 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CLAIR_EXAMINE_ITEM_DETECTION" in nested EOCs on true condition in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_EXAMINE_ITEM_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
msgid ""
"You have a sense of vast distances from this object, as though it came from "
"a place you would never find on any map.  For a moment, you see an eagle "
"stooping over a snake, wings flashing in the sun, and a vast shape moving "
"through the void between the stars."
msgstr ""
"마치 어떤 지도에서도 찾을 수 없는 곳에서 온 것처럼, 이 물체에서 멀리 떨어진 듯한 광활한 거리가 느껴집니다. 잠시, 독수리가 뱀 위로"
" 몸을 숙이고 햇빛에 번쩍이는 날개와 별들 사이의 공허 속에서 움직이는 거대한 형체가 보입니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CLAIR_CRAFTING_ADD_BLINDNESS_WHEN_CRAFTING"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
msgid "You close your eyes as the visions overtake you."
msgstr "당신은 환상이 당신을 사로잡자 눈을 감습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CLAIR_CRAFTING_REMOVE_BLINDNESS_WHEN_DONE_CRAFTING"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
msgid "You open your eyes as the visions fade."
msgstr "당신은 환상이 사라지는 것을 보며 눈을 뜬다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CLAIR_ASTRAL_PROJECTION_INITIATE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HEDGE_ASTRAL_PROJECTION"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid "As you meditate, you feel your spirit slipping free from your body."
msgstr "명상을 하면 영혼이 몸에서 빠져나가는 것을 느낄 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Success message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CLAIR_ASTRAL_PROJECTION_DEACTIVATE"
#. ~ Success message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HEDGE_ASTRAL_PROJECTION_DEACTIVATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/clairsentience_eoc.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_eocs.json
msgid "You snap back into your body once again."
msgstr "당신은 다시 한번 본래의 몸으로 돌아왔습니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "classless_toggleable_concentration_end"
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_classless_toggleable_concentration_end"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/classless.json
msgid "[Ψ]Stop Concentrating"
msgstr "[Ψ]집중을 멈추세요"

#. ~ Description of spell "classless_toggleable_concentration_end ( [Ψ]Stop
#. Concentrating )"
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_classless_toggleable_concentration_end (
#. [Ψ]Stop Concentrating )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/classless.json
msgid ""
"End your concentration on all of your maintained powers.\n"
"\n"
"Channeling this power <color_green>always succeeds</color>."
msgstr ""
"유지 중인 모든 능력에 대한 집중을 멈추세요.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력을 사용하면 <color_green>항상 성공합니다</color>."

#. ~ Message of spell "classless_toggleable_concentration_end ( [Ψ]Stop
#. Concentrating )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
msgid "You stop concentrating on your powers."
msgstr "당신은 자신의 능력에 집중하는 것을 멈춥니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "classless_specific_concentration_end"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
msgid "[Ψ]Stop Concentrating (Individual)"
msgstr "[Ψ]집중을 멈추세요(개인)"

#. ~ Description of spell "classless_specific_concentration_end ( [Ψ]Stop
#. Concentrating (Individual) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
msgid ""
"End your concentration on a specific power.\n"
"\n"
"Channeling this power <color_green>always succeeds</color>."
msgstr ""
"특정 능력에 대한 집중을 끝내세요.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력을 사용하면 <color_green>항상 성공합니다</color>."

#. ~ Message of spell "classless_specific_concentration_end ( [Ψ]Stop
#. Concentrating (Individual) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/classless.json
msgid "You stop concentrating on one of your powers."
msgstr "당신은 자신의 능력 중 하나에 집중하는 것을 멈춥니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_see_electric"
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_electrokinetic_see_electric"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Spark Sight (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]스파크 사이트(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_see_electric ( [Ψ]Spark Sight (C) )"
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_electrokinetic_see_electric ( [Ψ]Spark Sight
#. (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Open your senses to the flow of electricity, revealing nearby electrical creatures or robots.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"감각을 열어 전기의 흐름을 감지하세요. 근처에 전기 생물이나 로봇이 있는지 확인해 보세요.\n"
"\n"
"이 힘은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_shock_touch"
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_electrokinetic_shock_touch"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Static Touch"
msgstr "[Ψ]정적 터치"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_shock_touch ( [Ψ]Static Touch )"
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_electrokinetic_shock_touch ( [Ψ]Static Touch )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Unleash a shock when touching a target, doing a small amount of damage and "
"dazing them."
msgstr "타겟에게 닿으면 전기 충격을 가해 소량의 피해를 입히고 기절시킵니다."

#. ~ Sound description of spell "electrokinetic_shock_touch ( [Ψ]Static Touch
#. )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "afs_electrokinetic_shock_touch ( [Ψ]Static
#. Touch )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid "zzzaaaaapp!"
msgstr "짜자아아아앙!"

#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_shock_touch ( [Ψ]Static Touch )"
#. ~ Message of spell "afs_electrokinetic_shock_touch ( [Ψ]Static Touch )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid "Your hands crackle with sparks!"
msgstr "당신의 손에서 불꽃이 튀어요!"

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_zap_enemies"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Electrical Discharge (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]전기 방전(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_zap_enemies ( [Ψ]Electrical
#. Discharge (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Build up a charge in your body, zapping anyone who attempts to attack you.  It will also protect you from EMP attacks.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"몸에 전하를 축적하여 공격하려는 모든 적을 감전시킵니다. 또한 EMP 공격으로부터 보호해 줍니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_melee_attacks"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Voltaic Strikes (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]볼타 충돌(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_melee_attacks ( [Ψ]Voltaic Strikes
#. (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Unleash electrical blasts on those you strike in melee.  It also provides protection against electrical damage.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"근접 공격으로 적중한 적에게 전기 폭발을 일으킵니다. 또한 전기 피해로부터 보호합니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_ylow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_ylow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_melee_attacks ( [Ψ]Voltaic Strikes (C)
#. )"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_MELEE_ATTACKS_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "Lightning crackles between your fingers!"
msgstr "번개가 손가락 사이로 딱딱거립니다!"

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_hacking_interface"
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_electrokinetic_hacking_interface"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Hacking Interface (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]해킹 인터페이스(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_hacking_interface ( [Ψ]Hacking
#. Interface (C) )"
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_electrokinetic_hacking_interface ( [Ψ]Hacking
#. Interface (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Create an electrical interface with your powers, allowing you to hack nearby devices as if you were using a computer.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"당신의 능력으로 전기적 인터페이스를 만들어 마치 컴퓨터를 사용하듯 주변 장치를 해킹할 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>능력이 상실될 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_personal_battery"
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_electrokinetic_personal_battery"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Electron Overflow (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]전자 오버플로(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_personal_battery ( [Ψ]Electron
#. Overflow (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Generate power for battery-powered devices on your person.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"배터리로 작동하는 기기에 전원을 공급하세요.\n"
"\n"
"이 전원은 <color_yellow>집중력에 의해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중력이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>고장날 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_paralysis"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Neural Spasms"
msgstr "[Ψ]신경 경련"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_paralysis ( [Ψ]Neural Spasms )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Cause an electrical burst in the target's nervous system (or the remains of "
"it), incapacitating them briefly.  It will only work on targets that have, "
"or had, a nervous system."
msgstr ""
"대상의 신경계(또는 그 잔여물)에 전기적 파열을 일으켜 잠시 무력화시킵니다. 신경계가 있거나 있었던 대상에게만 효과가 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_reduce_pain"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Pain Suppression (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]통증억제(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_reduce_pain ( [Ψ]Pain Suppression
#. (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"With your control over electricity, reduce the strength of the pain signals in your own body.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"전기를 제어하여 자신의 몸에서 발생하는 통증 신호의 강도를 줄이세요.\n"
"\n"
"이 힘은 <color_ylow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_ylow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_bolt"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Electrocutioner"
msgstr "[Ψ]감전사"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_bolt ( [Ψ]Electrocutioner
#. )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "Launch a bolt of lightning at a nearby target."
msgstr "근처의 목표물에 번개를 발사합니다."

#. ~ Sound description of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_bolt (
#. [Ψ]Electrocutioner )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "electrokinetic_kill_robot_sparks ( [Ψ]Short
#. Circuit Lightning Burst )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_blast ( [Ψ]Ion Blast
#. )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "sylph_massive_lightning_bolt_spell ( Fist of
#. Heaven's Fury )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/sylph_mutation_spells.json
msgid "zzzzaaaaaapp!"
msgstr "zzzzaaaaaaaapp!"

#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_bolt ( [Ψ]Electrocutioner )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "You unleash a bolt of lightning."
msgstr "당신은 번개를 발사합니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_recharge_vehicle"
#. ~ Name of spell "afs_electrokinetic_recharge_vehicle"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Re-energize"
msgstr "[Ψ]재활용"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_recharge_vehicle ( [Ψ]Re-energize )"
#. ~ Description of spell "afs_electrokinetic_recharge_vehicle ( [Ψ]Re-
#. energize )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Turn your own energy into power for a vehicle or appliance.  You need merely"
" touch the vehicle or any part of the power grid to recharge the batteries."
msgstr ""
"자신의 에너지를 차량이나 가전제품에 필요한 전력으로 전환하세요. 차량이나 전력망의 어느 부분이든 터치하기만 하면 배터리가 충전됩니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_recharge_vehicle ( [Ψ]Re-energize )"
#. ~ Message of spell "afs_electrokinetic_recharge_vehicle ( [Ψ]Re-energize )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis.json
msgid "Power flows into your target."
msgstr "힘이 당신의 목표에 흐릅니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_pain_immune"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Analgesic Block"
msgstr "[Ψ]진통 차단"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_pain_immune ( [Ψ]Analgesic Block )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"By clamping down on all pain signals you can completely eliminate your ability to feel pain briefly.  This does not eliminate the source of pain, and when the power ends all of the original pain and more will return.\n"
"\n"
"Analgesic Block is <color_red>incompatible</color> with Neuro-Acceleration."
msgstr ""
"모든 통증 신호를 억제하면 일시적으로 통증을 느끼는 능력을 완전히 없앨 수 있습니다. 하지만 이는 통증의 근원을 제거하는 것이 아니며, 통증이 사라지면 원래의 통증과 그 이상의 통증이 다시 나타날 것입니다.\n"
"\n"
"진통 차단은 신경 가속과 <color_red>호환되지 않습니다</color>."

#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_pain_immune ( [Ψ]Analgesic Block )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "The pain just… disappears."
msgstr "고통은 그냥 사라져요."

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_speed_boost"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Neuro-acceleration"
msgstr "[Ψ]신경 가속"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_speed_boost ( [Ψ]Neuro-acceleration
#. )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"You can improve the efficiency of your or an ally's nervous system, allowing for much faster response times.  This also increases the target's ability to retain information.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  Neuro-acceleration is <color_red>incompatible</color> with Analgesic Block.  When used on <color_green>allies</color>, the power has <color_yellow>one-half the normal duration</color>."
msgstr ""
"자신이나 아군의 신경계 효율을 향상시켜 반응 속도를 크게 높일 수 있습니다. 또한 대상의 정보 기억 능력도 향상됩니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>. 신경 가속은 진통 차단과 <color_red>양립할 수 없습니다</color>. <color_green>아군</color>에게 사용할 경우, 이 능력은 <color_yellow>일반 지속 시간의 절반</color>으로 유지됩니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_kill_robot"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Short Circuit"
msgstr "[Ψ]단락 회로"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_kill_robot ( [Ψ]Short Circuit )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "Cause a massive power surge within a robot or cyborg, disabling it."
msgstr "로봇이나 사이보그 내부에 엄청난 전력 급증을 일으켜 무력화시킵니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_kill_robot ( [Ψ]Short Circuit )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "You channel a surge of power into your target!"
msgstr "당신은 목표물에 엄청난 힘을 불어넣습니다!"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_robot_interface ( [Ψ]Robotic
#. Interface )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Use your powers to remotely interface with a robot's internal circuitry, "
"allowing you to hack it if you have the skill."
msgstr "로봇의 내부 회로와 원격으로 접속할 수 있는 능력을 사용하면, 해당 기술이 있다면 해킹도 가능합니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_aura"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Galvanic Aura (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]갈바닉 오라(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_aura ( [Ψ]Galvanic Aura
#. (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Charge the air around you with power, unleashing blasts at anyone nearby.  This power does not discriminate between friend and foe.  It will also protect you from electricity while active.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>"
msgstr ""
"주변 공기를 힘으로 가득 채워 근처 모든 대상에게 폭발을 퍼붓습니다. 이 능력은 아군과 적군을 가리지 않습니다. 또한 활성화되어 있는 동안 전기로부터 보호해 줍니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_aura ( [Ψ]Galvanic Aura (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "The air around you hums with power."
msgstr "당신 주변의 공기가 강력한 힘으로 웅웅거립니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_blast"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Ion Blast"
msgstr "[Ψ]이온 폭발"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_blast ( [Ψ]Ion Blast )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Launch a blast of lightning at a nearby target, causing a secondary "
"explosion at the location."
msgstr "근처 목표물에 번개를 발사하여 해당 위치에 2차 폭발을 일으킵니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_lightning_blast ( [Ψ]Ion Blast )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "You unleash an explosive blast of lightning."
msgstr "폭발적인 번개를 발사합니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "electrokinetic_revive"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Revivification"
msgstr "[Ψ]부활"

#. ~ Description of spell "electrokinetic_revive ( [Ψ]Revivification )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Manipulate the nervous system of a corpse, causing it to rise and protect "
"you.  This protection will only last a short time."
msgstr "시체의 신경계를 조종하여 시체가 깨어나 당신을 보호하게 합니다. 이 보호는 잠시만 지속됩니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "electrokinetic_revive ( [Ψ]Revivification )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis.json
msgid "You charge a nearby corpse with lightning."
msgstr "근처의 시체에 번개를 던집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_SEE_ELECTRICITY_INITIATE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_AFS_ELECTROKIN_SEE_ELECTRICITY_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You open your senses to the flow of current."
msgstr "당신은 전류의 흐름에 감각을 엽니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ELECTROKIN_HACKING_INTERFACE_INITIATE"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_AFS_ELECTROKIN_HACKING_INTERFACE_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You now have the ability to hack into nearby electronics."
msgstr "이제 근처의 전자기기를 해킹할 수 있게 되었습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ELECTROKIN_PERSONAL_BATTERY_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "The power you channel vanishes into nothingness."
msgstr "당신이 쏟은 힘은 허무하게 사라집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ELECTROKIN_PERSONAL_BATTERY_INITIATE_REAL"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_AFS_ELECTROKIN_PERSONAL_BATTERY_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/spells/psionics/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "The hair on your body stands up on end."
msgstr "당신 몸의 털이 곤두서게 됩니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_REDUCE_PAIN_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "The aches and pains of post-Cataclysmic life fade, just a little."
msgstr "대격변 이후의 삶의 고통과 아픔은 조금씩 사라져 갑니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_SPEED_BOOST_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "You enhance the functioning of your neurons."
msgstr "신경 세포의 기능이 향상됩니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_LIGHTNING_AURA_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_concentration_eocs.json
msgid "The air around you begins crackling with electricity!"
msgstr "당신 주변의 공기가 전기로 딱딱거리기 시작합니다!"

#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ELECTROKIN_PARALYSIS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_eoc.json
msgid "You overload the target's neurons!"
msgstr "타겟의 신경세포에 과부하를 주었어요!"

#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ELECTROKIN_PARALYSIS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_eoc.json
msgid "You attempt to overload the target's neurons but nothing happens!"
msgstr "타겟의 뉴런에 과부하를 주려고 시도했지만 아무 일도 일어나지 않았습니다!"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ELECTROKIN_PAIN_IMMUNE_ON"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/electrokinesis_eoc.json
msgid "You are already under the effects of Analgesic Block!"
msgstr "당신은 이미 진통 차단 효과를 받고 있습니다!"

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_local"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Candle's Glow (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]캔들의 빛 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_local ( [Ψ]Candle's Glow (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Create a simple patch of light nearby, sufficient to read or perform simple tasks with.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"근처에 책을 읽거나 간단한 작업을 수행하기에 충분한 간단한 빛줄기를 만드세요.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>. <color_red>전투에 참여하면 효과가 취소됩니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_create_light"
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_create_light_01"
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_create_light_02"
#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_create_light_03"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Field of Light"
msgstr "[Ψ]빛의 장"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_create_light ( [Ψ]Field of Light )"
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_create_light_01 ( [Ψ]Field of Light )"
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_create_light_02 ( [Ψ]Field of Light )"
#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_create_light_03 ( [Ψ]Field of Light )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "Create photons to illuminate an entire area."
msgstr "전체 영역을 밝히는 광자를 생성합니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_create_light ( [Ψ]Field of Light )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "Sudden light bursts forth!"
msgstr "갑자기 빛이 터져나왔다!"

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_up_enemy"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Illuminate"
msgstr "[Ψ]조명하다"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_up_enemy ( [Ψ]Illuminate )"
#. ~ Description of spell "xe_werewolf_illuminate_target_spell ( Moon's Cold
#. Glow )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/werewolf_spells.json
msgid ""
"Surround a single target with a outline of line that follows them as they "
"move, revealing their position at all times."
msgstr "단일 대상을 그들이 움직일 때 따라가는 선으로 둘러싸서 항상 그들의 위치를 드러냅니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_light_up_enemy ( [Ψ]Illuminate )"
#. ~ Message of spell "xe_werewolf_illuminate_target_spell ( Moon's Cold Glow
#. )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/werewolf_spells.json
msgid "Your target is outlined in light."
msgstr "당신의 목표는 빛으로 윤곽이 그려져 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_snuff_light"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Blackout"
msgstr "[Ψ]블랙아웃"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_snuff_light ( [Ψ]Blackout )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "Interrupt the flow of photons to create an area of darkness."
msgstr "광자의 흐름을 방해하여 어둠의 영역을 만듭니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_snuff_light ( [Ψ]Blackout )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "As you concentrate, an area nearby is plunged into darkness!"
msgstr "당신이 집중하면, 근처 지역이 어둠 속으로 빠져듭니다!"

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_dodge"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Trick of the Light (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]빛의 속임수 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_dodge ( [Ψ]Trick of the Light
#. (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Manipulate the light around your body, creating shifting illusions, blurring your outline and position, and becoming harder to hit.  An enemy successfully hitting you will pinpoint your location and <color_red>disrupt the power</color>.\n"
"\n"
"his power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"몸 주변의 빛을 조작하여 움직이는 환영을 만들고, 윤곽과 위치를 흐릿하게 만들며, 공격하기 어렵게 만듭니다. 적이 당신을 공격하면 당신의 위치를 정확히 파악하고 <color_red>능력을 방해합니다</color>.\n"
"\n"
"그의 능력은 <color_ylow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_ylow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_beam"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Photon Beam"
msgstr "[Ψ]광자 빔"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_beam ( [Ψ]Photon Beam )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "Concentrate photons into a high-energy beam."
msgstr "광자를 고에너지 빔으로 집중시킵니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_light_beam ( [Ψ]Photon Beam )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "You fire a searing beam of light!"
msgstr "당신은 뜨거운 빛줄기를 발사합니다!"

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_camouflage"
#. ~ Combination of chameleon and camouflage
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Chameleoflage (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]카멜레오플라주(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_camouflage ( [Ψ]Chameleoflage (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"By blending the light reflecting from you with the light reflecting from nearby surfaces, you can make yourself much harder to spot from a distance.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"자신에게서 반사되는 빛과 주변 표면에서 반사되는 빛을 섞으면 멀리서 자신을 발견하기 훨씬 어려워집니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중력</color>을 통해 유지되며, <color_yellow>집중력이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_rad_immunity"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Lucent Barrier (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]루센트 배리어(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_rad_immunity ( [Ψ]Lucent Barrier (C)
#. )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Create a barrier of light around yourself to protect against radiation and light damage.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"방사선과 빛으로부터 자신을 보호하기 위해 주변에 빛의 장벽을 생성하세요.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_ylow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_ylow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_arms"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Refracted Arms"
msgstr "[Ψ]굴절된 팔"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_arms ( [Ψ]Refracted Arms )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Create the illusion of extra arms and wielded items to trick your enemies, "
"forcing them off balance and rendering them open to attack."
msgstr "적을 속여 균형을 깨뜨리고 공격에 취약하게 만들기 위해 추가 무기와 사용하는 아이템의 환상을 만들어냅니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_light_arms ( [Ψ]Refracted Arms )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Light around your arms shimmers and refracts, creating the illusion of "
"multiple arms."
msgstr "팔 주위의 빛이 반짝이고 굴절되어 팔이 여러 개인 것 같은 착각을 불러일으킵니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_hide_ugly"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Mirror-Mask (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]미러 마스크(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_hide_ugly ( [Ψ]Mirror-Mask (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Hide your true form behind unassuming illusions, preventing baseline humans from reacting poorly to your presence if you are mutated or a cyborg.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"진정한 모습을 겸손한 환상 뒤에 숨겨, 돌연변이나 사이보그일 때 일반 인간이 당신의 존재에 부정적으로 반응하는 것을 방지하세요.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>. <color_red>전투에 참여하면 취소됩니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_flash_bang"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Flashbang"
msgstr "[Ψ]플래시뱅"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_flash_bang ( [Ψ]Flashbang )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Create a concentration of photons and EM radiation and then allow them to "
"burst outward, creating a bright flash of light accompanied by a loud sound,"
" producing a flashbang effect."
msgstr "광자와 전자기파를 집중시킨 다음 폭발시켜 밝은 빛과 큰 소리를 내며 플래시뱅 효과를 생성합니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_flash_bang ( [Ψ]Flashbang )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "The air bursts into a eye-searing flash accompanied by a loud bang!"
msgstr "공기가 눈을 찌르는 듯한 섬광과 함께 큰 굉음이 터져나왔다!"

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_image"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Lucid Shadows"
msgstr "[Ψ]명료한 그림자"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_image ( [Ψ]Lucid Shadows )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "Form images of yourself to confuse and distract enemies."
msgstr "자신의 이미지를 형성하여 적을 혼란스럽게 하고 주의를 분산시키세요."

#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_light_image ( [Ψ]Lucid Shadows )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "Identical copies of you suddenly appear!"
msgstr "당신과 똑같은 사람이 갑자기 나타났어요!"

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_radio"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Radio Transception (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]무선 전송(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_radio ( [Ψ]Radio Transception (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Attune your senses to radio waves, allowing you to listen to transmissions and send them yourself.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"감각을 전파에 맞춰 전파를 듣고 직접 전송할 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>. <color_red>전투에 참여하면 효과가 사라집니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_sterilize_food"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Gamma Sterilization"
msgstr "[Ψ]감마 살균"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_sterilize_food ( [Ψ]Gamma
#. Sterilization )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Use a focused emission of high-power radiation to eliminating microorganisms"
" in food and allowing it to last much longer before rotting.  This power is "
"<color_red>extremely taxing</color>."
msgstr ""
"고출력 방사선을 집중적으로 방출하여 식품 내 미생물을 제거하고 부패하기 전까지 식품의 수명을 연장합니다. 이 기술은 "
"<color_red>매우 강력합니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_stun_robots"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Sensor Jamming"
msgstr "[Ψ]센서 재밍"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_stun_robots ( [Ψ]Sensor Jamming )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Unleash a localized burst of electromagnetic radiation, overloading any "
"electronic sensory equipment in the area."
msgstr "전자기파를 국지적으로 폭발시켜 해당 지역의 모든 전자 감지 장비를 과부하시킵니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_stun_robots ( [Ψ]Sensor Jamming )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "You unleash an electromagnetic wave!"
msgstr "전자파를 방출하세요!"

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_invisibility"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Veil of Light (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]빛의 베일 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_invisibility ( [Ψ]Veil of Light (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Refract light around yourself to become invisible.  Moving too quickly has a chance to disrupt the effect, and attacking in melee will invariably do so.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"주변 빛을 굴절시켜 투명해집니다. 너무 빨리 움직이면 효과가 흐트러질 수 있으며, 근접 공격 시 효과가 흐트러질 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_flash"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Star Flash"
msgstr "[Ψ]스타 플래시"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_flash ( [Ψ]Star Flash )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Create a destructive flash of light in a line, damaging all targets caught "
"in the beam."
msgstr "일직선으로 파괴적인 빛을 발사하여 광선에 잡힌 모든 대상에게 피해를 입힙니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_light_flash ( [Ψ]Star Flash )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "You fire a searing wave of light!"
msgstr "당신은 뜨거운 빛의 파동을 발사합니다!"

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_blinding_glare"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Blinding Radiance (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]눈부신 광채 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_blinding_glare ( [Ψ]Blinding Radiance
#. (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"You can emit so much light that anyone trying to attack you risks being blinded.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"당신은 공격하려는 사람이 실명할 위험이 있을 만큼 엄청난 빛을 방출할 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_ylow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_ylow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_disintegrate"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Luminous Disintegration"
msgstr "[Ψ]빛나는 분해"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_disintegrate ( [Ψ]Luminous
#. Disintegration )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Concentrate a massive amount of light into a single target, causing it to "
"disintegrate."
msgstr "엄청난 양의 빛을 하나의 표적에 집중시켜 분해시킵니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "photokinetic_light_disintegrate ( [Ψ]Luminous
#. Disintegration )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "You focus a pointpoint burst of light on your target!"
msgstr "당신은 목표물에 빛의 집중을 시킵니다!"

#. ~ Name of spell "photokinetic_light_army"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Phantom Legion (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]팬텀 리전 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "photokinetic_light_army ( [Ψ]Phantom Legion (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Create a myriad of illusions around yourself to mislead and confuse your enemies.  The illusions will explode into blinding flashes if damaged.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It requires <color_yellow>even more concentration</color> than usual.  Concentration will <color_green>automatically end</color> if all illusions are destroyed."
msgstr ""
"주변에 수많은 환영을 생성하여 적을 현혹하고 혼란에 빠뜨립니다. 환영이 손상되면 눈부신 섬광으로 폭발합니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>실패할 수 있습니다</color>. 평소보다 <color_yellow>더 많은 집중</color>이 필요합니다. 모든 환영이 파괴되면 집중이 <color_green>자동으로 종료됩니다</color>."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LIGHT_LOCAL_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "A soft glow springs up around you."
msgstr "부드러운 빛이 당신 주위로 솟아오릅니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LIGHT_DODGE_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "You are surrounded by shifting illusions."
msgstr "당신은 변화하는 환상에 둘러싸여 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_RAD_IMMUNITY_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid ""
"The air around you shimmers as an invisible barrier of light forms around "
"you."
msgstr "당신 주변의 공기가 반짝거리고, 당신 주변에는 눈에 보이지 않는 빛의 장벽이 형성됩니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_CAMOUFLAGE_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "You twist nearby light to help conceal you from distant observers."
msgstr "가까운 빛을 돌려서 멀리 있는 관찰자의 눈을 피할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_HIDE_UGLY_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "You shroud your true form behind unassuming illusions."
msgstr "당신은 당신의 진정한 모습을 겸손한 환상 뒤에 가립니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_RADIO_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "You attune your senses to passing radio waves."
msgstr "당신은 지나가는 전파에 감각을 맞춘다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_INVISIBILITY_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Suddenly, the world around you seems like it's on the other side of the "
"surface of water."
msgstr "갑자기, 주변 세계가 물 표면의 반대편에 있는 것처럼 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_BLINDING_GLARE_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "You begin glowing as brightly as the sun!"
msgstr "당신은 태양처럼 밝게 빛나기 시작합니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PHOTOKIN_LIGHT_ARMY_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "A myriad of duplicates of yourself appear nearby!"
msgstr "근처에 당신과 똑같은 사람이 무수히 많이 나타납니다!"

#. ~ Player spell casting message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PHOTOKIN_REMOVE_LIGHT_ARMY"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "The remaining light duplicates disappear."
msgstr "남아 있는 밝은 복제본은 사라집니다."

#. ~ Player inventory menu title in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PHOTOKINETIC_STERILIZE_FOODS"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/photokinesis_eocs.json
msgid "What food or drink do you want to sterilize?"
msgstr "어떤 음식이나 음료를 살균하고 싶으신가요?"

#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_eruption"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Fountain of Flames"
msgstr "[Ψ]불꽃의 분수"

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_eruption ( [Ψ]Fountain of Flames )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "Cause a burst of flames at the target location."
msgstr "목표 위치에 화염을 일으킨다."

#. ~ Message of spell "pyrokinetic_eruption ( [Ψ]Fountain of Flames )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "You summon flames!"
msgstr "당신은 불꽃을 소환합니다!"

#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_flash"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Brilliant Flash"
msgstr "[Ψ]찬란한 플래시"

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_flash ( [Ψ]Brilliant Flash )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"By strongly exciting the air at a particular point, you produce a burst of "
"light."
msgstr "특정 지점의 공기를 강하게 자극하면 빛이 터져 나옵니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_cauterize"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Cauterize"
msgstr "[Ψ]소작하다"

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_cauterize ( [Ψ]Cauterize )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Using an extremely focused application of pyrokinesis, sear a wound shut to "
"stop the bleeding.  This is liable to be painful and is almost certainly "
"likely to just cause more damage if you don't have any medical knowledge.  "
"If the bleeding is too strong, cauterization will be ineffective, and there "
"is a <color_red>chance of infection</color> whether you are successful or "
"not."
msgstr ""
"극도로 집중적인 발열작용을 사용하여 상처를 태워 지혈합니다. 이 방법은 고통스러울 수 있으며, 의학적 지식이 없다면 오히려 더 큰 손상을"
" 초래할 가능성이 높습니다. 출혈이 너무 심하면 소작술이 효과가 없으며, 성공 여부와 관계없이 <color_red>감염 "
"가능성</color>이 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_call_flames"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Banked Flames (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]뱅크드 플레임스 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_call_flames ( [Ψ]Banked Flames (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Call up flames over your outstretched hand.  You can use them to heat up food, boil water, start fires, or anything else fire can accomplish.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"뻗은 손 위로 불꽃을 불러일으킵니다. 음식을 데우거나, 물을 끓이거나, 불을 피우거나, 불이 할 수 있는 모든 것을 할 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_ylow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_ylow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>. <color_red>전투에 참여하면 효과가 취소됩니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_quell_flames"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Quell Fire"
msgstr "[Ψ]진압 불"

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_quell_flames ( [Ψ]Quell Fire )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "As you can create fire, you can also extinguish it."
msgstr "불을 만들 수도 있지만, 끌 수도 있습니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "pyrokinetic_quell_flames ( [Ψ]Quell Fire )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "You disperse the flames harmlessly."
msgstr "당신은 불길을 무해하게 분산시킵니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_cloak"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Cloak of Warmth (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]따뜻함의 망토 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_cloak ( [Ψ]Cloak of Warmth (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Control the temperature of the nearby air, warming you and protecting you against flames.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"주변 공기의 온도를 조절하여 몸을 따뜻하게 하고 화염으로부터 보호합니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 힘은 <color_yellow>집중력에 의해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중력이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>작동하지 않을 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_flamethrower"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Flamethrower"
msgstr "[Ψ]화염방사기"

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_flamethrower ( [Ψ]Flamethrower )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "Spray fire in a cone in front of you."
msgstr "당신 앞에 원뿔 모양으로 불을 뿜으세요."

#. ~ Message of spell "pyrokinetic_flamethrower ( [Ψ]Flamethrower )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "You hurl a spray of flames."
msgstr "당신은 불꽃을 뿜어냅니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_lance"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Incandescent Lance (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]백열창 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_lance ( [Ψ]Incandescent Lance (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Concentrate heat into a thin, searing beam capable of cutting through solid metal or welding it together.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>.  It is <color_red>canceled by engaging in combat</color>."
msgstr ""
"열을 가늘고 뜨거운 광선으로 집중시켜 단단한 금속을 절단하거나 용접할 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 힘은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>. <color_red>전투에 참여하면 효과가 취소됩니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_thermogenesis"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Thermogenesis"
msgstr "[Ψ]열발생"

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_thermogenesis ( [Ψ]Thermogenesis )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Heat the air nearby and maintain it, taking off the chill or turning winter "
"to warm summer."
msgstr "근처의 공기를 따뜻하게 유지하고 추위를 없애거나 겨울을 따뜻한 여름으로 바꿔줍니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_aura"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Blazing Aura (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]불타는 오라 (C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_aura ( [Ψ]Blazing Aura (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Surround yourself with a cloud of flames, damaging anyone in melee combat with you.  The flames also produce light.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"자신을 불꽃 구름으로 감싸 근접 전투 중인 모든 적에게 피해를 입힙니다. 불꽃은 또한 빛을 생성합니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 능력은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_flame_immunity"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Flameshield (C)"
msgstr "[Ψ]화염방패(C)"

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_flame_immunity ( [Ψ]Flameshield (C) )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Your power over fire is such that you can now step directly into raging flames and walk through them unharmed, feeling no more than a pleasant warmth.\n"
"\n"
"This power <color_yellow>is maintained by concentration</color> and <color_red>may fail</color> if <color_yellow>concentration is interrupted</color>."
msgstr ""
"불을 다스리는 당신의 힘은 이제 맹렬한 불길 속으로 직접 들어가도 다치지 않고 그 속을 걸을 수 있을 정도입니다. 기분 좋은 온기 외에는 아무것도 느끼지 못합니다.\n"
"\n"
"이 힘은 <color_yellow>집중을 통해 유지되며</color>, <color_yellow>집중이 방해받으면</color> <color_red>효과가 사라질 수 있습니다</color>."

#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_blast"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Conflagration"
msgstr "[Ψ]화재"

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_blast ( [Ψ]Conflagration )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Create an expanding fireball that catches multiple targets in its wake."
msgstr "여러 대상을 덮치는 확장되는 불덩어리를 생성합니다."

#. ~ Sound description of spell "pyrokinetic_blast ( [Ψ]Conflagration )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "pyrokinetic_aoe_blast ( [Ψ]Hellfire )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "pyrokinetic_incineration ( [Ψ]Crucible )"
#. ~ Sound description of spell "salamander_explosion_and_heal_spell ( The
#. Phoenix's Last Cry )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/paraclesians/salamander_mutation_spells.json
msgid "the roar of flames!"
msgstr "불꽃의 포효!"

#. ~ Message of spell "pyrokinetic_blast ( [Ψ]Conflagration )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "You call forth a raging inferno!"
msgstr "당신은 맹렬한 지옥불을 불러일으킵니다!"

#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_aoe_blast"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Hellfire"
msgstr "[Ψ]지옥불"

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_aoe_blast ( [Ψ]Hellfire )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Send forth raging flames and turn the ground around you into an inferno.  "
"You will be <color_yellow>briefly</color> immune to the aftereffects of your"
" own power as well."
msgstr ""
"맹렬한 불길을 내뿜어 주변 땅을 지옥불로 만듭니다. 또한, <color_yellow>잠시</color> 자신의 힘의 후유증에도 면역이 "
"됩니다."

#. ~ Message of spell "pyrokinetic_aoe_blast ( [Ψ]Hellfire )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "The ground around you explodes in flames!"
msgstr "당신 주변의 땅이 불길에 휩싸입니다!"

#. ~ Name of spell "pyrokinetic_incineration"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "[Ψ]Crucible"
msgstr "[Ψ]도가니"

#. ~ Description of spell "pyrokinetic_incineration ( [Ψ]Crucible )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid ""
"Concentrate the entirety of your power into a single white-hot point, "
"searing your target with the heat of a volcano."
msgstr "당신의 모든 힘을 단 하나의 뜨거운 지점에 집중시켜, 화산의 열기로 목표물을 태워버리세요."

#. ~ Message of spell "pyrokinetic_incineration ( [Ψ]Crucible )"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis.json
msgid "You focus all of your power onto a single point!"
msgstr "당신은 모든 힘을 단 하나의 지점에 집중합니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CALL_FLAME_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "Flames begin dancing in the air above your hand."
msgstr "불꽃이 당신 손 위 공중에서 춤을 추기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYRO_REMOVE_FIRE_TOOL"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "The flames over your hand gutter and die out."
msgstr "당신 손 위의 불꽃이 꺼지고 꺼집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_WARMTH_CLOAK_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "You heat the nearby air to a comfortable temperature."
msgstr "주변 공기를 편안한 온도로 가열합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_TORCH_WELD_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "A searing line of flame springs forth from your finger."
msgstr "당신의 손가락에서 뜨거운 불꽃이 솟아오릅니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYRO_REMOVE_TORCH_WELD"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "The line of fire vanishes in an instant."
msgstr "총격선은 순식간에 사라진다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_BLAZING_AURA_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "You set the air around yourself ablaze."
msgstr "당신은 주변의 공기를 불태웠습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_FLAME_IMMUNITY_INITIATE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "The nearby air loses any heat."
msgstr "근처의 공기는 열을 잃습니다."

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VITAKIN_CONCENTRATED_HEALING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/vitakinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "Left Arm"
msgstr "왼팔"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VITAKIN_CONCENTRATED_HEALING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/vitakinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "Right Arm"
msgstr "오른팔"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VITAKIN_CONCENTRATED_HEALING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/vitakinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "Left Leg"
msgstr "왼다리"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_VITAKIN_CONCENTRATED_HEALING_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/vitakinesis_concentration_eoc.json
msgid "Right Leg"
msgstr "오른다리"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
msgid "Cauterize wounds on the left arm."
msgstr "왼쪽 팔의 상처를 소작합니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
msgid "Cauterize wounds on the right arm."
msgstr "오른팔의 상처를 소작합니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
msgid "Cauterize wounds on the head."
msgstr "머리의 상처를 소작합니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
msgid "Cauterize wounds on the left leg."
msgstr "왼쪽 다리의 상처를 소작합니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
msgid "Cauterize wounds on the right leg."
msgstr "오른쪽 다리의 상처를 소작합니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_SELECTOR"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/pyrokinesis_eoc.json
msgid "Cauterize wounds on the torso."
msgstr "몸통의 상처를 소작합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PYROKIN_CAUTERIZE_LEFT_ARM_2" in
