msgstr "조정된 확률은 <context_val:reality_tear_adjustment>입니다."

#. ~ Success message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_TELEPORT_LOCI_TECHNIQUE"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/powers/teleportation_eoc.json
msgid ""
"You feel a moment of darkness and terrible cold, but you are quickly back at"
" your established locus."
msgstr "당신은 잠시 어둠과 끔찍한 추위를 느끼지만, 곧 원래 자리로 돌아옵니다."

#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC
