#. ~ Feed message of monster "mon_hummingbird"
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/bird.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to like you!  It quickly flies around you and seems friendly."
msgstr "%s가 당신을 좋아하는 것 같아요! 당신 주위를 빠르게 날아다니며 친근해 보여요."

#. ~ Pet message of monster "mon_hummingbird"
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/bird.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s flies around you."
msgstr "%s가 당신 주위를 날아다닙니다."

#. ~ Feed message of monster "mon_crayfish_giant_larva"
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/fish.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s seems to… uhh, like you?  Well, as certainly as you could tell a "
"giant crustacean could like you.  It swims around your legs and seems "
"friendly."
msgstr ""
"%s가… 음, 당신을 좋아하는 것 같아요? 음, 거대한 갑각류가 당신을 좋아하는 게 분명하잖아요. 당신 다리 주위를 헤엄치며 다정해 "
"보이네요."

#. ~ Pet message of monster "mon_crayfish_giant_larva"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "mon_diving_larva_friendly"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "mon_water_scorpion_larva_friendly"
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/fish.json
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/insect_spider.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s swims around your feet."
msgstr "%s가 발 주위를 헤엄칩니다."

