"The egg of a centipede.  This one has been carefully tended for.  The "
"centipede larva inside seems more timid and calmer upon touch."
msgstr "지네의 알입니다. 정성껏 관리된 알입니다. 안에 있는 지네 유충은 만져보니 더 소심하고 차분해 보입니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid "sweet goop"
msgid_plural "sweet goop"
msgstr[0] "달콤한 끈적한 것"

#. ~ Description of "sweet goop"
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/items/comestibles/other.json
msgid ""
"A bunch of sweet stuff with a wet, goopy consistency.  Normal bugs would die"
" for this, just hope the mutants will like it as well."
msgstr ""
"촉촉하고 끈적끈적한 질감에 달콤한 게 잔뜩 들어 있어요. 일반 벌레들은 이걸 정말 좋아할 거예요. 돌연변이 벌레들도 좋아했으면 좋겠네요."

#. ~ name of the nested group
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/recipes/nested.json
msgid "tame eggs"
msgstr "길들인 달걀"

#. ~ Description of the category "tame eggs"
#: data/mods/Tamable_Wildlife/recipes/nested.json
msgid "Recipes related to taming the eggs of aggressive invertebrates."
msgstr "공격적인 무척추동물의 알을 길들이는 것과 관련된 요리법."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "toxic_glue"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
msgid "Termite Glue"
msgstr "흰개미 접착제"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Termite Glue"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Termite Glue"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
msgid "You're covered in thick noxious glue!"
msgstr "당신은 두껍고 유해한 접착제로 뒤덮여 있어요!"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Termite Glue"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
msgid "The glue has washed up but it surely left a mark."
msgstr "접착제가 씻겨 나갔지만 분명 흔적이 남았을 겁니다."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Termite Glue"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
msgid "The glue restricts your movement."
msgstr "접착제는 움직임을 제한합니다."

#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Termite Glue"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/effects.json
msgid "Chemical Allergen"
msgstr "화학 알레르겐"

#. ~ MOD name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/modinfo.json
msgid "TropiCataclysm"
msgstr "트로피카타클리즘"

#. ~ Description of MOD "TropiCataclysm"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Changes the setting from New England to an undisclosed region in Brazil.  "
"Initially based out of Desert Region mod."
msgstr "배경을 뉴잉글랜드에서 브라질의 비공개 지역으로 변경합니다. 처음에는 사막 지역 모드를 기반으로 합니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "spread_glue"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
msgid "Spread Glue"
msgstr "접착제를 바르다"

#. ~ Description of spell "spread_glue ( Spread Glue )"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
msgid "Splatters a glue-like substance along the ground in a cone."
msgstr "땅에 접착제 같은 물질을 원뿔 모양으로 뿌립니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "pollen_breath"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
msgid "Pollen Breath"
msgstr "꽃가루 숨결"

#. ~ Description of spell "pollen_breath ( Pollen Breath )"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
msgid "Spews pollen in a cone."
msgstr "원뿔 모양으로 꽃가루를 뿌립니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "malboro_breath"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
msgid "Bad Breath"
msgstr "구취"

#. ~ Description of spell "malboro_breath ( Bad Breath )"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/spells.json
msgid "Spews toxic gas in a cone."
msgstr "원뿔 모양으로 독성 가스를 뿜어낸다."

#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_overmap_terrain.json
msgid "desert"
msgstr "사막"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
msgid "singing sand"
msgstr "휘파람 모래"

#. ~ Description of terrain "singing sand"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A formation of sand containing special minerals to produce whistling noises "
"when stepped on and from the wind."
msgstr "바람이 불거나 밟힐 때 휘파람 소리를 내는 특수한 광물을 함유한 모래의 형체."

#. ~ Bashing failed sound
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/maps/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_groundxeno.json
msgid "fweet!"
msgstr "휘이익!"

#. ~ Description of terrain "outcrop"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
msgid ""
"An assortment of various large, sharp rocks that jut out from the "
"surrounding terrain.  Could be used as a surface for a number of things or "
"climbed on if worn with proper footwear."
msgstr "주변 지형에서 돌출된 다양한 커다랗고 날카로운 암석. 탁자처럼 사용되거나 적절한 신발을 신는 경우 올라갈 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
msgid "dune"
msgstr "사구"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dune"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
msgid ""
"A huge sand dune that is continually reshaped by the wind.  Climbing it will"
" be troublesome."
msgstr "바람에 의해 끊임없이 모양이 바뀌는 거대한 모래언덕. 등반하기엔 번거로울 것입니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#. ~ Overmap terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/overmap/desert_overmap_terrain.json
msgid "desert pavement"
msgstr "사막포도"

#. ~ Description of terrain "desert pavement"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
msgid ""
"Not that kind of pavement!  Naturally occurring pockets of densely packed "
"rock fragments that is easier to traverse than sand, with the right "
"footwear."
msgstr "평범한 인도와는 거리가 멉니다! 적절한 신발을 신었다면 모래바닥보다 횡단하기 쉬운, 고밀도 암석 파편 지역입니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
msgid "scorched earth"
msgstr "그을린 땅"

#. ~ Description of terrain "scorched earth"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/tropical_terrain.json
#: data/mods/desert_region/furniture-and-terrain/desert_terrain.json
msgid ""
"Cracked and dry soil that doesn't look like it will be capable of supporting"
" anything in your lifetime."
msgstr "당신의 삶을 지탱할 수 있을 것 같지 않은 갈라지고 건조한 토양."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
msgid "fungal mat"
msgstr "곰팡이 매트"

#. ~ Description of terrain "fungal mat"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
msgid ""
"A dense layer of mutated underground fungus grown by the termites.  "
"Completely unrelated to the alien fungus found in the surface."
msgstr "흰개미가 키운 돌연변이 지하 진균이 빽빽게 성장한 층입니다. 지표에서 발견된 외계 진균와는 전혀 관련이 없습니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
msgid "underground fungus"
msgstr "지하 균류"

#. ~ Description of terrain "underground fungus"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
msgid ""
"This is a large clump of mutated fungi grown by the termites deep "
"underground.  It looks slightly toxic but edible and it should be ripe for "
"harvest on winter."
msgstr ""
"이것은 흰개미가 지하 깊은 곳에서 키운  돌연변이 곰팡이의 큰 덩어리입니다. 약간 독성이 있어 보이지만 식용이 가능하며 잘 익으면 겨울에"
" 수확 할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "underground fungus"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_fungal_termite.json
msgid ""
"This is a large clump of mutated fungi grown by the termites deep "
"underground.  It doesn't seem to be ready for harvest yet."
msgstr "이것은 흰개미가 지하 깊은 곳에서 키운  돌연변이 곰팡이의 큰 덩어리입니다. 아직 수확할 준비가 되지 않은 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "pachira tree"
msgstr "파키라 나무"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pachira tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"A massive wetland tree belonging to the 'Pachira' genus, also known as the "
"Guiana Chestnut Tree.  If you look closely, you can see some unharvested "
"chestnuts."
msgstr "'파키라'속에 속하는 거대한 습지 나무로, 기아나 밤나무라고도 불립니다. 자세히 보면 수확되지 않은 밤을 볼 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "chestnut tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"A massive wetland tree belonging to the 'Pachira' genus, also known as the "
"Guiana Chestnut tree."
msgstr "'파키라' 속에 속하는 거대한 습지 나무로, 기아나밤나무로도 알려져 있습니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "gevuina tree"
msgstr "게부이나 나무"

#. ~ Description of terrain "gevuina tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"A stubby tree belonging to the 'Gevuina' genus, also known as the Chilean "
"Hazelnut Tree.  If you look closely, you can see some unharvested hazelnuts."
msgstr ""
"'게부이나(Gevuina)' 속에 속하는 뭉툭한 나무로, 칠레 헤이즐넛나무라고도 불립니다. 자세히 보면 수확되지 않은 헤이즐넛을 볼 수 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "gevuina tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"A stubby tree belonging to the 'Gevuina' genus, also known as the Chilean "
"Hazelnut Tree."
msgstr "'게부이나' 속에 속하는 땅딸막한 나무로, 칠레 헤이즐넛나무라고도 불립니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "avellanita bush"
msgstr "아벨라니타 부시"

#. ~ Description of terrain "avellanita bush"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"A species of bush belonging to the 'Avellanita' genus.  This plant is native"
" to Chile and has potential due to their edible nuts."
msgstr ""
"'아벨라니타(Avellanita)' 속에 속하는 관목의 한 종입니다. 이 식물은 칠레가 원산지이며, 식용 견과류로 활용될 가능성이 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "avellanita bush"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"A species of bush belonging to the 'Avellanita' genus.  Currently devoid of "
"nuts."
msgstr "'아벨라니타(Avellanita)' 속에 속하는 관목의 한 종. 현재 열매가 없습니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "ceiba"
msgstr "세이바"

#. ~ Description of terrain "ceiba"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"A massive tropical tree belonging to the 'Ceiba' genus.  These gigantic "
"trees can be found from Mexico to Southern Chile."
msgstr "'세이바'속에 속하는 거대한 열대 나무입니다. 이 거대한 나무는 멕시코에서 칠레 남부까지 분포합니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "acacia"
msgstr "아카시아"

#. ~ Description of terrain "acacia"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"A slender subtropical tree belonging to the 'Acacia' genus.  Members of this"
" genus are mostly constrained to Australia but have been brought abroad for "
"multiple purposes with some being considered invasive species."
msgstr ""
"'아카시아' 속에 속하는 가느다란 아열대 나무입니다. 이 속에 속하는 나무들은 대부분 호주에만 서식하지만, 다양한 목적으로 해외로 "
"반입되기도 하며, 일부는 침입종으로 간주됩니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "huizache"
msgstr "집"

#. ~ Description of terrain "huizache"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"A slender tropical tree belonging to the 'Vachellia' genus.  This genus of "
"plants is related to acacias but are native to the Americas with a wide "
"distribution from Mexico to Brazil and worldwide."
msgstr ""
"'바켈리아(Vachellia)' 속에 속하는 가느다란 열대 나무입니다. 이 속 식물은 아카시아와 관련이 있지만 아메리카 대륙이 원산지이며"
" 멕시코에서 브라질을 거쳐 전 세계로 널리 분포합니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "parajubea"
msgstr "파라주베아"

#. ~ Description of terrain "parajubea"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"A medium sized palm tree belonging to the 'Parajubea' genus.  There are only"
" three confirmed members of this genus, two of them endangered in Bolivia."
msgstr ""
"'파라주베아' 속에 속하는 중간 크기의 야자수입니다. 이 속에 속하는 종은 현재 세 종만 확인되었으며, 그중 두 종은 볼리비아에서 멸종 "
"위기에 처해 있습니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "guayacan"
msgstr "과야칸"

#. ~ Description of terrain "guayacan"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"A medium sized tropical tree belonging to one of four different genera "
"native to the Americas.  All well known for their incredibly sturdy wood."
msgstr ""
"아메리카 대륙에 자생하는 네 가지 속(屬) 중 하나에 속하는 중간 크기의 열대 나무입니다. 모두 놀라울 정도로 튼튼한 목재로 잘 알려져 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "ficus"
msgstr "무화과나무"

#. ~ Description of terrain "ficus"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"A large tropical tree belonging to the 'Ficus' genus.  This genus has a "
"worldwide distribution, specially known for their fruit known as 'figs' or "
"the latex they produce when cut."
msgstr ""
"'무화과(Ficus)' 속에 속하는 대형 열대 나무입니다. 이 속은 전 세계에 분포하며, 특히 '무화과'라고 불리는 열매나 열매를 자르면"
" 나오는 수액으로 유명합니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "mango tree"
msgstr "망고나무"

#. ~ Description of terrain "mango tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Mangifera' genus, producing fruit commonly "
"known as mangoes.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could "
"probably find a few mature ones in summer."
msgstr ""
"이 나무는 '망고'라는 열매를 맺는 '망기페라' 속에 속합니다. 가지를 자세히 살펴보면 여름에 잘 익은 망고 몇 개를 발견할 수 있을 "
"것입니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "mango tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Mangifera' genus, producing fruit commonly "
"known as mangoes.  There do not appear to be any ripe mangoes now."
msgstr "이 나무는 '망고'라는 열매를 맺는 '망기페라' 속에 속합니다. 현재 익은 망고는 없는 것으로 보입니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "papaya tree"
msgstr "파파야 나무"

#. ~ Description of terrain "papaya tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Carica' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as papayas.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could probably "
"find a few mature ones in summer."
msgstr ""
"이 나무는 '카리카(Carica)' 속에 속하며, 흔히 파파야라고 불리는 열매를 맺습니다. 가지를 자세히 살펴보면 여름에 다 자란 "
"파파야를 몇 개 찾을 수 있을 것입니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "papaya tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Carica' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as papayas.  There do not appear to be any ripe papayas now."
msgstr ""
"이 나무는 '카리카(Carica)' 속에 속하며, 흔히 파파야라고 불리는 열매를 맺습니다. 현재 익은 파파야는 없는 것으로 보입니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "pomegranate tree"
msgstr "석류나무"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pomegranate tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Punica' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as pomegranates.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could "
"probably find a few mature ones in autumn."
msgstr ""
"이 나무는 '석류(Punica)' 속에 속하며, 흔히 석류라고 불리는 열매를 맺습니다. 가지를 자세히 살펴보면 가을에 다 자란 석류를 몇"
" 개 찾을 수 있을 것입니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "pomegranate tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Punica' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as pomegranates.  There do not appear to be any ripe pomegranates now."
msgstr ""
"이 나무는 '석류(Punica)' 속에 속하며, 흔히 석류라고 불리는 열매를 맺습니다. 현재 익은 석류는 없는 것으로 보입니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "coconut palm tree"
msgstr "코코넛 야자수"

#. ~ Description of terrain "coconut palm tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Cocos' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as coconuts.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could probably "
"find a few mature ones in summer."
msgstr ""
"이 나무는 '코코스' 속에 속하며, 흔히 코코넛이라고 불리는 열매를 맺습니다. 가지를 자세히 살펴보면 여름에 잘 익은 열매를 몇 개 찾을"
" 수 있을 것입니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "coconut palm tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Cocos' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as coconuts.  There do not appear to be any ripe coconuts now."
msgstr "이 나무는 '코코스' 속에 속하며, 흔히 '코코넛'으로 알려진 열매를 맺습니다. 현재 익은 코코넛은 없는 것으로 보입니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "orange tree"
msgstr "오렌지나무"

#. ~ Description of terrain "orange tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Citrus' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as oranges.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could probably "
"find a few mature ones in spring."
msgstr ""
"이 나무는 '감귤류' 속에 속하며, 흔히 오렌지라고 불리는 과일을 맺습니다. 가지를 자세히 살펴보면 봄에 익은 오렌지 몇 개를 발견할 수"
" 있을 것입니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "orange tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Citrus' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as oranges.  There do not appear to be any ripe oranges now."
msgstr "이 나무는 '감귤류' 속에 속하며, 흔히 오렌지라고 불리는 과일을 생산합니다. 현재 익은 오렌지는 없는 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "lemon tree"
msgstr "레몬나무"

#. ~ Description of terrain "lemon tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Citrus' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as lemons.  If you examined the branches more closely, you could probably "
"find a few mature ones in winter."
msgstr ""
"이 나무는 '감귤류' 속에 속하며, 흔히 레몬이라고 불리는 과일을 맺습니다. 가지를 자세히 살펴보면 겨울에 익은 레몬 몇 개를 발견할 수"
" 있을 것입니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "lemon tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Citrus' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as lemons.  There do not appear to be any ripe lemons now."
msgstr "이 나무는 '감귤류' 속에 속하며, 흔히 레몬이라고 불리는 과일을 생산합니다. 현재 익은 레몬은 없는 것으로 보입니다."

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid "grapefruit tree"
msgstr "자몽나무"

#. ~ Description of terrain "grapefruit tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Citrus' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
"as grapefruits or pomelos.  If you examined the branches more closely, you "
"could probably find a few mature ones in autumn."
msgstr ""
"이 나무는 '감귤류' 속에 속하며, 흔히 자몽이나 포멜로라고 불리는 과일을 생산합니다. 가지를 자세히 살펴보면 가을에 익은 자몽을 몇 개"
" 찾을 수 있을 것입니다."

#. ~ Description of terrain "grapefruit tree"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/furniture_and_terrain/tropical_terrain_flora.json
msgid ""
"This tree is a member of the 'Citrus' genus, producing fruit commonly known "
