msgstr "5월의 화재"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Fires of Bealtaine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your weapon is burning with white-gold fire."
msgstr "당신의 무기는 백금빛 불꽃으로 타오르고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Fires of Bealtaine"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The flames on your weapon go out."
msgstr "무기의 불꽃이 꺼집니다."

