msgstr "통행권 파손"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Broken Right of Passage"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are no longer protected by the contracts of eld."
msgstr "더 이상 eld 계약에 의해 보호받지 않습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_brownie_attacked_someone"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Conspicuous"
msgstr "확실히 보이는"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Conspicuous"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "People can definitely see you now."
msgstr "이제 사람들이 당신을 확실히 볼 수 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "called_daffodil"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Called the daffodil"
msgstr "수선화라고 불린다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Called the daffodil"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You recently called some daffodils.  You need to wait a day before you can "
"call more."
msgstr "최근에 수선화를 몇 송이 꺾으셨네요. 더 꺾으려면 하루 정도 기다려야 합니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_dream_drainer_speed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Accelerated"
msgstr "가속화됨"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Accelerated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "A burst of speed."
msgstr "엄청난 속도."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_dream_drainer_armor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Armored"
msgstr "장갑"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_moon_withdrawal"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Moon-starved"
msgstr "달이 굶주린"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "last_breath_mist_cooldown"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Recovering from the last breath's mist"
msgstr "마지막 숨결의 안개에서 회복하다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Recovering from the last breath's mist"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Triggering your abilities that way has taken their toll on you.  You cannot "
"save yourself from death that way another time yet."
msgstr "그런 식으로 능력을 발동시킨 게 당신에게 큰 타격을 줬습니다. 다시는 그런 식으로 죽음에서 스스로를 구할 수 없을 겁니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lilin_ruach_drain_side_effects"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Ruach-drained"
msgstr "루아흐 배수"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Ruach-drained"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "A lilit has drained away some of your life-force."
msgstr "릴리트가 당신의 생명력 일부를 빨아들였습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lilin_no_ruach"
#. ~ Biblical Hebrew for 'famine' or 'starvation'
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Ra'ab"
msgstr "라브"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Ra'ab"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are out of ruach and gradually weakening."
msgstr "당신은 성령을 잃고 점차 약해지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lilin_attribute_bonuses"
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
msgid "Might of the Nephilim"
msgstr "네피림의 힘"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Might of the Nephilim"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are enhancing your physical abilities."
msgstr "당신은 신체 능력을 향상시키고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lilin_speed_boost"
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "lilin_speed_dodge_boost_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/lilin_spells.json
msgid "Reaping the Whirlwind"
msgstr "회오리바람을 거두다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Reaping the Whirlwind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are moving incredibly quickly."
msgstr "당신은 믿을 수 없을 정도로 빠르게 움직이고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lilin_silent_at_night"
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Samuel 2:9
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
msgid "Silent in Darkness"
msgstr "어둠 속의 침묵"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Silent in Darkness"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your movements make as little noise as the shadows of the night."
msgstr "당신의 움직임은 밤의 그림자처럼 소리가 거의 나지 않습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lilin_steady_speed"
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Psalms 72:5
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
msgid "Enduring Through All Generations"
msgstr "모든 세대를 거쳐 지속되는"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Enduring Through All Generations"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You will endure all obstacles without faltering."
msgstr "당신은 흔들리지 않고 모든 장애물을 견뎌낼 것입니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lilin_limb_score_bonuses_at_night"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The Night Hunter"
msgstr "나이트헌터"

#. ~ Description of effect type "The Night Hunter"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Now they will know why they fear the night."
msgstr "이제 그들은 왜 밤을 두려워하는지 알게 될 것이다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lilin_incremental_speed_boost"
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ This is a reference to Isaiah 45:3
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/xe_lilin.json
msgid "The Treasures of Darkness"
msgstr "어둠의 보물"

#. ~ Description of effect type "The Treasures of Darkness"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Having spent a long time in the shadows, you are now quicker than usual."
msgstr "오랫동안 그림자 속에 숨어 있었기 때문에 이제 평소보다 더 빨라졌습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lilin_allowed_ruach_drain"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Willingly drained"
msgstr "기꺼이 배수하다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Willingly drained"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"This follower allowed you to take some of their ruach, and they won't "
"respond kindly to being drained more this soon."
msgstr ""
"이 팔로워는 당신이 그들의 루아흐 중 일부를 가져가는 것을 허용했고, 그들은 이렇게 빨리 더 많은 루아흐를 소모하는 것에 친절하게 "
"반응하지 않을 것입니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_sleep_shield_check"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Promises of undisrupted sleep"
msgstr "방해받지 않는 수면의 약속"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Promises of undisrupted sleep"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "I wish you a good night."
msgstr "좋은 밤 보내시길 바랍니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Promises of undisrupted sleep"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You could swear that this man wished you a good night."
msgstr "이 남자가 당신에게 좋은 밤 보내라고 바랐다고 맹세해도 과언이 아닐 겁니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_sleep_shield"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Undisrupted sleep"
msgstr "방해받지 않는 수면"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Undisrupted sleep"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Sleep well.  Nothing but you can disrupt your sleep."
msgstr "잘 주무세요. 당신 외에는 당신의 잠을 방해할 수 있는 것이 없습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Undisrupted sleep"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "As you fall asleep, you feel safer than you ever were."
msgstr "잠들면서 당신은 예전보다 더 안전하다고 느낀다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Undisrupted sleep"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "As you wake up, the feeling of safety quickly fades away."
msgstr "깨어나자마자 안전감은 금세 사라진다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lilin_aoe_daze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Disoriented"
msgstr "방향 감각을 잃었다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Disoriented"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "A loud noise fueled by a curse has sent you reeling."
msgstr "저주로 인한 큰 소리가 당신을 휘청거리게 했습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lilin_supernatural_disease"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Miasma"
msgstr "독기"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Miasma"
#. ~ Description of effect type "Devouring Plague"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are infected by a supernatural disease."
msgstr "당신은 초자연적인 질병에 감염되었습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_lilin_supernatural_disease_focused"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Devouring Plague"
msgstr "삼키는 역병"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_chronomancy_field"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Chronomancy Field"
msgstr "시간점술 분야"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Chronomancy Field"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You have engaged some of your temporal abilities and any kills you make "
"while this is active will grant you insight."
msgstr "당신은 시간 능력 중 일부를 사용했으며, 이 능력이 활성화된 동안 적을 처치하면 통찰력을 얻게 됩니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Chronomancy Field"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You gain an increased awareness of the 4th dimension and how it interacts "
"with the universe."
msgstr "당신은 4차원에 대한 인식이 높아지고, 그것이 우주와 어떻게 상호 작용하는지 알게 됩니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Chronomancy Field"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your awareness of the 4th dimension fades."
msgstr "4차원에 대한 인식이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_xedra_time_freeze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Frozen in Time"
msgstr "시간 속에 얼어붙다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Frozen in Time"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are completely frozen in time."
msgstr "당신은 시간 속에 완전히 얼어붙어 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Frozen in Time"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Everything is suddenly different."
msgstr "모든 것이 갑자기 달라졌습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_xedra_eater_stabilize_reality"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Stabilized Reality"
msgstr "안정화된 현실"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stabilized Reality"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are anchored in normal reality."
msgstr "당신은 평범한 현실에 뿌리를 두고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Stabilized Reality"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel much more vulnerable."
msgstr "당신은 훨씬 더 취약함을 느끼게 됩니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_xedra_dreamer_generate_accelerated_time"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Accelerated Time Emission"
msgstr "가속 시간 방출"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Accelerated Time Emission"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You continuously generate fields of short-lived accelerated time."
msgstr "당신은 지속적으로 짧은 시간 동안 가속되는 시간의 필드를 생성합니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_xedra_dreamer_accelerated_time"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Time Accelerated"
msgstr "시간 가속"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Time Accelerated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your local time is far accelerated to the baseline, allowing you to act much"
" quicker."
msgstr "귀하의 현지 시간은 기준선보다 훨씬 빨라져 훨씬 더 빠르게 행동할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Time Accelerated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Everything seems much quicker."
msgstr "모든 것이 훨씬 빨라진 것 같아요."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_xedra_eater_erosion"
#. ~ Name of spell "xedra_eater_erosion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/eater_spells.json
msgid "Erosion"
msgstr "부식"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Erosion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You maintain a field of unstable time around you.  When you attack targets "
"in melee they will degrade over time."
msgstr "주변에 불안정한 시간장을 생성합니다. 근접 공격으로 대상을 공격하면 시간이 지남에 따라 약화됩니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Erosion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your field of unstable time fades."
msgstr "불안정한 시간의 영역이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_xedra_chronomancer_chronal_accel"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Chronal Acceleration"
msgstr "연대순 가속"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Chronal Acceleration"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are accelerating your relative progression of time compared to the "
"universal baseline."
msgstr "당신은 우주의 기준선과 비교했을 때 시간의 상대적 진행을 가속화하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Chronal Acceleration"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The world slows down around you."
msgstr "당신 주변의 세상이 느려집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_xedra_chronomancer_destabilizing_strikes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Destabilizing Strikes"
msgstr "불안정화 파업"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Destabilizing Strikes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You maintain a field of destabilized time around you.  Your attacks cause "
"your targets to erode over time."
msgstr "주변에 불안정한 시간장을 형성합니다. 공격 시 대상은 시간이 지남에 따라 침식됩니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Destabilizing Strikes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your hands turn gray as the air around them starts to flicker."
msgstr "당신의 손은 회색으로 변하고, 주변 공기가 깜빡이기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Destabilizing Strikes"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your field of destabilized time fades."
msgstr "불안정한 시간의 영역이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_xedra_chronomancer_stabilize_timeline"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Stabilized Timeline"
msgstr "안정화된 타임라인"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stabilized Timeline"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are protected from adverse changes in your personal timestream."
msgstr "귀하는 개인 시간의 흐름에 부정적인 변화가 생기는 것을 방지합니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Stabilized Timeline"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You may not look any different, but you can tell that you're completely "
"protected from harmful time magic."
msgstr "겉모습은 별반 다르지 않을지 몰라도, 해로운 시간 마법으로부터 완벽하게 보호받고 있다는 걸 알 수 있을 거예요."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Stabilized Timeline"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel more vulnerable to manipulated time."
msgstr "당신은 조작된 시간에 더 취약함을 느낀다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_xedra_chronomancer_reverse_entropy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Reversed Entropy"
msgstr "역전된 엔트로피"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Reversed Entropy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your equipment is slowly losing its damage, repairing itself to its "
"original, ideal form."
msgstr "귀하의 장비는 천천히 손상을 회복하고 원래의 이상적인 형태로 복구되고 있습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Reversed Entropy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your equipment obtains a gray tint and appears ever so slightly more whole."
msgstr "장비가 회색빛을 띠며 약간 더 온전해 보입니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Reversed Entropy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your equipment loses its gray tint."
msgstr "장비의 회색빛이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_xedra_rewrite_wound_causality"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Rewriting Wound Causality"
msgstr "상처 인과관계 재작성"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Rewriting Wound Causality"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your injuries are disappearing in a harmless paradox."
msgstr "당신의 부상은 무해한 역설 속에서 사라지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_xedra_rewrite_equipment_causality"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Rewriting Equipment Causality"
msgstr "장비 인과관계 다시 쓰기"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Rewriting Equipment Causality"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The equipments' faults are disappearing in a harmless paradox."
msgstr "장비의 결함은 무해한 역설 속에서 사라지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_xedra_time_loop"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Time Looped"
msgstr "시간 루프"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Time Looped"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Every few seconds every change to your person reverts."
msgstr "몇 초마다 해당 사람의 모든 변경 사항이 원래대로 돌아갑니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_xedra_chronomancer_stable_timeloop"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Stable Time Loop"
msgstr "안정적인 시간 루프"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stable Time Loop"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are prepared to revert yourself to a prior point in time."
msgstr "당신은 과거 시점으로 돌아갈 준비가 되어 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_xedra_monster_erosion"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Eroding Time"
msgstr "침식되는 시간"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Eroding Time"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"This creature destabilizes time around it, eroding everything it touches."
msgstr "이 생물은 주변의 시간을 불안정하게 만들고, 접촉하는 모든 것을 침식시킵니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_recently_reshuffled_weaknesses"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Reshuffled Weaknesses"
msgstr "재편된 약점"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Reshuffled Weaknesses"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You recently reshuffled your vampiric weaknesses.  Until your blood "
"stabilizes, further attempts will be fruitless."
msgstr "최근 뱀파이어의 약점을 다시 드러냈습니다. 혈액 상태가 안정될 때까지는 더 이상의 시도는 무의미할 것입니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Reshuffled Weaknesses"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your blood has stabilized enough to let you try to reshuffle your weaknesses"
" again, should they prove too much to bear."
msgstr "당신의 혈액은 당신이 견뎌내기에 너무 큰 약점이 드러날 경우, 다시 약점을 바꿔볼 수 있을 만큼 충분히 안정되었습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_need_living_blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Thirst for Living Blood"
msgstr "살아있는 피에 대한 갈증"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Thirst for Living Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Cold blood is not enough.  You need some warm blood straight from the vein, "
"you need it NOW!"
msgstr "차가운 피만으로는 부족해. 혈관에서 바로 흘러나오는 따뜻한 피가 필요해. 지금 당장!"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Thirst for Living Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You want to sink your fangs in someone's neck and drink their blood."
msgstr "당신은 누군가의 목에 송곳니를 박고 피를 마시고 싶어합니다."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Thirst for Living Blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your thirst distract you."
msgstr "갈증이 당신의 주의를 산만하게 합니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_earth_sleeper_penalty"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Disrupted Rest"
msgstr "중단된 휴식"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Disrupted Rest"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You have slept away from the earth, leaving you fatigued and weakened for an"
" entire day."
msgstr "당신은 땅에서 멀리 떨어져 잠을 잤고, 하루 종일 지치고 약해졌습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_holy_place_burn"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Rebuked by holiness"
msgstr "거룩함으로 책망을 받다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Rebuked by holiness"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The sanctity of this place is killing you."
msgstr "이 장소의 신성함이 당신을 죽이고 있습니다."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Rebuked by holiness"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel rejected by this place."
msgstr "당신은 이곳에서 거부당했다고 느낀다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vast_water_burn"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Melted by the vast waters"
msgstr "광활한 물에 녹아내리다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Melted by the vast waters"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are dissolving in the vast waters."
msgstr "당신은 광활한 물 속으로 녹아들어갑니다."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Melted by the vast waters"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You are melting from your proximity to water."
msgstr "당신은 물에 가까워서 녹고 있습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_slain_by_the_sun"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Slain by the Sun"
msgstr "태양에 의해 살해되다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Slain by the Sun"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The sun is burning you like a dry leaf in a wildfire."
msgstr "태양은 당신을 들불 속의 마른 잎사귀처럼 태우고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Blood Craving"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Need blood must have blood blood right now DRINK BLOOD NOW!"
msgstr "피가 필요해 피가 필요해 지금 당장 피를 마셔!"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Blood Craving"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are wracked with pain as your craving hits you.  You can only think "
"about getting some of that delicious blood you so desperately need."
msgstr ""
"갈증이 밀려오면서 극심한 고통에 시달립니다. 그토록 간절히 원하는 그 맛있는 피를 조금이라도 얻고 싶다는 생각만 할 뿐입니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Blood Craving"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your craving calms down."
msgstr "갈망이 가라앉습니다."

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Blood Craving"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your craving distract you."
msgstr "당신의 갈망은 당신을 산만하게 합니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "vampire_attacked_vampire_or_renfield"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Broken Vampire's Truce"
msgstr "깨진 뱀파이어의 휴전"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Broken Vampire's Truce"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your actions against the vampires and their servants have drawn their ire."
msgstr "뱀파이어와 그 하인들에 대한 당신의 행동은 그들의 분노를 샀습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_anathema_final_form"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Hasted by shadows"
msgstr "그림자에 의해 서두르다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hasted by shadows"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The Anathema is much quicker now thanks to vampiric abilities."
msgstr "뱀파이어 능력 덕분에 아나테마가 훨씬 더 빨라졌습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_player_anathema_potency_boost"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Apex Vampire's Potency"
msgstr "에이펙스 뱀파이어의 효능"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Apex Vampire's Potency"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "All the vampire blood you drank has empowered you."
msgstr "당신이 마신 뱀파이어의 피는 모두 당신에게 힘을 실어주었습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_anathema_need_vampire_blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Apex's Thirst"
msgstr "에이펙스의 갈증"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Apex's Thirst"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your blood is consuming itself in its thirst for the blood of vampires."
msgstr "당신의 피는 뱀파이어의 피에 대한 갈증으로 스스로를 소모하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Apex's Thirst"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You feel a gnawing thirst for the blood of vampires.  Better find some, "
"before your blood devours itself."
msgstr "뱀파이어의 피에 대한 갈증이 치밀어 오른다. 피가 자기 자신을 삼키기 전에 뱀파이어를 찾는 게 좋겠다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Apex's Thirst"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your thirst for vampire blood calms down."
msgstr "뱀파이어 피에 대한 갈증이 가라앉습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_vampire_invisible_in_dark"
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "vampire_invisible_in_dark"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutations.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/vampire_spells.json
msgid "Shrouded by the Shadowed Path"
msgstr "그림자가 드리운 길에 가려져"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Shrouded by the Shadowed Path"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"Until the shadows you gathered fade or the sun shines upon you, you cannot "
"be seen."
msgstr "당신이 모은 그림자가 사라지거나 태양이 당신을 비출 때까지 당신은 보이지 않을 것입니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Shrouded by the Shadowed Path"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The shadows you gathered meld with you, hiding you from sight."
msgstr "당신이 모은 그림자가 당신과 섞여 당신을 시야에서 감춥니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Shrouded by the Shadowed Path"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "The shadows aren't hiding you anymore."
msgstr "그림자가 더 이상 당신을 숨기지 않습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_anathema_mind_chaos"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Blood-Muddled Mind"
msgstr "피로 뒤섞인 마음"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Blood-Muddled Mind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your mind reels from all the vampire blood you drank."
msgstr "당신은 마신 뱀파이어의 피 때문에 정신이 흐트러졌습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "xe_hydrating_gout_incubation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Imminent Hydrating Gout"
msgstr "임박한 수분 공급 통풍"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Imminent Hydrating Gout"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are about to suffer from the hydrating gout.  This disease causes the "
"spontaneous generation of water inside the body, and becomes more virulent "
"the more hydrated the afflicted is."
msgstr ""
"당신은 수분 통풍을 겪게 될 것입니다. 이 질환은 체내에 수분이 저절로 생성되는 질환으로, 환자의 수분 섭취량이 많을수록 증상이 더욱 "
"악화됩니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Imminent Hydrating Gout"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You have a bad feeling about drinking more water."
msgstr "당신은 물을 더 많이 마시는 것에 대해 나쁜 느낌을 가지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Imminent Hydrating Gout"
#. ~ Blood analysis description of effect type "Hydrating Gout"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Unknown water-producing pathogen."
msgstr "알려지지 않은 물 생성 병원균."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "xe_hydrating_gout"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Hydrating Gout"
msgstr "통풍 수분 공급"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hydrating Gout"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are suffering from the peculiar illness known as hydrating gout.  This "
"disease causes the spontaneous generation of water inside the body, and "
"becomes more virulent the more hydrated the afflicted is."
msgstr ""
"당신은 수화 통풍이라는 특이한 질병을 앓고 계십니다. 이 질병은 체내에 수분이 자연적으로 생성되는 질환으로, 환자의 수분 섭취량이 "
"많을수록 증상이 더욱 악화됩니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Hydrating Gout"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel you're going to drown in your own body water."
msgstr "당신은 자신의 몸 속 물에 빠져 죽을 것 같은 기분이 듭니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Hydrating Gout"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You no longer fear the absence of thirst."
msgstr "당신은 더 이상 갈증이 없다는 것을 두려워하지 않습니다."

#. ~ Male memorial apply log of effect type "Hydrating Gout"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Caught a supernatural illness."
msgstr "초자연적인 질병에 걸렸습니다."

#. ~ Female memorial apply log of effect type "Hydrating Gout"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Caught a supernatural illness."
msgstr "초자연적인 질병에 걸렸습니다."

#. ~ Male memorial remove log of effect type "Hydrating Gout"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_male"
msgid "Got over the hydrating gout."
msgstr "수분 공급으로 인한 통풍을 극복했습니다."

#. ~ Female memorial remove log of effect type "Hydrating Gout"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgctxt "memorial_female"
msgid "Got over the hydrating gout."
msgstr "수분 공급으로 인한 통풍을 극복했습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_bloodthorn_druid_upgrade_ready"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Twitching Heartvines"
msgstr "꿈틀거리는 하트바인"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Twitching Heartvines"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"You can occasionally feel your heartvines twitch beneath your skin.  They "
"are ready to grow.  Seek out the unspoiled wilderness and allow them to "
"flourish."
msgstr ""
"가끔씩 피부 아래에서 심장의 덩굴이 꿈틀거리는 것을 느낄 수 있습니다. 심장의 덩굴은 자랄 준비가 되었습니다. 훼손되지 않은 자연을 찾아"
" 꽃피우세요."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Twitching Heartvines"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid ""
"As the vampire dies you feel your heartvines stir, invigorated by the "
"creature's blood.  You must seek out the wilderness and meditate there to "
"allow your heartvine to grow."
msgstr ""
"뱀파이어가 죽으면서 당신의 심장줄기가 그 생명체의 피에 의해 활력을 얻어 움직이는 것을 느낄 수 있습니다. 당신은 황야를 찾아 명상을 "
"통해 심장줄기가 자라도록 해야 합니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Twitching Heartvines"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your heartvines cease their movements."
msgstr "당신의 심장줄기가 움직임을 멈췄습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id
#. "effect_bloodthorne_druid_gain_strength_dexterity_buff"
#. ~ Mutation name
#. ~ Name of spell "bloodthorne_druid_gain_strength_dexterity_buff_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/bloodthorne_druid_traits.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/bloodthorne_druid_spells.json
msgid "Verdurous Prowess"
msgstr "푸른 기량"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Verdurous Prowess"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your physical capabilities are increased."
msgstr "신체 능력이 향상됩니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Verdurous Prowess"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "You feel a surge of power and a sense of unity with the wild."
msgstr "당신은 힘의 급증과 자연과의 일체감을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Verdurous Prowess"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects.json
msgid "Your wilderness-enhanced prowess fades away."
msgstr "자연 속에서 강화된 당신의 능력이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_bloodthorne_druid_thorn_prison"
