msgstr "당신은 여름 태양의 순수한 빛으로 빛납니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Helios's Wrath"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "The blinding light fades away."
msgstr "눈부신 빛이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_changeling_autumn_detect_magic_user"
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_autumn_detect_magic_user_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_seasonal_magic_autumn.json
