msgstr "화려함은 당신을 조기에 늙게 만든다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Touch of Frailty"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "Your vigor returns."
msgstr "활력이 돌아왔습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_changeling_autumn_scare_humans"
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_autumn_scare_humans_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_seasonal_magic_autumn.json
