msgstr "눈 속의 발소리"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Footsteps in the Snow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "Like an animal in winter, you are moving in almost complete silence."
msgstr "겨울의 동물처럼, 당신은 거의 완전한 침묵 속에서 움직이고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Footsteps in the Snow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "The sound of your footsteps intrudes in your perceptions."
msgstr "당신의 발소리가 당신의 지각에 침투합니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_changeling_winter_walk_on_water"
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_winter_walk_on_water_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_seasonal_magic_winter.json
msgid "Path of Rime"
msgstr "서리의 길"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Path of Rime"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid ""
"Each step you take leaves a tracing of frost on the ground, and liquids "
"freeze at your touch."
msgstr "당신이 걸어가는 매 걸음마다 땅에 서리가 남고, 당신이 만지는 액체는 얼어붙습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_changeling_winter_feign_death"
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_winter_feign_death_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_seasonal_magic_winter.json
