msgstr "무덤의 고요함"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stillness of the Tomb"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "You do not move, or breathe, or think, or live.  For now."
msgstr "당신은 움직이지도, 숨쉬지도, 생각하지도, 살지도 않습니다. 지금은 말이죠."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Stillness of the Tomb"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "Life returns to your limbs."
msgstr "생명이 당신의 사지로 돌아온다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_changeling_winter_feign_death_limiter"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "Definitely Alive"
msgstr "확실히 살아있다"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Definitely Alive"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "You can fool them once, but you can't fool them twice."
msgstr "한 번은 속일 수 있지만, 두 번은 속일 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_changeling_winter_silence"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "Frozen Tongue"
msgstr "얼어붙은 혀"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Frozen Tongue"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "Your tongue feels like solid ice."
msgstr "혀가 얼음처럼 딱딱하게 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Frozen Tongue"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "The icy feeling on your tongue vanishes."
msgstr "혀에 느껴지는 차가운 느낌이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_changeling_winter_frozen_breath"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "Chilled"
msgstr "냉장"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Chilled"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "Your movements are slowed."
msgstr "당신의 움직임이 느려졌습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Chilled"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "The bone-deep chill fades away."
msgstr "뼈 속까지 스며드는 추위가 사라진다."

