#. ~ Description of effect type "Frozen Heart"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "All emotions are frozen out."
msgstr "모든 감정이 얼어붙는다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_changeling_winter_see_craft_darkness"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
