msgstr "달빛 아래서 또는 별빛 아래서"

#. ~ Description of effect type "By Moon or By Starlight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
msgid "You are at home in the dark."
msgstr "당신은 어둠 속에서도 집에 있는 듯합니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_changeling_winter_cut_off_fey_nature"
#. ~ Name of spell "changeling_winter_cut_off_fey_nature_spell"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_changeling_seasonal_magic.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/changeling_seasonal_magic_winter.json
