#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_werewolf_red_handed_rage_monster"
#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/effects_monster_only.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/werewolf_traits.json
