msgstr "당신의 상처는 천천히 치유되고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Restore Flesh and Bone"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your regeneration slows down as the goblin fruit's magic fades."
msgstr "고블린 과일의 마법이 사라지면서 재생 속도가 느려집니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Quick Blows"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You can attack faster."
msgstr "더 빨리 공격할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Quick Blows"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your muscles twitch as the goblin fruit's magic fades."
msgstr "고블린 과일의 마법이 사라지면서 당신의 근육이 꿈틀거립니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Summer's Heat"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "The magic of that goblin fruit is keeping you warm."
msgstr "그 고블린 과일의 마법은 당신을 따뜻하게 지켜줍니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_nightvision"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Darkvision"
msgstr "다크비전"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_shadow"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Muffled"
msgstr "머플드"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Muffled"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your movements are muffled."
msgstr "당신의 움직임은 흐릿합니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Muffled"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your footsteps feel quieter."
msgstr "발소리가 더 조용해졌습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stopped Bleeding"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your blood is all being contained within your body."
msgstr "당신의 혈액은 모두 당신의 몸 안에 담겨 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of effect type "Good Vision"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "The magic of that goblin fruit is helping you see better."
msgstr "그 고블린 과일의 마법은 당신의 시력을 향상하는 데 도움이 됩니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_featherfall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Feather Fall"
msgstr "페더 폴"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Feather Fall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You can fall any distance without damage."
msgstr "아무리 멀리 떨어져도 다치지 않습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Feather Fall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You feel as light as air."
msgstr "당신은 공기처럼 가벼움을 느낍니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Feather Fall"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Gravity reclaims its hold on you."
msgstr "중력이 다시 당신을 사로잡는다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Omniscience"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your head pounds as you suddenly see in all directions simultaneously."
msgstr "갑자기 모든 방향이 동시에 보이면서 머리가 욱신거린다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Omniscience"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your senses snap back into your body."
msgstr "당신의 감각이 다시 몸으로 돌아왔습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_water_breathing"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Return to the Sea"
msgstr "바다로의 귀환"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Return to the Sea"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You can breathe underwater."
msgstr "물속에서도 숨을 쉴 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Return to the Sea"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You feel an urge to take a swim."
msgstr "수영을 하고 싶은 충동을 느낀다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Return to the Sea"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You need to take a breath of air, now!"
msgstr "지금 당장 숨을 쉬어야 합니다!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_stealth"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Unnoticed"
msgstr "눈에 띄지 않음"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Unnoticed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You're beneath notice, unless they get too close of you."
msgstr "그들이 당신에게 너무 가까이 다가오지 않는 한, 당신은 눈에 띄지 않습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Unnoticed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You find it hard to notice your own presence."
msgstr "당신은 자신의 존재를 알아차리기 어렵습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Unnoticed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You become noticeable again."
msgstr "당신은 다시 눈에 띄게 됩니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_combat_skill_boost"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Violent reflection"
msgstr "폭력적인 반사"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Violent reflection"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid ""
"You are mirroring a version of yourself that is more skilled at violence."
msgstr "당신은 폭력에 더 능숙한 자신을 모방하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Violent reflection"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your mind fills with violence and the knowledge to use it."
msgstr "당신의 마음은 폭력과 그것을 사용하는 지식으로 가득 차게 됩니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Violent reflection"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your level of violence returns to normal."
msgstr "폭력 수준이 정상으로 돌아왔습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_craft_skill_boost"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Imitated skill"
msgstr "모방된 기술"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Imitated skill"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You're imitating yourself, if you were better at making things."
msgstr "당신이 뭔가를 만드는 데 더 능숙하다면, 당신은 자신을 모방하고 있는 것입니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Imitated skill"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You start imitating a more skilled artisan."
msgstr "당신은 더 숙련된 장인을 모방하기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Imitated skill"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your talent to imitate fades."
msgstr "모방하는 재능이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_immovable"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Immovable"
msgstr "움직일 수 없는"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Immovable"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You cannot be moved against your will by mundane means."
msgstr "당신은 세속적인 수단으로 당신의 의지에 반하여 움직일 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Immovable"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You feel fixed in place!"
msgstr "당신은 제자리에 고정된 것 같은 느낌을 받습니다!"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Immovable"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You stumble a little as your immovability ceases."
msgstr "당신은 움직이지 않게 되면서 약간 비틀거립니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_dodge_instant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Untouchable"
msgstr "만질 수 없는"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Untouchable"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "For an instant, nothing can touch you."
msgstr "그 순간, 아무것도 당신을 건드릴 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Untouchable"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You start dodging everything that could touch you!"
msgstr "당신은 당신을 건드릴 수 있는 모든 것을 피하기 시작합니다!"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Untouchable"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your dodging abilities return to normal."
msgstr "회피 능력이 정상으로 돌아옵니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_focus_boost"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Understanding"
msgstr "이해"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Understanding"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "As long as it lasts, you will have an easier time learning new things."
msgstr "이것이 지속되는 한, 새로운 것을 배우는 것이 더 쉬워질 것입니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Understanding"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Everything feels a little easier to understand now."
msgstr "이제 모든 것이 조금 더 이해하기 쉬워졌습니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Understanding"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your mind returns to its regular level of understanding."
msgstr "당신의 마음은 원래의 이해 수준으로 돌아갑니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_heal_after_sleep"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Eventual restful sleep"
msgstr "결국 편안한 수면"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_teleport"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Fractal teleportation"
msgstr "프랙탈 순간이동"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Fractal teleportation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your position constantly changes."
msgstr "당신의 위치는 끊임없이 변합니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Fractal teleportation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You feel your position grow uncertain."
msgstr "당신은 자신의 입장이 불확실해지는 것을 느낀다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Fractal teleportation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You stop teleporting all over the place."
msgstr "더 이상 여기저기 순간이동을 하지 마세요."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_climb"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Sticky climb"
msgstr "끈적끈적한 등반"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sticky climb"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You can climb walls without trouble."
msgstr "당신은 어려움 없이 벽을 오를 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Sticky climb"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your extremities become sticky."
msgstr "팔다리가 끈적끈적해진다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Sticky climb"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your extremities stop being this sticky."
msgstr "이제 당신의 팔다리는 더 이상 끈적거리지 않을 거예요."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_amplification_instant"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Pressurized amplification"
msgstr "가압 증폭"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Pressurized amplification"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Pressurized amplification"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your muscles are filled with pressurized power!"
msgstr "당신의 근육은 압박된 힘으로 가득 차 있습니다!"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Pressurized amplification"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "The power leaves your muscles in an instant."
msgstr "순식간에 근육에서 힘이 빠져나갑니다."

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Pressurized amplification"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "The pressure inside your muscles grows!"
msgstr "근육 내부의 압력이 커집니다!"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "goblin_fruit_carry_boost"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Lightened load"
msgstr "가벼워진 하중"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lightened load"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You find it easier to carry heavy charges."
msgstr "무거운 짐을 싣는 것이 더 쉽습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Lightened load"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You feel lighter, as does everything you're carrying."
msgstr "당신은 더 가벼워진 느낌을 받고, 당신이 가지고 있는 모든 것도 가벼워집니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Lightened load"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "The weight of your belongings return to normal."
msgstr "소지품의 무게가 정상으로 돌아옵니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_wild_travel_boost"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "A path through the forest"
msgstr "숲을 통과하는 길"

#. ~ Description of effect type "A path through the forest"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You move a bit quicker through the wilds."
msgstr "야생지대에서는 조금 더 빨리 움직일 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "A path through the forest"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Nearby vegetation becomes a little less daunting."
msgstr "근처의 식물이 조금 덜 두렵게 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "A path through the forest"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Traversing vegetation stops being easier."
msgstr "초목을 통과하는 것이 더 쉬워졌습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_slowing_armor"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "The stone's endurance"
msgstr "돌의 내구성"

#. ~ Description of effect type "The stone's endurance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You are more resistant to damage but move more slowly."
msgstr "당신은 피해에 대한 저항력이 더 강해지지만 움직임이 더 느려집니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "The stone's endurance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You stiffen, becoming slower but more resistant to anything."
msgstr "당신은 몸이 굳어지고, 더 느려지지만, 모든 것에 더 강하게 저항하게 됩니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "The stone's endurance"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "The stiffness quits your body."
msgstr "몸이 뻣뻣해진다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_social_boost"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Silver tongue"
msgstr "은색 혀"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Silver tongue"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You are better at convincing others to do what you want."
msgstr "당신은 당신이 원하는 것을 하도록 다른 사람들을 설득하는 데 능숙합니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Silver tongue"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You feel more persuasive."
msgstr "당신은 더 설득력이 있다고 느낀다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Silver tongue"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your charisma returns to normal."
msgstr "카리스마가 정상으로 돌아왔습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_altitude_speed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Gust of wind"
msgstr "돌풍"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Gust of wind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "The winds are assisting your movements."
msgstr "바람이 당신의 움직임을 돕고 있습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Gust of wind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You long for the skies as winds start blowing at you."
msgstr "바람이 불어오자 당신은 하늘을 그리워합니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Gust of wind"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "The skies lose their heightened luster."
msgstr "하늘은 더 이상 높았던 광채를 잃습니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_cold_resist"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Shelter from the cold"
msgstr "추위로부터 보호"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Shelter from the cold"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You withstand the cold much better than most."
msgstr "당신은 대부분의 사람들보다 추위를 훨씬 잘 견뎌냅니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Shelter from the cold"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You feel much more warm."
msgstr "훨씬 더 따뜻함을 느끼게 됩니다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Shelter from the cold"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "The warm feeling fades."
msgstr "따뜻한 느낌이 사라진다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_craft_speed_boost"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Accelerated artistry"
msgstr "가속화된 예술성"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Accelerated artistry"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You make things quicker, unless someone else is looking."
msgstr "다른 사람이 보고 있지 않다면, 일을 더 빨리 끝낼 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Accelerated artistry"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "You feel better at making things, but only if nobody is watching you."
msgstr "아무도 당신을 지켜보지 않을 때만, 뭔가를 만드는 데 더 능숙하다고 느낀다."

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Accelerated artistry"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Your increased crafting quickness returns to normal."
msgstr "증가했던 제작 속도가 원래대로 돌아옵니다."

#. ~ Name of effect type id "effect_goblin_fruit_cure_dreamless_cooldown"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid "Cloudy fruit aftertaste"
msgstr "흐린 과일 뒷맛"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cloudy fruit aftertaste"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/goblin_fruit_effects.json
msgid ""
"You can still faintly taste that cloudy fruit.  Any cloudy fruit you might "
"eat before the aftertaste ends won't have any effect."
msgstr "아직도 탁한 과일 맛이 희미하게 느껴집니다. 뒷맛이 사라지기 전에 탁한 과일을 먹어도 아무런 효과가 없습니다."

#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_door_c"
#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_door_c_peep"
#. ~ Message after transforming to "t_door_metal_c"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/ter_transform.json
msgid "The numpad chirps happily at you as the door unlocks."
msgstr "문이 열리면서 숫자 패드가 행복하게 삐걱거리는 소리가 납니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CONSUMED_BLOOD_TREATMENT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid "You take a blood treatment."
msgstr "혈액 치료를 받습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_REDUCE_VAMPVIRUS" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_CONSUMED_BLOOD_TREATMENT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid "The light seems less bright and the air fresher."
msgstr "빛이 덜 밝아지고 공기가 더 상쾌해졌습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_REDUCE_VAMPVIRUS3" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_CONSUMED_BLOOD_TREATMENT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_REDUCE_VAMPVIRUS4" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_CONSUMED_BLOOD_TREATMENT"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "learn_blood_of_saints"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "learn_blood_of_saints_2"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/comestibles/med.json
msgid ""
"Your veins burn and ache.  What were you thinking trying this?  You are "
"already one of the damned!"
msgstr "혈관이 화끈거리고 아파. 대체 무슨 생각으로 이걸 시도한 거야? 넌 이미 저주받은 놈들 중 하나잖아!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_COMPLETED_ROLL_REMAINDER_VAMPVIRUS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid "You flush with desire as you think about blood."
msgstr "피를 생각하면 욕망이 솟아오른다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_COMPLETED_VAMPIRE3_REAL"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid ""
"You can advance no further without access to a mentor.  Maybe you could find"
" one where you've found the other vampires?"
msgstr "멘토 없이는 더 이상 전진할 수 없어. 다른 뱀파이어들을 만났던 곳에서 멘토를 찾을 수도 있지 않을까?"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_COMPLETED_VAMPIRE4"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid "You can advance no further without more guidance from your mentor."
msgstr "멘토의 추가적인 지도 없이는 더 이상 발전할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SUCCESFUL_ROLL_REMAINDER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid "Suddenly you feel your heart pounding and you realize a new ability."
msgstr "갑자기 심장이 두근거리는 것을 느끼고 새로운 능력을 깨닫습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SUCCESFUL_ROLL_REMAINDER2"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid "Suddenly you feel your heart slowing and you realize a new ability."
msgstr "갑자기 심장이 느려지는 것을 느끼고 새로운 능력을 깨닫습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "eoc_vampvirus_1_trait" in nested
#. EOCs in effect in EoC "eoc_vampvirus_1_math_checker" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPVIRUS" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_vampire_virus_escalation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid ""
"You suddenly understand that drinking someones blood will make you feel "
"better than you've ever felt before in your life."
msgstr "당신은 갑자기 누군가의 피를 마시면 지금껏 느껴보지 못했던 기분이 좋아진다는 걸 깨달았습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "eoc_vampvirus_2_trait" in nested
#. EOCs in effect in EoC "eoc_vampvirus_2_math_checker" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPVIRUS1" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_vampire_virus_escalation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid ""
"With a popping sound several of your teeth fall out but when you put a "
"finger into your mouth to feel the hole, there are new sharp fangs where you"
" expected nothing."
msgstr ""
"탁탁거리는 소리와 함께 여러 개의 이가 빠지지만, 손가락을 입에 넣어 구멍을 만져보면 예상치 못한 곳에 날카로운 송곳니가 새로 돋아나 "
"있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "eoc_vampvirus_3_trait" in nested
#. EOCs in effect in EoC "eoc_vampvirus_3_math_checker" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPVIRUS2" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_vampire_virus_escalation"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid ""
"You feel the absence of your heart beating for several seconds and then it "
"resumes at this new rhythm."
msgstr "몇 초 동안 심장이 뛰지 않는 듯한 느낌이 들다가 새로운 리듬으로 다시 뛰기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "eoc_blood_hunger" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPVIRUS_HUNGER" in nested EOCs in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_vampire_virus_blood_needs"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid "You need to consume human blood to stay alive."
msgstr "살아남으려면 인간의 피를 먹어야 합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CONSUMED_BLOOD_ANATHEMA"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid ""
"Your hunger for blood submerges you for a moment, as the blood of the "
"Anathema combines with your own.  Vampires, mortals, what's the difference?"
"  You'll drink them all dry anyway."
msgstr ""
"아나테마의 피가 당신의 피와 합쳐지면서, 피에 대한 갈증이 잠시 당신을 삼킨다. 뱀파이어든 필멸자든, 뭐가 다른가? 어차피 다 마셔버릴 "
"테니까."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CONSUMED_BLOOD_ANATHEMA"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid ""
"The blood's power tries to take hold, but another sinister power prevents it"
" from doing so!"
msgstr "피의 힘이 자리 잡으려 하지만, 또 다른 사악한 힘이 그것을 막습니다!"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CONSUMED_BLOOD_ANATHEMA"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid ""
"The blood's power tries to take hold, but you lack the vampiric potency it "
"requires to do so!"
msgstr "피의 힘이 자리 잡으려 하지만, 그러기 위해 필요한 뱀파이어의 힘이 당신에게는 없습니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_ANATHEMA_ROLL_FOR_THRESHOLD"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_ANATHEMA_GAINING" in nested
#. EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_ANATHEMA_GAIN_POWERS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid ""
"Like the Anathema before you, there is no more limit to how powerful you can"
" be.  Only your limited supply of vampire blood stand in your way.  Will "
"this power be worth the heavy cost?"
msgstr ""
"당신 앞에 있는 아나테마처럼, 당신의 힘에는 더 이상 한계가 없습니다. 오직 당신의 제한된 뱀파이어 피만이 당신을 가로막습니다. 이 힘은"
" 그 무거운 대가를 치를 만한 가치가 있을까요?"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SUCCESFUL_ROLL_REMAINDER_ANATHEMA"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid "Suddenly you feel your blood boiling and you realize a new ability."
msgstr "갑자기 피가 끓는 듯한 느낌이 들고 새로운 능력이 눈에 들어옵니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_ANATHEMA_ADD_WEAKNESS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid ""
"A vampiric curse far more dire than any other has manifested within you."
msgstr "다른 어떤 것보다도 훨씬 더 무서운 뱀파이어의 저주가 당신 안에서 나타났습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_ANATHEMA_GAIN_POTENCY"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/effects/vampvirus.json
msgid ""
"Your power has grown a little more thanks to all the vampire blood you "
"drank."
msgstr "당신이 마신 뱀파이어의 피 덕분에 당신의 힘은 조금 더 커졌습니다."

#. ~ Name of a enchantment
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/enchantments/armor.json
msgid "Charm of Spring"
msgstr "봄의 매력"

#. ~ Description of enchantment "Charm of Spring"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/enchantments/armor.json
msgid ""
"You are wearing equipment that helps handle harsh climates and protects from"
" damaging cold."
msgstr "당신은 혹독한 기후를 견뎌내고 추위로부터 몸을 보호하는 장비를 착용하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "INCREASE_BERSERKER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/enchantments/armor.json
msgid "BERSERK +1."
msgstr "광전사 +1."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ENTER_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_DUNGEON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/abyssal_hunger_eocs.json
msgid "You were devoured by the Abyssal Hunger!"
msgstr "당신은 심연의 굶주림에 삼켜졌습니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_ENTER_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_NEXT_LEVEL"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/abyssal_hunger_eocs.json
msgid "You move through the monster's innards and reach another empty space."
msgstr "괴물의 내부를 통과해 또 다른 빈 공간에 도달합니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ENTER_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_NEXT_LEVEL"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/abyssal_hunger_eocs.json
msgid "You reach the Abyssal Hunger's brain."
msgstr "당신은 심연의 허기의 뇌에 도달했습니다."

#. ~ Success message in teleportation in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ABYSSAL_HUNGER_EXIT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/abyssal_hunger_eocs.json
msgid "You return to where you performed the ritual."
msgstr "의식을 거행한 장소로 돌아갑니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DEATH_ABYSSAL_HUNGER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/abyssal_hunger_eocs.json
msgid ""
"It is unclear if you were slain by an immune system or digested but suffice "
"to say, you are no more."
msgstr "면역 체계에 의해 살해당했는지, 소화되었는지는 불분명하지만, 당신은 더 이상 존재하지 않는다고 말할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "become_fire_fae"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "become_doll_fae"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "become_plant_fae"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/alchemy_eocs.json
msgid ""
"As you imbibe the concoction, you feel the stolen power fusing with your "
"essence."
msgstr "그 혼합물을 마시면 훔친 힘이 당신의 본질과 융합되는 것을 느낄 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "become_fire_fae"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "become_doll_fae"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "become_air_fae"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "become_water_fae"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "become_earth_fae"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "become_plant_fae"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/alchemy_eocs.json
msgid ""
"The power attempts to take hold, but is rebuffed by something sinister "
"within you."
msgstr "그 힘은 자리 잡으려 하지만 당신 내면의 사악한 무언가에 의해 막힙니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "become_air_fae"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/alchemy_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You imbibed the concoction and you feel your soul merge with an alien power,"
" becoming attuned to the winds."
msgstr "당신은 그 혼합물을 마셨고, 당신의 영혼이 외계의 힘과 합쳐지는 것을 느꼈고, 바람에 맞춰졌습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "become_water_fae"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/alchemy_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You imbibed the concoction and you feel your soul merge with an alien power,"
" becoming attuned to the waters."
msgstr "당신은 그 혼합물을 마셨고, 당신의 영혼이 외계의 힘과 합쳐지는 것을 느꼈고, 물과 조화를 이루었습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "become_earth_fae"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/alchemy_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You imbibed the concoction and you feel your soul merge with an alien power,"
" becoming attuned to the earth."
msgstr "당신은 그 혼합물을 마시고, 당신의 영혼이 외계의 힘과 합쳐지는 것을 느꼈고, 지구와 조화를 이루게 되었습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XEDRA_CHRONOMANCER_KILLED_DIFFICULT_TIME_ENEMY"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/chronomancer_eocs.json
msgid "You gain a large amount of insight into the workings of time!"
msgstr "시간의 흐름에 대한 많은 통찰력을 얻게 됩니다!"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XEDRA_CHRONOMANCER_KILLED_MEDIUM_TIME_ENEMY"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/chronomancer_eocs.json
msgid "You gain a medium amount of insight into the workings of time."
msgstr "당신은 시간의 작동 원리에 대해 중간 정도의 통찰력을 얻습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XEDRA_CHRONOMANCER_KILLED_NORMAL_TIME_ENEMY"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/chronomancer_eocs.json
msgid "You gain a small amount of insight into the workings of time."
msgstr "당신은 시간의 작동 원리에 대한 작은 통찰력을 얻게 됩니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_on_kill_award_chrono_exp"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/chronomancer_eocs.json
msgid "You gain a tiny amount of insight into the workings of time."
msgstr "당신은 시간의 작동 원리에 대한 작은 통찰력을 얻게 됩니다."

#. ~ NPC message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XEDRA_CHRONOMANCER_PARADOX_INSIGHT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/chronomancer_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Observing this paradox gave you <context_val:insight_gain> Insight into time"
msgstr "이 역설을 관찰하면 <context_val:insight_gain> 시간에 대한 통찰력을 얻을 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XEDRA_CHRONOMANCER_MEDITATE_EFFFECT_REMOVE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/chronomancer_eocs.json
msgid "You finish your meditations."
msgstr "명상을 마칩니다."

#. ~ Verb in activity "act_xedra_time_freeze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/chronomancer_eocs.json
msgid "frozen in time"
msgstr "시간 속에 얼어붙다"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_XEDRA_DAMAGE_REVERSAL"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/chronomancer_eocs.json
msgid "Your wound heals!"
msgstr "상처가 낫습니다!"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_XEDRA_DAMAGE_REVERSAL"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/chronomancer_eocs.json
msgid "You don't have a previous wound to heal."
msgstr "당신은 치유해야 할 이전의 상처가 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XEDRA_CHRONOMANCER_LOOPING_WOUND_DAMAGE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/chronomancer_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You feel a sharp jolt of pain as a stab wound suddenly opens in your belly!"
msgstr "갑자기 배에 칼에 찔린 상처가 생기고 날카로운 고통을 느끼게 됩니다!"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XEDRA_CHRONOMANCER_UNSTABLE_POWERS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/chronomancer_eocs.json
msgid "Your chronomantic powers destabilize and you lose their effects!"
msgstr "당신의 시간술 능력은 불안정해지고 그 효과를 잃게 됩니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_XEDRA_TIME_LOOP_ENDED_LOOP"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/chronomancer_eocs.json
msgid "Your time loop ends!"
msgstr "시간 루프가 끝납니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XEDRA_CHRONOMANCER_STABLE_TIMELOOP_LOSE_EFFECT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/chronomancer_eocs.json
msgid "Time rewinds!"
msgstr "시간이 되돌아갑니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MESSAGE_SCORE_TIMER" in nested EOCs
#. on true condition in effect in EoC "EOC_DREAMSMITHS_SCORE_TIMER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/dreamsmith.json
msgid ""
"Something sparked in your head, and you realize an interesting property of "
"dreamdross.  Maybe you can forge something new?"
msgstr "머릿속에 뭔가 불꽃이 튀더니, 드림드로스의 흥미로운 속성을 깨달았습니다. 어쩌면 새로운 걸 만들어낼 수 있을지도 몰라요."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DREAMSMITHS_SCORE_TRAIN"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/dreamsmith.json
msgid ""
"You just can't seem to figure out even the simplest principles of "
"dreamdross."
msgstr "당신은 드림드로스의 가장 간단한 원리조차 이해할 수 없는 듯합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DREAMSMITH_MESSAGE_POSITIVE" in
#. nested EOCs on true condition in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DREAMSMITHS_RECIPES_ENCH"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/dreamsmith.json
msgid ""
"A brilliant idea about the properties of dreamdross hits your head, and you "
"think you know how to utilize it now."
msgstr "드림드로스의 특성에 대한 훌륭한 아이디어가 떠올랐고, 이제는 그것을 활용하는 방법을 안다고 생각합니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_DREAMSMITHS_RECIPES_ENCH"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/dreamsmith.json
msgid ""
"Using the dreamdross, you test out a new idea.  It fails, but you're getting"
" closer to a breakthrough.  You can feel it."
msgstr "드림드로스를 사용하여 새로운 아이디어를 시험해 봅니다. 실패하지만, 돌파구에 점점 가까워지고 있습니다. 느낄 수 있죠."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DREAMSMITH_SUPER_MESSAGE_POSITIVE"
#. in nested EOCs on true condition in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DREAMSMITHS_RECIPES_SUPER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/dreamsmith.json
msgid ""
"You found a pretty smart way to utilize dreamdross' abilities, and you can't"
" wait to use it."
msgstr "당신은 드림드로스의 능력을 활용하는 꽤 똑똑한 방법을 찾았고, 그것을 사용하고 싶어 안달이 나 있네요."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DREAMSMITH_CASINGS_LC_MESSAGE_POSITIVE" in nested EOCs on true
#. condition in effect in EoC "DREAMSMITH_CASINGS_LOW_CALIBER_RECIPE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/dreamsmith.json
msgid "You realize you know suddenly how to make a low caliber bullet casing."
msgstr "당신은 갑자기 저구경 총알 껍질을 만드는 방법을 알게 되었다는 것을 깨닫습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_DREAMSMITH_CASINGS_HC_MESSAGE_POSITIVE" in nested EOCs on true
#. condition in effect in EoC "DREAMSMITH_CASINGS_LARGE_CALIBER_RECIPE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/dreamsmith.json
msgid ""
"You realize you know suddenly how to make a larger caliber bullet casing."
msgstr "갑자기 더 큰 구경의 총알 껍질을 만드는 방법을 알게 되었다는 것을 깨닫습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LIEUTENANT_SPAWN_SHADOW_MESSAGE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/eater_eocs.json
msgid "The night closes in… but you were born to destroy what's coming"
msgstr "밤이 다가오고 있습니다… 하지만 당신은 다가올 것을 파괴하기 위해 태어났습니다"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_UNDINE_WARP_POOL_BOTTOM_FLOOR"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/elemental_eruptions.json
msgid ""
"You swim down and down, further and further, until you're no longer sure "
"which way is up.  You're in total darkness, still swimming, when you see a "
"light up ahead.  With a goal at last in reach, you swim toward it as the "
"light broadens and expands and, finally, you breach the water's surface."
msgstr ""
"아래로, 아래로, 점점 더 멀리 헤엄치다가, 어느 쪽이 위인지 더 이상 알 수 없게 됩니다. 칠흑 같은 어둠 속에서 계속 헤엄치던 중, "
"앞쪽에 빛이 보입니다. 마침내 목표 지점에 다다르자, 빛이 점점 넓어지고 확장되면서 그 곳을 향해 헤엄쳐 갑니다. 마침내 수면 위로 "
"솟아오릅니다."

