msgid "Your attempts to save anything are hopeless…"
msgstr "당신이 무엇이든 구하려는 시도는 헛수고일 뿐입니다..."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SLEEPING_SEIZED_BY_LILIT_WARNING"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/eoc_strange_events.json
msgid ""
"The night was a little rough.  You tossed and turned, aware of every single "
"noise and creak of wood in a way you never were before all of this happened,"
" before you finally fell asleep.  You weren't attacked and woke up without "
"trouble, but you have to wonder if it's really safe, sleeping alone like "
"this in an abandoned building?"
msgstr ""
"밤은 좀 험난했다. 이 모든 일이 일어나기 전, 마침내 잠들기 전까지는, 당신은 뒤척이며 나무가 삐걱거리는 소리 하나하나를 전혀 "
"알아차리지 못했다. 공격당하지도 않았고, 아무 문제 없이 깨어났지만, 버려진 건물에서 이렇게 혼자 자는 게 정말 안전한 걸까 하는 생각이"
" 들었다."

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_BROWNIE_IN_YOUR_FACTION_BASE_SUCCESS" in nested EOCs on true
#. condition in effect in EoC "EOC_XE_BROWNIE_IN_YOUR_FACTION_BASE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/eoc_strange_events.json
msgid "A wizened, hairy creature suddenly appears out of thin air!"
msgstr "갑자기 주름지고 털이 많은 생물이 공기 중에서 나타났습니다!"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_STRANGE_EVENT_BROWNIE_CONVERSATION"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/eoc_strange_events.json
msgid ""
"The strange creature sees you and starts before spinning around and "
"vanishing into thin air."
msgstr "이상한 생물이 당신을 보고 갑자기 움직이더니 돌아서서 공기 속으로 사라집니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_EATER_DREAMER_COUNTER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
msgid ""
"In your dream, you stand at the edge of two worlds, a bad feeling overcoming"
" you."
msgstr "꿈속에서 당신은 두 세계의 끝에 서 있고, 나쁜 기분이 당신을 압도하고 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_EATER_DREAMER_COUNTER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
msgid ""
"One world's infinitely dense, concentrated into a singular dot with "
"neverending gales and scorching heat."
msgstr "한 세계는 무한히 밀도가 높고, 끝없는 폭풍과 뜨거운 열기가 있는 단일 점으로 집중되어 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_EATER_DREAMER_COUNTER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
msgid ""
"The other world is limitless, full to the brim with potential and boundless "
"possibilities.  You watched it, but can't comprehend what you saw."
msgstr ""
"다른 세상은 무한하고, 잠재력과 무한한 가능성으로 가득 차 있습니다. 당신은 그것을 보았지만, 무엇을 보았는지 이해할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_EATER_DREAMER_COUNTER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
msgid ""
"You watch for a while but there is only you to decide and decide you must."
msgstr "당신은 잠시 지켜보지만 결정할 사람은 당신뿐이고, 당신은 결정해야 합니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_EATER_DREAMER_COUNTER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
msgid ""
"You don't remember much from your dream, but what little you do is that "
"there was something… or someone, and you answered their questions."
msgstr ""
"당신은 꿈에서 많은 것을 기억하지 못합니다. 하지만 당신이 기억하는 것은 무언가가 있었다는 것, 또는 누군가가 있었다는 것, 그리고 "
"당신이 그들의 질문에 답했다는 것입니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_INVENTOR_DREAMSMITH_COUNTER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
msgid "It happens again.  Otherworldly nightmares haunt you."
msgstr "또 그런 일이 일어났네요. 다른 세상의 악몽이 당신을 괴롭힙니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_INVENTOR_DREAMSMITH_COUNTER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
msgid "Another time, another two worlds."
msgstr "또 다른 시간, 또 다른 두 세계."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_INVENTOR_DREAMSMITH_COUNTER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
msgid "You don't remember much from these two, they felt very similar."
msgstr "이 둘에 대해서는 별로 기억나는 게 없지만, 느낌이 매우 비슷했어요."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_INVENTOR_DREAMSMITH_COUNTER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
msgid "One was tiring and hard-working."
msgstr "한 사람은 피곤하고 열심히 일했습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_INVENTOR_DREAMSMITH_COUNTER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
msgid "The second was information, information, and nothing but information."
msgstr "두 번째는 정보, 정보, 그리고 정보 그 자체였습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_INVENTOR_DREAMSMITH_COUNTER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
msgid "It is time to choose again."
msgstr "다시 선택할 때가 왔습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in switch statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_MAGIC_SEQUENCE_INVENTOR_DREAMSMITH_COUNTER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/give_a_class_eoc.json
msgid "It is that person again."
msgstr "또 그 사람이야."

