#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/inventor.json
msgid "You hear a sudden crack!"
msgstr "갑자기 딱딱거리는 소리가 들립니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_RUST_INVENTOR_ITEMS" in nested EOCs
#. on true condition in effect in EoC "EOC_INVENTOR_CRAFTED_DEGRADATION"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/inventor.json
msgid ""
"Your lack of an inventor's aura makes items created by their fevered mind "
"rapidly degrade!"
msgstr "인벤터의 기운이 부족하면, 그들의 흥분한 정신으로 만든 물건도 빠르게 질이 떨어지게 됩니다!"

#. ~ NPC message in effect in EoC "EOC_RUST_INVENTOR_ITEMS" in nested EOCs on
#. true condition in effect in EoC "EOC_INVENTOR_CRAFTED_DEGRADATION"
