msgstr "비가 매끈한 시트에 떨어진다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_WEATHER_CONTROL_RAINSTORM_TO_THUNDERSTORM"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/magic_weather_control.json
