msgstr "눈이 내리기 시작하면서 하늘이 흐려진다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_WEATHER_CONTROL_BELOW_FREEZING_INITIATE" in nested EOCs in effect in
#. EoC "EOC_WEATHER_CONTROL_BELOW_FREEZING"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/magic_weather_control.json
msgid "Snow slowly begins to drift down from the clouds above."
msgstr "위쪽 구름에서 눈이 천천히 내려오기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_WEATHER_CONTROL_FLURRIES_TO_SNOWING"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/magic_weather_control.json
msgid "Snow falls steadily now."
msgstr "지금은 눈이 꾸준히 내리고 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_WEATHER_CONTROL_SNOWING_TO_SNOWSTORM"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/magic_weather_control.json
msgid "Snow falls thickly, obscuring your vision."
msgstr "눈이 많이 내려 시야가 가려졌습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CALL_DAFFODIL"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid "You can't call more daffodil yet."
msgstr "아직은 수선화를 더 부를 수 없어요."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SHADOW_LOOT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid "As the shadow dissipates, it leaves something behind."
msgstr "그림자가 사라지면서 무언가가 남습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_DREAM_DRAINER_LOOT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid "As the mosquito fades away, it leaves something behind."
msgstr "모기가 사라지면서 무언가를 남깁니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_LUNA_ATTUNED_LOOT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid "As the revenant decoheres, it leaves something behind."
msgstr "망령이 깨어나면서 무언가를 남긴다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ATTEMPT_TO_MAKE_STORMWROUGHT_BLOOD_SUCCESS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid ""
"The ritual harnesses the energies of the tear to infuse some blood with it, "
"leaving behind a small ball of almost-solid blood.  It only needs to bath in"
" the energies of the storms until it is fully charged and it will be ready "
"to use."
msgstr ""
"이 의식은 눈물의 에너지를 이용하여 피를 주입하고, 거의 고체에 가까운 작은 피덩어리를 남깁니다. 이 피덩어리는 폭풍의 에너지에 몸을 "
"담그기만 하면 완전히 충전되어 사용할 준비가 됩니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ATTEMPT_TO_MAKE_STORMWROUGHT_BLOOD_FAIL"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Without the proximity of a tear in reality, the ritual fails to harness any "
"energy and the blood boils away."
msgstr "현실에 눈물이 없다면 의식은 에너지를 활용하지 못하고 피는 끓어오릅니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "STORMWROUGHT_BLOOD_FULL_CHARGE" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "CHARGE_STORMWROUGHT_BLOOD"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid "As the stormwrought blood becomes fully charged, it starts simmering."
msgstr "폭풍으로 휩싸인 피가 완전히 충전되면서 끓기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "STORMWROUGHT_BLOOD_HIGH_CHARGE" in
#. nested EOCs in false effect in EoC "STORMWROUGHT_BLOOD_FULL_CHARGE" in
#. nested EOCs in effect in EoC "CHARGE_STORMWROUGHT_BLOOD"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid ""
"The stormwrought blood boils intensely for a moment before returning to its "
"inert state."
msgstr "폭풍에 휩싸인 피는 잠시 격렬하게 끓어오르다가 다시 무기력한 상태로 돌아간다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "STORMWROUGHT_BLOOD_LOW_CHARGE" in nested
#. EOCs in false effect in EoC "STORMWROUGHT_BLOOD_HIGH_CHARGE" in nested EOCs
#. in false effect in EoC "STORMWROUGHT_BLOOD_FULL_CHARGE" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "CHARGE_STORMWROUGHT_BLOOD"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid "The stormwrought blood boils a little, then becomes inert again."
msgstr "폭풍에 휩싸인 피는 약간 끓어오르다가 다시 가라앉는다."

#. ~ NPC message in effect in EoC "EOC_SUMMON_DREAM_DRAINER_2" in nested EOCs
#. in effect in EoC "EOC_SUMMON_DREAM_DRAINER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid ""
"The mosquito consumes the catalyst and suddenly starts filling with air as "
"it reshapes itself."
msgstr "모기는 촉매를 먹어치우고 갑자기 자신의 모습을 바꾸면서 공기가 차오르기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHECK_TO_SUMMON_REVENANT_MOON_DARK_OUTSIDE" in nested EOCs in effect
#. in EoC "EOC_CHECK_TO_SUMMON_REVENANT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid ""
"You utter the last words of the ritual and the revenant suddently animates, "
"disappears and reappears nearby, a deadly glare in its eyes."
msgstr ""
"당신이 의식의 마지막 말을 하자마자 망령이 갑자기 살아나 사라지고 근처에 다시 나타나며 눈에는 치명적인 빛이 비치고 있습니다."

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHECK_TO_SUMMON_REVENANT_MOON_DARK_OUTSIDE" in nested EOCs in effect
#. in EoC "EOC_CHECK_TO_SUMMON_REVENANT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid "You see a flash of moonlight surrounding a tall, slender being."
msgstr "당신은 키가 크고 날씬한 존재를 둘러싼 달빛의 번쩍임을 봅니다."

#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHECK_TO_SUMMON_REVENANT_MOON_DARK_OUTSIDE" in nested EOCs in effect
#. in EoC "EOC_CHECK_TO_SUMMON_REVENANT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid "You see a flash of moonlight surrounding tall, slender beings."
msgstr "키가 크고 날씬한 존재들을 둘러싼 달빛이 번쩍이는 것을 봅니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHECK_TO_SUMMON_REVENANT_MOON_DARK_OUTSIDE" in nested EOCs in effect
#. in EoC "EOC_CHECK_TO_SUMMON_REVENANT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid ""
"The revenant cannot be animated unless a sufficient amount of the light of a"
" full moon shines upon it."
msgstr "망령은 보름달의 빛이 충분히 비치지 않는 한 살아 움직일 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SLEEP_SHIELD_SEVENOCLOCK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid ""
"Distrustful of the shenanigans you used to bring him at such a high "
"altitude, the Man of the Nineteenth Hour refuses to shield you!"
msgstr "19시의 사나이는 당신이 그렇게 높은 고도에서 저지른 짓을 의심하며 당신을 보호하기를 거부합니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_VAMPIRE_BLEED_STOLEN_BLOOD"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/misc_eoc.json
msgid "You are losing your stolen blood through your bleeding wounds!"
msgstr "당신은 피를 흘리는 상처를 통해 훔친 피를 잃고 있습니다!"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PLAYABLE_CHANGELING_COMMONER_CHOOSE_HERITAGE"
