#. "EOC_PLAYABLE_CHANGELING_COMMONER_CHOOSE_HERITAGE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/playable_changeling_advancement_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your parents were selkies, who spend part of the time upon land and part of "
"the time as a seal in the sea"
msgstr "당신의 부모님은 셀키였는데, 시간의 일부는 육지에서, 나머지 시간은 바다에서 물개로 지냈습니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PLAYABLE_CHANGELING_COMMONER_CHOOSE_HERITAGE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/eocs/playable_changeling_advancement_eocs.json
msgid "Your parents were trow, tough as stone, who dwell beneath the earth."
msgstr "당신의 부모님은 땅속에 사는 돌처럼 튼튼한 사람들이었습니다."

