"아음속으로 만들어 최종 성능은 저하시킵니다. 최신형 소음기만큼 효과적이지 않습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid "FN Five-seveN suppressed"
msgid_plural "FN Five-seveN suppresseds"
msgstr[0] "FN 파이브세븐 소음기 장착"

#. ~ Description of gun "FN Five-seveN suppressed"
#. ~ Description of "FN Five-seveN suppressed"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"Designed to work with FN's proprietary 5.7x28mm round and with a built in "
"suppressor, the Five-seveN is a lightweight integrally suppressed pistol "
"with a very high capacity, best used against armored opponents."
msgstr ""
"FN의 독점적인 5.7x28mm 탄약과 소음기 내장형으로 설계된 Five-seveN은 매우 높은 탄환 용량을 갖춘 가볍고 일체형 소음기 "
"권총으로, 장갑을 낀 상대에게 사용하기에 가장 적합합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid "SR-1 Vektor Gyurza"
msgid_plural "SR-1 Vektor Gyurza"
msgstr[0] "SR-1 벡터 규르자"

#. ~ Description of gun "SR-1 Vektor Gyurza"
#. ~ Description of "SR-1 Vektor Gyurza"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"The SR-1 Vektor also known as the Gyurza (Гюрза, Russian for 'blunt-nosed "
"viper') or Serdyukov SPS is a 9×21mm Gyurza semi-automatic pistol designed "
"for the Russian military.  It fires 9x21mm ammunition, which is rare in the "
"States."
msgstr ""
"SR-1 Vektor는 '규르자(Гюрза, 러시아어로 '뭉툭한 코의 독사'라는 뜻)' 또는 세르듀코프 SPS라고도 불리는데, "
"러시아군용으로 설계된 9×21mm 규르자 반자동 권총입니다. 미국에서는 보기 드문 9×21mm 탄을 사용합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid "Auto Assault-12"
msgid_plural "Auto Assault-12s"
msgstr[0] "자동 돌격-12"

#. ~ Description of gun "Auto Assault-12"
#. ~ Description of "Auto Assault-12"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"The Atchisson Assault Shotgun, is an automatic combat shotgun developed in "
"1972 by Maxwell Atchisson.  The most prominent feature is reduced recoil."
msgstr "애치슨 어썰트 샷건은 1972년 맥스웰 애치슨이 개발한 자동 전투용 샷건입니다. 가장 두드러진 특징은 반동 감소입니다."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of a gun
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid "HAMMER dual AA-12 turret system"
msgid_plural "HAMMER dual AA-12 turret systems"
msgstr[0] "HAMMER 듀얼 AA-12 터렛 시스템"

#. ~ Description of gun "HAMMER dual AA-12 turret system"
#. ~ Description of "HAMMER dual AA-12 turret system"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/guns.json
msgid ""
"An electrically driven dual AA-12s mounted together to match to a turret."
msgstr "포탑에 맞춰 함께 장착된 전기 구동식 AA-12 2문."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Rain Ward"
msgid_plural "Rain Wards"
msgstr[0] "비 보호막"

#. ~ Description of "Rain Ward"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Thanks to the words of the charm you spoke, you won't get wet."
msgstr "당신이 말한 마법의 말 덕분에 젖지 않을 거예요."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Witchlight"
msgid_plural "Witchlights"
msgstr[0] "마녀의 빛"

#. ~ Description of "Witchlight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "A bobbing ball of blueish-green light, just bright enough to read by."
msgstr "푸른빛이 도는 녹색 빛의 움직이는 공. 그 빛으로 책을 읽을 수 있을 만큼 밝습니다."

#. ~ "description" action message of item "Witchlight"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Dismiss the witchlight"
msgstr "마녀의 빛을 없애다"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "life of the crops"
msgid_plural "life of the crops"
msgstr[0] "작물의 생명"

#. ~ Description of "life of the crops"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Use this to fertilize your crops."
msgstr "이것을 사용하여 작물에 비료를 주세요."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Name of spell "hedge_light_fire"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/spells/hedge_magic_spells.json
msgid "To Kindle the Flames"
msgid_plural "To Kindle the Flames"
msgstr[0] "불꽃을 지피다"

#. ~ Description of "To Kindle the Flames"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"The item that starts fires when using To Kindle the Flames.  This should be "
"summoned and deleted as part of the spell, so you should never actually see "
"it."
msgstr ""
"\"불꽃을 피우다\"를 사용하면 불이 붙는 아이템입니다. 이 아이템은 주문의 일부로 소환 후 삭제해야 하므로, 실제로 볼 일은 없을 "
"겁니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Faesight Charm"
msgid_plural "Faesight Charms"
msgstr[0] "요정 시야 부적"

#. ~ Description of "Faesight Charm"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"A small sack with herbs in it to warn you if the Fair Folk are nearby.  You "
"had better wear it under your clothes.  You wouldn't want them to know "
"you're avoiding them.  It's awaiting you to speak the final words of the "
"charm and activate it."
msgstr ""
"요정들이 근처에 있는지 알려주는 약초가 든 작은 자루. 옷 안에 입는 게 좋을 거야. 네가 그들을 피하고 있다는 걸 들키고 싶지 않을 "
"테니까. 마법의 마지막 말을 하고 마법을 발동시키기만을 기다리고 있어."

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "Faesight Charm"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "You recite that last part of the charm."
msgstr "당신은 주문의 마지막 부분을 낭송합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Faesight Charm (active)"
msgid_plural "Faesight Charms (active)"
msgstr[0] "요정 시야 부적 (활성)"

#. ~ Description of "Faesight Charm (active)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"A small sack with herbs in it to warn you if the Fair Folk are nearby.  You "
"had better wear it under your clothes.  You wouldn't want them to know "
"you're avoiding them."
msgstr ""
"요정들이 근처에 있는지 알려주는 약초가 든 작은 자루. 옷 안에 입는 게 좋을 거야. 요정들을 피하고 있다는 걸 들키면 안 되니까."

#. ~ Dying message of tool "Faesight Charm (active)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Your otherworldly senses fade."
msgstr "당신의 이 세상 밖의 감각이 사라집니다."

#. ~ Description of "Faesight Charm"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"A small sack with herbs in it to warn you if the Fair Folk are nearby.  You "
"had better wear it under your clothes.  You wouldn't want them to know "
"you're avoiding them.  This charm seems lifeless somehow, its energy spent."
msgstr ""
"요정들이 근처에 있는지 알려주는 약초가 든 작은 자루. 옷 안에 입는 게 좋을 거야. 네가 그들을 피하고 있다는 걸 들키고 싶지 않을 "
"테니까. 이 마법은 어쩐지 생명력이 없어 보여. 에너지가 다한 것 같아."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "betweener's maze"
msgid_plural "betweener's mazes"
msgstr[0] "중간자의 미로"

#. ~ Description of "betweener's maze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"A yarn contraption similar to a cat's cradle that looks like a three "
"dimensional maze.  When placed properly, it can fascinate the changeling "
"blooded."
msgstr ""
"고양이 요람처럼 생긴 실 모양의 장치로, 3차원 미로처럼 보입니다. 제대로 배치하면 변신하는 피의 요정들을 매료시킬 수 있습니다."

#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "betweener's maze"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "You place the betweener's maze."
msgstr "중간 미로를 놓습니다."

#. ~ Description of "Blood-and-Ash Paste"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"A disgusting mixture of blood, ashes, and certain herbs.  Using it will "
"allow you to see otherworldly creatures even through walls or in darkness."
msgstr ""
"피와 재, 그리고 특정 약초가 섞인 역겨운 혼합물입니다. 이걸 사용하면 벽 너머나 어둠 속에서도 다른 세계의 생물을 볼 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Curative tea"
msgid_plural "Curative teas"
msgstr[0] "치유 차"

#. ~ Description of "Curative tea"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"Tea with herbs, iron, and a bit of magick.  If you're sick, there's nothing "
"better for your body than this."
msgstr "약초와 철분, 그리고 약간의 마법이 들어간 차. 몸이 아플 때 이보다 더 좋은 건 없을 거예요."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "drained bearskin talisman"
msgid_plural "drained bearskin talismans"
msgstr[0] "힘이 빠진 곰가죽 부적"

#. ~ Description of "drained bearskin talisman"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"A heavy fur mantle attached to the skull of a bear.  The charm worked into "
"it has been expended."
msgstr "곰의 두개골에 붙은 두꺼운 모피 망토. 거기에 새겨진 마법이 소진되었습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "bearskin talisman"
msgid_plural "bearskin talismans"
msgstr[0] "곰가죽 부적"

#. ~ Description of "bearskin talisman"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"A heavy fur mantle attached to the skull of a bear.  When you put it on, the"
" charm will take effect and grant you the bear's power."
msgstr "곰의 두개골에 붙인 두꺼운 모피 망토입니다. 착용하면 마법의 효과가 발휘되어 곰의 힘을 얻게 됩니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "magic square (To Walk Upon the Water)"
msgid_plural "magic squares (To Walk Upon the Water)"
msgstr[0] "마법진 (물 위를 걷기)"

#. ~ Description of "magic square (To Walk Upon the Water)"
#. ~ Description of "magic square (To Operate Under the Water)"
#. ~ Description of "magic square (To Demolish Buildings and Strongholds)"
#. ~ Description of "magic square (To Cause Armed Men to Appear)"
#. ~ Description of "magic square (To Cause the Spirits to Bring us Anything
#. We May Wish to Eat or to Drink)"
#. ~ Description of "magic square (To Render Oneself Invisible Unto Every
#. Person)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "A piece of paper.  A magic square is carefully written on it."
msgstr "한 장의 종이 위에 마법의 사각형이 조심스럽게 쓰여 있습니다."

#. ~ "description" action message of item "magic square (To Walk Upon the
#. Water)"
#. ~ "description" action message of item "magic square (To Operate Under the
#. Water)"
#. ~ "description" action message of item "magic square (To Demolish Buildings
#. and Strongholds)"
#. ~ "description" action message of item "magic square (To Cause Armed Men to
#. Appear)"
#. ~ "description" action message of item "magic square (To Cause the Spirits
#. to Bring us Anything We May Wish to Eat or to Drink)"
#. ~ "description" action message of item "magic square (To Render Oneself
#. Invisible Unto Every Person)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Activate the charm using the magic square."
msgstr "마법의 사각형을 이용해 매력을 활성화하세요."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "magic square (To Operate Under the Water)"
msgid_plural "magic squares (To Operate Under the Water)"
msgstr[0] "마법진 (물 속에서 작동하기)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "magic square (To Demolish Buildings and Strongholds)"
msgid_plural "magic squares (To Demolish Buildings and Strongholds)"
msgstr[0] "마법진 (건물과 요새를 파괴하기)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "magic square (To Cause Armed Men to Appear)"
msgid_plural "magic squares (To Cause Armed Men to Appear)"
msgstr[0] "마법진 (무장한 남자를 나타나게 하기)"

#. ~ Player sees monster spawns in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HEDGE_ARMED_MEN_MAGIC_SQUARE" in use action of item "magic square (To
#. Cause Armed Men to Appear)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "An armed warrior appears."
msgstr "무장한 전사가 등장합니다."

#. ~ Player sees monsters spawn in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HEDGE_ARMED_MEN_MAGIC_SQUARE" in use action of item "magic square (To
#. Cause Armed Men to Appear)"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "Several armed warriors appear."
msgstr "무장한 전사들이 여러 명 나타납니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid ""
"magic square (To Cause the Spirits to Bring us Anything We May Wish to Eat "
"or to Drink)"
msgid_plural ""
"magic squares (To Cause the Spirits to Bring us Anything We May Wish to Eat "
"or to Drink)"
msgstr[0] "마법진 (영혼이 우리가 먹거나 마시고 싶은 것을 가져오게 하기)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/hedge_magic_items.json
msgid "magic square (To Render Oneself Invisible Unto Every Person)"
msgid_plural "magic squares (To Render Oneself Invisible Unto Every Person)"
msgstr[0] "마법진 (모든 사람에게 자신을 보이지 않게 하기)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "glasknife"
msgid_plural "glasknives"
msgstr[0] "유리칼"

#. ~ Description of "glasknife"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"This is a knife that seems to be made of glass, but significantly more "
"durable, like some sort of crystal with the strength of metal."
msgstr "이 칼은 유리로 만들어진 것처럼 보이지만, 금속만큼 강한 일종의 수정처럼 훨씬 더 내구성이 뛰어납니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "mirrored estoc"
msgid_plural "mirrored estocs"
msgstr[0] "거울 에스톡"

#. ~ Description of "mirrored estoc"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A thin piercing sword no wider than two fingers side by side, it's mirrored "
"surface reflects the world back at it's wielders opponents and is difficult "
"to see to parry.  You've never felt a sword like this before."
msgstr ""
"손가락 두 개를 나란히 놓았을 때보다 얇고 날카로운 검. 거울처럼 반사되는 표면은 세상의 빛을 휘두르는 자와 적에게 반사시켜, 눈으로 "
"확인하기 어려워 쳐내기가 어렵습니다. 이런 검을 느껴본 적은 없을 겁니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "frostrimed estoc"
msgid_plural "frostrimed estocs"
msgstr[0] "서리 테두리 에스톡"

#. ~ Description of "frostrimed estoc"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"This sword is covered in shifting frost and seems to move of its own "
"volition in your hands."
msgstr "이 검은 움직이는 서리로 뒤덮여 있으며, 손 안에서 스스로 움직이는 것처럼 보입니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "witchwood sword"
msgid_plural "witchwood swords"
msgstr[0] "마녀나무 검"

#. ~ Description of "witchwood sword"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"This sword is made all of a single piece of wood and so black any details "
"are lost.  Some kind of shimmering leather is wrapped around the grip."
msgstr ""
"이 검은 나무 한 조각으로만 만들어져서 검은색이라 디테일이 하나도 살아나지 않습니다. 손잡이에는 반짝이는 가죽이 감겨 있습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "redcap club"
msgid_plural "redcap clubs"
msgstr[0] "레드캡 곤봉"

#. ~ Description of "redcap club"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A giant bloodstained club, barely human wieldable with two hands.  You see "
"shadowy tendrils of blood whenever it connects with an enemy, sticking to "
"whatever it hits and burning like acid."
msgstr ""
"두 손으로 휘두르기에는 거의 인간 같지 않은 거대한 피 묻은 곤봉. 적에게 닿을 때마다 희미한 피 촉수가 나타나, 닿는 곳에 달라붙어 "
"산처럼 타오른다."

#. ~ Name of spell "blood_tendrils"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "Blood Tendrils"
msgstr "피의 덩굴"

#. ~ Description of spell "blood_tendrils ( Blood Tendrils )"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "Brownish reddish tendrils connect from the club to your enemies."
msgstr "갈색빛이 도는 붉은색 덩굴이 곤봉에서 적에게로 연결됩니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "pooka gladius"
msgid_plural "pooka gladii"
msgstr[0] "푸카 글라디우스"

#. ~ Description of "pooka gladius"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A gladius covered in the whorls of Celtic knots.  Sparks seems to pop off "
"the edge of the blade."
msgstr "켈트 매듭의 소용돌이 무늬로 뒤덮인 글라디우스. 칼날 끝에서 불꽃이 튀는 듯하다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "salamagman hand axe"
msgid_plural "salamagman hand axes"
msgstr[0] "살라마그만 손도끼"

#. ~ Description of "salamagman hand axe"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "A one-handed combat axe, the blade is slightly larger than a tomahawk."
msgstr "한 손으로 사용하는 전투용 도끼로, 칼날이 토마호크보다 약간 큽니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "salamagman battle axe"
msgid_plural "salamagman battle axes"
msgstr[0] "살라마그만 전투 도끼"

#. ~ Description of "salamagman battle axe"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A huge axe designed for warfare.  Made of forged dreamdross, and enchanted "
"to channel heat into those it wounds."
msgstr ""
"전쟁에 사용하기 위해 고안된 거대한 도끼. 단조된 꿈의 가루로 만들어졌으며, 상처를 입힌 자에게 열을 전달하는 마법이 걸려 있습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "obsidian macuahuitl"
msgid_plural "obsidian macuahuitls"
msgstr[0] "흑요석 마쿠아후이틀"

#. ~ Description of "obsidian macuahuitl"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"Astute observers of Mesoamerican history may recognize this as a macuahuitl,"
" the favored weapon of the Aztecs.  This macuahuitl looks as though it was "
"made deep inside of a black mirror."
msgstr ""
"메소아메리카 역사를 예리하게 관찰하는 사람이라면 이것이 아즈텍인들이 애용했던 무기인 마쿠아후이틀임을 알아볼 수 있을 것입니다. 이 "
"마쿠아후이틀은 마치 검은 거울 속 깊숙한 곳에 만들어진 것처럼 보입니다."

#. ~ Name of spell "distant_thunder"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "Distant Thunder"
msgstr "먼 천둥"

#. ~ Description of spell "distant_thunder ( Distant Thunder )"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "Sparks zap at your opponent."
msgstr "상대방에게 불꽃을 뿜어냅니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "dreamdross knife"
msgid_plural "dreamdross knives"
msgstr[0] "꿈 찌꺼기 칼"

#. ~ Description of "dreamdross knife"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"Covered with thin layer of dreamdross, this knife is a light and sharp tool "
"to work with."
msgstr "얇은 드림드로스 층으로 덮인 이 칼은 가볍고 날카로운 도구로 작업하기 좋습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "dreamdross club"
msgid_plural "dreamdross clubs"
msgstr[0] "꿈 찌꺼기 곤봉"

#. ~ Description of "dreamdross club"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"It was a good tool before, but now it's covered with a thick layer of "
"dreamdross, and it works as a light but deadly weapon."
msgstr "원래는 좋은 도구였지만, 이제는 두꺼운 드림드로스 층으로 덮여 가볍지만 치명적인 무기로 기능합니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid "dreamdrossed quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "dreamdrossed quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "꿈 찌꺼기 쿼터스태프"

#. ~ Description of "dreamdrossed quarterstaff"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A long stick that's been covered with dreamdross, but lacks any magical "
"properties."
msgstr "드림드로스가 묻힌 긴 막대기지만, 마법적인 속성은 전혀 없습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "dreamforged_q_staff_ench"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/dreamforged_weapon.json
msgid "dreamforged quarterstaff"
msgid_plural "dreamforged quarterstaves"
msgstr[0] "꿈으로 벼려낸 쿼터스태프"

#. ~ Description of "dreamforged quarterstaff"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/melee.json
msgid ""
"A long quarterstaff, forged entirely from dreamdross.  Twice as heavy than a"
" wooden one, but lot sturdier, and still useful as a weapon.  The dreamdross"
" grants it some minor magical properties, but you can't control their "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"드림드로스로만 만들어진 긴 쿼터스태프입니다. 나무로 만든 쿼터스태프보다 두 배나 무겁지만 훨씬 튼튼하고 무기로도 여전히 유용합니다. "
"드림드로스는 약간의 마법적 효과를 부여하지만, 그 효과는 제어할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Item name
#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "dreamforged_longsword_ench"
