msgstr "길들여지지 않은 공기의 샘플."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/nether_monster_drops.json
msgid "jade shard"
msgid_plural "jade shards"
msgstr[0] "비취 조각"

#. ~ Description of "jade shard"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/nether_monster_drops.json
msgid ""
"A shard of jade that fell away from the petrified corpse of a yugg.  The "
"edges are rounded and sinuous, and when you look at it out of the corner of "
"your eye it almost seems to be trying to crawl away."
msgstr ""
"유그의 석화된 시체에서 떨어져 나온 비취 조각. 가장자리는 둥글고 굴곡이 있어, 눈꼬치로 보면 마치 기어서 도망치려는 듯하다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/nether_monster_drops.json
msgid "blank blood"
msgid_plural "blank blood"
msgstr[0] "공백 피"

#. ~ Description of "blank blood"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/nether_monster_drops.json
msgid ""
"Blood extracted from a blank body.  It's a pale red color with none of the "
"luster of human blood."
msgstr "텅 빈 몸에서 뽑아낸 피. 인간의 피처럼 윤기가 전혀 없는 옅은 붉은색이다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/nether_monster_drops.json
msgid "star-stone"
msgid_plural "star-stones"
msgstr[0] "별돌"

#. ~ Description of "star-stone"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/items/nether_monster_drops.json
msgid ""
"A strange chunk of what looks like stone in the shape of a seven-pointed "
"star.  Its surface is smooth with thin lines in it, like driftwood, but "
"despite that it doesn't seem to reflect any light."
msgstr ""
"일곱 개의 꼭짓점을 가진 별 모양의 돌덩이. 표면은 유목처럼 매끈하고 가는 선들이 있지만, 그럼에도 불구하고 빛을 반사하는 것 같지는 "
"않다."

#. ~ Item name
