#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid "Basic Alchemical Knowledge"
msgstr "기본 연금술 지식"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Basic Alchemical Knowledge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You spent years before the Cataclysm researching esoteric sciences and "
"occult mysteries but only now in the heat of survival, have you experienced "
"the epiphany that will allow you to create alchemical substances."
msgstr ""
"대격변이 일어나기 전 수년 동안 당신은 난해한 과학과 신비로운 신비를 연구해 왔지만, 생존의 열기 속에서야 연금술 물질을 창조할 수 있는"
" 계시를 경험하게 되었습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid "Initiate Alchemy"
msgstr "연금술을 시작하다"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Initiate Alchemy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"The days and weeks since the Cataclysm have been a blur of ideas and "
"thoughts that you can only wish you had been able to think of before "
"everything ended."
msgstr "대격변 이후의 며칠, 몇 주는 끝이 나기 전에 생각해 낼 수 있었으면 하는 생각과 아이디어로 가득 차 있었습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid "Adept Alchemical Knowledge"
msgstr "숙련된 연금술 지식"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Adept Alchemical Knowledge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"The things you've learned would have changed your life in the old days, you "
"could have dropped out of the rat race and become a hidden master of the "
"occult."
msgstr ""
"당신이 배운 것들은 옛날에 당신의 삶을 바꾸었을 수도 있고, 쥐 경주에서 빠져나와 숨겨진 신비주의의 거장이 되었을 수도 있습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid "Cold Iron Knowledge"
msgstr "차가운 철 지식"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cold Iron Knowledge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"You've mastered the technique of cold forging iron from ingots into various "
"items and weapons that are particularly effective against creatures from "
"faerie myths."
msgstr ""
"여러분은 주괴에서 철을 냉간 단조하여 다양한 아이템과 무기를 만드는 기술을 터득했으며, 이는 요정 신화 속 생물에 특히 효과적입니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid "Magister Alchemical Knowledge"
msgstr "연금술 지식의 마법사"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Magister Alchemical Knowledge"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"At this stage in your occult education, normally you would start a small "
"cabal of your own with apprentices that would engage in research and "
"material gathering.  You would likely have several rich patrons financing "
"you in return for alchemical medicines and goods to give them health and "
"longevity."
msgstr ""
"오컬트 교육의 이 단계에서는 보통 견습생들과 함께 소규모 카발을 만들어 연구와 자료 수집에 참여하게 됩니다. 아마도 여러 부유한 "
"후원자들이 건강과 장수를 위한 연금술 약과 물품을 제공하는 대가로 자금을 지원할 것입니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid "Illuminated Alchemy"
msgstr "조명된 연금술"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Illuminated Alchemy"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Truly you have become one of the hidden occult masters of the world.  It's a"
" pity that so few people are around for you to enjoy the benefits of your "
"knowledge.  At least it's helping you to survive and maybe even thrive in "
"this post-Cataclysm world."
msgstr ""
"당신은 정말 세상의 숨겨진 오컬트 거장이 되었군요. 당신의 지식을 누릴 사람이 너무 적어 안타깝습니다. 적어도 대격변 이후의 세상에서 "
"살아남고, 어쩌면 번영하는 데 도움이 되고 있습니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid "Mana for Morons"
msgstr "바보들을 위한 마나"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Mana for Morons"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"Maybe you aren't a genius, but something inside of you grants previously "
"hidden reserves of mana."
msgstr "당신은 천재가 아닐지도 모릅니다. 하지만 당신 안의 무언가가 이전에 숨겨져 있던 마나를 끌어올립니다."

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid "Vampire Killer"
msgstr "뱀파이어 킬러"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Vampire Killer"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perks.json
msgid ""
"One of your ancestors spent their life fighting the monsters that stalk the "
"night, and you have finally taken up their legacy, though you've also "
"adopted their unusual weapon choice.  When wielding a whip, you do greatly-"
"increased damage to vampires and renfields, and have a much easier time "
"hitting their weakpoints."
msgstr ""
"당신의 조상 중 한 명이 밤을 노리는 괴물들과 싸우며 평생을 바쳤고, 당신은 마침내 그들의 유산을 이어받았습니다. 다만, 그들의 독특한 "
"무기 선택도 받아들였습니다. 채찍을 휘두르면 뱀파이어와 렌필드에게 더 큰 피해를 입히고, 그들의 약점을 훨씬 쉽게 공략할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_COMPLETED_ROLL_REMAINDER_ALCHEMY"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perk_data/Alchemy1.json
msgid "You have learned all the secrets of this level."
msgstr "당신은 이 레벨의 모든 비밀을 배웠습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_SUCCESFUL_ROLL_REMAINDER_ALCHEMY"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perk_data/Alchemy1.json
msgid "You learn a new secret of alchemy."
msgstr "당신은 연금술의 새로운 비밀을 배웁니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ALCHEMY1"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ALCHEMY2"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ALCHEMY3"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ALCHEMY3_COLD_IRON"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ALCHEMY4"
#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_ALCHEMY5"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks/perk_data/Alchemy1.json
msgid ""
"Your thoughts are too scattered to unearth more secrets of the universe."
msgstr "당신의 생각은 너무 산만해서 우주의 더 많은 비밀을 밝혀낼 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_DDOTD_DHAMPIRS_VAMPIRES_RESIST_INFECTION"
#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_XE_DDOTD_DHAMPIRS_VAMPIRES_RESIST_INFECTION_FOLLOWUP"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/classic_zombies/eocs.json
msgid ""
"You've started feeling a bit better.  Maybe your unique condition has saved "
"you from the zombie bite's inexorable death…this time."
msgstr ""
"기분이 좀 나아지기 시작했어요. 어쩌면 당신의 특별한 병이 좀비에게 물려 죽을 고비를 넘기지 못하게 해줬을지도 몰라요… 이번에는요."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/defense_mode/main_menu.json
msgid ""
"<color_yellow>Assault On Precinct 13</color>: (Hold out against the Exodii "
"with five of your coworkers in your office building.)"
msgstr "<color_yellow>13구역 공격</color>: (사무실 건물에서 동료 5명과 함께 엑소다이에 맞서 싸웁니다.)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/defense_mode/monster_corpses.json
msgid "broken Exodii Jotunn"
msgid_plural "broken Exodii Jotunns"
msgstr[0] "부서진 엑소다이 조툰"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/defense_mode/npcs.json
msgid "Zebra Investigator"
msgstr "얼룩말 수사관"

#. ~ Job description of "Zebra Investigator" NPC class
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/defense_mode/npcs.json
msgid ""
"I've seen things I don't want to remember, strange far worlds and stuff."
msgstr "나는 기억하고 싶지 않은 것들을 봤어요. 이상하고 먼 세상 같은 것들 말이죠."

#. ~ Name of starting location "sloc_defense_mode_border_office"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/defense_mode/scenarios.json
msgid "Border Patrol Office"
msgstr "국경 순찰대 사무실"

#. ~ Description of species "DM_VAMPIRE"
#. ~ Description of species "VAMPIRE"
