#. ~ Description of scenario "Paraclesian Birth, Lost and Alone" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/innawood/player/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your first moments of life, born of the elements, alone.  An elemental fae "
"on a dying world, lost in the wilderness."
msgstr "원소로 태어나 홀로 남은, 삶의 첫 순간. 죽어가는 세상의 원소 요정이 황야에서 길을 잃다."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Paraclesian Birth, Lost and Alone" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/innawood/player/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your first moments of life, born of the elements, alone.  An elemental fae "
"on a dying world, lost in the wilderness."
msgstr "원소로 태어나 홀로 남은, 삶의 첫 순간. 죽어가는 세상의 원소 요정이 황야에서 길을 잃다."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Werewolf, Natural-born" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/innawood/player/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You had no idea what was going on the first time it happened, when you woke "
"up with mud on your bare feet and a sour taste in your mouth, but you were "
"soon found.  The People of the Moon, they called themselves, and they said "
"you were one of them.  A werewolf.  You lived out in the wilderness for a "
"while with them.  Maybe some of the People are still out there."
msgstr ""
"처음 일어났을 때, 맨발에 진흙이 묻고 입안에 신맛이 나는 채로 깨어났을 때는 무슨 일이 벌어지고 있는지 전혀 몰랐지만, 곧 당신은 "
"발견되었습니다. 그들은 스스로를 달의 사람들이라고 불렀고, 당신이 그들 중 하나라고 말했습니다. 늑대인간. 당신은 한동안 그들과 함께 "
"황야에서 살았습니다. 어쩌면 그들 중 일부가 아직 저 밖에 있을지도 모릅니다."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Werewolf, Natural-born" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mod_interactions/innawood/player/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
