msgid ""
"You have no idea what happened, but you're alone in the unspoiled "
"wilderness.  You have mud on your feet, none of your clothes or possessions,"
" and you don't know where you are.  But you have learned there's a beast "
"inside you, and anyone who crosses you had best beware."
msgstr ""
"무슨 일이 일어났는지 전혀 알 수 없지만, 당신은 때묻지 않은 황야에 홀로 남겨졌습니다. 발에는 진흙이 묻었고, 옷이나 소지품은 아무것도"
