#. ~ Mutation class name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/mutation_category.json
msgid "Fair Folk Noble"
msgstr "페어 포크 귀족"

#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Fair Folk Noble" for male
#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Fair Folk Commoner, Brownie" for male
#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Fair Folk Commoner, Pooka" for male
#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Fair Folk Commoner, Selkie" for male
#. ~ Memorial message of mutation class "Fair Folk Commoner, Trow" for male
