msgid "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
msgstr "고블린 과일 재배"

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Selkie gains the ability to grow a goblin "
"fruit when near water or under the rain."
msgstr "이 능력을 얻으면 셀키는 물 근처나 비가 올 때 고블린 과일을 키울 수 있는 능력을 얻습니다."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Brownie gains the ability to grow a goblin "
"fruit when indoors and unobserved."
msgstr "이 능력을 얻으면 브라우니는 실내에 있고 아무도 없는 동안 고블린 과일을 키울 수 있는 능력을 얻습니다."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Pooka gains the ability to grow a goblin fruit"
" when near animals."
msgstr "이 능력을 얻으면 푸카는 동물 근처에서 고블린 과일을 키울 수 있는 능력을 얻습니다."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Trow gains the ability to grow a goblin fruit "
"when underground or at night."
msgstr "이 능력을 얻으면 트로우는 지하나 밤에 고블린 과일을 재배할 수 있는 능력을 얻습니다."

#. ~ Description of mutation "Cultivate Goblin Fruit"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling.json
msgid ""
"Upon gaining this ability the Noble gains the ability to grow a goblin fruit"
" when near humans or Fae."
msgstr "이 능력을 얻으면 귀족은 인간이나 요정 근처에서 고블린 과일을 키울 수 있는 능력을 얻습니다."

#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_CHANGELING_EFFECTS_REMOVED_BY_SPELLCASTING"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You cast a spell and effects are being removed"
msgstr "주문을 시전하면 효과가 제거됩니다."

#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_CHANGELING_EFFECTS_REMOVED_LOSE_EFFECTS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "Effects are being removed"
msgstr "효과가 제거되고 있습니다"

#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "EOC_CHANGELING_EFFECTS_REMOVED_BY_MOVEMENT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You moved and effects are being removed"
msgstr "이동이 완료되어 효과가 제거됩니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CHANGELING_DISGUISE_AS_NATURE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You wrap yourself up in a glamour."
msgstr "당신은 화려함으로 자신을 감싸고 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_CHANGELING_DISGUISE_AS_NATURE"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You need to be among nature to disguise yourself within nature."
msgstr "자연 속에 숨어들려면 자연 속에 있어야 합니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_DISGUISE_AS_NATURE_END"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "The glamour disguising you fades."
msgstr "당신을 가렸던 매력은 사라진다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CHANGELING_NOBLE_BURNING_WEAPON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "Your weapon kindles into white-gold flame."
msgstr "당신의 무기가 백금빛 불꽃으로 타오릅니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_NOBLE_BURNING_WEAPON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "Fires of Bealtaine requires a weapon to affect in order to take hold."
msgstr "비엘테인의 불은 자리를 잡기 위해선 무기가 필요합니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_NOBLE_MOVEMENT_BUFFS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "Your stretch your limbs and bounce on your heels."
msgstr "팔다리를 쭉 뻗고 발꿈치로 뛰세요."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_NOBLE_RIGHT_OF_PASSAGE_ON"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "After your actions you may not invoke the right of passage."
msgstr "귀하의 행동 이후에는 통과의례를 주장할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_BROWNIE_INDOOR_BLINK_SUCCESS" in
#. nested EOCs on true condition in effect in EoC "EOC_BROWNIE_INDOOR_BLINK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You carefully slip through the cracks."
msgstr "당신은 조심스럽게 틈새를 빠져나갑니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_BROWNIE_INDOOR_BLINK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You must be indoors to slip through the cracks."
msgstr "틈새를 빠져나가려면 실내에 있어야 합니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_BROWNIE_HOME_TELEPORT_ACTUAL_TELEPORT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You slip through the door and head straight home."
msgstr "당신은 문을 열고 곧장 집으로 향합니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_BROWNIE_HOME_TELEPORT_ACTUAL_TELEPORT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You must be unobserved to hurry home!"
msgstr "집에 서둘러 가려면 눈에 띄지 않아야 해요!"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_BROWNIE_HOME_TELEPORT_ACTUAL_TELEPORT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You must be in a doorway to hurry home."
msgstr "서둘러 집으로 돌아가려면 문간에 있어야 합니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_POOKA_SHAPESHIFTING_MANA_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You do not have enough mana to maintain all of your shapeshifts!"
msgstr "모든 변신을 유지할 만큼 마나가 부족합니다!"

