"Your body shifts and warps as your fingers extend into wings and feathers "
"burst from your skin as you take to the air."
msgstr "손가락이 날개로 뻗어 나가고 깃털이 피부에서 터져 나오면서 공중으로 날아오르면서 몸이 움직이고 휘어집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_POOKA_SHAPESHIFT_FULL_RAVEN_deactivated" in nested EOCs in false
#. effect in EoC "EOC_POOKA_SHAPESHIFT_FULL_RAVEN_activated"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your body shifts and your feathers vanish as you return to your previous "
"form."
msgstr "몸이 바뀌고 깃털이 사라지면서 원래 모습으로 돌아옵니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_POOKA_SHAPESHIFT_FULL_WOLF_activated_2" in nested EOCs in effect in
#. EoC "EOC_POOKA_SHAPESHIFT_FULL_WOLF_activated"
