msgstr "당신의 꿈은 당신에게 달의 눈물을 만드는 비밀을 알려주었습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_SELKIE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You must be near water or under the rain to call forth a goblin fruit."
msgstr "고블린 열매를 불러내려면 물 근처나 비가 와야 합니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_BROWNIE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You must be inside and unobserved to call forth a goblin fruit."
msgstr "고블린 과일을 불러내려면 안에 있어야 하며 눈에 띄지 않아야 합니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_POOKA_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You must be near an animal to call forth a goblin fruit."
msgstr "고블린 열매를 불러내려면 동물 근처에 있어야 합니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_TROW_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You must be under the ground or at night to call forth a goblin fruit."
msgstr "고블린 열매를 불러내려면 땅속이나 밤에 있어야 합니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_NOBLE_GOBLIN_FRUIT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_eocs.json
msgid "You must be near humans or Fae to call forth a goblin fruit."
msgstr "고블린 열매를 불러내려면 인간이나 요정 근처에 있어야 합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_GRANT_INITIAL_SEASONAL_MAGIC"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_seasonal_magic_research_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You dream of the lands Under the Hill.  Though you've never been there, it "
"calls to your spirit, reminding you of your true home.  You belong to one of"
" the great Courts of the Fair Folk, but which one?"
msgstr ""
"당신은 언덕 아래의 땅을 꿈꿉니다. 비록 그곳에 가본 적은 없지만, 그곳은 당신의 영혼을 불러일으키며 진정한 고향을 떠올리게 합니다. "
"당신은 아름다운 사람들의 위대한 궁정 중 하나에 속해 있지만, 과연 어느 궁정에 속할까요?"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_GRANT_INITIAL_SEASONAL_MAGIC"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_seasonal_magic_research_eocs.json
msgid "The Summer Court"
msgstr "여름 궁정"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_GRANT_INITIAL_SEASONAL_MAGIC"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_seasonal_magic_research_eocs.json
msgid "The Winter Court"
msgstr "겨울 궁정"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_GRANT_INITIAL_SEASONAL_MAGIC"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_seasonal_magic_research_eocs.json
msgid ""
"The Summer Court, sometimes called the Seelie Court, the Fair Folk that are "
"considered more benevolent (or at least, less malevolent) by mortals."
msgstr ""
"여름 궁정은 때때로 씨리 궁정이라고도 불리며, 인간에게 더 자비로운(또는 적어도 덜 악의적인) 것으로 여겨지는 페어 포크들입니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_GRANT_INITIAL_SEASONAL_MAGIC"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_seasonal_magic_research_eocs.json
msgid ""
"The Winter Court, sometimes called the Unseelie Court, the Fair Folk who "
"lurk under bridges and in the darkness of the wild places."
msgstr "겨울 궁정은 때때로 언시리 궁정이라고도 불리며, 다리 아래와 야생 지역의 어둠 속에 숨어 있는 페어 포크들을 말합니다."

#. ~ EOC selection title in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_GRANT_INITIAL_SEASONAL_MAGIC"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_seasonal_magic_research_eocs.json
msgid "Choose your court."
msgstr "법원을 선택하세요."

