msgid ""
"Magicks of Spring, affecting plants, growth, healing, rain, creativity, and "
"love."
msgstr "봄의 마법은 식물, 성장, 치유, 비, 창의성, 사랑에 영향을 미칩니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_PICK_COURT_SUMMER"
#. ~ EOC option description in nested effect in then statement in effect in
