#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_seasonal_magic_research_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Magicks of Autumn, affecting decay, the harvest, fear, preservation, "
"concealment, home and the hearth, and colors."
msgstr "가을의 마법은 부패, 수확, 두려움, 보존, 은폐, 집과 난로, 색상에 영향을 미칩니다."

#. ~ EOC option description in nested effect in then statement in effect in
#. EoC "EOC_PICK_COURT_SUMMER"
#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_PICK_COURT_WINTER"
