#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_seasonal_magic_research_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Magicks of Winter, affecting darkness, silence, sleep, ice, snow, cold, "
"wind, and death."
msgstr "겨울의 마법은 어둠, 침묵, 수면, 얼음, 눈, 추위, 바람, 죽음에 영향을 미칩니다."

#. ~ EOC selection title in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PICK_COURT_SUMMER"
#. ~ EOC selection title in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_PICK_COURT_WINTER"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_seasonal_magic_research_eocs.json
msgid ""
"As one of the nobility of the Fair Folk, you are heir to a deeper "
"understanding of their magicks.  Choose a second path."
msgstr "페어 포크의 귀족 중 한 명인 당신은 그들의 마법에 대한 더 깊은 이해를 계승했습니다. 두 번째 길을 선택하세요."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_TURN_DREAMDROSS_INTO_DREAMSPARKS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_seasonal_magic_research_eocs.json
