msgid ""
"Dreamsparks are evanescent things, and to hold more would be to have them "
"fade away."
msgstr "드림스파크는 덧없는 것이기 때문에 더 많이 간직할수록 사라져 버릴 것입니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_USE_DREAMDROSS_TO_RESEARCH_NEW_SPELLS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_seasonal_magic_research_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You reach into the dreamdross and draw on the dreams of mortals for "
"inspiration."
msgstr "당신은 꿈의 찌꺼기를 파헤쳐 필멸자의 꿈에서 영감을 얻습니다."

#. ~ EOC selection title in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_USE_DREAMDROSS_TO_RESEARCH_NEW_SPELLS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_seasonal_magic_research_eocs.json
msgid "Which branch of glamour will you research?"
msgstr "어떤 글래머 분야를 연구하고 싶으신가요?"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_USE_DREAMDROSS_TO_RESEARCH_NEW_SPELLS"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_seasonal_magic_research_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You don't have enough dreamdross for your research into new magicks to be "
"effective.  You need at least "
"<u_val:changeling_seasonal_magic_dreamdross_research_cost> scraps of "
"dreamdross."
msgstr ""
"새로운 마법 연구를 효과적으로 진행하기에는 드림드로스가 부족합니다. 드림드로스를 적어도 "
"<u_val:changeling_seasonal_magic_dreamdross_research_cost>개는 남겨두세요."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CHANGELING_RESEARCH_SEASONAL_MAGIC_DREAMDROSS_PAY_COST"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/mutations/playable_changeling_seasonal_magic_research_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Somehow, you researched a glamour without having enough dreamdross for it.  "
"Please report this bug."
msgstr "어떻게 된 일인지, 당신은 충분한 꿈의 찌꺼기 없이 글래머를 조사했군요. 이 버그를 신고해 주세요."

