#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite book.  Cat's Cradle."
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite game.  Pathogen"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite game.  Steam Gears"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Help me find my favorite game.  Terraforming
#. Mercury"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
msgid "Well thanks anyway."
msgstr "어쨌든 고맙습니다."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
msgid "Help me find my favorite book.  Brave New World."
msgstr "제가 제일 좋아하는 책을 찾아주세요. 멋진 신세계."

#. ~ Description of mission "Help me find my favorite book.  Brave New World."
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
msgid ""
"Could you help me find my favorite book?  It's Brave New World by Aldous "
"Huxley.  It really spoke to me before the end and even more now."
msgstr ""
"제가 제일 좋아하는 책을 골라주시겠어요? 올더스 헉슬리의 멋진 신세계예요. 읽기 전부터도 정말 마음에 와닿았는데, 지금 읽어 보니 더 "
"그렇네요."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
msgid "Help me find my favorite book.  Cat's Cradle."
msgstr "제가 제일 좋아하는 책을 찾아주세요. 캣츠 크레이들."

#. ~ Description of mission "Help me find my favorite book.  Cat's Cradle."
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
msgid ""
"Could you help me find my favorite book?  It's Cat's Cradle, by Kurt "
"Vonnegut.  It's an interesting take on an alternate cataclysmic scenario."
msgstr ""
"제가 제일 좋아하는 책을 찾아주시겠어요? 커트 보니거트의 『캣츠 크래들』이에요. 대격변이라는 또 다른 시나리오를 흥미롭게 풀어낸 "
"작품이죠."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
msgid "Help me find my favorite game.  Pathogen"
msgstr "제가 제일 좋아하는 게임을 찾아주세요. 병원균"

#. ~ Description of mission "Help me find my favorite game.  Pathogen"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/npc/npc_vampiresacrifice_chat.json
msgid ""
"Could you help me find my favorite game?  It's a board game called Pathogen."
"  At least the diseases in this game can be beaten."
msgstr ""
"제가 제일 좋아하는 게임을 찾는 걸 도와주시겠어요? 병원균이라는 보드게임이에요. 적어도 이 게임에 나오는 질병들은 물리칠 수 있잖아요."

