msgid "There is a loud clicking sound as you commune with any nearby bats."
msgstr "근처에 있는 박쥐와 대화할 때 큰 클릭 소리가 들립니다."

#. ~ Player spell casting message in effect in EoC "EOC_SUMMON_XL_BAT"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/cbm_eoc.json
msgid ""
"A click fires out of the back of your throat like a gunshot.  What could "
"this possibly be speaking to?"
msgstr "목구멍 뒤쪽에서 총소리처럼 딸깍 소리가 난다. 이게 무슨 소리일까?"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Awakened Eater"
msgstr "각성한 이터"

#. ~ Description of profession "Awakened Eater" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since the Cataclysm you've been able to clearly see elements of other "
"realities that have intruded your own.  You also are able to consume a "
"resource they seem to have brought with them to give you power far beyond a "
"normal human."
msgstr ""
"대격변 이후로 당신은 자신의 현실에 침투한 다른 현실의 요소들을 명확하게 볼 수 있게 되었습니다. 또한 그들이 가져온 것으로 보이는 "
"자원을 소비하여 일반 인간을 훨씬 뛰어넘는 힘을 얻을 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Awakened Eater"
msgstr "각성한 이터"

