#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Awakened Dreamer"
msgstr "각성한 드리머"

#. ~ Description of profession "Awakened Dreamer" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since the Cataclysm you've become far more aware of the weakened gap "
"between realities.  Specifically, of what is on the other side.  "
"Surprisingly, it doesn't seem universally hostile, and you think you'd be "
"able to bring some of these entities over if you desired."
msgstr ""
"대격변 이후 당신은 현실 사이의 간극이 얼마나 약해졌는지, 특히 반대편에 무엇이 있는지를 훨씬 더 잘 알게 되었습니다. 놀랍게도, 모든 "
"사람이 적대적인 것 같지는 않고, 원한다면 그 존재들 중 일부를 데려올 수 있을 거라고 생각합니다."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
