#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dhampir (Species)"
msgstr "Dhampir (종)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dhampir (Species)" for male
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"One of your parents was always a little odd.  They stayed out of the sun as "
"much as they could, their eyes were a bit of an odd color, and they vanished"
" without a trace before you grew old enough to ask them why they left the "
"room every time you got a scrape that drew blood.  But now that you're "
"older, you understand.  You are the child of a vampire, and have inherited a"
" small portion of their power."
msgstr ""
"부모님 중 한 분은 항상 조금 이상하셨어요. 최대한 햇빛을 피하셨고, 눈 색깔도 좀 이상하셨죠. 그리고 당신이 찰과상에 피가 날 때마다 "
"왜 방을 나가셨는지 물어볼 만큼 나이가 들기도 전에 흔적도 없이 사라지셨어요. 하지만 이제 나이가 드니 이해하시겠죠. 당신은 뱀파이어의 "
"자식이고, 그들의 힘의 일부를 물려받았으니까요."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Dhampir (Species)"
msgstr "담피르 (종족)"

#. ~ Description of profession "Dhampir (Species)" for female
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/player/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"One of your parents was always a little odd.  They stayed out of the sun as "
"much as they could, their eyes were a bit of an odd color, and they vanished"
" without a trace before you grew old enough to ask them why they left the "
"room every time you got a scrape that drew blood.  But now that you're "
"older, you understand.  You are the child of a vampire, and have inherited a"
" small portion of their power."
msgstr ""
"부모님 중 한 분은 항상 조금 이상하셨어요. 최대한 햇빛을 피하셨고, 눈 색깔도 좀 이상하셨죠. 그리고 당신이 찰과상에 피가 날 때마다 "
"왜 방을 나가셨는지 물어볼 만큼 나이가 들기도 전에 흔적도 없이 사라지셨어요. 하지만 이제 나이가 드니 이해되네요. 당신은 뱀파이어의 "
"자식이고, 그들의 힘의 일부를 물려받았으니까요."

