#. "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_WARDROBE_MANA_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/paraclesians/arvore_recipes.json
msgid ""
"Use your magick to turn treesung wood into a wardrobe.\n"
"\n"
"You must have <color_yellow>Treesinging level 6</color> and at least <color_yellow>750 mana</color> to create the item."
