"Use your magick to turn treesung wood into a long spear made of living wood.\n"
"\n"
"You must have <color_yellow>Treesinging level 3</color> and at least <color_yellow>350 mana</color> to create the item."
msgstr ""
"마법을 사용하여 나무를 살아있는 나무로 만든 긴 창으로 바꿔보세요.\n"
"\n"
"이 아이템을 제작하려면 <color_yellow>나무의 울림 레벨 3</color>과 최소 <color_yellow>350 마나</color>가 필요합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_PIKE_TREESUNG_SPELL_CHECK" in nested EOCs in effect
#. in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_PIKE_TREESUNG_MANA_CHECK" in result of
#. recipe crafting "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_PIKE_TREESUNG_MANA_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/paraclesians/arvore_recipes.json
msgid ""
"As your song fades, you behold a long spear all made of a single piece of "
"wood, as though it had grown that way in the depths of the forest."
msgstr "당신의 노래가 사라지자, 당신은 숲 깊은 곳에서 자란 것처럼 하나의 나무 조각으로 만들어진 긴 창을 봅니다."

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting
#. "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_MACE_TREESUNG_MANA_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/paraclesians/arvore_recipes.json
msgid ""
"Use your magick to turn treesung wood into a heavy mace made of living wood.\n"
"\n"
"You must have <color_yellow>Treesinging level 3</color> and at least <color_yellow>350 mana</color> to create the item."
msgstr ""
"마법을 사용하여 나무를 살아있는 나무로 만든 무거운 철퇴로 바꿔보세요.\n"
"\n"
"이 아이템을 제작하려면 <color_yellow>나무의 울림 레벨 3</color>과 최소 <color_yellow>350의 마나</color>가 필요합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_MACE_TREESUNG_SPELL_CHECK" in nested EOCs in effect
#. in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_MACE_TREESUNG_MANA_CHECK" in result of
#. recipe crafting "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_MACE_TREESUNG_MANA_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/paraclesians/arvore_recipes.json
msgid ""
"As your song fades, you behold a mace all made of a single piece of wood, as"
" though it had grown that way in the depths of the forest."
msgstr "당신의 노래가 사라지자, 당신은 마치 숲 깊은 곳에서 자란 것처럼 하나의 나무 조각으로 만들어진 철퇴를 보게 됩니다."

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting
#. "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_Q_STAFF_TREESUNG_MANA_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/paraclesians/arvore_recipes.json
msgid ""
"Use your magick to turn treesung wood into a quarterstaff made of living wood.\n"
"\n"
"You must have <color_yellow>Treesinging level 1</color> and at least <color_yellow>150 mana</color> to create the item."
msgstr ""
"마법을 사용하여 나무를 살아있는 나무로 만든 쿼터스태프로 바꿔보세요.\n"
"\n"
"이 아이템을 제작하려면 <color_yellow>나무의 울림 레벨 1</color>과 최소 <color_yellow>150의 마나</color>가 필요합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_Q_STAFF_TREESUNG_SPELL_CHECK" in nested EOCs in
#. effect in EoC "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_Q_STAFF_TREESUNG_MANA_CHECK" in
#. result of recipe crafting
#. "EOC_ARVORE_TREESINGING_Q_STAFF_TREESUNG_MANA_CHECK"
#: data/mods/Xedra_Evolved/recipes/paraclesians/arvore_recipes.json
msgid ""
"As your song fades, you behold a quarterstaff all made of a single piece of "
