#. ~ Mission name
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/agustmoon_travel_eocs.json
msgid "Reach the Port Augustmoon shuttle"
msgstr "어거스트문 항구 왕복선으로 가기"

#. ~ Description of mission "Reach the Port Augustmoon shuttle"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/agustmoon_travel_eocs.json
msgid ""
"Your shuttle has landed nearby.  It will wait for up to 3 hours before "
"returning to port, you might what to reach it before then."
msgstr "왕복선이 주변에 착륙했습니다. 3시간 안에 탑승하지 않으면 다시 항구로 돌아갈 것입니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_CALL_AUGUSTMOON_SHUTTLE"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/agustmoon_travel_eocs.json
msgid "Order Received: Shuttle inbound to your location."
msgstr "명령 접수됨. 왕복선이 곧 도착합니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_CALL_AUGUSTMOON_SHUTTLE"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/agustmoon_travel_eocs.json
msgid "WARNING: Cannot schedule landing, shuttle already inbound."
msgstr "경고! 이미 착륙된 왕복선이 있어 호출할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_LAND_AUGUSTMOON_SHUTTLE"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/agustmoon_travel_eocs.json
msgid ""
"You see the engine plume of your landing drone shuttle in the distance.  "
"You'll have about four hours to reach it before it leaves."
msgstr "멀리서 착륙하는 왕복선이 보입니다. 왕복선이 떠나기 전까지 4시간이 주어집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_AUGUSTMOON_SHUTTLE_TP"
#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_AUGUSTMOON_SPACEPORT_TP"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/agustmoon_travel_eocs.json
msgid ""
"The shuttle's ascent is a little rough, but you're soon on your way to Port "
"Augustmoon."
msgstr "수송선이 상륙하면서 어거스트문 항구로 향합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_PORT_TO_LANDING_PAD_TP"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/agustmoon_travel_eocs.json
msgid ""
"An orbital drop in a rackety cargo shuttle preceded by an almost interminable wait within Port Augustmoon customs level leads you to the planetary wastes below.\n"
"\n"
" What passes by the spaceport is nothing but a small radio outpost surrounded by chainlink fencing.  Beyond it, any guarantees of civilization are left behind."
msgstr ""
"어거스트문 항구에서 오랜 시간을 기다리고, 항구에 도착한 화물 수송선을 탑니다. 곧이어 수송선이 출발하면서 아래의 폐허가 되어버린 행성을 향해 이동합니다.\n"
"\n"
"수송선은 철조망으로 둘러싸인 작은 무전 야영지에 착륙합니다. 야영지 너머에는 지금은 무너져내린 인류의 문명만이 있습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_VALIDATE_PORT_AUGUSTMOON"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/agustmoon_travel_eocs.json
msgid "MANUALLY FINDING PORT AUGUSTMOON AS A FALLBACK.  (PRESS SPACE)."
msgstr "대안으로 PORT AUGUSTMOON을 수동으로 찾습니다. (스페이스바를 누르세요)"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_VALIDATE_LANDING_PAD"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/agustmoon_travel_eocs.json
msgid "MANUALLY FINDING THE LANDING PAD AS A FALLBACK.  (PRESS SPACE)."
msgstr "대안으로 착륙 패드를 수동으로 찾습니다. (스페이스바를 누르세요)."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "_update_ui" in nested EOCs on true condition in effect in EoC
#. "afs_cryosuit_ui_eoc"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/cryosuit_eocs.json
msgid "Your cryosuit sounds a critical power warning!"
msgstr "귀하의 크라이오슈트에서 심각한 전력 경고가 울립니다!"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. else statement in effect in EoC "_update_ui" in nested EOCs on true
#. condition in effect in EoC "afs_cryosuit_ui_eoc"
