msgstr "크라이오슈트가 전력 부족 경고음을 울립니다!"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_AFS_CONCENTRATION_VS_LIMIT_CALCULATIONS"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/esper_eoc.json
msgid ""
"As you stop concentrating, your mind clears a bit.  It's easier to think "
"now."
msgstr "집중을 멈추면 마음이 조금 맑아집니다. 이제 생각하기가 더 쉬워집니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_AFS_PSIONICS_ADVERSE_EVENT_NOSEBLEED"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/esper_eoc.json
msgid "As you unleash your powers, blood drips from your nose."
msgstr "당신이 자신의 힘을 발휘하자 코에서 피가 떨어진다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_PSIONICS_ADVERSE_EVENT_HEADACHE"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/esper_eoc.json
msgid "As you unleash your powers, your head begins to throb."
msgstr "당신이 자신의 힘을 발휘하면서, 당신의 머리가 욱신거리기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_AFS_PSIONICS_ADVERSE_EVENT_HEALTH_PENALTY"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/esper_eoc.json
msgid "As you unleash your powers, you feel enervated."
msgstr "당신이 자신의 힘을 발휘할 때, 당신은 무기력함을 느낀다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_ESPER_DAZED_ENDS_POWERS_2"
#. in nested EOCs in effect in EoC "EOC_AFS_ESPER_DAZED_ENDS_POWERS"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/EOC/esper_eoc.json
msgid "Your head is swimming.  You can no longer maintain your powers!"
msgstr "머리가 어지러워요. 더 이상 힘을 유지할 수 없어요!"

#. ~ Message in effect in EoC "_EOC_return_to_partyleader_fail_msg" in nested
