#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Corporate Infiltrator"
msgstr "산업 스파이"

#. ~ Description of profession "Corporate Infiltrator" for male
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A spy and mercenary at the direct service of the Solar Corporations.  "
"Touring the frontier in search of intelligence gathering and sabotage "
"contracts.  Equipped with a set of irreplaceable holographic technology that"
" borders on the miraculous."
msgstr ""
"솔라 코퍼레이션(Solar Corporation) 소속 스파이 겸 용병. 정보 수집 및 방해 공작 계약을 위해 국경 지대를 누비고 "
"다닙니다. 경이로움에 가까운, 대체 불가능한 홀로그램 기술을 갖추고 있습니다."

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/professions.json
