#. ~ Proficiency category name
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/proficiencies.json
msgid "Social Standing"
msgstr "사회적 지위"

#. ~ Description of proficiency category "Social Standing"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/proficiencies.json
msgid ""
"Proficiencies related to your status within spacefaring culture in all its "
"forms."
msgstr "모든 형태의 우주 여행 문화에서 귀하의 지위와 관련된 능숙도입니다."

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/proficiencies.json
msgid "Armament License"
msgstr "군비 허가"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Armament License"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/proficiencies.json
msgid ""
"You have a license to own and operate military grade weaponry and can "
"legally purchase such items without any difficulty."
msgstr ""
"귀하는 군용 무기를 소유하고 운용할 수 있는 면허를 소지하고 있으며, 아무런 어려움 없이 합법적으로 해당 품목을 구매할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Concentration (Expert)"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/proficiencies.json
msgid ""
"You can maintain your concentration even if outside in winter without a coat"
" or in the middle of a fight."
msgstr "겨울에 코트도 없이 밖에 있더라도, 혹은 싸움 중이더라도 집중력을 유지할 수 있습니다."

#. ~ Martial technique name
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/techniques.json
msgid "Pressure Crunch"
msgstr "압력 강타"

#. ~ Description of martial technique "Pressure Crunch"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/techniques.json
msgid "Heavy stun and knockback, 1.5x bash damage, crit only"
msgstr "강한 기절과 밀치기, 타격 피해 1.5배, 치명타 한정"

#. ~ Message of martial technique "Pressure Crunch"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/techniques.json
#, c-format
msgid "You smash %s with a pressurized slam"
msgstr "%s에게 막대한 압력의 강타를 갈깁니다."

#. ~ Message of martial technique "Pressure Crunch"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/player/techniques.json
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> smashes %s with a pressurized slam"
msgstr "<npcname>(이)가 %s에게 막대한 압력의 강타를 갈깁니다."

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/price_overrides/grenades.json
msgid "smoke bomb"
msgid_plural "smoke bombs"
msgstr[0] "연막탄"

#. ~ name of the nested group
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/electrokinesis_practice.json
msgid "[Ψ]practice: electrokinesis"
msgstr "[Ψ]연습: 전기 운동"

#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_PRACTICE_AFS_ELECTROKIN_SPARK_SIGHT"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/electrokinesis_practice.json
msgid "[Ψ]spark sight"
msgstr "[Ψ]스파크 사이트"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_PRACTICE_AFS_ELECTROKIN_SHOCK_TOUCH"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/electrokinesis_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to build up a charge in "
"your hand and unleash it."
msgstr "당신의 능력을 숙고하고, 손에 충전물을 쌓아서 방출하는 능력을 향상시키세요."

#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_PRACTICE_AFS_ELECTROKIN_SHOCK_TOUCH"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/electrokinesis_practice.json
msgid "[Ψ]static touch"
msgstr "[Ψ]정적 터치"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_PRACTICE_AFS_ELECTROKIN_ZAP_ENEMIES"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/electrokinesis_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to electrocute those who "
"attack you in melee."
msgstr "당신의 능력을 숙고하고 근접전에서 당신을 공격하는 자들을 감전시키는 능력을 향상시키세요."

#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting "EOC_PRACTICE_AFS_ELECTROKIN_ZAP_ENEMIES"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/electrokinesis_practice.json
msgid "[Ψ]electrical discharge"
msgstr "[Ψ]전기 방전"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting
#. "EOC_PRACTICE_AFS_ELECTRO_PERSONAL_BATTERY"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/electrokinesis_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to fuel personal electronic"
" devices with your powers."
msgstr "당신의 능력을 숙고하고, 당신의 능력을 이용해 개인용 전자기기에 전력을 공급하는 능력을 향상시켜 보세요."

#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting
#. "EOC_PRACTICE_AFS_ELECTRO_PERSONAL_BATTERY"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/electrokinesis_practice.json
msgid "[Ψ]electron overflow"
msgstr "[Ψ]전자 오버플로"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting
#. "EOC_PRACTICE_AFS_ELECTROKIN_RECHARGE_VEHICLE"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/electrokinesis_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to recharge large-scale "
"batteries or connected power grids."
msgstr "여러분의 능력을 숙고하고 대규모 배터리나 연결된 전력망을 충전하는 능력을 향상시키세요."

#. ~ Custom name for recipe crafting
#. "EOC_PRACTICE_AFS_ELECTROKIN_RECHARGE_VEHICLE"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/electrokinesis_practice.json
msgid "[Ψ]re-energize"
msgstr "[Ψ]재활력화"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_AFS_ESPER_STUDYING_POWER_BEGIN"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/practice_eocs.json
msgid "You spend some time meditating and developing your powers."
msgstr "당신은 명상을 하고 자신의 힘을 개발하는 데 시간을 보냅니다."

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_AFS_ESPER_STUDYING_POWER_BEGIN"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/practice_eocs.json
msgid "You spend some time meditating but something seems missing."
msgstr "명상을 하면서 시간을 보냈지만, 무언가가 빠진 것 같습니다."

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_AFS_ESPER_STUDYING_POWER_BEGIN"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/practice_eocs.json
msgid "You are too exhausted to develop your powers."
msgstr "당신은 너무 지쳐서 당신의 능력을 개발할 수 없습니다."

#. ~ name of the nested group
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/telekinesis_practice.json
msgid "[Ψ]practice: telekinesis"
msgstr "[Ψ]연습: 텔레키네시스"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "EOC_PRACTICE_AFS_TELEKIN_MOVE_ITEMS"
#: data/mods/aftershock_exoplanet/recipes/esper/telekinesis_practice.json
msgid ""
"Contemplate your powers and improve your ability to pick up and move items."
