"Gland surplus production since cooldown: <u_val:mutagen_gland_surplus>mg"
msgstr "쿨다운 이후 샘 잉여 생산: <u_val:mutagen_gland_surplus>mg"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_TEST_GLAND"
#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/debug.json
msgid "EOC_IS_GLAND giving false positive"
msgstr "EOC_IS_GLAND가 거짓 양성을 나타냄"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in nested effect in
#. then statement in effect in EoC "EOC_TEST_GLAND"
#: data/mods/extra_mut_scen/debug.json
