#: data/mods/innawood/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since you were a child you loved hunting, and quickly developed a "
"talent for javelin throwing.  Why, if the world ended, there's nothing you'd"
" want at your side more than your trusty javelins.  So, when it did, you "
"made sure to bring them along."
msgstr ""
"어렸을 때부터 사냥을 좋아했고, 금세 창던지기에 재능을 보였어요. 세상이 멸망한다면, 믿음직한 창보다 더 곁에 두고 싶은 건 없겠죠. "
"그래서 세상이 멸망했을 때, 당신은 꼭 창을 가져갔죠."

